{"id": "19360", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19360", "title": "Kamatari Racine", "text": "Kamatari Thierry izina ry'ubuhanzi nka Racine Rwanda yavukiye i Kigali, mu Rwanda ni umuraperi wu munyaRwanda, umusizi ndetse umwanditsi w'afilimi. \nYakoze filimi y'urukurikirane rwu Rwanda rwitwa Impanga. Yatorewe kuba umukinnyi wu mugabo mwiza muri \"Impanga Series Awards\". Indirimbo ye\"Crush\" yarangije umwanya wa kabiri wumuziki mwiza wu Rwanda kuri RFI. Mu ndirimbo yanditse harimo \"nka Umwamikazi\" wa Lil G feat Christopher Muneza na \"Katapilla\" ya Bruce Melodie. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nNi umuhungu wa Rutajoga Innocent, na Gahongayire Genevieve, abaye uwa kabiri mu bana batanu. Ni se wa Inganzo Aiden Lyric wavutse muri 2023. \nRacine ni umuraperi wo mu Rwanda kandi ufatwa nk'umwe mu baraperi bafite impano yo mu mutwe u Rwanda yagize mu mpera z'imyaka ya za 2010, wamenyekanye cyane mu 2017 nyuma yo gushyira ahagaragara indirimbo ye ya mbere yise Agahugu. \nRap ye ahanini yashinze imizi mubisigo kuko yahoze ari umusizi mbere yo kuba umuraperi asubira mumashuri yisumbuye. Nyuma, yaje kuba umuraperi ku izina rya stage G-Intwari aho azaririmbira ku ishuri. \nMbere yo kugira alubumu ya mbere, Racine yakoranye imishinga ibiri, imwe ikaba megahit WAKIWAKI irimo inyenyeri zose zifitwe na Ish Kevin. Racine yagize uruhare runini mugushinga ibyuma byumuziki bitari ibintu mu Rwanda kera. Yakoze umwe mu basifuzi badasanzwe witwa Imizi cypher muri 2018 yerekanaga abaraperi benshi bafite impano. Bavuga ko yohereje amafoto ya subliminal kuri bagenzi be baraperi mu ndirimbo ye ya KAREZI Yagaragaye ku mbuga nkoranyambaga mu 2021 kubera umurongo wa rap yihuta cyane wagaragaye kuri GANG-LA ft WAWA. Numwanditsi w'ibizima kubahanzi benshi. \nIbindi.\nRacine yakoze alubumu ye ya mbere muri 2022, RWAHIPHOP, mu buryo bw'ikigereranyo bisobanura Ripande Hip Hop ifite ingaragu 13, hamwe n\u2019ubufatanye butavugwaho rumwe bwiswe IKANZU bwavugaga umujyi kubera umwihariko wabwo udasanzwe kuko byari biteye ubwoba. Iyi niyo alubumu yonyine yabonye kugeza ubu. Muri 2023, yasohoye umukino wagutse EP witwa 2023AD. Album ye ya mbere 2022 \"RwaHiphop\". \nSitidiyo ya Album.\nRwahiphop\nEp.\n\"Hinduka\"\nAmashusho.\nRacine yakinnye muri serie ya Impanga muri 2020 aho yatangiriye ku gice cya 3, igihembwe cya 1, kandi yatorewe kuba umukinnyi wumugabo mwiza wigitaramo. Muri iki gitaramo, bigaragara ko ari umuhungu ukennye ukomoka mu cyaro agerageza kwibeshaho mu mujyi wa Kigali akora umuziki wa rap. "}
{"id": "19361", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19361", "title": "Bizimana Amani", "text": "Bizimana Amani Bizimana (yavutse 1996), uzwi ku izina rya Amalon ni umuririmbyi akaba n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo na Filimi. Kuva mu Karere ka Rubavu, yabanje kumenyekana asohora amashusho yindirimbo Yambi muri 2018. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nAmalon yavutse muri 1996 mu karere ka Rubavu mu ntara y\u2019iburengerazuba y\u2019u Rwanda, avukira Amran na Uwamahoro Habiba. Amalon yize amashuri yisumbuye ya Kagarama kurwego rusanzwe hanyuma nyuma ahuriweho na Integrated Polytechnic Regional Centre IPRC Kicukiro. \nYatangiye umwuga we nk'umuraperi nyuma yinjira muri Afrobeat na R&amp;B ayobowe na 1 K Entertainment, isosiyete yashinzwe na Pius Rukabuza, uzwi ku izina rya DJ Pius, umuririmbyi wo mu Rwanda akaba na DJ uzwi kugeza mu 2021. \nIndirimbo ye ya mbere \"yambi\" yamushizeho kugirango yamamare mu ndirimbo zitandukanye yakurikiranye nka \"Byakubaho\" na \"Delilah\" arimo Ally Soudy. \nImikorere.\nMuri 2019, yari mu bahanzi, barimo Sheebah Karungi ukomoka muri Uganda, Bruce Melodie, nyirarume Austin, Riderman, Social Mulah, Active, Safi Madiba, Marina, Umwamikazi cha na Jay Polly, bakoreye ibitaramo muri Camp Kigali. \nMuri uwo mwaka, Amalon niwe muhanzi wu Rwanda wenyine wakinnye kuri stage hamwe na Burna Boy mu gitaramo cya BurnaBoyExperience cyabereye muri Intare Conference Arena."}
{"id": "19362", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19362", "title": "Mpazimpaka Jonas Kennedy", "text": "Mazimpaka Jones Kennedy ni muntu ki?\nMazimpaka Jones Kennedy ni umunyarwanda ukurikije ubwenegihugu akaba afite imyaka 64 y'amavuko. ni umukinnyi wa film haba mu karere ndetse no mu mahanga. yagaragaye muri video nyinshi zikora advert z'ubucuruzi kandi yagiye agaragara muri film mpuza mahanga kurubu kandi Mazimpaka akaba ri umwe mu bashumba bakorera ivuga butumwa mu Itorero rya Authentic Word Ministry Zion temple Celebration Center \nImyirondoro.\nMazimpaka jones Kennedy amazina yiswe n'ababyeyi akaba yaravukiye mu gihugu cy'uburundi kuya gashyantare mu 1960 akurira mu gihugu cya Uganda. Amashuri ye yisumbuye yayize mu gihugu cy'Ubugande muri Kololo Senior Secondary School mu mwaka wa 1977 kugeza 1978, yashoreje amashuri yisumbuye Kampala High school mu mwaka wa 1979 kugeza mu 1980 kurubu akaba ari umugabo utuye Ahitwa Ntarama muri bugesera,\nMazimpaka Jones Kennedy afite uburebure bwa metero imwe na mirongo itandatu na karindwi (1.67) z'uburebure akaba kandi yarashakanye na Kibuuka Harriet akaba yarabyaye abana barindwi aribo Musoni Allan, Kabera Arnold, Nkusi Arthur, Ndahiro Alban,Utamuriza Bridget, Nshuti Bella harimo nuwitabye Imana Mpfizi Asley. \nIjambo rimufasha mubuzima.\nQuotes: A vision with out Focus is just an Illusion "}
{"id": "19363", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19363", "title": "Itahiwacu Bruce", "text": "Itahiwacu Bruce (yavutse ku ya 3 Werurwe 1992), bakunze kwita Bruce Melodie uzwi ku izina rya Munyakazi ni umuririmbyi wo mu Rwanda yatsindiye Primus Guma Guma Super Star inshuro 8 PGGSS. \nNiwe washinze Ig \u0431\u0430\u0440 umuziki wanditseho Label. Bruce kandi ni ambasaderi w'ikirango cya BK Arena na Primus. Akora umuziki we muri 1:55 AM label yari iyobowe n'umutoza Gael. Mu Kwakira 2023, Bruce melody yasohoye indirimbo ya mbere. Iyo ari hafi irimo Jamaica ikora ibitaramo mpuzamahanga Shaggy.\nAmateka.\nImyaka yo hambere.\nBruce Itahiwacu yavukiye mu Karere ka Kicukiro. Ni umwana wa kabiri mu muryango w'abana bane uhagarariwe na Gervain Ntibihangana (se) na Velene Muteteri wapfuye mu 2013. Bruce yize amashuri abanza ya Camp Kanombe i Kanombe, amashuri yisumbuye ayiga mu ishuri rya kisilamu rya Rwamagana. \nUmwuga wa muzika.\nBruce afatwa nk'umuyobozi w'umucuranzi wu Rwanda. Yatangiye kuririmba akiri muto muri korari y'itorero maze asohora indirimbo ye ya mbere ya alubumu Tubivemo munsi yitwa, \"Ndumiwe\", muri Kanama 2013. Album ye ya kabiri, \"Ntundize\", yasohotse mu 2014. Muri kiriya gihe, Bruce yabarizwaga muri Super Level Music Label. Muri Gashyantare 2021, Bruce yatangaje ko yasinyanye na Cloud 9 Entertainment kugira ngo akurikirane umwuga we wa muzika, ariko muri 2022 asesa amasezerano na Lee maze yinjira mu buyobozi bushya, 1:55 AM Imyidagaduro, iyobowe n'umutoza wa Gael Karomba AKA Gael. \nAlbum za studio.\nYakinnye ibitaramo mu Rwanda no mu bihugu duturanye, harimo na Uganda kandi akorana n'abahanzi benshi, barimo Urban Boyz, Umwamikazi Cha, JayC, Sheebah Karungi, Pallaso, B2C, Fik fameica na Khaligraph Jones. Yise Craig David nk'intumwa ye. Niwe muhanzi wambere wu Rwanda waririmbye muri Coke Studio (Afrika) | Coke Studio Afrika.. Muri 2020 Bruce melodie yareze Kenny Sol na Juno kizigenza. Mu 2023 yagaragaye mu ndirimbo ya Harmonize yitwa Zanzibar.\nAgaciro.\nBruce Melodie, muri 2021, yatoranijwe nk'umwe mu bahanzi bo mu Rwanda bafite ubukungu buhamye. Bruce Melodie n'itsinda rye batangije TV TV ISIBO TV (2020) Yasinyanye kandi amasezerano akomeye yo kwemeza na sosiyete ya BROK ya miliyoni 50 z'amafaranga y'u Rwf. Yakoranye n\u2019amasosiyete y'itumanaho yaho (MTN, Airtel) abinyujije mu kwamamaza kandi yasinyanye na infinix mobile nka ambasaderi wayo. Yasinyanye kandi amasezerano na Tecno mobile muri 2021. Yasinyanye amasezerano mashya na Kigali Arena yari ifite agaciro ka miliyoni 150 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda maze mu 2021 aba umuherwe mu mafranga y'u Rwanda asinyana amasezerano na miliyoni y'amadorali y'Amerika na Food Bundles. Ari mubacuranzi 20 ba mbere baturutse muri Afrika yuburasirazuba kurutonde rwabaherwe muri USD.\u00a0&lt;/link&gt;[\"citation ikenewe\"]"}
{"id": "19364", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19364", "title": "Nduwimana Lean Paul", "text": "Nduwimana Jean Paul, bakunze kwita amazi ya Noopja yavutse muri 07 Kanama 1983) i Nyarugenge, mu Rwanda, kuri Daniel Baranzira na Therese Mukamazimpaka, ni umuhanzi ufata amajwi mu Rwanda, rwiyemezamirimo, umwanditsi akaba n'u washinze label yanditse yitwa Country Records. Noopja ni we washinze sitidiyo yamamaye muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba Country Records, washinze radiyo yo mu Rwanda 105.7 FM Country FM akaba n'umuyobozi wa Necessary Generation, umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta ufasha urubyiruko rutishoboye ruva mu mpande zitandukanye. Rwanda. \nUbuzima bwambere nakazi.\nNduwimana Jean Paul, wavutse ku ya 7 Kanama 1983, avukira mu murenge wa Gitambi wo mu Karere ka Nyarugenge, uherereye mu murwa mukuru wa Kigali mu Rwanda. Ni umwana wa gatatu mu muryango w'abantu barindwi, umuhungu wa Mukamazimpaka Therese na Baranzira Daniel. Abavandimwe be barimo KOZZE, uzwi cyane mu gutunganya umuziki wo mu Rwanda. Noopja yakundaga umuziki yakongejwe na nyina, wabaye ingoma y'itorero kandi yari azwiho kwitangira gusenga no kuririmba buri gitondo mu rugo. Uku kumenyekanisha hakiri kare umuziki ninjyana byashizeho urufatiro rwumwuga wejo hazaza mu muziki. Guhura n\u2019ibibazo na sitidiyo zafashwe amajwi yabanje gukorana, Yahisemo gushinga sitidiyo ye yo gufata amajwi, Country Records. Intego ye kwari ugushiraho ibidukikije byunganira kandi byubaha abahanzi, bakemeza ko bahabwa icyubahiro nubufasha babikwiye. \nUsibye gushinga Country Records, Noopja yatangije \"Country FM\". Icyerekezo cye kuri radiyo kwari ugutanga urubuga rwibanda ku rubyiruko, ruteza imbere impano zabo, rukanabaha amahirwe yo kwerekana ubushobozi bwabo. Binyuze muri izo gahunda, yagize uruhare runini mu muziki w\u2019u Rwanda kandi akomeza gushishikariza no gutera inkunga abahanzi bakiri bato mu gace atuyemo. "}
{"id": "19365", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19365", "title": "Muhoranimana Eloi", "text": "Muhoranimana Eloi (yavutse ku ya 27 Gicurasi 1999), uzwi cyane ku izina ry'ubuhanzi Eloi El ni umuhanzi w'umuziki w'umunyarwanda, umwanditsi w'indirimbo ndetse na producer utungana amashusho. \nEloi kabuhariwe mu muziki wo munzu wimbitse akaba ari sub-genre y'umuziki wimbyino za elegitoronike (EDM). Eloi yasohoye ingaragu zirenga 10 ubufatanye nka: \"Magical\", \"Amajwi,\" \"Utari kumwe, Inzira Unkunda\". \nEloi yasohoye Umukino wagutse EP witwa \"Afurika ku Isi\", wagaragaye nkuwambere wagaragaye muri EP yasohoye. "}
{"id": "19367", "revid": "12240", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19367", "title": "Kasirye Martin", "text": "Kasirye Martin bakunze kwita Mc Tino azwi ku izina rya Tino Berbatov) wavutse kuya 2 ugushyingo 1984 i Jinja, muri Uganda kubabyeyi bitwa Baramaze John na Veronique Tebasurwa, ni umunyamakuru w\u2019umunyarwanda, akaba ari munyamakuru ukorera kuri Radio, ari umuhanzi, MC na Deejay. Yakundaga kwerekana ibirori bitandukanye by'umuziki harimo Primus Guma Guma Super Star. Yabaye MC mu bitaramo byose bikomeye byabereye mu Rwanda, muri byo hateguwe na MTN u Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\n yize muri kaminuza yu Rwanda mu ishami ry\u2019imicungire y\u2019ubucuruzi Marketing muri 2010. Yakomereje amasomo ye mu Buhinde, mu kigo cy\u2019Ubuhinde gishinzwe itumanaho, aho yakuye impamyabumenyi mu itumanaho rusange. \nUmwuga wa muzika.\nMc Tino yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere, \"Umurima\", muri 2018 ifite indirimbo zizwi cyane nka Umurima, Niwe Nawe, MULA. \nMc Tino yari umuririmbyi wambere wa TBB trio yumuziki yari igizwe nabanyamuryango batatu: Tino, Bob na Benja. Batandukanye nyuma ya Primus Guma Guma Superstar saison 6 atangira umwuga wenyine. \nKwamamaza.\nKuri ubu akora ikiganiro cyitwa DUNDA Show kuri KT Radio. Yakiriye Sonia Kayitesi, Jean Paul Bujyacyera, DJ Ira, Auddy Kelly, Confy, Racine Kamatari, Kataleya na Kandle, Marc Uwizeye na Emmanuel Sibomana kuri radio ye yitwa Dunda kuri KT Radio. \nEmceeing.\nYakundaga kwerekana ibirori bitandukanye byumuziki harimo Primus Guma Guma Super Star. Yabaye MC mu bitaramo byose bikomeye byabereye mu Rwanda, muri byo hateguwe na MTN u Rwanda. Mc Tino afatwa nkumuyobozi wu Rwanda Mc Rwanda yatangiye mcee kuva 2007. \nYakoze nka mc igihe Jason Derulo yagiye mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "19368", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19368", "title": "Tuyishime Joshua", "text": "Tuyishime Joshua yavutse ku ya 5 Nyakanga 1988 kugeza 2 Nzeri 2021 uzwi ku izina rya Jay Polly, yari umucuranzi w'u Rwanda. \nJay Polly niwe wegukanye Primus Guma Guma Super Star ibihe 4 (PGGSS4). Yari umwe mu bahanzi batsinze injyana ya hip - hop mu Rwanda kandi yahoze mu itsinda ry\u2019itsinda rya hip - hop ryitwa Tuff Gang hamwe n\u2019abandi baraperi nka \"Fireman\", \"BullDogg\", \"P Fla\", na \"Green P.\" \nMuri 2014, Jay Poly yari ambasaderi w\u2019ikirango wa MTN u Rwanda. Mbere y'urupfu rwe, Jay Polly yari yarasangiye ibyiciro n'abahanzi bazwi ku isi barimo Lucky Dube, Koffi Olomide, Sean Kingston, Jason Derulo, Kevin Lyttle, na Davido. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nJay Polly yavutse ku ya 5 Nyakanga 1988, avukira i Gikondo, mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Yabaye umwana wa kabiri mu muryango w'abantu batatu barimo mukuru we, \"Uwera Jean Maurice\" uzwi ku izina rya \"Uncle Morris,\" umunyamakuru w'u Rwanda. Jay Polly yize amashuri abanza ya Kinunga n'icyahoze ari ETO Kicukiro ubu Integrated Polytechnic Regional College (IPRC) Kigali. \nUmwuga wa muzika.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nJay Polly yatangiye kwandika no gufata amajwi muri 2003, ubwo yari mu mashuri yisumbuye ari kumwe n'incuti ye icyo gihe none akaba umuraperi, \"Green P.\" Hamwe n'izindi nshuti, bashinze itsinda ry'umuziki ryitwa G5. Mu 2004, itsinda ryaratandukanye maze Jay atangira gufata umuziki wenyine. Yasohoye \"Amafaranga\" ye yindirimbo yakurikiwe nindirimbo zakunzwe \"Nda Khoho\", \"ubona\", nizindi nyinshi. \nTuff Gang.\nMuri 2007, Jay Polly na Green P bagiye gufata amajwi muri studio ya ONB aho producer \"Lick Lick\" yakoraga. Lick Lick yafataga amajwi abahanzi batandukanye bo mu Rwanda icyo gihe bazaza ubu barimo abastar barimo \"King James\", Meddy, na The Ben hamwe n\u2019abandi baraperi 3 bato \"BullDogg\", \"Fireman\", na \"P Fla.\" Lick Lick, amaze kubona ko abaraperi batanu bafite icyerekezo kimwe n\u2019ubushobozi, bahisemo kubahuza no gukora itsinda ryumuziki witwa TuffGang. \nPGGSS.\nMuri 2011 na 2013, Jay Polly yatowe muri Primus Guma Guma Super Star (PGGSS) ariko ntiyayitsinda. Muri 2013, yasinyanye amasezerano yimyaka 3 na Touch Records aho yasohoye indirimbo zitandukanye zamamaye zirimo \"Deux fois Deux\", \"Nda kuho Ndahumeka\", \"Malaika\", na \"Siribateri\" ft Bruce Melodie kuvuga bake. Muri 2014, yatowe muri PGGSS saison 4 yatsinze ku ya 30 Kanama uwo mwaka. "}
{"id": "19369", "revid": "16551", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19369", "title": "Munyangango Audce", "text": "Munyangango Audace yavutse ku ya 9 Mata 1989, wamenyekanye ku izina rya Auddy Kelly, ni umuririmbyi w'umunya Rwanda, umwanditsi w'indirimbo na rwiyemezamirimo. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nAuddy yavukiye mu Rwanda ari umwana wa kabiri mu bana batatu. Yatangiye kuririmba akiri muto atangirana na \"Azaph Music International\", itsinda rya korari ku rusengero rwa Siyoni.\nYashyizeho itsinda ry'abaririmbyi bitwaga \"Abasizwe 6\" hanyuma nyuma, atangira gutwara wenyine. \nMuri 2014, Kelly yari afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda. Muri 2018, yerekeje muri kaminuza ya Mount Kenya aho yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu micungire y\u2019imari. \nUmwuga.\nKelly yatangiye umwuga we wo kuririmba muri 2012. Muri 2016, Yatsindiye igihembo cy'umuhanzi mwiza wa Afro fusion numuhanzi mwiza w'imyambarire. Bivugwa ko ari we muntu wa mbere wateguye \"ishakisha rya Karaoke Talent\", rigamije gufasha no gutera inkunga abaririmbyi babonaga ko bafite impano binyuze muri Karaoke. Nk\u2019uko KT Press ibitangaza, yanavuguruye Amasunzu mu kuri. \nIbindi.\nIndirimbo.\nYasohoye kandi alubumu yagaragayemo Jody Phibi Album za studio."}
{"id": "19370", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19370", "title": "Mugisha Benjamin", "text": "Benjamin Mugisha yavutse ku ya 9 Mutarama 1987 yamenyekanye ku izina rya The Ben, ni umuririmbyi akaba n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo.\nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, yimukiye muri Amerika aho yakoranye n'umuhanzi Mike E Ellison ukomoka mu mujyi wa Detroit. Nyuma, yatumiriwe gutaramira ku cyicaro cya Loni. Indirimbo ya Ben yitwa \" I'm in love\", yasohotse mu Kwakira 2012, yatumye hashyirwaho icyiciro gishya cy'umuziki mu birori byo gutanga ibihembo bya Salax Music 2012 mu Rwanda bituma aba umuntu wa mbere wahawe igihembo cy'umuhanzi w\u2019umuziki mwiza muri Diaspora. \nMu 2021, Julien Bmjizzo; Uzwi mukuyobora videwo z\u2019umuziki wo mu Rwanda yafashe amashusho anayobora indirimbo yise \"Why\" ya The Ben na Diamond Platnumz. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 9 Mutarama 1987, avukira i Kampala, muri Uganda.\u00a0\nBen yashakanye na Uwicyeza Pamella wamenyekanye nka Miss Rwanda 2019. bafitanye umwana umwe w\u2019imfura witwa Icyeza Luna Mugisha Ora. \nIbihembo.\nBen yamenyekanye nk'umuhanzi witwaye neza muri Afro R&amp;B muri Salax Awards, ibihembo by\u2019umuziki ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu mu Rwanda mu 2008-2009. Muri 2009-2010 yongeye kwakira igihembo \"Umuhanzi witwaye neza muri Afro R&amp;B ndetse n'umuhanzi mwiza w'umugabo. Muri 2010-11, yatsindiye indirimbo nziza, Ben yahawe indirimbo ya Salas Award y'umwaka wa 2010- 2011. "}
{"id": "19371", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19371", "title": "Nabonibo Albert", "text": "Nabonibo Albert yavutse 1983 cyangwa 1984 ni umuririmbyi z'ihimbaza Imana akaba n'umucungamari ukomoka i Gicumbi mu nkengero za Kigali, mu Rwanda. Amakuru ya Thomson Reutersna Foundation asobanura Nabonibo nk'umuririmbyi uzwi kandi uzwi cyane, kandi avuga ko yasohoye indirimbo umunani z'Imana kuva mu 2012. Muri Kanama 2019, yaje kumenyekana ku rwego mpuzamahanga ubwo yavaga ari abaryamana bahuje ibitsina, ibyo bikaba bifitanye isano n\u2019ibitekerezo bya Afurika byo kurwanya abaryamana bahuje ibitsina. Byongeye kandi, amatorero yo mu gihugu cya gikirisitu avuga ko kuba LGBTQ ari icyaha. Mu gusohoka abaye uwa mbere mu Rwanda umuririmbyi w'Imana kumugaragaro. \"Pink News\" yamwise izina rya munani inkuru zikomeye kandi zigenda zisohoka zo muri 2019, avuga ko byanze bikunze yahura nabyo. \nUbuzima.\nAlbert Nabonibo yavutse 1984 muri Kacyiru na Grew muri Gicumbi, kamwe mu turere dutanu two mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru, u Rwanda. Nabonibo yagize uruhare mu matorero yo muri Afurika y\u2019Abapentekote harimo n\u2019umwe mu bagize korari y\u2019iryo torero. Yagize icyo ageraho kuva 2014, harimo \"Umenipenda\" na \"Sogongera.\" Kugeza muri Kanama 2019, byabaye ngombwa ko ahuza ibitsina kandi akabaho ubuzima bubiri. Nkuko yabikekaga, Nabonibo yahuye n'ikibazo cyo kuva ku kazi, mu muryango, no gutotezwa ku rusengero bituma avuye muri batatu. \nUmugabane ufite amategeko akomeye ku isi arwanya abaryamana bahuje ibitsina, n'abantu ba LGBTQ ; guhuza ibitsina ni icyaha mu bihugu byinshi, ibihano kuva igihe cyo gufungwa kugeza gupfa. "}
{"id": "19373", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19373", "title": "Bibarwa Kitoko", "text": "wavutse Patrick Bibarwa yavutse muri mutarama 2010 ni umuririmbyi wo Rwanda. Yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere, \"Ifaranga\", muri Mutarama 2010. Iyi alubumu yishimiye byihuse kandi byinshi mu Rwanda no muri Uganda. Mu mwaka wa 2012, umusubirizi w'ikinyamakuru cyo muri Uganda cya The East African yamwise umuhanzi ukomeye mu Rwanda muri iki gihe. Mbere yo gutangira umwuga we wa muzika, Bibarwa yaririmbaga muri korari y'itorero ryaho. \nMu mwaka wa 2012, Kitoko yatumiriwe gutanga igitaramo ku giti cye ku isabukuru y'amavuko ya Ange Kagame, umukobwa wa perezida w'u Rwanda, Paul Kagame. Muri Gashyantare 2013, Kitoko yaririmbye mu iserukiramuco ry'umuco w'u Rwanda ryabereye i Jylland Fyn, muri Danimarike. yitabiriye kandi u Muryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba no muri Amerika, Ubufaransa n'Ububiligi. Yatsindiye ibihembo inshuro ebyiri muri Salax Awards, harimo no mu cyiciro cy'umuhanzi mwiza wa Afrobeat. \nMuri Kamena 2013, Kitoko yatangaje ko yeguye mu ruganda rwa muzika kubera impamvu zitazwi. \nIbindi.\nAlbumu.\nKitoko Bibarwa"}
{"id": "19374", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19374", "title": "Kagabo Richards Rwamunono", "text": "Kagabo Richards Rwamunono, ni Umuyobozi w'akarere ka Rwamagana wungirije ushinzwe iterambere ry'ubukungu. Yabanje kuba umujyanama wa Guverineri w\u2019Intara y\u2019Iburasirazuba.\nAmateka.\nKagabo, ku wa Kane tariki 07 Ukuboza 2023, yatorewe kuba umuyobozi w'akarere wungirije ushinzwe imibereho myiza ku majwi 170, asimbura Nyirabihogo Jeanne d\u2019Arc, weguye kuri izi nshingano. Kagabo yari amaze imyaka 11 ari Umujyanama wa Guverineri w\u2019Intara. "}
{"id": "19375", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19375", "title": "Umutoni Jeanne", "text": "Umutoni Jeanne, ni Umuyobozi w\u2019Akarere ka Rwamagana wungirije ushinzwe Imibereho myiza.\nAmateka.\nUmutoni, yagiye agira uruhari mu bikorwa b'itandukanye byo gufasha abaturage b'akarere ka Rwamagana kuva mu bukene, kurwanya icyorezo cya Sida, binyuze mu mishinga itandukanye y'abafatanyabikorwa bako karere.\nMu nshingano ze, yagaragaye mu bikorwa byinshi by'iterambere birimo:"}
{"id": "19376", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19376", "title": "Kurwanya ubukene mu Akarere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Akarere ka Rwamagana ni kamwe mu turere turindwi tugize intare y'Iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Ku wa 9 Ugushyingo 2023, mu nteko rusange, Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere bwiyemeje gufatanya n\u2019Ihuriro ry\u2019Abafatanyabikorwa, JADF mu gukura mu bukene imiryango 4000 mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka ibiri.\nAmateka.\nAkarere ka Rwamagana kagizwe n\u2019Imirenge 14, Utugali 82 n\u2019Imidugudu 474. Gafite ubuso bungana na 682 km2 n\u2019abaturage 484,953, bari ku bucucike bwa 740/Km2. \nMu nama yo ku wa 9 Ugushyingo 2023, Umuyobozi w\u2019Akarere ka Rwamagana wungirije ushinzwe imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage, Umutoni Jeanne yagaragaje ko Akarere ka Rwamagana gafite ingo zisaga ibihumbi 26 zikennye kandi ko kihaye intego ko nibura ingo 4000 zigomba kuba zavuye mu bukene myaka ibiri2024 na 2025, akaba ari naho ubuyobozi bwasabye aba bafatanyabikorwa kubafasha mu gukurikirana aba baturage bakava mu bukene binyuze mu bikorwa bitandukanye bizakorerwa abaturage.\nGuhanga akazi.\nVisi Meya Umutoni yavuze ko bimwe mu byo abaturage bazakorerwa ngo bikure mu bukene harimo guhabwa ifumbire, amatungo, ibikoresho ku bana babo biga, abatiga basubizwe mu ishuri abandi bashyirwe mu myuga.\nBazahabwa kandi akazi muri VUP, batangirwe mituweli n\u2019ibindi byinshi harimo ibyo bazakorerwa n\u2019Akarere n\u2019ibindi bazakorerwa n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa. \nUmuhuzabikorwa w\u2019Abafatanyabikorwa b\u2019Akarere ka Rwamagana, Uwayezu Valens, yavuze ko bari basanzwe bafasha abaturage ku giti cyabo ariko ko ubu bagiye guhuza imbaraga mu kugabana abaturage 4000 ku buryo buri wese agira uruhare rwe mu kubafasha."}
{"id": "19377", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19377", "title": "Amasezerano y\u2019ubufatanye hagati y\u2019akarere ka Rwamagana n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino w\u2019amagare mu Rwanda", "text": "Mu Karere ka Rwamagana, ku wa 6 Mutarama 2023, habaye umuhango wo gusinya amasezerano y\u2019ubufatanye hagati y\u2019akarere n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino w\u2019amagare mu Rwanda (FERWACY), agamije guteza imbere uyu mukino no gutegura isiganwa ry'umukino w'amagare rya Rwamagana Race. Ni amasezerano azamara imyaka itatu, aho byitezwe ko azafasha kuzamura impano z'abakinnyi basiganwa ku magare bashya no guha imyitozo abasanzwe bakina.\nInshingano z'akarere.\nAkarere ka Rwamagana kiyemeje;\nInshingano za FERWACY.\nFERWACY yo yiyemeje;"}
{"id": "19378", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19378", "title": "Kwamamaza umukandida wa RPF mu Karere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Mu Akarere ka Rwamagana, ku wa 25 Kamena 2024, abanyamuryango ba FPR- Inkotanyi bateraniye ku kibuga cy\u2019umupira cya Kigabiro bitabiriye igikorwa cyo gutangiza gahunda yo kwamamaza umukandida wa RPF ku mwanya wa Perezida wa Repubulika ndetse n\u2019abakandida b\u2019Abadepite.\nIbyo kwishimira.\nAbaturage ba Karere ka Rwamagana bishimiye ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere n\u2019ibihindura imibereho bagejejweho mu myaka irindwi ishize n\u2019umukandida wa RPF-Inkotanyi Paul Kagame muri gahunda ya Guverinoma ya 2017-2024. Bavuze ko ibikorwa remezo Perezida wa Repubulika Paul Kagame akaba n\u2019umukandida w\u2019Umuryango FPR Inkotanyi yari yemereye abaturage muri manda ishize, byose yabibagejejeho ndetse hiyongeraho n\u2019ibindi."}
{"id": "19379", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19379", "title": "Umushinga wa Gikuriro kuri bose mu Karere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Gikuriro kuri bose, ni umushinga ugamije kurwanya imirire mibi, guteza imbere ingo mbonezamikurire z\u2019abana bato(ECDs), kwita ku bafite ubumuga no kwimakaza uburezi budaheza. \nAmateka.\nMu Karere ka Rwamagana, ku wa 11/02/2022, mu cyumba cy\u2019inama cyo mu kigo cy\u2019urubyiruko cya \u201cYEGO Center Rwamagana\u201d hatangirijwe ibikorwa by\u2019umushinga \u201cGikuriro kuri bose\u201d kugirango abaturage ba Karere babashe guhabwa izi serivisi. Umushinga \u201cGikuriro kuri bose\u201d ukaba uzashyirwa mu mirenge irindwi(7) yo mu karere ka Rwamagana ariyo: Muyumbu, Fumbwe, Kigabiro, Gishari, Karenge, Munyaga na Munyiginya.\nIki gikorwa cyitabiriwena Meya Mbonyumuvunyi Radjab ndetse na Visi Meya Umutoni Jeanne ushinzwe iterambere ry\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage mu Akarere ka Rwamagana, Intara y'Iburasirazuba.\nMu Rwanda, Uyu mushinga uzageragerezwa mu mirenge ya Kigabiro na Muhazi yo mu karere ka Rwamagana mu gihe cy\u2019amezi cumi n\u2019atanu(15) uhereye mu kwezi kwa Mutarama 2022; ukaba ubusanzwe TEARFUND yawukoreraga mu bihugu bya\u00a0Repubulika iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo na Sudani y\u2019epfo."}
{"id": "19380", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19380", "title": "Umurenge Sacco Kigabiro", "text": "Umurenge SACCO Kigabiro, ni koperative y'abaturage b'Umurenge wa Kigabiro mu Akarere ka Rwamagana mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Iyi koperative yahawe ubuzima gatozi n'Umuyobozi w\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe guteza imbere Amakoperative RCA ashingiye ku ibaruwa ya perezida wa koperative yo kuwa 09 Werurwe 2010.\nAmateka.\nIcyemezo No RCA /467/2010 cyo kuwa 29/03/2010 giha ubuzimagatozi \u00abImboni Kigabiro Savings and Credit cooperative\u00bb (IMBONI KIGABIRO SACCO)\nUmuyobozi w\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe guteza imbere Amakoperative; Ashingiye ku Itegeko no 50/2007 ryo kuwa 18 Nzeri 2007 rigena ishyirwaho, imiterere n\u2019imikorere y\u2019Amakoperative mu Rwanda, cyane cyane mu ngingo yaryo ya 23, igika cya 3; Ashingiye ku Itegeko no 16/2008 ryo kuwa 11/06/2008 rishyiraho Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe guteza Imbere Amakoperative, cyane cyane mu ngingo yaryo ya 3, igika cya 2;\nIngingo ya 1.\nIngingo ya mbere: IMBONI KIGABIRO SACCO ifite icyicaro i Cyanya, Umurenge wa Kigabiro, Akarere ka Rwamagana, Intara y\u2019Iburasirazuba, ihawe ubuzimagatozi.\nIngingo ya 2:.\nIMBONI KIGABIRO SACCO igamije guteza imbere abanyamuryango ibafasha kwizigamira no kubona inguzanyo. Ntiyemerewe gukora indi mirimo inyuranye n\u2019iyo iherewe ubuzimagatozi, keretse ibanje kubisaba ikanabiherwa uburenganzira.\nIngingo ya 3:.\nIki cyemezo kigira agaciro guhera umunsi cyatangarijweho mu Igazeti ya Leta ya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda.\nIntego.\nIMBONI KIGABIRO SACCO igamije guteza imbere abanyamuryango ibafasha kwizigamira no kubona inguzanyo. Ntiyemerewe gukora indi mirimo inyuranye n\u2019iyo yaherewe ubuzimagatozi, keretse ibanje kubisaba ikanabiherwa uburenganzira na leta."}
{"id": "19381", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19381", "title": "TEARFUND Rwanda", "text": "Tearfund, ni umushinga wa gikirisitu ukorera mu Rwanda kuva mu 1968. Ubu ukorera mu turere 12 two mu ntara y'Amajyepfo n'Uburasirazuba mu karere ka Rwamagana ndetse na Kigali, binyuze mu matorero. \nIbikorwa.\nBakorana n'abayobozi b'amatorero n'abayobozi bo munzego zibanze kugirango basubize ibibazo by'abaturage. Byinshi muribi bigerwaho binyuze mumatsinda yo kwifasha - inama zisanzwe mubaturage kubantu bashaka kuzigama amafaranga no kongera amafaranga yabo. \nAmatorero arenga 1.000 hirya no hino mu Rwanda yifatanije nakazi ka CCT, kandi, kugeza ubu, abanyamuryango b\u2019itsinda barenga 26.000 bafite ibikoresho byo gutangiza imishinga yabo. Amatsinda nayo yatojwe kwihangira imirimo kandi ahujwe nabatanga serivise yimari kugirango bateze imbere ubucuruzi bwabo."}
{"id": "19382", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19382", "title": "Twagirayezu Daniel", "text": "Twagirayezu Daniel ni umuturage akaba n'umuyobozi wo mudugudu wa Kinteko mu Kagari ka Rweru, Umurenge wa Gahengeri mu Akarere ka Rwamagana.\nAmateka.\nTwagirayezu, yahoze ari umwana wo mu muhanda utagira epfo na ruguru akaza gufashwa n\u2019ubuyobozi bwiza kuva mu muhanda ndetse na we ubwe ashingiye ku mpanuro ahabwa yiyubakamo imbaraga zatumye buri wese ubu amubonamo ubushobozi kurusha uko yari umwana wo mu muhanda.\nTwagirayezu Daniel amaze gutorerwa kuyobora uyu mudugudu inshuro eshatu kandi abaturage bemeza ko bayobowe neza nk\u2019uko byemezwa na Karemera IgnaceAti \u201cUmudugudu wacu ni intangarugero kandi natwe turabyishimira, iyo umuyobozi wacu ahawe igihembo bidutera ishema.\nTwagirayezu ahamya ko gahunda ya Girinka munyarwanda y\u2019umukuru w\u2019Igihugu Kagame Paul yo koroza Abanyarwanda na we yamugezeho kugeza ubu akaba afite inka 13 kandi na we yaroroje abandi."}
{"id": "19384", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19384", "title": "Igishanga cya ruhogo", "text": "Igishanga cya ruhogo ni igishanga gihingwamo umuceri mu karere ka Rwamagana. Ni igishanga gikora ku Mirenge itatu ariyo Kigabiro,Rubona na Mwulire, gihingwamo umuceri aho abahinzi bahoze bagihingamo kuri hegitari 270 maze Leta y'u Rwanda niy'u Buyapani ibinyujije mu kigega gishinzwe ubutwererane Mpuzamahanga (JICA) bakacyivugurura kuri ubu gihingwamo kuri hegitari 348. Kukivugurura byatwaye miliyari makumyabiri n'imwe y'amafaranga y'u Rwanda (21Million Frw) zashowe mu bikorwa byo kuvugurura ibyuzi bibiri birimo icya cyimpima na Gashara ndetse hakaba haranubatswe ikindi cyuzi gishya cya Bugugu, Hanubatswe umuyoboro ugeza amazi mu mirima. Uwo muyoboro ureshya na kilometero 23,5. Abahinzi barenga 1200 bagihingamo bavugako umusaruro wabo wikubye hafi kabiri kuko babonaga Toni eshatu kuri hegitari none ubu babona toni hafi esheshatu.\nAndi makuru.\nIcyi gishanga cya ruhogo mbere cyitaravugururwa cyatangaga umusaruro mucye ugereranije nubu cyamaze kuvugurwa. Icyo bita igishanga cya Cyaruhogo ni uk ari izina rimenyerewe, ariko ubusanzwe ni ibishanga bitandukanye, hari icyitwa Gashara, Cyimpima,Bugugu na Cyaruhogo; Ibi byose bihingwamo n'abahinzi 1,174 bibumbiye mu makoperative ane, bafite ibyuzi bihangano 3 ubu byamaze kuguvururwa byitezweho kuzabafasha kuhira ubuso bungana na hegitari 170. Icyifuzo cya minisiteri ifite ubuhinzi mu nshingano ni uko kuri hegitari imwe y'ubutaka havamo toni umunani z'umuceri, ibi ngo bizatuma n'amafaranga umuhinzi azabona aziyongera kuko azaba afite umusaruro mwinshi."}
{"id": "19385", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19385", "title": "One Cup of Milk per Child in Rwamagana", "text": "One Cup of Milk per Child, ni gahunda yatangijwe mu Karere ka Rwamagana yo guha amata abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 5, aho bayafatira mu ngo mbonezamikurire y\u2019abana bato (ECD) hagamijwe kurwanya imirire mibi mu bana.\nAmateka.\nIyi gahunda yatangijwe kuwa 06 Gashyantare 2024 mu Murenge wa Kigabiro no mu yindi mirenge itandatu hatangirijwe gahunda yo guha abana amata babasanze mu ma ECDs barererwamo, mu gihe iyi gahunda biteganyijwe kuri uyu wa 07 Gashyantare iratangizwa mu mirenge 14 yose igize Akarere ka Rwamagana. Buri mwana agenewe\u00a0 litiro 2.5 mu minsi 5. Ababyeyi bakaba basabwa kuyunganira bategurira abana indyo yuzuye no gushyigikira gahunda mbonezamikurire y\u2019abana bato; harwanywa imirire mibi n\u2019igwingira mu bana. Mu Karere ka Rwamagana habarurwa ingo mbonezamikurire 627 zirererwamo abana 32,235.\nUmuyobozi w\u2019Akarere ka Rwamagana wungirije ushinzwe imibereho myiza Umutoni Jeanne yasabye ababyeyi gishyigikira iyi gahunda kandi nabo bakagira uruhare mu kurwanya imirire mibi baha abana babo n\u2019 ibiribwa byunganira aya amata bahabwa na leta. "}
{"id": "19386", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19386", "title": "Intore z\u2019Inkomezabigwi z' Akarere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Urugerero rw\u2019Inkomezabigwi icyiciro cya 11 mu akarere ka Rwamagana, urubyiruko rwasabwe kwigira ku muco w\u2019abanyarwanda bo hambere w\u2019ubukorerabushake.\nAmateka.\nKuwa 19 Ukuboza mu murenge wa Muhazi mu kagari ka Kabare niho hashorejwe urugero rw\u2019Intore z\u2019Inkomezabigwi ku rwego rw\u2019Akarere, muri uwo muhango waranzwe no kumurika bimwe mu bikorwa byakozwe n\u2019izi ntore, ni umunsi kandi wahujwe n\u2019uw\u2019ubukorerabushake usanzwe wizihizwa ku wa 05 Ukuboza.\nUmuyobozi w\u2019Imirimo rusange mu Karere ka Rwamagana Hagenimana Jean Damasc\u00e8ne ubwo yafataga ijambo ryo gusoza urugerero rw\u2019Inkomezabigwi Icyiciro cya 11/2023 yagize ati:\u201dTubakeneye nk\u2019abakorerabushake ariko bafite disipline kuko tuzi ko mwayitojwe, mu kinyarwanda baravuga ngo ubuze imfura ata ibiheko, niyo mpamvu tubakeneye kugira ngo mubere icyitegererezo barumuna banyu, nubwo musoje Urugerero ntabwo birangiye turabakeneye mu bukorerabushake."}
{"id": "19387", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19387", "title": "Kurwanya ihohoterwa mu Mashuri mu Karere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Abarimu bo mu Murenge wa Kigabiro bagiranye igihango n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Rwamagana cyo kurwanya ihohoterwa iryo ari ryo ryose rituma abana bata ishuri. \nAmateka.\nMu kwizihiza umunsi mpuzamahanga wa Mwarimu, kuwa 14 Ukuboza 2023, mu Murenge wa Kigabiro, abarimu, abayobozi b\u2019ibigo by\u2019amashuri n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere bizihije uyu munsi mu birori byaranzwe n\u2019imbyino z\u2019abana bato, indirimbo za bamwe mu barezi ndetse n\u2019ibiganiro byashojwe n\u2019ubusabane. \nAbarimu bo mu Murenge wa Kigabiro biyemeje kurwanya ihohoterwa iryo ari ryo ryose rikorerwa abana, guzafatanya n\u2019izindi nzego kurwanya inda z\u2019imburagihe mu bangavu n\u2019izitateganyijwe ku bakuru, gufatanya kandi n\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze mu kugarura abana bataye ishuri no gutangira amakuru ku gihe aho twabonye babonye hohoterwa\u201d"}
{"id": "19388", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19388", "title": "Gahunda ya Tujyanemo Tugumanemo muri Rwamagana", "text": "Tujyanemo Tugumanemo,ni gahunda yihariye ishishikariza abaturage kwita ku mihigo mu Akarere ka Rwamagana.\nAmateka.\nUmuyobozi w\u2019Akarere ka Rwamagana wungirije ushinzwe imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage Umutoni Jeanne yasobanuye ko iyi gahunda yatangijwe hagamijwe kwihutisha imihigo na bimwe mu bikorwa byari bitangiye kugenda buhoro.\nAgira ati: \u201cNiba dushoje imihigo y\u2019uyu mwaka tuyigumanemo, ariko tunajyane mu yo tugiye gutangira, iyi gahunda turimo kuyishyiramo imbaraga cyane kugira ngo buri muntu wese abigire ibye ariko ntagire naho atakarira ahubwo ajyemo kandi agumemo.\u201d\nIbyagezweho.\nMu karere ka Rwamagana muri uyu mwaka w\u2019imihigo wa 2022/2023 bafite imihigo 107 iri mu byiciro bitatu by\u2019ingenzi ari byo ubukungu, imibereho myiza n\u2019imiyoborere."}
{"id": "19389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19389", "title": "Ishuri ry\u2019umuryango mu Akarere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Ishuri ry\u2019umuryango, ni gahunda yatangijwe mu akarere ka Rwamagana igamije guca amakimbirane mu miryango ku buryo burambye, imiryango ibana nayo ifashwa kumenya ikiyatera ikigishwa ndetse ikanaherekezwa mu rugendo rwo kuyasohokamo.\nAmateka.\nKuwa 10 Werurwe 2023 ku biro by\u2019Umurenge wa Karenge, imiryango irindwi imaze amezi atandatu yiga mu ishuri ry\u2019umuryango yahawe icyemezo cy\u2019ishimwe ko yasoje amasomo yahawe, iyi miryango ikaba yizewe kutazasubira mu makimbirane.\nKu rwego rw\u2019Akarere hari imiryango 522 yari ifitanye amakimbirane, muri aba umurenge wa Karenge wari ufite imiryango 138 ni ukuvuga ko ari 36% ibi twabibonyemo ikibazo gikomeye kandi ubuyobozi bugomba gushakamo igisubizo.\u201d\nImikorere.\nIshuri ry\u2019umuryango ni uburyo bwihariye bwo guhuza imiryango ifite amakimbirane, ikabanza kuganirizwa by\u2019umwihariko nyuma buri munsi wa Gatanu bagahurira ku buyobozi bakigishwa amasomo atandukanye.\nUmuryango ufite amakimbirane ushakirwa undi muryango w\u2019inyagamugayo ubakurikirana umunsi ku wundi mu kubahiriza ibyo bize mu ishuri, uru rugendo rwose rugomba kumara amezi atandatu umuryango bigaragaye ko nta kangononwa na gato ugifite kabasubiza mu makimbirane, bagahabwa icyemezo cy\u2019ishimwe ko barangije kwiga, aba kandi bagirana amasezerano n\u2019ubuyobozi ko batazasubira mu makimbirane.\nIngendabihe.\nIshuri ry\u2019umuryango rifite ibyiciro bibiri by\u2019ingenzi, icya mbere ni amasomo ane bahabwa mu gihe cy\u2019ukwezi, buri wa gatanu ugenerwa isomo rimwe biga mu masaha atatu kuva saa munani z\u2019amanywa kugeza saa kumi.\nUbwoko bw'amasomo.\nIsomo rya mbere ni irigaragaza isano iri hagati y\u2019igihugu n\u2019umuryango \u201cumuryango utekanye uteye imbere ni igihugu gihamye\u201d isomo rya kabiri ni impamvu y\u2019amakimbirane mu miryango, irya gatatu ni ingaruka ziba mu makimbirane naho irya kane ni ugukemura amakimbirane mu miryango.\nIcyiciro cya kabiri ni ugutangira kwigishwa no guherekezwa mu gushyira mu bikorwa ibyari mu masomo ya mbere, aha niho imiryango ubwayo ifashwa kumenya ikibazo gitera amakimbirane, uyu muryango ushakirwa umuryango w\u2019inyangamugayo uzawuherekeza muri ya masomo, buri munsi wa gatanu bagakomeza kujya hahandi bahurira haba ku biro by\u2019akagari, ku Murenge cyangwa se ku biro by\u2019umudugudu ibi bikorwa mu gihe cy\u2019amezi atanu"}
{"id": "19390", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19390", "title": "Ishuri ry\u2019Imyuga rya Rubona mu karere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Ishuri ry\u2019Imyuga rya Rubona, ryatashywe ku mugaragaro kuwa mbere tariki 31/03/2014, ryitezweho kuzamura ubumenyingiro mu rubyiruko rw\u2019akarere ka Rwamagana ku buryo rizabafungurira inzira yo kwihangira imirimo aho gutegereza kujya gusa akazi. Iri shuri riherereye mu murenge wa Rubona mu karere ka Rwamagana ryeguriwe akarere kakazajya karicunga ku bufatanye na Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi.\nAmateka.\nIri shuri ryuzuye ritwaye ibihumbi 290 by\u2019amadolari ya Amerika (amanyarwanda agera kuri 196.521.502) yatanzwe ku nkunga ya Sosiyete y\u2019Abanyakoreya y\u2019Epfo \u201cHYUNDAI\u201d yamamaye cyane mu gukora imodoka ku bufatanye n\u2019Umuryango mpuzamahanga \u201cPlan International Rwanda.\nIri shuri kugeza ubu ririmo abanyeshuri 145 biganjemo abakobwa rizakomeza gufashwa na Hyundai ndetse na Plan International Rwanda mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka 2 iri imbere mu rwego rwo rwo gukomeza kwiyubaka."}
{"id": "19391", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19391", "title": "Kiliziya ya Orthodox i Rwamagana", "text": "Kiliziya Gatolika ya orotodogisi, ni torero rya kabiri rinini rya gikirisitu, rifite abayoboke bagera kuri miliyoni 220 ku isi. Mu rwego rwo kwagura iri dini kuwa 27 Ukwakira 2022,hatashye urusengero rushya rwubatse mu Karere ka Rwamagana. \nAmateka.\nKiliziya ya Orthodox, yemerewe bwa mbere gukorera ku butaka bw\u2019u Rwanda mu 2013. Yatangiriye mu karere ka Kirehe ahitwa mu Kaziba. Kugeza ubu ifite abayoboke babarirwa hagati y\u2019ibihumbi birindwi n\u2019umunani.\nMusenyeri wa Kiliziya ya Orthodox mu Rwanda, mu Burundi no mu Burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demukarasi ya Congo, Innocentios Byakatonda avuga ko Kiriziya y'aba Orthodox ifite imishinga iteganya gufatanyamo na Leta y'u Rwanda, bahereye ku kigo nderabuzima bagiye kubaka mu karere ka Rwamagana."}
{"id": "19392", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19392", "title": "Impamba y'Umwana ku Ishuri muri Rwamagana", "text": "Impamba y'Umwana ku Ishuri, ni gahunda y'ubukangurambaga yatangijwe mu akarere ka Rwamagana, igamije kunganira gahunda y\u2019ifunguro ku ishuri (School Feeding) yashyizweho na Minisiteri y'uburezi mu Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nMu karere ka Rwamagana, iki gikorwa cyakorwe n\u2019abaturage mu mirenge yose k'ubufatanye n'abayobozi bo munzego zibanze hagamijwe ko nta mwana uzongera guta ishuri bitewe n\u2019uko iwabo babuze amafaranga yo kwishyura ifunguro ku ishuri.\nKuwa 13 Ukwakira 2022, ku kigo cy\u2019amashuri cya GS Rusisiro giherereye mu murenge wa Musha niho hashorejwe ubukangurambaga bwiswe Impamba y\u2019Umwana ku ishuri, iyi gahunda yateguwe mu mirenge yose.\nNi nyuma y\u2019aho Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi yashyizeho amabwiriza agena amafaranga agomba gutangwa n\u2019umubyeyi ku ishuri aya akaba ari ayo kunganira \u2018School Feeding mu mashuri y\u2019incuke, abanza n\u2019ayisumbuye.\nMuri iyi gahunda umuturage asabwa gutanga ikiro kimwe cy\u2019ibinyampeke ku musaruro yabonye, hari abadahinga ariko bafite ubushobozi nabo basabwa gutanga byibuze amafaranga y\u2019ikiro kimwe cy\u2019ibinyampeke(ibigori, amasaka n\u2019umuceri).\nMuri ubu bukangurambaga hakusanyijwe ibiro 818 by\u2019ibishyimbo, amasaka hakusanyijwe toni eshatu zirenga n\u2019aho ibigori ni toni eshatu n\u2019ibiro 599 hakusanyijwe kandi amafaranga ibihumbi 150.\nUbu bwunganizi buzatangwa mu bigo hakurikijwe imibare y\u2019abana bahari bakomoka mu miryango itishoboye, amasaka azavamo igikoma cy\u2019abana bari mu marerero ya Leta ndetse n\u2019amashuri y\u2019incuke.\nMuri 2021/2022 abana bari barataye ishuri ni 716, hagarutse 657 nk\u2019uko bitangazwa n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Rwamagana."}
{"id": "19393", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19393", "title": "Abarinzi b\u2019igihango bo mu Karere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Abarinzi b'igihango.\nNi abantu bagizwe n\u2019abagize uruhare mu guhisha no kurengera abahigwaga muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994, n\u2019abandi bakoze ibikorwa by\u2019indashyikirwa mu guteza imbere ubumwe bw\u2019abanyarwanda no guhuza Abanyarwanda.,Abarinzi b\u2019igihango bo mu Karere ka Rwamagana bashishikarizwa kwitwara neza bakirinda kwishora mu byaha bikomeye byatuma bakwa iryo shimwe nkuko bigarukwaho n'Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Rwamagana mu butumwa bwatanzwe ubwo hatangizwaga ukwezi k\u2019ubumwe n\u2019ubudaheranwa bw\u2019abanyarwanda, n\u2019igikorwa cyabereye ku biro by\u2019umurenge wa Muhazi kuri uyu wa 04 Ukwakira 2022.,\nIshimwe rihabwa Abarinzi b'igihango.\nAbarinzi b\u2019igihango bahabwa imidari y\u2019ishimwe ku bakiriho, naho abatakiriho bahabwa ibyemezo by'ishimwe mu imiryango yabo. \nMu murenge wa Muhazi, umwe mu abarinzi b'igihangao Mukabaranga Patricie ufite imyaka 52, muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994 afatanyije n\u2019umubyeyi we bahishe abantu bane barabarinda kugeza ubwo ingabo z\u2019Inkotanyi zibatabaye. "}
{"id": "19394", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19394", "title": "Indwara ya muryamo mu Akarere ka Rwamagana", "text": "Muryamo y\u2019ingurube, ni indwara iterwa na virus ya (African Swine Fever Virus) ikaba ifata ingurube zorowe ndetse n\u2019ingurube zo mu gasozi. Iyi ndwara ya muryango yagaragaye mu bworozi bw'ingurube mu murenge wa Muyumbu mu Karere ka Rwamagana nkuko bitangazwa muri raporo y'ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe Iterambere ry\u2019Ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi, RAB mu itangazo yashyize hanze kuwa Kane tariki ya 16 Nzeri 2021.\nIbimenyetso.\nIbimenyetso biyiranga ni umuriro mwinshi uri hejuru ya degr\u00e9 Celcius mirongo ine (40oC), kunanirwa kurya, kunanirwa kugenda, gutitira, gutukura ku bice by\u2019umutwe, ku nda no ku maboko n\u2019amaguru uhereye ku bice by\u2019imyanya myibarukiro.\nKurwanya Muryamo.\nRAB yavuze ko mu rwego rwo guhashya ubwo burwayi bwamaze kugaragara mu Rwanda, aborozi b\u2019ingurube, Inzego z\u2019Ibanze n\u2019Abaturarwanda muri rusange bamenyeshwa ko indwara ya muryamo y\u2019ingurube ari indwara y\u2019icyorezo, kandi nta muti nta n\u2019urukingo igira.\nAborozi bose basabwe guhagarika kuzerereza ingurube ku gasozi, ingurube zikaguma mu biraro, umworozi wese ushaka kujyana cyangwa kugurisha ingurube ye azajya abihererwa icyangombwa n\u2019umuganga w\u2019amatungo k\u2019Umurenge cyemeza ko itungo rye nta burwayi rifite kandi yubahirize amabwiriza yo gukumira icyorezo cya Muryamo y\u2019ingurube"}
{"id": "19395", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19395", "title": "Kwigira TVET Rwamagana", "text": "Kwigira TVET Rwamagana, ni ishuri ry'imyuga riherereye mu Kagari ka Cyanya mu Murenge wa Kigabiro mu Karere ka Rwamagana. \nAmateka.\nBinyuze muri iki kigo kuwa 21/08/2021, abanyeshuri 26 bize ubudozi bahawe imashini zibafasha gutangira kwihangira umurimo, no kujya ku isoko ry\u2019umurimo. Iri shuri riterwa inkunga n'umushinga umuryango Umbrella for Vulnerable ryashinzwe na Sheikh Habimana Saleh \nAbanyeshuri barangije kwiga imyuga mu Kwigira TVET Rwamagana, bize imyuga itandukanye, harimo ubudozi, guteka, amashanyarazi n\u2019amazi, ni amasomo bahabwa mu gihe cy\u2019amezi 12, ndetse bagafashwa mu buzima bwo hanze aho abenshi bafashwa kubona akazi, dore ko nkuko bivugwa na Sheikh Habimana Saleh ngo kuva 2014, abana bose bahize 80% byabo bafite akazi \u201ckandi keza\u201d, ngo hari bane muri bo ubu bakorera Zambia.\nUbuhamya.\nTuyisenge Christine ni umwe mu bakobwa bize kudoda, yemeza ko ubumenyi afite bumuha imbaraga zo guhangana ku isoko ry\u2019umurimo. Ati: \u201cHamwe no gukomeza gukora no kwibumbira muri koperative, tuzakomeza gutera imbere no guhindura sosiyeti aho dutuye.\u201d"}
{"id": "19396", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19396", "title": "A Selfish Woman", "text": "A selfish Woman, ni filime ivuga ku nkuru y\u2019umwari (Joella) uba warasigiwe inshingano zo kwita ku bavandimwe be (James na Ange) nyuma y\u2019uko abayeyi be bakoze icyaha kigatuma bashakishwa n\u2019ubutabera bagatoroka. \nAmateka.\nIyi filime yatangijwe urubyiruko rwo mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Ni filme ishingiye ku mukobwa uba ufite ibyo yasezeranyije iwabo agomba kubakorera ariko ibyo ashaka kubakorera bigatuma yirengagizwa ibyo ashaka nk\u2019umuntu kuko inshingano aba yaremereye iwabo zibangamira ubuzima bwe, abantu yakundaga arabareka, ibyo yakabaye akora akabireka kugira ngo anezeze abo yasezeranyije.\nIgice cya mbere n\u2019icya kabiri cyayo kigizwe n'uduce 60 ikindi izanjya isohoka inshuro ebyiri mu cyumweru, ica ku murongo wa Youtube witwa Indongozi Muzika.\nMu bakinnyi bayirimo bazwi harimo Mugabo Cosette usanzwe umenyerewe mu gukina filme, Kwizera wamenyekanye ubwo yashakanaga n\u2019umugore umurusha imyaka 27 n\u2019abandi batandukanye, Iyi filime ikazajya isohoka inshuro ebyiri mu cyumweru.\nUmwanditsi.\nUmuyobozi w\u2019iyi Filime akanaba uwayanditse, Ishimwe Unique Olivier yavuze ko yakoze iyi fiilme agamije kugaragaza ingaruka zo gukora wishushanya muri rubanda ukigira uwo utari we kugira ngo ushimwe."}
{"id": "19397", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19397", "title": "Inzu z'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda", "text": "Inzu z'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda zigiye kuzajya zisora.\nMu Rwanda hasohotse"}
{"id": "19398", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19398", "title": "Lillian Mbabazi", "text": "Lillian Mbabazi ni umunyarwanda akaba ari umuhanzi ufata amajwi ukorera ibikorwa bye muri umuganda. Yavukiye muri Uganda ku babyeyi b'u Rwanda. Nk\u2019uko byatangajwe na Uganda wamamaza muri Bryan Morel Publications, mu injyana ya muzika ya Lilian ni neo-roho ifitanye isano na R&amp;B Band. akaba Yari umunyamuryango wa Blu ya 3. Muri 2014, yari umwe mu bahanzi bagaragaye mu gihembwe cya kabiri cya Coke Studio Africa, yaje kandi kugaragara muri Filimi. \nUmwuga.\nMbabazi yatangiye kwitwara neza mu 2003, nyuma y\u2019amarushanwa ya Coca-Cola Pop Star yatumye hashyirwaho Blu ya 3. Yabonye intsinzi muri muzika hamwe nitsinda, yatsindiye Umuhanzi / Itsinda ryiza muri Uganda &amp; Video yumuziki mwiza wo muri Uganda muri 2005 Kisima Music Awards, ndetse na filimi ikaba Video y'umwaka (Hitaji) muri Pearl of Africa Music Awards muri 2005 \nYatsindiye kandi Video yumwaka (Burrn) muri 2007 Pearl of Africa Music Awards 2007 kandi yatorewe kuba Itsinda ryiza rya Afrika yuburasirazuba bwiza muri 2005 muri Kora Awards. Yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya Album ya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (\"Hitaji\") mu bihembo bya muzika bya Tanzaniya 2005 ndetse na filimi, Video nziza yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (Frisky) mu 2006 muri Channel O Music Video Awards. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, yatowe mu ndirimbo nziza yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (\"Aho uri\" kumwe na Radio &amp; Weasel) mu bihembo bya muzika bya Tanzaniya 2010 naho mu 2009, yatowe mu itsinda ryiza &amp; Umuhanzi witwaye neza mu 2009 muri MTV Africa Music Awards 2009. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, yatangiye umwuga wenyine kandi afite indirimbo nziza nka \"Vitamine\" hamwe na Weasel wo muri bombi Goodlyfe Crew, Kawa na Akaga Yakoranye na Goodlyfe Crew, Navio, AY, P-Unit na Kitoko.\u00a0\nMu mwaka wa 2016, Mbabazi yatsindiye igihembo cye cya mbere mu bihembo bya HiPipo Music Awards kubera ibihembo bye byo kwibuka hamwe na A Pass. \nRadiyo.\nMbabazi yatangiye gukora kuri 91.3 Capital FM, imwe mu maradiyo akomeye ya FM muri Uganda, nyuma yo kugenda kwa mugenzi wabo mukuru wa Big Breakfast Karitas Karisimbi mu myaka ya za 2000. Icyakora, yavuye kuri sitasiyo kugira ngo yibande ku mwuga we wa muzika mbere gato yuko Blu ya 3 isenyuka maze asimburwa kuri sitasiyo na Jackie Lumbasi. Nyuma yaje kwinjira kuri Radiyo yo mu mujyi \nUbuzima bwite.\nMbabazi yari afitanye umubano na nyakwigendera umucuranzi wa Radio Mowzey (25 Mutarama 1985 - 1 Gashyantare 2018), babyarana abana babiri (Asante Manzi na Izuba). Bivugwa ko abo bashakanye babanye kuva igihe bari muri kaminuza ya Makerere, mbere yo gutandukana kwabo amezi make kugeza mu 2015. Abashakanye bamaze kubona umwana wabo wa mbere, bahuye nibibazo byinshi amaherezo biganisha ku gutandukana. "}
{"id": "19399", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19399", "title": "Mbanda John", "text": "Mbanda John, uzwi cyane ku izina rye ry'ubuhanzi Calvin Mbanda (yavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 1998) avukira i Kinyinya, mu Karere ka Gasabo, mu Rwanda ni umuririmbyi akaba ari umukinnyi wa Filimi wo mu Rwanda, umwanditsi w'indirimbo akaba n'umuhanzi. Yatangiye umwuga we wa muzika mu 2019. Yavuze ko gutsinda kwe kuri label ye yari ifitwe na BadRam, wagenzuye Mbanda afite imyaka 21. Muri 2019, yatangiye gukorana na The Mane Music House irimo abahanzi barimo Jay Polly atangira gukora indirimbo nka Aye, Tiktak, Aba Abantu. Yasohoye indirimbo zirimo Ariel Wayz, Marina, Tuyishime Joshua, Safi Madiba, Victor Rukotana, Mbanda azwi cyane mu ndirimbo ze za mbere. Indirimbo ze zose zatoranijwe mu bihembo bitatu birimo \"Kiss summer awards\", \"Ibihembo byatoranijwe\", \"ibihembo bya Isangonamuzika\", nyuma Mbanda avuga ko atazongera gukorana na Mane Music House. "}
{"id": "19400", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19400", "title": "Ga\u00ebl Faye", "text": "Ga\u00ebl Faye (Yavutse ku ya 6 Kanama 1982) ni Umunyarwanda akaba ari umuririmbyi w\u2019umufaransa, umuraperi, n'umwanditsi w'ibitabo indirimbo n'afilimi zitandukanye.\nUbuzima bwite.\nFaye yavukiye i Bujumbura, mu Burundi, kwa se w'umufaransa na nyina w'u Rwanda. Yimukiye mu Bufaransa afite imyaka 13, ahunga intambara yo mu Burundi. Yize ubukungu n\u2019imari. \nArubatse, afite abakobwa babiri. \nIgitabo.\nFaye yanditse igitabo yatewe inkunga n'uburambe bwe mu myaka y'ubwangavu ku ntambara yo mu Burundi. \"Igihugu gito\" (\"Petit Pays\") cyasohowe bwa mbere mu Bufaransa muri Kanama 2016 na Grasset. Yatsindiye ibihembo bitanu byubuvanganzo. Yahinduwe mu ndimi 36 ikorerwa muri firime, yasohotse muri 2020. \nUmuziki.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, Faye na Edgar Sekloka basohoye alubumu ya rap na hip-hop yitwa \"Amata Kawa n'Isukari\" (n'izina ry'itsinda ryabo). \nFaye yahise asohora alubumu eshatu wenyine na EP imwe: \"Pili Pili sur un Croissant au Beurre\" (2013), Des fleurs EP (2014) \"Lundi M\u00e9chant\" (2020) na \"Mauve Jacaranda\" (2022). \"Lundi M\u00e9chant\" yagiye zahabu muri 2022."}
{"id": "19401", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19401", "title": "Simon Bikindi", "text": "Simon Bikindi (Yavutse 28 Nzeri 1954 apfa 15 Ukuboza 2018) yari umucuranzi n'umuririmbyi wo mu Rwanda wahoze azwi cyane mu Rwanda. Indirimbo ze zo gukunda igihugu ni zo zakinnye kuri radiyo y'igihugu Radiyo y'u Rwanda mu gihe cy'intambara na genocide yakorewe abatutsi muri 194 mu Rwanda. Kubera ibikorwa yakoze mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda, yaburanishijwe ahamwa n'icyaha cyo gushishikariza jenoside n'Urukiko mpuzamahanga mpanabyaha rw\u2019u Rwanda (ICTR) muri 2008. Yapfuye azize diyabete mu bitaro bya Benini mu Kuboza 2018.\nAmavu n'amavuko mugihe cya jenoside.\nBikindi, yavukiye i Rwerere muri perefegitura y\u2019amajyaruguru ubu ni mu intara y'amajyaruguru akarere ka Munsaze mu y\u2019iburengerazuba bwa Gisenyi, ako karere kavamo Perezida Habyarimana na benshi mu bantu bakomeye mu butegetsi bwe bwa MRND.\nMu gihe cya jenoside, yari umuhimbyi uzwi akaba n'umuririmbyi wa muzika uzwi cyane akaba n'umuyobozi w'itsinda ryitwa \"Irindiro Ballet\". Indirimbo ze zasobanuwe ko zifite amagambo ya elliptique n'indirimbo zishimishije, haba mu icyongereza, igifaransa na Kinyarwanda no guhuza inyandiko za rap style hamwe nindirimbo gakondo za rubanda. Filimi ya mbere, yasohotse muri 1990, yari iy'indirimbo z'ubukwe gakondo. Yongeyeho kandi ko yari umukozi wa Leta muri Minisiteri y\u2019Urubyiruko na Siporo akaba n'umwe mu bagize ishyaka rya MRND.\nZimwe mu ndirimbo ze zerekeje ku batutsi zacuranzwe kuri Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Libre des Mille Collines kugira ngo zishishikarize ubwicanyi. Yavuye mu gihugu hasigaye iminsi mike ngo itsembabwoko ritangire ariko agaruka nyuma muri Kamena. Ni ikibazo cyo kujya impaka niba yaragize uruhare muri jenoside ndetse n\u2019urwego ki, ariko nk'uko byemejwe n\u2019urukiko mpuzamahanga mpanabyaha rw\u2019u Rwanda (ICTR), bigaragazwa nta gushidikanya na gato ko yaba yarifatanije n\u2019interahamwe z\u2019intagondwa z\u2019intagondwa. kandi yasabye ku mugaragaro Abahutu gutsemba Abatutsi bose muri Kamena 1994. Nyuma yo kwigarurira FPR, yahunze igihugu. Indirimbo ze zirabujijwe mu Rwanda kuva mu 1994. \nIkigeragezo.\nInyandiko y'ibirego no gufatwa.\nBikindi yashinjwaga n\u2019urukiko mpuzamahanga mpanabyaha rw\u2019u Rwanda (ICTR). Yashinjwaga ibi bikurikira: umugambi wo gukora genocide ; itsembabwoko, cyangwa ubundi bufatanye muri jenoside ; gushishikariza no gukangurira rubanda gukora jenoside, n'ubwicanyi no gutotezwa, nk'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Inyandiko y'ibirego yavugaga ko Bikindi \"yahimbye, aririmba, yandika cyangwa akwirakwiza ibikorwa bya muzika bishimangira ubufatanye bw'Abahutu no gushinja abatutsi kuba imbata y'Abahutu \". Ubushinjacyaha bwatanze indirimbo yise The Awakening ariko bakunze kwita Nanga aba bahutu (Nanga Abahutu), yibasiye Abahutu bashyigikiye abatutsi cyane cyane abo bahutu bakoranye n\u2019inyeshyamba zo mu gihugu cy\u2019abatutsi bo mu Rwanda barwanya guverinoma. \nByongeye kandi, havuzwe ko mu mezi yabanjirije itsembabwoko, Bikindi \"yagishije inama na Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, Minisitiri w\u2019Urubyiruko na Siporo, Callixte Nzabonimana n\u2019ubuyobozi bwa gisirikare bwahujwe na MRND ku magambo y\u2019indirimbo\" mbere yo kubarekura ngo bakinwe ku bahutu. Amashanyarazi ya radiyo RTLM. Ubushinjacyaha bwavuze kandi ko mu minsi 100 ya jenoside kuva ku ya 7 Mata kugeza ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1994, Bikindi yagize uruhare mu bwicanyi, haba muri perefegitura ya Kigali na Gisenyi, kandi ko yafashije mu gushaka no gutegura imitwe yitwara gisirikare \"ya Interahamwe\". \nNyuma yo gufatwa i Leiden mu Buholandi ku ya 12 Nyakanga 2001, Bikindi yarwanyije koherezwa mu mahanga maze asaba ubuhungiro. Icyakora, nyuma y'amezi umunani, ku ya 27 Werurwe 2002, yashyizwe mu maboko ya ICTR. Nyuma yaje kwirega ku byaha byose aregwa maze afungirwa muri gereza y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye (UNDF) i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya. Nyuma y\u2019ubukererwe, urubanza rwe rw\u2019ibyaha by\u2019intambara rwatangiye ku ya 15 Gicurasi 2006. Yari ahagarariwe n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019igice cya Kenya cya komisiyo mpuzamahanga y\u2019abahanga mu mategeko (ICJ), Wilfred Ngunjiri Nderitu.\nIbisobanuro.\nUsibye ibindi bimenyetso, ubushinjacyaha bwatanze indirimbo yishimira ikurwaho ry'ubwami no kugarura ubwigenge kuva 1959 kugeza 1961: impuguke y'u Rwanda mu rubanza yaje gusobanura ko indirimbo ya nyuma idashobora kwandikirwa igihugu cy'u Rwanda muri rusange, kubera ko Abatutsi bari bafitanye isano n\u2019ubwami bw\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019ubutegetsi bwa gikoloni, kandi ko bidashoboka kwanga ingoma ya cyami utabanje kwanga abatutsi. Ubwunganizi bwavuze ko mu buhamya bw\u2019abatangabuhamya harimo kwivuguruza, bahakana ko izo ndirimbo zivuga ku batutsi no guhamagarira abatangabuhamya b\u2019abatutsi Bikindi ngo bafashije kurokora ubuzima bwabo. \nKu bijyanye n'indirimbo, impande zombi zari zifite impuguke ku ruhande rwazo, ariko ntawahakana ko amagambo yari agoye kuyasobanura kandi ko demokarasi n'amahoro byavuzwe. Umwunganizi wa Bikindi yavuze kandi ko gushinja Bikindi ari \"kumwima uburenganzira bwe bwo kuvuga\". Umwe mu bunganira uregwa yashinjwaga kuba yarahaye ruswa umutangabuhamya. Umwunganira mukuru wunganira abaregwa yemeye ikirego cy\u2019ubushinjacyaha, bituma Bikindi yanga gukomeza kumuhagararira ukundi. Nyuma ICTR yakuyeho avoka icyo kirego. \nItsinda ry'ubushinjacyaha mu rubanza rwa Bikindi ryasabye igihano cy'igifungo cya burundu, igihano gikomeye urukiko rutanga. Ubwunganizi bwasabye umwere.\nUrubanza.\nUkuboza 2008, Bikindi yakatiwe igifungo cy\u2019imyaka 15 n\u2019inguzanyo y\u2019imyaka 7 yari amaze akora, kubera gushishikariza jenoside. Iki gihano cyaturutse ku kuba urukiko rwasanze byagaragaye nta gushidikanya na gato ko mu mpera za Kamena 1994 yari yavuze ijambo ry\u2019imodoka ya Interahamwe ifite sisitemu yo kubarizamo rubanda, asaba kandi yibutsa abaturage b'Abahutu gutsemba abatutsi bose, uwo yise \"inzoka\". Ibindi birego byose byavanyweho; by'umwihariko, urukiko rwasanze mu gihe indirimbo zimwe na zimwe zifite imiterere ishishikaje, zose zanditswe mbere ya 1994, bityo mbere ya jenoside, kandi ko nta bimenyetso bihagije byerekana ko Bikindi yagize uruhare mu gukwirakwiza indirimbo ze kuri radio mugihe cya jenoside, cyangwa ko we ubwe yagize uruhare mubwicanyi cyangwa gutegura imitwe yitwara gisirikare. \nKwakira.\nUrubanza rwari rwarafashwe nkikibazo kubera ikibazo giteye impungenge cyuko umuhanzi akurikiranwa ku bushake kubera ibikorwa bye, ubuhanzi bukaba bushobora gusobanurwa mu buryo butandukanye. Urubanza ariko rwirinze iki kibazo kitavugwaho rumwe, kubera ko rutari rushingiye ku ndirimbo za Bikindi. \nUbuzima bwa muntu n'imiterere.\nMu gihe cya jenoside, Bikindi yari afitanye umubano na Angeline Mukabanana, umututsi. Mu kiganiro yagiranye n'ikinyamakuru New York Times muri 2008, yagaragaje igitekerezo cye ko Bikindi nta muntu yangaga kandi ko yari umuntu ufite amahirwe, ashishikajwe no gushimisha. Yavuze ko Bikindi yareze umuhungu we, wari ufite se w\u2019abatutsi, kandi akaba yarafashije abaturanyi babo b'Abatutsi kurwanya abicanyi b'Abahutu. Mukabanana yavuze ko Bikindi amaze kwandika \"Nanze aba bahutu\", amubaza impamvu yanditse ibyo kandi yerekana ko bishoboka ko FPR yatsinze intambara. Yavuze ko yashubije ati: Guverinoma itegeka kwandika izi ndirimbo. Nunva FPR izaza i Kigali ukwezi gutaha, nzabandikira indirimbo. "}
{"id": "19402", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19402", "title": "Nyungura Cornelius", "text": "Cornelius Nyungura (yavutse ku ya 24 Werurwe 1977), uzwi ku izina rya stage Corneille, ni umuririmbyi wa R and B wo muri Kanada. Yavukiye mu Budage bw'Iburengerazuba ku babyeyi b'a Rwanda. Igihe kinini cy'ubwana bwe yamaze mu Rwanda, amaherezo yimukira i Quebec, muri Kanada, muri 1997. Aririmba mu Gifaransa n'Icyongereza. Ibikorwa bye byamenyekanye cyane muzike y'abanyamerika numuziki w'ubugingo ; ndetse na Prince, Marvin Gaye.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nCorneille yavukiye i Freiburg im Breisgau, mu Budage, nubwo ubuzima bwe bwose yabukoresheje mu Rwanda. Yavumbuye ishyaka rye muri muzika muri 1993, nuko yinjira mu itsinda rya R B, ryatsinze amarushanwa ya D\u00e9couverte 1993. Ibi kandi byamumenyesheje kwandika indirimbo no guhimba umuziki. Icyakora, ubuzima bwe bwarahindutse nyuma ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda mu 1994. Se, Emile Nyungura, yari umuyobozi w\u2019ishyaka rya politiki PSD yatekerezaga ko arwanya leta bityo akaba ari igitero; Corneille yiboneye iyicwa ry'ababyeyi be na barumuna be na bashiki be batatu afite imyaka 17. Yahungiye mu Budage, aho nshuti z'ababyeyi be bamujyanye.\nUmwuga.\nMuri Nyakanga 1997, Corneille yahisemo kuva mu Budage kugira ngo akomeze amasomo mu itumanaho, maze yimukira i Montreal, muri Kanada, kugira ngo yige muri kaminuza ya Concordia. Muri kiriya gihe, yashinze one, itsinda R and B, hamwe na Pierre Gage na Gardy Martin, abo bahuye nyuma gato yo kugera i Qu\u00e9bec. \"Zoukin\", imwe mu ndirimbo z'itsinda ryanditswe na Corneille, yazamutse ku mwanya wa mbere mu gukina indege za Kanada. Hanyuma, mu ntangiriro za 2001, Corneille yavuye muri iryo tsinda, yifuza gukomeza umwuga wenyine. Yatangiye kwibanda ku ndirimbo ze kahise. Muri 2002, Corneille yakoze imishinga itandukanye. Yanditse kandi ahimba indirimbo Ce soir yo gukusanya \"Cocktail R and B 2\" (Ghetto R&amp;B, Sony Music) na Si seulement on s'aimait ya \"Hip Hop Folies\" (Sony Music). Yatumiwe na Dave Stewart, yaririmbye mu imurikagurisha rye rya mbere ryabereye i R\u00e9servoir i Paris, maze agira amahirwe yo kuririmbana na Jimmy Cliff. Muri Mutarama 2003, yatumiriwe kuzitabira nk'igikorwa cyo gufungura Cunnie Williams muri Olympia. \nAlbum ya mbere ya Corneille, verisiyo yo muri Kanada ya \"Parce qu'on vient de loin\", yasohotse ku ya 10 Nzeri 2002. Inyandiko y\u2019igifaransa yarimo ibihembo byinshi kuri disiki ya kabiri, yasohotse ku ya 20 Ukwakira 2003, ihita igenda neza. Muri Mata 2003, Corneille yaririmbanye na Craig David, asubiramo umurongo mu gifaransa mu ndirimbo \"Rise and Fall\". Yakoze urugendo rwe rwa mbere muri Gicurasi 2003, akinira amazu yuzuye i Paris, Marseille, Lyon na Bordeaux. Muri Werurwe 2005, uyu muhanzikazi yitabiriye igitaramo \"Africa Live\", cyateguwe mu rwego rwo kurwanya (malariya). Bwari bwo bwa mbere agaruka ku mugabane w'iwabo kuva jenoside. Album ya kabiri ya Corneille ya \"Les marchands de r\u00eaves\", yasohotse mu Gushyingo 2005. Corneille yakoranye na Croix Rouge yo muri Kanada mu rwego rwo gukangurira abana bazize intambara. Yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere yo mu Cyongereza, \"Ivuka rya Koruneliyo\", muri Nyakanga 2007. Mu mpera za 2014 yabaye umunywanyi mu gihembwe cya gatanu cya tereviziyo y\u2019Ubufaransa TF1 ' \"Danse avec les Stars\".\nMu 2022 yatorewe kuba muri Manie Musicale maze atsinda irushanwa. \nIbindi.\nCorneille yanditse indirimbo Il \u00e9tait temps kuri Virginie Pouchain nyuma yo kwemererwa guhagararira Ubufaransa mu marushanwa y'indirimbo za Eurovision 2006. Indirimbo yarangije umwanya wa 22 kuri 24 barangije. \nMuri 2014, yitabiriye igihembwe cya gatanu cya \"Danse avec les star\" - Igifaransa cyo \"kubyina hamwe na Stars\". Yafatanije n'umubyinnyi wabigize umwuga Candice Pascal. Ku ya 8 Ugushyingo 2014, bakuweho barangiza ku mwanya wa 6 kuri 11 bahatanira.\nUbuzima bwite.\nCorneille yashakanye n'umunyamideli ukomoka muri Kanada akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime Sofia de Medeiros mu 2006; bafite umwana umwe. \nIbindi.\nFilimi.\nAlbum za studio"}
{"id": "19403", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19403", "title": "Jean-Paul Samputu", "text": "Jean-Paul Samputu (yavutse ku ya 15 Werurwe 1962) ni umuririmbyi wo mu Rwanda, umwanditsi w'indirimbo, n'umucuranzi. Uwatsindiye igihembo cya Kora muri 2003, Samputu azenguruka isi nka ambasaderi w\u2019umuco mu Rwanda.\nYavukiye mu Rwanda muri 1962, Samputu yatangiye kuririmba muri 1977 muri korari y'itorero, kandi yayobowe n'umuziki gakondo ndetse n'uw'iki gihe, nka Stevie Wonder, Bob Marley, Jimmy Cliff, na Lionel Richie. Yageze muri Amerika muri 2004 mu myaka icumi Yibuka, igikorwa cyo kwibuka imyaka 10 jenoside yabaye mu Rwanda. \nSamputu aririmba mu ndimi esheshatu (Kinyarwanda, Igiswahiri, Lingala, Ganda, Igifaransa n'Icyongereza) ndetse no mu buryo butandukanye kuva soukous, rhumba na reggae, kugeza mu Rwanda gakondo 5/8, Afrobeat, pygmy, na gospel. Ahuza imigenzo idasanzwe ya muzika ituruka mu turere twose two mu Rwanda, muri zo, Intwatwa, Umushayayo, Imparamba, na Ikinimba.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nJean Paul Samputu yavutse ku ya 15 Werurwe 1962 i Butare, mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "19404", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19404", "title": "Muneza Christophe", "text": "Muneza Christophe (Yavutse ku ya 30 Mutarama 1994), bakunze kwita Christopher Muneza uyu ni umuririmbyi, umwanditsi w'indirimbo ndetse n'umuhanzi. \nYabaye uwabonye umwanya wa kabiri muri Primus Guma Guma Superstar (PGGSS ibihe 6 na 7. Intsinzi ye ayitirira we n'umujyanama we Clement Ishimwe, wagenzuye Muneza afite imyaka 15. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yatangiye gukorana na Kina Music House irimo abahanzi benshi barimo Butera Knowless atangira gukora indirimbo nka \" Sigaho \", \" mi casa \", \" Ishema \", agaragara muri \"Like nk'umwamikazi\" na Lil G yanditswe na Umuraperi Racine. Muri 2017, uyu muhanzi yitabiriye amarushanwa ya Primus Guma Guma Super Star aho yavuze ko nyuma ya \" PGGSS \", atazongera gukorana na Kina Music. Muri uwo mwaka ninabwo yamuritse album ye \"ijuru rito\" ubwo hizihizwaga umunsi w'abakundanye. Mu mwaka w'2019 yongeye kumurika indi Album kumunsi nkuwo, byatumye bamwe mubakunzi be bamubaza impamvu akunda kumurika ibihangano bye kuri uwo munsi, ababwira ko impvu ari uko uwo munsi ujyanye n'ibihangano akora"}
{"id": "19405", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19405", "title": "Alpha Rwirangira", "text": "Alpha Rwirangira (Yavutse 25 Gicurasi 1986) ni umuririmbyi ndetse n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo. Aririmba umuziki w'isi, reggae, R B, n'umuziki wo kubyina byose mu Cyongereza, Igiswahiri na Kinyarwanda.\nUmuziki.\nNyuma yuko Rwirangira atsindiye East East Tusker Project Fame nibwo umwuga we wumuziki wabigize umwuga watangiye. Ibi bimutera gufata amajwi no gukorana na AY yo muri Tanzaniya ku ndirimbo yitwa \"Songa Mbele\", na Bebe Cool, ku ndirimbo \"Ngwino\". \nNyuma yo gusohora iyi ndirimbo, ibihuha byatangiye gukwirakwira ko Rwirangira \" atari Umunyarwanda nyawe \", kubera ko ari mubyara wa AY Nyuma yo gutsindira Tusker Project Fame, Alpha yatangiye kuzenguruka Afurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, Rwirangira yarangije asohora alubumu ye ya mbere yise \"One Africa,\" alubumu iteza imbere ubumwe n'ubwiyunge mu Banyafurika. Yaje kuyitangiza mu Rwanda, Kenya, Uganda, Tanzaniya, n'Uburundi. \nMu 2012, Rwirangira, yimukiye muri Amerika kwiga kaminuza ya Campbellsville, muri Kentucky kugira ngo akomeze amasomo ye ya muzika. \nMu mwaka wa 2012 mu biruhuko bya Noheri mu Rwanda, Rwirangira yafashe amajwi abiri, imwe hamwe na King James \"Uhuza\", \" Bwiza \" hamwe n\u2019amahoro na \" African Swagga irimo Rah P. Mu 2013 yakoranye na La'Myia Nziza mu ndirimbo Ijuru\".\nImpaka.\nAlpha Rwirangira yegukanye ibihembo bya Pearl of Africa Music Awards 2011 nk'umuhanzi mwiza w\u2019umugabo w\u2019u Rwanda, ariko yanga kwitabira ibirori byo gutanga ibihembo, kuko yumvaga bitateguwe nabi. \nAlpha Rwirangira yanze gusinyana na Afrika yepfo Record Label Gallo Record Company murwego rwo gutsindira Tusker Project Fame Season 3. Yashinje kandi Tusker Project Fame kuba idafasha abatsinze kera kandi bari muri ibi kubera gushaka amafaranga. \nMuri 2015, Alpha Rwirangira yatangaje ko yatandukanye n'umukunzi we umaze igihe kinini witwa Esther UWINGABIRE wari mu bahatanira Miss Rwanda 2012 ndetse n'abamuteza imbere Ernesto Ugeziwe na Tijara KABENDERA ariko impande zombi ntizemeza aya makuru.\u00a0]"}
{"id": "19406", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19406", "title": "Neza", "text": "Neza Patricia Masozera, [\u200b\u200b Yavutse 23 ukuboza 1984) azwi nka Neza, ni umunyarwanda ubarizwa muri Canada ukora afropop. Muri 2017, yahawe igihembo nk'umuhanzi \"utanga icyizere muri Afurika\" na All Africa Music Awards. \nKera.\nNeza Yabuze se akiri muto arerwa na nyina wapfakaye. Kubera inzara mu gihugu cyabo, Zayire, umuryango wimukiye mu Rwanda mu 1995. Nyuma yimyaka itatu, umuryango wimukiye i Toronto, muri Kanada biturutse ku cyifuzo cya mushiki we yifuza kumuha ubuzima bwiza kandi butekanye. \nUmwuga.\nNeza yatangiye umuziki mu ntangiriro ya 2000, kandi kuva icyo gihe yatangiye kwiteza imbere mu buhanga bwa elektiki. Mu itumba 2010, Neza yasohoye inzira 7 ya EP yitwa 'Brand New', yagaragayemo indirimbo 'Go Gettaz'. Iyi nzira yagaragaye no kuri mixtape ya DJ Charlie Brown 'Brown Billz - R&amp;B Edition'. Amashusho ye remix ya 'Pop That' y\u2019igifaransa Montana yasohotse muri Nzeri 2012, yatanze ibitekerezo 2000+ mu byumweru 3 bya mbere kandi byanyuze kuri televiziyo y'igihugu mu Rwanda. Muri 2016 yasohoye imwe ifite amashusho: Tambola yashimiwe cyane, ariko ntahantu na hamwe ushobora kuboneka kuri enterineti. Muri 2017, Neza yimukiye i Lagos, muri Nijeriya, maze asinywa n'umuririmbyi wo muri Nijeriya, Mc Galaxy kuri label ye, MCG Empire. Neza yasohoye inshuro eshatu (Uranyica, Shaba &amp; Vibe) munsi ya label. Yagaragaye kandi kuri Album ya Skales umuhanzi wo muri Nigeriya indirimbo ebyiri \"Gbe\" na \"Ubuzima bwiza\" "}
{"id": "19407", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19407", "title": "Rwanda Defence Forces Army Band", "text": "Rwanda defences forces army band ni Umutwe wa Gisirikare w\u2019ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda ufite mushingano zawo kuririmba aho wagiye ukora filimi zitandukanye, ni itsinda rinini rikorera Leta na Gisirikare. Nubwo ihagarariye ingabo ndetse ugengwa n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ingabo. Kuva mu 2009 Itsinda rya Gisirikare rya RDF riyobowe na Liyetona Koloneli Gilbert Ndayisabye. Itsinda rya RDF rigizwe n'abayobozi bakuru hamwe na bane:\nIri tsinda rikora muri Repubulika yu Rwanda no ku mugabane munini wa Afurika. Benshi mu baririmbyi bayo boherejwe mu myaka yashize mu bikorwa byo kubungabunga amahoro muri Rwanda. \nAmateka.\nItsinda rya gisirikare rya RDF ryashinzwe muri 1992 mu gihe cy\u2019intambara yo Kwibohoza mu 1990 kugeza 1994 kandi ryatangiye gukora ku ya 8 Werurwe 1992 ahitwa Mulindi FPR na RPA HQ ubwo ryari rifite abanyamuryango 40 gusa. Nyuma y\u2019intambara yo muri 1994, yongeye gushyirwaho n\u2019abanyamuryango 120 bahuguwe n\u2019umutwe wa gisirikare wa Gana wari mu ngabo z\u2019amahoro ziyobowe na UNAMIR (United Nation Mission mu Rwanda). Muri 2005, Liyetona Koloneli Lemuel Kayumba yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru w'itsinda ryashyizweho na Major Gilbert Ndayisabye. Ku buyobozi bwe, iryo tsinda ryatangije imyitozo n\u2019ubusabane n\u2019andi mashuri y\u2019umuziki ya gisirikare y\u2019amahanga. Mu mwaka wa 2008, ingabo za RDF zohereje itsinda rya mbere ry\u2019abacuranzi 20 bitabiriye amasomo y\u2019umuziki wa Gisirikare ya Afurika yepfo, yatanzwe n\u2019ingabo za Afurika yepfo Band Cape Town babifashijwemo na kaminuza ya Stellenbosch. Umwaka umwe, abanyamuryango 29 bagize iryo tsinda bitabiriye amahugurwa yakozwe nitsinda ry\u2019ingabo z\u2019ingabo z\u2019igihugu cya Uganda mu ishuri rya gisirikare ry\u2019u Rwanda i Nyakinama. \nIbirori byo Kwibohoza.\nIri tsinda riririmbira parade ngarukamwaka kuri Stade Amahoro mugihe cyo kwizihiza umunsi wo kwibohora. Bambaye imyenda isanzwe itukura nicyatsi, bakora indirimbo yubahiriza igihugu, \"u Rwanda Nziza\" kimwe no kwerekana ibyerekanwa. Bakora kandi ingendo za gisirikare gakondo numuziki kavukire nkindirimbo yigiswahiri \"Sisi Wenyewe\". Iri tsinda ryasohoye alubumu nshya yitwa \"Ubudasa\" mu rwego rwo kwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 25 yo kwibohora muri 2019. \nIbindi byabaye.\nItsinda ryayo rya jazz ryitabiriye ibitaramo hamwe nabasivili ba jazz. Yakoranye n\u2019amatsinda menshi y\u2019amahanga, icyamenyekanye cyane muri zo ni Ingabo z\u2019Amerika zirwanira mu kirere mu Burayi. Yabanje kwitabira Tattoo ya Gisirikare ya Cape Town muri 2010. Abagize Urban Boyz (itsinda rya Afropop muri Rwanda) hamwe nitsinda rya jazz ryitwaye neza mu birori byo gutangiza ku mugaragaro imikino ya gisirikare mu 2017. \nItsinda rya Gisirikare Amasomo Yumuziki Yibanze.\nUyu mutwe uyobora amasomo ya muzika ya Gisirikare Yibanze Yumuziki mu kigo cya Gisirikare cya Kanombe. Amasomo arimo ibi bikurikira: "}
{"id": "19409", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19409", "title": "Butare Cynthia", "text": "Cynthia Butare ni umunyarwanda akaba ari umukinnyi wa firime uba m'uBusuwisi kimwe naba videwo. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime w'umunyarwanda, \"Kickin, it With The Kinks\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Geneve mu Busuwisi. Yabaye i Geneve kugeza arangije amashuri yisumbuye hanyuma yimukira mu Bwongereza kwiga amashuri makuru. \nUmwuga.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Digital Media and Communication nyuma arangiza Master's in Documentary Practice muri kaminuza ya Manchester Metropolitan. Muri 2011, yakoze firime ngufi \"Kickin It With The Kinks\" kumushinga we wa kaminuza. Filime yahawe igihembo cya documentaire nziza mu ishami rye. Nyuma mu 2016, Cynthia ari kumwe n'inshuti ye Mundia, bahisemo gukora verisiyo ndende ya firime. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yerekanwa mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Muri uwo mwaka, yatangije isosiyete ye bwite, ' CB Production. \nAkiri ingimbi, yatangiye kwandika mu 2003. Nubwo yahagaritse blog nyuma yimyaka itatu, yongeye kuyitangiza muri 2012. Muri 2013, Butare yahawe igihembo cya Blog nziza yumwaka na BEFFTA. Icyakora, yimukiye mu Rwanda mu 2014. Igihe yari mu Rwanda, yakoze filime ye ya kabiri ya documentaire, \"Ishimwa: Kuva Amaraso Yera Kuri Grace\". Yerekanwe mu rwego rwo kwerekana iserukiramuco rya sinema mu Rwanda. Kuri ubu arimo gukora umushinga witwa \"Garuka\". "}
{"id": "19410", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19410", "title": "Sharangabo Mbabazi Philbert Aim\u00e9", "text": "Sharangabo Mbabazi Philbert Aim\u00e9 (yavutse muri 1990), ni umukinnyi wa firimi ukomoka mu Rwanda. Yakoze firimi ngufi zamamaye cyane zirimo, \"Abibohoza\", \"Imirongo\" na \"Nabonye Ibintu Byanjye Ibumoso\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nPhilbert Aim\u00e9 Mbabazi yavutse 1990 mu Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMbabazi yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami rya sinema yakuye muri kaminuza y\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019ubushakashatsi i Geneve (UMUTWE - Gen\u00e8ve, Haute \u00e9cole d'art et de design) i Geneve. Mugihe cyishuri, yakoze firime ebyiri \"The Liberators\" na \"Versus\". Filime zombi zerekanwe mu birori byinshi bya firime harimo Vision du R\u00e9el Nyon, Internationale Kurzfilmtage Winterthur, Tampere, Oberhausen na Uppsala Festival Festival. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi muri 2017, yasubiye mu Rwanda.\nMuri 2019, yayoboye filime ngufi \"Nabonye Ibintu byanjye n'ibumoso\" yatsindiye igihembo kinini mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Oberhausen. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya firime rirenga 20 nk'Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi rya Rotterdam, International Kurzfilmtage Winterthur, Go Short Nijmegen, Indie Lisboa na ISFF Hamburg, FIFF Namur n'ibindi \nYatangije isosiyete ikora firime yitwa 'Imitana Productions' ifite icyicaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Nyuma yaje gukora filime ye yambere yumukobwa \"Republika\" (Spectrum). "}
{"id": "19413", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19413", "title": "Filimi Bounty", "text": "Bounty cyangwa se Impano ni filime isetsa y'ibikorwa ya 2012 yanditse n'umunyarwanda witwa Kagame Shyaka yerekana bwa mbere bwa Fung Chi Keung ikinwamo Chapman To, Fiona Sit na Alex Man. Mu Gushyingo, iyi filime yakiriye Ikigega cyo Guteza Imbere Amafilime ya Hong Kong \" Umushinga wo Guteza Imbere Amafilime Umushinga wo Gutunganya Amafilime \" kugira ngo utange HK $ 2,605.711. Iyi ni film ya 13 yatewe inkunga n'ikigega cyo guteza imbere amafilime ya Hong Kong. \nUmugambi.\nHamwe n'imyizerere yubuzima, Cho Sai Fung (Chapman To) numuntu wubwonko ufite ubuhanga budasanzwe, wishingikiriza kumuhiga wubuntu kugirango abeho. Kuri iyi nshuro yaje ku kirwa, hoteri nto yitwa LAZY Inn, guhiga umujura Lee Kin Fai wahunze, hamwe na HK $ 4000,000. Suen Long Ching (Fiona Sit) numukobwa wincumbi (Alex Man). Afite ibitekerezo byinshi n'amatsiko, kandi ni hyperactive. Nosy se numukobwa bakurikiranye abakiriya badasanzwe Cho, hamwe no gukorakora nabi no kutumvikana, bikurura urwenya rutandukanye."}
{"id": "19414", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19414", "title": "Kalimunda Jacqueline", "text": "Jacqueline Kalimunda (yavutse muri 1974) ni umuproduce ukomoka mu Rwanda, ukora inkuru mbarankuru zizwi nka documentaire, umuyobozi n'umwanditsi wa filimi.\nUbuzima.\nJaqueline Kalimunda yavukiye i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Yabaye muri Kenya, Madagasikari n'Ubwongereza mbere yo kwimukira mu Bufaransa. Kalimunda akiri mwishuri, yize imiyoborere hamwe namateka ya Afrika. Yinzobere mu gutunganya firime no kuyikwirakwiza. Kalimunda yatojwe nk'umwanditsi kandi akoresha ubwo buhanga mu gukora documentaire na firime za televiziyo. Yitangiye kuvuga inkuru zumwimerere ninsanganyamatsiko mubikorwa bye. \nMuri Filimi.\nMu 2002, yanditse, ayobora kandi afatanya gukora filime ye ya mbere, iminota 23 \"ya Histoire de tresses\" (\"About Braids\"), yatowe nka filime ngufi nziza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Zanzibar 2003. Filime ngufi kandi yatanzwe mu Bwongereza n'Ikigo cy'Ubwongereza gishinzwe amafilime na Amerika mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya New York. Filime yerekana inkuru hagati yumukobwa ukiri muto numuhanga wogosha umusatsi wo muri Afrika. Umugore arasaba umusatsi-kogosha kugirango yongere gukora uburyo budasanzwe bwo kogosha umusatsi. \nInyandiko \"ya Homeland\" ni umwanzuro wumushinga muremure watangiye ubwo yakoraga ubushakashatsi ku mashusho yu Rwanda hamwe n\u2019amateka Jean-Pierre Chr\u00e9tien na H\u00e9l\u00e8ne d'Almeida-Topor. Kuri iki gikorwa, Jacqueline Kalimunda yashyize ahagaragara imyaka 80 yububiko bwa firime butarasohoka mu Rwanda. Filime yerekanwe muri Fespaco 2007 muri Ouagadougou. \nMu 2007 na 2008, Jacqueline Kalimunda yafatanije kuyobora igihembwe cya mbere n'icya kabiri cy'uruhererekane rwa televiziyo \"Imagine Afrika\", cyanyuze mu bihugu 35 by'Afurika ku mbuga za televiziyo rusange mu Cyongereza, Igifaransa, Igiswahiri, Zulu, Igiporutugali n'izindi ndimi. Hanyuma yayoboye muri koproduction hamwe na Canal Plus Horizon filime yamenyekanye \"cyane mubuzima\" bwa 2011.\nUmunyeshuri wiga muri Berlinale Talent Campus, Jacqueline Kalimunda yakoze kandi ayobora muri 2012 \"Burning Down\", yibanze kuri Afurika Filime ngufi ya mbere hamwe na Eriq Ebouaney (Femme fatale ya Brian de Palma, Lumumba ya Raoul Peck) na Cyril Guei.\nMuri 2016 Kalimunda yanditse kandi ayobora \"Floris\", documentaire mu rurimi rwa Kinyarwanda. "}
{"id": "19415", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19415", "title": "Zanzibar International Film Festival", "text": "Zanzibar International Film Festival cyangwa se Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firimi i Zanzibar (ZIFF), rizwi kandi nk'Iserukiramuco ry'ibihugu bya Dhow, ni iserukiramuco rya filime ngarukamwaka ribera muri Zanzibar, muri Tanzaniya kandi ni kimwe mu birori ndangamuco binini muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. ZIFF ni umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta washinzwe muri 1997 hagamijwe guteza imbere no guteza imbere amafilimi n\u2019inganda z\u2019umuco nk\u2019umusemburo w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imibereho n\u2019ubukungu mu karere. "}
{"id": "19416", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19416", "title": "British Film Institute", "text": "Ikigo cy\u2019Ubwongereza gishinzwe amafilim (BFI) n\u2019umuryango utabara imbabare wa firimi na televiziyo uteza imbere kandi ukabungabunga amashusho na televiziyo mu Bwongereza wagiye werekana amafilimi akomoka mu Rwanda aha twavuga nka filimi yanditse na Kalimunda Jacqueline yitwa le 23 minutes. BFI ikoresha amafaranga yatanzwe na tombora yigihugu kugirango ishishikarize gukora firimi, gukwirakwiza, nuburezi. Yatewe inkunga n\u2019ishami ry\u2019umuco, itangazamakuru na siporo, kandi iterwa inkunga igice kimwe n\u2019amategeko agenga ikigo cy\u2019amafirime mu Bwongereza 1949. \nIntego.\nBFI yashinzwe muri 1933 mu rwego rwo gushishikariza iterambere ry\u2019ubuhanzi bwa firime, televiziyo ndetse n\u2019ishusho igenda ikora mu Bwongereza, kugira ngo bamenyekanishe imikoreshereze yabo nk'inyandiko z'ubuzima bw'iki gihe n'imico, guteza imbere uburezi bujyanye na filime, televiziyo ndetse n'ishusho ikora. muri rusange, n'ingaruka zabyo muri societe, guteza imbere kugera no gushimira uburyo bwagutse bushoboka bwa sinema yo mu Bwongereza no ku isi no gushiraho, kwita no guteza imbere ibyegeranyo byerekana amateka n'amashusho bigenda byerekanwa mu Bwongereza. \nIbikorwa bya BFI.\nUbubiko.\nBFI ikomeza ububiko bwa firime nini ku isi, BFI National Archive, yahoze yitwa Isomero ry\u2019amafirime y\u2019igihugu (1935\u20131955), Ububiko bw\u2019amafirime y\u2019igihugu (1955\u20131992), hamwe n\u2019ububiko bw\u2019amafirime na televiziyo by\u2019igihugu (1993\u20132006). Ububiko burimo firime zirenga 50.000, amazina arenga 100.000 adahimbano, hamwe na tereviziyo zigera kuri 625.000. Ibyinshi mu byegeranyo ni ibikoresho byabongereza ariko binagaragaza ibintu bifite akamaro mpuzamahanga ku isi yose. Ububiko bukusanya kandi filime zigaragaramo abakinnyi bakomeye b\u2019abongereza nakazi k\u2019abayobozi b\u2019abongereza.\u00a0&lt;/link&gt;[\"citation ikenewe\"]\nBFI iyobora BFI Southbank (ahahoze hitwa Theatre National Film (NFT) na cinema ya BFI IMAX, byombi biherereye ku nkombe y\u2019amajyepfo yuruzi rwa Thames i Londres. IMAX ifite ecran nini ya sinema nini mubwongereza kandi yerekana ibyamamare biheruka gusohoka hamwe na firime ngufi zerekana ikoranabuhanga ryayo, ikubiyemo kwerekana IMAX 70mm, kwerekana IMAX 3D na 11,600 watt yijwi rya digitale. BFI Southbank (ecran ya firime yigihugu ya firime na Studio) yerekana firime zo kwisi yose, cyane cyane firime yamateka kandi yihariye izwi cyane idashobora kubona sinema yerekana. BFI ikwirakwiza kandi ububiko bwa sinema n\u2019ububiko bw\u2019umuco ahandi hantu - buri mwaka ahantu hasaga 800 hirya no hino mu Bwongereza, ndetse no ku bibuga byinshi byo mu mahanga. \nUburezi.\nBFI itanga gahunda zitandukanye zuburezi, cyane cyane mu gushyigikira imyigishirize y\u2019amafilime n\u2019itangazamakuru mu mashuri. Mu mpera z'umwaka wa 2012, BFI yakiriye amafaranga mu ishami rishinzwe uburezi kugira ngo hashyizweho ihuriro rya BFI Film Academy Network ku rubyiruko ruri hagati y\u2019imyaka 16 na 25. Gahunda yo gutura ikorwa muri NFTS buri mwaka.\nIminsi mikuru.\nBFI ikora iserukiramuco rya sinema ngarukamwaka rya Londres hamwe na BFI Flare: Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya LGBT LGBT hamwe n\u2019urubyiruko ruzaba rwerekanwe na Future Film Festival. "}
{"id": "19417", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19417", "title": "Karekezi Joel", "text": "Jo\u00ebl Karekezi (yavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1985) ni umwanditsi w\u2019u Rwanda, umuyobozi wa firime akaba na produce wa firime. afite Filime ngufi \"Yitwa Pardon\", ivuga ku bwiyunge nyuma ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994, yatsindiye igihembo cya Zahabu Impala mu iserukiramuco rya Filime Amakula ryabereye muri Uganda. Imiterere yihariye yakozwe mu 2011, kandi yerekanwa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya G\u00f6teborg, nyuma no mu yandi maserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ya firime harimo iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Seattle (2013), iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Chicago na FESPACO. \nUbuzima n'uburere.\nKarekezi yavukiye i Rubavu, mu Rwanda. Se yapfuye mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, nyuma y'iki gikorwa yahungiye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC) aho yasanze umwe mubyara be. Yize gufata amashusho muri Maisha Film Lab muri 2009; Afite impamyabumenyi mu bijyanye na filime iva mu ishuri ryo muri Kanada CineCours. \nUmwuga.\nKarekezi amaze kwitabira Laboratwari ya Maisha, yayoboye filime ye ngufi \"yitwa Pardon\", yatsindiye igihembo cya Zahabu Impala mu iserukiramuco rya Filime Amakula muri Uganda. Mu mwaka wa 2010 herekanywe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Durban, Amashusho Yerekana Iserukiramuco rya Filime ngufi muri Etiyopiya, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Kenya, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Zanzibar ndetse n\u2019iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Afurika rya Silicon Valley muri Californiya, aho ryatsindiye Filime ngufi nziza igihembo. \nKarekezi yakoze verisiyo iranga, \"Imbabazi\", zishingiye ku nyuguti zimwe. Yakozwe ku ngengo yimari iciriritse muri Uganda. \nMuri 2013 Karekezi yakoraga kuri \" Impuhwe z'ishyamba \", yerekanwe muri Fabrique des cinemas du Monde mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes muri 2013. Inyandiko ya \" Impuhwe z'ishyamba \" yatsindiye igihembo cya CFI cyiza cya Audiovisual Award kubera umushinga w'amajwi wizewe cyane muri Durban FilmMart muri 2012. \nIzindi filime ze zirimo: \"Les jeunes \u00e0 la poursuite du travail\", 2009; \"Abacitse ku icumu\", 2010; \"na Ntukazime Nararokotse\", 2010. \nUbuzima bwite.\nKarekezi azi neza igifaransa. "}
{"id": "19418", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19418", "title": "Niyongabo Yves Montand", "text": "Yves Montand Niyongabo ni umuyobozi wa firime mu Rwanda. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYves yavukiye kandi akurira mu Burundi. Nyuma yaje kwimukira mu Rwanda aho yaretse gukora filimi. Yakoze nk'umuhuzabikorwa wa firime Munyurangabo muri 2017. Muri 2010 Yves yatoranijwe mu mahugurwa ya firime yateguwe na CPH: Dox muri Danimarike. "}
{"id": "19419", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19419", "title": "Denis Nsanzamahoro", "text": "Denis Nsanzamahoro, wamenyekanye ku izina rya Rwasa, yari umukinnyi wa filime wo mu Rwanda. Yari kandi umuyobozi n'umutunganyi wa filime. Yapfuye ku ya 5 Nzeri 2019.\nYakinnye muri filime nyarwanda no muri filime mpuzamahanga, nka \"100 Days\" na \"Sometimes in April\". Mu 2023, yahawe igihembo cya \"Legend Award\" muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nUmwuga.\nDenis Nsanzamahoro yatangiye umwuga wa filime mu 1999. Yakinnye muri filime nyarwanda nka \"Rwasa\" na \"Ay'Urukundo\". Izina rya Rwasa ryaturutse kuri iyo filime. Yakinnye kandi mu matangazo yamamaza.\nYakinnye muri filime mpuzamahanga \"100 Days\" na \"Sometimes in April\". Mu 2006, yakinnye muri \"The Last King of Scotland\". Yakinnye kandi muri \"Sakabaka\" na \"Operation Turquoise\". Yagize uruhare mu ikorwa rya \"Sakabaka\".\nFilime ya nyuma yakinnyemo ni \"Petit Pays\" ya Ga\u00ebl Faye, mu 2019.\nUrupfu.\nDenis Nsanzamahoro yapfiriye mu Ibitaro bya Kaminuza by\u2019i Kigali (CHUK) ku ya 5 Nzeri 2019. Yari amazeyo iminsi ine. Yazize diyabete.\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023, yahawe igihembo cya \"Legend Award\" muri Rwanda International Movie Awards. Murumuna we n'imfura ye ni bo bakiriye icyo gihembo."}
{"id": "19420", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19420", "title": "Ruhorahoza Kivu", "text": "Kivu Ruhorahoza ni umuyobozi wa firime w'umunyarwanda, umwanditsi akaba na produce. Azwi ku rwego mpuzamahanga kubera filime yakinnye yitwa Gray Matter yatsindiye Jury idasanzwe ku bakinnyi ba Filime beza bakizamuka mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Tribeca 2011 ndetse na Jury Ecumenical Jury yavuzwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Warsaw 2011. Yatsindiye kandi igihembo kinini cy'Iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya T\u00fcbingen mu Bufaransa, Umuyobozi mwiza na Signis Igihembo cy'Iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya Afurika rya Cordoba ndetse na Jury Igihembo cyihariye cy'Iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya Khouribga muri Maroke.\nKivu yavukiye i Kigali ku ya 6 Ukuboza 1982, yinjiye mu mwuga wa filime akora mu 2004 ari umufasha w\u2019ibikorwa bya Eric Kabera, umuproducer w\u2019u Rwanda. Yaje kuzamurwa mu ntera agirwa umuyobozi ushinzwe umusaruro, aho yajyaga afasha abakozi b'amakuru baza mu Rwanda kuva kuri BBC cyangwa CNN. Icyakora ishyaka rye ryari firime.\nKivu Ruhorahoza yageze ku rubuga mpuzamahanga rwa firime muri 2007 hamwe na filime ye ya mbere ngufi \"Yiyemereye\" yatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019Umujyi wa Venice mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi ry\u2019Afurika, Aziya na Amerika y'Epfo kandi ryerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Venice. Filime ye ya kabiri \"Yatakaye mu majyepfo\" (2008) yatsindiye Filime ngufi ya Afurika nziza mu iserukiramuco rya Vues D'Afrique i Montreal kandi yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi rya Rotterdam.\n\"Icyatsi\".\nMu mwaka wa 2011, Kivu Ruhorahoza yazamuye umwuga we nyuma yo gushyira ahagaragara filime ye ya mbere \"yerekana imvi\", filime ivuga ku ihahamuka n\u2019ubusazi nyuma ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo muri 1994. Iyi filime yakorewe mu Rwanda mu bihe by\u2019amafaranga adahungabana, ariko byagenze neza cyane maze ikomeza gukina mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rizwi cyane nka Tribeca, Melbourne, Warsaw, Rotterdam, Dubai, Durban, G\u00f6teborg na Festival do Rio.\n\"Ikintu cya Aimless Wanderer\".\nMu mwaka wa 2014, Kivu yatangiye gukora amashusho ye ya kabiri \"Ibintu bya Aimless Wanderer\", filime ivuga ku ngingo ikomeye y\u2019imibanire hagati y \" abenegihugu \" n\u2019abanyaburengerazuba. Filime ivuga kuri paranoia, kutizerana no kutumvikana, film yafotowe rwose kuri Kamera ya Sinema ya BlackMagic, hamwe na bije ntoya hamwe nabakozi bose baho. Yatoranijwe kumugaragaro kugirango yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Sundance Film Festival muri gahunda nshya yumupaka."}
{"id": "19421", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19421", "title": "Uwizeyimana Anisziya", "text": "Uwizeyimana Anisziya waje kwitwa Anisia Uzeyman (yavutse Anisziya Uwizeyimana, Gashyantare 1975) ni umukinnyi w'amafirime ukomoka mu Rwanda akaba n'umwanditsi w'amakinamico. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi hamwe na Saul Williams wo muri filime ya \"Neptune Frost\" muri 2021. Yavukiye i Gihindamuyaga i Mbazi, mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "19422", "revid": "13702", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19422", "title": "Iradukunda Oceanne", "text": "Belle Oceanne Iradukunda (yavutse ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 1996) ni umukinnyi w'amafirime w'umunyarwanda ndetse n'Umunyamerika, umuyobozi wa filime, n'umwanditsi. Yavukiye kandi akurira mu Rwanda, ubu akaba atuye i Los Angeles, muri Californiya. \"Belle\", yakiriwe na we muri filime nka \"Kubana n'abapfuye\", \"Kugeza ku rupfu Tuzatandukana\", na \"Shifty Business\". \nUmwuga.\nIradukunda yagaragaye muri televiziyo ya Hollywood isetsa-ikinamico ya Tyler Perry yitwa, \"Sistas\", kuri televiziyo kuri BET kuva ku ya 23 Ukwakira 2019, akina nk'umutegarugori. Muri 2020, yanditse kandi ayobora film, \"Urakoze kunsuzugura\". \nImpaka.\nMuri Werurwe 2018, \"Ikinyamakuru New Times\" cyo mu Rwanda cyatangaje uyu mukinnyi w'amafilime ashinja uwateguye gahunda y\u2019icyumweru cy\u2019imyambarire mpuzamahanga ya Kigali, John Bunyeshuli, icyaha cyo kwiba igitekerezo cye cy\u2019umwimerere. "}
{"id": "19423", "revid": "10227", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19423", "title": "Kantarama Gahigiri", "text": "Kantarama Gahigiri (yavutse ku ya 13 Ukuboza 1976) ni umukinnyi wa filime w'umunyarwanda uba mu Busuwisi. Azwi cyane muri firime \"Tapis rouge\", \"Me and U\", \"Umumarayika Yatakaye nibindi\" byinshi. Afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga yakuye mu ishuri rya Graduate Institute of International and Development Studies hamwe na kaminuza ya New York Institute of Technology.\nUmwuga.\nFilime ya mbere ya Gahigiri \"Tapis Rouge\" yahawe igihembo cyiza cya Filime nziza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema ryabereye i Geneve no kuyobora neza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Chelsea. Ubu arimo ateza imbere Tanzanite, afro pulp dystopian thriller binyuze muri Realness - Residency of African Screenwriter. "}
{"id": "19424", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19424", "title": "Filimi Ishaba", "text": "Filimi Ishaba ni filimi yasohotse muri 2005, ikaya barabaye filimi ya nditse na Yuli Amuli, Filimi Ishaba ikaba yarakimye n'abakinnyi bagiye batandukanye ariko bose babarizwe muri Maisha Film Lab.\nUmwanditsi.\nYuhi Amuli ni umuyobozi wa firime nyafurika, Producer n'umwanditsi wavukiye mu Rwanda. Filime ebyiri za mbere ngufi ISHABA na AKARWA zerekanwe kandi zegukana ibihembo mu birori bitandukanye bya firime ku isi; mu Bufaransa, Misiri, Afurika y'Epfo na Kanada."}
{"id": "19425", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19425", "title": "Filimi Akarwa", "text": "Filimi Akarwa ni filimi ngufi yasohotse ndetse itangira kugaragara muri 2005, Akarwa ikaya barabaye filimi ya Yuli Amuli, Filimi Akarwa ikaba yarakimye n'abakinnyi bagiye batandukanye ariko bose babarizwe muri Maisha Film Lab, iyi ikaba ari itsinda rimenyerewe muri filime mu Rwanda.\nUmwanditsi.\nYuhi Amuli ni umuyobozi wa firime mu Rwanda no muri afurika, akaba ari Produce n'umwanditsi wavukiye mu Rwanda. Filime ebyiri za mbere ngufi ISHABA na AKARWA zerekanwe kandi zegukana ibihembo mu birori bitandukanye bya firime ku isi; mu Bufaransa, Misiri, Afurika y'Epfo na Kanada."}
{"id": "19426", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19426", "title": "Irankunda Julien", "text": "Irankunda Julien, uzwi ku izina rya Julien Bmjizzo (yavutse ku ya 27 Gashyantare 1994 Kimihurura, Gasabo kwa Kwibeshya S\u00e9bastien na Kasine Marie Grace) ni umuyobozi w\u2019amashusho na filimi zo mu Rwanda, bizwi nka Cinematography akaba ari nawe washinze label yanditse yitwa Bproud Music.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nBmjizzo yavukiye i Kigali, mu Rwanda, yagiye mu ishuri rizwi ku izina rya ESAPAG Gitwe mu Rwanda ariko arangije amashuri yisumbuye mu 2011 kubera umuryango we wimukiye mu Bubiligi. Yakomeje amashuri ye mu Bubiligi ku ishuri ryitwa Virgo Plus aho yarangirije amashuri yisumbuye mu bijyanye na Computer Science Management na Accounting. Nyuma yaje kwiga kaminuza yo mu Bubiligi aho yize Itumanaho n\u2019itangazamakuru ryinshi. \nUmwuga.\nMuri uwo mwaka wa 2015, Bmjizzo yashinze \"BproudMusic\", urubuga rukora umuziki rukorera mu Bubiligi rwibanda ku gutunganya amashusho. Muri 2021 nyine, Bmjizzo yasohoye indirimbo ye yise \"Kamwe\" yagaragayemo abahanzi 11 ba Hip hop na RnB Rwanda. \nAmashusho na Filimi.\nKuva muri 2015, Bmjizzo yakoranye n'abacuranzi bo mu Rwanda na Tanzaniya nka Diamond Platnumz, The Ben na Bruce Melodie. Julien Bmjizzo yakoze ku mushinga we wa mbere w\u2019umuziki, \"Gusa wowe\" na The Ben ft Ben Kayiranga, nk'umuyobozi wa videwo mu 2015. Muri 2021 Bmjizzo yarashe anayobora indirimbo yitwa \"Impamvu\" ya The Ben na Diamond Platnumz. Uyu mushinga wumuziki wagiye ahagaragara cyane wazanye Bmjizzo kumurongo munini wumuziki wisi. Uyu mushinga wambere wumuziki wamugejeje kumurongo mubikorwa byumuziki wu Rwanda ndetse no mubindi bihugu ubwo yatangiraga gukora imirimo yindirimbo nyinshi akora nkumuyobozi. Bmjizzo yakoze amashusho yindirimbo zirenga 500. "}
{"id": "19427", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19427", "title": "Ruzindana Lionel", "text": "Ruzindana Lionel (yavutse muri 1987), ni umukinnyi wa filimi ubarizwa mu mubiligi ariko ukomoka mu Rwanda. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Earth and Blood\", \"Third Wedding\" hamwe na \"Red Soil\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse muri 1987 i Kigali, mu Rwanda nk'imfura mu muryango, akurira i Gikondo kugeza 1994. Yarangije amashuri abanza mu Rwanda mu mujyi wa Kigali, kugeza ku myaka 7. Yimukiye mu Bubiligi hanyuma aba mu Bufaransa hafi umwaka. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye gukina ubwo yimukira mu Bubiligi. Yabanje kurangiza mu kigo cya Sainte Marie mu Bubiligi. Hagati aho, yinjiye mu matsinda abiri yikinamico kandi yiga gukina birambuye. Yatangiye gukina sinema nyamukuru muri 2015. Muri 2018, yakinnye muri filime \"Troisi\u00e8mes Noces\" iyobowe na David Lambert. Nyuma yinjiye mu ikinamico muri \"Plein La Vue\" muri 2019 abifashijwemo na Philippe Lyon. Yakinnye kandi muri filime \"Rouge\" iyobowe na Farid Bentoumi nk 'umurinzi'. \nMuri 2020 yakinnye muri filime \"Isi n'amaraso\" afite uruhare 'S\u00fcleyman'. Muri 2020, yakinnye muri filime \"La Terre et Le Sang\" umukinnyi wa firime Julien Leclerq ubu iri kuri Netflix. "}
{"id": "19428", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19428", "title": "Earth and Blood", "text": "Earth and Blood cyangwa se mu kinyarwanda yitwa Isi n'amaraso ni filime y\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019igifaransa yo muri 2020 iyobowe na Julien Leclercq ikinwamo na Sami Bouajila, Eriq Ebouaney na Samy Seghir. Iyi filime ivuga kubyerekeranye nubugizi bwa nabi bwakorewe mu ruganda rwitaruye ruba iyo umukozi ukiri muto ahishe kilo umunani za kokayine yibwe mu gatsiko. Iyo abayoboke b'agatsiko kitwaje imbunda nini baza kugarura ibiyobyabwenge, nyir'uruganda akora urwego rwa nyuma rwo kurinda umukobwa we w'umwangavu.\nYashyizwe ahagaragara ku ya 18 Mata 2020, kuri Netflix."}
{"id": "19429", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19429", "title": "Umuhire Eliane", "text": "Eliane Umuhire ni umukinnyi w'afilimi w'umunyarwanda arko ubarizwa m'ubufaransa. Umwuga we w'ubuhanzi ufite insanganyamatsiko ibiranga, kwibuka no kwihangana. Ibikorwa bye byagaragaye muri filime zatanzwe mu minsi mikuru mpuzamahanga izwi, aho yatsindiye ibihembo kubera ibikorwa bye ndetse n\u2019ubwitange mu mibereho. Yamamaye cyane kubera uruhare yagize muri filime yo muri Polonye \"Inyoni ziririmba i Kigali\" na Krzystof Krauze na Joanna Kos, Eliane yahawe igihembo cy\u2019abakinnyi bitwaye neza mu birori nko mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Chicago, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Karlovy Vary, ibihangano bya Gdynia Polonye Ibirori, Iserukiramuco rya Polonye i New York, Reka CEE Festival i Vienne, ndetse n'igihembo cya Mastercard Rising Star muri iserukiramuco rya firime ryigenga rya Netia Off Kamera.\nMu mishinga iheruka harimo \"Omen\" ya Baloji, yahawe muri Un Certain Regard i Cannes mu 2023, filime ya \"Neptune Frost\" ya Saul Williams yerekanwe muri Fortnight ya Diregiteri mu 2021, filime ya Netflix \"Ibiti by'amahoro\" by Alanna Brown, na BAFTA filime ngufi yitwa \"Bazigaga\" iyobowe na Jo Igabire Moys, yatsindiye ibihembo bye byo gukina mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Clermont-Ferrand ndetse na Festival International du Film Francophone de Namur. Eliane akora cyane kuri tereviziyo, cyane cyane murukurikirane \"Haven of Grace\", yatambutse kuri Arte. Vuba aha azakina muri \"Plan\u00e8te B\", iyobowe na Aude L\u00e9a Rapin, hamwe na Adele Exarchopoulus, na Souheila Yacoub. Yagaragaye kandi muri \"Ahantu hatuje: Umunsi wa mbere\" hamwe na Lupita Nyong'o, Joseph Quinn na Djimon Hounsou. "}
{"id": "19430", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19430", "title": "Mizero Ncuti Gatwa", "text": "Mizero Ncuti Gatwa (yavutse kamera 1992) yavukiye mu rwanda gusa ubu atuye mu byongereza akaba ri umukinnyi wa filimi. Yatangiye umyuga wa filimi mu mashuri ya Dundee repertory theatre aho yaje kubona umudari wa Lan chrleson muri 2014.\nIcyerekezo cya Gatwa cyagezweho ubwo yakina ari umwangavu w\u2019abahuje ibitsina witwa Eric Effiong muri televiziyo ya Netflix, yerekana ibiganiro \"byerekeranye n\u2019igitsina\" (2019\u20132023), byamuhesheje igihembo cya BAFTA Scotland ndetse n\u2019abahatanira ibihembo bitatu bya Televiziyo ya BAFTA. Yagize uruhare runini muri filime \"Barbie\" (2023) hamwe na televiziyo \"Masters of the Air\" (2024), maze arazamuka cyane agaragaza kwigira umuntu wa cumi na gatanu kwa Muganga mu kiganiro cya siyanse ya siyanse ya BBC baza \"Muganga\" (2023 - ubungubu).\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nGatwa yavukiye i Nyarugenge, Kigali, mu Rwanda, ku ya 15 Ukwakira 1992. \u00a0i Se, ni Gatwa Tharcisse, ukomoka mu karere ka Karongi mu Rwanda, ubu ni umunyamakuru. \nUyu muryango wahunze u Rwanda mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994 maze batura muri otcosse. Babaga i Oxgangs muri Edinburgh, bimukira i Dunfermline afite imyaka 15. Gatwa yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Boroughmuir na Dunfermline High School mbere yo kwimukira i Glasgow kwiga muri Royal Conservatoire ya Scotland, arangiza afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubuhanzi mu gukina mu 2013. Mugihe yiga, yakoraga muri club The Polo Lounge, atanga ibyuma hanyuma nyuma aba umubyinnyi. Conservatoire yamuhaye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga y'icyubahiro mu cyiciro cyo gutanga impamyabumenyi 2022. \nUmwuga.\n2013\u20132021: Akazi kambere kare niterambere hamwe nuburere \"bwimibonano mpuzabitsina\".\nAmaze kurangiza amashuri, Gatwa yahawe umwanya muri Dundee Repertory Theatre gahunda yo gutanga impamyabumenyi aho yakinnye mu bitaramo byinshi harimo na \"Victoria\" wa David Greig. Muri iki gihe, Gatwa yagabweho igitero n'abantu batatu batazi mu muhanda bavunika urwasaya; ibi byakosowe hamwe na titanium. Yagize uruhare rugufi muri sitcom \"ya Bob Servant\" 2014, nayo yashyizweho kandi ikorerwa amashusho muri Dundee. Muri 2014, Gatwa yahawe igihembo muri Ian Charleson Awards kubera ibikorwa bye bya Mercutio 2014 i \"Romeo na Juliet\" i Home, Manchester."}
{"id": "19431", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19431", "title": "Kagame Kayije", "text": "Kayije Kagame (yavutse muri 1987) ni umuhanzi akaba ari umukinnyi wa filimi zitandunye ukomoka mu Rwanda ariko ubarizwa mu busuwisi.\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nKagame yavukiye mu muryango w'u Rwanda i Geneve mu 1987. Se, Faustin, ni umunyamakuru ukomeye wa politiki akaba n'umujyanama wa Perezida w'u Rwanda Paul Kagame (nta sano bafitanye); nyina ni umwarimu wamateka nigifaransa. Umwe muri barumuna be ni umukinnyi wa firime Shyaka Kagame. Kayije yashishikajwe no gukina afite imyaka 19 ubwo yirukanaga umuyobozi Raffaele Curi\u00a0[i] i Roma kandi yamuhaye uruhare mu ikinamico. Yize ikinamico muri Conservatoire de Musique de Gen\u00e8ve umwaka umwe, hanyuma mu 2010 yiyandikisha muri Ecole Nationale Sup\u00e9rieure des Arts et Techniques du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre\u00a0[fr] (ENSATT) i Lyon. Muri 2014, yitabiriye gahunda yo guhugura mu mpeshyi i New York yakiriwe n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ikinamico Robert Wilson, wamutaye muri uwo mwaka mu kubyutsa \"Les N\u00e8gres\" i Od\u00e9on i Paris. \nMubuhanzi, Kagame yakoranye firime ngufi, kwishyiriraho amajwi, nibindi bikoresho hamwe nibice. Muri 2019, hamwe nabandi bahanzi, Kagame yateguye \"Ubuzima Burebure Ibi, kandi Ibi biguha ubuzima\", igice cyafashe igice cyose cyinyubako ya Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de l'Usine\u00a0[fr] i Geneve. Muri uwo mwaka, Kagame n'umukinnyi wa filime Grace Seri bazengurutse \"Sans Grace Avec Grace\", ibice bibiri. Mu 2022, we n'umukinnyi wa firime Hugo Radi batangiye kuzenguruka \"Int\u00e9rieur Vie / Int\u00e9rieur Nuit\", umurimo nk'uwo ukaba wateguwe kimwe cya kabiri naho igice cyafashwe amashusho. \nMuri \"Saint Omer\" ya Alice Diop (2022), Kagame yerekanye bwa mbere muri firime yakinnye na Rama, umwanditsi utwite yitegereza umugore (wakinnye na Guslagie Malanda) mu rubanza azira kwica umukobwa we w\u2019umwaka umwe. Imiterere ya Kagame ifite analogue yubuzima busanzwe muri Diop, witabiriye urubanza film ishingiyeho. AO Scott wo mu \"kinyamakuru The New York Times\" yashimye \"imikorere, ituje\" ya Kagame, maze \"IndieWire\" imushimira \"elegance idafite imbaraga\". Kagame yatorewe kuba umwe muri R\u00e9v\u00e9lations mu birori bya 48 bya C\u00e9sar, naho Iterambere ry\u2019amafirime y\u2019iburayi (EFP) amwita umwe mu ba Shooting Stars 2023. "}
{"id": "19433", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19433", "title": "Gilbert Ndahayo", "text": "Ndahiro Gilbert ni umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka mu gihugu cyu Rwanda ariko akaba atuye muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika, Gilbert akaba akurikirana impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu ishuri rikomeye rya kaminuza rikuru rya Columbia i New York. Ndahayo akaba yarashinze sociyete ya sinema muri 2006 ubwo yabonaga umwanya wo gukora filime ya mbere yitwa Inkovu zo mu minsi yanjye ', ku bufatanye n'Ikigo cya Suwede yabereye mu Rwanda.\nIbindi.\nNdahiro kandi arimo ashyira hamwe izindi filime ebyiri muri firimi zerekana ikinamico rya kera, nka HBO y'Abanyamerika kugirango bakore filimi zishingiye ku nkuru zo muri Afurika."}
{"id": "19434", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19434", "title": "Michel Mpambara", "text": "Michel Mpambara yavutse 1973 ni umunyarwanda akaba ari umukinnyi wa filimi ukorera mu Rwanda no hanze kumugabane wa afurika. \nFilimi.\nMichel Mpambara akaba yarakinnye muri filimi zigiye zitandukanye aha twavuga nka Comment conqu\u00e9rir l'Am\u00e9rique (2004), iyitwa Faro, iyindi ya la reine des eaux (2007) ndetse na Pour toujours, hamwe na les Canadiens! (2009)."}
{"id": "19435", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19435", "title": "Nsengiyumva Jean Roger", "text": "Nsengiyumva Jean Roger ni umukinnyi w'umunyarwanda, uzwi cyane mu kugaragara muri filimi nka \"Africa United\" na \"cumi na gatandatu\" hamwe na televiziyo Informer ndetse nindi yitwa \"Ntuzi\".\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nNsengiyumva yakuriye i Norfolk mu Bwongereza nyuma yo guhunga Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994. Nsengiyumva yavukiye i Kigali, abura se mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994."}
{"id": "19436", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19436", "title": "Mahoro Oliver Smith", "text": "Mahoro Olivier smith niyo mazina yiswe n'ababyeyi be ariko nyuma aza kwitwa Trezzo Mahoro yavutse ku ya 18 Nyakanga 1996 mu Rwanda nka Oliver Mahoro Smith. Ubu atuye i Vancouver, muri Columbiya y\u2019Ubwongereza,muri america. Trezzo yashishikajwe no gukina muri filimi mu mwaka wa nyuma w'amashuri yisumbuye ku ishuri ryisumbuye rya Templeton. "}
{"id": "19437", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19437", "title": "Mugisha Cedrick", "text": "Cedrick Mughisha Banzi (yavutse ku ya 14 Gicurasi 1997 i Kigali, mu Rwanda) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amguru akaba n'umukinnyi wa televiziyo akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime, uzwi cyane mu bitaramo yakinnye muri televiziyo yo muri Esipanye \"Smiley\" muri 2022 ari kumwe n'umukinnyi wa Katolika Carlos Cuevas.\nYakinnye muri 1. SC Znojmo FK muri Repubulika ya Ceki, hanyuma muri club yumupira wamaguru ya Rayo Vallecano i Madrid kuva 2021. \nMuri 2019, yagaragaye muri firime ya Pedro Almod\u00f3var \"Ububabare n'icyubahiro\".\nYakinnye kandi kuri serivise ya Espagne \"Cu\u00e9ntame c\u00f3mo pas\u00f3\" na sitcom \"La que se avecina\". "}
{"id": "19439", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19439", "title": "Ishimwe Chrispin", "text": "Ishimwe Chrispin uzwi ku izina rya Chrrispin, yavutse ku ya 18 Mata 2005, akaba ari nyir\u2019ikinyamakuru kizwi nka New Time Africa. Akaba n'umuhanzi ufite impano nyinshi ukomoka Kigali, Rwanda Chrispin akomoka mu muryango w'abana 4. Umuhanzi Chrispin yatangiye akiri muto, akunda injyana ya R&amp;B (Rhythm na blues) injyana, kuririmba, kwandika indirimbo, kubyina, no gukina, aho yatangiriye muri firime nke \nIbindi.\nChrispin arusha ibyo akora. Chrispin yatangiye kumva umuziki na firime nziza igihe yari mu kiciro cya 4 mu mashuri abanza. Yakundaga kumva indirimbo no kureba firime z'abandi bantu kuko niyo soko y'amagambo meza yo gukoresha mu ndirimbo ze, kandi kubyina byari bikurikira nyuma y'umuziki.\nImpano ye yo kubyina no gukina yari ikintu kimukorera kubera ubumenyi yakuye muri Club Rafiki muri Nyamirambo. "}
{"id": "19441", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19441", "title": "Frederic Jean", "text": "Frederic Jean yavutse ku itariki ya 8 ugushyingo 1981 mu Rwanda. Ni umukinnyi wa filimi wamenyekanye muri filimi ya izwi nka Emancipation (2022), Doom Patrol (2019) na Battle for Skyark (2015)."}
{"id": "19442", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19442", "title": "Sibomana Emmanuel", "text": "Sibomana Emmanuel yavutse 1 mutarama 1988 mu karere ka Nyanza mu Rwanda, I se ni SIBOMANA Enias na nyina ni MUKANDANGA Marita, ni umukinnyi wa filimi n'ikinamico ya radio yu Rwanda kandi ni umunyamakuru. Muri 2014 Sibomana yatangiye umwuga we mu bitangazamakuru byamamaza, akina ikinamico ku Isano kuri Radio Rwanda. Yakoze nka radiotv10 ari (Kameramani, Muhinduzi wa Video editor, na News Reporter), no kuri Hot FM 103.6 (News Presenter &amp; Reporter) Umunyamakuru wa TV (mutima w'Urugo).\nFilimi.\nSibomana Emmanuel amenyekana kubikorwa bye, maze atumirwa kwinjira kuri Radio BBC Urunana Ikipe ya Drama aho yakinnye nka Patrick. Yakoze kandi nk'umukinnyi mu itsinda rya Drama rya Rwanda rya Indamutsa. Mu mwuga we w'itangazamakuru, Sibomana akubiyemo ingingo zitandukanye, uhereye ku mibereho kugeza ku muco, kandi yari azwiho ubushobozi bwo kuzana inkuru mu buzima akoresheje uburyo bwe bushishikaje kandi bushishikaje."}
{"id": "19443", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19443", "title": "Dallila Hermans", "text": "Dallila Hermans yavutse muri 1986 mu gihugu cyu Rwanda. Dallila Hermans ni umukinnyi wa filimi zitandukanye, filimi izwi yakinnye ni De bal (1999), na De slimste mens ter wereld (2003) hamwe na Buitenhof (1995)."}
