{"id": "19512", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19512", "title": "TTC Muhanga", "text": "TTC Muhanga ni ikigo cy'amashuri y'isumbuye cy'ikaba giherereye mu intara y'amajyepho yu Rwanda, mu karere ka Muhanga, mu murenge wa Muhanga, ni ikgo cy'igisha abantu umwuga wo kwigisha, ni igigo nderabarezi."}
