{"id": "19581", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19581", "title": "Icyiyaga cya muhazi", "text": "ICYIYAGA CYA MUHAZI\nicyiyaga cya muhazi giherereye mukarere ka rwamagana ikiyaga cya muhazi cyangirika mugihe abantu bagikoresheje nabi nkiyo umuntu ataye umwandawe ahantu hatateganyijwe nko kugasozi iyo abantu bakoresheje iyi fumbire, amagi y\u2019inzoka ya Ascaris imvura iyo iguye atarukira ku bimera, abantu babisarura bakayajyana mu rugo\nIyo batabisukuye neza abinjiramo, iyo imvura iguye amagi atembanwa n\u2019amazi akajya mu bishanga, abahinzi bahinga akabinjiramo.leta y urwanda irabasaba gukoresha neza\nAkamaro ki cyiyaga cya muhazi.\nIcyiyaga cya muhazi gikorerwamo uburobyi gifasha ubukerarugendo "}
{"id": "19596", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19596", "title": "Alphonse Ndanda", "text": "Nizeyimana Alphonse, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Ndanda Alphonse yavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 1990, avukira mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda, yatangiye umwuga we nk'umuzamu, akinira amakipe menshi akomeye yo mu Rwanda, harimo Rayon Sports FC, Mukura, na AS Kigali hamwe ni kipe nkuru y'igihugu. Atuye mu Bwongereza, aho yagiye mu mwuga w'ubutoza, agaragaza ko ari ambasaderi w'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda kuri kimwe mu byiciro byo guhangana ku isi.\nUmwuga.\nUbu, nk'umutoza, yakoresheje ubwo bwitange mu nshingano ze nshya, atoza abakinnyi bakiri bato kandi yemeza ko bafite ibikoresho n'ubuyobozi kugira ngo batsinde. Umusanzu we ntiwazamuye gusa umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda ahubwo wanakinguye amarembo y'abakinnyi b'u Rwanda gushakisha amahirwe mu makipe yo mu Burayi, cyane cyane mu Bwongereza.\nAbakinnyi b\u2019u Rwanda barashobora gukomeza kungukirwa n\u2019amasosiyete mpuzamahanga ndetse n\u2019urubuga yashyizeho, bigatanga inzira yo kwinjiza benshi mu bakinnyi b\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru bo mu Rwanda mu makipe akomeye yo mu Burayi.\nUbwitange bwa Alphonse mu guteza imbere umupira w'u Rwanda ni ntagereranywa, kandi imbaraga ze zimubera urumuri rw'ibisekuruza bizaza bifuza kugera ku rwego rwo hejuru muri siporo.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNdanda avuka mu Rwanda ku Gisozi, Akarere ka Gasabo mu mujyi wa Kigali.\n= Inkomoko ="}
{"id": "19597", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19597", "title": "KORORERA MU KIRARO", "text": "Ubusobanuro.\nKororera mu kiraro nuburyo bwo korora amatungo ari hamwe, ibyo bigafasha uworoye ayo matungo kuyakurikirana, kuyagaburira, kuyavura, kuyarinda indwara no mu buryo bwo gutanga ifumbire nyinshi mugihe gito, nibindi.\nIbyatumaga umusaruro w'inka zororewe mukiraro zitagira umusaruro.\nReka twivugire kubworozi bw'inka bukorewe mu kiraro, mu Rwanda abantu barimo bagenda bamenyera kororera mu kiraro kubera ko basanze kororera mugasozi ntanyungu byabagiraga nko kororera mubiraro, aho wasanganga inka zirwa ziruka imusozi, rimwe narimwe zigakurayo indwara nkuburondwe, uburenge, ikibagarira nizindi, ikindi kibazo inka zirisha mugasozi zahuraga nazo nukubyarana ni bimasa badashaka, ugasanga umuntu araragiye inka ze zihuye nikimasa mugasozo kirakibanguriye, ukazasanga abyaje inka yincenzi, ikindi kibazo wasangaga abarozi batabona ifumbire kuko izo nka zabaga zataye amase mugasozi aho baziragiye, rimwe na rimwe umusaruro w' amata ugasanga wabaye mucye.\nIcy kororera mukiraro byafashije.\nkororera mukiraro byafashije ababikora kubasha kwihaza ku mukamo, kubasha gurwanya indwara zandurira mugasozi, kurwanya icyororo umuntu atahisemo kuko iyo bibaye ngobwa umuntu ashobora no kwifashisha intanga avugurura icyororo ke, kandi nanone bifasha kwihaza kwifumbire kubera ko inka ziba zita amase ahantu hamwe."}
{"id": "19598", "revid": "9913", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19598", "title": "Ibijumba bya orange", "text": "Ibijumba bya orange n' ibijumba by' ibara ry' icunga bikungahaye kuri vitamine A, byatangiye guhingwa mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2015 biturutse ku cyemezo cya minisiteri y' ubuhinzi n' ubworozi ndetse na minisiteri y' ubuzima.\nAkamaro..\nAbahanga mu by' ubuzima bavuga ko ibi bijumba bikungahaye kuri Vitamini A, ikaba vitamini y' ingenzi cyane ku bagore batwite, abana ndetse n' abantu bose muri rusange. ikihumba kimwe cya orange gipima garama 100 kirimo vitamini A yose umubiri w' umuntu ikenera kumunsi.\nkandi abahanga bavuga ko ibijumba bya orange bibamo ibinyabutabire bya Alpha_carotene na Beta_Carotene bikaba iby' ingenzi cyane mu kurwanya canseri."}
{"id": "19599", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19599", "title": "Ubushera", "text": "Ubushera.\nUbushera ini ikinyobwa gakondo kidasembuye gitegurwa hifashishijwe amasaka,amazi n'ibikoresho nk'ikibindi,indobo,isafuriya n'amakoma.\nuko ubushera butegurwa:.\nubusanzwe kugirango ikinyobwa cyitwa ubushera kiboneke,ubanza kwinika amasaka mu gihe cy'iminsi itatu hanyuma ukayakura mu mazi,ukayavanga n'ivu hanyuma ukayanika akuma neza.yamara kuma ukayasya agahinduka ifu.ushobora kwifashisha icyuma gisya ibinyampeke \niyo ifu imaze kuboneka,uyicanira mu mazi mu gihe cy'isaha yose bikabira ugakora igikoma ukongeramo amazi menshi ukagifungura ukabireka bikamara nibura amasaha cumi n'abiri bipfundikiye\nAkamaro k'ubushera.\nubushera ni ikinyobwa kigirira akamaro kanini abakunywa kuko burimo ama vitamini menshi n'imyunyu ngugu ifasha umubiri guhorana imbaraga n'imbaduko."}
{"id": "19600", "revid": "16551", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19600", "title": "Ikaramu", "text": "Ijambo \u201cikaramu\u201d ni ijambo rikoreshwa cyane mu buzima bwa buri munsi, cyane cyane mu burezi, itumanaho no mu miryango muri rusange. Dore amakuru arambuye kuri iryo jambo:\n\ud83d\udcdd Mu nshamake:.\n----ikaramu ni igikoresho kifashishwa twandika; ikaba igizwe n' kirahure n'agatima kaba karimo umuti wifashishwa \nAkamaro.\nAbantu benshi bavuze ku karamu ko ari ingirakamaro kuko uwayikoresheje atajya abura ikimurengera. Ikaramu ni ingirakamaro uwakoresheje ikaramu arayirata iti \"uwagukoresheje ntajya aburara\".Ikaramu ni ingenzi ku buzima bwacu buri gihe tugomba kuyiha agaciro kuko ifite byinshi imara mu buzima. "}
{"id": "19601", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19601", "title": "Zoko", "text": "zoko ni umusozi muremure uherereye mu murenge wa mutete ho mukarere ka Gicumbi.\nAmateka avugwa kuruno musozi.\nuyu musozi wa zoko ufite uburebure bwa kilometero 3.5 zubutumburuke uturutse kumuhanda mugari(kaburimbo) uva kigali ujya kumupaka wa gatuna, ujya i Gicumbi mu mugi cyangwa ujya muntara y\"iburasirazuba mukarere ka nyagatare na gatsibo.\nkuruyu musozi kandi bivuga ko ariho urupfu rwamburiye ubuzima cacana babanje kurwana inkundura.\nkugirango ugere kumpinga yuyu musozi unyura mumuhanda uturutse muri santere ya Gaseke ukazamuka mu muhanda ujya ku murenge wa mutete ari naho hubatse urwibutso rukuru ruruhukiyemo imibiri yabazize genocide rwo mu karere ka Gicumbi.\nAmateka y 'abazize jenoside ykorewe abatusi i mutete..\nvidewo ivuga ku mateka ya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mutete muri gicumbi. \nkanda hano..."}
{"id": "19602", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19602", "title": "Akamaro k'amagi", "text": "Amagi niki?\nAmagi ari mubiryo turya bikungahaye kuntunga nyinshi cyane ariko hari umubare utagomba kurenza k'umunsi.\nTugiye kurebera hamwe akamaro k'amagi ningaruka kuwarengeje umubare.\nAkamaro k'amagi.\nmwikorwa ry 'amaraso afite na poroteyine z'ingenzi afite na vitamini f ifasha ubwonko gukora neza.\nIbyo kwibuka!\nIntungamubiri nyinshi 60%biri mumweru naho 40% biri mu muhondo\nkumunsi dukwiye kurya nibura igi rimwe twarenza tukarya abiri mugihe urengeje \nbishobora ku gutera igifu."}
{"id": "19603", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19603", "title": "Amazi meza", "text": "amazi ni ubwoko bw'ibisukika kandi amazi afite akamaro kanini kubiremwa byose.amazi mbere na mbere ya baye mbere ya byose,ariko m' u Rwanda ikigo gishinzwe amazi mu rwanda (WASAC) cyatangiye kubyaza amazi mo ibindi bintu."}
{"id": "19604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19604", "title": "Ibigori by'umuhondo", "text": "ibigori by'umuhondo n'ibigori byibara ry'umuhondo bikungahaye kurivitamine A,B,na E bitewe nigihe bimaze bihingwa bigenda bicica arikona nanone simuribose ahubwo abakunda gushaka amafaranga badashaka ibivangiwe nibobabica kuko bivangira ibindi.\nSkamaro.\nibigori byumuhondo bikungahaye kurivitamine B ariyo ifitemo vitamine zigaburira ubwonko bigatuma bukoraneza.ikindi ibigori bituma umubiri ugirimbaraga murimake biterimbaraga.birindanindwara nka kanceri nizindi nyinshi\nikindi kandi ibigoribyumuhondo bituma ababyeyi barera abanababo neza kuko usanga abana babikundirako biryoha kurusha ibyumweru btyo bigatuma bitarambirana mukubifungura\nAho ibigori byumuhondo byera.\nibigori byumuhondo byera hafiyahose murwanda.ibibigori bihingwa mubutaka bufite ifumbire, kandi bufite amazi kuko bikunda amazi cyane.\nisuyemubutaka bisaba kubyuhira cyangwase kubibagarira."}
{"id": "19605", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19605", "title": "Amasaka meza", "text": "Amasaka ni bimwemubihigwa byingirakama mu Rwanda,nigihigwakidufashamubuzimabwacu bwaburimunsi.\nTugikoresha murwegorwibyokurya,mugufata ibyo kuryabyamugitondo nkigikoma,mubyokurya byasasitankubu\ngari.\nAkamaro.\nAkamaro kamasa nigihigwa gikoreshwamumuconyarwa nkokwengainzogaharimo urwagwa,ikigage,ubuishera.\nNa none amasaka akoreshwa mubyokuryabyamugitondonkigikoma,na none amasakayadufashankomumirireyi\nnyamanswa urugero:Inyoni,inkoko,imbata,inumazirya ifuyamasa.Amasaka wayajyanakwiso ukayagurisha aka"}
{"id": "19606", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19606", "title": "Amatunda y'ubururu", "text": "Itunda cyangwa icunga n'imwe mumbuto zikunzwe n'abantu cyane cyane kubera ko harimo umwimerere unogeye\nburi umwe wese,n'imbuto nanone zifite akamaro kanini cyane kubuzima bwa muntu,zikaba zifite vitamini A,C,akize\nkandi kumunyu wa potasiyumu,karisiyumu,ubutare nizindi. n'imbuto kandi igira igiti nibura kirandaranda gifite kandi\nimkomoko muri Brezille. ikaba kandi igihingwa cyera igihe gito hagati y' imyaka 5-7 ikirushijeho kandi igiti cy' icunga cyangwa \nigiti cy' itunda gikura vuba vuba.\nUBUZIMA\nAkamaro.\ninzobere mubyi imbuto z' itunda cyangwa se icunga bavuga ko itunda ari kimwe mu mbuto zigira umwimerere \nmukuzuza indyo yuzuye,bavuga ko nanone ko igira nubura vitamini A,C ko kandi abana iyo bafashe \nizo mbuto zibagirira akamaro kanini mubuzima bwabo.\nkandi inzobere mubijyanye n'imbuto bavuga ko icunga cyangwa itunda ko ufashe izo mbuto agira ubuzima bwiza kuruta ubwo yari afite"}
{"id": "19607", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19607", "title": "Umusatsi", "text": "Umusatsa nigice cyumubiri giherereye kumutwe aho akenshi gikunzwe nigitsina gore.Nkuko rero ukunzwe nabagore cyane cyane ubwo rero baba bafite inshingano zo kukitaho uko bikwiye"}
{"id": "19608", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19608", "title": "Umuseke", "text": "umuseke ni urubuga rwashyiri weho kumenyesha amakuru avugwa ku isi.rwatangiye mu mwaka 2010 ahasaga.\nakamaro.\n1.gutanga amakuru ari kuvugwa ku isi. \n2. gufasha abaubufashantu ku bona amakuru yizewe\nubufasha.\n1.gutanga inkunga kugirango umuseke uzamuke\n2. kureba amakuru yatangajwe n'umuseke"}
{"id": "19609", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19609", "title": "Amandazi", "text": "Amandazi mubuzimabwacu afitevitamini turanayacuruzamubuzimabusanzwe adufitiyeakamaro turayacuruzaakaduha amafaranga afiteamokomenshi twavuga sipesiyar, zingaro, ibidufun' ibindi...\nAkamaro.\namandaziadufitiye akamaro kenshim' ubuzima bwacuturayacuruzaakaduha amafarangamenshitukiteza imberemubuzimabwaburimunsi tubigireibyacu kukobidufitiyeakamaro amandaziadufitioyeakamarokenshi \nkuvauyumunsikugezaibihebyose duharanirekumenyabyinshi mubuzimabwacubwaburimunsikukobidufitiyeakamarokenshi\ncyane.\nnibyagacirokenshi kubimenyeshaburimunntuwese tubigireibyacu kukoaribyagacirokenshicyane nibyagacirokenshicyane."}
{"id": "19610", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19610", "title": "Cocomble", "text": "Cocomble ni urubuto rufite ibara ryicyatsi,Mu myaka 1000 ishize nibwo mu buhinde havumbuwe igihingwa cyeraga imbuto zitari zizwi icyo gihe niko kuzita cocomble kuko zari zifitiye akamaro abantu.\nAkamaro.\nHari imvugo zitandukanye bakoresha berekana akamaro kuru rubuto ku buzima bwa muntu usanga mu ndimi zamahanga bati `cool as cucumber`bashaka kuvuga uburyo izi mbuto zituma ugubwa neza ndetse ugaca ukubiri ni cyokere mu gihe waziriye,uru rubuto ningenzi cyane kubuzimz bwa muntu kuburyo ni nzobere ku buvuzi nu buzima zitugira inama yo kujya tuzirya buri munsi bidushobokeye."}
{"id": "19611", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19611", "title": "Akamaro k'indimu mu mubiri", "text": "Indimu ziri mu mabara menshi harimo umuhondo n'icyatsi zikaba zifitemo vitamine c, potasiyumu,kalisiyumu kandi biba byiza \niyo uyivanze mu mazi kubera ko indimu yonyine ituma ishinya yangirika.\nAkamaro k'amazi y'indimu.\nAmazi y'indimu zifasha mu kubyimbura inda kubera ko amazi y'indimu agabanya acide urike itera indwara nyinshi ziterwa\nn'acide ikabije mu mubiri.\nIndimu ivanze n'amazi kandi bifasha mu kurinda no kurwanya indwara zo mu kanwa bikanatuma hahorana impumuro nziza \nAmazi y'indimu kandi yakoreshwa mu mwanya w'ikawa kubantu bakunda kuyinywa mu gitondo kandi nta ngarua byatera k'umuntu \nurwaye umuvuduko w'amaraso.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe mu mwaka wa2019 bwagaragaje ko kunywa ibinyobwa birimo indimu bituma impinduka ziterwa no gusaza zigabanuka."}
{"id": "19612", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19612", "title": "Indwara zo mu mutwe", "text": "Mu buzima bwacu bwa buri munsi duhura n'ibibazo bigiye bitandukanye by'ubuzima. Haba ku mubiri ndetse no mu mutwe.Indwara zo mu mutwe zishobora kwibasira buri zititaye kuwo ari we, akazi akora, cyangwa ubuzima abayemo.Tugiye kugaruka kuri byinshi utari uzi ku ndwara zo mu mutwe ndetse n'ubuzima bwo mu mutwe\nIndwara zo mu mutwe ni iki?\nIndwara zo mu mutwe ni imyitwarire idasanzwe umuntu ashobora kugaragaza akaba yata umurongo agatangira no kubangamira abandi.\nAkenshi izi ndwara, inyinshi muri zo zishobora kuba zidakomeye cg ngo zibe ari indwara zimara igihe kirekire ahubwo rimwe na rimwe zishobora kuba ari izoroheje cyangwa zimwe zishira vuba.Ishami ry'umuryango w'abibumbye ryita ku buzima (OMS) ryasobanuye ko ubuzima bwo mu mutwe ari kumenya ubushobozi bwawe ndetse ukagira ubuzima bwiza.Hari indwara zo mu mutwe zibasira abantu benshi ku isi,aha twavuga nk'indwara y'agahinda gakabije aho (OMS) yagaragaje ko yibasiye abantu bangana na miliyoni 300 ku isi yose na ho abangana na 4% bafite indwara y'ubwoba bukabije.\nNi ibiki bitera inwara zo mu mutwe?\n1.IGITSINA \nUbushakashatsi bwagaragaje ko inwara nka schizophrenia zibasira abagore cyane na ho ibibazo by'ikoreshwa by'ibiyobyabwenge bikibasira abagabo cyane kurusha abagore\n2.IMBUGA NKORANYA MBAGA\nImbuga nkoranyambaga zishobora gusunikira abantu bazikoresha mu bwigunge bigatuma bagira ibibazo byo mu mutwe. ubushakashatsi bwagaragaje ko 10% mu bazikoresha bavuze ko zituma bashobora kwigunga na ho 10% bakavuga ko bazigiriraho ibihe.\n3.UBUZIMA UMUNTU ABAYEMO\nUbuzima umuntu abayemo bushobora kuba bwamutera ibibazo byo mu mutwe. mu gihe umuntu abaye mu buzima bubi bishobora kumutera ibibazo byo mu mutwe."}
{"id": "19615", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19615", "title": "Umuziki ugezweho", "text": "Umuziki ugezweho ni umuziki wifashisha tekiniki n'ubumenyi bw'igihe tugezemo, kandi ukurikiza imimerere n'ibyifuzo by'abantu b'iki gihe. Ni umuziki uba ukurikije ibigezweho, akaba akenshi ukora mu buryo butandukanye n'umuziki wa kera, wifashisha ibikoresho n'ikoranabuhanga rigezweho. Ubundi, umuziki ugezweho ushobora kugera ku bantu benshi, cyane cyane binyuze mu mbuga nkoranyambaga, uburyo bwo gutunganya umuziki mu buryo bwa digitale, ndetse no gukoresha imvugo n'umuziki bihuye n'umuco n'ibikorwa bya none.\nMuri rusange:.\nUmuziki ugezweho ni umuziki uhuza uburyo bw\u2019imyidagaduro, ubuhanzi, n\u2019icyerekezo cy\u2019imico ya none. Bahanzi bashobora gukoresha ikoranabuhanga, kumenya ibyifuzo by\u2019abafana, no gukoresha imico n\u2019ibihangano bihuje amahitamo y\u2019abantu, byose bifasha gukora umuziki mwiza ugezweho kandi ukundwa. Gukora umuziki mwiza bisaba no guhanga udushya, kumenya uko umuziki ugenda uhinduka, ndetse no guhora ugerageza kuzakira ibisubizo bishya mu bikorwa byose byo gukora indirimbo."}
{"id": "19616", "revid": "15032", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19616", "title": "Ubukanishi", "text": "ubukanishi: ni umwuga ugamije gukora ibintu byangiritse bikongera bikaba bizima, urugero, imodoka, imashini zo munganda n'ibindi."}
{"id": "19617", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19617", "title": "Igisenge", "text": "Igisenge ni ubwoko bwinzu abantu bubaka,hari ubwoko bubiri igisenge cy'inzu yibyatsi,igisenge cy;inzu yamabati mu Rwanda hambere habaga ubwoko bw;inzu zubakishijwe ibyatsi ariko zaje gucika.Haza izubakishije amabati ndetse namatafari.\nIgisenge nanone hari ubundi bwoko bw'inzu zihishe igisenge arizo zitwa (konoshi) mundimi zamahanga,murimake igisenge ni amoko atata mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "19618", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19618", "title": "Amoko y'amacupa", "text": "AMOKO Y'AMACUPA\nAmacupa agira amoko menshi cyane nkahano mu Rwanda.Dore ukobikurikirana\n1.Amacupa y'amavuta\n2.Amacupa azamo inzoga\n3.Amacupa azamo inzoga zidasembuye\n4.Amacupa ashyirwamo indabo ndetse nibindi."}
{"id": "19619", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19619", "title": "Abakonyine", "text": "ABAKONYINE\nAbakonyine ni abantu ki?\nMuntara y'iburasirazuba haba ubwoko bw'abantu butandukanye harimo nubu bw'abakonyine,abobantu bakunze kuba barebare,abatesi,ndetse batunga inka nyinshi cyane ugereranyije nabandi mu gihugu cyu Rwanda..\nAbo bantu ntibakunda kurya ahubwo bakunda amata cyane, gukunda amata bifitanye isano n'umuco w'ubworozi kuruta kuba ari ikimenyetso cy'abo.\nAMASHAKIRO;"}
{"id": "19620", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19620", "title": "INZARA", "text": "Inzara ni igice cy'umubiri w'umuntu gisangwa ku ntoki no kubirenge, kifashishwa mu kwishima ku mubiri igihe hari uburibwe umuntu agize. \nUmumaro w'inzara.\nInzara zifashishwa mukugaraga ubwiza bw'igitsinagore cyane cyane abakobwa, iyo umuntu afite inzara ndende bivugwako ariwe ufite inzara nziza.\nAbenshi bakunda kuzisiga amabara menshi kugirango bazongerere ubwiza.\nAmata"}
{"id": "19621", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19621", "title": "Insigamigani", "text": "INSIGAMIGANI;insigamigani ni bumwe mubuvanganzo bwo muri rubanda bushingira kubyabayeho igihe runaka,aho byabereye,kandi insigamigani zigaragarira mu mivugire,imico,imigendere ya bantu babayeho.\nZimwe mu ngero zi nsigamigani zo mu Rwanda.\n.NDATEGA ZIVAMO\n.yigize nkana"}
{"id": "19622", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19622", "title": "Umupira wamaguru kw'isi yose", "text": "Umuntu akivuga umupira wamaguru uhita wumva imyidagaduro, Nibyo umupira wamaguru urakunzwe ku isi hose.\nbiragoranyo ko wasanga igihugu kuriyi si kidafite umupira wamaguru, waba ari uwakinyamwuga cyangwa atari uwakinyamwuga.\nariko uzumva abenshi bavuga ko inkomoko yawo ari muri Brasil.\nIBIHUGU BIZWI MUMUPIRA WAMAGURU.\nmu ma miliyaridi atuye isi, miliyalidi 4 muri zo ni abakunzi bumupira wamaguru, mubakunda umupira wamaguruz hari abawumva kuma radio,abawureba kuma televiziyo ndetse hari nabawureba imbona nkubone kubibuga.\nMenya ibihugu 10 birenze mumupira wamaguru\n1.Argentina\n2. France\n3. Spain\n4.England\n5.Brasil\n6.Portugal\n7. Netherland\n8. Belgium\n9.Italy\n10.Germany\nuru nirwo rutonde rw'ibihugu 10 birenze mu mupira wamaguru."}
{"id": "19623", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19623", "title": "Imbyino zigezweho", "text": "Imbyino zigezweho ni izo abantu bakunze gukoresha mu bihe bitandukanye, cyane cyane mu birori, ibitaramo, ndetse no mu bindi bikorwa byo kwishimisha. Mu Rwanda imbyino zigezweho zinagaragaramo imivugo cyangwa injyana zitandukanye, ziba zigamije guhuza ibyiyumvo by'abantu n'imibereho yabo.\nImbyino zigezweho mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2024.\n1.Amapiano.\nIyi ni injyana ikundwa cyane muri Afurika y'Epfo ariko ubu yamaze gukwira mu bindi bihugu harimo n'u Rwanda. Amapiano igizwe n'imbyino zikubiyemo ibirere bigezweho, umuziki utuje, ndetse n'umuziki wihuta."}
