{"id": "19682", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19682", "title": "Intoki", "text": "Intoki ni kimwe mu bice by'umuntu ziba z'imeze udushami duto tw'umubiri w'umuntu, tugize ukuboko kandi dufite inshingano zo gufata, gukoraho,no gukora ibikorwa bitandukanye\nIntoki tuzikoresha mubuzima bwa buri munsi kandi ibintu bitandukanye,niyo mpamvu usanga abantu bamwe batazitaho abandi bakazitaho, ariko ni ingenzi kuzitaho kuko nazo zigize umubiri wacu kandi ni ihame ko tugomba kugirirra isuku umubiri wacu, kuko bidufasha mu kwirinda indwara zitandukanye zandurira mu mwanda,harimo nk'imiswi(Diarrhea) ndetse n'izindi harimo nicyorezo covid19.\nUburyo bwo gukorera isuku intoki zawe.\nGukora isuku y\u2019intoki ni ingenzi cyane kugira ngo wirinde indwara no kugumana isuku. Dore uburyo bwo gukaraba intoki neza:\n4.Koresha ubundi buryo bwo gusukura: Niba bishoboka, shakisha na \"scrub\" cyangwa icyo bita \"nail brush\" kugirango umenye ko usukuye neza no hagati mu ntoki.\nAKAMARO KO GUKARABA INTOKI.\n\u2022Gukaraba intoki n\u2019amazi meza n\u2019isabune bituma udukoko tuzirimo dupfa bityo bikakurinda indwara zituruka ku mwanda.\n\u2022Kugira isuku mu biganza birinda umuntu indwara kandi bigakumira kuyikwirakwiza mu bandi."}
{"id": "19683", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19683", "title": "Ikaye", "text": "IKAYE ;NI igikoresho gikoresha bandikaho inyandiko zitandukanye\nAKAMARO KIKAYE\n.ikoreshwa nabanyeshuri\n.ikaye idufasha mukubika amakuru\n.ikaye idufasha mu kwiga \nAMABARA YAMAKAYE\n.amakayi menshi akozwe mu ibara ryumweru\nUKO TWAGIRIRA ISUKU AMAKAYE\n1.kwirinda gushyiraho imyanda\n2.kwirinda kuyashyira mu mazi\n3.kuyabika ahantu humutse \nAMOKO YAMAKAYE\n.ikayi yimpapuro 2oo\n.ikayi yimpapuro 96 \n.ikayi yimpapuro16\nAMAKAYE AGIZWE NIKI\n.amakaye yose agizwe nimpapuro zumweru"}
{"id": "19684", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19684", "title": "Imbasa", "text": "IMBASA\nImbasa ni indwara yibasira abana bari munsi y'imyaka 15 ariko cyane cyane abari munsi yi 5.\nImbasa iterwa na virusi ikunze kugaragara mu umwanda wo m'umusarane,igafata uwariye cyagwa uwanyweye wese ibirimo iyo virusi.Bimwe mu ibimenyetso byayo ni ukugira ubumuga ku kaguru kamwe cyagwa yombi nanone ushobora kugira ubumuga ku \nkaboko kamwe cyagwa yombi.Dr Rosette Nahimana ushizwe porogaramu zo gukingira mw'ishami ry'umuryango w'Abibumbye\nrishinzwe ubuzima (OMS) avugako iyi ndwara hari abayirwara ikabahitana cyagwa ikabatera ubumuga buhoraho.\nYakomeje avugako mubantu 200 umwe muribo agira ubumuga buhoraho abandi uko bakameza kuvurwa ibimenyetso bigenda\nbiganuka kandi hagati ya 5cyagwa10%yabo irabahitana kubera kumugara imikaya yo mubuhumekero bakananirwa guhumeka.\nYarongeye ati:\u00abGukingira iyindwara aribwo buryo bwonyine bwo kurandura ino ndwara burundu mu Rwanda.\nYongeyeho kandi ko imbaraga zashyizwe mugukinira abana batoya byatumye abari bayirwabaravuye ku bihumbi 350 mu mwaka\nwi 1988 bakagera ku bihumbi 33 mu mwaka wa2018 kwisi hose.\nKugeza ubu mu Rwanda igipimo cyabana bayikingizwa ni 93% akaba ari nayompamvu Minisiteri y'ubuzima(RBC) ishishikariza ababye gukingiza abana babo kuko gukingiza abana bihendutse cyane kurusha kubavuza.\nUbu butumwa bwanagarutsweho kuri 25Ukwakira mu karere ka Nyanza ubwo hizihizwaga umunsi mukuru wo kurwanya imbasa\nmu Rwanda."}
