{"id": "19686", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19686", "title": "Ibisimba by\u2019umutwe muremure", "text": "Ibisimba by\u2019umutwe muremure cyangwa se sikoropiyo ni agasimba gato ko mu muryango w\u2019ibinyamushongo. Kagaragazwa n\u2019umurizo wihariye: ugizwe n\u2019utugirangingo, wigondoye ureba imbere hejuru y\u2019umugongo. Ku mpera y\u2019umurizo harasongoye (hari agacumu).\nUwo murizo wayo usongoye ni wo ijomba umuntu ikamutera ubumara bukoze mu bintu bihumanya, bigira ingaruka ku myakura no mu bwonko.\nIfite uduhembe tubiri tw\u2019imbere yifashisha mu gufata ibintu n\u2019utuguru 8. Uko ireshya biterwa n\u2019ubwoko bwayo (uburebure bwayo harimo n\u2019umurizo akenshi ni ukuva kuri 9mm kugera kuri 21cm).\nIndyanishamurizo zishobora kuba ari umuhondo, umutuku cyangwa umukara, gusa muri rusange ziteye kimwe.\nZikunda kwigaragaza nijoro, ku manywa ziba zihishe mu nzu ahiherereye, muri fondasiyo y\u2019inzu, mu gisenge, mu gitanda cyangwa mu biryamirwa, mu myenda, mu nkweto n\u2019amasogisi, hanyuma igasohoka nijoro igiye gushaka ibyo kurya, icyo gihe nibwo iruma abantu."}
{"id": "19687", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19687", "title": "ISAHA", "text": "AKAMARO KI ISAHA yambara kukubokoisaha nigikoresho umuntu\nAKAMAROKI SAHA\nisaha yambarwa kuku boko\nisaha ituma tumenyaigihe\nAMOKO YI SAHA\nisaha ya gashinge\nisaha yi mibare\nUKOTWABUNGA BUNGA ISAHA\nku yirinda amazi\nku yirinda izuba ryinshi cyane"}
{"id": "19688", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19688", "title": "Icungamutungo", "text": "Icungamutungo ni ikintu nk' abantu dukenera mu buzima bwa buri munsi. Icungamutungo ni uburyo bwo kugenzura, gucunga, no gukoresha neza umutungo cyangwa ibikoresho mu buryo bw'umwuga cyangwa bwateguwe, kugira ngo bigerweho intego zitandukanye kandi bikoreshwe mu buryo bukwiye..\nRero mu buzima bwiki gihe bitewe naho iterambere rigeze abantu tubayeho ibintu byose dukeneye kandi dutunze dukeneye kubicunga \"icungamutungo\" rishobora kugaruka ku gucunga umutungo w'umuntu cyangwa ikigo, harimo kubika no kugenzura imari, ibikoresho, ndetse n'ibindi byangombwa, kugira ngo bifashe kugera ku ntego z'imari cyangwa z'ubucuruzi.\nMu Rwanda hari ishami ry' icungamutungo umuntu wifuza kumenya ibijyanye n' icungamutungo ntiyabura aho yabyigira.Mu nzego zitandukanye, icungamutungo rishobora gukoreshwa mu gucunga umutungo wa leta, wa sosiyete, cyangwa wa buri wese mu rwego rwo kumenya aho umutungo uherereye no gukoresha neza ibikenerwa byose mu gihe gikwiye.\nAkamaro k' icungamutungo.\nicungamutungo rifite akamaro kanini harimo:\n1.Ridufasha mu gukoresha neza umutungo.\n2.Kugira gahunda n' imikorere myiza.\n3.Kubaka ubushobozi bwo kwikemurira ibibazo.\n4.Guteza imbere ibikorwa by' iterambere.\n5.Kwirinda ibibazo by' ubukungu n' ingaruka zabyo."}
{"id": "19689", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19689", "title": "UBUTAYU", "text": "Ubutayu ni ahantu hameze nk'ubutaka budahagije cyangwa bwumye, akenshi bukaba bufite ubushyuhe bwinshi kandi budafite imvura ihagije. Ibi bituma ubutayu bugira umwihariko w'ubuzima buke kandi bukaba butagira ubworozi bwinshi cyangwa ibikorwa by\u2019ubuhinzi nka ahandi hantu.\nUbutayu bushobora kuba:\nIbitera ubutayu.\nUbutayu buterwa n'ibintu bitandukanye, harimo:\nIngaruka z'ubutayu.\nIngaruka z\u2019ubutayu ni nyinshi kandi zishobora kugira ingaruka zikomeye ku buzima bw\u2019abantu, inyamaswa, ibimera, ndetse n'ubukungu bw'igihugu. Dore zimwe mu ngaruka z'ubutayu:\nIbinyabuzima byo mubutayu.\nIbinyabuzima byo mu butayu birangwa n\u2019ibinyabuzima byihariye byashoboye kwihanganira ibihe bikomeye by\u2019ubushyuhe n\u2019umwuma. Muri butayu, ibinyabuzima byakoresheje uburyo bwo kwihanganira ubushyuhe bukabije, kubura amazi, no guhangana n\u2019ibindi bibazo biterwa n\u2019imiterere y\u2019ubutayu. Dore bimwe mu binyabuzima byo mu butayu:"}
{"id": "19690", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19690", "title": "Imyumati", "text": "IMYUMBATI; NI IGIHINGA GITERAYE NKIKIJUMBA CYIKABA GIHEREREYE MUBITERA IMBARA\nAKAMARO KIMYUMBATI\n.imyumbati itera imbaraga\n.imbati igabanya inzara mubaturage\n.imyumbati irwanya isuri\nUKO IMYUMBATI ITEYE\n.umwumbati iyo ukera uri mubutaka hejuru habahari igiti kimeze nkisombe naho hasi hari umwumbati\nAKAMARO KUMWUMBATI KUMWANA MUTO\n.umwana muto aba akeneye imbaraga ngo akure imyumati imutera imwaraga noneho agakura\nAHANTU HERA IMYUMBATI MURWANDA\n.NYAGATARE /mutara/\n.KARONGI\n.NYAMASHEKE\nAKANDI KAMARO KIMYUMBATI\n.imyumbati iduha amafaranga"}
