{"id": "19693", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19693", "title": "Imigani migufi", "text": "= IMIGANI MIGUFI YA KINYARWANDA =\n\"Imigani migufi\"niyo migani bakunze kwita \"imigani y'imigenurano\"ni imigani ikunda gukoreshwa babwira umuntu ikintu runaka cyangwa bakayivuga harikintu bagamije kuvuga gusa bikavugwa mumigani kuburyo ubyumvise ashobora kudasobanukirwa icyo bishatse kuvuga.\nImigani migufi kandi ni imigani iri muburyo buzimije kuburyo uyumva wese adahita asobanukirwa n'icyo uwo mugani ushatse kuvuga,imigani migufi nyarwanda rero yakundaga gukoreshwa cyane haricyo bashatse kubwira umuntu bityo bakawuca bawugenurira k'umuntu arinayo mpamvu yitwa imigani y'imigenurano.\nMurwanda imigani migufi nimwe mubyerekana umuco wabanyarwanda kuko abanyarwanda wasangaga bashobora kuvugira mumigani bityo urihanze yabo cyangwa undi muntu w'umunyamahanga atabasha kumenya icyo bavuze,ibyorere byerekana ko abanyarwanda bafite umuco wo kuganira kandi muburyo bw'ururimi rwacu gakondo.Dore ingero zimwe z'imigani migufi nyarwanda.\n1.Ababiri baruta umwe\n2.Ababiri bateranye abeza\n3.Abagira iyo bajya baragenda\n4.Ubwenge buza ubujiji buhise\n5.Abasangira busa bitana ibisambo\n6.Abagiye inama Imana irabasanga\n7.Urwishigishiye ararusoma\n8.Akebo kajya iwamugarura\n9.Ntawe urya inka nkanyirayo\n10.Inzira ntibwira umugenzi\n11.Umuhana avayo ntumuhana ajyayo\n12.Ifuni ibagara ubuncuti ni akarenge\n12.Urucira mukaso rugatwara nyoko\n13.Akabura ntikaboneke ni nyina w'umuntu\n14.Umutego mutindi ushibukana nyirawo\n15.Urugo ni urugendwa \n16.Ibyabapfu biribwa n'abapfumu\n17.Abahizi babiri ntibanyura inzira imwe\n18.Abajya impaka ari babiri umwe aba yigiza nkana\n19.Ubugabo si ubutumbi\n20.Uwiba ahetse aba abwira uwo mumugongo\n21.Abakiranye ntibahishana ibibuno\n22.Abo umwami yahaye amata nibo bamwimye amatwi\n23.Habwirwa benshi hakumva beneyo\n24.Ubwira uwumva ntavunika\n25.Umutsima w'imbwa Imana irara iwusonze\n26.Voka y'imbwa imanuka ihiye\n27.Agahanga k'umugabo gahuma katavuze\n28.Ntabihanga bibiri munkono imwe\n29.Amavuta y'umugabo n'amuraye kumubiri\n30.Umutima muhanano ntiwuzura igituza\n31. Ababiri bagiye inama baruta umunani barasana\n32. abagira inyonjo bagira ibirori.\n33.Ndeke bihore yasangiye numaze ibye.\n34. Aho ushyinguye amagara ntuhashyira ubugi bw'icyuma.\n35.Aho uniga uhasanga umuhogo.\n36. Aho umukecuru atoye uruhindu ahita uruganda.\n37. Aho kwerekana inkongoro wakwerekana uwo yareze.\n38. Aharaye inzara haramuka inzigo.\n39. Ahari amahoro umuhoro urogosha \n40. Aho inkuba yerekeye niho ibicu bijya.\n41. Aho guhana umupfu wayobya umuvu.\n42. Ibihembe by'intama ntawumenya aho bikura byerekeza.\n43. Ibitsindagiwe n'umunwa ntibyuzuza ibigega.\n44. Guherekeza utagushaka ni ugutera inzira agahinda.\n45. Guha umukungu ni ukugura inzira.\n46. Gesa ubwiyo ubwino ntiburera.\n47. Cira mugacuma haryoha ururaye.\n48. Bavuga ibigoramye imihoro ikarakara.\n49. Bakunda inkwi bakanga umushenyi.\n50. Babona isha itamba bagata urwo bambaye.\nUbusobanuro Bw'imigani imwe nimwe.\n.Akebo kajya iwamugarura.\nUyu mugani bawuca iyo babonye umuntu witurwa ineza yagiranye imico myiza ye, nubwo bavuga ngo 'Akebo kajya iwa mugarura.'\nWakomotse kuri Mugarura uwo nyine, ku ngoma itazwi neza ikirari. Mugarura uwo ngo yakuranye imico myiza cyane, akubitiraho n'ubukire muri byose; Imyaka n'amatungo. Abantu baza kumucaho inshuro, akabereka icyibo cya mugerwa w'umuhinzi, umuhingiye yahingura akamuha inshuro y'umuhinzi muri icyo cyibo, hanyuma akamushyiriramo indi y'ubuntu.\nAbigenza atyo imyaka myinshi, n'uje kumusaba inka nawe akayimuha, ndetse ngo byarimba akamuha n'indi ya kabiri. Bibera aho, bukeye inshuti ze n'abana be baramukuba, bamubwira ko yangiza inka ze n'imyaka ye, Bati; Dore urimaraho ibintu ubyangiza, nihacaho iminsi uzasigara umeze ute??? Ejo uzasanga rubanda rukunnyega ntawe ukureba n'irihumye.\nMugarura yumva amagambo yabo akabihorera ntagire icyo abasubiza, Bigenda gutyo igihe kirekire.Bibaho biratinda bishyize kera, haza umuntu amugerageresha kumushuka, aramubwira ati;' Mugarura, ubuntu bwawe bwo gutanga utabaze rubanda turabwishimira, ariko n'ubwo tugushima bwose jyewe ntacyo urampa! None nje kugusaba inka eshantu zokubaga'. Mugarura aramwemerera, amuha inka eshanu arazijyana.\nAzigejeje iwe, aho kuzibagira arazorora; zirakunda zirororoka, ziba amashyo atanu. Rubanda babibonye batyo, Barega Mugarura ibwami ko yangiza ibintu, dore ko ubwo uwangizaga inka ze bavugagako amara inka z'umwami. Ibyo bituma umwami amugabiza rubanda abaramunyaga, ariko inka n'ibintu bye nta muntu wabigabanye byatwawe na rubanda bose rubyigabanije.\nNuko ibwami bategeka ko Mugarura atazahabwa umuriro kuko yabaye umupfu mu bintu by'ibwami. Mugarura amaze kunyagwa ahinduka umukene cyane, abura aho aba n'umugore n'abana be, agumya kuzerera. Hanyuma atunguka ku muntu wigeze kumuhingira akamuha inshuro ebyiri. Uwo mugabo amukubise amaso, agira impuwe; ava mu nzu ya kambere ayiha Mugarura, asigara mu nzu yo mugikari. Mugarura amaze kubona inzu abamo, rubanda bamenya ko yabonye icumbi; abo yagiriye neza batangira kujya bagenda nijoro, bamushyira ibintu. Ubwo kugenda nijoro batinyaga Ibwami.\nUwo Mugarura uwo yahaye inshuro ebyiri, akaza nijoro akamusubiza za nshuro, ndetse akabigira gatatu, mbese rubanda yagiriye neza bose baramuyobokaga, bamuzanira amafunguro; bamwe mu twibo, abandi mu bitebo. Bigeze aho abenshi yagiriye neza bajya kumuhakirwa ibwami ngo bamuhe umuriro. Ibwami baremera, bamuha inka y'umuriro. Mugarura amaze kubona umuriro, rubanda barishima; noneho baza ku mugaragaro bamuzanira ibintu byo kumwishimira bamwitura ineza yabagiriye.\nBukeye wa mugabo wazaga kumushuka ngo amuhe inka eshanu zo kubaga (zazindi yagezaga iwe akazorora), yumvise ko Mugarura acumbitse, aramubwira ati; Ngize amahirwe kuko wabonye umuriro, za nka wampaga zo kubaga uko ari eshanu narazoroye, zabaye amashyo atanu; none ngaya amasho atatu nanjye ndasigarana abiri.' Mugarura amushimana na rubanda, barakomeza barahurura, bamuzanira amaturo n'inka n'imyaka nuko yubaka imitiba n'ibigega.\nNuko Mugarura asubira kuba umukungu, ndetse arusha mbere aratunga aratunganirwa. Uwo rero rubanda bamuzaniraga ibintu bibuka uko yabagiriraga, ni byo byiswe ko 'Akebo kagera iwa Mugarura'.\n'Gushyira akebo iwa Mugarura= Kwitega iminsi'\n.Ababiri bagiye inama baruta umunani barasana..\nUmuryango w'abantu bake bumvikana, urusha imbaraga umuryango munini usubiranamo. Uyu mugani bawucira gushishikariza abantu gushyira hamwe no guhuza umutima. abajya inama Imana irabasanga.\n.Abagabanye imbisi(inyama) ntibagabana umufa (cyangwa; ntibagabana izihiye)..\nKugabana inyama mbisi bivuze ko hariho inkono ebyiri zo guteka. Kugabana izihiye bivuze kurira hamwe. Abateka ukubiri bagomba no kurya ukubiri. Kugabana bishushanya kumvikana. Iyo abantu bagiranye amasezerano ni ngombwa kuyubahiriza.\n.Abagira inyonjo bagira ibirori..\nKera umuntu ufite inyonjo yagendanye n'umuntu ucumbagira. Noneho abantu bakagenda bashungera umunyanyonjo, naho ucumbagira ntibamwiteho. Ucumbagira ni ko kuvuga ati 'Abagira inyonjo bagira ibirori' Bashobora kuwucira ku muntu ugira amafuti kandi akayiratana.\nAgasaza k'inshizi y'amanga kabona inkumi ibyutse kati; Ngwino unyoze ibirenze! Inkumi iti;' Birakozwa na Nyabarongo cyangwa n'umugezi utemba'\n.Ndeke bihore yasangiye numaze ibye..\nuyumugani bawuca iyo umuntu adakoresheje igihe cye neza bavuga bati amahirwe ubonye yakoreshe akokanya nutinda, abandi bazayabyaza umusaruro. \n.Aho ushyinguye amagara ntuhashyira ubugi bw'icyuma..\nUyumugani bawuca bashaka kuvuga bati ahantu uteze amakiriro ntukahangize cyangwa se wirinda icyahangiza.\n.Aho uniga uhasanga umuhogo..\nuyu mugani bawucira abantu bakora ibintu nkana bagira bati ibaze nko kwangiza ikintu uziko ntakamaro kigufitiye nyuma ugasanga icyo cyintu wangije kigufitiye akamaro.\n.Aho umucekuru atoye uruhindu ahita uruganda..\nuyumugani usobanura ko ahantu ugiriye amahirwe adahoraho bagira bati iyo umuntu agiriye amahirwe ahantu, agira ngo niko bihora.\n.Aho kwerekana inkongoro wakwerekana uwo yareze..\nuyu mugani bawuca bashaka nkokwerekana ko atari ngombwa kwigamba ibyo wakoze ahubwo byaba byiza uretse ibikorwa bikivugira aho bagira bati; Wivuga uti nakoze ibikorwa runaka ahubwo garagaza abo wabikoreye.\n.Aharaye inzara haramuka inzigo.\nuyumugani bawuca ahantu hari umwiryane kuko ahari umwiryane haba hari ninzara.\n.Ahari amahoro umuhoro urogosha..\nUyu mugani bawuvugira ko ahari amahoro ntakidashoboka bagira bati; Ahantu hari imutekano n'ibyari bigoye ubonako bidashoboka birashoboka.\n.Aho ibyago byaje ibihaha bica umuhoro..\nuyu mugani usobanura ko iyo ibyago byaje bishobora kugera naho bitari byitezwe.\n.Aho inkuba yerekeye niho ibicu bijya..\nuyumugani usobanurako uruhande umuyobozi arimo arirwo nabayoborwa baba barimo cyangwa se nirwo bagomba kujyamo.\n.Aho guhana umupfu wayobya umuvu..\nUyu mugani usobanura ko aho guhana umuntu wumupfapfa cyangwa umuntu utumva wamureka ntumuteho igihe kuko aba atagirwa ninama.\n.Ibihembe by'intama ntawumenya aho bikura byerekeza..\nUyumugani usobanurako nta muntu wamenya ahazaza h'uruhinja.\n.Ibitsindagiwe n'umunwa ntibyuzuza ibigega..\nUyu mugani. ibivuzwe gusa cyangwa ibintu byubatse mumagambo gusa ntacyo byageraho.\n.Guherekeza utagushaka ni ugutera inzira agahinda..\nUyu mugani usobanuyeko Kwita kumuntu utaguha agaciro birababaza cyane.\n.Guha umukungu ni ukugura inzira..\nUyu mugani usobanuyeko iyo ugiriye neza umunyamaboko arinko kwiteganyiriza ahazaza.\n.Gesa ubwiyo ubwino ntiburera..\nUyu mugani usobanura nko kubwira umuntu reba ibyiwanyu ibya hano ntibikureba.\n.Cira mugacuma haryoha Ururaye..\nUyu mugani bakunda kuwucira umuntu uvuga amagambo mbenshi aho iyo bamubwiye ngo cira mugacuma haryoha ururaye baba bamubwiye ngo Rekera aho kuvuga ibisigaye n'ibanga.\n.Bazirunge zange zibe isogo..\nuyumugani usobanuye ko ntako baba batagize ngo ibintu bibe byiza ariko bikanga bigakomeza kuba bibi.\n.Bavuga ibigoramye imihoro ikarakara..\nUyu mugani usobanura ko iyo bavuze amakosa cyangwa bagaragaje amakosa runaka nyirayo niwe urakara mbere.\n.Bakunda inkwi bakanga umushenyi..\nUyumugani usobanuye ko abantu bakunda ibyiza ariko bakanga ababiharaniye.\n.Babona Isha itamba bagata urwo bambaye..\nUyu mugani usobanura ko umuntu aba abonye ibintu byinzaduka akibagirwa ibyacyera byamufashije."}
{"id": "19694", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19694", "title": "INDEGE", "text": "INDEGE;ni ikinyabiziga kigendera mukirere gikoresha benine\nAKAMARO KINDEGE\n.indege idufasha kuva ahantu hamwe turya ahandi\n.indege iryana imizigo\n.indege ivana ibicuruzwa ahantu hamwe ibiryana ahandi\n.indege idufasha mu intambara\nAMOKO YINDEGE\n.INDEGE YINAMBARA\n.INDEGE ITWARA IMIZIGO\n.INDEGE ITWARA ABAGENZI\nAKAMARO KINDEGE MU ITERAMBERE RYIGIHUGU\n.indege idufasha kuvana ibicuruzwa mugihugu cyimwe ibiryana mukindi maze bigateza imbere igihugu\n.indege ivana abantu mugihugu kimwe ibaryana mukindi maze bikubaka umubano mwiza wibihugu\nAMAVUTA YINDEGE BAYITA (BENZINE)"}
{"id": "19695", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19695", "title": "Indwara y'uruhara", "text": "Indwara y'uruhara ni indwara igaragara k'uruhu igafata igice cy'umutwe, aho usanga umusatsi uri igice kimwe ahandi warapfutse. kandi ishobora guterwa n'impamvu zitandukanye,ariko bikaba binashoboka kurwirinda.\nImpamvu zishobora gutera indwara y'uruhara.\n1.Imihindagurikire y'ikirere: ubushyuhe, ubukonje cyangwa izuba bikabije bishobora gutera ibibazo k'uruhu harimo n'uruhara.\n2.Ubwandu.: Indwara nka bakteriya, virusi, cyangwa udukoko (fungus) bishobora kwangiza uruhu,bikaba byatera ibimenyetso nko kuvuvuka,kuribwa cyangwa kubora.\n3.Imirire mibi: Kutarya indyo yuzuye cyangwa kugira intungamubiri nke nabyo bishobora kugira ingaruka ku ruhu.\n4.Imyitwarire mibi ku ruhu: gukoresha ibirungo bihumanya cyangwa ibindi bintu bishobora kwangiza uruhu, nk'amavuta,isabune cyangwa ibindi bikoresho bikoreshwa k'uruhu.\n5.Indwara za gikoko: Nka eczema, psoriasis cyangwa acne, aho uruhu rwibasirwa n\u2019indwara ziterwa n\u2019imyitwarire y\u2019imikurire cyangwa ibyiza bidahuye n'uruhu.\n6.Ibibazo by'ubuzima bw'umubiri: Ubundi burwayi, nk'uburwayi bw'amaraso, uburwayi bw'umutima cyangwa umunyu mu mubiri, nabyo bishobora gutera ibibazo ku ruhu harimo no kuzana uruhara.\nUko indwara y'uruhara ishobora kugaragara.\nUKO URUHARA RWAKIRINDWA.\n1. Guhora ukorera umusatsi isuku ihagije, wirinda indwara zishobora gufata umusatsi ziturutse ku isuku nke.\n2. Kwirinda gukoresha ibisokozo cyangwa uburoso bikoreshwa n\u2019abantu benshi.\n3. Gukoresha amavuta akomeye nk\u2019ahindura amabara y\u2019umusatsi.\n4. Kwirinda kwiyogoshesha umaraho umusatsi cyane.\n5. Kurya indyo yuzuye kandi ikungahaye ku myunyu ngugu nka magnesium, calcium, fer na zinc bifasha cyane kumera k\u2019umusatsi.\n6. Kwirinda umunaniro ukabije, kuko ngo bituma umubiri ukora imisemburo myinshi cyane ya kigabo hanyuma bigatera uruhara."}
{"id": "19696", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19696", "title": "Amaguru", "text": "AMAGURU;ni igice cyumubiri kidufasha kugenda giherereye hepfo yigihimba\nAKAMARO KAMAGURU\n.amaguru adufasha kugenda\n.amaguru adufasha kwihuta\n.amaguru adufasha kwiruka\nAHANTU AMAGURU AHEREREYE\n.amaguru aherereye hepfo yigihimba\nISUKU YAMAGURU\n.kuyoza dukoresheje amazi meza nisabunegisagara\n.kumutsa amaguru nyuma yokwoga\n.gusiga amavuta amaguru"}
{"id": "19697", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19697", "title": "Ikimuri", "text": "\"Ikimuri\"ni ijambo risobanura amauta y'inka akaba aramavuta bakura mumata iyo bayacunda bakaba bayifashisha nk'umuti cyangwa bakayarya..\nIkimuri cyangwa se amavuta y'inka agira akamaro kenshi ndetse akungahaye no kuri vitamine nyinshi umubiri ukenera,urugero rwa vitamine isangwa mumavuta y'inka ikenerwa cyane n'umubiri w'umuntu twavuga ni vitamineA,iyi vitamine izwiho kugira akamaro gatandukanye nko kuba ifasha mu mikurire myiza y'amagufwa n'amenyo,kugira uruhu rwiza no kurinda ubwandu butandukanye. Ikindi iyi vitamine A igira uruhare mukurinda utunyangingo tw'umubiri(antioxidant),ndetse no kugira ubuzima bwiza bw'amaso ukanatuma umubiri ukora imisemburo ukeneye kurugero rwiza.\nMumavuta y'inka kandi habonekamo izindi vitamine nkaD,E na K. Vitamine K iboneka mumavuta y'inka nizwi nka K2 iba mumavuta n'amata yinka yagaburiwe ubwatsi gusa, ifasha umubiri kuvugurura karisiyumu ziwurimo kuyibura mumubiri bitera indwara zitandukanye nk'izumutima,kanseri n'indwara yo kuribwa amagufwa no kumungwa kwayo.\nAkamaro k'ikimuri\n1.Ikimuri gifasha mukuringaniza ibinure mumubiri\n2.Ikimuri ni isoko yimyunyu ngugu ifitiye umubiri wacu akamaro\n3.Ikimuri kidufasha mukugira uruhu rwiza igihe wakisize\n4.Ikimuri ni isoko ya vitamine zitandukanye umubiri wacu ukenera, urugero nka vitamine D,E,na K\n5.Ikimuri cyangwa amavuta y'inka atuma ibiryo bihumura igihe yakoreshejwe bateka ndetse yongera n'uburyohe bw'ibiryo."}
{"id": "19698", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19698", "title": "Amaboko", "text": "AMABOKO ;ni igicye cyumubiri kidufasha gufata ibintu giherereye haruguru yigihimba \nAKAMARO KAMABOKO\n.amaboko adufasha gufata ibntu\n.amaboko adufasha guhinga\n.amaboko adufasha guteka \nAHANTU AMABOKO AHEREREYE\n.amabo aherereye ruguru yigihimba\nISUKU YAMABOKO\n.koza amaboko ukoresheje amazi nisabune\n.kuyumutsa nyuma yokoga \n.kuyasiga amavuta"}
{"id": "19699", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19699", "title": "Umutwe", "text": "Kubabara umutwe ni ikimenyetso cy'ububabare mu maso cyangwa mu mutwe. Iyo bigarutse kenshi bizwi nk'indwara yo kubabara umutwe. Kubabara umutwe kenshi bishobora kugira ingaruka ku mibanire n'abandi ndetse no ku kazi. Hari kandi ibyago byinshi byo kwiheba ku bafite umutwe ukomeye.\nKuribwa umutwe bishobora guterwa ahanini n'ikibazo runaka cyangwa bigaterwa n'ikibazo cyihishe inyuma. Umutwe w'ibanze urimo umutwe ufata imitsi, umutwe ufata imitsi, n'umutwe ufata imitsi. Umutwe ukurikiraho urimo kuribwa umutwe cyane hakoreshejwe imiti, kuva amaraso muri subarachnoid, meningitis, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso mu mutwe, gucikamo ibice by'uruti rw'umugongo, glaucoma, sinusiti, arteritis y'igihe gito, ibibyimba byo mu bwonko, uburozi bwa monoxide ya karubone, eclampsia, na thrombosis ya sinus yo mu bwonko. Gusuzuma indwara akenshi bishingiye ku bimenyetso n'ubushobozi bishobora guterwa n'ibishushanyo mbonera by'abaganga cyangwa gutobora uruhu rwo mu ruhu.\nKuvura umutwe biterwa n'impamvu nyamukuru, ariko akenshi bikubiyemo imiti igabanya ububabare. Muri rusange, imiti yo mu bwoko bwa opiate ntiyemerwa. Igice kinini (96%) cy'umutwe ntabwo gishyira ubuzima mu kaga.\nHafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'abantu bakuru bagira ikibazo cy'umutwe mu mwaka runaka naho abagera kuri 4% bakagira ikibazo cy'umutwe mu gihe kirenze kimwe cya kabiri cy'iminsi mu kwezi. Kubabara umutwe cyane ni byo bikunze kugaragara cyane, bikagira ingaruka kuri 1.6\u00a0miliyari z'abantu (21.8% by'abaturage) hagakurikiraho umutwe ufata abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 848 (11.7%). Kubabara umutwe bikunze kugaragara cyane ku bantu bari hagati y'imyaka 25 na 40."}
{"id": "19700", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19700", "title": "ITARA", "text": "Ijambo \u201citara\u201d ni ijambo rikoreshwa cyane mu Kinyarwanda, cyane cyane mu bijyanye n\u2019urumuri n\u2019itumanaho ry\u2019amaso n\u2019amatara. Dore amakuru arambuye kuri iri jambo:\n\ud83d\udcdd Mu ncamake:.\n----ITARA:itara ni igikoresho gikoresha umuriro wamashanyarazi kidufasha kureba\nAKAMARO KITARA\n.ikara idufasha kureba mu mwijima\n.itara itanga urumuri\nAMOKO YAMATARA\n.amatara yimodoka\n.amatara yomurugo\nUKO TWAKORERA ISUKU AMATARA\n.kuyarinda kuyashira mumazi\n.kuyashira ahantu humutse\n.kuyahanaguraho umwanda"}
{"id": "19703", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19703", "title": "M. Enamul Hossain", "text": "M. Enamul Hossain (yavutse ku ya 6 Kamena 1969) ni umuhanga mu by'uburezi, umushakashatsi, n'umunyakwigira ukomoka mu gihugu cya Bangladesh, uzwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe mu bijyanye n'ubutunzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro, ibibazo by\u2019ibidukikije, n\u2019iterambere rirambye. Yabaye umwarimu muri Kaminuza ya King Fahd mu Ishami ry'Ubumenyi bwa Peteroli n'Ubucukuzi bw'Amabuye y\u2019Agaciro. \nuri Kare n\u2019Amashuri.\nM. Enamul Hossain yize impamyabumenyi ya mbere (BSc) mu gushushanya imashini (Mechanical Engineering) muri Kaminuza y\u2019Ubugenge n\u2019Ikoranabuhanga ya Bangladesh (BUET) mu 1995. Nyuma yaho, yakomereje mu masomo y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza (Master's) mu bijyanye n\u2019Ubukungu bw\u2019Ibikomoka kuri Peteroli n\u2019Imiterere y\u2019Ibutaka (Petroleum and Mineral Resources Engineering) binyuze mu bufatanye bwa BUET na Kaminuza ya Alberta, maze arangiza iyo degree mu 2001. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019ikirenga (PhD) mu by\u2019ubugenge burambye bw\u2019ibikomoka kuri Peteroli (Sustainable Petroleum Engineering) hamwe n\u2019impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya gatatu (MBA) muri Kaminuza ya Dalhousie, Canada, mu 2008 na 2009, bikurikirana.\nUmwuga.\nM. Enamul Hossain yakoze mu myanya itandukanye y\u2019ubuyobozi no mu burezi muri za kaminuza ku isi hose, harimo:\nYanakoreye kandi nka Professor Adjunct muri kaminuza nyinshi ku isi yose no mu nganda zitandukanye, aho yagize imyanya y'ubuyobozi muri Saudi Aramco, ONGE, Qatar Petroleum, Petronas, na ADNOC.\nImigabane mu Bushakashatsi.\nM. Enamul Hossain yakoze byinshi mu bijyanye n\u2019ingufu z\u2019ubumenyi zishyigikira iterambere rirambye n\u2019ubushakashatsi mu by'amavuta n\u2019ibikomoka kuri peteroli, by\u2019umwihariko binyuze mu gutangiza \"igitekerezo cyo kwibuka\" mu bikorwa by\u2019amavuta ya peteroli. Ubushakashatsi bwe bwashimwe ku rwego mpuzamahanga, bukaba bwarabonye inkunga irenga miliyoni 16.9 z\u2019amadolari y'Amerika itangwa n\u2019ibigo nka Statoil, Saudi Aramco, na NSERC.\nAfite patenti 11 zemewe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, zimwe muri zo zikaba ziri mu nzira yo gushyirwa ku isoko. Ibikorwa bye by\u2019ubushakashatsi birimo inyandiko z\u2019ubumenyi zirenga 200 hamwe n\u2019ibitabo 10, byanditswe bigashyirwa hanze n\u2019inzu zisohora ibitabo zikomeye nka Elsevier, Wiley, na Scrivener Publishing.\nUbwitange n'Ubuyobozi mu Burezi.\nM. Enamul Hossain ni we washinze Ishuri Mpuzamahanga rya NSRIC muri Toronto (NIST) n\u2019Ishuri Rikuru Mpuzamahanga rya NSRIC muri Toronto (NICT). Yashinzwe kandi Umuryango witwa Aziza Trust, umuryango utanga ubufasha washinzwe mu mwaka wa 2009, binyuze muri uyu muryango yashinze Umujyi w\u2019Uburezi wa NSRIC mu mujyi wa Chattogram, muri Bangladesh, utanga uburezi ku banyeshuri batishoboye.\nUbuzima Bwe bw\u2019Igiti.\nM. Enamul Hossain afite filozofiya y\u2019ubuzima bwite n\u2019iy\u2019umwuga ishingiye cyane ku ndangagaciro ziri mu mizi y\u2019umwuka. Ubushakashatsi bwe bwa siyansi ku kwibuka kwa peteroli bufite imizi mu gusobanura kwe Surah Al-Hashr, byamubereye isoko yo kuganisha ubushakashatsi n\u2019ibikorwa bye bya kaminuza.\nIbitabo n\u2019Impamyabumenyi-mpanuka.\nM. Enamul Hossain ni umwanditsi w\u2019ibitabo 10 ku bijyanye n'ubumenyi bw'ubucukuzi bwa peteroli n'ubumenyi burambye, birimo ibitabo by\u2019ingenzi bikunze gukoreshwa mu mashuri makuru. Afite impamyabumenyi-mpanuka 11 zemewe na Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika zijyanye n'imikorere irambye mu bucukuzi bwa peteroli.\nAmashakiro y\u2019Ibikorwa byatoranyijwe.\nIbitabo Byatoranijwe\nIngingo z\u2019ingenzi"}
{"id": "19704", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19704", "title": "Uburenganzira bwumwana", "text": "UBURENGANZIRA BW'UMWANA\nuburenganzira bwumwana ni nshingano za buri murezi wese yaba umwarimu,umuyobozi,umubyeyi agomba kumenya neza niba umwana uburenganzira bwe bukurikizwa muburyo ubwo ari bwo bwose.\nZIMWE MU NGERO ZUBURENGANZIRA BW'UMWANA NI:\n1,umwana agomba kwiga,bisobanuyeko umwana afite uburenganzira bwo kwiga guhera amashuri abanza kugeza arangije,kandi buri mubyeyi aba afite inshingano zo kumenya neza nimba umwana yiga neza.\n2,umwana afite uburenganzira bwo kurya,umwana agomba kurya bitewe nubushobozi bw'iwabo gusa umubyeyi akamenya neza nimba koko yabibonye.\nhari nizindi ngero zuburenganzira bwumwana \n.kuryama\n.gukina \nndetse nibindi byinshi.\numwana wese murwanda ashakirwa ubwishingizi bwo kwivuza hakurikijwe amategeko abigenga hano mu rwanda.\nkandi mugihe hagaragaye ahantu hatubahirizwa uburenganzira bw'umwana hakurikiranwa ni nzego zibishinzwe kandi zigahana abata bwubahiriza."}
