{"id": "19724", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19724", "title": "Imbunda", "text": "Imbunda ni ubwoko ubwo ari bwo bwose bw\u2019imbunda ikoresha ituritsa kandi igenewe gutwarwa no gukoreshwa n\u2019umuntu ku giti cye. Iri jambo rifite ibisobanuro byisumbuyeho biteganywa n\u2019amategeko mu bihugu bitandukanye\nIntwaro za mbere zatangiriye mu Bushinwa mu kinyejana cya 10, aho udutiyo tw\u2019ibyatsi (bamboo) twuzuyemo barutane (gunpowder) n\u2019amasasu dushyirwaga ku minyururu kugira ngo hakorwe intwaro yitwaga fire lance, ishoborwa gukoreshwa n\u2019umuntu umwe. Iyi ntwaro yakoreshejwe neza nk\u2019intwaro ikangura umwanzi mu ntambara yo kugota umujyi wa De\u2019an mu mwaka wa 1132.\nMu kinyejana cya 13, ibirindiro bya fire lance byasimbujwe udutiyo tw\u2019icyuma, maze bihinduka imbunda nto zifite umwobo w\u2019icyuma (hand cannon). Iyo ikoranabuhanga ryakwirakwiriye mu bihugu bya Aziya n\u2019u Burayi mu kinyejana cya 14.\nIntwaro za kera zakoresheje cyane cyane barutane (black powder) nk\u2019itwaro ituma amasasu asohoka, mu gihe intwaro za none zikoresha smokeless powder cyangwa ibindi bisasu biturika. Intwaro nyinshi za none (uretse imbunda zifite umwobo utariho umwobo uzunguruka nka smoothbore shotguns) zifite umwobo wihuta amasasu (rifled barrels) kugira ngo asohoke azengurutse, bikazamura uburyo aguruka neza mu kirere.\nIntwaro za none zishobora gusobanurwa hakurikijwe kalibiri (ni ukuvuga ubugari bw\u2019ahanyura isasu). Ku mapistole n\u2019imbunda ndende (rifles), ibi bipimwa muri milimetero cyangwa muri santimetero (nka 7.62mm cyangwa.308 in.). Ku mbunda za shotgun, hashyirwa mu byiciro hakurikijwe igipimo cy\u2019ubunini (gauge cyangwa bore, urugero: 12 ga. cyangwa.410 bore).\nIntwaro zinashobora gutandukanywa hakurikijwe ubwoko bw\u2019uburyo zikoreshwa (action type), urugero: imbunda ishyirwamo amasasu imbere (muzzleloader), ishyirwamo inyuma (breechloader), ifite uburyo bwa lever, bolt, pump, revolver, imbunda yikoresha igice (semi-automatic) cyangwa ikora yonyine (fully automatic). Nanone, hashobora gusobanurwa uko zitwarwa, yaba zifashwe n\u2019ukuboko (hand-held) cyangwa zishyizwe ku cyuma cyazifasha gukomeza kuguma ahantu hamwe (mechanical mounting).\nUbundi buryo bwo kuzigabanya bushobora gutanga amakuru ku bwoko bw\u2019inyundo n\u2019inyabyo (rifled barrel), uburebure bw\u2019iyo nyundo (nka 24 inches), uburyo bw\u2019ubumara (firing mechanism), urugero: matchlock, wheellock, flintlock, cyangwa percussion lock. Hashobora kandi kurebwa igikorwa intwaro yagenewe (nka hunting rifle), cyangwa izina ryamenyekanye cyane ry\u2019iyo ntwaro (Gatling gun).\nAbarasisha intwaro bayerekeza ku ntego zabo bakoresheje ubuhanga bwo guhuza amaso n\u2019amaboko (hand-eye coordination), bifashishije uburyo bwo kureba bwubatswe ku mbunda (iron sights) cyangwa ubundi buryo bw\u2019ikoranabuhanga (optical sights).\nImbunda nto (pistols) zisanzwe zifite intera y\u2019ukuri itarenza metero 100 (yardi 110 cyangwa metero 330). Imbunda ndende (rifles) zishobora kurasa neza kugeza kuri metero 500 (yardi 550 cyangwa metero 1,600) iyo hakoreshwejwe iron sights, cyangwa intera ndende kurushaho iyo hifashishijwe optical sights.\nImbunda zidasanzwe zagenewe abashinzwe kurasa kure cyane (sniper rifles) hamwe n\u2019imbunda zikoreshwa mu kwangiza ibikoresho bikomeye (anti-materiel rifles) zishobora kurasa neza ku ntera irenga metero 2,000 (yardi 2,200)."}
{"id": "19727", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19727", "title": "Gushya kwa Los Angeles", "text": "Gushya kwa Los Angeles.\nTariki 7/01/2025 nibwo inkonjyi iteye ubwoba yatatse agace gatuwe nabenshi Los Angeles,\nni mjuri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika iyi nkonjyi kuva yatangira yahise yangiza \nubutaka busaga kilometero 161.87 ndeste yangiza ibikorwa bisaga 12,300.\nubu muri uku kwa kabiri imaze kwangiza kilometero 57,000 ndeste yangije ibikorwa bisaga\n17,700.\nbivugwako yatewe n'amagambo yavuzwe nu mu MC wigitaramo cyari cyahuriyemo \nabaturage benshi hagamijwe gushimira abantu cyane cyane bavufashije bakakuba hafi mu \nmwaka wa 2024.\nuwo mu MC we rero yavuzeko ikintu cyamushimishije nuko Imana muba shimiwe \nntayagaragayemo icyo nicyo cyatumwe nyuma y'igihe gito hahita hatera inkonjyi \ny'umuriro itewe n'umuyaga mwinshi cyane.\nAbashinzwe ibyo kuzima umuriro bazwi nka fire fighters mu rurimi rw'icyongereza\nbari kugera geza gukora bashoboye kujyirango bahagarike uko gushya kuri kwiyongera \nbikabije. gusa hari ahakiri gushya mugihe bakiri kuzimya.\nIyi miriro yagize ingaruka zikomeye ku baturage.\nUduce twibasiwe n\u2019iyi miriro ni uturere twegeranye n\u2019amashyamba aho ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere\nry\u2019imijyi bihurira n\u2019ubutaka butarubakwaho, bikabituma byorohera cyane kwibasirwa n\u2019inkongi z\u2019imiriro.\nMu rwego rwo kugoboka abahuye n\u2019iki cyago, American Red Cross iri gutanga \nubufasha ndetse no gutuza abakuwe mu byabo. Niba warategetswe guhunga, \nhari amahirwe yo kubona ubufasha abigenewe.\nUburyo ibintu bihagaze buracyahindagurika, kuko hakomeje ibikorwa byo kuzimya \nimiriro no gufasha abaturage. Abaturage barasabwa gukomeza gukurikira amakuru y\u2019ingenzi \natangazwa n\u2019inzego zibishinzwe no kugendera ku mabwiriza y\u2019umutekano."}
{"id": "19728", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19728", "title": "Umurenge wa Nkungu", "text": "Umurenge wa Nkungu ni umwe mu mirenge 18 igize Akarere ka Rusizi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 4 n'imidugudu 40.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nkungu wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 696.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari n'imidugudu.\nUmurenge wa Nkungu ni umwe mu mirenge 18 y'Akarere ka Rusizi. Ugizwe n'utugari 4 n'imidugudu 40:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nkungu wari utuwe n'abaturage 20 697. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 696.\nUbuzima.\nUmurenge wa Nkungu ufite ikigo nderabuzima. Mu 2009, iki kigo nderabuzima nticyari gifite ibikoresho bihagije by'ubuvuzi.\nUbukungu n'ibidukikije.\nBamwe mu baturage ba Nkungu basoroma icyayi mu mirima ya Copth\u00e9 Shagasha.\nIshyirahamwe Zirarese Nkungu rikusanya amata y'aborozi mbere yo kuyagurisha. Mu 2018, Caritas ya Diyosezi Gatolika ya Cyangugu yaryubakiye inyubako ku bufatanye n'Urwego rw'Igihugu rw'Iterambere (RDB). Iyo nyubako ifite agaciro ka hafi miliyoni 17,5 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda. Abanyamuryango baryo biyemeje kurinda ishyamba rya Cyamudongo.\nIshyamba rya Cyamudongo ni igice gito cya Pariki ya Nyungwe. Ribamo impundu."}
{"id": "19729", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19729", "title": "Imibonano mpuzabitsina", "text": "Imibonano mpuzabitsina niyo miterere y'ibinyabuzima igena niba ibinyabuzima byororoka byimibonano mpuza bitsina Bitanga umukino w' Umugabo cyangwa w'umugore Mugihe cyimyororokere y'imibonano mpuzabitsina. Igitsina gabo nigitsina gore bikora zygote ikura ikabyara izungura imico kuri buri mubyeyi. Mubisanzwe, ibinyabuzima bitanga udukino duto, twinshi twimuka (intanga) byitwa \"igitsina gabo\", mugihe ibinyabuzima bitanga imikino nini, itagendanwa (selile) byitwa \"igitsina gore\"."}
