{"id": "19831", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19831", "title": "Indyoheshabirayi", "text": "Rutihunza inzarwe y'isayo\nIngurube zahanitse imirizo,\nRwa muturaga ku bijumba,\nNi igikoroto cyo mu bikoko.\n5. Igira ibikobokobo by'ubukombe,\nIkizihirwa isanga ibishanga,\nIkizimba aho inzarwe iganje\nIkahavurunga ijabo rikahava,\nIkahacundagura bitaravugwa\n10. Ikahavogereza ingurube nto,\nIkahatengagura cyane\nNgo iz'imicanda zihace,\nIkahacogoza ihaconshoma,\nIkahahindura amacamba.\n15. Ikahavura kuba isayo,\nIkaharyama humutse,\nWayibyutsa ntibyumve;\nWayikoraho uyegereye,\nIkagusigaho icyondo.\n20. Ikagukwiza icyagane;\nYakureba igitsure,\nUkirinda kuyicyura,\nAho ishakiye gutaha,\nUkayikurikira iyo nyumba.\n25. Ukayireba uko yateruye;\nUkayikunda mu ngendo,\nNtijorwe mu ibondo,\nUkirinda aho yaciye,\nKo hanuka bibi cyane.\n30. Wayireba itambuka,\nUkayirata kuba itungo\nWayikebukamo imihore,\nUkayihongera ibijumba.\nUko yatendeje izuru\n35. Ku iherezo ry'umutonzi,\nNi ko itengura ibivuvu;\nIyo rwarika-mavubi,\nIkabihoroba ikabihwanya,\nIkabivunja ikabivuruga.\n40. Aho isohokeye ngo urebe,\nUkayikeka kuba imvuzo,\nAri ukwuzuraho ivu.\nUbwo iteye mu nyambo,\nZ'Umutware w'Uruyange.\n45. Yinyuriye ku irembo,\nBikanga rwabwiga!\nIngeyo zose zirakubana,\nN'abashumba barabyuka,\nBarahamuka, barahuruza.\n50. Imyinjiro yo ikaba itanu:\nBayihimbyamo amakome!\nUbwo ibiruru birahanika,\nInzamururo zirahoga!\nUwarusazanye muri bo.\n55. Yirata kuyitsirika,\nAmagambo arayacurika,\nAyibwira amateshwa!\nNgo \"Umurizo urawushyire irya,\nNa yo amaso uyampange!\n60. Wikwigira hirya:\nGumya usange ibiraro!\nMu buryamo nihakonje,\nMu ijanja nihashyuhe!\nNtutinde mu igenda.\n65. Gira uguruke ay'intashya!\"\nAvugishwa ijoro ryose!\nNgo burakeye barareba\nIyo ntamati ibugarije:\nYegereye imyugariro.\n70. Iraharyama harazibama.\nBayitura izimano\nUmutware yohereje:\nIcyo gitebo cy'ibijumba,\nNgo ikirabukwe ku rukinga.\n75. Iragisanga igihugiraho,\nBuguruye ziraturuka!\nUmutware w'Uruyange\nYemera ko mu nyambo,\nZ'Umwami nyir\u2019 u Rwanda.\n80. Bayirabukira ibitebo\nBakayoboka ikabatwara."}
{"id": "19832", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19832", "title": "Amahunge", "text": "Amahunge cyangwa se amahungire ni umurima bahingamo ibijumba muburyo bw'ihariye, cyangwa se byabugenewe, aho habaga ari mu gisambu cynagwa se mu rwiri kuki amahungu akorwa ahantu hakomeye.\nAmahunge.\nAmahunge y'ibijumba cyangwa se amayogi ni intabire cyangwa se ubuhinge aho buba bwege hejuru, akaka ariho batera ibijumba, amateke cyangwa imyumbati cyangwase urutoki, akaba ariho babyitanga ibinyamayogi. "}
{"id": "19833", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19833", "title": "Amayogi", "text": "Amayogi ni ibikoresho bigaragara mu muco nyarwanda, aho akunzwe gukoresha mu birori, akaab akunzwe kwambabwa ku maguru. rero amayogi akaba bakaba bayacura bakoresheje umuvuba."}
{"id": "19834", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19834", "title": "Umugara w'intore", "text": "Umugara w'intore ni umwambaro intore z'abagabo zambara ku mutwe yabo, ukaba ukoze mu migwegwe, ukaba ari umwe mu mitako mwiza iranga uranga intore nyarwanda, ukiwubona uhita ubonaka ari intore.\nIntore.\nUbundi inyamaswa y'intare igira umugara, ariko nanone intore zimbyina imbyino z'erekeranye n'umuco nyarwanda nazo zingira ibikoresho byitwa umugara."}
{"id": "19835", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19835", "title": "Ingabo z'intore", "text": "Ingabo z'intore ni igikoresho gikoze mu giti cy'umuko kigaraga mu muco Nyarwanda, ingabo ikaba ari igikoresho gikunzwe gukoresha n'intore iyo ziri guhamiriza, Ingabo ikaba ifatwa mu ntoki, ikaba ari ikoreshwa mu kwikingira imyambi cyanngwa se icumu mu gihe uyifite ari kurungamba cyangwa se mu guhamiriza."}
{"id": "19836", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19836", "title": "Umuhamirizo", "text": "Umuhamirizo ni imbyino zigaragara mu muco nyarwanda, ikaba yaradutse ku ngoma y'umwami Kigeli IV Rwabugili, ni mu mwaka 1880, wari utangijwe n'umutwe w'ingabo witwa Inyaruguru, aho zawubyinaga nk'umudiho.\nUmuhamirizo.\nUmuhamirizo ni urukomatane cyangwa se uruhurirane cyangwa urusobekerane rw'intore aho ziba ziyerekana mu mwiyereko zateguye, aho ziba zakenyeye, zitwaje amacumu, imiheto ingabo zambaye bidasanzwe nkuko bigaragaza umuco nyarwanda."}
{"id": "19837", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19837", "title": "Ruharage", "text": "Ruharage ni ubundi ingoma zikoreshwa mu muhamirizo w'intore, aho iri zina rikomoka ku mparage, aho urwo ruhu rwabaga rukoze izo ngoma zo mu muco nyarwanda, gusa zabaga ubundi bibambishije uruhu rw'ihene. \nIngoma.\nUbundi ingoma zikoreshwa n'intore, ariho hakomoka inyito y'amagambo atandukanye arimo gutoza, gutora n'itorero, mu muco nyarwanda. "}
{"id": "19838", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19838", "title": "Umurishyo", "text": "Umurishyo ni igiti gito kiba kibaje kimeze nkagati gato aho gikoreshwa kugenda bagikubita ku ngoma, umurishyo akaba ari uduti tubiri tuba tureshya. \nUmurishyo.\nUmurishyo urimo amako menshi bitewe n'ingoma uba uraza gukoreshwa. "}
{"id": "19839", "revid": "120881", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19839", "title": "Charles kwizera", "text": "Kwizera charles yavutse 2007 yamenyekanye ku izina rya stage Drizzy charle, ni umusofitiweya developa w'umunyarwanda.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\ndrizzy yavutse mu 2007 i nyagatare, Intara y'Iburasirazuba nk'umwana wa gatandatu mu muryango w'abantu barindwi."}
{"id": "19840", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19840", "title": "Itorero", "text": "Itorero ni kimwe mu biranga umuco nyarwanda, rikaba ariryo ry'igirwagamo umuco nyarwanda, amateka y'ahatise. Mu itorero niho abakurambee bigishirizaga abato uko bakunda igihugu, kumasha, gukirana ndetse no nindi mikino cyarugamba.\nItorero.\nMu itorero niho bigiraga kugukita ingoma, kuba intore hakazamo ndetse nizindi ndagagaciro zirimo Gutora, Gutoza, Itorero. kandi bahigiraga guhamiriza n'ibindi byinshi byerekeye igihugu."}
{"id": "19841", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19841", "title": "Umukenyero", "text": "Umukenyero ni umwambaro wakera ugaragaza umuco nyarwanda ndetse no mukarere ugigaye ukoresha cyane, ubundi umukenyero wari mwambaro wa mbarwa n'abagore nkukko biri mu muco nyarwanda, gusa n'abagabo basigaye bayicyenyera.\nUmukenyero.\nUmukenyero watangiye gukoreshwa kera cyane mu Rwanda, cyane cyane ukambarwa n'abantu bakuze b'abacyecuru aho babaga bitabiriye ubukwe cyangwa se ibirori bigiye bitandukanye, ibirori by'umuco, kurya ubunnyano, kubatirisha abana. Umukenyero ukaba w'ambarwa ujyanye n'ikindi gitambaro cy'itwa umwitero."}
{"id": "19842", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19842", "title": "Umwitero", "text": "Umwitero ni umwe mu myambaro igize umushanana cyangwa se umukenyero, umwitero ukaba igitambaro umugore cyangwa umukobwa cyangwa se abana uretseko nabo n'abagabo basigaye bayambara bitera kigice cy'ohejuru nko mu gatuza cyangwa ku mabere, uturuka ku rutugu rumwe ugana hasi mu rucyenyerero kurundi ruhande. \nUmwitero.\nUmwitero ugendana n'umushanana, ukaba wambarwa hari ibiroro byabaye. umwitero ushobora kuba usa n'umukenyero gusa nano bishoboara kuba bidasa."}
{"id": "19843", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19843", "title": "Inigi", "text": "Inigi cyangwa se urunigi ni umutako abagore cyangwa se abakobwa bambara mu ijosi rukaba ryaragiye rukoresha kuva kera mu muco nyarwanda rwerekana ubwiza bw'urwambaye.\nInigi.\nUrunigi abakobwa cyangwa umugore bayambara muburyo bw'inshi ahantu henshi byose bikaba bifite n'ibisibanuro bitandukanye aha twavuga:"}
{"id": "19844", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19844", "title": "Icyansi", "text": "Icyansi ni kimwe mu bikoresho byakera bakoreshawa n'abakurambere bu Rwanda, ndetse cyarangaga umuco nyarwanda, aho icyansi cyari kimwe mu byakoreshwaga mu gukama cyangwa se mu gufata neza amata. icyansi cyabaga ari inkongoro yabazwaga mugiti cy'umusave cyangwa umukerenke n'isabo byakurwaga mu nzuzi zirega ibicuma zigaterekwa zikamara igihe zikabyazwamo icyansi cyo kubungabunga amata mumuco nyarwanda.\nMu muco nyarwanda, icyansi ni igikoresho cy\u2019umwimerere gikoreshwaga mu gukama amata avuye ku nka. By\u2019umwihariko, cyari kimwe mu bikoresho by\u2019ingenzi mu kubungabunga amata, kuzirinda umwanda, no kugaragaza agaciro k\u2019inka mu muryango.\nIcyansi.\nIcyansi kiraziririzwa ndetse niyo cya'menetse hari umvugo bakoresha, icyansi nti kimeneka ahubwo kirabyara, cyangwa kiraseka. "}
{"id": "19845", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19845", "title": "Igicuma", "text": "Igicuma ni igikoresho cya kera mu kinyrwanda ndetse cyerekana uko abanyarwanda bajyaga basangira bakagakoresha, haba umutobe cyangwa urwagwa cyangwa ikigage, agacuma baragahinga ka kera maze bakagasarura bakagatunganya ubundi bagatangira kugakoresha mu bikoresho bisazwe, bakogeshe amazi yonyine.\nIgicuma.\nIgucuma kugirango ubashe kuba wannya ikigage, umutobe cyangwa urwagwa rurimo bisabako ugomba gukoresha umuheha mutoya wabugenewe. "}
{"id": "19846", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19846", "title": "Umuhini", "text": "Umuhini ni igiti cyakoreshwa n'ubu gikoreshwa kuva kera mu bakurambere ubwo babaga bamaze gukora isekuru mu muvure mu giti cy'umuvure,nyuma bakoraga umuhini wabafashaga mugusekura ibintu bitandukanye bashyize mu isekuru. \nUmuhini.\nUmuhini ni igiti gifite uburerebure bungana burenga metero, ntabwo uba uremera uba woroshye, ahanini umuhini ukunze kuba ukoze mu giti cy'indakatsi, bidakuyeho ko n'ibindi biti wawukoramo."}
{"id": "19847", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19847", "title": "Umutemeri", "text": "Umutemeri ni kimwe mubice bugize agaseke, ukaba ari igice gipfundikira agaseke, sibyo gusa umutemeri ufasha muri byinshi byagiye bugaragara mu muco nyarwanda.\nUmutemeri.\nMubihe by'akera umutemeri wanjya ufasha mukubifashmo ibintu bitandukanye harimo nka rukacarara."}
{"id": "19848", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19848", "title": "Kagambage Alexandre", "text": "Kagambage Alexandre wamenyekanye cyane mu ndirimbo z\u2019ibirori by\u2019ubukwe, ni umwe mu bahanzi bafite ibigwi byihagazeho muri muzika nyarwanda, akaba yaracuranze mu matsinda atandukanye yo hambere arimo Les Unis, Super Alouette na Uruyanjye ariko nyuma yaje kwicurangira wenyine (solo).\nUsibye kuba yari umuhanzi, umucaranzi n\u2019umuririmbyi, Kagambage Alexandre yize amashuri y\u2019imyuga akaba yari azi gushushanya no kubaza.\nMbere yo gutangira gucuranga, Kagambage Alexandre n\u2019abavandimwe be barimo impanga ye Kagame Alexis na we wacurangaga na Ntaganira Fabien, baririmbaga muri korali ya paruwase y\u2019iwabo ku ivuko mu Murenge wa Runda mu Karere ka Kamonyi (Gitarama).\nNtaganira Fabien avuga ko murumuna we yari umuntu utuje cyane ku buryo ngo n\u2019iyo wamukoserezaga yakubazaga mu ijwi rituje cyane ati \u201cese ubitewe ni iki ?\u201d\nyitabye imana mu 2005."}
{"id": "19849", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19849", "title": "Urwabya", "text": "Urwabya ni igikoresho gakondo cya kera kigaragara mu muco nyarwanda, urwabya rukaba rukoze mu ibumba aho ruba rufite umunwa mu nini rumeze nki kibindi ariko bitandukanye mu mikoreshereze aho urwabya barutekamo gusa imboga. urwabya rutandukanye n'uruho, igikebano, urucyo n'ikibindi.\nIbindi.\nUrwabya rukunze kuba ari rutoya ugereranije n'ikibindi kandi rwose ruba rufite umunwa mu nini cyane kugirango ibyatekewemo babashe kubyarura."}
{"id": "19850", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19850", "title": "Ingasire", "text": "Ingasire ni ibiye rigendana n'urusyo, Ingasire ni ibuye umusyi afata mu ntoki ari gusya rikaba ari ubwoko bw'ibuye ryitwa isarabyayi, Ingasire ikaba ryaragiye rigaragara mu muco nyarwanda nkirifasha abanyarwanda mu mugusya ibinyameke bigiye bitandukanye harimo amasaka, amamera, ibigori n'ibindi bitandukanye. "}
{"id": "19851", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19851", "title": "Umuce", "text": "Umuce ni kimwe mu bikoresho by'umuco nyarwanda bya kera kuva mu bakurambere bu Rwanda, umuce ubundi bawita umusambi cyangwa se ikirago. Umuce ubundi ukoze mu rukaganga bumishije ubundi bakagenda bahambiriza umugwegwe nayo babanje gutunganya neza bayikubita, bakayumutsa ubindi ikoroha.\nIbindi.\nUmuce ubundi utandukanye n'umusambi ndetse nanone byobi bitandukanye ndetse n'ikirago, ariko nanone bigatandukana bigendanye naho bikoresha ndetse n'imikoreshereze."}
{"id": "19852", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19852", "title": "Nsanzabera Jean de Dieu", "text": "Nsanzabera Jean de Dieu ni umugabo w'umunyarwanda akaba ari inzobere mu muco nyarwanda, amateka yu Rwanda, umusizi w'umusaza, inzobere kabuhariwe, umurage n'ubuvanganzo nya Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nNsanzabera jean de Dieu ni umwe mubanditsi bagiye bandika ubitandunaye ku muco wa kera w'abanyarwanda, harimo ibitabo yanditse nk'icyitwa Umuco mu Buvanganzo, ndetse ubu akaba asigaye ari umunyamukuri kuri TV1 aho ayobora ikiganiro cyitwa muzehe quiz. \nIbitabo yanditse.\nNsanzabera Jean de Dieu yanditse ibitabo bitandukaye amaza kwandika ibitabo bigera kuri 56, ndetse harimo imivugo 250 n'ibindi bitandukanye."}
{"id": "19853", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19853", "title": "Umurage ndangamuco w'isi", "text": "Umurage ndangamuco w'isi ni gahunda y'isi yokumenyekanisha ibintu biyiriho ariko bikonzwe na unesco. umurage ndangamuco w'isi ubundi uginzwe n'ibintu bigiye bitandukanye bigize umuco w'ibigaragara, ibifatika n'ibidafatika mu buhanzi, ubugeni, umuco, imibereyo y'abantu mu bihugu bigiye bitandukanye mu myaka uko yagiye ikurikirana mu biragano by'abantu. \nMu Rwanda.\nMu murange ndangamuco w'isi harimo ibintu byinshi bigiye bitandunaye bikomoka mu Rwanda aha twavuga:"}
{"id": "19854", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19854", "title": "Intara", "text": "Intara ni kimwe mu bikoresho gakondo kuva kera mu muco Nyarwanda, aho cyabaga gikoze mu biti byitwa urubatura cyangwa se imigano, cyangwa se imikumbuguru. \nIntara.\nIntara ubundi ikoreshwa mu kazi kagiye gatandukanye aha twavuga nko mu kugosora imyaka igiye itandukanye cyangwa se gutunganya ibintu bigiye bitandukanye."}
{"id": "19855", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19855", "title": "Umujishi", "text": "Umujishi cyangwa se tujye mu mujishi ni igiti gikoreshwa mu ngobyi ya kinyarwanda,kikaba ari igiti gikunze kuvugwa cyangwa gukoresha mu muco nyarwanda bashaka kuvuga guheka umuntu urwaye.\nUmujishi.\nUmujishi mu ngombyi ubundi iba ari ibiri (2) igafata mu mpande ebyiri z'ingombyi, mu mujishi hajyamo abantu 4, babiri imbere n'ababiri inyuma. "}
{"id": "19856", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19856", "title": "Amakoma", "text": "Amakoma ni amasaka yose yeze akaba ariko akaba atinitse atari amakoma, Amakoma ashobora kubari amasaka y'umweru cynagwa se amasaka y'umutuku.\namakoma.\nAmakoma akoreshwa cyane mu muco nyarwanda, iyo bari gukora ishisho."}
{"id": "19857", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19857", "title": "Umusemburo", "text": "Umusemburo ni kimwe binyobwa biza mu muco nyarwanda, aho umusemburo aba ari ishisho. Umusemburo ukaba igizwe n'ibintu byinshi bitandukanye kugirango ufashe ikigange cyangwa urwagwa gushya neza."}
{"id": "19859", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19859", "title": "Umurage", "text": "Umurage ni ibintu byose birimo indirimbo, ibikoresho bitandukanye twasigiwe n'abakurambere mu muco nyarwanda tukajya tubigenderaho mu buzima bw'aminsi yose, twavuga ubuvanganzo, imwemerere, imitekerereza ndetse n'ibindi nki mikorere."}
{"id": "19860", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19860", "title": "Umuzinga", "text": "Umuzinga ni igikoresho cya kinyarwanda kuva kera aho kiba kiboshye nkimeze nk'igitebo ariko gifunze hose, nkikaba gifite gifite utwenge tubiri twitwa amaso, aho inzuki zisohokera cyangwa zikinjira. \nUmuzinga.\nUmuzinga ubundi bawumanika mu biti kugirango inzuki zize zinjyemo, ariko cyane cyane mu giti cy'umuvumu. umuzinga ukaba ukoze mu mu biti bitandukanye harimo umbatura, imbingo, imigano, umuhurura n'ibindi."}
{"id": "19861", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19861", "title": "Umutiba w'imyaka", "text": "Umutiba w'imyaka ni igikoresho cyo kuva kera mu muco nyarwanda banjyaga babikamo imyaka ku mwero wayo. Umutiba ukaba warabaga ukoze mu biti bitandukanye, harimo imbingo ndetse n'imbariro nyuma bakubaka bagashyiramo icyondo gusa bagasiga umwanya wokunyzamo imyaka bashaka guhunika no kuba bayikuramo."}
{"id": "19862", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19862", "title": "Ingata", "text": "Ingata ni igikoresho cya kera aho kiba gikoze mu byatsi cyangwa mu makoma yumwe cyangwa imihurura n'ibindi byatsi.\nGukoresha.\nIngata ni igikoresho kuva kera mu muco nyarwanda, ikaba ifasha cyangwa yarafashaga mu kwikorera ibitu ku mutwe, kurutugu ndetse no gushyigikira ikibindi, Umutiba w'imyaka."}
{"id": "19863", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19863", "title": "Manzi Josbert", "text": "Manzi Josbert (azwi muri muzika, Gutunganya no kuyobora amashusho y'indirimbo na filime, ni umu content creator azwi ku mazina nka Manzi Wijos) ni umuhanzi numu video Director w'umunyarwanda wavukiye mu Karere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y 'Amajyepfo, akaba ari umwana wa mbere mu muryango w'abantu batatu. Manzi Wijos ntakidasanzwe kubona yarakuze akunda umuziki no ku wutunganya no gukora imirimo ifite aho ihuriye nawo nibisanzwe kuri we kuko yakuze akunda kubyina, kuririmba no kureba TV cyane. Mu gihe abandi banyeshuri bibandaga mugukurikirana ayandi masomo asanzwe, we yakungaga gushushanya no kwandika indirimbo, kubyina, ndetse no kuririmba agakunda no gukoresha machine cyane\nyibanze m'umuziki kuwukora, kuwutunganya mu buryo bw'amashusho, gu creating ama contents, gukora ibiganiro nama filime aba aribyo akurikirana nku mwuga kuko nizo zari inzozi ze.\nAMASHAKIRO;"}
{"id": "19865", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19865", "title": "Cole palmer", "text": "cole palmer.\nChelsea\u2019s Cole Palmer ntiyagaragaye mu mukino wa Premier League wahuje Chelsea na Arsenal kubera uburwayi. \nYahuye n'ikibazo cy'impiswi, cyamugizeho ingaruka mu mukino aheruka gukina na Leicester City,\nkandi cyagarutse nyuma yo gukina igihe gito muri Conference League.\nIyi ntabsence ni igihombo gikomeye kuri Chelsea, kuko Palmer yari umwe mu bakinnyi b'ingenzi muri uyu mwaka, \naho yatsinze ibitego 14 mu mikino 28. Ariko, form ye yaragabanutse, \namaze imikino 10 adatsinda igitego ndetse yananirwaga gutsinda penaliti mu mukino batsinzemo Leicester.\nChelsea izasabwa guhindura uburyo bw\u2019imikinire kugira ngo ikemure ikibazo cyo kubura Palmer muri uyu mukino w'ingenzi."}
{"id": "19866", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19866", "title": "Football", "text": "FOOT BALL ni umukino dukina kugirango twishime kandi ni umukino ukinwa n'abantu 11 ari amakipe abiri ahanganye.\nURUGERO RWAMAKIPE AKINA FOOT BALL\nAMAKIPE ARI MURI PREMIER LEAGUE\nABAKINNYI BAKINIRA LIVERPOOL BARI TOP 5\nABAKINNYI BATANU BABA KIRE BAMBERE\nABAKINNYI BAFITE BARONDORE NYINSHI"}
{"id": "19867", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19867", "title": "Uruganda rwa cimerwa", "text": "URUGANDA RWA CIMERWA\nuru ni uruganda rukora sima(cima) nyarwanda rukayohereza mu mahanga ndetse no mu gihugu hagati ikindi kandi rukaba rutanga sima yizewe mu Rwanda hose.\nBIMWE MU BIHUGU CIMERWA YOHEREZA SIMA\n1,tanzania\n2,uganda\n3,kongo\n4,kenya\n5,south sudan."}
{"id": "19868", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19868", "title": "Kirazira z,umuco nyarwanda", "text": "Kuva nakera abanyarwanda hari ibyo baziririzaga,muri make ibyo batinyaga kuvuga cyangwa gukora kuko babaga baziko \nbizabagiraho ingaruka zitari nziza.\nZimwe muri kirazira z'umuco nyarwanda.\n-kirazira kwicara ku isekuru\n-kirazira kwicara ku ishyiga\n-kirazira ku umugore kuvuga izina rya sebukwe\n-kirazira ku umugore gukama inka ari mu imihango\n-kirazira kwicara ku umuvure\n-kirazira kurira mu uburiri\n-kirazira guterura umwishwya ntugire icyo umuha\n-kirazira gutera umuntu ingata\n-kirazira gutuka nyogosenge\n-kirazira guterura igisabo utari isugi\n-kirazira kurara mu muvure\n-kirazira ku icara ku urusyo\n-kirazira ku umukobwa kurunda ibishingwe munzu\n-kirazira kurya umuneke wikimane"}
{"id": "19869", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19869", "title": "Inganda", "text": "INGANDA\nAKAMARO KI INGANDA MU RWANDA\ninganda ni kimwe mu bikorwa remezo abantu batuye isi bakenera mu buzima bwabo bwa buri munsi.\nibyo twauga ku nganda ni byinshi harimo nko gukora imyambaro,gukora ibyob kurya biri nkumutsima,zidukorera\namasabune dukoresha iyo dusukura aho tuba,ibyob dukoresha nibindi byinshi.\nMuburyo bwo guteza imbere imibereho ya muntu dukwiye kuzamura inganda nyinshi duharanira kubaho neza,\nnkabanyarwanda ndetse nisi muri rusange,tuzamura ubukungu bwigihugu na baturarwanda bose."}
{"id": "19870", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19870", "title": "Indyoyuzuye", "text": "Mubuzima bwacu bwaburimunsi kugirango umuntu abeho nuko agomba gufata intungamubiri zose zuzuye umubiri wacu ukenera arizo dusanga mundyo yuzuye,none wakibaza ngo:ese indyo yuzuye iba imeze ite,ese yaba igizwe n'ayhe mafunguro nibyo tugiye kureba.\nAbantu benshi rero usanga batekerezako indyo yuzuye bisaba kuba ufite amafunguro menshi cyangwase bisaba igishoro kinini akaba arinayo mpamvu usanga bamwe nabamwe bavugako indyo yuzuye ariya bantu bakize gusa ariko nagirango mvuge ko uko ari ukwibeshya impamvu ni uko indyo yuzuye idasaba ibintu bihenze cyane cyangwa ngo ibe igenewe bamwe gusa ngo kubera aribo bafite ubushobozi.Bimwe mubigize indyo yuzuye twasangamo ibyiciro bitatu byingenzi aribyo ibi bikurikira,\n1.Ibyubaka umubiri.\nMundyo yuzuye tugiramo ibyubaka umubiri aho dusangamo intunga mubiri zubaka umubiri tukaba tuzisanga mumafunguro agiye atandukanye kandi yoroshye kubonnwa naburiwese urugero;amagi,soya,ibishyimbo,inyama,amafi ndetse nibindi bitandukanye.Mubyubaka umubiri dusangamo intungamubiri zikungahaye cyane kuri(protein) none wakibaza akamaro ka protein kumubiri wacu?\nIzi ntungamubiri (proteins) ziri mubif\nasha umubiri wacu mimikorere yawo yaburimunsi.Buri gice cy'umubiri wacu gikora proteyine ngo gikore neza,urugero;mu igogora(digestion), guhumeka(respiration) ni bindi ikora nka enzyme.Proteyine zongera ingufu n'ubushyuhe mumubiri mugihe ibinyamasukari byashize zikaba zifasha imikaya yacu mukongera kwisana nyuma yo gukomereka.\n2.Ibitera imbaraga.\nMubitera imbaraga dusangamo amafunguro akungahaye cyane kubinyamasukari ndetse navitamineB,C, Dna E.I biribwa dusangamo izi vitamine ni ibijumba,imyumbati,umuceri,ibirayi n'imbuto nynshi.Izi vitamine zose zifasha umubiri wacu gukora neza zigafasha no mwikoreshwa neza ry'ubwonko.\n3.Ibirinda indwara.\nM,undyo yuzuye kandi dusangamo ibirinda indwara aho dusangamo vitamine nyinshi zigiye zitandukanye harimo vitamineA,B1,B2,B3,B4,B5,B6,B7,B9,B12,C,D,K,naE.Izi vitamine tuzisanga mumboga nka dodo,amashu,karoti,n'imbuto zirimo avoka,inanasi,amtunda,imineke nibindi.Imboga n'imbuto ahanini tuzisangamo vitamineC,A,E,na K.Naho vitamine B ahanini tuzisanga mubikomoka kumatungo.Ibibyose biturinda indwara ziterwa no kubura vitamin.\nNingombwa rero ko buri muntu wese yita kumirire ye ndetse akagerageza gufata izi ntungamubiri zose kuko zose ari ingirakamaro kubuzima bwacu.\nAkamaro k'indyo yuzuye kubuzima bwacu.\n-Indyo yuzuye ituma umubiri wacu uhorana imbaraga kandi ukomeye.\n-Kongera ubudahangarwaa bw'umubiri wacu ndetse no guhashya indwara.\n-Kongera imikaya no gusana ingingo.\n-kuryanya indwara ahanini ziterwa n'imirire miboi.\nIbi byose nitura muka tubikurikije tugafata intunga mubiri zose uko bikwiye ntakabuza yuzagira ubuzima bwiza.\n Umwandutsi:IFASHUWACU Kevine"}
{"id": "19871", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19871", "title": "Amapantaro", "text": "Amapantaro ni imyambaro y'ibibero. ni imyenda yambarwa ku birenge, ikaba ifite ingufi cyangwa indende bitewe n'uko imeze.kandi ikaba yambarwa nabantu bose yaba abakobwa ndetse n'abahungu.\nAmapantaro y'ibitenge agezweho wadodesha.\n-Imyenda idoze mu bitenge,cyane cyane iy\u2019abakobwa n\u2019abadamu ntabwo ijya ipfa guhararukwa kuko uko iminsi ishira usanga hari moderi ziza zigezweho, ari nayo mpamvu tugiye kugaruka ku mapantaro adoze mu bitenge agezweho y\u2019abakobwa n\u2019abadamu.\n-Kuri ubu ugiye kudodesha ipantaro mu gitenge,wadodesha ipantaro ikwegereye kandi yicupa kuburyo iba iri kuri taye kandi ifite imifuka ibiri mu mpande.\n-Indi pantaro igezweho nayo iba ari icupa kandi iri kuri taye ariko hasi ikaba iteyeho akandi gatambaro k\u2019umupira gatuma iba ifunganye hasi.\n-Hari kandi moderi y\u2019ipantaro y\u2019injurugutu ariko itarekuye cyane,ahubwo ikaba ifashe uyambaye maze hasi ikaba irekuye buhoro kandi irimo rasitike.\n-Amapantaro adoze muri izi moderi niyo agezweho muri iyi minsi kuruta ayandi,nawe ubaye ukeneye kudodesha ntuzagire indi moderi ukoresha itari muri izi.\nImpamvu ari byiza kwambara amapantaro.\nBitewe n'imyemerere ya buri muntu, ahari ushobora kuba udakunda amapantaro niba uri igitsina gore. Bamwe bavugako umukobwa cyagwa umugore wambaye ipantaro aba ameze nk'umugabo. gusa tugiye kurebera hamwe ibyiza byo kuyambara ku bagore.\nAbakobwa cyangwa abagore bambara amapantaro kubera impamvu zabo bwite zihariye ariko zifite aho zihuriye n'ubuzima. Abandi bakambara amapantaro kubera kwigana no kureberanaho.Abakobwa batambara amapantaro abenshi bahura n'ingaruka zimwe na zimwe, dore ko hari aho bagera bakagirwa inama yo kwambara n'utwenda tw'imbere tubafashe. kwambara ipantaro ku gitsina gore ni byiza kubera ko bamwe mu bagabo n'abasore bubu nta muco bafite.\nKwambara ipantaro bishobora kukurinda ibisambo cyangwa bikakurinda gukoreshwa ingeso mbi mu gihe uri ahantu utizeye. Bamwe mu bagabo cyangwa abasore bakoresha ingano y'ikanzu cyangwa ijipo wambaye bagashimisha imitima yabo byakanya gato.\nAmafoto mabi ushobora gufatwa ashobora gukoreshwa nabi ku by'inyungu z'amafaranga bahabwa nyamara wowe ntaruhare wabigizemo. nubwo bimeze bityo, abagore cyangwa abakobwa bagirwa inama yo kutajya bambara amapantaro abaziritse cyane ku by'impamvu z'ubuzima nanone.\nEse wajya mu mikino ngorora mubiri cyangwa indi myitozo wambaye ikanzu? ntabwo byakunda, ni byiza gushaka ipantaro yabigenewe, ukajya ugorora umubiri wawe. Bamwe mu bagore batambara amapantaro ntanubwo bakora imyitozo ngororamubiri nyamara nayo ikenewe cyane."}
{"id": "19872", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19872", "title": "Inkono za kinyarwanda", "text": "INKONO ni ikintu gikoresha muguteka,kandi ni igikoresho cyo mugikoni. inkono ni isafuriya cyangwa igikoresho gikomeye gifite ubushobozi bwo gushyushya amazi cyangwa ibyo guteka..\ninkono n'igikoresho cya kera cyakoreshwaga mu guteka cyangwa mugushyushya amazi.inkono kandi n'igikoresho gitekwamo ibiryo byingeri zose harimo nk' ibitoki,isombe,ibirayi,ibishyimbo,ibijumba nibindi...,kandi ikindi inkono n'igikoresho gikozwe mu ibumba cyane cyane ikoreshwa m'ugikoni"}
{"id": "19873", "revid": "18637", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19873", "title": "Josh ishimwe", "text": "Joshua Ishimwe is a Rwandan student leader and public speaker serving as the Student Representative Council (SRC) President at the African Leadership College of Higher Education (ALCHE) in Mauritius. He is known for his work in student governance, youth leadership, and advocacy for student engagement and innovation."}
{"id": "19874", "revid": "123189", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19874", "title": "Rukara rwa bishingwe", "text": "Rukara Rwa Bishingwe ni Muntu Ki?\nRukara rwa Bishingwe ni mwene Bishingwe na Nyirakavumbi,yavukiye i Gahunga mu Ngoma y'u Burera,kuri ubu ni mu Murenge wa Gahunga mu Karere ka Burera aho bakunze kwita \"Gahunga k'Abarashi\".\nRukara yabayeho ku ngoma ya Yuhi V Musinga, umwami waba yarategetse u Rwanda hagati y'umwaka wa 1895 na 1931 hakurikijwe igenekereza ry'urutonde rw'Abami bategetse u Rwanda. Uyu Rukara rwa Bishingwe bivugwa ko atigeze ajya imbizi n'abazungu nkuko amateka abigaragaza. Abenshi bumva inkuru ya Rukara bakagirango ni umugani cyangwa igitekerezo, ariko ni inkuru mpamo kuko n'ubu Rukara afite benshi bamukomokaho bari bafite igisingizo cy'Ubutwari cy'Umuryango w'Abarashi, mu nzu y'Abarashi. Benshi muri aba ubu bakaba batuye mu Karere ka Burera mu murenge wa Gahunga ho mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru, aho bakunze kwita mu Gahunga k'Abarashi. \nEse koko Rukara rwa Bishingwe yishe umuzungu?\nImyaka ijana na cumi n'itanu (115) irashije Rukara rwa Bishingwe yishe umuzungu bapfa ko umuzungu w'umupadiri yari yivanze mubya Politiki n'imibereho y' Abanyarwanda nubwo bivugwa ko amwica atari yabigambiriye ahubwo byatewe n'umujinya umuzungu yari amuteye. Bivugwa ko Rukara yakundaga guhinyuza cyane kuko ni nabyo yapfaga n'umugabekazi Kanjogera nyina wa Musinga, kuko yigeze kumubwira ngo nta rubanza rwaciwe n'umugore. Uku guhinyura rero ni nabyo yapfuye na Padiri Loupias kuko uyu mu padiri bivugwa ko yateye imbago mu isambu y'Abarashi umuryango Rukara yakomokagamo ngo Kiliziya izahubake nuko Rukara arazirambura \nRukara rero yishe uyu Mupadiri yari agiye kumusobanurira impamvu yarimbuye imbago z'Abapadiri. Bamaze guhura umuzungu yasuhuje Rukara ngo \u2018Yambu\u2019 undi amwihanangiriza kutazongera kumusuhuza atyo kuko Rukara yavugaga ko yambu ari ukwamburwa abana.\nIbi Loupias yabifashe nk\u2019agasuzuguro, aba amukubise urushyi maze Rukara azabiranywa n\u2019uburakari aba yadukiye Padiri amuta ku munigo kugeza aheze umwuka."}
{"id": "19876", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19876", "title": "Nyiratunga", "text": "Umugabekazi Nyiratunga.\nNyiratunga yabanje gushakwa na Gihana Nyamihana umwana wa Cyilima Rujugira akaba umugabo bakaba bari batuye ku Muyange wera ibisabo mu Ruhango rwa Mutakara na Nangingare ubu niho hubatse ishuri rya Muyange!.\nNdabarasa rero umuvandimwe wa Gihana Nyamihana yimye ingoma ya se Cyilima Rujugira yimana irya Kigeli aba Kigeli Ndabarasa atanze nawe Sentabyo ahabwa uruharo ngo arwigize imbere yimana irya Mibambwe gusa ntiyatinda ku ngoma ku bw\u2019ubwiko bwa Gatarabuhura umuvandimwe we washakaga kumwaka ingoma. \nGatarabuhura umwe mu bazwiho mu mateka y\u2019u Rwanda kuba bararwaniye ubutegetsi.\nIzina rya Gatarabuhura riza mu mateka bwa mbere igihe cy\u2019iyimikwa ry\u2019umwami Mibambwe III Sentabyo, umwami wimikiwe hafi ya Muhazi ahitwa i Gasange (mu cyahoze ari Komini Giti ya (\u2026) \nMuri icyo gihe rero nibwo abiru bateguriye umuhiigo Mibambwe Sentabyo baca iraro kwa Nyiratunga bukeye Nyiratunga asama Gahindiro umwana rukumbi wa Mibambwe Sentabyo! \nUgenekereje isano, Mibambwe Sentabyo yari nk\u2019umwana wa Nyiratunga kuko Sentabyo ni uwa Kigeli Ndabarasa umuvandimwe wa Gihana Nyamihana umugabo wa Nyiratunga bakaba bene Cyilima Rujugira. \nNyuma y\u2019itanga rya Mibambwe Sentabyo azize ubushita himye uruhinja rwe na Nyiratunga arirwo Gahindiro ka Mibambwe rwimana irya Yuhi, ruba Yuhi Gahindiro."}
{"id": "19877", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19877", "title": "GIHANGA NGOMIJANA", "text": "Gihanga ngomijana.\nNi umwami wambere w'Urwanda wahanze ingoma y'urwanda wavukiye mu umubari (Ubu ni mukarere ka kayonza) Mu ntangiriro z\u2019ubutegetsi bwe, Gihanga nta ngoma yimanye, ahubwo yategekeshaga ibindi birango bibiri aribyo inyundo n\u2019ikindi gikoresho cy\u2019umuziki bita urusengo.Ibyo gushyiraho ingoma nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubwami ngo yaba yarabizaniwe n\u2019uwitwa Rubunga nawe abikopeye mu bucurabwenge bwakoreshwaga n\u2019abitwa Abarenge. Abarenge bari Abasinga, aribo bitwaga Abasangwabutaka(bivuga abo Abanyiginya basanze bategeka) ngo akaba ari bo bari mu gihugu mbere y\u2019uko iriya ngoma Nyiginya iza kurutegeka.Ingoma ya mbere yakoreshejwe n\u2019ubutegetsi bwa Gihanga yahawe izina rya Rwoga bituruka ku ijambo \u2019kwogera\u2019 cyangwa se \u2019kwamamara\u2019.\nAbagore Gihanga Yashakanye nabo.\nIkindi amateka garagaza, avuga ko Gihanga yagiye abyara abana batandukanye badahuje ba nyina kuko nawe yari afite abagore benshi nk'uko byari bisanzwe bimenyerewe mu Rwanda rwo ha mbere.\nUmugore wa mbere wa Gihanga ari uwitwa Nyamususa akaba umukobwa wa Jeni uturuka mu bwoko bw'Abarenge akaba yarabyaranye n'uyu mugore Kanyarwanda Gahima (Wamusimbuye ku Ngoma),\nKanyandorwa Sabugabo se wa Mushambo ukomokwaho n'ubwoko bw' Abashambo (Wabaye Umwami wo mu Ndorwa),\nNdetse n'uwitwa Kanyabugesera Mugondo se wa Muhondogo sekuruza w'ubwoko Abahondogo (Bategetse u Bugesera),\nNdetse na Nyirarucyaba umukuramberekazi w'ubwoko bw'Abacyaba (Bategekaga Ingoma y'u Bugara).\nGihanga yarongoye kandi Nyangobero ukomoka mu Bunyabungo (Intara ya Kivu y'Amajyepfo) barabyarana Kanyabungo Ngabo waje gutegeka mu Bunyabungo ndetse arongora na Nyirampirangwe babyarana Gashubi se wa Gashingo ukomokwaho n'abitwa Abashingo ndetse ngo babyarana n'undi mwana witwa Gafomo.\nGihanga yari afite undi mugore w'inshoreke witwaga Nyirarutsobe babyarana Rutsobe umukurambere w'abo mu bwoko bw'Abatsobe."}
{"id": "19878", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19878", "title": "Nyamulagira", "text": "Nyamulagira (Nyamuragira).\nNyamulagira ni ikirunga kinini giherereye mu gihugu cya DRC mu muri kivu y'amajyaruguru Hafi y'umujyi wa Goma kikaba kikibarirwa mu birunga bikiruka (ibyo bita Active Volcanoes) kikaba gifite Metero ibihumbi bitatu na mirongo itanu n'umunani z'ubutumburuke (3058 m) \nIgihe Giherukira Kuruka.\nkuwa 19.03.2025 \nAho Giherereye.\nMu birometero cumi na bitanu mu burengerazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Kivu (15Km) hafi y'umujyi wa Goma Uherereye Muntara ya Kivu y'Amajyaruguru,Mu Gihugu cya DRC "}
{"id": "19879", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19879", "title": "QUEEN NANNY", "text": "1,329 / 5,000\nQueen Nanny.\nUmugore w'umwirabura uzwiho kuyobora ingabo ari Umugore zitwa Marone zigatsinda ingabo z'Abongereza Umukecuru wa(c.1686-c.1760) bivugwa ko Nanny yavutse ahagana mu 1686, yayoboye ingabo z'abirabura bari barajyanywe mubucakara bitwaga Windward Maroons agatsida ingabo z'abongereza baba kolonizaga mu misoz ya Jamaica mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 18. Ku buyobozi bwa Nanny, Windward Maroons yarwanye intambara y'inyeshyamba irwanya nAbongereza, izwi ku izina rya mbere rya Maroon, yamaze imyaka myinshi. Umwamikazi Nanny' yavukiye muri Gana y'ubu, izwi ku izina rya Gold Coast. Inkuru zimwe zishimangira ko Nanny atigeze aba Umucakara, ariko birashoboka ko yahunze uburetwa nyuma gato yo kugera muri Jamayike.\nIbindi bizwi kuri Queen Nanny.\nNi ukuba yari afite imbaraga zidasanzwe, n'imitekerereze iri hejuru byamufashaga gutsinda Ingabo z'Abongereze Mu birwa bya Jamayica, \nKuba yaratsitse abongereza kugeza aho abasinyisha amasezerano y'amahoro mu \nubu Ifoto ya Queen nany igaragara ku inote (Amafranga) ya Jamaica Nk'Intwari yabo."}
{"id": "19880", "revid": "14993", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19880", "title": "UMURENGE WA NGARAMA", "text": "Umurenge wa ngarama n'umwe mumirenge igize akarere ka Gatsibo gaherereye mu ntara y' iburasirazuba ukaba uyoborwa nuwitwa NIYONZIZA FELICIEN.\nImiterere.\nUyu murenge ugizwe n'utugari 5 aritwo\nUyu murenge kandi ufite ibuye(urutare) nyaburanga abantu bakunze kuhatemberera bakahifotoreza kandi uru rutare amateka atubwira ko ariho umwami ruganzu ndori yahagaze akarasa umwambi ukava i ngarama ugasatura umusozi wanyagahanga hakavuka ubuvumo bita\" nyankokoma\".\nkururwo rutare kandi hariho ikirenge cyuwo mwami,amajanja y'imbwa ye ndetse nahandi hantu hadasanze ufata ibuye wakomangaho hakavuga nkingoma.\nInkomoko.\nhttps://www.gatsibo.gov.rw/\nRwanda Cultural Sites - iRwanda"}
{"id": "19881", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19881", "title": "GS Gaseke in gicumbi", "text": "Group Scolaire Gaseke.\nGS Gaseke ni ikigo kimwe mubigo bigize igihugu cy'u Rwanda giherereye mu karere ka Gicumbi, mu murenge wa Mutete, Akagari ka Gaseke,Umudugudu w'Irasaniro.Iki kigo kiri k'umuhanda Kigali -Gatuna mu gihe cy'iminota 30 uturutse muri gare ya Nyabugogo uba ugeze kuri iki kigo. Gs Gaseke ni ikigo kigisha neza kandi mungeri zose, gifite amashuri y'inshuke, amashuri abanza, na mashuri yisumbuye. mu amashuri yisumbuye gifite ishami rya MCE:(Mathematics, Computer science and Economics).\nIBINDI TWAMENYA KURI GS GASEKE\nGS Gaseke ni ikigo gikunda kwitabira amarushanwa nka, school business club competition, school business plan pitch competition and First Legal League competion(FLL) atangwa na REB n'abafatanyabikorwa bayo. GS Gaseke ni ikigo cyambere cyahawe murandasi(Internet) yihuta yo mu bwoko bwa starlink kiyihawe na TONY BLAIR, kandi bya cyongereye ubushobozi ubu kiri k'urwego rwo kwakira amahugurwa atandukanye abera mu akarere, gufasha abaturage n'ibindi bigo by'amashuri bigituriye gukoresha internet.ibi bikaba bituma cyarabaye ishuri ry'indashyikirwa(SCHOOL OF EXCELLENT)."}
{"id": "19882", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19882", "title": "Nyinawimana", "text": "Urwunge rw'amashuri rwa Nyinawimana ni ikigo giherereye mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru mu Karere ka Gicumbi Umurenge wa Nyamiyaga mu Kagari ka Kiziba. Kikaba gifite abanyeshuri bose hamwe barenga 2800 kikaba cyarashizwe mu 1960. Kilizi ya Nyinawimana)abanyeshuri basengeramo kikaba ari ikigo gitanga uburere bunoze kikaba gitsindisha k'urwego rwo hejuru kandi kikaba gifite n'ibyumba cy'abakobwa abagize ikibazo bafashirizwamo, ikindi gifite igikone batekeramo gifite isuku kandi kitegereye abanyeshuri ku buryo kitababangamira bigatuma biga neza bakanatsinda neza k'urwego rushimishije.\nGroupe Scolaire Nyinawimana.\nGroupe Scolaire Nyinawimana ni ikigo cy'amashuri giherereye mu Karere ka Gicumbi. Iyo bavuze Nyinawinana wumva Bikiramariya;ariko mu karere ka Gicumbi mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru hari umusozi witwa Nyinawimana hakaba ariho habarizwa iki kigo. Ariko padiri NDAYAMBAJE Ildophonse akavuga ko uyu musozi bakunda kuwita \" Mugisaninzu\" kubera ibicu bikunda kuba bihabuditse. Nyuma haje gushingwa paruwasi Nyinawimana tariki ya mbere ugushyingo 1960.Ubu rero iki kigo gifite ibyumba by'amashuri birenga mirongo itatu harererwamo abahungu n'abakobwa;Abanyehuri barenga ibihumbi bitatu ndetse n'abarimu barenga mirongo inani.Iki kigo gifite ibyiciro bitatu byamashuri aribyo amashuri y'inshuke (nursery),abanza primary ndetse n'ayisumbuye agabanyijemo ibyiciro bitatu aribyo indimi,amateka n'ubumenyi bw'isi. Cyashinzwe mu mwaka w'igihumbi kimwe magana kenda mirongo itandatu(1960).\nNi ishuri rya kiliziya Gatolika, rikaba ryararagijwe mutagatifu Fransisiko Xaverikikaba gifite umuyobozi witwa SEBAHIRE Deogratius ariwe deregiteri. Nyinawimana ni ikigo kinini cyane. Gihuriraho abayeshuri benshi, ikindi kandi iki kigo gikorana n'imishinga myinshi. Ari avs, cartas ndetse n'iyindi myinshi.Ikindi Kandi iyi mishinga ifasha abanyeshuri benshi bagatsinda bishimishije. Amakuru mashya ahari ubu nuko iki kigo kitakiyoborwa na SEBAHIRE ahubwo biravurwa ko derigiteri yahinduwe \nNyinawimana\nAmashakiro;"}
{"id": "19883", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19883", "title": "Imodoka zikoresha amashanyarazi", "text": "IMODOKA ZIKORESHA AMASHANYARAZI MU RWANDA\nMurwego rwo kugabanya imyuka ihumanya ikirere, mu Rwanda hasigaye hakoreshwa imodoka zikoresha amashanyarazi, nubwo bitaraba 100%.\nImodoka zikoresha amashanyarazi zirimo ubwoko bwinshi ariko harimo iyitwa CADILLAC LYRQ, iyi modoka ikoresha amashanyarazi 100%.\nImwe mumodoka zikoresha amashanyarazi."}
{"id": "19884", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19884", "title": "Umurenge wa Byumba", "text": "Umurenge wa Byumba ni umwe mu mirenge 21 igize Akarere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda. Muri uyu murenge harimo igice kinini cy'umujyi wa Byumba.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Byumba wari utuwe n'abaturage 43 134. Abaturage 19 270 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 23 864 batuye mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Byumba wari utuwe n'abaturage 36 401. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 43 134. Abagabo bari 20 372. Abagore bari 22 762.\nAbaturage 19 270 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 23 864 batuye mu cyaro. Imirenge myinshi y'Akarere ka Gicumbi ituwe n'abaturage bo mu cyaro gusa. Byumba, Kageyo na Rukomo ni yo mirenge ifite abaturage batuye mu mujyi.\nUmujyi wa Byumba.\nUmujyi wa Byumba witwa kandi umujyi wa Gicumbi. Igice kinini cyawo kiri mu Murenge wa Byumba. Ikindi gice kiri mu Murenge wa Kaniga. Byumba ni icyicaro cya Diyosezi Gatolika ya Byumba."}
{"id": "19885", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19885", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Gisozi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Gisozi ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali. Ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'abasaga ibihumbi 250 y'abazize jenocide yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. ruherereye ku musozi wa Gisozi,urwibutso rwa Kigali ni rumwe mu zubatswe ku ikubitiro nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi kuko mu 1994 aribwo umusozi wa Gisozi watoranyijwe ngo imibiri y\u2019abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi iharuhukire. Uru rwibutso ruherereye mu Murenge wa Gisozi, Akarere ka Gasabo. Uru rwibutso rwubatse mu rwego rwo gufasha abarokotse Jenoside n'abandi bantu bose kuzirikana ku mateka y'icyo gihe,no gukomeza kwigisha isi yose ku ngaruka zayo.\nNyuma y'ivugururwa ry'urwibutso rwo ku Gisozi Abanyarwanda barasabwa kurushaho kurusura.\nUbuyobozi bw\u2019urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali ruri ku Gisozi bufatanyije n\u2019inshuti zarwo, basabye abanyarwanda kutirara bareka gusura inzibutso za Jenoside, kubera urwitwazo ko baba barazisuye cyangwa ko ntaho babona ho kwibukira ku Gisozi.\nUmuryango mpuzamahanga wa Aegis Trust wita ku rwibutso rwo ku Gisozi, watangaje ko ibyumba byo kwigiramo ububi bwa Jenoside, ndetse n\u2019ikibanza cyo kwicaramo, kumva no kureba ibikorwa bijyanye no kwibuka (Amphitheatre), byamaze kubakwa.\n\u201cUru rwibutso ntirugomba guhagararira gusa ku kwerekana amateka, ahubwo twashatse ko ayo mateka [agomba kuba amateka y\u2019isi], yaba umusingi w\u2019ibihe byiza bizaza; niyo mpamvu hubatswe iyi \u2018amphitheatre\u2019, kuko iyo hazaga abantu barenze 1,000 baburaga aho bicara, bikaba ngombwa ko basimburana\u201d, nk\u2019uko umuyobozi wa Aegis Trust, Freddy Mutanguha yabitangaje.\n\u2018Amphitheatre\u2019 yo ku Gisozi (ikibanza kigizwe n\u2019intebe zubatswe n\u2019amabuye) ngo ishobora kwakira abantu bagera kuri 5,000 icyarimwe, bakareba, bakumva inyigisho, imikino n\u2019ibindi bagezwaho n\u2019abantu bari imbere yabo, mu gikono gikozwe mu byuma kihateretse.\nUrwibutso rwo ku Gisozi ngo rugiye kubakirwa kandi ikigo mpuzamahanga kibikwamo inyandiko zivuga kuri Jenoside zagiye ziba ku isi; ku buryo ngo abavuye mu bihugu bitandukanye bajya baza kuhigira amasomo yo gukumira Jenoside n\u2019ubundi bugome bukorerwa ikiremwamuntu, nk\u2019uko Mutangana yabisobanuye.\nMuri iki gihe abanyarwanda basura urwibutso rwo ku Gisozi ngo baragabanutse basigara batarenga 50% bavuye kuri 70% y\u2019abazaga mu myaka ibiri ishize; ibyo bigaterwa n\u2019uko benshi ngo biyumvisha ko basuye urwo rwibutso inshuro nyinshi, n\u2019ubwo Mutangana ngo atirengagiza ikibazo cy\u2019amikoro make kuri bamwe.\nAbadepite Mutesi Anita na Jean Marie Vianney Gatabazi bo mu ihuriro rigize inshuti z\u2019u rwibutso mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda, bamenyesha ko kwibuka bitazigera bireka gukorwa, bagasaba abanyarwanda kutirara no kutumva ko gusura urwibutso rimwe bihagije.\n\u201cAbanyarwanda bagomba guhora baza hano gusura urwibutso, bakumva impamvu Jenoside yabaye kugirango itazongera kubaho; uretse ko hari benshi bataranasobanukirwa uko Jenoside yabaye\u201d, Depite Mutesi.\nNyuma yo kubaka Amphitheatre ku Gisozi, abakozi ba banki za COGEBANKI na ACCESS baje kuhibukira, banatera inkunga izo nyubako zitararangira neza, aho Cogebanki yatanze ibihumbi 20 by\u2019amadolari, Acces itanga ibihumbi 10 by\u2019amadolari, yiyongera ku zindi nkunga izo banki zivuga ko zagiye zifashisha urwibutso rwo ku Gisozi."}
{"id": "19886", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19886", "title": "Diyoseze ya byumba", "text": "DIYOSEZE GATORIKA YA BYUMBA.\ndiyose gatolika ya byumba(mu kilatin: dioecesis byumbanus) ni agace ka kiliziya cyangwa diyoseze ya kiliziya gatorika ya roma mu rwnda. yashinzwe kuwa 5 ugushyingo 1981 na papa yohani pawulo wa II. iyi diyosezi ni imwe mu zigize akarere k' ubutumwa ka arrikidiyosezi ya kigali.\nurutonde rw' abasenyeri ba diyosezi gatolika ya byumba.\nDiyosezi gaturika ya byumba igizwe n' ibice byomowe kuri diyosezi ya ruhengeri na kibungo, ifite ubuso bugera kuri kilometero kare 5100, ikaba igizwe ahanini n' igice cy' amajyaruguru y' uburasirazuba bw' u rwanda.\nimbibi za diyosezi gatolika ya byumba.\ndiyosezi gatolika ya byumba ihana imbibi na tanzaniya mu burasirazuba n' u buganda mu majyaruguru, mu majyepfo y' uburengerazuba ihana imbibi na arikidiyosezi ya kigali naho mu burengerazuba igahana imbibi na diyosezi ya ruhengeri.\nparuwasi za diyosezi gaturika ya byumba.\nDiyoseze ya byumba"}
{"id": "19887", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19887", "title": "Rwanda Premier League", "text": "Dore amateka ya Shampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda (Rwanda Premier League):\n----Shampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019amateka yayo\nShampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda, izwi nka \"Rwanda Premier League\", yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1975. Igenzurwa n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umupira w\u2019Amaguru mu Rwanda (FERWAFA). Mu myaka yashize, iyi shampiyona yagize iterambere rikomeye, igaragaza impano nyinshi z\u2019abakinnyi b\u2019Abanyarwanda ndetse ikanagira uruhare mu guteza imbere umuco w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu gihugu.\nAmakipe yabaye ibigwi.\nHari amakipe yagaragaje ubudahangarwa muri iyi shampiyona:\nAbakinnyi b\u2019ibihe byose muri Shampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda.\nShampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda yakiniwe n\u2019abakinnyi bakomeye bagaragaje ubuhanga budasanzwe:\nAmakuru mashya.\nMu mwaka wa shampiyona wa 2023\u201324, APR FC yongereye ibigwi byayo yegukana igikombe cya 5 yikurikiranya, mbere y\u2019imikino itatu ngo shampiyona irangire. Ikipe yatsinze Kiyovu SC igitego 1-0, igitego cyatsinzwe na Gilbert Mugisha.\nNanone, ikipe ya Vision FC yakoze amateka yo kuzamuka muri shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere nyuma y\u2019imyaka 13 iri mu cyiciro cya kabiri. Ibi bigaragaza iterambere n\u2019ubukana shampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda igenda igira.\nShampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda ikomeje kuba urubuga rw\u2019ingenzi rwo kugaragaza impano z\u2019abakinnyi no guteza imbere umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda, ndetse n\u2019icyubahiro cy\u2019igihugu ku rwego rwa Afurika."}
{"id": "19888", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19888", "title": "Arnold Kabera", "text": "Arnold Kabera (yavutse mu 1989), uzwi ku izina ry'umuziki Sintex, ni umuririmbyi w'umuziki wa afro-dancehall ukomoka mu Rwanda, uzwi cyane kubera umusanzu we mu iterambere ry\u2019umuziki w\u2019igihugu. Ubuhanga bwe mu njyana ya dancehall bwamuhaye umwihariko mu muziki usanzwe wiganjemo hip hop, Afrobeat, na R&amp;B\nUbuzima Bwambere n\u2019Impamvu Yamuteye Gukunda Umuziki.\nSintex yatangiye gukunda umuziki akiri muto, akurikiza abahanzi bakomeye barimo Mowzey Radio, Chris Brown, Lucky Dube, na Christopher Martin. Yatangiye umwuga w\u2019umuziki mu buryo bw'umwuga mu 2012 nyuma yo kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye muri Uganda, aho yari azwi kandi nk\u2019umubyinnyi.\nUmwuga.\nIntangiriro n\u2019Iterambere.\nMu 2012, Sintex yakoze indirimbo ye ya mbere yise \"Akabazo\" muri Unlimited Records. Igihe cy\u2019ingenzi mu mwuga we cyabaye ubwo yahuraga n\u2019umutunganyirizamusiki w\u2019Umunya-Kenya Castello, wamuhuje n\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Ubudage Goethe Institute. Bamaze kubona impano ye, umuryango w\u2019Abadage wamuhaye ibikoresho byo muri studio, bimufasha gutangiza studio ye bwite. Ariko kuyicunga ntibyamukundiye, maze ayigurisha mu 2015.\nMu 2017, umwuga wa Sintex warushijeho gutera imbere ubwo yinjiraga muri Arthur Nation, ikigo gishinzwe gucunga abahanzi cyashinzwe na Umuvandimwe we, Arthur Nkusi, umunyarwenya akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru. Muri iyi sosiyete, yasohoye indirimbo zakunzwe zirimo \"You and I,\" \"Icyoroshye,\" \"Superstar,\" na \"Twifunze.\" Izi ndirimbo zamufashije kwagura abafana be no kubona ibitaramo bikomeye nka Iwacu Muzika na Kigali Jazz Junction.\nAlbum n\u2019Indirimbo.\nMu kwa gatatu 2020, Sintex yasohoye EP (Extended Play) yitwa \"My Vibes,\" igizwe n\u2019indirimbo esheshatu: \"Calculator,\" \"Jangolo,\" \"Love Story,\" \"Friday,\" \"Gahunda,\" na \"Midnight Call.\" Yakoranye n\u2019abatunganyirizamusiki batandukanye barimo Knox Beat, Papito, Ibalab, Bob Pro, Holybeat, na Danny Beats. Mu Ukwakira 2023, Sintex yasohoye album ye ya mbere yise \"Dedication,\" yayituye umugore we Shadia Keza barushinze muri Kanama 2023. Iyi album irimo indirimbo esheshatu: \"Dedication,\" \"Gladiator,\" \"Keza,\" \"Te Quiero,\" \"Cease Fire,\" na \"Street,\" zigaragaza urukundo n\u2019ukwizihirwa kwe. \nImpinduka mu Mwuga we.\nNyuma yo gushyingiranwa, Sintex yasezeye muri Arthur Nation Ltd maze ashinga inzu ye y\u2019umuziki yitwa \"Ak High Class.\" Yatangaje ko iyi mpinduka yakozwe mu bwumvikane kandi igamije iterambere rye bwite no kugera ku mahirwe mashya mu ruganda rw\u2019umuziki. \nbuzima Bwe Bwite.\nMuri Kanama 2023, Sintex yashakanye na Shadia Keza, umuhango wagize uruhare runini mu ndirimbo ze.\nUmusanzu n\u2019Icyo Avuze mu Muziki.\nUrugendo rwa Sintex kuva ku mwanyenga w\u2019imbyino kugera ku rwego rwo hejuru nk\u2019umuririmbyi wa afro-dancehall rugaragaza ubwitange, umuhate, n\u2019urukundo afitiye umuziki. Uburyo ahuza ubuzima bwe bwite n'ibihangano bye bikomeza gukundwa n'abakunzi b\u2019umuziki, bimufasha kugira umwanya ukomeye mu muziki w\u2019u Rwanda."}
{"id": "19889", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19889", "title": "Ikigo RCHC", "text": "Ikigo cyitwa RCHC cyangwa se mu kinyarwanda ni ikigo nyarwanda cy'ubuzima bushingiye ku muco kizwi nka RCHC mu mpine, aho cyatangiye kumugaragaro muri 2011. \nIkigo.\nIkigo nyarwanda cy'ubuzima bushingiye ku muco ni ikigo cy'ashinzwe na Rutangarwamaboko, akaba ari umugabo ukunda kuvuga ndetse no kwita ku muco nyarwanda."}
{"id": "19890", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19890", "title": "Umuziki gakondo", "text": "Umuziki gakondo ni uruhurirane rw'ibikoresho nyarwanda bibyara umuziki urwehoheye amatwi, hakaba hari ibikoresho bigiye bitandunkanye mu rwanda byakoreshwaga mu muziki gakodo wu Rwanda wa kera. \nIbikoresho.\nUmuziki wagiye ukoreshwa n'ibikoresho bimwe na bimwe twavuga wenda: icyembe, iningiri, umuduri, ingoma."}
{"id": "19891", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19891", "title": "Amahembe", "text": "Amahembe n'ibimwe mu bikoresho by'akoreshwaga mu muco wa kera mu muco nyarwanda, aho yakoreshwaga ibintu byinshi bigiye bitandukanye kuva kera cyane haba ibikoresho, bitandukanye mubuvuzi n'ibindi."}
{"id": "19893", "revid": "15026", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19893", "title": "INYAMA ZIKOMOKA KUMATUNGO", "text": "INYAMA ZIKOMOKA K'UMATUNGO\nInyama ni bimwe mubiribwa bikomoka kumatungo bidufasha mu kwita ku mibiri yacu no kwirinda indwara zitandukanye.\nAMOKO YINYAMA\nINYAMASWA ZIBA ZIFITE INYAMA Z'UMWERU \nINYAMASWA ZIBA Z'IFITE INYAMA Z'UMUTUKU\nAKAMARO K'INYAMA Z'UMWERU\nAKAMARO K'INYAMA Z'UMUTUKU\nIKINTU CYAKWEREKA KO INYAMA AR'IZI KURIBWA"}
{"id": "19894", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19894", "title": "Umucyeka", "text": "\"Umucyeka\" ni ijambo ry'ikinyarwanda rikoreshwa mu gusobanura umwotsi cyangwa igipimo cy'umwotsi gituruka ku bintu byaka cyangwa byaka umuriro.\nAkenshi, umucyeka ugaragara cyane igihe ibintu bitangiye gushya cyangwa gucana, urugero nka mu gihe bateka ku ziko cyangwa mu gihe hakoreshejwe ibikoresho byaka umuriro.\nMuri rusange, \"umucyeka\" usobanura ibirere byuzuye umwotsi wavuye mu bintu bitarashya neza cyangwa bifite ubushyuhe butari bwiza, akaba ari na bwo buryo bwo kugaragaza ahantu hari umwotsi cyangwa aho ibintu bitangiye gucana."}
{"id": "19895", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19895", "title": "Ubworozi mu Rwanda", "text": "Ubworozi mu Rwanda ni imwe mu mirimo y'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi igira uruhare runini mu bukungu bw'igihugu. Mu Rwanda, ubworozi bw'amatungo ni ingirakamaro mu gutanga ibiribwa, ndetse no guteza imbere ubukungu binyuze mu gukora imirimo itandukanye y'ubworozi. Ubworozi bw'amatungo mu Rwanda bukorwa ku rwego rwo hejuru, cyane cyane mu bworozi bw'inka, intama, ingurube, ndetse n'inkoko.\nUbworozi buboneka mu Rwanda.\nMu Rwanda, ubworozi buboneka butandukanye, kandi buri bworozi bufite umusaruro wihariye mu kuzamura ubukungu bw'igihugu. Dore ubworozi bukunze kuboneka mu Rwanda:\nAkamaro k'ubworozi mu Rwanda.\nUbworozi bufite akamaro kanini mu buzima bw'abantu, ubukungu bw'igihugu, ndetse n'iterambere ry'imiryango. Dore bimwe mu by'akamaro bworozi bufite:\n6. Iterambere Ryinganda Zikora ibikomoka ku Matungo:.\nUbworozi ni igice cy\u2019ingenzi mu iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu, kandi bufasha mu guteza imbere imibereho y\u2019abaturage mu buryo butandukanye."}
{"id": "19896", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19896", "title": "Umuco Gakondo w'u Rwanda", "text": "Umuco Gakondo w\u2019u Rwanda.\nUmuco gakondo w\u2019u Rwanda ushingiye ku bumwe bw\u2019abaturage, icyubahiro, n\u2019imigenzo y\u2019ubuvanganzo nyemvugo. \nAbanyarwanda bafite umurage ukomeye ushingiye ku mahoro, imbyino, umuziki, ubuvanganzo, n\u2019ubukorikori. \nDore bimwe mu bigize umuco gakondo w\u2019u Rwanda:"}
{"id": "19897", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19897", "title": "Ikoranabuhanga mu amashuri", "text": "Leta y'u Rwanda ikomeje gushyira imbaraga mu guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga mumashuri yose mu gihugu,aho iri gukora ibishoboka byose ngo ibigo byose byo murwanda ibigezemo interinete.Kugeza ubu mumashuri yo mucyaro ikorana buhanga riracyari ku ikigero cyohasi.Gusa ntitwakirengagizako bimwe mu ibigo byo murwanda byamaze gutangira gukoresha ikoranabuhanga.ubu murwanda iyigahunda ikorera mu bigo byo muturere twa Kirehe,Gicumbi,Gisagara,Gatsibo,karongi ndetse na Nyamagabe.\nIbikoresho byifashishwa mu ikoranabuhanga mu amashuri..\n-XO laptop:Ubu ni ubwoko bwi imashini abana bo mumashuri abanza \nbakoresha kugirango babashe kugira ubumenyi kuri mudasobwa.\nIyi mudasobwa irahendutse kuburyo byorohera buri kigo cy'amashuri kuzigondera.\nIzi mudasobwa zakozwe na NICHOLAS NEGROPENTE.\n-Tablet:ni ibiterefoni binini abanyeshuri bifashisha iyo bari kwiga imibare ndetse n'ikoranabuhanga.iyigahunda yo gukwirakwiza tablet mubigo by'amashuri byo murwanda iterwa inkunga numuryango witwa profuturo wo muri Espagne."}
{"id": "19898", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19898", "title": "Ifumbire mu rwanda", "text": "IFUMBIRE NIKI?\nInkomoko yifumbire.\nifumbire ikomoka ahantu henshi hatandukanye aho twavuga nko kubinyabuzima,nkimibiri yaboze iragenda ikavamo ifumbire kubimera,iklindi ifumbire ishora guturuka munganda ariyo bita ifumbire mvaruganda,aho niho inganda zikora amafumbire atandukanye muburyo bwo kongera imyinyu kubimera nu budahangarwa mu butaka.\nifumbire ikunzwe gukoreshwa kubimera bitandukanye hari iyikoreshwa batera,babagara imyaka,mubundi buryo ifumbire mvaruganda ikoreshwa nimuburyo bwo kongera umusaruro nokwihaza mubiribwa sibyo gusa ifumbire yakifashishwa mukongera umusaruro ku bahinzi bose kandi bavugurura ubutaka."}
{"id": "19899", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19899", "title": "Umuco W'ubutwari Mu Rwanda", "text": "Ubusobanuro bw'umuco.\nUmuco ni ibyo abantu bahuriraho kandi bemeranywaho; ni uburyo bwo gutekereza no gukora biha umuyoboro cyangwa umurongo imyitwarire y'umuntu cyangwa itsinda ry'abantu runaka;\n-Umuco ugenga inzego z'imibereho y'abantu, ubuhanzi n'ubukorikori,ukwemera n'ubwenge bwabo.\n-Umuco ukomatanya kandi ubumenyi bwose n'inyigisho umuntu agenda yunguka mu buzima bwe bwa muntu.\n-Umuco utandukanye na kamere muntu, umuco ntuvukanwa, umuco ni imyitwarire,imitekerereze,ubumenyi,imyemerere umuntu agenda ahererekanya n'abandi bitewe n'ahantu batuye, amateka yabo n'ibibakikije.\nUmuco niwo shingiro remezo ry'ubumwe bw'abenegihugu kuko bawusangiye, ukabaranga. Imibereho n'imibanire y'abantu igizwe n'ingingo nyinshi kandi zishobora gusobanurwa mmu buryo bwagutse; Abantu mumiryango yabo itandukanye babaho kandi bakabana ku buryo butandukanye bitewe n'imyemerere ndetse n'anategeko agenga umuryango wabo.\nUmuryango nyarwanda ufite indangagaciro na kirazira bigenga imibereho y'abawugize, bityo gusesengura umuco mu mibereho n'imibanire yabo, bikaba byibanda kuri izo ngingo ebyiri;\n-INDANGAGACIRO\nIndangagaciro ni Imyitwarire ihebuje igaragaza cyangwa se iranga abantu batuye igihugu iki n'iki kandi bakayifatiraho urugero. Ni ibikorwa bishingiye ku muco byemeranijweho n'abenegihugu, bifuza ko byahora bibaranga, bikanabitirirwa uko ibihe bigenda biha ibindi.\n-KIRAZIRA\nKirazira z'umuco w'u Rwanda ni imico cyangwa imyitwarire mibi umunyarwanda wese agomba kwirinda kandi akayirinda n'abandi, imiziririzo umunyarwanda yagendera kure kugira ngo akomeze kuba umuntu mu bandi. Kirazira ziyobora ubuzima bw'abantu, bagashishikarira iteka gukora icyiza, bikabafasha kutabangamirana.\nUbutwari.\nubutwari ni indangagaciro igaraga mu muco w'imiryango y'abantu itandukanye ituye ku isi. Mu myimvire yabatuye kwisi.Abantu benshi bafasheko risobanura risobanura Ubwitage n'ubutwari ku rugamba. Nta tandukaniro rinini n'imyumvire mu bihugu binyuranye aho ubutwari bwajyanaga no kwitanga rusha abandi ku rugamba.\nUbutwari ntibwafataga ibitsina byombi kimwe, Akenshi abagore ntibavugwaga kandi nabo hari ababaga barabaye intwari ndetse no ku rugamba. Mu Rwanda akenshi ubutwari bwagaragariraga cyanecyane mu bikorwa by'urugamba rwo kwagura no kurinda ubusugire bw'igihugu. \nMu mateka yavuba y'isi ubutwari bufatwa nko kwiyemeza gukora ikintu ugamije ineza y'abantu benshi, byaba ngombwa ukaba wabizira. Intwari ntizitinya gutanga ubuzima bwazo bitewe n'uko ziba zemera ukuri kandi zikaba ziteguye kugupfira bibaye ngombwa. Uwagaragaje ubutwari yitwa intwari, akaba umuntu ufasha abandi, akitanga by'ikirenga, atagamije inyungu cyangwa icyubahiro kivuye mu bikorwa bye.\nUmuco W'ubutwari.\nNiba umuco usobanura nk'ibyo abantu bahuriraho kandi bemeranywaho, uburyo bwo gutekereza no gukora biha umuyoboro cyanga umurongo imyitwarire y'umuntu cyanga istinda ry'abantu, Umuco w'ubutwari wasobanurwa nk'uburyo bwo gucukumbura ibikorwa bifitiye abntu benshi akamaro, bityo buri wese agaharanira gushyira imbere inyungu rusange aho kwikunda no kwireba ubwe gusa.\nUmucyo w'wubutwari ni amatwara meza abantu bumvikanaho, akabaranga mu buzima bwabo bwaburimunsi, akabaha icerekezo gihamye bagamije iterambererusange risigasiwe no gukunda igihugu bahuriyeho, kukirinda, kukirwanirira no kurenger ubuzugire bw'agagituye.\nMu Rwanda umuco w'ubutwari ugaragara mu bihe bitandukanye by'amateka y'igihugu. Amateka ya kera atwereka ko abanyarwanda bumvaga ko 'u Rwanda rutera rudaterwa' ibi biakaba byaragaragazaga icyizere bagirirana n'imbaraga n'ubutwari by'ingabo zabo.\nUmuco w'ubutwari ukwiye gufatwa nko kugira icyerekezo kimwe, buri wese agatanga umusanzu we atizigama ngo icyo cyerekezo kigerweho, nta gusigana, ugize intege nke agafashwa, intego abantu bihaye bakayigereraho kugihe kandi umurimo abantu berekejeho amaboko bakawunoza uko bishoboka kose. kwanga kurwanirira igihugu kubera gutinya urupfu byari igisebo kuwabikoze, ndetse bakanamucira umugani bagiea bati;'Wanga guha amaraso igihugu, imbwa zikayanywera ubusa'.\nIndangagaciro z'umuco w'ubutwari mu Rwanda.\n-Umuco w'ubutwari, iyo umutu abishyizeho umwete ashobora kuwitoza. Ubutwari buturuka muri ako kamenyero ko guhitamo icyiza ukanga ikibi, ukageraho wemera guhara amagara yawe aho gutwarwa n'ikibi. Intwari iba igamije burigihe guhindura imibereho y'umuryango w'abantu iwuganisha aheza."}
{"id": "19901", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19901", "title": "Umurenge wa Mutete", "text": "Umurenge wa Mutete ni umwe mu mirenge 21 igize Akarere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mutete wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 517. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nAkarere ka Gicumbi kagizwe n'imirenge 21. Umurenge wa Mutete ni umwe muri yo.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mutete wari utuwe n'abaturage 23 053. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 517. Abagabo bari 12 960. Abagore bari 14 557.\nAbaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19903", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19903", "title": "Amaraso", "text": "Amaraso ni amazi yo mu mubiri atembera mu mitsi, akagira uruhare rukomeye mu mikorere y\u2019umubiri. Akenshi agaragara afite ibara ritukura bitewe na hemoglobine iba mu uturemangingo dutukura tw'amaraso.\nAkamaro k'amaraso.\nAmaraso afite imirimo myinshi mu mubiri, harimo:\nAmatsinda y'amaraso.\nAmaraso ashyirwa mu matsinda hakurikijwe ibimenyetso biboneka ku turemangingo dutukura tw\u2019amaraso. Muri sisitemu ya ABO, hari amatsinda ane y\u2019ingenzi:\nHari kandi sisitemu ya Rh, igaragaza niba amaraso ari Rh positif cyangwa Rh n\u00e9gatif."}
{"id": "19906", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19906", "title": "Akarere ka rutsiro", "text": "Rutsiro ni akarere kashyizwe mu ntara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda. Ni akarere gatuwe n'abaturage benshi b'ingeri zitandukanye, kakaba gafite amateka akomeye ndetse n'ubuzima busanzwe bukomeje gutera imbere. Rutsiro ifite ibyiza by'ubutaka birimo imisozi n'ibiyaga byiza, bituma ari ahantu heza ho gusura. Uretse ibyiza by'ubutaka, Rutsiro izwi kandi ku kuba igice gikomeye mu buhinzi, aho abaturage bayo bakora ubuhinzi bw'ibinyomoro, ibirayi, imyumbati, n'ibindi.\nRutsiro ifite ibikorwa byinshi by'iterambere, harimo imishinga y'ubuhinzi no kongera umusaruro, ndetse n'uburezi butanga amahirwe ku bana b'aho. Hariho kandi ibikorwa bya leta n'abafatanyabikorwa batandukanye mu rwego rwo guteza imbere ubuzima, ibikorwa remezo, n'ubucuruzi mu karere.\nKugeza ubu, Rutsiro irimo kugenda iterambere ryihuse, kandi igira uruhare mu buryo bwagutse mu kwigisha abaturage uburyo bwo guhangana n'ibibazo by'ubuzima, kurwanya ubukene no guharanira impinduka mu buzima bwabo.\nIbiranga Ibidukikije n'Ubukungu bwa Rutsiro\nRutsiro ni akarere kagaragara mu ntara y'Iburengerazuba y'u Rwanda, kakaba gafite ibyiza by'ubutaka n'ibikorwa by'ubukungu bitandukanye. Bimwe mu biranga ibidukikije n'ubukungu bwa Rutsiro ni ibi bikurikira:\nMu ncamake, Rutsiro ni akarere gashyigikira iterambere ry'ubukungu, abakozi b'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi, ndetse n'ubukerarugendo. Ibi byose bigira uruhare mu iterambere rihamye rya Rutsiro, kakaba ari ahantu heza ho gutura no gukora ibikorwa bitandukanye by'ubukungu\nImiterere n'Ubushobozi bw'Ubuzima bwo mu Baturage.\nMu ncamake, ubuyobozi bwa Rutsiro bugaragaza imbaraga mu kubaka umutekano, gukemura ibibazo by'iterambere, ndetse no guteza imbere imibereho myiza y'abaturage. Ubuyobozi bukomeza kubakira ku miyoborere myiza no gushyira imbere gahunda z'iterambere mu buryo bwuzuzanya na politiki za Leta.\nAkarere ka Rutsiro ni ahantu heza hifitemo ibyiza byinshi by'ubutaka, ibidukikije, n'ubukungu butandukanye. Ifite imisozi ihanamye, ibiyaga bitangaje nka Kivu, ndetse n'ahantu nyaburanga hatanga amahirwe menshi y'ubukerarugendo. Abaturage ba Rutsiro bakora cyane ubuhinzi n'ubworozi, aho ibikorwa byo guhinga ibinyampeke, kawa, n'ibindi bihingwa bifite uruhare runini mu iterambere ry'akarere.\nUbuyobozi bwa Rutsiro bukora kugira ngo bubyaze umusaruro ibikorerwa mu karere, kandi bwita ku iterambere ry'imibereho myiza y'abaturage. Gahunda za Leta zijyanye n'uburezi, ubuzima, n'ibikorwaremezo zishyirwa mu bikorwa neza, bigatuma Rutsiro ikomeza gutera imbere mu buryo buhamye.\nMu buryo bw'imiyoborere, Rutsiro itanga icyerekezo cyo kugera ku ntego z'iterambere rirambye, aho ubuyobozi buharanira imiyoborere myiza, uburenganzira bw'abaturage, no guteza imbere imishinga y'iterambere. Ibi byose bituma Rutsiro iba ahantu heza ho gutura no gukora ibikorwa bitandukanye by'ubukungu, ikaba ari akarere kigaragara nk'ahazaza heza h'iterambere mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "19907", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19907", "title": "Umupira", "text": "AMATEKA Y'UMUPIRA MU RWANDA NO KU ISI\nAmateka y'umupira w'amaguru (soccer cyangwa football mu ndimi z'amahanga) aratangaje kandi afite ibice byinshi by'ingenzi mu mateka y'uyu mukino. Uyu mukino wakurikiye undi mukino witwa \"cuju\" wakinwaga mu Bushinwa, ndetse hari ibindi bimenyetso byerekana ko wari warakiniwe no mu bindi bihugu. Dore amwe mu mateka akomeye:\nUyu mukino umaze gukundwa mu bihugu bitandukanye, kugeza aho umuntu wese ashobora gukurikirana imikino kuri televiziyo, ndetse ibikombe by'isi na shampiyona bituma abantu bibanda ku mupira w\u2019amaguru mu buryo bwagutse.\nUMUPIRA WA MAGURU MU RWANDA\nAmateka y'umupira w'amaguru (football) mu Rwanda ni urugendo rw'ubuzima bwo gukura no guhinduka, kuva ku mukino w'abana n'ibikorwa by'abaturage kugeza ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Dore amwe mu mateka y'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda:\nUyu munsi, umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda umaze gukomera, ugaragaza impano, n'ubushake bwo gukomeza ku rwego mpuzamahanga, ndetse amakipe akomeye yo mu gihugu yitabira imikino yo ku rwego rw\u2019akarere n\u2019isi yose.\nAkamaro ku mupira wa maguru muRwanda\nUmupira w\u2019amaguru ufite akamaro kanini ku gihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda mu nzego zitandukanye. Ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu, umupira w\u2019amaguru si gusa umukino, ahubwo ni igikoresho cy\u2019imiyoborere, ubumwe, iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu, ndetse n\u2019ishoramari mu buzima bwa buri munsi. Dore bimwe mu byiza by\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ku Rwanda:\nMu by'ukuri, umupira w\u2019amaguru ni umukino ufite uruhare runini mu kubaka u Rwanda, mu guteza imbere abantu no kwereka isi ko igihugu cyacu gishoboye kandi cyashyize imbere ibikorwa by'ubufatanye, ubumwe, ndetse n\u2019iterambere.\numupira wa maguru mu muco nyarwanda\nUmupira w'amaguru ufite akamaro gakomeye mu muco Nyarwanda, aho ushyigikira ubumwe, ubufatanye, no kuganira mu buryo bworoshye. Mu Rwanda, umupira w'amaguru ntabwo ari umukino gusa, ahubwo ni igikoresho gikomeye cyo gukomeza kwimakaza umuco wo guhuriza hamwe abantu, no gushyira imbere ibyiza by'umuryango nyarwanda. Dore bimwe mu buryo umupira w\u2019amaguru ugaragara mu muco Nyarwanda:\n8. Gukora n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa.\nMu ncamake, umupira w\u2019amaguru mu muco nyarwanda ni urufunguzo mu guhuza abantu, kubaka igihugu gifite ubumwe, no guteza imbere imibereho myiza. Uyu mukino ugira uruhare mu gusigasira ibyiza byo mu muco w\u2019ubufatanye, kwihesha agaciro, no kugera ku ntego y\u2019ubuzima bwiza muri rusange."}
{"id": "19908", "revid": "15569", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19908", "title": "Ubukerarugendo mukarere ka nyagatare", "text": "Ubukerarugendo mukarere ka nyagatare.\nAkarere ka Nyagatare kari mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, kakaba gafite amahirwe menshi mu bukerarugendo kubera ibyiza nyaburanga n'amateka bifite. Mu rwego rwo guteza imbere ubukerarugendo, hatangijwe ibikorwa bitandukanye birimo gusura ahantu nyaburanga. \nMuhazi Yacu\nMu mwaka wa 2019, habaye inama nyunguranabitekerezo ku iterambere ry'ubukerarugendo mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, aho Nyagatare yagaragaje ko ifite ahantu henshi ho kwitabwaho hakabyazwa umusaruro mu rwego rw'ubukerarugendo. \nnyagatare.gov.rw\nNyagatare kandi ni umwe mu mijyi yunganira Kigali, aho mu myaka yashize hatashywe ibikorwa by'iterambere birimo imihanda ya kaburimbo n'ahandi hantu nyaburanga, bigamije guteza imbere ubukerarugendo. \nnyagatare.gov.rw\nMuri rusange, Akarere ka Nyagatare gafite byinshi byiza byo gutemberera, harimo ahantu nyaburanga, ibikorwa by'ubukerarugendo, ndetse n'umuco w'abaturage, byose bigamije gukurura ba mukerarugendo no guteza imbere ubukerarugendo mu karere."}
