{"id": "19915", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19915", "title": "Ubumwe bwaba nya rwanda", "text": "UBUMWE BWABANYARWANDA.\nUbwumvikane n'Ubumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda: Inzira yo Gukira Amateka no Kubaka Ejo Hazaza.\nUbumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda ni ikintu cy\u2019ingenzi cyane mu mibereho y\u2019abaturage b\u2019u Rwanda. U Rwanda rwanyuze mu bihe bikomeye, ariko nyuma y\u2019ibyo bihe by'amateka, ubumwe bw'abanyarwanda bwabaye urufunguzo rwo kubaka igihugu gishya cyiza, gikomeje gutera imbere. Ibi byose byatangiriye ku kwimakaza imiyoborere myiza, kurwanya amacakubiri, no guha agaciro umuco w\u2019ubumwe n\u2019ubwiyunge.\nAmateka y'Ubumwe bw'Abanyarwanda\nUbumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda bwatangiriye mu gihe cy\u2019amateka yagiye agira ingaruka zikomeye ku gihugu, zirimo urugomo, intambara, n'amacakubiri. Jenoside yo mu 1994 niyo yateye ishyano rikomeye mu gihugu, aho Abanyarwanda benshi bagiye bahura n\u2019ibibazo bikomeye byo gutakaza ababo no gusiga ibyiza byabo. Nyuma ya Jenoside, igihugu cyahuye n'ikibazo gikomeye cyo kongera guhuza abanyarwanda, gusana imitima yangiritse, no kubaka umubano w\u2019abaturage nyuma y\u2019ubwiyunge.\nInzira y\u2019Ubumwe\nNyuma ya Jenoside, leta y'u Rwanda yagiye ikora ibishoboka byose mu gushakira abanyarwanda uburyo bwo gusana ibikomere, gushyira imbere ubumwe, ndetse no kubaka igihugu gifite indangagaciro zikomeye zo guharanira amahoro n\u2019ubumwe. Gahunda ya \"Ubwiyunge\" yashyizweho hagamijwe gusubiza agaciro abacitse ku icumu rya Jenoside, ndetse no guhindura uburyo abantu batekerezaga ku byaha byakozwe. Ikintu cy\u2019ingenzi muri ubu buryo ni ugushyira imbere imyumvire ya \u201cu Rwanda ni igihugu kimwe\u201d aho abantu basabwe kubana mu mahoro no gushyira imbere ibyiza by\u2019ubumwe.\nIbikorwa by'Ubwiyunge\nUbwiyunge bwasaga nk\u2019inzira y\u2019agahinda n\u2019amarangamutima menshi. Ibi byashoboraga kuzamura ibibazo mu baturage, ariko leta y\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019amashyirahamwe akomeye yashyizeho gahunda z\u2019ubwiyunge, zigasaba abanyarwanda ko bemera ibibazo byashize, ko bagomba gukora ibikorwa byo gusana ubuzima bwabo no kubana mu buryo bufite icyerekezo cyiza. Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali na Ibiro by\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye byagize uruhare runini mu guhuza abantu, kuganira ku byahise, no gufasha abanyarwanda gukira imitima yabo.\nUbumwe mu Mico\nUbumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda buturuka mu mico gakondo y\u2019igihugu, aho abantu basangiraga ibyiza n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019umuco. Urugero, Imbyino za Kinyarwanda, Amateka y'imiyoborere ndetse n\u2019Imikino gakondo bigaragaza imbaraga zo guhuza abantu n\u2019ibyo bakunda byabo. Ibi byose bifasha abanyarwanda gukomeza kubaka igihugu gitera imbere, aho abantu bita ku mico yabo, ariko banaharanira ubumwe n'amahoro.\nInshingano ya buri Munyarwanda\nBuri munyarwanda afite inshingano yo kurwanya ivangura, gukomeza guharanira ubumwe, no gushyira mu bikorwa ingamba z\u2019iterambere rirambye. Ibi bituma ubumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda bukomeza kuba imbaraga nyamukuru z\u2019igihugu. Ibikorwa byo kubaka ibikorwa remezo, guteza imbere uburezi, ubuzima, n'ubukungu byose bigamije guhuza abanyarwanda no kubasubiza icyizere cy\u2019ejo hazaza heza.\nUbumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda ku Isi\nUbumwe bw\u2019abanyarwanda ntibwibanda gusa ku gihugu imbere, ahubwo no ku rwego mpuzamahanga, abanyarwanda babaye urufunguzo rw'ubumwe mu bihugu byinshi. Kuri uyu munsi, u Rwanda ni igihugu gikomeye ku rwego rw'isi, gifite ijambo mu bikorwa byo kubungabunga amahoro no gufasha ibihugu biri mu ntambara gukemura amakimbirane. Imyitwarire y'abanyarwanda, aho bashyira imbere ubumwe, guharanira amahoro, n\u2019ubufatanye, byabaye isomo rikomeye ku isi yose.\nIcyerekezo cy\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda\nUbumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda bugomba gukomeza kugira uruhare mu kubaka igihugu gitekanye, cyubahiriza uburenganzira bwa muntu, kandi kigamije iterambere rirambye. Buri munyarwanda agomba kugira uruhare mu gukomeza kubaka ubumwe, kurwanya icyatuma igihugu gikomeza kubona ibibazo, no guharanira iterambere ku nyungu z\u2019abaturage bose.\nUmwanzuro\nUbumwe bw\u2019abanyarwanda si ikintu gishobora kugerwaho mu gihe gito, ahubwo ni urugendo rukomeje, rufite intego yo gukira no gusana ibyahise. Iyo abantu bagize uruhare mu kubaka ubumwe, igihugu kiba cyiza, kizewe, kandi kigatera imbere. Ubumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda ni ishingiro ry\u2019amahoro, kandi ni igikoresho gikomeye mu kubaka ejo hazaza heza mu gihugu.\nIcyerekezo cy'Ubwiyunge mu Muryango Nyarwanda.\nUbumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda ni imbaraga zikomeye zishobora kubaka igihugu kiza. U Rwanda rwagiye rugira ibihe bikomeye, ariko ubu ni igihugu gikomeye mu karere no ku isi kubera guharanira ubumwe, amahoro, n'ubwiyunge. Mu bihe by'ahazaza, ubumwe bukomeza kuba ishingiro ry\u2019ubwiyunge ndetse n\u2019iterambere rirambye.\nByose biri ku murongo w\u2019ubufatanye, kwihanganirana, n\u2019iterambere rirambye, aho abantu bose bafite umutima wo kubaka igihugu kibereye buri wese, kikaba giteye imbere."}
{"id": "19916", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19916", "title": "Imizi yibimera", "text": "Imizi ni iki?\nimizi ni igice cyingenzi mu bice bigize ikimera kigafasha mu gukurura amazi ava mubutaka ajya mu bindi bice byikimera bityo bigatuma ikimera gikura neza,kituma bityo kigahora itoto ibibabi byacyo bihora bitoshye cyane.\nAkamaro kimizi kukimera.\nimizi ifasha ikimera mugutwara inungamuburi mu mbuto zacyoikimera kigakura neza kandi mu butaka dusagamo udukoko dushinzwe gutwara inungamubiri ziva mu butaka zijya mukimera ibyo bikorwa ni mizi y'ikimera,imizi igira amoko menshi aho twavuga imizi miremire ni mizi migufi,buri kimera kigira imizi bitewe nubwoko bwacyo cyangwa ubushobozi bwacyo hari nk'biti biba mumashyamba bigira imizi miremire ibyo biti bikunze kuba ahantu hihariye nko mubutayu kugirago bikurure amazi yo mubutaka.\nibindi bimera nk'ibijumba bikunze kugira imizi migufi kuko bikunze guterwa nafi y'isoko yamazi kugirango byere neza kandi kugihe kandi muri ibyo bimera twavuga;imyumbati,ibigori,ibishyimbo ibindi biterwa hafi y'isoko y'amazi nko kumigezi n'ibishanga."}
{"id": "19917", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19917", "title": "Ishema", "text": "1. Ishema ry'Abanyarwanda.\nIshyaka ry\u2019Abanyarwanda ririmo ishema rikomeye kubera:\n2. Umuco w\u2019Abanyarwanda.\nUmuco wa Rwanda ni umutuku, udasanzwe, kandi urambye:\n5. Inyandiko y'Ishusho.\n\"Abanyarwanda ni abanyamahoro, abanyarwanda ni abanyacyubahiro. Turi abanyarwanda, dusobanura ishema ryacu mu mico\"\", mu bumwe, no mu kwihangana.\""}
{"id": "19918", "revid": "15025", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19918", "title": "Uburakari", "text": "\"Uburakari\" ni ijambo ry'ikinyarwanda risobanura \"anger\" cyangwa \"uburakari\" mu Cyongereza. Ni uburyo umuntu yumva afite umujinya cyangwa atishimiye ikintu runaka. Uburakari bushobora kuvuka bitewe n'ibintu bitandukanye, nk'ibyakomerekeje umutima cyangwa ibitagenda neza.\nUburakari ni imwe mu myitwarire igomba kwitonderwa, kuko bushobora gutera ingaruka mbi mu mibanire n'abandi, bityo ni byiza kubufata neza no kubumenya kugira ngo umuntu abubashe kugenzura."}
{"id": "19919", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19919", "title": "Ururimi (kuvuga)", "text": "Amateka y\u2019ururimi rw'Ikinyarwanda ni umwihariko w\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019abanyarwanda, kuko urwo rurimi rwagiye rukoreshwa mu buzima bwa buri munsi kandi rufite agaciro gakomeye mu muco n\u2019amateka y\u2019igihugu. Ikinyarwanda ni ururimi rw'Abanyarwanda rwemewe n'amateka, kikaba kimwe mu ndimi z'ibanze mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda.\n1. Ikinyarwanda n'uburyo bw'ikivugwa:.\nIkinyarwanda ni ururimi rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019indimi z\u2019I-Bantu, bityo kikaba gifitanye isano n\u2019izindi ndimi zo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba nka Kiswahili, Kirundi, n'izindi. Ururimi rw'ikinyarwanda rufite ibintu bibiri by'ingenzi byihariye:\n2. Imiterere y\u2019Ururimi rw'Ikinyarwanda:.\nIkinyarwanda kigizwe n'inyito, imvugo n\u2019amagambo ashingiye ku migenzo ya kera. Hari ibintu byinshi bitandukanye bigize ururimi rw'ikinyarwanda harimo:\n3. Amahame y\u2019imvugo:.\nUrurimi rw'Ikinyarwanda rugira imiterere y'inyito, aho amagambo agira inkomoko mu kinyarwanda gisanzwe. Ururimi rw\u2019ikinyarwanda ni ururimi rutanga umuco ndetse rukubiyemo ubumenyi bw\u2019ikirere n\u2019aho u Rwanda rwavuye.\n4. Ikinyarwanda n\u2019amateka ya Politiki:.\nMu gihe cy\u2019amateka y'igihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda, ururimi rw\u2019ikinyarwanda rwagiye rukoreshwa nk'uburyo bwo gusakaza ubutumwa, cyane mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Nyuma ya Jenoside, gukoresha ikinyarwanda byahindutse ikimenyetso cyo kongera kubaka ubumwe bw'abanyarwanda. Ikinyarwanda cyahindutse ururimi rw'umwimerere rwerekana icyizere mu muryango.\n5. Ikinyarwanda mu Mico n'Imigenzo:.\nUrurimi rw'ikinyarwanda rukoreshwa cyane mu mico n'imigenzo y\u2019Abanyarwanda. Ni ururimi rukoresha ibimenyetso, ibitwenge, ibivugo, ndetse n'imigani ya kera kugira ngo umuco wabo wiyongere kandi urusheho gusakara. Indirimbo, imihango y'ubukwe, n'ubundi busabane byose bikunze kugenda bibumbatiye ururimi rw\u2019ikinyarwanda nk'igikoresho cy\u2019imvugo.\n6. Ikibazo cy'ururimi mu bihugu bituranyi:.\nNubwo ururimi rw\u2019Ikirarwanda ari rufite imvugo yihariye, rufite isano kandi n\u2019ururimi rw'Ikinyarwanda. Gukoresha ikinyarwanda mu gihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda, Kirundi mu Burundi ndetse no mu mashuri byagize ingaruka nziza ku buryo bwo kumva ibijyanye n\u2019ibisobanuro n\u2019amateka.\n7. Inzira zo Kubungabunga Ikinyarwanda:.\nMu Rwanda, harimo gahunda yo kubungabunga ururimi rw'Ikinyarwanda. Ubu ururimi rw\u2019Ikinyarwanda rwigishwa mu mashuri ndetse rukaba rukoreshwa mu buryo bwemewe mu itangazamakuru ndetse n'ibikorwa bya leta. Gusa, hari ikibazo cy'ihinduka ry\u2019ururimi mu gihe cyagiye kigaragara cyane mu bihugu bitandukanye.\nIkinyarwanda ni ururimi rw\u2019agaciro gakomeye mu muco, mu mibanire ndetse no mu bigo by'amashuri muri Rwanda."}
{"id": "19920", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19920", "title": "Amateka y'ururimi rw'ikinyarwanda", "text": "Amateka y\u2019ururimi rw'ikinyarwanda ni umwihariko w\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019abanyarwanda, kuko urwo rurimi rwagiye rukoreshwa mu buzima bwa buri munsi kandi rufite agaciro gakomeye mu muco n\u2019amateka y\u2019igihugu. Ikinyarwanda ni ururimi rw'Abanyarwanda rwemewe n'amateka, kikaba kimwe mu ndimi z'ibanze mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda.\n1. Ikinyarwanda n'uburyo bw'ikivugwa:.\nIkinyarwanda ni ururimi rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019indimi z\u2019I-Bantu, bityo kikaba gifitanye isano n\u2019izindi ndimi zo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba nka Kiswahili, Kirundi, n'izindi. Ururimi rw'ikinyarwanda rufite ibintu bibiri by'ingenzi byihariye:\n2. Imiterere y\u2019Ururimi rw'Ikinyarwanda:.\nIkinyarwanda kigizwe n'inyito, imvugo n\u2019amagambo ashingiye ku migenzo ya kera. Hari ibintu byinshi bitandukanye bigize ururimi rw'ikinyarwanda harimo:\n3. Amahame y\u2019imvugo:.\nUrurimi rw'Ikinyarwanda rugira imiterere y'inyito, aho amagambo agira inkomoko mu kinyarwanda gisanzwe. Ururimi rw\u2019ikinyarwanda ni ururimi rutanga umuco ndetse rukubiyemo ubumenyi bw\u2019ikirere n\u2019aho u Rwanda rwavuye.\n4. Ikinyarwanda n\u2019amateka ya Politiki:.\nMu gihe cy\u2019amateka y'igihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda, ururimi rw\u2019ikinyarwanda rwagiye rukoreshwa nk'uburyo bwo gusakaza ubutumwa, cyane mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Nyuma ya Jenoside, gukoresha ikinyarwanda byahindutse ikimenyetso cyo kongera kubaka ubumwe bw'abanyarwanda. Ikinyarwanda cyahindutse ururimi rw'umwimerere rwerekana icyizere mu muryango.\n5. Ikinyarwanda mu Mico n'Imigenzo:.\nUrurimi rw'ikinyarwanda rukoreshwa cyane mu mico n'imigenzo y\u2019Abanyarwanda. Ni ururimi rukoresha ibimenyetso, ibitwenge, ibivugo, ndetse n'imigani ya kera kugira ngo umuco wabo wiyongere kandi urusheho gusakara. Indirimbo, imihango y'ubukwe, n'ubundi busabane byose bikunze kugenda bibumbatiye ururimi 