{"id": "19921", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19921", "title": "Ibikorwa remezo mu karere ka nyagatare", "text": "Akarere ka Nyagatare mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba kagiye kagaragaza iterambere mu bikorwa remezo mu myaka yashize. Muri byo, hatashywe Stade y'Akarere ka Nyagatare ifite agaciro ka miliyari hafi 10 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda, ikaba ifite ibibuga bitandukanye birimo umupira w'amaguru, volleyball, basketball, tennis, n'ahabera imikino ngororamubiri. \nMu rwego rw'imihanda, hubatswe umuhanda wa Rukomo-Nyagatare ureshya na kilometero 73, watwaye miliyoni 73.5 z'amadorali ya Amerika.\nByongeye kandi, ibikorwa byo kubaka ibiraro birimo icya Mirama-Rurenge, cyatwaye miliyoni 360 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda, bigamije koroshya ubuhahirane mu karere. \nMu rwego rw'uburezi, hubatswe ibiro bishya by'Akagari ka Bwera bifite ibyumba bitanu byo gukoreramo n'ibyumba bibiri binini bya salle z'inama, bigamije kunoza serivisi z'ubuyobozi no korohereza abaturage. \nUbuyobozi bw'Akarere buvuga ko ibikorwa remezo byabaye imbarutso y'iterambere, kandi busaba abaturage kubyaza umusaruro ibyo bikorwa no kubungabunga ibyagezweho. \nMu rwego rwo gukomeza guteza imbere ibikorwa remezo, umuyobozi w'Akarere yasabye abaturage kugira uruhare mu kubungabunga ibi bikorwa no kubibyaza umusaruro, kugira ngo bifashe mu kwihutisha iterambere ry'akarere."}
{"id": "19922", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19922", "title": "Parike ya nyungwe", "text": "Pariki ya Nyungwe ni imwe muri pariki zikomeye kandi z'ingenzi mu Rwanda, ikaba izwi cyane cyane kubera ubwiza bw'urusobe bw'ibinyabuzima(inyamaswa n'ibimera) biyibonekamo.\nAmakuru arambuye kuri pariki y'igihugu ya Nyungwe:\nPariki y'igihugu ya Nyungwe iherereye mu ntara y Uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda,mu turere twa Rusizi,Nyamasheke, Karongi, no mu ntara y'amajyepfo mu turere twa Nyaruguru na Nyamagabe. Iyi pariki kandi ihana urubibi na pariki ya Kibira yo mu gihugu cy'Uburundi. Pariki y'igihugu ya Nyungwe ifite ubuso bugera kuri kirometero kare igihumbi na makumyabiri (1,020 km\u00b2)\nUrusobe rw'ibinyabuzima dusanga muri Pariki ya Nyungwe"}
{"id": "19923", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19923", "title": "Umurenge wa Kageyo (Gicumbi)", "text": "Umurenge wa Kageyo ni umwe mu mirenge 21 igize Akarere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kageyo wari utuwe n'abaturage 20 888.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Kageyo ni umwe mu mirenge 21 y'Akarere ka Gicumbi. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kageyo wari utuwe n'abaturage 30 270. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 20 888. Abagabo bari 9 887. Abagore bari 11 001. Abaturage 6 646 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 14 242 batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19924", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19924", "title": "Umurenge wa Kabare", "text": "Umurenge wa Kabare ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kabare wari utuwe n'abaturage 40 228.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Kabare ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Kayonza. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 110,7.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kabare wari utuwe n'abaturage 34 460. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 40 228. Abagabo bari 19 336. Abagore bari 20 892. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19926", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19926", "title": "IBIKORWA REMEZO MU KARERE KA RULINDO", "text": "IBIKORWA REMEZO MU KARERE KA RULINDO\nRulindo: Hatashywe ibikorwa remezo byatwaye miliyoni zirenga 730 Frw mu kwishimira Kwibohora.\nYanditswe na ISHIMWEngabo victory\nKuya 4 July 2022 saa 08:07\nMu bikorwa remezo bishimira harimo Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Cyinzuzi kiri mu Murenge wa Cyinzuzi wari usigaye mu Karere utagira ikigo nderabuzima. Cyatwaye 495 802 359 Frw, kikazajya cyakira abaturage barenga 24900 bo mu Mirenge ya Cyinzuzi, Ntarabana na Masoro.\nHari n\u2019ibiraro bibiri byo mu kirere birimo ikiri ku mugezi wa Rusine gihuza Imirenge ya Ntarabana na Masoro, n\u2019ikiri ku Mugezi wa Gisagayandi gihuza Imirenge ya Rukozo muri Rulindo na Miyove muri Gicumbi. Byatwaye agera kuri miliyoni 240 Frw.\nIbi biraro bije gukemura ibibazo by\u2019uko mu gihe cy\u2019imvura iyo migezi yuzuraga igatuma abanyeshuri basiba amasomo, abandi bakarara badatashye kubera kubura aho banyura cyangwa bagataha bakerewe, n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019imigenderanire y\u2019iyo mirenge.\nBamwe mu batuye miri iyo mirenge yahawe ibikorwa remezo, bavuga ko bari babinyotewe kandi bigiye kubafasha mu kwihutisha iterambere ry\u2019imibereho yabo.\nMutuyimana Marie Chantal, Umujyanama w\u2019Ubuzima mu Mudugudu wa Kavumu yagize ati \"Ubundi mbere igihe twakeneraga kwivuza byadusabaga gutega moto ya 3000 Frw ijya i Remera, urumva no kugaruka byasabaga 6000 Frw.\"\n\"Byagiye bitugiraho ingaruka kuko wasangaga hari ababyeyi babyarira mu nzira, ndetse mbere hari n\u2019ababyaraga abana bapfuye. Hari n\u2019abantu biganyiraga kujya kwa muganga ugasanga barembeye mu ngo. Ubu hano ni hafi, na nijoro umuntu yakwizana n\u2019amaguru. Turashimira Leta n\u2019abayobozi bacu batwitayeho, kuko ubu tugiye kwibohora tumeze neza nta kibazo cy\u2019ubuzima dufite.\"\nNshimyumuremyi Christophe we yagize ati \"Turabatumye mudutumikire mutubwirire Umubyeyi wacu Perezida Paul Kagame muti \u2019Kisaro waratubohoye, uduha umutekano, uduha iterambere turagushimiye n\u2019ingabo uyoboye n\u2019abayobozi mukorana. Tukuri inyuma ntituzatenguka ubu twambariye urugamba rwo kwiteza imbere dufatanyije\u2019.\"\nUmuyobozi w\u2019Akarere ka Rulindo, Mukanyirigira Judith, yasabye abaturage gukoresha neza ibikorwa remezo bahawe no gukunda umurimo.\nYagize ati \"Ibi byose mwahawe ni urukundo Umukuru w\u2019Igihugu abakunda kandi ahora abifuriza ubuzima bwiza n\u2019iterambere. Ni ahanyu rero kubifata neza no kubibyaza umusaruro kugira ngo tumushimire ibyaza yaduhaye.\"\nYanabashishikarije gutanga umusanzu mu kwivuza ku gihe, gukora bakiteza imbere no gukomeza ubufatanye mu kubungabunga umutekano kuko ari byo nzira yo kwibohora nyakuri.\nBuri mwaka u Rwanda rwizihiza umunsi mukuru wo Kwibohora kuwa 4 Nyakanga, Abanyarwanda bakishimira ibyo bamaze kugeraho mu ngeri zitandukanye zirimo ubukungu, imibereho myiza, umutekano, iterambere n\u2019ibindi.\nIBYO WAMENYA KU BIKORWA REMEZO\nIbyo wamenya ku bikorwa remezo Miss Muheto yagonze.\nYanditswe na Nsengiyumva Emmy\nKuya 30 October 2024 saa 10:32\nYasuwe: \nYavuzweho:\nKuri uyu wa Kabiri, tariki ya 29 Ukwakira 2024, ni bwo Polisi y\u2019u Rwanda yanyujije ubutumwa ku mbuga nkoranyambaga zayo igaragaza ko dosiye ya Miss Muheto yamaze gushyikirizwa ubushinjacyaha.\nMu itangazo ryashyizwe hanze Polisi yagize iti \u201cPolisi iramenyesha ko Miss Muheto Divine yafashwe kubera gutwara ikinyabiziga yanyoye ibisindisha birengeje igipimo, kandi nta ruhushya rwo gutwara ibinyabiziga agira, kugonga no kwangiza ibikorwa remezo, hamwe no guhunga nyuma yo kugonga.\u201d\nNyuma y\u2019uko Polisi isohoye iri tangazo, benshi basakaje amafoto agaragaza ubwo Miss Muheto yakoraga impanuka mu gihe cyashize akagonga inzu, nyamara kuri iyi nshuro ntabwo ari yo yari yagonze.\nMu gushaka kumenya amakuru yimbitse kuri iyi mpanuka, IGIHE yamenye ko Miss Nshuti Muheto Divine yakoze ibi byaha hagati yo ku wa 18-20 Ukwakira 2024.\nUyu mukobwa wambitswe ikamba rya Miss Rwanda mu 2022, amakuru yizewe ahamya ko yakoreye impanuka ku muhanda uva Kicukiro ugana i Remera ahahoze Alpha Palace, kuri sitasiyo ya lisansi.\nMu gukora impanuka, uyu mukobwa wari wasomye kuri ka manyinya yisanze yagonze umukindo ndetse n\u2019ipoto y\u2019amashanyarazi, ibivuze ko yagonze ibikorwa remezo bibiri. Nyuma yo kugonga, uyu mukobwa ukiri muto yagerageje guhunga ngo atabazwa kuri aya mahano.\nGusa nyuma yo guta imodoka ye, Miss Nshuti Muheto Divine yaje gutega indi agaruka kureba uko ikibazo kimeze ari na bwo yahise atabwa muri yombi, aza gukorerwa dosiye ikaba yamaze kugezwa mu Bushinjacyaha."}
{"id": "19927", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19927", "title": "Umurenge wa Gahini", "text": "Umurenge wa Gahini ni umwe mu mirenge igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Uri hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Muhazi.\nMu 2022, uyu murenge wari utuwe n'abaturage 46 009. Gahini ifite ibitaro binini. Ni n'icyicaro cya Diyosezi ya Gahini y'Itorero Angilikani ry'u Rwanda.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Gahini ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 201,7. Agace ka Gahini kari ku musozi, ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 520. Kari hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Muhazi.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gahini wari utuwe n'abaturage 32 650. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 46 009. Abagabo bari 22 449. Abagore bari 23 560. Abaturage 38 092 batuye mu cyaro. Abaturage 7 917 batuye mu mujyi.\nAmateka.\nUmuryango w'abamisiyoneri Church Missionary Society (CMS) wahisemo Gahini. Wahubatse ivugabutumwa, ibitaro n'amashuri. Muganga Joe Church yatangiye imirimo y'ubuvuzi i Gahini nyuma ya 1927. Ububyutse bwo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (\"East African Revival\") bwagaragaye bwa mbere i Gahini.\nUyu munsi, Gahini ni icyicaro cya Diyosezi ya Gahini y'Itorero Angilikani ry'u Rwanda.\nUbuvuzi.\nIbitaro bya Gahini byashinzwe na CMS. Ni bimwe mu bitaro binini by'Intara y'Iburasirazuba. Bitanga serivisi zo kubyaza no kubaga amagufa. Bivura kandi virusi itera SIDA n'indwara z'amaso. Bifite ikigo cyita ku bafite ubumuga.\nUbukerarugendo.\nInkombe y'Ikiyaga cya Muhazi ni ahantu nyaburanga h'ingenzi. Seeds of Peace Centre na Jambo Beach bisurwa n'abakerarugendo. Benshi bahahagarara bajya cyangwa bava muri Pariki y'Igihugu y'Akagera. Bakora ingendo mu bwato, uburobyi no kureba inyoni."}
{"id": "19928", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19928", "title": "Umuco", "text": "\"UMUCO\" ni ijambo ryo mu Kinyarwanda risobanura \"culture\" mu Cyongereza. Mu buryo rusange, umuco ureshya n'uburyo abantu babana, ibyo bemera, imigenzo yabo, imyemerere, ibiribwa, imyambarire, indirimbo, imivugo, n'ibindi bikorwa bigize ubuzima bwa buri munsi bw'umuryango cyangwa igihugu. Mu Kinyarwanda, \"umuco\" ugira uruhare runini mu kubaka ubumwe bw'abenegihugu n'ubusabane bwabo..\nHari ibice byinshi by'umuco, birimo:\nMuri make, umuco ni uburyo abantu bagira isano n'ubuzima, urwego rwabo rwa sosiyete, ndetse n'imiryango yabo.\nIbyino ni ibikorwa by\u2019imyidagaduro cyangwa umuco w\u2019imvugo n\u2019imibyinire, aho abantu bibyina mu buryo bwihariye, bishimisha kandi bigaragaza ibitekerezo, amarangamutima, cyangwa amateka. Ibyino ni kimwe mu bigize umuco w\u2019abantu kandi byaba mu bice bitandukanye by\u2019isi, buri gace k'isi kigira uburyo bwabwo bwo kubyina, hagendewe ku migenzo, amateka, cyangwa ibihe byihariye by'aho..\nMu muco Nyarwanda, hari ibyino byihariye, harimo:\nIbyino ni kimwe mu buryo bwiza bwo kugaragaza no gusigasira umuco w\u2019igihugu cyangwa sosiyete, bikanatuma abantu barushaho kumva umuco wabo, bakanawusangiza abandi."}
{"id": "19930", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19930", "title": "Ifuni", "text": "Ifuni mu kinyarwanda ni isuka yakoreshaga kera mu muco nyarwanda, aho ifuni yakoraga ibintu bitandukanye, haba mu buhinzi, ubworozi mugucura ibintu bitandukanye bakoresheje umuvuba. "}
{"id": "19931", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19931", "title": "Inkwano", "text": "Inkwano ni kimwe mu bintu umuryango w'umuhungu ubasaba umugeni utanga kugirango bamuhe umugeni mu muco w'abanyrwanda. Inkwano zabaga zirimo amako atandukanye, nubwo habagaho umugeni w'ubuntu ariko inka nicyo kintu cy'apimirwagaho inkwano zitangwa.\nInka zitegura kwima.\nni inkwano yatangwaga ku muryango w'umukobwa aho zabaga ari inyana z'inka za majigija ariko zitegura kwima noneho ikabyarira rimwe n'umugeni b'azikoye.\nInka z'ibyeyi.\ninka b'ankwagamo umugeni ariko w'abyari iwabo cy'angwa watandukanye n'umugabo gusa yarabyaye bitanyuze mu muco nyarwanda.\nInka umunani cyangwa ijana n'izazo.\nInka mu nani cyangwa ijana n'izazo zabaga ari inka bakoye umugore wari utuzwe n'undi mugabo bakamukurayo maze agasabwa mu rundi rugo, kuko yishimiwe kandi akuzwe bakamwita umugore wasumbakaje.\nGukwa isuka.\nIsuka nayo yari inkwano yazaga mbere kugirango izage guhingira ubwatsi inka zizarya, mu muco n'amateka yu Rwanda Isuka yafatwaga nk'inkwano aho yatanganga amasuka 10 angana n'inka.\nGutenda.\nGutenda byakorwaga n'umusore washakaga gukwa umukobwa ariko akaba nta kwano afite, rero akajya kwa sebukwe akabakorera akazi mugihe bumvikanye maze yakarangiza bakamuha umukobwa wabo."}
{"id": "19933", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19933", "title": "Amatabi", "text": "Itabi ni kimwe mu bintu bigaragara mu bintu biza mu muco nyarwanda, ndetse bifite umumaro cyane kuko ry'afashaga abantu benshi mu kazi kabo kaburi munsi, harimo arinnyaga bagiye ku rugambo, itabi barikoreshaga bagiye kuragira, itabi kandi barikoreshaga bashaka nkiyongeramo akanyabugabo."}
{"id": "19934", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19934", "title": "Incyamuro", "text": "Incyamuro ni igikoresho cyakoreshaga cyane mu muco nyarwandaikaba ari igikoresho cy'ifashishwaga mugukora ibikorwa bitandukanye harimo umuvure cyngwa se isekuru mu giti cyitwa umuko cyangwa se umuvumu, ndetse incyamuro bafashaga mu gukora inkongoro cyangwa se imbehe. "}
{"id": "19935", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19935", "title": "Indyabiti", "text": "Iryabiti ni kimwe mu gikoresho cya kera mu muco nyarwanda, aho yyakoreshaga mu kwasa ibiti binini iryabiti yagiye itwa andi mazina harimo nki ishoka. "}
{"id": "19936", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19936", "title": "Urunana", "text": "Urunana ni kimwe mubikoresho by'akera bigaragara mu umuco nyarwanda, rukaba rwari rumwe mu bikoresho byakoreshaga mu buhinzi cyangwa se ubuhinzi, ubundi Urunani ni umuhoro wu bungubu. Urunani rwabaga rwihese ku mutwe warwo,ahagana hagati hakaba ariho hari ubugi hatyaye."}
{"id": "19937", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19937", "title": "Sobanukirwa Imigani Migufi Itangaje", "text": "Muri buri stinda ry'abantu, Imiryango ndetse n'ibihugu usanga bagira ibintu bibahuza ndetse bikaba umwihariko wabo,ibyo bikabatandukanya n'abandi ndetse ugasanga aribyo bibagira abo baribo.\nAha ushobora gusanga mo byinshi birimo nk'ururimi rubahuza, imico itandukanye nimirire ndetse n'imyambarire. Kumugabane w'afurika ndetse no m'u Rwanda by'umwihariko, ibyo uranihasanga bikaba birimo Imigani migufi, aho ikoreshwa ushaka kuvuga ikintu ariko muburyo butumvwa n'umuntu uwariwe wese keretse imenyereye ururimi rw'ikinyarwanda. Ubu tugiye kurebera hamwe imigani migufi 10 itangaje cyane;\n1.Shotora ingagi uzabona ubwitonzi bwayo!\nUyumugani bawuca bashaka kuvuga ko atari byiza kwendereza, kwiyenza kumuntu kugeza aho akwereka uburakari cyangwa kamere ye.\n2.Nta sugi iba munzu y'ibyariro (Maternite).\nNkuko byumvikana, munzu y'ibyariro habamo ababyeyi baje kubyara, ntiwasangamo amasugi! bakaba bawucira umuntu wagaragaweho nokubeshya nyamara umuntu wese yibonera ukuri kubiriho.\n3.Umugore uhora atekereza aho umugabo we ari ni umupfakazi gusa..\nUyu ni umugani ushobora guca ushaka kumvisha rubanda ko hari ibibazo byawe ugomba kwimenyera wowe ubwawe gusa.\n4.Umwana yakina n'amabere ya nyina ariko ntiyakina n'ubugabo bwa se!\nUyu mugani bawuca bashaka kwerekana ko ntamikino! Niyo wakwisanzura ariko haraho utakagombye kurenga, mbese ko utagomba kurengera.\n5.Ujya koga mumaso ntahera kubirenge!\nUyumugani bawuca bashaka kuvugako buri kintu kigira kigihe cyacyo, mbese ko utakorera ibintu byose rimwe ko ahubwo ugomba guhera ku vyingenzi kuruta ibindi.\n6.Intebe niyo imenya uwasuze!\nIyo intebe ziba zivuga, nizo zavugisha ukuri umuntu wasuze mubantu!!\nUyu mugani ucibwa hagamijwe kwerekana ko ukuri nyako kubyabaye kuba gufitwe n'uwo byabayeho.\n7.Uwaraye aribwa munnyo, abyukana intoki zinuka!!\nUyu mugani usekeje, ucibwa hashaka gusobanurwako ataribyiza guhisha ikibazo ufite kuko umunsi umwe kizagaragara wabishaka utabishaka.\n8.Iyo umubu ukurumye kubugabo nibwo umenyako ubuhubutsi budakemura ibibazo byose!\ncyangwa bati; Iyo imashini y'ipantalo igufashe kubugabo, nibwo umenyako guhubuka kudakemura ibibazo byose!\nIyi migani yombi yerekanako hari ibibazo bikemurwa n'ubwitonzi ndetse bikabije kuko uhubutse wakwagiza byinshi kurushaho.\n9.Agahwa kari kuwundi karahandurika!\nUyu mugani bawucaga bashaka kumvikanisha ko nubwo umuntu yakubwira ibibazo bye utabifata cyangwa se bitakuremerera nkuko we bimuremereye akenshi bamwe unasanga uba ubwira ibyo bibazo byawe babifata nkaho byoroshye bitakabaye bikubabaza.\n10.Igiti uzatema ushaje ugitera ukirimuto!\nuyu mugani bawuca badasobanura igiti ahubwo bavuga kwizigamira, iyo wizigamiye ukurimuto bigufasha no mubusaza bwawe ntago usaza wanduranya kuko uba warizigamiye.\nImigani migufi ariyo bakunze kwita Imigani y'imigenurano nubwo ivugitse mu buryo bunyarutse, irusha ibindi byose kuranga umuco rusange w'abanyarwanda. Ushaka kumenya uburezi n'uburere cyangwa imibanire y'abantu bya Kinyarwanda wabisangamo. Nkuko Amateka y'ubuvanganzo nyarwanda abigaragaza, umugani n'ipfundory'amagambo atonze neza, gacamigani yakagiriyemo ihame ridutoza gukora iki cyangwa se kudakora kiriya. Mbese muri make umugani ni umwanzuro w'amarenga y'intekerezo. Umugani uvuga ukuri ariko muri kamere yawo ntabwo wo uba ari ukuri.\ningero ziyo migani harimo; \n-Uwoze ntazika\n-Inyama utazarya ntuzirinda ibisiga.\n-Uruyuzi rujya kwera ibihaza rubanza ubututu.\n-Ntwe ukandagira ibijanju by'amacupa ngo ananirwe ibijanju by'ibicuma\n-Nyakamwe ntavumba mu Bakara\n-Agaharawe gahabwa agahari, agahararutswe kagahabwa agahini\n-Aho ingenzi ziri ingegera ntizigurumbya\n-Aho ingenzi zitari ingegera zirigurumbya\n-Nta nyanya zera imitobotobo\n-Icumu rizagucungura ntumenya aho ryacuriwe\n-Nyokorome akuruma akurora\n-Utagira nyirasenge arisenga\n-Umwana uko umureze niko akunera nindi migani myinshi..."}
{"id": "19938", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19938", "title": "Ubuhiri", "text": "Ubuhiri ni igiti cya cyera cya koreshwaga mu muco Nyarwanda, cyabaga gifite amabango gikomeye cyane, cyikaba baragikoreshaga mu mu kwasa inkwi, nicyo bategaga igiti bagiye kwasa bigafasha uwasa korohorwa nnicyo yasa, gusa aha bagkoreshaga Imangu."}
{"id": "19939", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19939", "title": "Imangu", "text": "Imangu ni igiti cya baga gisongoye, cyoakoreshwaga cyane mu kwasa inkwi, zabaga zifite amabango menshi cyangwa ibiti bikomeye, abasokuruza bacu bakoresha imangu cyane mu ishyamba cyangwa mu rugo.\nIbiti.\nHari ibiti bitandukanye byakorwagamo imangu kuko byari bizwiho gukomera aha twavuga indakatsi."}
{"id": "19940", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19940", "title": "Nyirabunyagwa", "text": "Nyirabunyagwa ni isuka y'agafuni yakoreshwaga kera ndetse nu bu mugutera imyaka itandukanye twavuaga ibishyimbo, ibigori, amasaka ndetse no ku bagara ibintu bigiye bitandukanye kuva kera mu muco nyarwanda."}
{"id": "19941", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19941", "title": "Intabire", "text": "Intabire ni umurima uhinze neza ibyatsi babitabye mu butaka ikaba ariyo bateragamo inyaka itandukanye mu gihe cyo kuyiteramo ndetse no kuyibagara. Intabire bateramo nki bishyimbo, amashaza, amasaka nibindi bitandukanye."}
{"id": "19942", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19942", "title": "Urutare rwa Bigogwe", "text": "Urutare rwa Bigogwe ruherereye mu karere ka Nyabihu mu ntara y'iBurengerazuba bw'U Rwanda.\nInkomoko y'izina.\nurutare rwahawe izina ibere rya Bigogwe bishingiye ku nkuru ivugwa mu mateka y'U Rwanda y'uwitwa Bere, wari umer mu basigajwe inyuma n'amateka wabonye ubuki ari kumwe na bagenzi be biyemeza kujya kubuhakura. Bere niwe wagiye aho ubwo buki bwari brui atangira kubuhakura aburya adasanyiye na Bagenzi be yirengagije ko ari bo bari bafasha imigoze imukomeza ngo atagwa mu rutare. Bagenzi ba bere babonye ko atari buze kuzana ubuki ngo basangire bahizemo kumjurekura, agwa mu rutare, ahasiga ubuzima. nibwo hatangiye kwitirirwa uwo Bere kuva ubwo kugeza n'ubu. Nyuma ariko haje guhindurwa ahakorerwa imyitozo y'igisirikare. kandi aka gace kakomeje kumenyekana kubera ubukerarugendo bushingiye ku nka.\nAndi mateka y\u2019uruhererekane nyemvugo avuga ko kwita ako gasozi \u2018Ibere rya Bigogwe\u2019 byaba byaraturutse ku mukobwa witwaga \u2018Nyirabigogwe\u2019 wari ufite ibere rinini cyane, akaza kugwa kuri uwo musozi bakahamwitirira."}
{"id": "19943", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19943", "title": "Igicugutu", "text": "Igicugutu ni ikinyabiziga gikoreshwa amaboko kigahabwa amapine abiri ebyiri kikaba gikoreshwa mu bihugu bya Afurika y'iburasirazuba mu gurwara imizigo.\nUbusanzwe igicugutu kiba gifite ikadiri yinguni, amapine abiri mato (akenshi bikozwe mu biti, rimwe na rimwe agafunikishwa ibisigazwa b'amapine y'ibinyabiziga akorerwa mu nganda), imikandara, hamwe na padi kugirango umukoresha ashyire ivi mugihe atwara icyo kinyabiziga. Kumanuka, ucyigenderaho ahagarara kumurongo nk'utwaye moto yo mu bwoko bwa skooter ari nayo kadere. Ku butaka buringaniye, uyigenderaho ashobora gushyira ivi rimwe ku ikadere hanyuma agasunikisha hasi ukundi kuguru nk'igare.\nAkenshi hongrwamo ibisigazwa by'amapine akorerwa mu nganda kugirango birinde ubunyerere \nAmateka.\nIgicugutu cyagaragaye bwa mbere mu myaka ya za 70 muri Kivu y'Amajyaruguru, mu bihe bitoroshye by'ubukungu ku butegetsi bwa Mobutu Sese Seko. \nMuri 2008, ibicugutu byari bifite agaciro k'amadorari 100 ya Amerika. mu gihe kumunsi, mukarere karere ka Afurika y'Iburasirazuba abantu abantu benshi babaho babaho binjiza ari munsi y'amadorari ya amerika abiri munsi kumunsi. muri 2014 byagaragajwe ko hari abatwara ibicuguti bakaba bamara amezi atandatu binjiza amadorari hagati y'10 na 20 ku munsi. "}
{"id": "19945", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19945", "title": "Yigize Kabushungwe", "text": "Yigize Kabushungwe ni umugani w'Ikinyarwanda baca iyo babona umuntu yigize indakoreka, bakagoragoza akanga, nibwo bavuga bati \"Knaka uriya yigize Kabushungwe\". uyu mugani wakomotse kuri Bushungwe w'i Kageyo mu Cyingogo (Gisenyi); ku ngoma ya Mutara Rwogera. \nInkomoko y'Umugani.\nUbwo Umwami Rwogera yajyaga ku butegetsi yari akiri muto, ni uko nyina witwaga Nyiramavugo Nyiramongi aba ari we uyobora mu mwanya, nk'uko byajyaga bikorwa ibwami iyo umwami yimikwaga akiri muto. muri icyo gihe nibwo uwitwa Bushungwe wari utuye i Kageyo, akaba umukungu w'imyaka n'amatungo, yatangiye kutavuga rumwe n'abajyanaga amaturo i Bwami, afata abo babyemeranywaho abasaba kujya bazana amaturo iwe aho kuyajyana ibwami. \nUmugabekazi abimenye atuma ingabo z'ibwami zijya kumufata ziramuzana, zimwereka umugabekazi. ni uko Bushungwe ahabwa igihano cyo gucibwa amatwi, kuko yari amaze kubeshya umugabekazi ko aho akomoka ubusembwa bubi burutwa no gupfa ari ukubaho udafite amatwi. birangira Bushungwe atishwe. "}
{"id": "19946", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19946", "title": "Nyabingi", "text": "Nyabingi ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi wakuye benshi umutima kugeza aho hari bamwe banamwita sekibi N\u2019ubwo izina ryamamaye cyane ari Nyabingi ariko izina rye ry\u2019Ikinyarwanda ni Nyabyinshi, bivuze umuntu ufite ubutunzi bwinshi, ni izina ryahawe umukobwa uvugwa ko we na Ruganzu ll Ndoli, bavutse ari impanga babyawe na Ndahiro ll Cyamatare.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nNyabingi yavutse yitwa Nyabyinshi, nyuma izina rye riza kumenyekana nka Nyabingi bitewe n'uko abantu bavugaga ururimi rw'urukiga, iyo bumvaga izina Nyabyinshi bo bumvaga Nyabingi.\nUmwaka yavutsemo ntuzwi neza, ariko Bikekwako yavutse hagati y'umwaka w1600 n'umwaka w'1800. \nUyu Nyabingi yagize ubutunzi bwinshi, Nyuma y'uko se yamuganiye agace k'u Rwanda kitwa mu ndorwa \nIkindi nyabingi avugwaho inkuru zitandukanye mumateka y'u, Rwanda, hari abumva iryo zina bagasesa urumeza, abandi bakamufata nk'igikomerezwa, Imana, Sekibi n'ibindi byinshi. yaru umwana w'umukobwa wa Ruganzu II ndori wayoboye urwanda mu ntangiro z'ikinyejana cya 16. Yamubyaye ubwo yari yarahungiye Ikaragwe kwa Nyirasenge Nyabunyana \nAho Nyabingi ahurira n'imyemerere.\nNyabingi ntiyigeze ashaka umugabo, ubwo yari agiye gupfa, yahamagaye abaja be n\u2019abagaragu abihera bwa butunzi bwe bwose ngo bazabugabane.\nNk\u2019ikimenyetso cyo kuzahora bamwibuka, bamushyiriraho imigenzo yo kujya bamuterekera. Baje no kwishyira hamwe biyita \u2018Abagirwa\u2019, nk\u2019abantu bagizwe na Nyabingi bagatunga bagatunganirwa.\nUwo muco wo guterekera Nyabingi wahereye aho, ukwira mu Banyarwanda bose aho uwabagiriye neza na nyuma yo gupfa bahoraga bamwibuka, Na n\u2019ubu Mu Rwanda, by\u2019umwihariko mu duce tw\u2019Amajyaruguru, hari ahakigaragara ibimenyetso biranga imibereho ya Nyabingi, ku gicumbi cy\u2019uwo muco ni mu Murenge wa Butaro mu Karere ka Burera.\nMuri ako gace hari abakiriho mu bahose ari Abagirwa ba Nyabingi, aho bagiye basimburana mu buryo bw\u2019uruhererekane bamwe basimbura ababyeyi babo, hakaba hakigaragara inzu za Nyabingi (Indaro/ingoro) aho baterekereraga."}
{"id": "19947", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19947", "title": "Itorero Inkindi n'amariza", "text": "Itorero Inkindi n'Amariza n'itsinda ry'abasore n'inkumi ryashiznwe kandi riyoborwa na Carine Karambizi rigamije gukundisha abakuru n'abato by'umwihariko urubyiruko gukunda imbyino n'umuco gakondo by'abanyarwanda.\nIri torero ryanshinzwe mu mwaka w'2021, rikaba rikora ibikorwa byo gusigasira umuco, babifatanyije n'ibikorwa bya Siporo nabyo bibiungabunga bikanasigasira umuco nyarwanda "}
{"id": "19949", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19949", "title": "Kwambara shariya", "text": "Kwambara shariya.\nShariya ni amategeko y'Imana yagenwe mu idini ya Islam, kandi ashingiye ku mabwiriza agenga imibereho y'abayisilamu. Iyo tuvuga \"kwambara shariya,\" bivuze kwambara mu buryo bukurikiza amategeko ya shariya, by'umwihariko ku bagore, aho kwambara bisaba imyambaro ishyira mu gaciro, ikubahiriza ubwiyoroshye, ubusugi, no kwirinda kugaragaza ibice by'umubiri byemerewe gusa mu ruhame.\nMuri rusange, ibi ni bimwe mu byo kwambara shariya bivuze:\nKwambara shariya rero ni igikorwa kigamije kugendera ku mahame ya Islam no kubaha amategeko y'Imana, mu gihe kigamije\nkurinda isura, umutima, n'ubwiza bw'umuntu. Naho ku bagabo, nubwo imyambarire yabo itandukanye gato, isaba kugira isuku n'icyubahiro mu kubaha amategeko ya shariya."}
{"id": "19950", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19950", "title": "Umurenge wa Runda", "text": "Umurenge wa Runda ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kamonyi, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Runda wari utuwe n'abaturage 72 778. Mu 2012, wari utuwe n'abaturage 34 839. Abaturage benshi b'uyu murenge batuye mu mujyi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Runda ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Kamonyi.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Runda wari utuwe n'abaturage 34 839. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 72 778. Abagabo bari 35 695. Abagore bari 37 083.\nMu 2022, abari hagati y'imyaka 0 na 14 bari 25 627. Abari hagati y'imyaka 15 na 64 bari 45 028. Abari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga bari 1 980.\nAbaturage 66 151 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 6 627 batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19951", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19951", "title": "Ikiraro", "text": "\"Ikiraro bambukiraho ni iki?\" mu Kinyarwanda bisobanuye \"Ni iki kiguhuza cyangwa kikuyobora mu yindi nzira?\" cyangwa \"Ni iki gikora nk'urugendo umuntu anyuramo?\".\nIyi mvugo ishobora kuba ikoreshejwe mu buryo bw'ubuvanganzo cyangwa mu buryo bw'ikigereranyo, aho ikiraro cyaba gisobanura inzira cyangwa icyerekezo umuntu akoreramo urugendo rw'ubuzima, aho arimo gukemura ibibazo cyangwa kugera ku ntego.\nHari ubwo iyo mvugo ikoreshwa mu buryo bw'ikigereranyo, aho ikiraro kivuga uburyo umuntu ashobora guhindura cyangwa kugera ku bintu runaka mu buzima bwe.\nkandi nanone mu rwanda dufite ibindi biraro:"}
{"id": "19952", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19952", "title": "Ubukorikori", "text": "Abanyabugeni n'abanyabukorikori.\nAbanyabugeni n'abanyabukorikori bakora ibihangano bijyanye n'umuco gakondo mu Rwanda.\nIbikoresho by'ubukorikori by'abanyarwanda byoherejwe n'abamisiyoneri i Vatikani mu 1925,\nbirimo kumurikwa mu ngoro ndanga murage ya Anima Mundi Ethonological Museum.\nAbayobozi mu ihuriro mpuzamahanga ry\u2019abanyabugeni n\u2019abanyabukorikori bo muri Burkina Faso basuye abanyabugeni bo mu Rwanda mu rwego rwo kubakangurira kujya bitabira imurikagurisha ribera muri icyo gihugu kuko iyo abantu baje muri iryo murikagurisha baba bashaka ibintu byo mu Rwanda cyane.\nAmakoperative y\u2019abanyabukorikori n\u2019abanyabugeni atandukanye akorera hirya no hino mu mujyi wa Kigali abo bashyitsi basuye tariki 27/01/2014 bakanayakangurira kuzitabira imurikagurisha ryo muri Burkina Faso babyishimiye ariko bagaragaza ikibazo cy\u2019ubushobozi bucye basaba ko MNICOM na PSF byazabafasha.\nUwera Maryse wari uhagarariye MINICOM yavuze ko ibi ari ibintu byo kuzaganiraho hagati y\u2019inzego bireba hakarebwa icyakorwa ariko kandi anibutsa aba banyabukorikori ko bakwiye gushyiraho akabo maze n\u2019uwabafasha akagira aho ahera atari ukuvuga ngo bazategereza gukorerwa byose.Musanze."}
{"id": "19953", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19953", "title": "UBUCUKUZIO BW'AMABUYE MU KARERE KA RULINDO", "text": "UBUCUKUZI BWA MABUYE MU KARERE KA RULINDO\nToni zirenga 2000 zicukurwa mu bigo bine:ishusho y'ubucukuzi bw'urwnda mu mibare\nToni zirenga 2000 zicukurwa mu bigo bine: Ishusho y\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019u Rwanda mu mibare.\nYanditswe na Ishimwe ngabo victory\nKuya 17 March 2025 saa 08:05\nYasuwe: \nYavuzweho:\nIcyakora twasuye bike cyane kuko mu mpushya zisaga 100 u Rwanda rumaze gutanga ku bacukura, nasuye ibigo bitanu bitunganganya amabuye ya Wolfram, gasegereti na coltan atunganywamo ibyuma ya tungsten, tin na tantalum.\nNi amabuye akenewe muri iyi minsi cyane, kuko atunganywamo ibyuma bikomeye bikoreshwa mu bwubatsi, mu ndege, mu bifaru, mu byogajuru, mu gukora imbunda, amasasu, ibikoresho by\u2019ikoranabuhanga nk\u2019ibitanda bya telefone, mudasobwa n\u2019ibindi bikoresho by\u2019ikoranabuhanga, gusudira n\u2019ibindi.\nNi amabuye u Rwanda rukungahayeho cyane kuko rucukura toni ziri hagati ya 8000-10000 buri mwaka, igiciro mu mafaranga kigahinduka bijyanye n\u2019uko amasoko ahagaze.\nMu bigo bigera ku 100 bicukura amabuye y\u2019agaciro bibarirwa mu Rwanda, twasuyemo bine, birimo ikirombe cya Nyakabingo kiri mu Karere ka Rulindo, icya Rukaragata kiri mu Ngororero, ibya Mwurire, Nzige na Rubona (bicukurwa n\u2019ikigo kimwe) mu Karere ka Rwamagana, n\u2019icya Bashyamba cyo mu Karere ka Nyarugenge.\nUkoze imibare ubona ko ibyo birombe bicukura amabuye abarirwa muri toni 2000 buri mwaka, bikagira abakozi hafi ibihumbi 5000 batunze imiryango yabo mu Rwanda.\nNi imirimo yashowemo akayabo kuko nka Trinity Metals igenzura ikirombe cya Nyakabingo imaze gushora arenga miliyoni 40$, bikaba n\u2019uko ku kigo cya Power M kigenzura ibirombe bya Rukaragata mu Karere ka Ngororero na cyane ko ho abakozi ari bake cyane ugereranyije n\u2019imashini zikorera ibintu.\nNi ubucukuzi bukorwa imusozi no mu nda y\u2019imisozi. Nituvuga imusozi wumve bya bindi byo kubanza guharura umusozi nka metero mirongo ingahe ubundi ugatangira kuyora uwo mucanga uba wuzuyemo amabuye y\u2019agaciro ukawutunganya amabuye ushaka ukayabona.\nUbundi buryo ni ubwo kujya mu nda y\u2019umusozi, ugacukura indani zitandukanye haba mu bitare no mu butaka bworoshye, aho nko mu birombe bya Bashyamba bamaze kucukura indani zireshya na kilometero 15 mu bitare 300.\nMu bushakashatsi ibyo bigo byakoze, bigaragaza ko ayo mabuye yose aramutse acukuwe neza byakorwa mu myaka igera kuri 50 iri imbere.\nUbwo bucukuzi ni nako bwungura haba abashoramari, abakozi n\u2019igihugu muri rusange kuko batanga nk\u2019imisoro.\nNka Twizerimana Jean Claude, ukorera mu kirombe cya Bashyamba IGIHE yamusanze mu ndani hafi muri metero 600 z\u2019ubutambike imbere mu musozi.\nYavuze ko amaze imyaka itatu akorera iki kigo kandi ngo abona iterambere ryacyo na we rimugeraho uko bwije n\u2019uko bukeye, kuko amaze kwigurira ikibanza mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nAti \u201cNagezemo ku cyumweru cya mbere bampemba ibihumbi 94 Frw, igikurikiyeho bampemba ibihumbi 114 Frw. Mu byumweru bibiri iyo nahembwe make bampa ibihumbi 190 Frw. Hari n\u2019ubwo bigenda neza gasegereti ikaboneka ibihumbi 800 Frw mu minsi 15 akinjira.\u201d\nMugenzi we wo mu Ngororero witwa Yankurije Betty umaze imyaka irindwi akora mu birombe bya Rukaragata ati \u201cMu myaka irindwi nageze kuri byinshi. Mbere nta mafaranga nagiraga. Ubu nishyurira abana ishuri, nubatse inzu, naguze inka ebyiri, isambu y\u2019ibihumbi 600 Frw n\u2019ibindi byinshi.\u201d\nIryo shimwe ni na ryo wumvana abashoye imari muri iyi mirimo barimo na Kwizera Jean Bosco usanzwe ari Umuyobozi Mukuru wa DUMAC Ltd, ikigo cya mbere gicukura gasegereti na Coltan nyinshi mu Rwanda bivanze, mu kirombe giherereye mu Karere ka Rwamagana mu mirenge ya Mwurire Nzige na Rubona.\nUyu mugabo watangiye ari umucukuzi usanzwe ubu ageze ku ishoramari rya miliyari 5 Frw ati \u201cTwatangiye dushora nka miliyoni 80 Frw ariko ubu tugeze kuri miliyari 5 Frw.\u201d\n\u201cTwatangiranye abakozi 120 ubu barenze 1000. Aha hari amabuye menshi cyane kuko niba twaratangiriye ku bilo 200 mu cyumweru uyu munsi nkaba ngeze kuri toni zirenga 20 kandi hafi yanjye hakaba ibindi birombe by\u2019ibindi bigo. Urumva ko aya mabuye ari menshi. Ntabwo washora uko utunguka.\u201d\nUmushoramari mugenzi we wo mu Bwongereza washoye muri Power M yo mu Ngororero witwa Ray Power unayoboye n\u2019Uruganda rwa Power Resources International rutunganyiriza Coltan mu Karere ka Bugesera, yagaragaje ko ahantu hangana na metero 600 yabonyemo amabuye y\u2019agaciro atandukanye ashobora gucukurwa kugeza mu myaka 16 iri imbere, iramutse icukuwe mu buryo bugezweho.\nAti \u201cUbu dufite amabuye twacukura mu myaka 16 ndatse turi gukora ubushakashatsi ku buryo igera ku myaka 20. Urumva ko aha hari amabuye. Inyungu iraboneka.\u201d\nUretse abo n\u2019igihugu ni ko cyunguka binyuze mu misoro. Kumva uburyo imisoro yiyongera ubyumvira mu musaruro wiyongera umunsi ku wundi.\nImibare y\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu Gishinzwe Mine, Peteroli na Gaz (Rwanda Mining Board- RMB) igaragaza ko garagaza ko amabuye y\u2019agaciro yoherejwe mu mahanga mu 2023 yinjirije u Rwanda asaga miliyari 1,1$, avuye kuri miliyoni 772$ bigaragaza izamuka rya 43.0%.\nIkigo cy\u2019Igihugu cy\u2019Ibarurishamibare (NISR) cyatangaje ko muri Mutarama 2025, umusaruro w\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro mu Rwanda, wiyongereyeho 4.3% ugereranyije na Mutarama 2024.\nAmabuye ntabwo agaruka ku mipaka\u2026\nRimwe na rimwe uzumva ibirego bigaragaza ko u Rwanda nta mabuye y\u2019agaciro rugira, icyakora abavuga ukumva baravuze ngo nko muri metero 500 cyangwa ikilometero kimwe hakurya y\u2019umupaka wayo ngo ni ho ayo mabuye abarizwa.\nNi ibintu Ray Power yumva agaseka, ashingiye ku bushakashatsi yakoze n\u2019akayabo yashoye mu bijyanye no guteza ubucukuzi bugezweho bwibanda ku mubare w\u2019imashini nyinshi kurusha abantu.\nAti \u201cNtabwo amabuye agira imipaka. Ntabwo akenera pasiporo ngo abe yava mu gice kimwe ajya mu kindi. Ubwanjye nishoreye imari mu bijyanye n\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro no gushakisha aho aherereye. Imitereye y\u2019aka karere ni imwe ku bijyanye n\u2019uwo mutungo kamere.\u201d\nAko gace Power avuga ni ako igice kibarizwamo amabuye y\u2019agaciro kizwi nka Kibaran-Angolan Belt. Uretse u Rwanda ruherereye rwagati muri cyo, kibarizwamo n\u2019ibice byo mu bihugu nka RDC, Angola, Repubulika ya Centrafrique, Zambia, Tanzania n\u2019ahandi.\nUmuyobozi w\u2019Ishami rya RMB rishinzwe ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro n\u2019ubugenzuzi bwayo, Nsengumuremyi Donat, yunze mu rya Ray Power agaragaza ko rwihagije ku mabuye ku bwinshi no ku bwiza, akavuga ko hafi igihugu cyose, ni ukuvuga mu turere 28 hagaragaye ibimenyetso by\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro atandukanye, ndetse muri utwo turere turimo ibikorwa by\u2019ubucukuzi.\nYavuze ko nubwo u Rwanda rukataje mu gucukura, ntaho ruragera kuko mu gihe ibindi bihugu bigeze ku bilometero nka bibiri munda y\u2019Isi, u Rwanda rutaragera no ku kilometero kimwe.\nAti \u201cU Rwanda rufite amabuye y\u2019agaciro, kuko ruherereye mu gice abarizwamo (Kibara Belt), ndetse rukaba hagati yacyo. Niba turi hagati bivuze turi mu izingiro ryayo. Haracyari imyaka myinshi yo gucukura.\u201d\nUyu muyobozi agaragaza ko ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro bwakomeje kwitabirwa cyane nko mu myaka icumi ishize aho u Rwanda rwabihaye umurongo. Ni urwego rubarurwamo abakozi barenga ibihumbi 70.\nAgaragaza ko kugeza ubu u Rwanda rumaze gutanga impushya 136 ku bigo by\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro 99, impushya 18 z\u2019ibigo bikora ubushakashatsi ku mabuye y\u2019agaciro zahawe ibigo 17, impushya 76 ku bigo bicuruza ayo mabuye n\u2019izindi eshatu ku biyongerera agaciro. Akagaragaza ko utashora muri ibyo byose nta mabuye ufite.\nUbucukuzi mu Rwanda bwatangiye gukorwa mu myaka 95 irashize mu Rwanda hatangijwe ibikorwa by\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro nyuma y\u2019imyaka hafi 10 yari ishize hakorwa ubushakashatsi, bwagaragaje ko rukungahaye ku mabuye atandukanye.\nAgaragara cyane ni Gasegereti, Coltan na Wolfram. Urugendo rwo kwiyubaka rujyana no kongera inganda zitunganya ayo mabuye mu Rwanda zirimo urwa Gasabo Gold Refinery, rufite ubushobozi bwo gutunganya toni 96 ku mwaka, urwa LuNa Smelter rutanganya gasegereti ubushobozi bwo gushongesha toni 360 za gasegereti buri kwezi, n\u2019urwa Power Resources International Ltd rufite ubushobozi bwo gutunganya toni 120 za coltan mu kwezi.\nNsengumuremyi avuga ko ubu bari mu mushinga wa leta uzamara imyaka itatu buzakorerwa mu duce twagaragaye ko dukungahaye ku mabuye y\u2019agaciro cyane, bagacukura mu ntera ndende ugana hasi, kugira ngo hamenywe ingano y\u2019amabuye u Rwanda rufite.\nAti \u201cTuri gukora ubwa zahabu, ubwa Lithium kuko isigaye ikenewe ku rwego mpuzamahanga n\u2019ubwa gasegereti coltan na wolfram.\u201d\nU Rwanda kandi rwanashoye mu burezi bugamije kurema inzobere muri iyo mirimo, uyu munsi bikaba ari itegeko ko ikirombe kigira inzobere mu ibijyanye n\u2019ubucukuzi n\u2019ushinzwe kurengera ibidukikije bose babyize.\nKuva Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda yashyiraho ishuri ryigisha ibijyanye n\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro mu 2015, ubu igihugu gifite abanyamwuga 260 bavuye kuri 40 rwabaruraga mu 1995.\nUretse 3Ts u Rwanda rufite na zahabu iboneka mu turere twa Gicumbi, Musanze, Burera, Nyamasheke, Rusizi na Nyarugenge, amabengeza akoreshwa mu mitako aboneka mu turere twa Ngororero, Muhango Ruhango, Muhanga, Sapphire aboneka mu Burengerazuba, Lithium n\u2019andi ndetse ubushakashatsi burakomeje.\nU Rwanda rufite intego y\u2019uko mu 2029 ruzaba rubarura umusaruro mu bucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro ungana na 2,2$. Gukusanya amabuye yose yacukuwe bikava kuri 40% bikagera kuri 80%."}
{"id": "19954", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19954", "title": "Akamaro ko kwiga", "text": "Kwiga ni ingenzi mu mikurire y'umuntu n'umuryango,bituma abantu bunguka ubumenyi,bakiteza imbere, kandi bagafata ibyemezo byuzuye amaherezo bikagira uruhare mu ejo hazaza heza kuri bo no ku isi.\nDore ibisobanuro birambuye kumpamvu kwiga ari ngombwa:\nInyungu z'umuntu ku giti cye:.\nUbumenyi no gusobanukirwa:.\nKwiga bituma abantu bamenya ibyisi,bakumva neza ibintu bitandukanye,kandi bagatezimbere ubuhanga bwo gutekereza.\nGuteza imbere ubuhanga:.\nBinyuze mu kwiga,abantu barashobora kubona ubumenyi bwingirakamro,bwaba amasomo,tekiniki,cyangwa ubuhanga bworoshye bukenewe kugira ngo umuntu atsinde mubice bitandukanye byubuzima.\nGukura kwawe:.\nKwiga bitera amatsiko y'ubwenge,bigatera inkunga yo kwivumbura,kandi bigira uruhare mu mikurire no kwiteza imbere.\nItanga umutekano w'amafaranga:.\nHejuru y'umutekano,uburezi nabwo butanga umutekanowamafaranga,cyane cyane muri sosiyete yubu.Uburezi bwiza bukunda kuganisha kumurimo uhembwa menshi,kimwe no kuguha ubumenyi bukenewe kugira ngo ugereyo\nBirakenewe kuburinganire:.\nKugira ngo isi yose ibe ingana rwose,igomba guhera ku burezi.Niba buri wese yarahawe amahirwe amwe yo kwiga,noneho habaho itandukaniro rito hagati yimibereho"}
{"id": "19955", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19955", "title": "Akarere ka nyabihu mu bukungu bw'igihugu", "text": "= Nyabihu: Inganda zikamura amababi y\u2019inturusu zirashinjwa kwangiza amashyamba y\u2019abaturage =\nYanditswe na \nISHEMA christian\n01-04-2025 - 18:31 \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0 \nAbaturage barebwa n\u2019icyo kibazo, cyane cyane ni abo mu Mirenge ine izo nganda zikoreramo, ariyo Rurembo, Rambura, Jomba na Mulinga, aho bemeza ko kuva izo nganda zigeze muri ako gace bari kwangirizwa amashyamba, dore ko amababi y\u2019inturusu yahindutse imari ikomeye muri ako gace.\nNk\u2019uko babitangarije Kigali Today, ngo amashyamba akomeje kwangizwa ari ku buso burenga hegitari eshanu, bakaba bibaza uko bazabaho mu minsi iri imbere.\nUmuturage wo mu Murenge wa Jomba, yavuze ko izo nganda zigurira abaturage amababi y\u2019inturusu, bigatera bamwe biganjemo abana kubigira ubucuruzi, kugeza ubwo birara mu mashyamba yabo bakayonona.\nAti \"Tukimara kubona ko abiganjemo abana bakomeje kujya birara mu mashyamba yacu bakayangiza, twegereye ba nyiri inganda tubabwira icyo kibazo, batubwira ko nta kintu babikoraho, badusaba gushyiraho abarinzi barinda amashyamba yacu, tukavuga tuti, ese turashyira abarinzi mu mashyamba bishoboke, bahembwe nande?\".\nArongera ati \"Njye nasanze umwana mu giti hejuru mu bushorishori agikonga, ambonye antera ubwoba ati, niba utagiye ngiye gusimbuka, ukagenda kugira ngo amahoro ahinde kuko ashobora gupfa bakagufunga. Twigeze gufata bamwe tubajyana kuri Polisi, komanda aravuga ngo ntabwo aburanisha ibishagari (amababi y\u2019inturusu), twararize turihanagura\".\nUwo muturage avuga ko uburyo ayo mashyamba ari kwangiza, bigira ingaruka zo kuma kw\u2019ibiti bimwe na bimwe bavuna imitwe.\nAti \"Igiti barakigonda kikagera hasi bakagica umutwe, urumva nta gikurikiraho uretse kuma, ishyamba ryanjye bararikokoye bararirangiza, nigeze kubwira abantu nti, ni muze murebe uburyo ishyamba ryanjye ryangijwe barumirwa, ubu byarandenze, amababi aba akenewe mu ruganda ngo ni ayo ku mitwe y\u2019igiti\".\nMugenzi we wo mu Murenge wa Rurembo ati \"Twakoze imishinga dutera ibiti, mu gihe bitangiye gukura ngo bitubyarire inyungu, bazana inganda ziteka amababi y\u2019inturusu zikayakamura, nta giti cyongeye gukura muri aka gace, baraza bakurira bakabikonda barangiza bakabica n\u2019imitwe igiti kikuma\".\nArongera ati \"Ntaho tutabigejeje, ariko twabuze kivugira, abana bamwe batiga nibo bakokora ibiti byacu bakajya kugurisha abo banyenganda, rwose turasaba ko ibyo bihagarara, ubu abana bari mu biruhuko ho birarenze\".\nAkomeza agira ati \"Ishyamba ryanjye ni igice cya hegitari, nta giti kizima wabonamo, biraduhombya cyane kuko niba narakoze umushinga wo gutera ishyamba abantu bakaryangiza ku nyungu zabo, urumva ni ikibazo\".\nUndi muturage ati \"Abo banyenganda baratuzonze, mu Murenge wa Jomba aho ntuye, inganda zatumazeho amashyamba, baraza bakarikokora wageramo ukibaza niba ari ishyamba bikakuyobera, ariko ikibazo gihari n\u2019uko ubuyobozi usanga busa naho bitabureba, kuko iyo utatse ntabwo bakumva\".\nArongera ati \"Nasanze banyangirije ishyamba mbigeza ku mukozi ushinzwe amashyamba mu Murenge, ati, muzadufatire umwe mumutuzanire tumuhane by\u2019intangarugero, mu minsi ibiri dufata umusore tumujyanyeyo, bati, tugiye gukora raporo, bahita bamurekura arataha\".\nAbo baturage baravuga ko batagambiriye gufungisha izo nganda, gusa bakavuga ko uburenganzira bwabo ku mashyamba yabo nabwo bukwiye kubahirizwa, inganda zigakora ariko n\u2019amashyamba yabo akabungabungwa, dore ko n\u2019ayo mavuta bavuga ko nta kintu abamariye, kuko batamenya icyo akora n\u2019aho agurishirizwa.\nBa nyiri inganda babivugaho iki?\nNyuma y\u2019uko abaturage bagaragaje ikibazo cyabo, Kigali Today yaganiriye n\u2019umwe mu bahagarariye izo nganda witwa Manizabayo Innocent, avuga ko ayo makuru abaturage bavuga atari ukuri.\nAti \"Ibyo abo baturage bavuga ntabwo aribyo, twe tugura amashagari y\u2019abantu batemye ibiti, tukagura n\u2019amashyamba ayo dusaruye amababi akaba ariyo dukoresha, ubwo rero hari abantu bigize abantu utamenya, bakora ibintu by\u2019imitwe\".\nAbajijwe ku bimenyetso abaturage bagaragaza byerekana ko amashyamba yabo yangizwa, yagize ati \"Ubwiwe n\u2019iki ko ataribo babyikorera bakiyangiriza, hari umuntu bafashe baramugaragaza bati, ng\u2019uyu akavuga ko twamwohereje?, wabwirwa n\u2019iki ko abantu bo muri iki gihe bakora ibintu utamenya, ko ashobora kugenda akiyangiriza ngo akunde aguharabike, urumva umuntu yatinyuka agakora bizinesi yo kwangiriza abaturage?\".\nManizabayo yavuze ko bamwe mu baturage bari gukoreshwa kugira ngo bahagarikishe iyo bizinesi, asaba abo baturage kunyura mu nzego z\u2019ubuyobozi.\nAti \"Bamwe mu baturage barakoreshwa ngo basebye ibyo abantu bakora, twe tugurira abantu bakuru ntabwo tugurira abana, n\u2019ubu ngiye gupakurura imodoka y\u2019ahantu twaguze amashagara, naho ibyo ni ababiri inyuma bagenda bagafata abantu bakabagurira inzagwa, barangiza bakagenda baharabika bizinesi z\u2019abantu\".\nIcyo ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere buvuga kuri icyo kibazo\nUbuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Nyabihu buremeza ko buzi izo nganda zikora umushongi mu mababi y\u2019inturusu, gusa ngo ntabwo bwari buzi iyo mikorere mibi yo kwangiza amashyamba y\u2019abaturage.\nUbuyobozi buvuga ko bugiye gukurikirana icyo kibazo, nibusanga ibyo abaturage bavuga ari ukuri, izo nganda zifatirwe ibyemezo, nk\u2019uko Umuyobozi w\u2019Akarere ka Nyabihu wungirije ushinzwe iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu, Habanabakize Jean Claude yabitangarije Kigali Today.\nAti \"Iki kibazo cy\u2019imikorere imeze ityo, cyo ntabwo tukizi ariko icyo tuzi n\u2019uko izo nganda zikamura inturusu zigakoramo umushongi ziriho, harabaho gukurikirana ibijyanye n\u2019imikorere byabo\".\nArongera ati \"Turumva ko iyo mikorere niba koko ari ukuri, ntabwo ihwitse nta n\u2019ubwo byemewe na gato, tugiye kubikurikirana kugira ngo mu by\u2019ukuri ababirimo ababikora gutyo bahanwe nk\u2019uko amategeko abiteganya, turabikurikirana kandi biraza gukemuka niba biriho koko\".\nISHEMA Christian/rw.wipedia.org"}
{"id": "19956", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19956", "title": "Umurenge wa Kisaro", "text": "Umurenge wa Kisaro ni umwe mu mirenge 17 igize Akarere ka Rulindo, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kisaro wari utuwe n'abaturage 23 113. Ugizwe n'utugari 6.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nAkarere ka Rulindo kagizwe n'imirenge 17, utugari 71 n'imidugudu 494. Umurenge wa Kisaro ugizwe n'utugari 6:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kisaro wari utuwe n'abaturage 19 868. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 23 113. Abagabo bari 11 054. Abagore bari 12 059. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19957", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19957", "title": "Ubugeni bwashimiwe", "text": "LeBron James yashimye imyambaro ya Moshions Sudani y\u2019Epfo yaserukanye.\nYanditswe na ISHEMA Christian\nKuya 02 march 2025 saa 10:12 \nYabivuze nyuma y\u2019ubutumwa bwatambukijwe ku rubuga rwa \u2018LeagueFits\u2019, bugaragaza ko Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu ya Sudani y\u2019Epfo yitabiriye imikino Olempike 2024 yambaye neza.\nMu bitekerezo byatanzwe kuri aya amafoto yashyizwe kuri uru rubuga aherekejwe n\u2019ubutumwa, LeBron James, yanditse agaragaza ko aba basore bari bambaye neza.\nAti \u201cAbahungu basa neza.\u2019\u2019\nUbwo imikino ya Olempike yatangiraga abinyujije ku mbuga nkoranyambaga ze, Turahirwa Moses yagaragaje ko yishimiye kuba ari we wambitse Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu ya Basketball ya Sudani y\u2019Epfo.\nAti \u201cDutewe ishema no kugera i Paris aho twambitse Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu ya Sudani y\u2019Epfo yitabiriye Imikino Olempike, imyenda yose yahanzwe inakorwa na Moshions.\u201d\nIkipe y\u2019Igihugu ya Sudani y\u2019Epfo iherutse guca igikuba nyuma yo gutsindwa bigoranye na Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika amanota 101 kuri 100 mu mukino wa gicuti bakinnye bitegura imikino Olempike.\nImikino Olempike yatangijwe ku mugaragaro mu muhango wabaye ku wa Gatanu, tariki 26 Nyakanga 2024 i Paris mu Bufaransa ku mugezi wa Seine.\nNi ku nshuro ya 33 iyi mikino igiye gukinwa mu mpeshyi kuva habaye iya mbere i Ath\u00e8nes mu Bugereki mu 1896.\nLeBron James yishimiye imyambaro Moshions yambitse Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu ya Sudani y\u2019Epfo\nAbakinnyi ba Sudani y'Epfo mu myambaro ya Moshions\nBasketball: Lebron James yujuje amanota ibihumbi 40\nIbi Lebron James yabikoze mu ijoro ryo Ku wa Gatandatu rishyira iryo Ku Cyumeru, tariki 3 Gashyatare 2024 ubwo ikipe ya Los Angeles Lakers akinira yatsindwaga iwa yo kuri Crypto Arena na Denver Nuggets amanota 124-114.\nMuri uyu mukino Lebron James yitwaye neza kuko yatsinze amanota 26 amugira uwa kabiri watsinze menshi nyuma ya Nikol Jokic ukinira Denver Nuggets watsinze 29 aho uyu mugabo w\u2019imyaka 39 kandi yanabaye umukinnyi mwiza (MVP) bitewe n\u2019amateka yari akoze ndetse binamugira mwiza kuko ayo manota yatsinze yose yaje ava inyuma dore ko ikipe ye yari yarushijwe.\nByamusabye gutsinda amanota ari hejuru 9 kugirango yuzuze amanota ibihumbi 40 kuko yagiye mu mukino ariyo abura ngo akore aka gahigo ndetse akomeze kuyobora uru rutomde rwa\u2019abakinnyi batsinze amanota menshi muri rusange barimo Kareem Abdul-Jabbar, Stephen Curry ndetse na Kobe Bryant.\nLebron James ubwo yari amaze guca kuri Kareem Abdul-Jabbar ina we wahoze akinira Los Angeles Lakers wari afite amanota ibihumbi 38 338 nibwo yatangajeko yifuza kuzuza amanota ibihumbi 40 ndetse byaba byiza akayarenza.\nUsibye kandi kuzuza amanota ibihumbi 40, Lebron James yabaye umukinnyi wa kane watanze imipira myinshi ivamo amanota (Assists) nyuma yo kuzuza ibihumbi 10,akaba aza inyuma ya John Stock wa mbere ufite ibihumbi 15, Jason Kid ufite ibihumbi 12, Paul Chris ufite ibihumbi 11.\nLebron James kandi yujuje gukina imipira ya kabiri ibihumbi 10 (Rebounds) ikinwa iyo umukinnyi yugarira cyangwa asatira atsinda byahise bimushyira byibuze mu bakinnyi 25 bakoze ako gahigo.Mu manota ibihumbi 40, yatsinze 23,119 muri Cleverland Cavaliers, atsinda 7,919 muri Miami Heat ahatsindira ibihumbi 8,979.\nUtu duhigo turaza twiyongera ku mateka amwe n\u2019amwe yagira kora arimo; gutwara ibikombe 4 bya shampiyona (NBA), ndeste aba umukinnyi wa shampiyona inshuro 3 (MVP).\nISHEMA Christian/rw.wikipedia.org"}
{"id": "19958", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19958", "title": "Umurenge wa Rubaya", "text": "Umurenge wa Rubaya ni umwe mu mirenge 21 igize Akarere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rubaya wari utuwe n'abaturage 12 044. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nAkarere ka Gicumbi kagizwe n'imirenge 21. Umurenge wa Rubaya ni umwe muri yo.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rubaya wari utuwe n'abaturage 10 509. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 12 044. Abagabo bari 5 801. Abagore bari 6 243.\nAbaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19959", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19959", "title": "Umurenge wa Mukarange", "text": "Umurenge wa Mukarange ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y\u2019Iburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda. Umujyi wa Kayonza n\u2019icyicaro cy\u2019Akarere ka Kayonza biherereye muri uyu murenge.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mukarange wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 54 818.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nAkarere ka Kayonza kagizwe n\u2019imirenge 12, utugari 50 n\u2019imidugudu 421. Umurenge wa Mukarange ugizwe n\u2019utugari 5:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mukarange wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 42 055. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 54 818. Abagore bari 28 074. Abagabo bari 26 744.\nAbaturage 29 476 bari batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 25 342 bari batuye mu cyaro. Abari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15 bari 20 896. Abafite hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 64 bari 32 271. Abafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga bari 1 651.\nUbukungu.\nUbuhinzi n\u2019ubucuruzi ni bimwe mu bikorwa by\u2019ubukungu muri Mukarange. Muri uyu murenge hubatswe ububiko, ubwanikiro n\u2019ubwumishirizo bw\u2019imyaka. Ibyo bikorwa remezo bigamije kugabanya umusaruro wangirika nyuma yo gusarura. Bigamije kandi kongera agaciro k\u2019ibikomoka ku buhinzi."}
{"id": "19960", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19960", "title": "Umurenge wa Murama", "text": "Umurenge wa Murama ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Murama wari utuwe n'abaturage 23 381.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Murama ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Kayonza. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 69,06.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Murama wari utuwe n'abaturage 19 945. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 23 381. Abagabo bari 11 169. Abagore bari 12 212. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19961", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19961", "title": "Umurenge wa Ndego", "text": "Umurenge wa Ndego ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Ndego wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 24 389. Uri ku mupaka wa Tanzaniya.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Ndego ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 177,1. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari tune: Byimana, Isangano, Karambi na Kiyovu.\nUhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Mwiri mu majyaruguru. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Rwinkwavu n\u2019Umurenge wa Kabare mu burengerazuba. Uhana imbibi na Tanzaniya mu burasirazuba. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Akarere ka Kirehe mu majyepfo. Mu murenge hari ibiyaga bya Rwakibali na Nasho.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Ndego wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 18 918. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 24 389. Abagabo bari 11 908. Abagore bari 12 481. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19962", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19962", "title": "Umurenge wa Kayenzi", "text": "Umurenge wa Kayenzi ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kamonyi, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kayenzi wari utuwe n'abaturage 25 209. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Kayenzi ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Kamonyi.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kayenzi wari utuwe n'abaturage 22 787. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 25 209. Abagabo bari 12 289. Abagore bari 12 920.\nMu 2022, abari hagati y'imyaka 0 na 14 bari 8 559. Abari hagati y'imyaka 15 na 64 bari 14 982. Abari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga bari 1 631.\nAbaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "19963", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19963", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyamirama", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyamirama ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y\u2019Iburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 4.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyamirama wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 38 562. Abenshi muri bo batuye mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAho uherereye.\nUmurenge wa Nyamirama uhana imbibi n\u2019imirenge ya Mukarange, Mwiri, Rwinkwavu, Kabarondo na Ruramira. Iyo mirenge iri mu Karere ka Kayonza. Uhana kandi imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Muhazi wo mu Akarere ka Rwamagana. Uri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 600 hafi.\nUtugari.\nAkarere ka Kayonza kagizwe n\u2019imirenge 12, utugari 50 n\u2019imidugudu 421. Umurenge wa Nyamirama ugizwe n\u2019utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyamirama wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 30 528. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 38 562.\nAbagabo bari 18 342. Abagore bari 20 220. Abaturage 37 787 bari batuye mu cyaro. Abaturage 775 bari batuye mu mujyi. Abari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15 bari 15 207. Abafite hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 64 bari 21 679. Abafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga bari 1 676."}
{"id": "19965", "revid": "15569", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19965", "title": "Ibishanga", "text": "Igishanga ni ahantu hasanzwe hari ubutaka bw'ibirunga cyangwa ibishanga, bukunze kuba hafi y'imigezi, aho amazi menshi yagiye akusanyirizwa cyangwa atembera mu buryo bwa gakondo. Aho hantu, ubutaka buba bwarahumye cyangwa bufite ubushyuhe, kandi amazi yaho ashyira mu bikorwa ibikorwa byo guhinga cyangwa gukoresha ibyo bikorwaremezo mu buryo bw'ubuhinzi.\nMu Rwanda, igishanga kenshi kijyanye n'ubuhinzi bw'imbuto, imyaka cyangwa ibindi byihariye. Igishanga gikunze kuba ahantu habonetse ibintu byinshi bihuza ubutaka n'amazi, bigatuma abantu babikoresha mu guhinga no kongera umusaruro w'ubuhinzi.\nMinisteri y'Ibidukikije irashimangira ko hari ibindi bishanga 5 bigiye gutunganywa kugira ngo Umujyi wa Kigali ukomeze kugira isura nziza ariko irengera ibidukikije ari na ko abantu barushaho kugira ahantu henshi ho kuruhukira.\nNi mu gihe abatuye mu murwa w\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019abawugenda ndetse n'abarengera ibidukikije, bashima intambwe yatewe hashyirwaho icyanya gifasha abantu kuruhuka no kwidagadura cya Nyandungu.\nMu masaha y'agasusuruko, icyanya cya Nyandungu kimaze icyumweru gifunguwe abantu barimo kugisura. Mu magana y'abarimo kuhatemberera harimo n'itsinda ry'abana biga mu ishuri ribanza rya Source du Savoirs bavuga ko ari bwo bwa mbere basuye pariki ndetse akaba ari inyungu ikomeye mu bijyanye no kwiyungura ubumenyi n'amateka ubusanzwe basoma mu bitabo gusa.\nIngeri nyinshi z'abasura iyi pariki baba baje kuruhuka, kuganira, gusura ibyiza bitatse iyi pariki birimo ubwoko bw'inyoni n'ibiti; ibi bikaba ari inyungu ikomeye ku batabasha kujya gusura pariki zisanzwe kuko zitaruye Umujyi wa Kigali.\nAbanyamahanga basura u Rwanda bavuga ko kongera ibyanya bitunganije ndetse byanasurwa bifite inyungu ikomeye ku bikorwa by'ubukerarugendo by'umwihariko ku batuye mu mujyi.\u201d"}
{"id": "19967", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19967", "title": "Umurenge wa Kigarama (Kicukiro)", "text": "Mu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUMURENGE WA KIGARAMA ni imwe mu mirenge igize Akarere ka Kicukiro mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nKigarama iri mu bice by'iburasirazuba bwa Kigali, ikaba igizwe n'imidugudu itandukanye. Ni ahantu haturanye n'imirenge nka Niboye, Gikondo, na Kabuye.\nKigarama ni umurenge wateye imbere mu bijyanye n'ubucuruzi, ibikorwa by'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi, ndetse n'ibikorwa remezo nka amazi, amashanyarazi n'ibikorwa by'uburezi. Uyu murenge kandi urafite ibikorwa byinshi by'iterambere ku rwego rw'umujyi wa Kigali.\nHari byinshi byagiye bikorwa muri Kigarama, harimo imihanda mishya, amahugurwa atandukanye ku baturage ndetse n'ibikorwa by'ubwuzuzanye mu bice bitandukanye by'ubuzima.\nMu Murenge wa Kigarama, hari ibikorwa remezo byinshi byateye imbere mu myaka yashize, bigamije guteza imbere imibereho myiza y'abaturage ndetse no kubafasha kugira ubuzima bwiza. Bimwe muri ibyo bikorwa remezo birimo:"}
{"id": "19968", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19968", "title": "Umurenge wa Rwinkwavu", "text": "Umurenge wa Rwinkwavu ni umwe mu mirenge igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda.\nMu 2022, uyu murenge wari utuwe n'abaturage 36 774. Uzwiho ubucukuzi bwa gasegereti. Ibitaro by'Akarere bya Rwinkwavu biri muri uyu murenge.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Rwinkwavu ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 92,32. Uri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 425 ugereranyije.\nUmurenge ugizwe n'utugari tune: Gihinga, Mbarara, Mukoyoyo na Nkondo.\nUhana imbibi n'Umurenge wa Mwiri mu majyaruguru. Uhana imbibi n'Umurenge wa Kabare mu burasirazuba. Uhana imbibi n'Umurenge wa Murama mu majyepfo. Uhana imbibi n'Umurenge wa Kabarondo mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba. Uhana imbibi n'Umurenge wa Nyamirama mu burengerazuba.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rwinkwavu wari ufite abaturage 36 774. Abagabo bari 17 822. Abagore bari 18 952. Mu 2012, abaturage bari 28 225. Hagati ya 2012 na 2022, abaturage biyongereye ku kigero cya 2,7 % buri mwaka. Mu 2022, ubucucike bwari abantu 398 kuri km\u00b2. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nUbukungu.\nUmurenge wa Rwinkwavu uzwiho ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro. Hacukurwa gasegereti. Ibirombe bya gasegereti biri ku buso bwa hegitari zirenga 2 000. Ibyo birombe biri mu mirenge ya Rwinkwavu, Rukara na Mwiri. Bikoresha abakozi barenga 800. Ubucukuzi butemewe n'amategeko ni ikibazo muri aka gace.\nUbuvuzi.\nIbitaro by'Akarere bya Rwinkwavu biri muri uyu murenge. Umuryango Partners In Health ukorera mu Rwanda kuva mu 2005. Mu Rwanda, uwo muryango witwa Inshuti Mu Buzima. Ufasha Ibitaro by'Akarere bya Rwinkwavu. Mu 2005, aka gace kari gafite ikigo nderabuzima kimwe gusa. Nta muganga wari uhari.\nUbwikorezi.\nUmuhanda w'igihugu NR25 unyura mu gice cy'iburasirazuba cy'umurenge. Umuhanda w'akarere uwuvaho ugana mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba."}
