{"id": "19972", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19972", "title": "Tyla", "text": "\u00a0Tyla Laura Seethal (wavutse 30 Mutarama 2002), uzwi ku izina rya Tyla, ni umuririmbyi akaba n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo. Imiterere ye ya muzika irangwa no guhuza injyana ya pop na amapiano, ibitangazamakuru bimwandikaho kenshi bikunze kumwita \" Umwamikazi wa Popiano \".\nTyla yavukiye kandi akurira i Johannesburg, nyuma yo gushyira hanze indirimbo ye ya mbere yise \" Getting Late \" igakundwa ahagana mu 2021 yagiranye amasezerano na Epic Records agamije ubufatanye mu bikorwa bye bya muzika. Yamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga nyuma yo gusohora indirimbo ye 2023 yise \" Water \", yinjiye mu ndirimbo icumi zabaye iza mbere mu bihugu byinshi birimo Afurika y'Epfo akomokamo, Ubwongereza na Amerika. Indirimbo ye \"Water\" niyo ndirimbo yambere y'umuhanzikazi wo muri Afrika yepfo yinjiye kurutonde rwitwa \"\"Billboard\" Hot 100\" yo muri Amerika mumyaka 55 byanamuhesheje igihembo cyambere cya 'Grammy Award' kitwa mu rurimi rwicyongereza 'Best African Music Performance'. Iyi ndirimbo yabanjirije alubumu ye ya mbere yise [2024], yasohotse mu rwego rwo gushimwa no gutsinda mu bucuruzi buciriritse, yinjiye no mu mizingo 25 igezweho mu bihugu byinshi bitandukanye biirimo na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika.\nTyla ni we muhanzi muto kurusha abandi bo muri Afurika wabayeho wegukanye igihembo cya Grammy Award. Ibindi bihembo yahawe birimo MTV Video Music Award, BET Awards ebyiri, MTV Europe Music Awards eshatu, ndetse n'igihembo cy'icyubahiro cya Global Force Award mu muhango wa mbere wa Billboard R&amp;B's No. 1's. Yanatorewe ibihembo bitandukanye harimo Brit Award, Ivor Novello Award, Soul Train Music Award, ndetse n'ibihembo icyenda bya South African Music Awards.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nTyla Laura Seethal yavutse ku wa 30 Mutarama 2002 i Edenvale, muri Gauteng, mu muryango mugari w'Abahindi Indo-Mauritian, Zulu, n'umuryango w'abakomoka muri Irilande. Yakuriye i Johannesburg, muri Gauteng, arangiza amashuri yisumbuye muri Edenglen mu wa 2019, aho yari umuyobozi w\u2019umuco. Tyla afite abavandimwe 3, mukuru we, Whitney, na murumunawe na mushiki we muto, Tyrese na Sydney.\nMu mwaka wa nyuma w'amashuri yisumbuye, yatangiye gukora umwuga wa muzika, agashyira indirimbo z'umwimerere n'izisubiwemo kuri rukuta rwe rwa Instagram ari nako ashakisha cyane amahirwe ashoboka ngo agere ku iterambere rirambye mu muziki. Yaje kubonywa n'umuntu wa mbere wagombaga kureberera inyungu ze mu bya muzika, Garth von Glehn, wateguye amasomo ye ya mbere yo gufata amajwi. Tyla yavuze ko buri weekend m'umwaka wa nyuma w'amashuri ye yisumbuye yayimaraga muri studio afata amajwi y'indirimbo. \nCareer.\n2019\u20132022: 'Getting Late' n'ibyo yagezeho k'urwego rw\u2019igihugu..\nMu mpera za 2019, nyuma yo kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye, Tyla yasohoye indirimbo ye ya mbere \"Getting Late\" mu buryo bwigenga, ifite umusaruro wa Kooldrink, maze imuha kumenyekana mu gihugu. Video yayo yashowemo imari na manaja we mu bihe bya gumamurugo by'icyorezo cya COVID-19, ikaza gusohoka muri Mutarama 2021. Iyo video yarebwe na za miliyoni z'abantu nyinshi kuri YouTube, kandi yaje gutoranywa mu bihembo bya South African Music Award muri 2022 mu cyiciro cya Video nziza y\u2019umwaka.\nIcyo gihe kandi, yari arimo kwiga ibijyanye n'ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro (Mining), ariko nyuma yo kumvisha ababyeyi be no kurira cyane, bemeye kumwemerera gusubika amasomo ye ya kaminuza kugira ngo agerageze kuzamura umwuga we w\u2019umuziki. Nyuma yaho, muri Gicurasi 2021, yasinyanye amasezerano na Epic Records binyuze mu bufatanye na Fax Records yo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Nyuma y\u2019iyo ndirimbo ye ya mbere, yasohoye indirimbo \"Overdue\" mu Ukwakira 2021 na \"To Last\" mu Ugushyingo 2022.\n2023 - kugeza ubu: Iterambere mpuzamahanga hamwe na \"Water\".\nMuri 2023, Tyla yakoze igitaramo cye cya mbere ku mugaragaro mu birori bya Dolce &amp; Gabbana byabaye nyuma ya Milan Fashion Week, nyuma yo gusohora indirimbo ye \"Been Thinking\", yahaye Tyla imyanya ye ya mbere ku manota ya \"Billboard Mainstream R&amp;B/Hip-Hop Airplay\" na \"Rhythmic Airplay charts\". Heven Haile wa Pitchfork yayisobanuye nk'indirimbo y\u2019uburanga yo mu birori, ifite umwuka w\u2019indirimbo z'urukundo za pop-R&amp;B z\u2019imyaka ya 2000 nka Ciara na Rihanna. Nyuma yaho, Tyla yifatanyije na Chris Brown nk\u2019umuhanzi ufungura urugendo rwe rw'ibitaramo \"Under the Influence Tour\". Muri Gicurasi 2023, yasohoye indirimbo \"Girl Next Door\" afatanyije na Ayra Starr wo muri Nijeriya. Muri Nyakanga 2023, yasohoye indirimbo \"Water\" nk\u2019indirimbo iyoboye album ye ya mbere yitwa Tyla. Nyuma yo kuzamura akarasisi k'imbyino kuri TikTok, \"Water\" yabaye iyambere mu bihugu bitandukanye birimo Afurika y\u2019Epfo, Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, n\u2019Ubwongereza. Tyla yabaye umuhanzi wa mbere ukiri muto wo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo winjiye ku rutonde rwa US Billboard Hot 100 nyuma y\u2019imyaka 55, nyuma y\u2019indirimbo \"Grazing in the Grass\" ya Hugh Masekela mu 1968.\nTyla yaririmbye \"Water\" muri The Bianca Show muri Suwede no muri \"The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\" muri Amerika. Video yayo yasohotse ku wa 6 Ukwakira 2023, irebwa n'abarenga miliyoni 3 kuri YouTube mu minsi itatu gusa. Tyla yaje gukora kuri remix y\u2019indirimbo \"Girls Need Love\" ya Summer Walker, yasohotse muri Girls Mix extended play muri Ukwakira 2023. Mu mpera za Ukuboza 2023, yatangaje ko album ye ya mbere yitwa Tyla (2024) igiye gusohoka, anasohora indirimbo eshatu: \"Truth or Dare\", \"On and On\", na \"Butterflies\" nk\u2019indirimbo z\u2019ibanze zo kwamamaza iyi album. Tyla yaririmbye indirimbo nka \"Water\" na \"Truth or Dare\" mu musozo wa Season 24 ya The Voice ku wa 19 Ukuboza 2023. Muri Gashyantare 2024, yatsindiye igihembo cya mbere cya Grammy Award mu cyiciro cya Best African Music Performance bigizwemo uruhare n'indirimbo ye \"Water\", aba n\u2019umuhanzi ukiri muto wa mbere w\u2019Afurika wegukanye Grammy Award.\nAlbum ye yitwa Tyla yasohotse ku wa 22 Werurwe 2024 binyuze kuri Fax na Epic Records. Video y\u2019indirimbo \"Art\" yasohokeye icyarimwe n\u2019iyi album. Tyla yakiriwe neza n\u2019abasesenguzi b\u2019umuziki, maze album ye iba mu 25 za mbere mu bihugu bitandukanye birimo Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, Ubwongereza, u Buholandi, Noruveji, Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande, n\u2019Ubusuwisi. Tyla yabonye amahirwe menshi yo gutoranywa mu bihembo bya Metro FM Music Awards muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo, aho yahawe amahirwe atandatu. Nyuma yaho, yegukanye ibihembo byinshi mu 2024 BET Awards, anganya na Usher na Victoria Mon\u00e9t i Los Angeles, aho yagaragaye mu imbyino ya \"Jump\" bwa mbere hamwe na Gunna na Skillibeng. Ku wa 11 Ukwakira 2024, Tyla yasohoye album ye ya mbere mu buryo bwa deluxe edition, irimo indirimbo eshatu nshya, harimo \"Push 2 Start\". Mu buryo bw\u2019umuziki, \"Push 2 Start\" ni indirimbo ya reggae yifitemo injyana ya amapiano pop-R&amp;B, yakiriwe neza n\u2019abakunzi b\u2019umuziki, video yayo ikaza gusohoka kuri YouTube ku wa 8 Ugushyingo 2024. Tyla yatanze ibitaramo muri Victoria's Secret Fashion Show 2024. Ku wa 11 Ugushyingo 2024, yagaragaye bwa mbere muri MTV Europe Music Awards (EMAs), aho yaririmbye indirimbo \"Push 2 Start\" na \"Water\". Icyi gihe, yatsindiye ibihembo 3 bya EMAs mu byiciro bya \u2018Best African Act\u2019, \u2018Best Afrobeats Artist\u2019 na \u2018Best R&amp;B Artist\u2019. Ku wa 28 Gashyantare, Tyla yagaragaye mu ndirimbo \"When I'm With You\" iri kuri album \"Alter Ego\" ya Lisa, umuraperi wo muri Tayilande.\nUbuhanzi.\nTyla akura ikitegererezo k'ubahanzi barimo Michael Jackson, Rihanna, Britney Spears, Drake, Wizkid, Freshlyground, Aaliyah na Cassie. Yavuze ko inzozi ze ari ukuba icyamamare cya mbere ku isi kiririmba injyana ya \"Pop\" kiva muri Afurika. Kuva icyo gihe yatangiye gufatwaga nk'\"Umwamikazi wa Popiano\", guhuza injyana ya pop na amapiano, yashizwemo bimwe mubifitanye isano n'injyana zirimo R&amp;B na Afrobeats. "}
{"id": "19973", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19973", "title": "Ayra Starr", "text": "Sarah Oyinkansola Aderibigbe Sarah Oyinkansola Aderibigbe (wavutse ku ya 14 Kamena 2002), uzwi cyane nka Ayra Starr, ni umuririmbyi akaba n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo wo muri Nijeriya. Yamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu mwaka wa 2022 ubwo yasohoraga indirimbo \u201cRush\u201d. Iyo ndirimbo yagiye ku rutonde rw\u2019indirimbo zikunzwe mu bihugu bitandukanye birimo Ubusuwisi, Irilande n\u2019Ubwongereza, aho yageze ku mwanya wa 24. Yanamuhesheje kandi guhabwa nominasiyo mu bihembo bya Grammy ku nshuro ya 66 nk\u2019umunyafurika witwaye neza. \nMu ntangiriro za 2021, Starr yatangiye umwuga we asohora umuzingo wambere windirimbo wiswe Ayra Starr ndetse nindirimbo yambere yari iriho yise \" Away \", yamaze ibyumweru bibiri bikurikiranye kuri numero ya kane kurutonde rwa TurnTable Top 50 ya Nijeriya; iyi indirimbo kandi yageze ku mwanya wa 17 kuri Billboard Top Triller Global chart. Yakurikiwe no kumurika alubumu ye ya mbere ya studio, 19 &amp; Dangerous (2021). yashyizwe mu byiciro nka Afropop na R&amp;B, yakiriwe neza kandi itanga ibyiciro bibiri bya mbere muri Nijeriya. Indirimbo ya mbere yise \" Umusamariya uva amaraso \" yageze ku mbonerahamwe ya Top 50, iba indirimbo ya mbere y\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019umugore igeze ku mwanya wa mbere. Muri Kanama muri uwo mwaka, Starr yashyizwe ku mwanya wa gatatu ku bahanzi bitezwe muri Billboard. \nMuri 2024, Starr yasohoye alubumu ye ya kabiri, \"Umwaka nujuje imyaka 21\".\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nOyinkansola Sarah Aderibigbe yavutse ku ya 14 Kamena 2002 i Cotonou muri B\u00e9nin, akurira aho no muri i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Ni Umunyanijeriyakazi wo mumuco waba Yoruba, hamwe n'ababyeyi bombi bo muri Leta ya Kwara. Yakuriye mu ndimi nyinshi, yiga Yoruba kandi yiga n'Igifaransa mu myaka ye ya mbere i B\u00e9nin, azi kandi neza icyongereza nururimi rwa Nigeriya Pidgin akoresha kenshi mu mirimo ye no mu mikoranire y'abanyamakuru. Umuryango we wimutse kenshi bitewe nubucuruzi bwa se, byatumye bigorana kurema ubucuti burambye nabandi bana mumashuri yisumbuye. Aderibigbe ni uwa kabiri mu bana batanu. Mukuru we Dami (wavutse 2000) yabaye umucuranzi wa gitari na nutunganya umuziki; barumuna be barimo Ade, Tolulope, na Jesutunmise. Umuziki wari ingenzi mubuzima bwumuryango. Nyina, wahoze ari umuririmbyi, na Dami bagize uruhare rukomeye mukubagenderaho. Afite imyaka icumi, yinjiye muri korari y'ishuri atangira kwandika indirimbo hamwe na Dami, bayobowe na nyina na nyirasenge. Abavandimwe be nabo bashinze itsinda kandi bahoraga binjira mumarushanwa yumuziki waho bari batuye. \nNubwo Aderibigbe yakundaga ubuhanzi akiri ingimbi, ise yari yaramusabye gushyira imbere amasomo mbere yuko apfa. Yize muri kaminuza Cours Sonou muri Cotonou ahabwa impamyabumenyi ya BA mu mibanire mpuzamahanga na siyanse ya politiki. Mu myaka ya kaminuza, yakunze gutotezwa nabanyeshuri bigana kubera imyaka ye ndetse nisura. Kugira ngo ahangane n'ibyiyumvo yagize byo gutukwa, yitabaje umuziki. \"Numvaga Nicki Minaj ngiye ku ishuri maze nkumva meze nka Nicki Minaj wa kabiri.\" Nyina wa Aderibigbe yashyigikiraga cyane ibyifuzo bye bya muzika kandi buri gihe yamushishikarizaga gukora umwuga wo kuririmba. \n2018\u20132020: Intangiriro yumwuga.\nUbunararibonye bwa Starr bwarimo guhatana akiri umwana kuri televiziyo ya Nigeriya yerekana impano ya \"Maltina Dance All\", aho yarangije ku mwanya wa kabiri kandi yatsindiye televiziyo nk'igihembo, ibyo umuryango we wabonaga ari ikimenyetso cyerekana impano ye hakiri kare. Mu myaka y\u2019ishuri, yakoze mashup ibyitwa nko kuvanga indirimbo ebyiri arizo One Direction '\" Inkuru y'Ubuzima Bwanjye \" na \" Sade \" ya Adekunle Gold mu gitaramo cy'ishuri. Nk\u2019uko Starr abitangaza ngo iki gitaramo cyateye ababyeyi n'abarimu amarira, maze ashishikarizwa gufatana uburemere umuziki, ibyo bikaba byararanze ibyo yaje kuvuga ko ari \"itangiriro\". Muri 2018, Starr yasinyanye na Quove Models, ikigo gishinzwe kwerekana imideli i Lagos. Nyuma yaje kwigana ibigo nka Studio ya Mazelle, Ikinyamakuru cyuzuye cyimyambarire, na Esperanza Woman. Nyuma yaje kuvuga ko umuziki n\u2019imyambarire ari inyungu zuzuzanya byaje bisanzwe kuri we. \nMuri icyo gihe kimwe, yatangiye no guteza imbere umwuga we wo kuririmba binyuze kuri murandasi. Muri 2019, yatangiye gushyira hanze indirimbo zisubiyemo b zabahanzi nka Andra Day na 2Face Idibia kumbuga nkoranyambaga. Muri uwo mwaka, Starr yanakinnye mu gitaramo cy\u2019imivugo aho yerekanaga amashusho ya Jorja Smith \" Ntunyitegereze ndira \", yibutsa ko bamwe mu bari bateraniye aho barize mu gihe cye. Yahisemo izina rya stage \"Ayra Starr\" kubera ko ryasobanuraga \"gukanguka no guhumura amaso,\" kandi agaragara mu mashusho y\u2019indirimbo ya Eri Ife yise\" Umugore w'ejo hazaza.Nubwo yakomeje kwamamara kuri murandasi ntiyakomeje gushidikanya ku bijyanye no gukurikirana umuziki ndetse anatekereza ku micungire y\u2019umuziki kugira ngo ashyigikire amashusho y\u2019umuvandimwe we Dami. Nkumuntu warukiri kwiga, yashimwe, byatumye abarimu bamutangarira kubona amashusho ye muri telephone zabo yakozwe nikigo cyumuziki gikorera abahanzi bazwi nka Di'Ja na Korede Bello. \nOther ventures.\nSarah Oyinkansola Aderibigbe Sarah Oyinkansola Aderibigbe (wavutse ku ya 14 Kamena 2002), uzwi cyane nka Ayra Starr, ni umuririmbyi n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo wo muri Nijeriya. Yamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu 2022 ubwo yasohoraga indirimbo \u201cRush\u201d. Iyo ndirimbo yagiye ku rutonde rw\u2019indirimbo zikunzwe mu bihugu bitandukanye birimo Ubusuwisi, Irilande n\u2019Ubwongereza, aho yageze ku mwanya wa 24. Yanamuhesheje kandi guhabwa nominasiyo mu bihembo bya Grammy ku nshuro ya 66 nk\u2019umunyafurika witwaye neza. \nMu ntangiriro za 2021, Starr yatangiye umwuga we asohora umuzingo wambere windirimbo wiswe Ayra Starr ndetse nindirimbo yambere yari iriho yise \" Away \", yamaze ibyumweru bibiri bikurik