ra kuri murandasi ntiyakomeje gushidikanya ku bijyanye no gukurikirana umuziki ndetse anatekereza ku micungire y\u2019umuziki kugira ngo ashyigikire amashusho y\u2019umuvandimwe we Dami. Nkumuntu warukiri kwiga, yashimwe, byatumye abarimu bamutangarira kubona amashusho ye muri telephone zabo yakozwe nikigo cyumuziki gikorera abahanzi bazwi nka Di'Ja na Korede Bello. \nUkuboza 2019, Starr yashyize ahagaragara indirimbo yumwimerere yitwa \"Ibyangiritse\" kurupapuro rwe rwa Instagram. Mu masaha atatu, uwashinze Mavin Don Jazzy yamwoherereje ubutumwa butaziguye bugaragaza ko ashimishijwe n'umuziki we kandi amutumira guhura. Nyuma Starr yabibonye yari kurya ibinyampeke maze abonye ubutumwa avuza induru yishimye, nuko nyirasenge amufasha gutanga igisubizo. Don Jazzy yavumbuye page ye abinyujije kumuntu wamukurikinaga kumbuga nkoranyambaga wakundaga gusangiza abandi ibihangano byabahanzi bakiri bato. Abonye ubutumwa bwe bwa mbere butabonye igisubizo, yamuvugishije abinyujije kuri musaza we. Isomo rya mbere rya Starr kuri Studiyo ya Mavin kwari ukumenyekanisha amajwi yabigize umwuga. Yiyemereye ko yari afite ubwoba bwinshi muri ibyo bihe; we na murumuna we bizihizaga bucece igihe cyose Don Jazzy yabaga avuye mucyumba, hanyuma akongera guhimba agarutse. Nyuma yaje gutekereza ku miterere ya Mavin nkumuryango aho gushingira ku bucuruzi., muri 2020 yafatiye amajwi muri Studiyo ya Mavin i Lagos hamwe na ba producer Louddaaa, Don Jazzy, na Dayogrey. \nUmuzingo wambere yikoreye yise umukino wa wagutse wasohotse ku ya 22 Mutarama 2021 abinyujije kuri Mavin Records. yasobanuwe nk \"amateka y\u2019urukundo cyangwa ibihe bishingiye ku rukundo\" kandi \"ahuza ibintu bya R&amp;amp;B / neo-roho na Afropop percussion.\" Starr yavuze ko icyifuzo cye muri aya majwi ari ugukora umuziki uzumvikana n'abumva ndetse n'abakuru. Kuvanga no kumenya neza umuzingo wizo ndirimbo byakozwe na Ikon, Louddaaa na Johnny Drille. Starr yanditse imwe mu ndirimbo kuri uwo muzingo wenyine kandi afatanya kwandika eyne zisigaye hamwe na murumuna we Dami. Nyuma gato yo gusohoka, uwo muzingo wabaye alubumu ya mbere kuri Nigeriya iTunes na Apple Music. Kugeza muri Werurwe 2021, wageze ku mwanya umwe kuri Apple Music mu bindi bihugu 4, yumvwa munshuro zirenga miliyoni 15 muri Spotify, YouTube na Audio Mack. Uyu mushinga wabyaye inzira \" Away \" wageze ku mwanya wa kane kuri TurnTable Top 50 yo muri Nijeriya na 17 muri Amerika Billboard Top Triller Global. Amashusho y'indirimbo ayiherekeza kandi yerekanwe ku rubuga rwa MTV Base rwa \"Naija\" Top 10 \".\" Starr yasohoye verisiyo ya remix ya \"Ija\" na \" Away \" irimo Tokimonsta na Lilo hagati ya Werurwe na Mata. Muri kiriya gihe kimwe, Umuzingo \"Twelve AM\" ya Crayon wasohotse hamwe nijwi rye mundirimbo \"Muri Sync.\" Yakinnye muri \" UC Berkeley \" Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanyeshuri bo muri Nijeriya ryerekana umuco wiswe Olori Awards. Muri Mata 2021, amashusho y\u2019indirimbo ye \"DITR\" yasohotse kuri YouTube abinyujije kuri Mavin. Muri Kamena 2021, hasohotse amashusho yindirimbo yindi ndirimbo yitwa \"Sare\". Amashusho yindirimbo yombi yayobowe na Afolabi Olalekan.\nKu ya 11 Nyakanga 2021, Starr yaririmbye shampiyona yanyuma ya \"Nigeriya Idol\". Ku ya 6 Kanama 2021, Album ye ya mbere ya studio, yise \"19 &amp;amp; Dangerous\" yashyizwe ahagaragara. Kuri iyi alubumu, yakoranye na bagenzi be bahoze bakorana Louddaaa na Don Jazzy, bombi bakaba baragize uruhare mu gutanga umusaruro kuri EP \"Ayra Starr\", ndetse n'abafatanyabikorwa bashya, London na Andre Vibez. Iyi alubumu yerekanye bwa mbere gufatanwa amajwi hamwe nabahanzi babatumirwa nka Foushe\u00e9 na CKay. Yahuye niyakirwa ryiza hamwe nabashima benshi amajwi yayo nkayambere muri Afropop na R&amp;B. Yabyaye ibitego bibiri bya mbere mirongo ine kuri \"TurnTable\" Top 50, isumba izindi ni \" Umusamariya Wamaraso \", iyo indirimbo yonyine, yabaye iya Starr ya mbere ya mbere ku mbonerahamwe. Indirimbo yazamutse muri Top 50 mu byumweru byinshi, kandi, ku mbonerahamwe yo ku ya 27 Nzeri 2021, yageze ku mwanya wa mbere, bituma Starr aba umuhanzi w'umugore wa mbere ubikora ufite indirimbo wenyine. ' [\"4\" \u200b Muri Nzeri 2021, yagizwe ambasaderi w\u2019ikirango muri Pepsi Nigeriya. Bukeye, Starr yaririmbye mugihe cyo kwerekana imbonankubone ya \"Big Brother Naija\". Yakoranye na Check kuri \"Akaga\", indirimbo ya kabiri kuri alubumu ye \"Bravo\". Mu bihembo bya 8 bya Afurika Muzik Magazine Awards, yatorewe igihembo cyiza cy'umuhanzi mushya. Muri Werurwe 2022, Starr yiswe \"Up Now\" na serivise yo gutunganya umuziki Audiomack. \nKu ya 16 Nzeri 2022, Starr yasohoye \" Rush \" nkimwe mundirimbo zigize album ya \"19 &amp;amp; Dangerous\". mu turere twinshi, harimo Ubusuwisi, Irilande n'Ubwongereza, aho yageze ku mwanya wa 24. Yabaye indirimbo yambere icuranzwe cyane kuri spotify yakozwe numugore wenyine wumunyanijeriya kandi yanatumye aba umunyafurika wambere wumugore urenze miliyoni ijana kundirimbo imwe yarebwe kuri yutube kandi yanatumye Starr ahamagarwa bwambere muri Grammy Awards ya 66 ngarukamwaka mu bihembo byiza bya muzika nyafurika. \u200b\"\u200b\" Kuya 10 Ugushyingo2022 yagaragaye mu ndirimbo ya Wizkid ya gatanu kuri alubumu yitwa urukundo rwinshi kwiyemera gucye. Indirimbo yageze ku mwanya wa 1 mu ndirimbo zigezweho kuri Billboard, kandi yerekanwe ku mwanya wa 5 ku mbonerahamwe y\u2019indirimbo za Billboard US Afrobeats. Ku ya 4 Werurwe 2023, Starr yerekeje ku mbuga nkoranyambaga atangaza ko umuziki we wakoreshejwe mu rwego rwo gufata amajwi ya filime \"Creed III\". Ku ya 13 Nyakanga 2023, Starr yatangaje ko azayobora urugendo rwe rwa mbere ruzenguruka isi rwiswe 21: The World Tour. Muri urwo ruzinduko harimo guhagarara Amerika ya Ruguru, Afurika, Uburayi na Ositaraliya. Ku ya 27 Ukwakira 2023, yagaragaye ku ndirimbo ya David Guetta yitwa \" Big FU \", hamwe n'umuraperi Lil Durk. Yageze ku mwanya wa 23 ku ndirimbo za Afrobeats zo muri Amerika na No 18 kuri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande Top 40 yambere. \n2024 - ubungubu: \"Umwaka nujuje imyaka 21\".\nMu mpera za 2023, Starr yatangiye gukora kuri alubumu ye ya kabiri yo muri studio, \"Umwaka nujuje imyaka 21\". Umushinga wagaragaje ubwihindurize bukomeye mubukorikori bwe, bugaragaza insanganyamatsiko yo kwishakisha, urukundo, intimba no guha imbaraga. Starr yasobanuye ko umutwe wa alubumu watewe inkunga no kuba yarakuze, asobanura ko \"atari imyaka gusa, ahubwo ko ari imikurire, kwivumbura, n'amasomo nize mu nzira.\" Amahugurwa yo gufata amajwi yabereye kuri Studiyo ya Mavin i Lagos akomeza mu 2024, hamwe n\u2019umusanzu watanzwe na Louddaaa, London, na Johnny Drille, ndetse na producer Rvssian watowe na Grammy. Starr yavuze ko gufata amajwi ari \"urugendo rwo kugerageza no kwigaragaza, aho nemereye kuba umunyantege nke.\" Mugihe cyo gutunganya alubumu, Starr yatangiye kubaka imbaraga n'amahirwe akomeye n'abafatanyabikorwa. Ku ya 5 Werurwe 2024, umuhanzi w\u2019umunyamerika uririmba injyana ya R&amp;B, Chris Brown, yatangaje ko mu 2024 Starr azaba kimwe mu bikorwa byo gutangiza uruzinduko rwe rwa 11:11 muri Amerika ya Ruguru, bishimangira kuba mpuzamahanga ahari ku ya 8 Mata 2024, producer Rvssian wo muri Jamayike yasohoye indirimbo \" Santa \", ku bufatanye n\u2019umuhanzi Starr hamwe n\u2019umuhanzi Rauw Alejandro wa reggaeton. Inzira yahindutse yamenyekanye cyane, ihuza Afropop, reggaeton, na Dancehall. Byatumye kandi Starr aba umuhanzi wambere wigitsina gore wo muri Nigeriya wageze kuri miliyoni 20 zabantu bamwumva kuri Spotify. Muri uko kwezi, Starr yitabiriye ibirori bya Fenty i Londres, aho yahuriye na Rihanna. Imikoranire yabo, yafashwe muri videwo ikwirakwizwa cyane, yateje kwibaza ku bufatanye bushoboka. Rihanna, wavumbuye umuziki wa Starr abinyujije kuri mubyara we, yagaragaje ko yishimiye Starr anabaza ibijyanye no gukorana na Starr na Tems. Nyuma Starr yagize icyo avuga ku mikoranire, agaragaza ko yishimiye ko Rihanna ashimishijwe kandi ko yiteguye gukorana n'abahanzi bombi mu bihe biri imbere. \nMbere yo gusohora TYIT21, Starr yabanje gusohora izindi ndirimbo nyinshi ari wenyine. \"Rhythm &amp; Blues\" yasohotse ku ya 13 Nzeri 2023, yinjiye mu nsanganyamatsiko z\u2019urukundo na karahanyuze, mu gihe \"Commas\" yasohotse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 2024, yagaragaje icyizere n'ubwigenge mu bijyanye n'amafaranga. \"Santa\", yasohotse ku ya 8 Mata 2024, yabaye inzira ihagaze neza, ishimirwa injyana yayo ishimishije ndetse n'amagambo akinisha. Buri ndirimbo yari iherekejwe n'amashusho yindirimbo zigaragara ziyobowe nabayobozi bakomeye bo muri Afrika, byubaka gutegereza alubumu yuzuye. \"Umwaka nujuje imyaka 21\" wasohotse kumugaragaro ku ya 31 Gicurasi 2024, binyuze muri Mavin Records. Iyi alubumu igaragaramo ubufatanye n'abahanzi nka Seyi Vibez, Coco Jones, Giveon, Asake, Anitta na Rauw Alejandro. Indirimbo nka \"Umugore w'umukomando,\" zirimo Coco Jones na Anitta, zigaragaza ubushobozi bwa Starr bwo guhuza injyana ya Afrobeat nuburyo bwa pop bwiburengerazuba. Avuga kuri ubwo ku bufatanye, yagize ati: \"Buri muhanzi yazanye ikintu kidasanzwe, ansunika gushakisha impande nshya z'ubuhanzi bwanjye.\" Imaze gusohoka, alubumu yatangiriye ku mwanya wa mbere ku mbonerahamwe ya Album ya Nijeriya maze yinjira muri Billboard 200 kuri No 195, bituma Starr aba umuhanzi w\u2019umugore wa mbere wo muri Nijeriya wageze kuri iyi ntambwe. Abakenguzamateka bashimye umusaruro wayo udasanzwe hamwe no kuvuga inkuru hamwe. \"Pitchfork\" yavuze ko iyo alubumu ari \"umurimo utinyitse kandi werekana neza unasobanura Afropop igezweho.\" Inndirimbo nka \"21\" zashimiwe cyane kubwimbaraga zamarangamutima, mugihe \"Abana Bameze neza\" yagaragazaga amajwi yumuryango wa Starr, bigatuma abamwumva bamenya neza ubuzima bwe bwite. Nyuma yo kumurika alubumu, Starr yakoze ibitaramo mpuzamahanga bikomeye kandi ashyigikira abahanzi bamenyekanye mu ngendo zikomeye. Yabashije kuba nk'igikorwa cyo gutangiza urugendo rwa Chris Brown mu 2024 11:11 Yerekeje mu mijyi 26 yo muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru kuva muri Kamena kugeza Kanama, aho yerekanaga inndirimbo nshya kuva kuri \"mu mwaka nujuje imyaka 21\". Muri kamena 2024, Starr yakoze amateka nkumuhanzi wambere wumugore wumunyafurika witwaye neza kuri Glastonbury Festival ya Pyramid Stage. Yayoboye kandi Afro Nation Detroit muri Kanama. Abakenguzamateka berekanye \"umwaka nujuje imyaka 21\" nkisobanura ubuzima bwa Starr, aho \"Billboard\" yayishimye \"nk'insanganyamatsiko yerekana gukura no nintumbero zihura n'imico yose.\" Starr yakoranye na Coldplay ku ndirimbo \"Ibyiyumvo byiza\" yo muri alubumu ya \"Moon Music\" ya Coldplay kandi yari igikorwa cyo gushyigikira itsinda rya Muzika rya Spheres World Tour muri Ositaraliya na Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande.\nMuri Gashyantare 2025, Starr yatangije umwaka n'indirimbo ye ya mbere yise \"Urukundo Rwose\", ashyiraho urwego ruzaba umwe mu myaka ye yihinduka rye. uko kwezi, yakoze amateka muri MOBO Awards yabereye muri Utilita Arena ya Newcastle ku ya 18 Gashyantare, aba umugore wa mbere mu myaka 16 wegukanye igihembo cyitwa amategeko meza ya muzika nyafurika. Yatsindiye kandi amategeko mpuzamahanga meza. Muri Mata yabaye umuhanzi wa mbere w\u2019umugore wo muri Nijeriya wabonye icyemezo cya Diamond cyo mu kilatini cyatanzwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019inganda zandika amajwi muri Amerika kubera ubufatanye bwe 2024 na \"Santa\" na Rvssian na Rauw Alejandro, binjije miliyoni zirenga 35 mukurebwa. Ku ya 25 Mata, yasohoye \" Gimme Dat \" irimo Wizkid, yerekana \"911\" ya Wyclef Jean na Mary J. Blige. Muri Kamena, Starr yatsindiye igihembo cye cya mbere cya BET kubera igihembo mpuzamahanga cyiza mu birori byabereye mu nzu mberabyombi ya Peacock i Los Angeles ku ya 9 Kamena, atoranya abatoranijwe barimo Black Sherif wo muri Gana, mugenzi we wo muri Nijeriya witwa Rema, na Tyla na Uncle Waffles wo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Urugendo rwe rwo mu mpeshyi 2025 rwatangiye ku ya 20 Kamena hamwe n\u2019igitaramo cyabereye mu iserukiramuco rya Summerjam New Jersey, hakurikiraho kugaragara mu iserukiramuco ry\u2019umuziki ryitiriwe Mutagatifu Kitts ku ya 28 Kamena na Montreal International Jazz Festival ku ya 1 Nyakanga. Kuva ku ya 7 Nyakanga, yinjiye mu itsinda ry\u2019abongereza Coldplay ku matariki menshi ya sitade kuri Muzika yabo ya Spheres World Tour, atangirana nabo murugendo rw\u2019amajoro atatu kuri Stade ya Downsview, muri Toronto ku ya 7, 8, na 12 Kanama kuri Stade ya Downsview. Izebguruka ryakomereje kuri sitade ya Wembley muri London kuya 22 na 23 Kanama, aho Coldplay yakinnye amateka yerekana amateka ikuraho iminsi icumi icuranga kuri stade yigihugu cyUbwongereza. \nHagati muri Nyakanga, Starr yasinyanye amasezerano n\u2019ubuyobozi mpuzamahanga na Roc Nation ya Jay-Z mu gihe asigaye yasinywe na Mavin Records kugira ngo asohore umuziki. Ubufatanye bufatika bwateguwe kugirango akoreshe imbaraga zo kumenyekana ku rwego mpuzamahanga, cyane cyane ku isoko ry\u2019Amerika. Iri tangazo ryagaragaye ku ya 16 Nyakanga, ryemeje ko Roc Nation izagenzura imurikagurisha rye ku isi, kuzenguruka, gutumaho, ndetse n'amasezerano yemeza, cyane cyane muri Amerika n'Uburayi. Ku ya 25 Nyakanga, yasohoye \" Umubiri ushyushye \", indirimbo yinjizwamo imbyino yakozwe na Ragee na The Elements, yashimiwe n'basesenguzi, hamwe na \"Billboard\" yayise \"igikonjo cyihuta cya divayi\". Iyi ndirimbo yaranze isohoka rye rya mbere munsi yubuyobozi bwa Roc Nation kandi ihinduka ihatanira igihembo cy'impeshyi. Ku ya 27 Nzeri, Starr yaririmbye mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry\u2019abenegihugu muri Parike Nkuru ya New York ari kumwe kuruhembe na Cardi B na Shakira, ndetse na Tyla, Mariah Umuhanga, na Camilo. Iri serukiramuco ryakiriwe na Ambasaderi w\u2019umuturage w\u2019isi Hugh Jackman hamwe na Bill Nye, Adam Lambert, Danai Gurira, na Liza Koshy, ryanyuze ku isi hose ku bantu barenga 60.000 bari bitabiriye ibyatsi binini. Mu gitaramo cye, Starr yazanye mugenzi we wo muri Nijeriya Rema nk'umushyitsi utunguranye, maze bakorera hamwe \"Rush\", bakurikirwa na Rema yise \" Calm down \" na \" Uruhinja (Ni Icyaha) \". Icyi ggihe cyabaye kimwe mubintu byavuzwe cyane mu birori. Nyuma yiyi mikoranire yakataraboneka, Starr na Rema bashyize ahagaragara ubufatanye bwabo bwa mbere nkabahanzi bafatanije kuyobora bise \"Ninde uriya mukobwa\" ku ya 17 Ukwakira. Iyi ndirimbo yakozwe na Ragee hamwe n\u2019ubundi bufasha bwaturutse muri The Elements, yahujije imbyino, R&amp;B, n\u2019iburasirazuba bwo hagati mu bunararibonye bwa Afro-Dance. \nUbuhanzi.\nImiterere yumuziki.\nMuri Nzeri 2021, Starr yagizwe ambasaderi w\u2019ikirango cya Pepsi Nigeria. Mu Kwakira 2021, yagaragaye mu rukurikirane rwa televiziyo The Cover. Yongeye kugaragara muri Fall/Winter 2021 issue of \"ODDA\" Muri uwo mwaka kandi, yagaragaye mu nyandiko ya Notion. Nyuma yaho, muri Gashyantare 2025 yasinyiye amasezerano yo kwamamaza ikirango New Balance hamwe n\u2019umuhanzi n\u2019umukinnyi Jaden Smith, aba umwe mubagaragaza urukurikirane rushya rw\u2019imyambaro ya siporo. Ubundi bufatanye bwe bwatangiriye kuri Maybelline New York, aho ahagarariye uruganda rw\u2019ibirungo byo kwisiga muri Afurika yo munsi y\u2019Ubutayu bwa Sahara hamwe na Darling Nigeria."}
{"id": "20068", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20068", "title": "Ishya", "text": "Ishya ni ikiganiro kiyobowe nabagore bane. Abo bagore ni Aissa Cyiza, Michelle Iradukunda, Cyuzuzo Jeanne D'Arc na Mucyo Christelle. \nIntangiriro.\nIshya ni kiganiro cyatangiye guca kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda Kigatambutswa nabagore batatu bari basanzwe mw'itangazamakuru aribo Aissa Cyiza, Michelle Iradukunda, Cyuzuzo Jeanne D'Arc bafatanije na Mucyo Christelle ukora mu by'imiti. Nyuma y'imyaka gica kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda cyakuweho gicishwa kuri shene y'ishya iba kuri you tube."}
{"id": "20070", "revid": "11347", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20070", "title": "Fatu Holo Kaba", "text": "Fatu Holo Kaba ni umugore w'umunyapolitiki wo muri Gineya.\nKu wa 22 Mutarama mu mwaka wa 2022, yashyizweho n'itegeko nk'umujyanama w' inama nkuru y'inzibacyuho (CNT) ya Repubulika ya Gineya nk' umuyobozi uhagarariye inzego rusange n'imiryango y'ubucuruzi \nImibereho ijyanye n'umwuga.\nFatu Holo Kaba yashyizweho muri Mutarama mu mwaka wa 2022 kandi yari imwe mu ntumwa za Gineya zabaga mu gice cya 67\u00a0cy'inama ya komisiyo y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe imiterere y\u2019abagore ibera muri Niyu Yoruke kuwa 17 Werurwe 2023 "}
{"id": "20071", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20071", "title": "Jacqueline Fatima Bocoum", "text": "Jacqueline Fatima Bocoum ni umugore w' umunyamakuru wo muri Senegal yaje guhinduka umwanditsi ukomoka muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba ho muri Senegali. Akaba ari umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo cy'itangazamakuru\"7\" \nimibereho.\nFatuma ni umgore w'umunyamakuru, yakoze muri (RTS na Sud FM) Ibitangaza makuru byo muri Senegale,mbere yo kuba Umuyobozi wa gahunda n\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe amakuru kuri Radiyo Nositalgie. Se umubyara yakoraga mu biro bya perezida L\u00e9opold S\u00e9dar Senghor. \numwuga akora.\nFatima Bocoum ni umwe mu bagore b' ikitegererezo bo muri Senegale kuko yabaye umugore wa mbere wayoboye itsinda ryitwa Presse, kandi yabaye umugore wambere wakoze kuri radiyo yigenga yo muri Senegale ariyo bita (Sud FM). Ftima kandi yabaye uuyobozi mukuru w'utumanaho muri minisiteri y'ubuzima ndetse no muri minisiteri y'itumanaho."}
{"id": "20072", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20072", "title": "Habiba Dembele", "text": "Habiba Dembele Sahouet ni umugore w'umunyamakuru wo Kote d'Ivoire akaba n'umunyamakuru kuri telviziyo.\nKugeza ubu ni umunyamakuru wa televiziyo mu masaha ya saa saba na saa mbiri z'ijoro \"(13 h-\" 20\"h)\" kumuyoboro mukuru wa La Peremiyere (RTI), ibarizwa muri Abija. \nKu wa 11 Gashyantare 2008, inkongi y'umuriro yibasiye sitidiyo ubwo yari arimo gufata amashusho ya \"saa mbiri\", bimutera gahagarika itangazamakuru yari arimo akora,maze ahunga inyubako. Umuriro watwitse sitidiyo nyinshi ariko muri rusange abashinzwe kuzimya umuriro bari bagerageje kuwuzimya. "}
{"id": "20077", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20077", "title": "Ruboneka jean Bosco", "text": "Ruboneka jean Bosco ni Umunyarwanda wavutse kuwa 01/01/1999 ni umukinnyi ukinira ikipe ya APR fc akaba akina hagati mukibuga akaba akomoka mukarere ka gatsibo akaba ari muri bamwe mubakinnyi ngenderwaho mwikipe ya APR fc akaba ari umukinnyi wamaguru wabigize umwuga.\nIbikorwa bya Ruboneka jean bosco muri APR FC.\nUu mukinnyi yagiye atsinda ibitego byinshi cyane mu ikipe ya APR fc dore ko uyu mukinnyi akina hagati mukibuga bityo rero akaba yaragiye atanga pase zitandukanye.Uyu mukinnyi rero akaba ari umwe mubakinnyi bingenzi mu ikipe ya APR Fc kandi akaba akomeje gukuza impano ye y'umupira w'a,maguru"}
