{"id": "20080", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20080", "title": "Umurenge wa Mugesera", "text": "Mugesera ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda. Uyu murenge uri ku nkombe y\u2019Ikiyaga cya Mugesera.\nMu 2022, Umurenge wa Mugesera wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 28 637. Abaturage bose babaga mu cyaro. Muri uyu murenge hahingwa inanasi nyinshi. Mu 2021, hubakwaga uruganda rutunganya inanasi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Mugesera uri mu Karere ka Ngoma. Akarere ka Ngoma gafite imirenge 14. Umurenge wa Mugesera uri ku nkombe y\u2019Ikiyaga cya Mugesera. Ni agace kagira imvura nke.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mugesera wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 25 716. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, abaturage bari 28 637. Muri bo, abagabo bari 13 624. Abagore bari 15 013. Abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15 bari 10 725. Abaturage bose babaga mu cyaro.\nUbukungu.\nMu Karere ka Ngoma, inanasi zihingwa ku buso burenga hegitari 4 000. Zihingwa cyane mu mirenge ya Zaza, Sake na Mugesera. Mu Murenge wa Mugesera, inanasi zihingwa ku buso burenga hegitari 2 500. Koperative y\u2019abahinzi b\u2019inanasi ya Mugesera (KOABANAMU) yari ifite abanyamuryango barenga 90.\nMu 2021, ikigo 1000 Hills Products Rwanda cyubakaga uruganda rutunganya inanasi mu Murenge wa Mugesera. Ku itariki ya 10 Mutarama 2021, imvura nyinshi yasenye igice cy\u2019urwo ruganda. Uruganda rwari ruteganyijwe gutangira kwakira inanasi muri Kanama 2021.\nImiyoborere.\nUmurenge wa Mugesera washimiwe uko wakoze umuganda mu mwaka wa 2015\u20132016. Wanashimiwe kubaka inyubako izakoreramo polisi.\nMu ntangiriro za 2018, abaturage batangiye kubakira imidugudu yabo ibiro. Muri Kamena 2018, imidugudu irindwi yari yararangije kubaka ibiro byayo. Ibindi biro 28 byari bikiri kubakwa. Ibiro bimwe byatwaraga hagati ya miliyoni 3 na miliyoni 5 z\u2019amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda."}
{"id": "20081", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20081", "title": "UBUHINZI BW'ABETERAVE", "text": "Beterave ni igihingwa kibarirwa mu binyabijumba nubwo ubusanzwe ari uruboga.kuri beterave itukura ikunze guhingwa mu Rwanda,ari nayo iyi nkuru y'ibandaho,\nigice cyo hasi cyangwa se ikijumba cyayo ni cyo kiribwa,mugihe hari n'ubundi bwoko bwa beterave buribwa amababi gusa.\nMuri rusange beterave n'igihingwa kitagoye gihinga kuko ntigikenera ubutaka bunini cyane,zahingwa no mumurima muto,n'umuntu ashobora \nno kugihinga mu karima k'igikoni.\nAbashakashatsi bavugako beterave ikunda icyirere cyidashyuha cyane ngo ikunda ahantu hari igipimo cy'ubushyuhe kiri hagati ya 15-23c(degree),\nkugirango ikure neza.gusa na none y'ihanganira ubushyuhe ugereranyije na karoti,kandi ikunda cyane ubutaka bw'umusenyi cyane kurusha\nubutaka bw'inombe,ikanihanganira ubutaka busharira butarengeje gatandatu(6).\nbeterave z'itangira kwera nyuma y'amezi atatu zitewe,nyuma umuntu akajya azisarura akurikije izo akeneye,\nkuko zibikika nez iyo ziri mu butaka zifite amababi yazo kurusha kuzikurira rimwe umuntu akazibika munzu \ncyangwa muri firigo.\ngusarura beterave bisabakubikora neza umuntu yirinda kuzikomeretsa kuko ngo bizangiza vuba.\nikindi iyo umuntu asarura beterav mu gihe cy'izuba ubutaka bukomeye agomba kubanza akazisukaho amazi\nkugirango ubutaka bworohe abashe kuzisarura neza.\niyo umuntu asarura beterave akataho amababi akayasiga mu murima,bikazaba ifumbire."}
{"id": "20082", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20082", "title": "B THREY", "text": "B Threy yamamaye ate.\nB THREY numuraperi nyarwanda amazinaye asanzwe ni Beritrad Muheto wamenyekanye nka Bethrey akaba afite umugore witwa Keza Nailla uyumuraperi nyarwanda avugako yatangiye kwiyumvamo ibyamuzika akirimuto kandiko nyirakuru yaramushyigikiye ahasaga mumwaka wa 2008 yakoranye umuziki nabasore biganaga batatu. 2014 mu ibiruhuko yagiye muri studio ahura na abatunganya umuziki akomeza kubikunda cyane.\nubwo b thry yatangiraga muzika.\nUbwo b threy yatangiraga injyana ya hipop by'umwuga. mu mwaka wa 2014 nibwo yahuye nabatunganya umuziki harimo Allan Slim, Dizolast na Dr. Nganji bituma arushaho kuwihebera muzika byumwihariko injyana ya hipop \nB-Threy uri mu batangije injyana ya Kinyatrap, ni umwe mu baraperi bamaze kumenyekana mu Rwanda.Mu 2019 uyu muraperi yasezeye muri Green Ferry Music ya Dr Nganji yamufasha we na bagenzi be bakoranaga injyana ya Kinyatrap yiyemeza gutangira urugendo rwe mu muziki. \nuyu muhanzi yaje kwamamamara ku indirimbo ya kinyaTrap yitwa Munyana arabenga "}
{"id": "20083", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20083", "title": "Dronie", "text": "Dronie.\nIndege zitagira aba pilote nindenzento zikoreshwa mugukwirakwiza inkingo nimiti ndetse nibicuruzwa\numumaro windege zitagira abapirote mu Rwanda zizwi nka Dronie nindege ntoya zijyamo umutwaro utarengeje ikiro kimwe kimiti cyangwa ibicuruzwa nindege zaje korohereza ndetse nokugabanya ingendo zakorwaga mu rwanda zinafashagutabara indembe kuko zifite umuvuduko udazanzwe zirihuta cyane mugihugu cyacu nkurwanda natwe zarahageze zikabazidufasha muribyinshi kugeza imiti ndetse nogutanga amaraso mu ibitaro bigiye bitandandukanye hirya no hino mu Igihugu"}
{"id": "20084", "revid": "15597", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20084", "title": "Wwww", "text": "\"IBYIGOJURU BIKORA GUTE?\"\nAmoko y\u2019Ibikoresho Bikoreshwa Mu Byogajuru\nIbikoresho bikoreshwa mu byogajuru ni ibice by\u2019ikoranabuhanga bishyirwa ku byogajuru (satellites) kugira ngo bifashe mu mirimo itandukanye harimo itumanaho, kugenzura isi, ubushakashatsi mu kirere, imiyoborere y\u2019ubwirinzi n\u2019ibindi. Ibyogajuru ubwabyo bikora nk\u2019icyicaro cyangwa icyuma cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga gishobora kugenda mu isanzure, kikohereza cyangwa kikakira amakuru.\nIbikoresho bikoreshwa kuri ibi byogajuru bigira amoko atandukanye, bitewe n\u2019akazi byagenewe gukora. Uko ikoranabuhanga rigenda ritera imbere, ni ko n\u2019ibi bikoresho bigenda bitera imbere mu bunini, ubushobozi no mu gukoresha ingufu nke.\n1. Ibyogajuru by\u2019Itumanaho (Communication Satellites).\nIbi ni byo byogajuru bikunze gukoreshwa cyane ku isi. Bifasha mu gutanga serivisi z\u2019itumanaho nka televiziyo, telefoni, internet, n\u2019itumanaho rya gisirikare. Bikoreshwa mu guhuza ibice bitandukanye by\u2019isi hakoreshejwe sinyali za radiyo cyangwa microwave.\nIbyo bikoresho bikubiyemo:\nUrugero:\n2. Ibyogajuru byo Kugenzura Isi (Earth Observation Satellites).\nIbi byogajuru bigamije gutanga amakuru ajyanye n\u2019imiterere y\u2019ubutaka, ibidukikije, n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere. Bikoreshwa mu buhinzi, igenamigambi ry\u2019imijyi, kugenzura ibiza n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019ubucukuzi.\nIbikoresho bikubiyemo:\nUrugero:\n3. Ibyogajuru bya Gisirikare (Military Satellites).\nIbi ni ibyogajuru bikoreshwa n\u2019ingabo mu rwego rwo kwicungira umutekano, gutahura ibikorwa by\u2019abanzi, cyangwa gutanga amakuru ku bijyanye n\u2019ikirere n\u2019aho ibikoresho bya gisirikare biri. Bimwe bikora akazi k\u2019ubutasi, gufata amajwi n\u2019amashusho, n\u2019ibindi.\nIbikoresho bikubiyemo:\nUrugero:\n4. Ibyogajuru by\u2019Imyidagaduro n\u2019Itumanaho rusange.\nIbi byogajuru bitanga serivisi zijyanye n\u2019imyidagaduro, harimo gukwirakwiza amajwi n\u2019amashusho, radio, GPS, n\u2019ibindi. Bikoreshwa n\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo cyangwa ibigo bikora ubucuruzi.\nIbikoresho bikubiyemo:\nUrugero:\n5. Ibyogajuru bito: CubeSats, NanoSats, na MicroSats.\nNi ibyogajuru bifite ubunini buto cyane, bikaba bikoreshwa cyane mu bushakashatsi mu mashuri makuru, mu bucuruzi buto, no mu kwiga ikoranabuhanga rishya. Kubera igiciro gito cyo kubitunganya no kubohereza mu isanzure, byatumye bihinduka ibikoresho by\u2019ingenzi mu iterambere ry\u2019itumanaho ryihariye n\u2019ubumenyi.\nUrugero:\n6. Ibyogajuru by\u2019Ubushakashatsi bw\u2019Isanzure (Space Science Satellites).\nBikoreshwa mu bushakashatsi mu by\u2019ikirere n\u2019isanzure, nko kugenzura inyenyeri, inyuguti z\u2019ikirere (galaxies), umwimerere w\u2019umwuka, n\u2019ubushakashatsi ku mibumbe nka Mars cyangwa Venus.\nUrugero:\nUmwanzuro.\nIbikoresho bikoreshwa mu byogajuru bigira uruhare rukomeye mu buzima bwa buri munsi. Bifasha mu itumanaho, mu kurengera ibidukikije, mu kwita ku buzima bw\u2019abantu, no mu kurinda umutekano w\u2019ibihugu. Iterambere ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga rizakomeza kwagura ubushobozi bw\u2019ibi bikoresho no gutuma byorohera ibihugu n\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo kubikoresha."}
