{"id": "20094", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20094", "title": "Umurenge wa Kivuye", "text": "Umurenge wa Kivuye ni umwe mu mirenge 17 igize Akarere ka Burera, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kivuye wari utuwe n'abaturage 18 057.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nAkarere ka Burera kagizwe n'imirenge 17. Umurenge wa Kivuye ni umwe muri yo.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kivuye wari utuwe n'abaturage 15 448. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 18 057. Abagabo bari 8 609. Abagore bari 9 448.\nAbaturage 1 580 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 16 477 batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "20095", "revid": "15858", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20095", "title": "Imivugo", "text": "Imivugo ni ubwoko bw'ubuvanganzo mu Kinyarwanda, ikaba igizwe n'ibitekerezo, amarangamutima, n'ubuhanga mu mvugo. Akenshi imivugo ikorwa mu buryo bw'ibisigo, ikaba ifite imirongo n'ibisigo bigaragara mu buryo bw'ubuvanganzo.\nImivugo ikunze gukoreshwa mu buryo butandukanye, harimo:\nImivugo ni igice cy'ingenzi mu muco nyarwanda, ikaba ifasha mu guhuza abantu no kubahuza n'ibitekerezo byabo."}
{"id": "20096", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20096", "title": "Umurenge wa Gatunda", "text": "Umurenge wa Gatunda ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Nyagatare, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gatunda wari utuwe n'abaturage 35 310. Ibitaro bya Gatunda byagenewe abaturage b'uyu murenge n'abo mu yindi mirenge ine.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Gatunda ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Nyagatare. Umurenge wa Gatunda wose ni icyaro.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gatunda wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 776. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 35 310. Muri bo, abagabo bari 16 767, abagore bari 18 543.\nUbuvuzi.\nIbitaro bya Gatunda biri mu Karere ka Nyagatare. Kubaka ibi bitaro byatwaye amafaranga y'u Rwanda agera kuri miliyari 4. Ibitaro bya Gatunda byagenewe guha serivisi abaturage bagera ku 400 000. Abo baturage ni abo mu mirenge ya Gatunda, Kiyombe, Karama, Mimuri na Mukama."}
