{"id": "20099", "revid": "15594", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20099", "title": "Dodoce Ndatimana", "text": "Umudugudu wa Kabuga \u2013 Kinishya, Nyankenke, Gicumbi.\nKabuga ni umudugudu uherereye mu kagari ka Kinishya, umurenge wa Nyankenke, mu karere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda. Ni umwe mu midugudu yegereye imisozi ihanamye igaragaramo icyizere cy\u2019uburumbuke, bitewe n\u2019ubutaka bwera buhwanye n\u2019ikirere cy\u2019ako gace. Akarere ka Gicumbi gashyira Kabuga mu midugudu ifite amahirwe yo gutera imbere binyuze muri gahunda z\u2019ubufatanye hagati y\u2019abaturage n\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze.\nAmateka ya Kabuga yanditse kuva mu myaka ya za 2000, ubwo Leta yatangizaga gahunda y\u2019imiturire mu midugudu igamije guteza imbere imibereho myiza n\u2019iterambere rirambye. Abaturage batuye Kabuga biganjemo abaturutse mu bice bitandukanye bya Nyankenke, bagahurizwa hamwe n\u2019inzego z\u2019ubuyobozi mu rwego rwo guhuriza hamwe serivisi no koroshya igenamigambi.\nUbukungu bw\u2019abaturage bishingiye ku buhinzi n\u2019ubworozi. Ibigori, ibishyimbo, n\u2019urutoki ni byo bihingwa biganje, mu gihe ubworozi burimo amatungo magufi nka ihene, inkwavu n\u2019inkoko. Abaturage bamaze kugira ubumenyi ku buryo bwo kubyaza umusaruro ubutaka n\u2019amatungo, hakaba harashinzwe amakoperative y\u2019abahinzi n\u2019aborozi, ndetse n\u2019amatsinda y\u2019imishinga y\u2019ubucuruzi.\nMu bijyanye n\u2019imibereho rusange, Kabuga ifite amahirwe yo kwegerezwa ibikorwaremezo nko kubona amazi meza avomwa ku mariba rusange, amashanyarazi atangwa na REG, n\u2019imihanda iciriritse yegeranya ingo zigize umudugudu. Uyu muhanda uhuza Kabuga n\u2019ahandi hatandukanye mu murenge wa Nyankenke. Harimo n\u2019umushinga ugezweho wo gukwirakwiza imirasire y\u2019izuba mu ngo zitaragerwaho n\u2019umuriro w\u2019amashanyarazi rusange.\nMu bijyanye n\u2019uburezi n\u2019ubuzima, Kabuga yegereye ibigo by\u2019amashuri abanza ndetse n\u2019ivuriro rya Kinishya, bituma abaturage babona serivisi z\u2019ingenzi hafi. Hari kandi n\u2019abaganga b\u2019abajyanama b\u2019ubuzima batuye umudugudu, bafasha mu gukurikirana isuku, ubuzima bw\u2019abana, n\u2019inkingo. Abanyeshuri biga mu mashuri yegereye barakomeza kubona amahirwe yo kwiga ku buryo buhoraho.\nUmuco n\u2019imyidagaduro biragaragara cyane muri Kabuga. Abaturage bishimira kwitabira amarushanwa y\u2019imikino, inama rusange, ibitaramo byo kwidagadura, n\u2019imihango gakondo y\u2019ubukwe cyangwa ubukerarugendo bw\u2019imbere mu gihugu. Kabuga irangwa n\u2019ubufatanye hagati y\u2019ingo, aho ibimina n\u2019amatsinda y\u2019ubwizigame y\u2019abagore n\u2019urubyiruko bikomeje kugira uruhare mu gutuma ubukungu bw\u2019umuturage bugenda buzamuka.\nKabuga igira uruhare mu bikorwa byo kurwanya ubushomeri n\u2019ubukene biciye muri gahunda nka \u201cHuguka Dukore,\u201d aho urubyiruko rurenga 30 ruri kwihugura mu myuga no kwihangira imirimo. Hari kandi amatsinda y\u2019abagore arimo gukora imishinga y\u2019ububoshyi, ubwogero bw\u2019inkoko, no kubyaza umusaruro ibikomoka ku buhinzi. Inzego z\u2019ibanze zifatanya n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa b\u2019iterambere (nk\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta) mu gushyira mu bikorwa ibyo bikorwa.\nImibare yegereye ukuri yerekana ko Kabuga igizwe n\u2019ingo zirenga 120 n\u2019abaturage basaga 600. Ubuyobozi bw\u2019umudugudu bufatanya n\u2019inama y\u2019abaturage buri kwezi mu gukemura ibibazo, gutanga ibitekerezo no guteza imbere gahunda z\u2019iterambere nk\u2019imihigo. Kabuga ifite icyerekezo cyo kuba umudugudu w\u2019icyitegererezo ku rwego rw\u2019umurenge wa Nyankenke.\nKabuga (Gicumbi).\nKabuga ni umudugudu uherereye mu kagari ka Kinishya, umurenge wa Nyankenke, mu karere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda. Ni umwe mu midugudu igize Kinishya, ukaba uzwi mu bikorwa by\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi ndetse no mu bufatanye bw\u2019abaturage mu rwego rw\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imibereho myiza.\nImiterere n\u2019Ubuhinzi.\nKabuga iherereye ahantu h\u2019ikirere gikonje, ku misozi ihanamye, ahakunze kuboneka imvura ihagije. Ubutaka bwaho bubyara cyane, bigatuma ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi biba indashyikirwa. Abaturage baho bahinga ibigori, ibishyimbo, ibirayi, urutoki ndetse n\u2019imboga. Hari kandi ubworozi bw\u2019ihene, inkoko n\u2019inka.\nUbuzima n\u2019Uburezi.\nKabuga yegereye ivuriro rya Kinishya ndetse n\u2019ibigo by\u2019amashuri abanza n\u2019ayisumbuye. Hari abajyanama b\u2019ubuzima baba mu mudugudu, bifasha mu gukurikirana isuku, imirire, n\u2019ubuzima rusange bw\u2019abaturage. Abana biga mu bigo byegereye bitabira amashuri ku buryo buhoraho.\nImibereho n\u2019Iterambere.\nAbaturage ba Kabuga bafite imyumvire y\u2019ubufatanye, bagashyira hamwe mu matsinda y\u2019ubwizigame n\u2019inguzanyo (ibimina), amatsinda y\u2019abagore n\u2019urubyiruko, ndetse n\u2019amakoperative y\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019imishinga iciriritse. Kabuga kandi ikomeje kwitabira gahunda ya Huguka Dukore aho urubyiruko rwigishwa imyuga n'ikoranabuhanga.\nIbikorwa Remezo.\nKabuga ifite imihanda iciriritse iyihuza n\u2019indi midugudu, amashanyarazi atangwa na REG, amazi meza avomwa ku masoko rusange, ndetse hari n\u2019umushinga wo gukwirakwiza imirasire y\u2019izuba mu ngo zitaragezwaho umuriro.\nUmuco n\u2019Umutekano.\nUmuco w\u2019abaturage ba Kabuga ugaragarira mu mbyino gakondo, indirimbo, amarushanwa y\u2019imikino n\u2019imihango y\u2019ubukwe bwa kinyarwanda. Umutekano urinzwe n\u2019abaturage ubwabo binyuze mu irondo ry\u2019umwuga n\u2019irya kinyamwuga, bakorana n\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze.\nIbidukikije.\nKabuga ifite gahunda yo kubungabunga ibidukikije irimo gutera ibiti, gukusanya imyanda neza, no kurengera amasoko y\u2019amazi. Hari ubukangurambaga bwo gukoresha ubwiherero bwa kijyambere no kwirinda isuri.\numwanditsi:Ndatimana Dodoce"}
{"id": "20100", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20100", "title": "Faustin NTEZILYAYO", "text": "Faustin Ntezilyayo yavukiye mu Karere ka Kamonyi, mu Rwanda, ku wa 20 Kanama 1962. Ni Umunyamategeko w'umunyarwanda w'inararibonye, wabaye Umucamanza Mukuru w'Urwanda kuva ku wa 6 Ukuboza 2019 kugeza ku wa 3 Ukuboza 2024. \nYize amategeko muri Kaminuza zitandukanye, harimo University of Antwerp aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (PhD), ndetse na Free University of Brussels aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri mu Mategeko y\u2019imisoro. \nMu mwuga we, Nteziryayo yakoze mu nzego zitandukanye za Leta, harimo kuba Minisitiri w'Ubutabera hagati ya 1996 na 1999, ndetse akaba yarabaye Umuyobozi Mukuru wa Banki Nkuru y\u2019Igihugu (Vice Governor) hagati ya 2000 na 2003. Yabaye kandi Umuyobozi Mukuru wa Rwanda Utilities Regulatory Agency (RURA) ndetse yabaye umujyanama mu by\u2019Amategeko muri Minisiteri y\u2019Ubucuruzi n\u2019Inganda.\nUretse imirimo ya Leta, Dr. Nteziryayo yabaye Umuyobozi wa Banki y\u2019Imari iciriritse (AGASEKE BANK) hagati ya 2011 na 2013, ndetse akaba ari umunyamuryango wa Chartered Institute of Arbitrators (FCIArb). Yabaye kandi Umucamanza mu Rukiko rw\u2019Umuryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (East African Court of Justice) kuva mu 2013 kugeza mu 2020.\nNi umwe mu bantu bafite ubunararibonye mu Mategeko no mu miyoborere, akaba yaragize uruhare runini mu mavugurura y\u2019Ubutabera mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nNyiricyubahiro afite Dogitora mu Mategeko (PhD in Law) yakuye muri Kaminuza ya mu Bubiligi mu 1994, Master mu Mategeko y\u2019Imisoro (LLM in Fiscal Law) yakuye muri Kaminuza yigenga ya Bruxelles mu Bubiligi mu 1996, ndetse na Master mu by\u2019Imibanire mpuzamahanga yihariye mu Bucuruzi mpuzamahanga (M.A in International Affairs - International Trade Policy) yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Carleton muri Kanada mu 2009."}
{"id": "20101", "revid": "15871", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20101", "title": "Akarere ka gisagara", "text": "mu karere ka gisagara,ubuhinzi n`ubworozi ni ingenzi mu iterambere ry`abaturage.ubuhinzi bw`imboga nk`ikaroti na puwavuro buragenda bwitabirwa cyane n`urubyiruko,kuko babona ko burimo amafaranga,ariko imbogamizi ikomeye ni igishoro cyo kuhira imyaka.\nhari n`imishinga nk`uwa kilimo trust,ifasha urubyiruko kwiga no gutangira ubuhinzi bw`imboga\nku bijyanyen`ubworozi,amatungo magufi nk`inkoko n`ingurube byafashije abaturage kwikura\nmu bukene.umushingawa PRISM waroroje abaturage inkoko,bakazibyaza umusaruro binyuze\nmu kugurishaamagi n`amatungo,bikabafasha kwiteza imbere."}
{"id": "20102", "revid": "15854", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20102", "title": "Amasiganwa y'amagare mu Rwanda", "text": "Amasiganwa y'amagare mu Rwanda.\nIrushanwa rya 17 rya Tour du Rwanda, irushanwa rya UCI Africa Tour, ryabaye kuva ku ya 23 Gashyantare kugeza ku ya 2 Werurwe 2025. Iri siganwa ryabereye mu Rwanda, ryari rigizwe n'ibyiciro 7, harimo na prologue. Eurosport itanga ikirangantego kirambuye nibisubizo kubyabaye.https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fsamuelngenda1%2Fstatus%2F1336664460954652672&amp;psig=AOvVaw0YGaiiANMmYNHgGYcQd3UX&amp;ust=1747417905665000&amp;source=images&amp;cd=vfe&amp;opi=89978449&amp;ved=0CBAQjRxqFwoTCMjtiOiEpo0DFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE"}
{"id": "20103", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20103", "title": "Counter-Terrorism Unit (CTU)", "text": "Counter-Terrorism Unit (CTU).\nCounter-Terrorism Unit (CTU) mu Rwanda ni ishami ryihariye rya Rwanda National Police (RNP) cyangwa Rwanda Defence Forces (RDF), rigizwe n\u2019abantu batoranyijwe neza kandi bahuguriwe kurwanya iterabwoba no gukora ibikorwa byihuse cyane (special operations)."}
{"id": "20104", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20104", "title": "Umurenge wa Butaro", "text": "Umurenge wa Butaro ni umwe mu mirenge 17 igize Akarere ka Burera, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Butaro wari utuwe n'abaturage 38 013. Muri uyu murenge hari Ibitaro bya Butaro, birimo ikigo cyo kuvura kanseri.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nAkarere ka Burera kagizwe n'imirenge 17. Umurenge wa Butaro ni umwe muri yo.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Butaro wari utuwe n'abaturage 31 520. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 38 013. Abagabo bari 18 352. Abagore bari 19 661.\nAbaturage 5 880 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 32 133 batuye mu cyaro.\nIbigo by'ingenzi.\nIbitaro bya Butaro biri i Butaro, mu Karere ka Burera. Byafunguwe ku wa 24 Mutarama 2011. Bifite ibitanda 150.\nKu wa 18 Nyakanga 2012, ikigo cyo kuvura kanseri cyafunguwe muri ibi bitaro. Cyitwa \"Butaro Cancer Center of Excellence\"."}
{"id": "20105", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20105", "title": "Igikombe Cy'isi cya 2026", "text": "Igikombe Cy'isi cya 2026.\nIgikombe cy'isi cya 2026 kizaba ari irushanwa ryihariye mu mateka ya ruhago, kuko ari bwo bwa mbere rizabera mu bihugu bitatu icyarimwe:Leta zunze ubumwe za amerika,kanada, na mexique. kizaba kuva ku itariki ya 11 kamena kugeza ku ya 19 nyakanga 2026.\nIbikomeye kuri FIFA Word Cup 2026.\n-Imiterere mishya: Irushanwa rizitabirwa n'amakipe 48, avuye mu kuri 32,\nagabanywemo amatsinda 12 y\u2019amakipe 4. Amakipe abiri ya mbere muri buri tsinda hamwe n,amakipe 8 ya gatatu yabaye meza kurusha andi azakomeza mu mikino ya 1/16.\n-Imikino; Hazakinwa imikino 104,izabera mu mijyi 16 yo muri amerika ya ruguru. umukino ufungura uzabera kuri Estadio Azteca i mexico city ku ya 11 kamena, naho umukino wa nyuma uzabera kuri MetLife Stadium ku ya 19 nyakanga.\n-Abakiriye: Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika zizakira imikino 78, harimo n\u2019iyo kuva muri 1/4 kugeza ku mukino wa nyuma. Kanada na Mexique zizakira buri imwe imikino 13.\n-Amakipe yamaze kubona itike: Amakipe y\u2019ibihugu byakiriye (USA, Kanada, Mexique) yamaze kubona itike. Ubuyapani na Irani na byo byamaze kubona itike, mu gihe amakipe menshi akiri mu rugendo rwo gushaka itike.\n-Indirimbo y'irushanwa: Indirimbo nyamukuru y'irushanwa ni iyitwa \"FIFA World Cup 26 Theme Song\", yasohotse ku ya 17 gicurasi 2023.\nMu 2025, hasohotse amavugurura 16 y'iondirimbo, buri yose ikozwe n,umuhanzi wo mu mijyi wakiriye irushanwa.\nAmakuru y\u2019ingenzi.\nIri rushanwa rizaba ari irya mbere rifite amakipe menshi, rikazaba rihuje imijyi 16 yo muri Amerika ya Ruguru. Abafana b\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru bategereje iri rushanwa n\u2019amatsiko menshi, kuko rizaba rihuje ubunararibonye bw\u2019ibihugu bitatu n\u2019amakipe menshi atandukanye ku rwego rw\u2019Isi."}
