{"id": "20108", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20108", "title": "Nyamiyaga", "text": "UMURENGE WA NYAMIYAGA.\nUmurenge wa Nyamiyaga ni umwe mu mirenge makumyabiri n'umwe igize akarere ka Gicumbi.\nUyu murenge ugizwe n'utugari turindwi aritwo:gahumuriza;kiziba;kabezaII;karambo;mataba;jamba;\nkabugaII. uhana imbibi n;umurenge wa Rutare;Rukomo;Ruvune;Mutete.\nMuru uyu murenge harimo ibigo by'amashuri bitandukanye muri bya twavugamo:G.S Nyinawimana;\nG.S Kagamba;G.S Mugina,G.S Runanga,ecole primary Kigwa,G.s runanga\nkandi hari ibikorwa bitandukanye bikorerwa muri uyu murenge harimo: ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro\nahagana munkoma. Ibiro by'uyu murenge biri mukagari ka beza "}
{"id": "20109", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20109", "title": "Uburobyi mu karere ka gisagara", "text": "ICYEREKEZO CY`UBUROBYI MU KARERE KA GISAGARA\nakarere ka gisagara gafite intego yo guteza imbere uburobyi nk`imwe mu nzira zo kongera umusaruro \nw`ibiribwa no guteza imbere ubukungu bw`abaturage.ubuyobozi bw`akarere bushishikariza abaturage\nkwitabira ubworozi bw`amafi,cyane cyane mu mirenge ifite amahirwe yo kubona amazi ahagije.ibi bikorwa\nbyose bigamije guteza imbere ubukungu bw`akarere no kugabanya ubukene mu baturage.\nkubera ibi bikorwa n`imishinga iri gushyirwa mu bikorwa,uburobyi mu karere ka gisagara bufite amahirwe\nyo gutera imbere no kugira uruhare runini mu iterambere ry`ubukungu bw`akarere n`igihugu muri rusange."}
{"id": "20113", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20113", "title": "Ibitaro bya Kigali bya Kaminuza", "text": "Ibitaro bya Kaminuza bya Kigali (CHUK) ni ibitaro byigisha bifite ibitanda 519, biherereye muMujyi wa Kigali,mu Rwanda. Byashinzwe mu 1918 n'abakoloni b'ababiligi. CHUK ni cyo kigo nderabuzima cya mbere cyashinzwe kandi kinini kurusha ibindi mu Rwanda. Cyagize uruhare rukomeye mu kongera kubaka urwego rw'ubuvuzi mu Rwanda nyuma ya Jenocide Cyagize uruhare rukomeye mu kongera kubaka urwego rw\u2019ubuvuzi mu Rwanda nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nAmateka.\nInkomoko y'ibitaro bya Kaminuza bya (CHUK) yatangiye mu 1918, ubwo byashingwaga kunshuro ya mbere n'ubuyobozi bw'ingabo z'ababiligi. Icyo gihe, ikigo nderabuzima cyatangiranye n'inyubako yari yarasizwe n'abadage. Gustave Latinne, umuganga w'ingabo z'ababiligi, niwe wagizwe umuyobozi wa mbere w'iki kigo..\nIbikoresho.\nCHUK nibitaro bya leta bizwiho gutanga serivisi kubanyarwanda basanzwe bafite ubwishingizi bwabaturage. CHUK ni ibitaro bya Leta bizwiho gutanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi ku banyarwanda benshi, cyane cyane abafite ubwishingizi bw'ubuzima. Ibitaro byunganira n'inkunga itangwa na Guverinoma y'U Rwanda ndetse n'abaterankunga mpuzamahanga. \nKwimuka.\nCHUK yimuriwe ahahoze ibitaro bya kera i Nyarugengeijya ku bitaro bya Masak, mu karere ka Kicukiro. Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuzima yatangaje ko impamvu nyamukuru y\u2019iyi kwimurwa ari imiterere y\u2019ibikoresho n\u2019aho ibitaro byari bisanzwe biherereye, hatari hakwiriye ku rwego rw\u2019ibitaro bya kaminuza.\nIbitaro bishya byubatswe ku nkunga y\u2019igihugu cy\u2019u Bushinwa, bikazagira ubushobozi burenze ubwo byari bifite, kuko bizaba bifite ibitanda birenga 800, ugereranyije n\u2019ibitanda 519 byari bihari mbere."}
