{"id": "20119", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20119", "title": "Paniel Meat Processing", "text": "Paniel Meat Processing Ltd (PMP) ni izina ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya Elite Meat Processors, kompanyi ikorera mu birwa bya morise (Mauritius) ikaba ifite ibikorwa byibanda ku musaruro no gukwirakwiza inyama ku mugabane w\u2019 Afurika. Elite Meat Processors yashyizweho kugira ngo igenzure kandi iyobore ibikorwa bya Paniel Meat Processing, ikaba ikorera mu birwa bya morise kandi kuva muri Ukuboza 2024 yashyizwe ku isoko ry\u2019imari n\u2019imigabane ryibirwa bya morise.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nPaniel Meat Processing (PMP) yashinzwe muri 2012 na Herv\u00e9 Tuyishime mu Rwanda, nyuma yo gutsinda irushanwa rya Guverinoma y'u Rwanda ryahurizaga hamwe ba rwiyemezamirimo.\nMuri 2013, Tuyishime hamwe na PMP batsindiye igihembo cy\u2019ubushabitsi cya REAL Fina Bank mu Rwanda. Mu ntangiriro, PMP yakoreraga mu murwa mukuru Kigali. Muri 2014, kompanyi yahinduye icyerekezo yibanda ku kohereza inyama zitunganyije hanze y\u2019igihugu, maze yimurira ibikorwa byayo i Rubavu, hafi y\u2019umupaka wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nMuri 2015, Tuyishime hamwe na PMP begukanye igihembo cya mbere mu irushanwa rya SPARK ryabereye mu Rwanda. Muri 2016, Tuyishime yatangije Livestock Bank, kompanyi igamije guha abahinzi n\u2019aborozi amatungo hamwe n\u2019ibindi bikoresho by\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi. Iyo kompanyi yaje kwihuza na PMP muri 2022.\nMuri 2019, PMP yari yaragutse ishyiramo ibicuruzwa bitandukanye birimo inyama z\u2019inka, intama, ihene, n\u2019inkoko, byose biboneka byihuse cyangwa bikonjeshejwe. Kompanyi yanashinze \"PMP Transport and Logistics\", igura amakamyo akonjesha n\u2019ibikoresho byo kubika mu bukonje. Kuva icyorezo cya COVID-19, PMP Transport and Logistics yabaye kompanyi yigenga yitwa TRUK Rwanda, ikora ibikorwa by\u2019ubwikorezi n\u2019itangwa ry\u2019ibicuruzwa, ikorera andi masosiyete y\u2019ibiribwa n\u2019ubuhinzi mu karere k\u2019Iburasirazuba bwa Afurika."}
{"id": "20120", "revid": "15794", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20120", "title": "Monmwi", "text": "agace gatagaje muramerika bita monowi.\nAkogace bavugako karigatuwe na bantu baza kukavaho bakajya mu yindi migi yamerika hazagusiga abantu babiri muruwo mugi bita monmwi amatekayahohantu avugaako abo bantu babiri bahagumye baka habyarira abana ariko bakaza gukura nabo bakajya mu yindi migi ariko hashije igihe umugabo yitaba imana umugore ara hasigara bavu gako ntagikorya cyaleta wahasanga twavuga nka mashuri,ibitaro,isoko nibindi bikorwa remezo ubungubu akogace gatuwe nu muntu umwe akaba ahafite ibikorwa bitandu kanye akaba yaru baste isomero ry'ibita bavuga ko umugabowe yakundaga gusoma ibitabo abantu bakaza kubisoa kandi yubaste aho abo bantu biyakirira iyo abakuru bimigi bitabiriye inama nawe ajyayo mu nama ubu uy'umugi utuwe nu muntu umwe"}
{"id": "20121", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20121", "title": "Vister rwanda", "text": "Vister Rwanda.\nVister rwanda nijambo mururimi rwacu rwikinyarwanda risobanura riti sura urwanda irijambo ryamenyekanye mubihugu byohanze bituma urwanda rumenyekana mubihugu byohanze ndetse nokwisi hose.aho usanga visterwanda ikoreshwa kumyambaro yamakipe atandukanye yomubihugu byiburayi byatumye amahanga ashaka kumenya urwanda bitewe niryo jambo rya vister rwanda nibyokoko murwanda harimo byinshi byogusura nki biringa,park yakagera,ibiyaga ndetse namashyamba kimeza nibyinshibigize urwanda kereka urwandittse mubitabo byamateka mundimi zose"}
{"id": "20123", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20123", "title": "Parfait Yongabo", "text": "Parfait Yongabo n'umunyarwanda akaba n'impuguke mu miyoborere y' ubushakashatsi n'udushya (innovation systems) akaba n'umwarimu w' ibijyanye n'ubushakashatsi muri IPRC Rwanda, akaba umuyobozi mu rwego rw'uburezi n'ubushakashatsi. yagize uruhare rukomeye muguteza imbere politiki y'ubushakashatsi n'udushya mu Rwanda, by'umwihariko murwego rw'ubuhinzi n'iterambere ry'ubumenyi.\nAmashuri.\nYongabo yakuye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (PhD) Muri Lund University yo muri Suwede aho yibanze kumiyoborere y'ubushakashatsi n'udushya.Yabanje kwiga muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda, ahakuye impamyabumenyi y'ikiciri cya gatatu Master's mu kubungabunga ibinyabuzima n'imicungire y'umutungo kamere.\nUmwuga.\nParfait Yongabo ni Umuyobozi ushinzwe iterambere ry'ibigo, ubushakashatsi bushingiye kubikorwa n'ubujyanama IDARC muri Rwanda Polytechnic. Mbere y'aho, yabaye umwarimu n'umushakashatsi muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda ishuri ry'ubuhinzi n'ubuvuzi bw'amatungo CAVM, ndetse anayobora gahunda ya Mastercard Foundation Scholars Program.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nYongabo n'umugabo arubatse afite umwana umwe w'umuhungu n'umugore, kandi n'abanyarwanda batuye ikigali mu karere ka Kicukiro nyuma yuko basoje amashuli yabo mugihugu cya Suwede. Amashuri abanza yayize mumajyepfo aho bita Muruhango Mukarere ka Nyanza, yarezwe n'umubyeyi umwe nawe waje kwitaba Imana mumwaka wa 2022. \nUbushakashatsi.\nUbushakashatsi bwa Yongabo bugaruka ku miyoborere y'ubumenyi, iterambere ry'udushya, n'imikoranire hagati ya leta, amashuri makuru n'abikorera. Yanditse inyandiko zinyuranye,zirimo\n\"Constructing the national innovation system in Rwanda, efforts and challenges. \n\"Emergence of an agricultural innovation systems in Rwanda, Stakeholders and policies as point of departure \n\"Technology and innovation trajectories in the Rwandan agricultural sector, Are value chain an option?\"\nUbushakashatsi bwe bwerekana uburyo u Rwanda rushyiraho politiki n'imiyoborere y'ubushakashatsi n'udushya, n'uruhare rwabyo mu iterambere ry'igihugu.\nIbihembo n'Imikoranire.\nYongabo yahawe ibihembo bitandukanye, birimo,\nYakoze imikoranire n'ibigo mpuzamahanga nka FAO, Sida, Belspo, Nuffic, IDRC, EU-JRC, University College London, na University of Johannesburg."}
{"id": "20125", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20125", "title": "Flim nyarwanda", "text": "Flim nyarwanda nikimwemubikorwa bigaragaza k'urwandarumazegutera imbere kukigerocyohejuru.Ubu urubyirukorwinshi rusigayerwumvako flim arakazikatunga umuntu mubuzimabwaburimunsi ndetse bamwe murubyiruko bafatira ikitegererezo kubakinnyi bomeye ho ikitegererezo nka papa sava,bamenya,nyaxo nabandi.Arikoharinabumvako flim itatunga umuntu ariko sikobiri flim nakazinkakandikosekatunga abantu"}
{"id": "20126", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20126", "title": "Papa leo XIV", "text": " PAPA LEO XIV:UMUNYAMERIKA WATOREWE KUBA UMUSHUMBA MUKURU WA KILIZYA \nInteko y'Abacardinal 133 bateraniye muri chapel ya sistinei vatican kuri uyu mugoroba wa taliki 8 gicurasi 2025 yatoye umushumba mushya wa kiliziya catholic,Cardinal Robert Francis Prevost.\nitorwa rya papa mushya ryemejwe n'umwotsi w'umweru wazamutse kuri chapel ya sistine,ahaberaga iri tora kuva taliki 7 Gicurasi. Bisobanuye ko mu itora,umukandida kuri uyu mwanya yabonye yabonye amajwi ari hejuru ya 89 muri 133 y'Abacardinal bitabiriye iri tora.\nCardinal Robert Prevost ukomoka muri leta zunze ubumwe z'Amerika yatowe nyuma yuko habaye ibyiciro bitanu by'itora birimo kimwe cyabaye taliki ya 7 Gicurasi n'ibindi bine byabaye kuya 8 Gicurasi 2025.Yafashe izina ry'ubutungane rya \"leo XIV\"\nPapa leo XIV yavukiye mu mujyi wa chicago muri leta lllinois taliki ya 14 nzeri 1955.Yagizwe umucardinal na Papa Francis taliki ya 15 mata 2023,amuragiza diyoseze ya callao muri peru.\nNiwe cardinal wa mbere ukomoka muri leta zunze ubumwe z'Amerika utorewe kuyobora kiliziya.Ibi byashimishije president Donald Trump wagaragazako yifuza kubona papa mushya aturuka mu gihugu cye.\nMu 2023,papa leo XIV yagaragajeko kiliziya idakwiye kwigisha amahame yayo gusa ahubwo ko ikwiye kwereka isi yose igisobanuro cyo kumenya yezu kristu.\nAti\"kenshi tuganzwa no kwigisha amahame... arik tukibagirwako umurimo wacu wi banze ari ukwigisha icyo kumenya kristu bisobanuye umurimo wacu ni ukwagura ihema tukareka buri wese akinjira muri kiliziya.\"\nUbu butumwa buca amarenga ko Papa leo XIV yiteguye kugendera mu murongo Papa francis yasimbuye kuri iyi nshingano,urimo kudaheza uwo ariwe wese ushaka kumugisha w'Imana,uko yabateye nimibereho yaba abyeho yose.\nCyakoze ntabwo avugwaho rumwe kuko,nkuko byatangajwe n'ikinyamakuru THE PILLAR muri nzeri 2024,Papa leo XIV ntiyigeze akurikirana ikirego cy'abagore bashinjaga abapadiri babiri kubahohotera mu 2007.Ibyo byabereye muri diyoseze ya callao muri peru, Yayobowe na Papa leo XIV kuva 2014 kugeza 2023 ubwo yahabwaga inshingano i roma."}
{"id": "20127", "revid": "15794", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20127", "title": "Iisirikare gikomeye kwisi", "text": "Ibihugu 25 bifite igisirikare karahabutaka ku Isi.\nUrutonde rushya rugaragaza uko ibihugu bifite igisirikare gikomeye ku Isi bikurikirana ruyobowe icya 1 Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika,2 Uburusiya 3 Bushinwa.USA ikoresha asaga miliyari 600 z\u2019amadolari ya Amerika buri mwaka, mu ngengo y\u2019imari igenerwa urwego rw\u2019umutekano rubarirwamo abawushinzwe 145 215 000.U Burusiya buza ku mwanya wa kabiri, bushora ari hasi ya miliyari 45 z\u2019amadolari ya Amerika mu rwego rw\u2019umutekano, mu gihe u Bushinwa bwo bukoresha asaga miliyari 161 z\u2019amadolari nkuko bitangazwa n\u2019urubuga rusesengura ibya gisirikare ruzwi nka Global FirepoweU Bushinwa na bwo bufite ubwato bumwe rukumbi butwara indege z\u2019intambara buzwi nka \u201cSoviet-era Liaoning\u201d, imodoka z\u2019intambara 6,457, indege 2, 955, ubwato busanzwe 714 n\u2019ingabo 2,335,000"}
{"id": "20128", "revid": "15794", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20128", "title": "Igihugugikize kuruta ibindi", "text": "Ibihugu 3 bikize kurusha ibindi muri Afurika.\n1.Afurika y\u2019Epfo\nAfurika y\u2019Epfo iza ku mwanya wa mbere ku rutonde rw\u2019ibihugu bikize muri Afurika hashingiwe ku musaruro mbumbe.\nIki gihugu gifite umusaruro mbumbe wa miliyari 595.7 z\u2019amadorali. Ubukungu bushingiye cyane ku mabuye y\u2019agacuro nka diyama na Zahabu.\n2. Egypt(Misiri)\nEgypt ni igihugu cya kabiri gikize muri Afurika, gifite umusaruro mbumbe wa miliyari 551.4 z\u2019amadorali.\nUbukungu bwa Egypt bushingiye ku ikoranabuhanga, ubukerarugendo bitewe n\u2019ibirango by\u2019amateka ifite nka za Pyramide...abaturage benshi bitungiwe n\u2019ibikorwa bakorera ku nkengero z\u2019uruzi rwa Nil.\n3. Nigeria\nKu mugabane w\u2019Afurika yose Nigeria ni igihugu cya gatatu gikize, gifite umusaruro mbumbe wa miliyari 478.5 z\u2019amadorali. Ni igihugu cya mbere gituwe cyane muri Afurika, inganda zacyo zituma kiza ku mwanya wa gatatu mu bihugu bizifite nyinshi muri Afurika."}
