{"id": "20132", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20132", "title": "INDIRIMBO YIGIHUGU CY'U RWANDA", "text": "Indirimbo yubahiriza igihugu cy'u Rwanda N'indirimbo yahanzwe numugabo witwa munyaneza vedaste ahagana 2001 afatanyije nabagenzibe bari bafunganye murigereza ya karubanda mukarere ka Huye uyumugobo witwa munyaneza vedaste avugako Natangiye indirimbo yitwa \u2018Rwanda Nziza\u2019 ariko mu itangira ryayo hari amakosa nari nakoze.Abandi barambwiraga bati ibe \u2018Rwanda Rwiza, Rwanda Yacu, Rwanda Rwacu, ibintu nk\u2019ibyo. Bakambaza bati se ni Nziza nk\u2019iki? Biba ngombwa ko tubiganiraho tubyemeranyaho ikomeza ityo.\u201d"}
{"id": "20137", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20137", "title": "Umugaba mukuru w'ingabo za Carabinieri", "text": "Umugaba mukuru wa Carabinieri ni muntu ki??\nJenerali Salvatore LUONGO, yavukiye i Naples ku ya 6 Kamena 1962, yatangiye umwuga we wa gisirikare mu 1977, yiga mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya (Nunziatella) i Naples, mu ishuri rya gisirikare rya Modena na Carabinieri Application School i Roma. Afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'amategeko, ubumenyi bwa politiki n'umutekano w'imbere mu gihugu, afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'ubumuntu yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Gregorian i Roma. Yize icyiciro cya 2 mu kigo cy'amashuri yisumbuye. Ni umuhanga mu rurimi rw'Icyongereza. Yakoranye na Kaminuza ya Roma IV mu nshingano zo kwigisha, guhangana n'ibyaha by'ubuvuzi bwa forensic ndetse by'umwihariko kurwanya ikoreshwa ry'ibiyobyabwenge. Yari umwarimu n'umugenzuzi w'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Masters \"Open Innovation and Entrepreunership\" muri Kaminuza ya Campus Biomedico University of Rome."}
{"id": "20138", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20138", "title": "Ikigo cya carabiniyeri", "text": "\"ISHURI RYABOFISIYE RYA CARABINIERI\"\nCorps ya kera ya Royal Carabinieri yashinzwe muri Turin n'Umwami wa Sardinia Vittorio Emanuele wa I, na Warrant Royal ku ya 13 Nyakanga 1814.CC_Salvo_D'Acquisto.\nNi ishuri rya ba ofisiye ba Carabinieri riherereye mu Butaliyani / Roma unyuze kuri Aurelia. Ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 1976, hiyongereyeho amasomo n'umubare wa ba ofisiye, cyitiriwe Major Ugo De Carolis, umudari wa Zahabu wa Carabinieri ku bw'intwari za gisirikare (muri memoriam) na Martyr wa Fosse Ardeatine.\nIri shuri ni ishuri rinini kandi ryiza rifite ubuso bungana na metero kare 82.000, Isomero, agace ka intranet yemerera abitabiriye bose guhuza umurongo wa interineti, laboratoire y'ururimi, ibyumba by'amashuri makuru, ibikoresho by'imikino yo mu nzu no hanze, hamwe no kurasa.Iri shuri kandi rifite ibyiciro byinshi byabanyeshuri nkabanyeshuri baba barabanje gukora umwana umwe i Modena bakaza bagakora indi myaka 3 y'amasomo muri kino kigo, uruhare rwamashyamba, tekiniki ninshingano zo gusaba.\nirishuri kandi ryagiye rinyura mubihe bitandukanya kandi bikomeye hagiye hakoreshwa uburyo bwinshi bwo kwinjira muri iri shuri ku buryo bubiri bwa mbere bwo kwinjiza mu gisirikare, byasabwaga kandi kwitabira amasomo yo gusaba igihe cyagenwe n\u2019amabwiriza yihariye agenewe abapolisi bo mu Ishuri rya Gisirikare.Ubutaliyani bwinjiye mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose bwazanye izindi nteko zishinga amategeko ku bijyanye no gushaka abapolisi.\nIndahiro ya Ofisiye Cadets wo mu mutwe wa Carabinieri byabaye mu 1943 na byo byagize ingaruka zikomeye ku ishuri rikuru rya Royal Carabinieri, riherereye mu mujyi wa Florence, ryinjijwe mu ngabo z\u2019igihugu cya Repubulika, umutwe witwaje intwaro wasimbuye burundu Corps ya Royal Carabinieri mu ifasi iyobowe na Repubulika y\u2019Ubutaliyani. Muri ubwo buryo, Ishuri ryiboneye ibyabaye mu ngabo za guverinoma ya Sal\u00f2, riva i Florence ryerekeza Lodi, kugeza Ubutaliyani bubohoye.\nNubwo Ishuri Rikuru ryari ryaretse kubaho, Carabinieri ntishobora kureka ibikorwa byamahugurwa make, ikoresheje ubuhanga busanzwe bwo kwigisha bwa ba Komanda, burigihe bwagiye bugengwa mumabwiriza rusange. Hamwe no kubohora Ubutaliyani, byashobokaga gukomeza gahunda yo kuvugurura Corps ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu, bityo, no mu mashami y\u2019amahugurwa: gusa mu 1949 ni bwo amasomo y\u2019abofisiye yakomereje kuri iryo shuri, yakira amasomo yo gusaba abaliyetona ba kabiri muri s.p.e. guturuka mu Ishuri rya Gisirikare rya Modena, icyakora hamwe n'umwe gusa.\nMu 1952 Ishuri rikuru rya Carabinieri ryaretse kubaho, kugira ngo risubire kuba ishuri rya ba ofisiye ba Carabinieri. Mu 1951, hamwe n\u2019ivugururwa ry\u2019Ingabo nyuma y\u2019Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, byongeye kumva ko hakenewe urugero rw\u2019amahugurwa y\u2019abasirikare ba Carabinieri mu nyubako nshya yagaragaye i Roma, mu kigo cya Vanvitellian cyanyuze kuri Garibaldi, ubu kikaba ari icyicaro gikuru cy\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019akarere \"Podgora\", aho amasomo asanzwe yatangiriye ku ya 1 Ugushyingo 1952.Mu 1975, izina rya Carabinieri Officers School ryagaruwe."}
{"id": "20141", "revid": "8075", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20141", "title": "Akagali ka Birembo", "text": "Akagari ka birembo ni kamwe mutugari tugize umurenge wa sovu. Gaherereye mu murenge wa Sovu Akarere ka Ngororero Intara y'Uburengerazuba. n'akagari kagizwe n'imidugudu ine ariyo Birembo, Kanyana, Musenyi na Kagano. Gakorerwamo imirimo itandukanye cyane cyane iyubuhinzi, n'ubworezi urugero koperative Terimbere yo mubirembo yorora ingurube.\nAbaturage bagatuyemo bakaba bishimira iterambere bamaze kugezwaho harimo imihanda nibindi.\nISHAKIRO.\nngororero.gov.rw"}
{"id": "20142", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20142", "title": "Umurenge wa Ngororero", "text": "Umurenge wa Ngororero ni umwe mu mirenge 13 igize Akarere ka Ngororero, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari dutandatu.\nMu 2022, Umurenge wa Ngororero wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 38.823. Ni wo murenge ufite abaturage benshi mu Karere ka Ngororero.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Ngororero uherereye mu burasirazuba bw\u2019Akarere ka Ngororero. Ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 58,50.\nMu majyaruguru, Umurenge wa Ngororero uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Matyazo. Mu burengerazuba, uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Hindiro n\u2019Umurenge wa Kageyo. Mu majyepfo, uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Muhororo.\nImiterere y\u2019ubuyobozi.\nUmurenge wa Ngororero ugizwe n\u2019utugari dutandatu:\nAkarere ka Ngororero kagizwe n\u2019imirenge 13, utugari 73 n\u2019imidugudu 419.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Ngororero wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 34.559. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, abaturage bari 38.823. Muri bo, abagore bari 20.569, abagabo bari 18.254.\nMu 2022, abaturage 9.106 babaga mu mujyi. Abandi 29.717 babaga mu cyaro. Ubucucike bwari abaturage 663,6 kuri kilometero kare.\nMu mirenge 13 y\u2019Akarere ka Ngororero, Umurenge wa Ngororero ni wo wari ufite abaturage benshi mu 2022.\nUbwikorezi.\nUmuhanda Muhanga\u2013Ngororero\u2013Mukamira unyura mu Murenge wa Ngororero. Icyicaro cy\u2019Akarere ka Ngororero kiri kuri uwo muhanda. Kiri ku birometero 46,6 uvuye i Muhanga. Kiri no ku birometero 60 uvuye i Mukamira."}
{"id": "20144", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20144", "title": "Ingoma y'Urweya Mu Rwanda Rwohambere", "text": "Amateka.\nIngoma y'U Rweya, bakunze kwita u Rweya rw'u Mubali, ni kimwe mu bihugu bya mbere byaranzwe kuri ubu butaka bw'u Rwanda, kikaba n'igihugu cya mbere Abazigaba bahanze bakigera my by'ino, ahasaga mu wa 400. Ni ingoma yari iherereye kuri ubu mu Karere ka Kayonza y'Amajyaruguru n'Akarere ka Gatsibo.\nGakondo nkuru yabo ari nayo yabaye intebe y'ingoma y'Abazigaba, ni mu Mirenge ya Mwiri na Murundi yo mu karere ka Kayonza, wongereho Umurenge wa Rwimbogo wo mu Akarere ka Gatsibo. Ako karere, ni ko bororokeyemo mbere y'uko bakwira mu gihugu cyose no mu bihugu dutandukanye nka Tanzania, Uganda n'u Burundi.\nUmukurambere w'Abazigaba ari nawe wahanze ingoma y'u Rweya rw'u Mubali, ni Kazigaba, ingoma Ngabe yabo nk'ikirango cy'igihugu yari \"sera'.Umwami wagengaga ingoma y'u Rweya rw'u Mubali mu iyaduka ry'Abanyiginya muri aka karere, ni Kabeja, ari na we se wa Nyamigezi wabaye sekuru wa Gihanga, kuko se Kazi yashatse Nyirarukangaga rwa Nyamigezi, babyarana Gihanga n;abandi bana.\nIngoma y'u Rweya rw'u Mubali, yigaruriwe na Kigeli Ndabarasa ahasaga mu wa 1740. Icyogihe yica Biyoro umwami w'icyo gihugu, ingoma yabo izima ityo. Ubutaka bwayo babwomeka ku Rwanda."}
{"id": "20147", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20147", "title": "Umusozi wa kalisimbi", "text": "Umusozi wa kalisimbi ni umwe mumisozi miremire muri afurika, ukaba ahantu nyaburanga u Rwanda rufite hakurura ba mukerarugendo baturutse hirya nohino ku isi, bitewe nuko ufite ibintu byinshi bidasanzwe namateka yihariye. kalisimbi iherereye mu majyaruguru y' u Rwanda kumupaka uruhuza na Repubulika iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo.\nkalisimbi ifite uburebure bungana na metero 4507 kandi ikaba ifite namasimbi kugasongero kayo \nINKOMOKO\n1.Kalisimbi Events yashimiwe uruhare igira mu guteza imbere itangwa rya serivisi nziza | IGIHE\n2.Ikirunga cyamize abazungu, umunara udasanzwe ku gasongero; ibintu 6 bidasanzwe kuri Karisimbi - #rwanda #RwOT\n3.Ikirunga cyamize abazungu, umunara udasanzwe ku gasongero; ibintu 6 bidasanzwe kuri Karisimbi - #rwanda #RwOT"}
{"id": "20148", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20148", "title": "Umusozi wa muhabura", "text": "umusozi wa muhabura nimwe mumisozi miremire u Rwanda rufite cyikaba giherere mumajyaruguru y'u Rwanda muturere twa burera na musanze gifite amateka maremare yatumye kitwa iryozina kuko mbere atariko cyitwaga, umusozi wamuhabura ukaba wariswe izina n'umwami w'u Rwanda rwa kera witwa kigeli nyamuheshera mu myaka ya 1600, ubwo yaguraga u Rwanda.\ninkomoko\nInkomoko y'izina Muhabura ryiswe ikirunga cya Muhabura | InyaRwanda.com"}
{"id": "20149", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20149", "title": "Umusozi wa kanyarira", "text": "Iyo umuntu avuze izina Kanyarira buri wese ahita yumva umusozi muremure uherereye mu ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo mu karere ka RUHANGO umurenge wa Byimana akagari ka Mpanda ukunze guhurirwaho n\u2019abakirisitu batandukanye bajya kuwusengeraho ngo basubizwe bimwe mu bibazo bafite.\nbamwe mu basaza bahabyirukiye kuva kera bavuga ko izina Kanyarira rikomoka ku mazi yaturukaga mu biti biteye kuri uyu musozi agahora atonyanga kubera ikime cyahahoraga muri ibyo biti mu bihe byo hambere.\nBitewe n\u2019imyizerere y\u2019abantu uyu musozi waje guhinduka ahantu twakwita hatagatifu abantu baza kuhayoboka bakajya bahasengera.\nKubera ko haje kugwa abantu bari mu masengesho inzego z\u2019ubuyobozi zabujije abantu kujya kuhasengera ariko byanga gucika burundu kuko nubu hari abajya kuhasengera bizeye ko ibibazo bafite biri bukemuke bizeye ko Imana iri bubafashe kubikemura.\nAbagiye bapfira kuri uyu musozi w\u2019Amasengesho ngo bagiye bazira impanuka zijyanye n\u2019imiterere y\u2019aho baba bagiye gusengera ugasanga batungurwa kandi nta butabazi bubari hafi ngo ugize ikibazo abe yafashwa ku buryo bwihuse."}
{"id": "20150", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20150", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Cyambwe", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Cyambwe ni ikiyaga cyo mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Giherereye mu Akarere ka Kirehe, mu Murenge wa Nasho.\nIkiyaga cya Cyambwe kiri hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Nasho. Kibamo amafi, imvubu n'ingona. Amazi yacyo akoreshwa mu kuhira imyaka.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Cyambwe kiri mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Giherereye mu Murenge wa Nasho, mu Karere ka Kirehe. Kiri ku ntera ya kilometero 2,7 mu burasirazuba bw'Ikiyaga cya Nasho.\nIbinyabuzima n'akamaro.\nMu Kiyaga cya Cyambwe haba amafi, imvubu n'ingona. Ikiyaga gitanga umusaruro munini w'amafi. Amazi yacyo akoreshwa mu kuhira imyaka, mu mushinga wo kuhira wa Nasho. Akarere ka Kirehe gashishikariza abaturage kurinda ikiyaga no kwirinda uburobyi butemewe."}
{"id": "20151", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20151", "title": "Ishuri ryimyitozo yagisirikare rya nasho", "text": "ishuri ryimyitozo yagisirikare rya nasho riherereye mu karere ka kirehe hagati yumurenge wa mpanga na nasho \nrikaba ritanga imyitozo kubasirikare bato (BASIC TRAINING CENTER NASHO)\nirishuri rigaragara hagati yibiyaga bya cyambwe na nasho kandi rikaba riri mu ishyamba.\nigisirikare cyu rwanda kivugako abanyeshuri binjira buri mwaka abeshi batorezwa mwishuri rya nasho kandi ko baba bafite ubumenyi buhagie mubya gisirikare.\nigisirikare cyu rwanda.\nigisirikare cyurwanda cyatangaje ko cyunguka abasirikare bashya harimo inkumi nabasore batorejwe mu ishuri rya nasho buri mwaka"}
{"id": "20152", "revid": "15375", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20152", "title": "GS NYAMIRAMA", "text": "GS Nyamirama ni ikigo giherereye mu karere ka Gatsibo mu murenge wa Gitoki, akagari ka nyamirama, umudugudu wa nyamuraza.Kigizwe n'amashuri abanza ndetse nayisumbuye.mu myaka ibiri ishize nibwo iki kigo cyongereye isoko yubumenyi kubanyesuri aho cyashyizeho amashuri yinshuke aho abana batangira kwiga bahereye hasi bakazamuka bafite ireme ry'ubumenyi buhagije ugereranije igihe cyagiye kibanza abana, bigagaga bahereye mu mashuri abanza."}
{"id": "20153", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20153", "title": "Igishanga cya Rwabuye", "text": "Igishanga cya rwabuye ni igishanga gihereye mu ntara y'amajyepfo mu karere ka Huye ni kumuhanda uva mu mugi wa Kigali werekeza mu mugi wa Huye. \nIki gishanga gikunzwe kwibasirwa n'ibiza ndetse n'umwuzure mugihe cy'imvura nyinshi. \nIki gishanga ahanini hacyo gihingwamo igihingwa cy'umuceri, nawo wangiza n'amazi menshi akunze guterwa n'imvura nyinshi. abaturage batuye muri iki gishanga bavugako iyo imvura y'u kwa kane itangiye kugwa baba bareba neza neza uko amazi atangira kuza nabo bagahita bafata utwangushye bagahungira kumuhanda bakaza kugaruka ari uko imvura ihise. "}
{"id": "20154", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20154", "title": "Ingufu za Hydrogen", "text": "Ingufu za hydrogen.\nNi ingufu z'ikinyabutabire kiboneka mu mazi (H20) cyangwa kigacukurwa mu misozi ikindi nuko ikinyabutabire hydrogen(H2) gishobora gucanywa ndetse cyikifashishwa mu gukora amabuye (fuelcells) mu gutanga amashanyarazi \nEjo hazaza hi ngufu za Hydrogen y' Icyatsi.\nTumenye hydrogen y'icyatsi ni Hadrogen itangiza ibidukikije (Eco-hydrogen) ni hydrodero y'amararankuba yakozwe hakoreshejwe ingufu zishya mu gutandukanya amazi. Ubu buryo ngombwa bukoresha mashini itandukanya amazi (electrolyzer) ifite imishinga y'anode na cathode, ikoresha amashanyarazi (akenshi aturuka kumwimerere) kugirango itandukanye amazi. Hydrodero y'amararankuba isohoka ikoreshwa, ituma turwanya impinduka z'ikirere kandi ituma dushobora kugera ku ntego yo kugabanya umwuka mubi hasi cyane mu mwaka wa 2050. Hakoreshejwe hydrodero y'amararankuba mu bikorwa byo gutwika amazi (boiler) aho gukoresha amavuta aturuka mu byasigaye mu butaka, byagabanya cyane kwangirika kw' ikirere, bigatuma turi hafi y'aho tutazongera kugira inyongera z'ikirere. "}
{"id": "20155", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20155", "title": "Ibyiza bya kirehe", "text": "kirehe nakarere ko murwanda gahana imbibi nigihugu cya tanzaniya kakaba kagizwe\nnimirenge cumi nibiri mpanga, nasho, gatore,kirehe,mahama,kigina, nyarubuye,gahara,mushikiri,nyamugari,kigarama, nyamugari.\nkakaba gatatswe nudusozi dutandukanye nibiyaga nka cyambwe nasho nisumo rya rusumo amashyamba ya makera."}
{"id": "20156", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20156", "title": "Umurenge wa Kamabuye", "text": "Umurenge wa Kamabuye ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Bugesera, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 101,8.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kamabuye wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 502.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAho uherereye.\nAkarere ka Bugesera kari mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Kagizwe n'imirenge 15. Umurenge wa Kamabuye ni umwe muri iyo mirenge. Umurenge wa Kamabuye ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 101,8.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kamabuye wari utuwe n'abaturage 20 843. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 502. Abagore bari 12 542. Abagabo bari 11 960. Ubucucike bwari abaturage 240,6 kuri kilometero kare."}
{"id": "20157", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20157", "title": "Umurenge wa Kanama", "text": "Umurenge wa Kanama ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 42,91.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kanama wari utuwe n'abaturage 37 584.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAho uherereye.\nUmurenge wa Kanama ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Rubavu. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 42,91.\nAmateka.\nKera, Kanama yari komini yo muri Perefegitura ya Gisenyi. Isoko rya Mahoko ryari muri iyo komini.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kanama wari utuwe n'abaturage 29 220. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 37 584.\nMu 2022, abagore bari 19 846, naho abagabo bari 17 738. Abaturage 16 488 babaga mu mujyi. Abandi 21 096 babaga mu cyaro. Ubucucike bwari abaturage 876 kuri km\u00b2 1.\nAbana bari munsi y'imyaka 15 bari 16 045. Abari hagati y'imyaka 15 na 64 bari 20 474. Abarengeje imyaka 64 bari 1 065."}
