{"id": "20159", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20159", "title": "Umurenge wa Mpanga", "text": "Umurenge wa Mpanga ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kirehe, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mpanga wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 40 173. Uri ku mupaka wa Tanzaniya. Ufite ibiyaga bibiri n\u2019ishyamba kimeza rya Ibanda-Makera.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Mpanga ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 248,6. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari turindwi: Bwiyorere, Kankobwa, Mpanga, Mushongi, Nasho, Nyakabungo na Rubaya.\nUhana imbibi n\u2019Akarere ka Kayonza mu majyaruguru. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Nasho mu burengerazuba. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Nyarubuye n\u2019Umurenge wa Mahama mu majyepfo. Uhana imbibi na Tanzaniya mu burasirazuba. Uwo mupaka ni umugezi w\u2019Akagera. Mu murenge hari ibiyaga bya Cyambwe na Rwampanga.\nIshyamba kimeza rya Ibanda-Makera riri mu Kagari ka Nasho. Rifite ubuso bwa hegitari 169.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mpanga wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 31 771. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 40 173. Abagabo bari 19 480. Abagore bari 20 693. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "20160", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20160", "title": "Pariki nkuru n'umusozi wa Algon", "text": "Pariki y'igihugu ya mount Elgon ni pariki yo mugihugu cya Kenya ihuriyeho na Uganga ifite ubuso ubuso bwa 140 km (87 mi) mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Victoria. pariki ifite ubuso bwa 1,279 kilometa (494 sq mi). igice cya uganda mu parike gifite 1,110 km mu gihe ogice cya kenya gifite ubuso bwa 169 km.\nUmusozi wa Elgon.\nIyi pariki bayise umusozi Elgon, akaba ari ikirunga cyazimiye kikaba cyari giherereye ku mupaka wa Uganda na Kenya, Pariki y'igihugu ya mount Elgon igabanyijemo umwihariko wa kenya na Uganda, umusozi wa Elgon kandi ukaba ufite amazi akomoka ku ruzi Nzola, rutemba rugana ku kiyaga cya Victoria, no ku ruzi rwa Turkwel rutemba mu kiyaga cya kurkana \nIkirere.\nUmusozi wa Elgon ufite ikirere gifite ubuhehere kandi bwumutse kigagira kandi umvura y'umwaka irenga 1,270 mm (50 in), Ibihe byumye bizwi nkimpeshyi bitangira muri kamena kugeza kanama no mukuboza kugeza werurwe, imvura ishobora kugwa igihe icyo aricyo cyose, umusozi wa Elgon iterwaho ibimera byinshi bitandukanye mu mashyamba ya montana kugaza ku gasozi keza kegeranye lobelle, pariki ya Elgon kandi ufimo ubwoko bw'inyamanswa burenga 400 butandukanye ukabaho kandi ubwoko bwinyoni byibuze 144, igishimishije cyane nubwoko bw'inyozi za jackson,igice cy'iburasirazuba cy'uzuyemo inuma \nIbidukikije ku musozi wa Elgon.\nMbere y'ubuyobozi bw'ubukoroni, ubutaka bukikijwe n'umusozi wa Elgon bw'acungwaga hashingiwe ku miterere n'ingufu z'abasangwabutaka, byabuzaga gukoresha cyane umutungo kamere ku butumburuke rusange bw'umusozi, ibisabwa kuri ubwo buryo byujuje ku buryo burambye kubera ko ubucucike bw'abaturage mu gace kegeranye bwari bukubye inshuro nyinshyi ugereranije nubu."}
{"id": "20161", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20161", "title": "Select Express LTD (Rwanda)", "text": "Select Express LTD ni ikigo cy'igenga gikorera mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda kikaba gitanga serivisi y'ubwikorezi bw'abantu n'ibintu mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda by'umwihariko mu ntara y'Uburasirazuba.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nSelect Express LTD ni ikigo cyashinzwe ku italiki ya 2 Gicurasi mu mwaka wa 2013, kikaba cyaremejwe n'urwego rushinzwe kugenzura imikorere y'inzego zimwe z'imirimo ifitiye igihugu akamaro (RURA). Aho uru rwego rwahaye iki kigo uburenganzira bwo gutanga serivisi y'ubwikorezi bw'abantu n'ibintu mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda.\nSelect Express LTD ifite icyicaro cyayo gikuru mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nIbyerekezo ikoreramo.\nSelect Express LTD nk'ikigo gitanga serivisi z'ubwikorezi bw'abantu n'ibintu mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda by'umwihariko mu ntara y'Iburasirazuba, ikorera mu byerekezo bitandukanye bikurikira aho ivana ikanajya abantu n'ibintu muri ibi byerekezo bikurikira;"}
{"id": "20162", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20162", "title": "Kigali Marriott Hotel", "text": "Kigali Marriott Hotel ni hoteri nziza y'ubucuruzi iherereye mu mujyi wa Kigali k'umuhanda KN3, mu akarere ka Nyarugenge, imbere y'ambasade y'Ubushinwa, n\u2019ibiro by'umujyi wa Kigali mu Rwanda. Iyi hotel ifite ubunararibonye mu kwakira abashyitsi no gutanga serivisi zitandukanye zirimo kwakira ibirori mpuzamahanga, inama zikomeye, Ubukwe n'amahugurwa."}
{"id": "20163", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20163", "title": "Ikigega cy'Imari yo Gusana Imihanda", "text": "Ikigega cy'Imari yo gusana Imihanda RMF(Road Maintenance Fund) n' Ikigo cya letay' u Rwanda cyashinzwe n'itegeko No.49/2013 rya 28/06/2013 ryasohowe mw'igazeti ya leta riteganya inshingano zayo arizo zari gukusanya no gutera inkunga isana ry'imihanda mugihugu hose.\nInkomoko.\nNubwo iki kigo cyahawe ubwigenge n'itegeko rya 2013,Iki Ikigega cyashyizweho mu mwaka wa 1998,mw'iyubaka Igihigu bushyashya nyuma ya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994 muburyo bwo kubungabunga no gusana imihanda y'u Rwanda,Kuva cyashingwa, RMF(Road Maintenance Fund) yateye intambwe igaragara mu kubungabunga ndetse no Gusana imihanda nubwo yari ifite amikoro make.\nUmutungo w'ikigega.\nAhantu umutungo wiki Kigega uva ni ahantu hatandukanye nk'imisoro ya lisansi na mazutu bingana na 69.4% by'umutungo wiki kigo,ahandi kandi ni Umuhanda wishyurwa ku binyabiziga biremereye byo mu mahanga - wakwa hakurikijwe amabwiriza ya COMESA, utanga 29.6% byinjira muri RMF.Indi sooko kandi ni amande acibwa aberenga kumategeko yo mumuhanda,bingana na 1% byinjira muri RMF.\nImiyoborere.\nRMF ikora nk'ikigo cya Leta cyigenga gifite Inama y'Ubuyobozi, Umuyobozi Mukuru, n'abakozi ba tekinike n'imari,Bagenzurwa na Minisiteri ishinzwe ibikorwa remezo ndetse bagakorana bya hafi n'inzego z'uturere ndetse nizindi nzego za leta"}
{"id": "20168", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20168", "title": "Nyankorogoma", "text": "nyankorogoma nurugomero rutanga ingufu zamashanyarazi ziturutse kumazi zingana na 11kw\nururugomero rukaba rwarubatswe numuturange wagize igitekerezo aho amazi yasumaga yasenyeraga abaturange agatwara nimyaka yabo cyane cyane iyo imvura yabaga yaguye. umuturange witwa hakuzwumuremyi victor niwe wagize uruhare mukubaka uru rugomero rukaba rugaburira umidugudu nka kabuga na rudandi\nAho ruherereye.\nNyankorogoma iherereye mumurenge wa mpanga mumudugudu wa rudandi \namazi yasenyeraga abatuye muri nyawera village"}
{"id": "20169", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20169", "title": "Umurenge wa Busasamana", "text": "Umurenge wa Busasamana ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Busasamana wari utuwe n'abaturage 40 542.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere y\u2019ubuyobozi.\nUmurenge wa Busasamana ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Rubavu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Busasamana ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 35,15. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, wari utuwe n'abaturage 31 253. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 40 542: abagore 21 143 n'abagabo 19 399. Ubucucike bwari abantu 1 153 kuri kilometero kare.\nMu 2022, abaturage 17 379 bari bafite imyaka iri munsi ya 15. Abaturage 21 831 bari bafite imyaka iri hagati ya 15 na 64. Abaturage 1 332 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga.\nAbaturage 36 007 (88,8 %) bari batuye mu cyaro. Abaturage 4 535 (11,2 %) bari batuye mu mujyi."}
{"id": "20170", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20170", "title": "Umurenge wa Mayange", "text": "Umurenge wa Mayange ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Bugesera, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mayange wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 54 084. Kuva mu 2005, uyu murenge wakorewemo umushinga witwa \"Millennium Village Project\".\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Mayange ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 146,8. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari dutanu: Gakamba, Kagenge, Kibenga, Kibirizi na Mbyo.\nUhana imbibi n\u2019imirenge ya Nyamata, Rilima, Gashora, Rweru, Ngeruka na Musenyi.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mayange wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 29 835. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 54 084. Abagabo bari 27 433. Abagore bari 26 651. Abaturage 35 039 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 19 045 batuye mu cyaro.\nUbukungu.\nKuva mu 2000 kugeza mu 2005, imvura yabaye nkeya mu Murenge wa Mayange. Umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi wabaye muke, abaturage bagira inzara.\nMu 2005, umushinga \"Millennium Village Project\" watangiye gukorera mu Murenge wa Mayange. Uyu mushinga wigishije abaturage ubuhinzi burambye no kuhira imyaka. Wafashije abaturage gushinga amakoperative 42.\nMu 2014, Ubuyapani bwatanze inkunga ya miliyoni 1,2 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika. Iyo nkunga yari igenewe amazi meza, isuku, ubuvuzi n\u2019imirire mu Murenge wa Mayange."}
{"id": "20171", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20171", "title": "Ururimi rwikirashi", "text": "ni ururimi ruvugwa murwanda cyane cyane nabaturange baturuka muturere nka kirehe,ngoma na kayonza muduce tumwe na tumwe\nabaturange butu turere bavugako bamenye ikinyarwanda bari munkambi mugihugu cya tanzaniya. uru rurimi rwikirashi rwumvikana nkindimi zitandukanye zo mubihugu nka uganda (ikinyankore) tanzaniya (ikinyambo ni gihaya). ni ururimi rwumuco rwa kera mucyahoze ari igihugu kigisaka. \nurugero rwikirashi.\nmukuramukanya bavuga: 1.ago mwasibana bivuze amakuru mwirirwanye\n2. MUKOMIRE? BIVUZE MURAKOMEYE? "}
