{"id": "20173", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20173", "title": "Shalom Express LTD (Rwanda)", "text": "Shalom Express LTD ni ikigo cy'igenga gikorera mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda kikaba gitanga serivisi y'ubwikorezi bw'abantu n'ibintu mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda by'umwihariko mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nShalom Express LTD ni ikigo cyashinzwe ku italiki ya 2 Gicurasi mu mwaka wa 2013, kikaba cyaremejwe n'urwego rushinzwe kugenzura imikorere y'inzego zimwe z'imirimo ifitiye igihugu akamaro (RURA). Aho uru rwego rwahaye iki kigo uburenganzira bwo gutanga serivisi y'ubwikorezi bw'abantu n'ibintu mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda.\nShalom Express LTD ifite icyicaro cyayo gikuru mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nIbyerekezo ikoreramo.\nSelect Express LTD nk'ikigo gitanga serivisi z'ubwikorezi bw'abantu n'ibintu mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda by'umwihariko mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru, ikorera mu byerekezo bitandukanye bikurikira aho ivana ikanajya abantu n'ibintu muri ibi byerekezo bikurikira;"}
{"id": "20174", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20174", "title": "Isuku muri kayonza", "text": "nyuma yuko akarere ka kayonza gashyizwe mudufite imijyi yunganira umujyi wa kigali abashoramari basabye kwihutisha iterambere\nkugirango bibafashe gukomeza guteza imbere umujyi wa kayonza binyuze mukwimakaza isuku\naho akarere ka kayonza gaherereye.\naka karere gaherereye mu ntara yiburasirazuba gahana imbibi na rwamagana,ngoma,gatsibo na kirehe.\nuko isuku yifashe mumujyi wa kayonza.\nkayonza ni umwe mumijyi itatu yatoranyijwe murwanda izagezwaho numushinga wa lake vikitoria water na sanitation \nuzageza amazi mumujyi murwengo rwo kwimakaza isuku "}
{"id": "20175", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20175", "title": "Umurenge wa Cyanzarwe", "text": "Umurenge wa Cyanzarwe ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Cyanzarwe wari utuwe n'abaturage 38 977. Abenshi muri bo baba mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'abaturage.\nUmurenge wa Cyanzarwe ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 34,8. Mu 2012, wari utuwe n'abaturage 29 615. Mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 38 977. Muri bo, abagabo ni 18 662, abagore ni 20 315. Abaturage 6 521 baba mu mujyi. Abandi 32 456 baba mu cyaro. Ubucucike ni abantu 1 120 kuri kilometero kare.\nMu 2022, abana bari munsi y'imyaka 15 bari 17 700. Abaturage bafite hagati y'imyaka 15 na 64 bari 20 147. Abafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga bari 1 130."}
{"id": "20176", "revid": "16115", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20176", "title": "Nyakabungo", "text": "akagari ka nyakabungo.\nnikamwe mutugize umurenge wa mpanga mukarere ka kirehe muntara yiburasirazuba hagaragarayo urugomero rwa nyankorogoma rwubatswe mumidugudu yaka kagali kanyakabungo harimo uwa rudandi na kabuga. muri aka kagali hari umudugudu wa gikushya na nyagatovu hakorerwa ubuhinzi cyane cyane ubwa kawa.\nibikorwaremezo bihagaragara.\nnyakabungo hagaragara uruganda rutunganya kawa yabaturange binyuze mumushinga wa RWACOF\nhagaragara ahakorewe umushinga wa RDF woguhinga kawa (MINADEF)\nhagaragara nubuhinzi bwibitoki na mashyamba yibiti bya karitusi"}
{"id": "20177", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20177", "title": "Umurenge wa Gisenyi", "text": "Umurenge wa Gisenyi ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu. Uherereye mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda, ku mupaka na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUmurenge wa Gisenyi ugizwe n\u2019utugari 7. Mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 51.594. Abaturage bawo bose batuye mu gice cy\u2019umujyi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Gisenyi ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 11,25. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Rubavu, Umurenge wa Rugerero n\u2019Umurenge wa Nyamyumba. Uhana kandi imbibi na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nImitegekere.\nUmurenge wa Gisenyi ugizwe n\u2019utugari 7:\nAbaturage.\nIbarura rusange ry\u2019abaturage ryo mu 2022 ryabaruye abaturage 51.594 mu Murenge wa Gisenyi. Muri bo, abagore ni 26.138, naho abagabo ni 25.456. Ubucucike bwari abantu 4.587 kuri kilometero kare.\nMu baturage bose, 15.271 bari bafite imyaka iri munsi ya 15. Abandi 34.721 bari bafite imyaka iri hagati ya 15 na 64. Naho 1.602 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga. Abaturage bose bari batuye mu gice cy\u2019umujyi.\nMu 2012, Umurenge wa Gisenyi wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 53.603. Umubare w\u2019abaturage wagabanutse hagati ya 2012 na 2022."}
{"id": "20178", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20178", "title": "Umurenge wa Kanzenze", "text": "Umurenge wa Kanzenze ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kanzenze wari utuwe n'abaturage 23 127. Ni wo murenge ufite abaturage bake mu Karere ka Rubavu. Abenshi muri bo baba mu mujyi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'abaturage.\nUmurenge wa Kanzenze ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 22,59. Mu 2012, wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 309. Mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 23 127. Muri bo, abagabo ni 10 821, abagore ni 12 306. Abaturage 18 639 baba mu mujyi. Abandi 4 488 baba mu cyaro. Ubucucike ni abantu 1 024 kuri kilometero kare.\nAbana bari munsi y'imyaka 15 ni 9 587. Abantu bari hagati y'imyaka 15 na 64 ni 12 700. Abafite imyaka 65 kuzamura ni 840.\nKanzenze ni wo murenge ufite abaturage bake mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Rubavu. Uhana imbibi n'Umurenge wa Cyanzarwe, Umurenge wa Mudende n'Umurenge wa Nyakiriba.\nAmateka.\nMuri Nzeri 2018, imva rusange y'abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi yabonetse mu Murenge wa Kanzenze. Iyo mva yari mu musarane. Yarimo imibiri 8."}
{"id": "20179", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20179", "title": "Ubuzima bwo kumuhanda", "text": "Ubuzima bw'abana baba ku mihanda bugenda buba bubi uko iminsi ishira.\nabana bo ku muhanda bagenda by'ubuzima biterwa no kwicwa n'inzara ndetse no kubura ubuvuzi mugihe baba barwaye, ndetse n'umwanda mwinshi bahura nawo ushobora kuba intandaro y'ubwo burwayi. Centre Cyprien et Daphrose Rugamba (CECYDAR), ni kimwe mu bigo bifasha abana bo mu muhanda gusubira mu buzima busanzwe, aho baganirizwa kugira ngo harebwe impamvu bari mu muhanda, ndetse bagafashwa gusubira mu muryango.\nKuva mu 1992 CECYDAR imaze kugorora abana bo mu muhanda barenga 5215, kongerera ubushobozi ingo 870 no kubaka inzu 28 z\u2019imiryango itishoboye. Uhereye muri 2018 kugera ubu, abana 676 baragorowe ndetse banasubizwa mu miryango yabo, muri bo abagera kuri 332 bafashwa mu bijyanye n\u2019uburezi. \nabana b'abakobwa kandi nabo bagaragara ku muhanda, ariko bo haba hari ibyago byinshi by'uko bahohoterwa na bagenzi babo babahungu cyangwa abandi bagabo. bityo bo bakaba bagerwaho n'ingaruka nyinshi z'ubwo buzima bwo ku muhanda kurusha basaza babo, aho baterwa inda z;indahekana, bagakoerwa n'ihohotererwa ryo ku mubiri."}
{"id": "20180", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20180", "title": "Umurenge wa Mudende", "text": "Umurenge wa Mudende ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mudende wari utuwe n'abaturage 32 077.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Mudende ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Rubavu. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 33,1. Utugari twawo turimo Rukeri na Ndoranyi. Ubuhinzi ni bwo bwiganje muri uyu murenge.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mudende wari utuwe n'abaturage 26 031. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 32 077. Abagore bari 16 824, naho abagabo bari 15 253. Abaturage 8 370 babaga mu mujyi, naho 23 707 babaga mu cyaro. Ubucucike bwari abaturage 969 kuri km\u00b2 imwe."}
{"id": "20181", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20181", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyakiriba", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyakiriba ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 21,90.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyakiriba wari utuwe n'abaturage 50 834.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAho uherereye.\nUmurenge wa Nyakiriba ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Rubavu. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 21,90.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyakiriba wari utuwe n'abaturage 30 068. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 50 834.\nMu 2022, abagabo bari 28 756, naho abagore bari 22 078. Abaturage 24 385 babaga mu mujyi. Abandi 26 449 babaga mu cyaro. Ubucucike bwari abaturage 2 321 kuri km\u00b2 1.\nAbana bari munsi y'imyaka 15 bari 17 880. Abari hagati y'imyaka 15 na 64 bari 31 280. Abarengeje imyaka 64 bari 1 674."}
{"id": "20182", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20182", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarubuye", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarubuye ni urwibutso rwibuka Abatutsi bishwe ku bwinshi muri Mata 1994 i Nyarubuye, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda, hafi y'umupaka uhuza u Rwanda na Tanzaniya, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nAhantu.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarubuye ruherereye i Nyarubuye, mu Akarere ka Kirehe, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda, hafi y'umupaka uhuza u Rwanda na Tanzaniya.\nImiterere y'aho.\nNyarubuye iri mu gice cy'iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda, hafi y'umupaka wa Tanzaniya. Aka gace kari mu duce twibasiwe n'ubwicanyi bukomeye mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyarubuye ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarubuye rwashyizwe ahari kiliziya Gatolika ya Nyarubuye. Ku wa 15 Mata 1994, Abatutsi ibihumbi bari bahahungiye bizeye ko bahabona umutekano barishwe.\nUbwicanyi bwabereye i Nyarubuye bwari bumwe mu bwicanyi bukomeye bwakozwe mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nUrwibutso rushyinguyemo imibiri y'abantu barenga 51.000 bazize Jenoside.\nAbarokotse Jenoside bo muri Nyarubuye bavuga ko ubwicanyi bwahabereye bwakoranywe ubugome bukabije.\nUmwihariko.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyarubuye ruzwiho kuba rwarabungabunze bimwe mu bice bya kiliziya yangijwe mu gihe cy'ubwicanyi. Muri uru rwibutso herekanwa imyambaro, amagufwa n'ibikoresho by'abazize Jenoside, kugira ngo bibere abarusura ibimenyetso by'ibyabereye aho.\nAbasura urwibutso banerekwa bimwe mu bimenyetso by'ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi i Nyarubuye. Harimo ibikoresho n'ahantu bifitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwakorewe abari bahungiye muri Paruwasi ya Nyarubuye.\nUrwibutso rusurwa n'abantu ku giti cyabo, amatsinda ndetse n'intumwa zo mu Rwanda no mu mahanga. Runaberamo ibikorwa byo kwibuka no kunamira abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "20183", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20183", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyamyumba", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyamyumba ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyamyumba wari utuwe n'abaturage 48 718.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyamyumba wari utuwe n'abaturage 37 491. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 48 718.\nMu 2022, abagore bari 24 990, naho abagabo bari 23 728. Abaturage 20 359 babaga mu mujyi, naho 28 359 babaga mu cyaro. Abana bari munsi y'imyaka 15 bari 20 252. Abari hagati y'imyaka 15 na 64 bari 26 900. Abarengeje imyaka 64 bari 1 566.\nUbukungu n'ubukerarugendo.\nMu Murenge wa Nyamyumba hari icyambu cya Nyamyumba. Icyo cyambu gihuza Akarere ka Rubavu n'utundi turere dukora ku Ikiyaga cya Kivu. Gihuza kandi Akarere ka Rubavu na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Muri uwo murenge hari n'amashyuza. Ayo mashyuza akurura ba mukerarugendo."}
{"id": "20184", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20184", "title": "Umurenge wa Rubavu", "text": "Umurenge wa Rubavu ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rubavu wari utuwe n'abaturage 80 107. Ni wo murenge ufite abaturage benshi mu Karere ka Rubavu.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nUmurenge wa Rubavu ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Rubavu. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 25,68.\nUmurenge wa Rubavu uhana imbibi n'imirenge ya Gisenyi, Cyanzarwe, Nyakiriba na Rugerero.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rubavu wari utuwe n'abaturage 42 394. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 80 107.\nMu 2022, abagore bari 41 343. Abagabo bari 38 764. Abaturage 65 895 babaga mu mujyi. Abaturage 14 212 babaga mu cyaro. Ku kilometero kare imwe hari abaturage 3 120."}
{"id": "20185", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20185", "title": "Umurenge wa Rugerero", "text": "Umurenge wa Rugerero ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rugerero wari utuwe n'abaturage 66 926. Abenshi muri bo batuye mu mujyi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAho uherereye.\nUmurenge wa Rugerero ni umwe mu mirenge 12 y'Akarere ka Rubavu. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 25,31.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rugerero wari utuwe n'abaturage 42 574. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 66 926. Abaturage 2 644 bari batuye kuri km\u00b2 imwe.\nMu 2022, abagore bari 34 522. Abagabo bari 32 404. Abari munsi y'imyaka 15 bari 28 159. Abari hagati y'imyaka 15 na 64 bari 37 212. Abari hejuru y'imyaka 64 bari 1 555.\nUmurenge wa Rugerero ni umwe mu mirenge ituwe cyane mu Karere ka Rubavu. Utuwe na 12,2 % by'abaturage b'akarere. Abaturage 84,7 % batuye mu mujyi."}
{"id": "20186", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20186", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kabuye", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kabuye ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri i Kabuye, mu Murenge wa Ndora, mu Akarere ka Gisagara, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda.\nUru rwibutso ruruhukiyemo imibiri irenga 50\u00a0000 y'abazize Jenoside. Myinshi muri iyo mibiri yahimuriwe mu 2018, ivanywe mu mva rusange zo mu karere.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Kabuye, mu Murenge wa Ndora, mu Karere ka Gisagara.\nUru rwibutso ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri mu gihugu hose. Izi nzibutso ni ahantu ho gushyingura, kwibuka no kuzirikana abazize Jenoside.\nUrwibutso rwa Kabuye ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nMu 1994, Ndora yari mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Butare. Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG) ivuga ko abayobozi b'igihugu n'ab'inzego z'ibanze bagize uruhare mu bwicanyi muri iyi perefegitura. Abayobozi, abasirikare n'Interahamwe barabigizemo uruhare.\nNk'uko KT Press ibivuga, urwibutso rw'agateganyo rw'i Kabuye rwari ahantu Perezida w'agateganyo Th\u00e9odore Sindikubwabo yavugiye ijambo rikangurira abantu kwica. Sindikubwabo yavukiye muri ako gace.\nMuri Gashyantare 2018, Akarere ka Gisagara katangaje ko kazimurira imibiri irenga 50\u00a0000 mu rwibutso rushya rw'i Kabuye. Uwo mushinga wari kuzatwara amafaranga y'u Rwanda miliyoni 500. Intego yari ugushyingura abazize Jenoside mu cyubahiro.\nMuri Kamena 2018, imibiri irenga 43\u00a0000 yimuriwe mu rwibutso rushya. Iyo mibiri yari ishyinguye mu mva rusange nyinshi zo mu Murenge wa Ndora.\nKwibuka.\nBuri mwaka, urwibutso rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" iteganywa n'amategeko. Ibigo bya Leta na byo byitabira iyi mihango. Urugero, abakozi b'Ikigo cy'Imisoro n'Amahoro (RRA) basuye urwibutso mu 2024. Batanze kandi amafaranga yo kugurira inka abarokotse Jenoside bo mu Karere ka Gisagara."}
{"id": "20187", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20187", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibuye", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibuye, ubu ruzwi nk'urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi rwa Gatwaro, rwibuka ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 i Kibuye, umujyi muto uherereye mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda ku nkombe z'ikiyaga cya Kivu, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nUrwibutso rwubatswe ahahoze urusengero rya kera, iruhande rwa sitade ishaje ya Gatwaro ahiciwe Abatutsi bari bakusanyirijwe kandi bafungiwe n\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze. Ku kibanza cyahoze ari sitade, ubu hubatswe ishuri ryegeranye n'urwibutso.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso rwubatswe aho abatutsi benshi, bari bagotewe aho, biciwe.\nIkibanza cyubatswe aho paruwasi yitiriwe Mutagatifu Petero ya Kibuye yahoze, hafi y\u2019ahahoze sitade ya Gatwaro, ubu yasimbuwe n\u2019ishuri ribanza.\nUru rwibutso ni rumwe mu nzibutso z'igihugu cy'u Rwanda zibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Izindi ni Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murambi, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ntarama, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali n'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarubuye.\nHari inzibutso nyinshi n'imva rusange mu nkengero z'urwibutso rwa Kibuye; zimwe mu mva rusange zaratunganyijwe, naho imibiri yari ahandi yimurirwa i Kibuye. Hirya no hino mu Rwanda hari n'izindi nzibutso nyinshi zibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nUrwibutso rwa Kibuye ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka y'ubwicanyi.\nUmubare munini w'abategetsi b'u Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside waturukaga mu majyaruguru no mu burengerazuba bw'igihugu. Kubera ko FPR Inkotanyi yinjiye mu Rwanda iturutse mu majyaruguru, mu duce two mu majyaruguru y'igihugu no mu mijyi nka Gisenyi na Kibuye, abayobozi ba Leta batanze disikuru zikangurira abantu Jenoside.\nDukurikije ibarura rusange ry\u2019abaturage ryo mu 1991, Abatutsi bo mu cyahoze ari perefegitura ya Kibuye bari 71\u00a0225, ni ukuvuga 15% by'abaturage.\nL\u00e9on Mugesera, umurwanashyaka wa MRND, yavugiye i Gisenyi ku wa 22 Ugushyingo 1992:\nKuva ku wa 20 kugeza ku wa 22 Gashyantare 1993, i Kibuye habaye ubundi bwicanyi bw\u2019Abatutsi bwakozwe n\u2019abarwanashyaka ba MRND na CDR; ubwo bwicanyi bwabaye no muri perefegitura za Byumba, Gisenyi na Ruhengeri.\nKu wa 4 Kanama 1993, hasinywe amasezerano y\u2019amahoro ya Arusha.\nKu wa 17 Mata 1994, hagabwe igitero gihuriweho kuri sitade ya Gatwaro, ku kigo cya paruwasi yitiriwe Mutagatifu Mikayeli ya Kibuye no ku ishuri ry\u2019ubuhinzi rya Nyamishaba.\nPerefe Cl\u00e9ment Kayishema ni we watanze ikimenyetso cy'ubwicanyi, yica Umututsi wa mbere, Ezekiyeli Munyakaragwe.\nUmuganga w\u2019Umudage wari i Kibuye igihe ubwicanyi bwatangiraga avuga ko ku munsi ubanziriza ubwicanyi i Kibuye hari impunzi z\u2019Abatutsi zigera ku 10\u00a0000: izigera ku 5\u00a0000 zari muri sitade ya Gatwaro, izindi ibihumbi byinshi zari mu kigo cya paruwasi ya Mutagatifu Mikayeli.\nNk\u2019uko Koloneli Patrick Sartre, wakoze iperereza ku ngabo z\u2019Ubufaransa zari mu Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside, abivuga, Abatutsi 12\u00a0000 biciwe ku wa 16 no ku wa 17 Mata kuri sitade ya Gatwaro, mu kigo cya paruwasi ya Kibuye no mu nkengero zaho. Liyetona Koloneli \u00c9ric de Stabenrath yasobanuye ko yasanze imirambo 4\u00a0300 igerekeranye kuri paruwasi, kandi avuga ko muri sitade habonetse imirambo iri hagati ya 7\u00a0000 na 9\u00a0000.\nMu 2020, abarokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi bari bagishakisha imibiri y'ababo ngo ishyingurwe mu cyubahiro ku rwibutso. Mu 2017, Claude Muhayimana, Umunyarwanda wari impunzi mu Ubufaransa akaba yarakoraga i Rouen, yarezwe mu Bufaransa ubufatanyacyaha mu bwicanyi bwabereye i Kibuye, ashinjwa kuba yaratwaye interahamwe mu modoka azijyana aho Abatutsi bicirwaga mu 1994."}
{"id": "20188", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20188", "title": "Akungo", "text": "Icyunngo ni kimwe mu bikoresho bya ahambere byakoreshwaga mu guteka kandi nanubu bigikoreshwa, iterambere ritaraza mu Rwanda ndetse no muri afrika beshyi nicyo gikoresho bifashishaga mugutegura amafunguro yabo, uko iminsi ishira indi igataha, abanyarwanda barazizibukira bagategurira mu bikoresho bizwi nka amasafuriya, akanyungo ni kimwe mu bikoresho byahambere aho bamwe mu rubyiruko rwubu bavugako batakizi.\nicyo ni imwe mu nkono gakondo gikozwe mw'ibumba akaba ari igikoresho bifashishaga kurubu wagereranya n'isafuriya kikaba cyarakoreshwaga mugutegura amafunguro ndetse no mubihugu bimwe na bimwe byo muri africa cyane cyane mu Rwanda rwo hambere\nUbwiza bw'icyungo.\nBavugako imboga zitekewe mu kungo ziryoha kurusha izatekewe mucyo twakzita amasafuriya ya kijyambere, ikindi hari ababumbyi batunzwe no kubumba, iyo babaga babumbye ibyungo ndetse n'ibindi bikoresho biva mwibumba byatumaga babona imibereho bakabasha kwiteza imberer mu buryo bumwe cyangwa ubundi "}
{"id": "20190", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20190", "title": "Aberdare Range Mountain", "text": "Abardare Range ni umusozi muremure uherereye mu majyaruguro yo mu murwa mukuru wa kenya ukaba upima kilometero zisaga 160km hamwe n'uburebure bwa metero 3,500 na fiti 11,480 ft. uzenguruka intara za Nyandurua, Nyeri, Murang'ra na Kiambu na Laikipia. \nImiterere.\nIkibanza cyangwase umusozi wa Aderdare ugizwe nigice cy'uruhande rw'iburasirazuba bw'ikibaya kinini cy RIFT kinyura mu majyaruguru ugana mu majyepfo. Mu burengerazuba, intara igwa hasi cyane mu kibaya cya Kinangop hanyuma ikagera mu kibaya kinini cya rift iburasirazuba, intara ihanamye cyane ikiyaga cya naivasha hamwe na Mau Escarpment ya kure bishobora kugaragara uhereye kumpinga ndende bufite uburebure bwa 3,999 metero na ft 13,120. Aberdares ni umusozi kandi ufite agace k'amazi y'urubogobogo rwa Sasumua n'urugomero rwa Ndakaini, rutanga amazi menshi i Nairobi. Amashyamba yo mu misozi ni agace kegereye Umugezi wa Tana, uruzi runini muri Kenya rutanga amazi ku rugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa seven forks rutanga hejuru ya 55 ku ijana by'amashanyarazi yose kenya.\nIshyamba rya Aderdare.\nIshyamba rya Aderdare Ranges niryo ryakira ishyamba rya Escarpments ya kikiyu ikora mu majyaruguru kuva muri Nairobi,Aderdare itandukanye cyane mu burebure bwa metero 2000 na ft 6,600 ku mupaka wa mashyamba kuruhande rwiburasirazuba na 4,001 metero na ft 13.127 werekeza ku nkombe yo mumajyaruguru kun mupaka ya oldonyo lesatima. Ranges imanuka iva ku minga yerekeza I nyaruhuhu uherereye mu majyaruguru aho bigaragara ko ibibata byinzuzi byangiritse hamwe n'imiyoboro y'ibiyaga. ku ruhande rw'amajyepfo."}
{"id": "20191", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20191", "title": "Amashyamba ya Kimeza", "text": "Amashyamba ni kimwe mu mutungo kamere u Rwanda rufite ariko by'umwihariko kuba rugifite amashyamba ya kimeza bikaba akarusho kuko bifasha mu kubungabunga urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima. Ishyamba rya kimeza rya Kibirizi riherereye mu karere ka Nyanza ni rimwe mu mashyamba agifite amoko y'ibiti atandukanye, harimo ibyo bita \"Umushikiri\" bikaba byifashishwa mu gukora imibavu.\nKubungabunga amashyamba ya kimeza.\nMinisiteri ishinzwe Ubutaka n'Amashyamba (MINILAF) yatangiye gahunda yo kubungabunga amashyamba agera kuri 107 ya kimeza u Rwanda rusigaranye, kugira ngo adacika.\nKubera ubukana bw'iyangirika ry'amashyamba cyane cyane aya kimeza, hanashyizweho itegeko rya Minisiteri w'intebe rirengera bene ayo mashyamba adafite kirengera. Iri tegeko ryaje gushyigikira itegeko ryagenga ibidukikije rigaragaza ubwoko bw'ibiti bigomba kurindwa kandi rikanatunga agatoki aho biherereye, ku buryo n'umuntu wafatwa abitema ahita akurikiranwa.\nRumwe muri izo ngero ni ibiti byitwa \" Umushikiri\" byari byibasiwe mu minsi ishije, aho byavugwaga ko bitanga imibavu ariko nyuma yo gukaza iryo tegeko; abafashwe bagakurikiranwa n'ubutabera byaracitse.\nIgisigaye ni amashyamba mato aherereye hirya no hino mu gihuhu ariko atitaweho nk'uko bikwiye. Ayo amashyamba abarirwa muri 107 ko ari yo asigaye mu Rwanda ariko MINILAF ikaba yarahagurukiye kuyarinda ngo atazimira. \nIshyamba rya Kibirizi riteye kuri hegitare 183 ni rimwe muri aya mashyamba arinzwe n'iteka rya Minisitiri. Iri shyamba riherereye mu karere ka Nyanza mu Ntara y' Amajyepfo na ryo riri mu ryakunze kwibasirwa kubera ibiti by'imishikiri bihateye. Ariko kuva Guverinoma yahagurukira iki kibazo ba rushimusi b'ibiti baragabanutse, kandi n'ingamba zo kurinda amashyamba nk'aya zarakajijwe.\nIgice gishinzwe kubungabunga amashyamba muri MINILAF cyatangije gahunda y'uko hari ibiti byavangwa n'imyaka cyane cyane ahegereye ya mashyamba ariko umwihariko uzashyirwa ahantu hegereye amashyamba akeneye kurindwa. Gahunda nk'iyi yo kurengera amashyamba karemano bakoresheje umukandara w'andi mashyamba agirira abaturage akamaro, isa niyagize akamaro ku baturiye ishyamba rya Nyungwe riherereye mu gice cya Kitabi mu Karere ka Nyamagabe.\nMu mwaka wa 2018 ubuso bwari buhinzeho amashyamba mu Rwanda, bwanganaga 29.6% ubariyemo n'aya kimeza yose.Gahunda ya leta yagaragaza ko bugomba kwiyongera bukagera kuri 30% muri 2020.\nInyandiko.\n1.https://www.igihe.com/umuco/amateka/article/imisozi-yabimburiye-indi-kubyara-u-rwanda-tubona-ubu\n2.https://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibimera/article/amashyamba-kimeza-107-asigaye-mu-rwanda-ashobora-kuzimira"}
{"id": "20192", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20192", "title": "Ibyutaruzi kuri pariki yigihugu ya nyungwe", "text": "Pariki y'igihungu ya nyungwe ni ishyamba cyimeza ribarizwa mu burengerazuba bwamajyepfo bw'u Rwanda, rifatanye na pariki y'igihugu ya kibira yomujyihugu cy'u Burundi kandi rishobora kuba ariryo shyamba ry'inzitane ryo mumisozi minini kandi miremire muri afirika yose.\naho riherereye.\niryo shyamba riri mu misozi ifite ubutumburuke buri hagati ya m 1600 na m2950 kandi ririmo amoko menshi yibimera ndetse namoko menshi yinyamanswa ajyizwe ahanini n'inyoni ndetse n'inguge.\nindanganturo\n1.https://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibimera/article/amashyamba-kimeza-107-asigaye-mu-rwanda-ashobora-kuzimira\n2.https://www.kigalitoday.com/ubukerarugendo/pariki/Menya-pariki-y-igihugu-ya-Nyungwe"}
{"id": "20193", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20193", "title": "Cherang'any Hills", "text": "Imisozi ya Cherang'any ni imisozi miremire yo mu burengerazuba bwa Kenya. uyu musozi mu umwe mu mashyamba atanu ya kenya ifatwa nk'ubukerarugendo, n'umusozi muremure ukaba wegeranye ni ikibaye kinini cyo hagati, igabanijwe na Mau Escarpment izamuka ku mupaka wa Tanzaniya kugera misozi ya Cherang'any, Escarpment ihuza ikibaya kizamuka kumusozi wa Elgon. Umusozi wa Cherangany uzenguruka intara eshatu arizo Trans Nzoia, Elgeyo marakwet no Pokot y'iburengerazuba. \nImiterere.\nUmusozi wa Cherang'any urebererwa n'umuryango w'abibumbye ishinzwe ibidukikije nka kamwe mu turere dutanu tw'ingenzi two gufata amazi muri kenya. () umuryango wa bibumbye ukurikirana impinduka z'amashyamba hagati ya 2000 na 2003, Umusozi wa Charang'any niyo yibasiwe cyane n'amashyamba yakurikiranwe, aho hagati 174.3 zatewe n'amashyamba, iki gihombo kikaba kiboneka mu karere ka marakwet no mu karere ka pokot. kubera ko iki gipande cy'amashyamba kavukire, umuryango wabibumbye urasaba ko ako gace gakurikiranywa hafi kugirango hatabaho irimbuka ry'uwo musozi. "}
{"id": "20194", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20194", "title": "Kivu belt", "text": "kivu belt nizina ry'umuhanda unyura kunyengero zikiyaga cya kivu muburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda woroheje ingendo muturere two muri iyo ntara, mubihugu byinshi bicyiri munzira yamajyambere, imihanda yubakwaga mujyihe cyashize wasangaga ari imihanda igana kukibuga cy'indege cyangwase igana kucyambu,ariko namihanda ihuza ibice by'igihugu bitandukanye. umuhanda wa kivu belt watangiye gukoreshwa kuwa gatandatu tariki 19 Mata 2019, ukaba waroroheje ingendo.\nindanganturo.\n1.https://www.kigalitoday.com/ubukungu/iterambere/article/uko-iterambere-ry-imihanda-ryagize-uruhare-mu-izamuka-ry-ubukungu-bw-u-rwanda\n2.https://www.kigalitoday.com/ubukungu/iterambere/article/kivu-belt-ibaye-iya-mbere-mu-gukora-ingendo-rutsiro-kigali"}
{"id": "20195", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20195", "title": "Umusozi wa Taita", "text": "Umusozi wa Taita, ni umusozi uherereye mu Ntara ya Taita-Taveta mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Kenya. Imisozi igizwe n'ibice bitatu mu majyepfo yumujyi wa Kasigau mu majyepfo hafi y'umupaka wa Tanzaniya. Massif ya Dawida ninini kandi nindende ifite uburebure bwa hejuru yinyanja kurwego rwo hejuru, Vuria. Dawida afite izindi mpinga eshatu zingenzi: Iyale, Wesu, na Susu. \nUbumenyi bwa geologiya.\nUmusozi wa Taita, umaze imyaka irenga miriyoni ijana. Ubu hashize imyaka miriyoni mirongo itatu, ako gace kari gatwikiriwe n'ishyamba rinini. Mugihe hashize imyaka miriyoni icumi, amashyamba yo mubutayu yahinduwe savanna, hasigara imisozi nk \"ibirwa\" aho amashyamba yo mu turere dushyuha yakomeje gutera imbere. Umusozi wa Taita uzamuka cyane uva muri parike yigihugu ya Tsavo. \nIbidukikije.\nImisozi izwiho amashyamba atose hamwe n\u2019ibinyabuzima bidasanzwe n\u2019ibimera. Amoko arenga 20 y\u2019icyorezo cya violet yo muri Afurika aboneka muri ako karere gusa. Ubwoko bw'inyoni zizwi cyane ni Taita thrush na Taita apalis. Falita ya Taita hamwe n\u2019imari ya Taita yavumbuwe bwa mbere ku misozi ariko ibera ahandi, na ho. Ampibian mu bwoko bwa \"Boulengerula\" iboneka gusa ku misozi ya Taita. \nAbaturage ba Taita kavukire batuye mumashyamba kandi bahinga ubutaka, butanga umusaruro mwinshi. Mirongo itanu y\u2019amashyamba kavukire yasimbuwe n\u2019ibiti bidasanzwe hagati ya 1955 na 2004. Ku bibaya no mu misozi ikikije, ubutaka bukoreshwa cyane mu guhinga no kurisha. Ibice binini byamashyamba biherereye ahantu.hangijywe no gutema amashyamba. Aka gace karimo ibihe bibiri by'imvura: Werurwe kugeza Gicurasi cyangwa Kamena, na Ukwakira kugeza Ukuboza, ariko imvura irahinduka cyane"}
{"id": "20196", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20196", "title": "Umusozi wa Udzungwa", "text": "Umusozi ya Udzungwa ni imisozi iri mu majyepfo ya Tanzaniya.N'umisozi ahanini uri mu karere ka Iringa, mu majyepfo y'umurwa mukuru wa Tanzaniya Dodoma. umisozi wa Udzungwa uri mu misozi y\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Arc, kandi ukaba utuwe n\u2019ibinyabuzima bitandukanye by\u2019ibimera n\u2019ibinyabuzima bifite amoko menshi y\u2019ibyorezo.\nni umusozi utuweho n'abaturage, izina Udzungwa rikomoka ku ijambo rya Kihehe \u201cWadzungwa\u201d, risobanura abantu batuye ku musozi. Iringa nigice kinini mumisozi, nicyicaro cyakarere.\nimisozi ya Undzungwa ifite ubuso bwa kilometero 16,131.40, ifite. Impinga ndende cyane. Umusozi ugera muri rusange uburaruko bushira ubuseruko. Ikibaya cya Usangu kiri mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba, gitwarwa n'umugezi munini wa Ruaha n'inzuzi zawo. Umugezi munini wa Ruaha utandukanya imisozi ya Udzungwa n'umusozi wa Rubeho n'imisozi ya Uvidunda ugana mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba. Umugezi wa Kilombero uri mu majyepfo no mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba. Mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba icyuho cya Makambako gitandukanya imisozi ya Udzungwa na Kipengere.\nIbimera n'ibinyabuzima.\nUbu hashize imyaka miriyoni mirongo itatu, ako gace kari gatwikiriwe n\u2019amashyamba manini. hashize imyaka miriyoni icumi, amashyamba yo mubutayu ahinduwe savanna, hasigara imisozi nk \"ibirwa\" aho amashyamba yo mu turere dushyuha yakomeje gutera imbere. Udzungwa nindi misozi ya Arc yi burasirazuba ifite ibinyabuzima bitandukanye cyane bifite amoko menshi y\u2019icyorezo (hejuru ya 25 ku ijana by\u2019ibinyabuzima). 10 ku ijana muri bo barinzwe na parike y\u2019igihugu cya Gisozi cya Udzungwa hamwe n\u2019ishyamba ry\u2019ibidukikije rya Udzungwa."}
{"id": "20197", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20197", "title": "Uluguru", "text": "Imisozi ya Uluguru ni imisozi iri mu burasirazuba bwa Tanzaniya, yitiriwe ubwoko bwa Luguru. Igice kinini cyimisozi ni umusozi unyura hafi y'amajyaruguru n'amajyepfo kandi ifite uburebure bwa Kuruhande runini rwa Uluguru,rufite imidugudu 50 ikora kumupaka wamashyamba kandi abantu barenga 151.000 baboneka mumisozi, akenshi bakiyongera mubucucike k'umusozi muremure kugera kumupaka wamashyamba.\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nUlugurus ifite ubutumburuke bwa 200\u00a0km imbere y'inyanja yu Buhinde. Biri mu ruhererekane rw'imisozi yo mu burasirazuba bwa Afurika hamwe bita mu misozi ya Arc irimo imisozi ya Taita, imisozi ya Pare, imisozi ya Usambara, imisozi ya Nguru, Rubeho, Ukaguru, imisozi ya Udzungwa n'imisozi ya Mahenge.\nAmashyamba yimisozi atanga ahantu ho gufata amazi kumigezi ninzuzi. Aya mazi atemba cyane cyane mu mpinga z\u2019amashyamba ya Ulugurus mu migezi ihuza guhuza uruzi rwa Ruvu, rutanga amazi mu mujyi wa Dar es Salaam. Benshi mu baturage baturanye, bagera kuri miliyoni 3, n\u2019inganda zikomeye muri Tanzaniya bashingira kuri aya mazi kugira ngo bakomeze kubaho. Gutakaza amashyamba no kugabanuka kw\u2019amazi yo gutanga amazi yimisozi rero bishobora kugira ingaruka zikomeye kumibereho yabantu nubushobozi bwinganda za Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "20198", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20198", "title": "Imisozi ya Usambara", "text": "Imisozi ya Usambara yo mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Tanzaniya muri Afurika yo mu turere dushyuha, igizwe n'imisozi y'iburasirazuba. ifite ubutumburuke bwa ndende na kimwe cya kabiri cy'ubugari, kandi biherereye mu Karere ka Lushoto mu Karere ka Tanga.hakaba hashize hafi imyaka miriyoni ebyiri kandi bigizwe nubutare bwa metamorphic Precambrian. Bagabanijwemo ibice bibiri; Uburengerazuba bwa Usambaras burenze Uburasirazuba bwa Usambara, bwegereye inkombe kandi bugwa imvura nyinshi.\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nUsambaras ni nubugari bwa. igice cyimisozi yuburasirazuba bwa Arc, kiva muri Kenya kinyura muri Tanzaniya. Ikirere ni kimwe mu ku isi. Ahantu hirengeye ni impinga ya Chambolo kuri metero 2,289 hejuru yinyanja. \nUbumenyi bwa geologiya.\nImisozi yavumbuwe hashize hafi miliyoni ebyiri. \nishyamba ryimvura ryanyuze mugihe kirekire kandi ryihindagurika ridasanzwe bituma habaho endemism itangaje hamwe n\u2019amashyamba yimvura ashaje. \nUburengerazuba n\u2019iburasirazuba Usambaras ni intera nini ya metamorphic metologique ya geologiya ya acide- gneisses, pyrox\u00e8ne, na amphiboles. [3] kuriyi misozi yashizweho uburyo bwo kuvoma imigezi igizwe n\u2019amasoko menshi y\u2019amazi,Igemurira umubare mwishi w'abaturage ba Tanzaniya "}
{"id": "20199", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20199", "title": "Umusozi wa Mahale", "text": "Imisozi ya Mahale ni imisozi mu Karere ka Uvinza mu Karere ka Kigoma muri Tanzaniya. Imisozi iri ku nkombe y'iburasirazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Tanganyika n'umusozi ufute ubutumburuke bagera kuri kugera k'umusozi Nkungwe, ahantu hirengeye Uvinza.\nuyu musoziukaba ufite akandi gace ka pariki y' ubukerarugendo harimo inkintare ndetse nizindi nyamanswa zigiye zitandukanye zikurura abakerarugendo nk'intare n'izindi irishyamba kandi ni gakondo y'abaturage bo mubwoko bwa Holoholo, mbere yo kw'imurwa mu myaka ya za 70 kugirango hashyirwe parike y'igihugu y'imisozi ya Mahale "}
{"id": "20200", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20200", "title": "Imusozi Ya Uvidunda", "text": "Umisozi ya Uvindunda (\"Milima ya Uvidunda\" mu Giswahili) ni imisozi mu burasirazuba bwa Tanzaniya.Ni imisozi miremire y'itiriwe abaturage Imisozi yitiriwe abaturage bakomoka mu misozi yo mu Karere ka Kilosa mu Karere ka Morogoro. \nImisozi ya Uvidunda iherereye hamwe n\u2019amasoko arenga 6 adakorwa ku nzira. Urwunya rw\u2019ubukerarugendo ndangamuco rw\u2019imisozi ya Uvidunda, rwatangijwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubukerarugendo bushingiye ku kubungabunga ibidukikije Mikumi Eco &amp; Ubukerarugendo bw\u2019umuco nicyo giteza imbere no gucunga amasoko ya Chizua, Isumo rya Kigaga, Isumo rya Mzombe, Isumo rya Ibwedunghu, Inzira ya Makene Ngorunda. nka WaVidunda, ururimi rwabo ni Chividunda.\nImiterere ya Uvindunda.\nImisozi ya Uvidunda ni igice giherereye mu burasirazuba bwa Arc. Urutonde rugizwe numwanya umwe ufite impinga eshatu zitandukanye, Chonwe, Mgwila, na Migomberama, zirenga metero 1500 z'uburebure.] \u200b\u200b Amajyepfo yuburasirazuba bwimisozi uruzi runini rwa Ruaha rusohoka mukibaya. Umusozi wa Malundwe uri iburasirazuba muri parike ya Mikumi.ikibaya cya Mkata kigemura mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba.\nIbidukikije.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe mu 2006 bwerekanye ko ishyamba rinini cyane ari ishyamba rya Iyunji (bita Chonwe) hafi y\u2019imidugudu ya Vidunda, Chonwe, na Udunghu. Hashingiwe ku byogajuru n\u2019ubushakashatsi bwakozwe ku butaka, byagereranijwe ko ishyamba ryagabanutse kuva kuri ha 471.3 mu 1975 rikagera kuri ha 356 mu 2006, rikagabanuka hafi 25%. Ahantu hanini hashyizweho ishyamba ryimeza hamwe nishyamba ryabonetse muburengerazuba bwimisozi. Ibice binini by'imisozi byari bwarakuweho ubuhinzi, kandi igice kinini cy\u2019ibiti n\u2019ishyamba byari bisigaye byangiritse kubera gutwikwa cyane no gusarura ibiti."}
{"id": "20201", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20201", "title": "Parike ya Kitulo", "text": "Pariki y'igihugu ya Kitulo ni Pariki y'igihugu ya Tanzaniya, igizwe n'akarere karinzwe n'ibyatsi bya montane n'ishyamba ku kibaya cya kitulo mu misozi miremire cyane ya Tanzaniya. Parike iri ku butumburuke bwa hagati yimisozi ya Kipengere na Poroto kandi ifite ubuso bwa, uherereye mu Karere ka Mbeya no mu Karere ka Njombe. Iyi parike iyobowe na parike y\u2019igihugu ya Tanzaniya (TANAPA) kandi ni parike ya mbere y\u2019igihugu muri Afurika yo mu turere dushyuha yashinzwe cyane cyane mu kurinda Ibimera byayo. \nAbenegihugu bavuga ko ikibaya cya Kitulo ari \"Bustani ya Mungu (Ubusitani bw'Imana), mu gihe abahanga mu bimera bavuga ko ari \"Serengeti y\u2019indabyo\". \nIyemezwa ry'iyi parike.\nKurinda ibimera bidasanzwe bya Kitulo Plateau byasabwe bwa mbere n\u2019umuryango w'ibinyabuzima bitandukanye (WCS), mu rwego rwo guhangana n\u2019ubucuruzi mpuzamahanga bugenda bwiyongera mu birayi Bya orchide ndetse no kongera ibikorwa byo guhiga no gutema amashyamba akikije. Mu 2002, nibwo Perezida Benjamin Mkapa yatangaje ko hashyizweho parike. Iyi parike yashyizwe mu kinyamakuru mu 2005, ihinduka parike y'igihugu ya cumi na kane ya Tanzaniya. TANAPA yatangaje ko iyi parike ishobora kwagurwa mu gihe kiri imbere kugira ngo ishyiremo ishyamba rituranye n'umusozi wa Rungwe."}
{"id": "20202", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20202", "title": "Umusozi Rungwe", "text": "Umusozi Rungwe ni umusozi wibirunga mu karere ka mbaya mu misozi miremire ya Tanzaniya. n'umusozi ufite utumburuke bwa, ni impinga ya kabiri yo hejuru ya Tanzaniya. Ikirunga cya Rungwe kuri ubu ntigikora.\nIcyo wamenya k'umusozi wa Rungwe.\nRungwe ni ihuriro ry'uburasirazuba nuburengerazuba bwa bwa Africa. Yiganjemo igihugu cyimisozi mumajyaruguru uburengerazuba bw'urugero rwikiyaga kirimo ikiyaga cya Malawi.Urugero na kipengere ruri mu burasirazuba, Imisozi ya poroto kandi iherereye mu majyaruguru. yi Ikirunga cya Kyejo (m 2176 m) kiri mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba. Ikibaya cya Kyela, gifata ikibaya cya Rift yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, kiri mu majyepfo, kigera ku kiyaga cya Malawi.\nIbidukikije.\nIbibaya bikikije ishyamba rya Maimbo. Amashyamba yo hejuru ya montane aboneka kugera kuri metero 2600 z'uburebure, harimo ibiti byikozemo ikiraro bireshya na metero 10-25. Ibiti bisanzwe birimo \"Albizia gummifera, Aphloia theiformis, Bersama abyssinica, Bridelia micrantha, Diospyros whyteana, Hagenia abyssinica, Macaranga kilimandscharica, Maesa lanceolata, Maytenus acuminata, Myrianthus holstii\", na \"Neoboutonia macrocalyx\". \"Astropanax goetzenii\" n'umuzabibu usanzwe."}
{"id": "20203", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20203", "title": "Umusozi wa Hanang", "text": "Umusozi Hanang ni umusozi uri wo mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya.ukaba uherereye mu karere ka Manyara na Hanang.Ni umusozi wa kane muremure muri Tanzaniya, ufite impinga eshatu za Kilimanjaro zibarwa nkumusozi umwe. \nInzira nyamukuru igana mu mpinga itangirira mu mujyi wa wa Katesh. Kuzamuka uwo musozi mugisate cy'ubukerarugendo bisaba amasaha 10 batara wurangiza bagakambika kugirango bagere kuwundi musozi wundi bifatante bakawugeraho kumunsi wa kabiri. \nIshyamba rya Hanang.\nIshamba rya Hanang rifite ubuso bwa 58.66\u00a0km\u00b2, kumusozi muremure. Hagati ya metero 2000 na 2700 z'uburebure, amashyamba ya montane yicyatsi kibisi atwikiriye umusozi utose wiburasirazuba bwumusozi nuburasirazuba bwamajyepfo, mugihe ahantu humye h\u2019iburengerazuba n\u2019amajyaruguru humye amashyamba yumye ya montane yumye yicyatsi kibisi nicyatsi kibisi. Hejuru ya metero 2700, amashyamba yimukira mubutaka bwatsi ndetse nubwatsi bwo hejuru."}
{"id": "20204", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20204", "title": "Umusozi wa Loolmalasin", "text": "Umusozi wa Loolmalasin cyangwa Loolmalassin (\"Mlima Lolmalasin\", mu Giswahili) ni umusozi uherereye mu karere ka Ngorongoro muri ahazwi nka Arusha muri Tanzaniya. Ifite uburebure bwa ni umusozi wa gatatu muremure muri Tanzaniya ufite impinga eshatu za Kilimanjaro zifatwa nkumusozi umwe. Umusozi uherereye muri mukibaya cya Nainokanoka. ni kirunga giherereye mu karere k\u2019imisozi miremire ya Crater kandi ni ikirunga cyazimye giheruka guturika muri Pleistocene. Umusozi Loolmalasin niwo musozi wa kabiri muremure mu karere ka Arusha n'ahantu hirengeye mu Karere ka Ngorongoro. Uyu musozi kandi ufite isoko yumugezi wa Simiyu, utemba ugana iburengerazuba kugera ku kiyaga cya Victoria mu karere ka Simiyu "}
{"id": "20205", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20205", "title": "Ol Doinyo Lengai", "text": "Ol Doinyo Lengai ni ikirunga gikora mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya. kIgizwe na cone yibirunga hamwe na crater ebyiri, amajyaruguru yaturitse mugihe cyamateka. Mu buryo budasanzwe ku isi birunga, ibirunga byadutse natrocarbonatite, ubushyuhe buke budasanzwe n'ubwoko bwa magma. Kuruka muri 2007\u20132008 byagize ingaruka ku karere kagikikije\nAmateka.\nAbantu bo mu bwoko bw'aba Maasai na Sonjo bavuga ko ikirunga ari \"Umusozi w 'Imana\", gifitanye isano n\u2019umugani w\u2019imana y\u2019imana Engai, wavuyeyo nyuma yo gukubitwa n\u2019umuhigi akoresheje umwambi. Andi mazina nka Basanjo, Donjo Ngai, Duenjo Ngai, Mongogogura, Mungogo wa Bogwe, na Oldonyo L'Engai. \nOl Doinyo Lengai ni cone ihuza izamuka hejuru yikibaya gikikije. Ifite ibyobo bibiri ku mpande zombi z'umusozi, n'imisozi ipima dufite ubunini buri hagati ya kugeza kuri bibera mu mwobo kandi bigatanga umusaruro wa lava uva mu mpinga zabo kandi, iyo zisenyutse, ziva ku mpande zabo. Ikibaya cyo mu majyepfo ntigikora kandi rimwe na rimwe cyuzuyemo amazi. [14] Ikirunga gitwikiriye imisozi y\u2019ibirunga, gifite imvumo nini ku ruhande rw\u2019iburengerazuba. Hariho imiyoboro baciye ku mpande za Ol Doinyo Lengai, nka Craterum Crater mu burengerazuba, imiyoboro ya Nasira mu majyaruguru, ikibaya cya Dorobo mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba, na Oltatwa Crater ku ruhande rw'iburasirazuba. "}
{"id": "20206", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20206", "title": "Amasangano y'umuhanda", "text": "Amasangano y'umuhanda ajyiye kuvugururwa ndetse no kuyagura mumugi wa kigali muburyo bwokoroshya injyendo.\namasangano azavugururwa.\nisangano riri chez lando, iriri ku Gishushu mu karere ka Gasabo ndetse niriri sonatubes mukarere ka kicukiro, kwisangano rya sonatube hazubakwa umuhanda womunsi y'ubutaka uzaturuka kunyubako ikoreramo minisiteri y'ubuzima ukarangirira ahahoze hakorera kaminuza y'ubukerarugendo ikoranabuhanga n'ubukungu, umuhanda ukazaba ufite metero zisaga 620, isangano ry'umuhanda rya chez lando hazubakwa umuhanda womunsi y'ubutaka kuburyo imodoka zizajya ziva ku Gishushu zijya kucyibuga mpuzamahanga cy'indege cya kigali ikanombe zizajya zinyura munsi y'umuhanda usanzwe ukazaba ufite metero 740, ku isangano rya Gishushu hazubakwa icyiraro kinyura hejuru y'umuhanda kiva ahari simba supermarket iki kiraro cyizaba jyifite metero 500.\nindanganuro.\n1.Amasangano y'imihanda atatu muri Kigali agiye kuvugururwa - #rwanda #RwOT\n2.Miliyari 140 Frw zizakoreshwa mu kuvugurura amasangano y\u2019imihanda mu mujyi wa Kigali \u2013 Umusanzu"}
{"id": "20207", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20207", "title": "Imihanda iherukwa gukorwa m' u Rwanda", "text": "Umuhanda nicyimwe mu bikorwa remezo bihenze kandi biba bifitiye runini abawukoresha kuko uhindura ubuzima bwaho ugeze, binyuze mu korohereza abaturage mu bikorwa bitandukanye birimo kugenderana no guhahirana.\nimwe mumihanda mishya.\numuhanda Ngoma - Ramiro-inyanza ugizwe nibice bitatu birimo ikiva i Ngoma kikajyera mu karere ka Bugesera kigizwe n'ibirometero 52.8 cyiyongeraho ibindi birometero 72.8 biva Bugesera bikajyera gasororo arinaho igice cyo mu karere ka nyanza gitangirira kikazanyura mumirenge itatu irimo kigoma,muyira na busororo,ahangana na kilometero 30,67, umuhanda base -butaro -kidaho numuhanda uhuza akarere ka rulindo na burere ureshya na kirometero 63, undi muhanda ni uwa Muhanga -karongi-ufite ibirometero 128.\nindanganturo.\n1.Gahunda yo kwiyubakira imihanda i Kigali igiye gusubukurwa - IGIHE.com\n2.Miliyari 140 Frw zizakoreshwa mu kuvugurura amasangano y\u2019imihanda mu mujyi wa Kigali \u2013 Umusanzu"}
{"id": "20209", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20209", "title": "Umusozi wa Kipengere Range", "text": "Kipengere Range, izwi kandi ku izina rya Livingstone Mountain, uyu musozi uherereye mu karere ka Njombe mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Tanzaniya mu majyaruguru y'ikiyaga cyaNyasa. Ni umusozi muremure unyura mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba uva mu kibaya cy'umugezi munini wa Ruaha mu majyaruguru ugana ku mugezi wa Ruhuhu mu majyepfo, kandi ugize igice cyo mu burasirazuba bwa Rift yo muri Afurika y'iburasirazuba. \nicyo wamenya ku musozi wa kipengere.\nKuva mu mujyi wa Mbeya intera igenda yerekeza mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba kandi igize igice cyo mu burasirazuba bwa Rift yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, igera ku 100\u00a0km kumanuka wamajyaruguru yuburasirazuba bwikiyaga kugera kumugezi wa Ruhuhu. Imisozi ya Poroto yibirunga ikora amajyaruguru yuburengerazuba bwagutse."}
{"id": "20210", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20210", "title": "Umugani", "text": "Umugani.\nUmugani n' inkuru mbarirano y'ibyabayeho cyangwa ibitekerezo byafasha rubanda mu kwagura ibitekerezo, kubanisha neza abaturange, gutangaza amakuru no kwigisha muco n'indangagaciro ziranga umunyarwanda. Imigani ni bumwe mu buvanganzo bwo muri rubanda twasingiwe nabakurambere. "}
{"id": "20211", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20211", "title": "Ingabo z' urwanda", "text": "INGABO ZU RWANDA.\nIngabo zu Rwanda (RDF) n' igisirikare cyaremwe muri 1962 cyahoze kitwa Rwadan Armed Force, gitangira gukora muri 1994, gifite ubuyobozi mu nzego zose hari umugaba mukuru w'ikirenga (CIC) nyiri cyubahiro Paul Kagame, (CDS): General Mubarak Muganga, Ubu tuvugana igisikare cyu Rwanda cyazamuye urwego mu nzego zitandukanye mu gucunga umutekano mu gihugu ndetse no mu bihugu bitandukanye muri Africa harimo: Centre Africa, Sudan, Mozambique nahandi... \nAMASHAKIRO"}
{"id": "20212", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20212", "title": "Mechatronics", "text": "MECHATRONICS TECHNOLOGY.\nMechatronics Technology n' isomo rishingiye mu ikoranabuhanga n'ubungenge rigamije kuzamura ikoranabuhanga mu nganda zitandukanye, kandi iri somo ryibanda kuri Mechanical &amp; electronics, irtangwa na kaminuza ebyiri mu Rwanda harimo Rwanda polytechnic Kigali na Rwanda polytechnic Tumba.\nMECHATRONICS MU RWANDA.\nMuri 2021 Rwanda polytechnic Kigali batangije ishami rya Mechatronics Technology mu gisate cya Mechanical department, muri 2022 Mechatronics Technology ya tangijwe ku mugaragaro muri Rwanda polytechnic Tumba, kubufatanye n'igihugu cy' ubufaransa, bataha inzu nini cyane yo kwingiramo kandi irimo ibyuma byo gukoreramo imirimo ntoki (Practical) cyangwa Workshop. \nIri shami ryitezweho gusohora abanyeshuri bafite ubumenyi ndetse n'ubushobozi mu kurema no gukoresha imashini zikoreshwa mu nganda zitandukanye, bagakora ubungenzuzi (Maintenance) hifashishijwe AI(ubwenge buhanganno) byitwa Preventive Maintenance, bakubaka SCADA System. nubundi bumwnenyi butandukanye.\nAmashami ya mechatronics technology.\nHari icyiciro cyisumbuye bita Advanced Diploma ndetse na Bachelor's degree muri Rwanda polytechnic Kigali na Tumba \nAMASHAKIRO"}
{"id": "20213", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20213", "title": "Bisate Lodge", "text": "Bisate lodge ni Hoteli iherereye mu Majyaruguru y' uRwanda mu karere ka Musanze, hafi ya Pariki y' igihugu y' ibirunga, ikaba imwe mu mahoteli afite ibiciro byihagazeho ndetse n' ubwiza bwihariye doreko ibarizwa mu ruhererekane rw' amahoteli y' abashoramari ba Wilderness bafite amahoteli menshi muri afrika. \nAmateka.\nBisate Lodge ni hoteli yatangiye kandi yamamara mu mwaka 2018, yakorewe ingigo cyangwa imbata na Nicolas Plewman, aho igizwe n' amazu yo mw' ishyamba ibyo bakunze kwita Forest villas witegereje ubona ko izo nzu zubatse neza nk' inzu z' abami bo hambere mu Rwanda mbese nkizo wasanga murugo ry' umwami i Butare ho mu karere ka Huye. \nSerivise wahasanga.\nMuri Bisate lodge nka hoteli igezweho ndetse iherereye ahantu nyaburanga usanga bafite serivise nyinshi utabona ahandi hose kandi zinihagazeho mubiciro:"}
{"id": "20214", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20214", "title": "Wilderness Magashi Peninsula", "text": "= Wilderness Magashi Peninsula =\nWilderness Magashi Peninsula, ni hoteli iri kubakwa muri pariki y' igihugu y' akagera mugace ka amajyarugu bw' iburasirazuba bw' iyi pariki, kuva muri Nzeri iyi hoteli izatangira kwakira abakiriya bambere, kuko kugeza ubu inyubako z' iyi hoteli zamaze kubakwa aho zigizwe n' inyubako zo kuraramo ndetse ikagira ninyubako yihariye ishobora kwakira umuryango cyangwa abantu bari mu biruhuko kizwi nka Villa. \nIbiciro.\nmuri iyi hoteli iherereye muri pariki y' Akagera mugace ka Magashi ifite ubwiza bwihariye ushingiye kuhantu iherereye, banyiri hoteli batangaje ibiciro byo kurara muri iyi hoteri.\nUmwihariko.\nInyubako z' iyi hoteli zirihariye ndetse n' imbata yayo irihariye kuko uyitegereje usanga yubatse nk' uruziga kandi yubatswe n' ibiti cyangwa imbaho, iri mubwoko bwa lodge, ifiteibyumba 8 kandi ikagira na Villa imwe igizwe n' ibyumba 4 na pisine yihariye, iherereye ahantu heza hitegeye kandi haboneka inyamanswa nyinshi nki intare, ingwe, isha nizindi. "}
{"id": "20215", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20215", "title": "Royal balloon Rwanda", "text": "Royal balloon Rwanda ni companyi y' ubukerarugendo isanzwe ikorera mu bihugu binyuranye by' Afrika, ikaba yazanye agashya mu ubukerarugendo bw' uRwanda, aha yazanye imipira itwarwa numuriro hot air balloons ebyiri zigashishwa mu gusura ibiza nyaburanga bitatse pariki y' akagera wibereye mu kirere, kuburyo ushobora kwitegereza pariki y' igihugu y' akagere uyirihejuru mu metero zirihagati ya 100m na 1000m kandi hot air balloons zishobora gutwara abakerarugendo 4 cyangwa 6. \nAkamaro.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 2022 nibwo ububuryo bw' ubukerarugendo nibwa bwatangiye kwifashishya muri pariki y' Akagera kubufatanye bwa Royal balloon Rwanda n' urwego rushinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda RDB (Rwanda Development Board). \nUmuyobozi w' ibikorwa bya Royal Balloon Rwanda mu Rwanda Atilla Turkmen yavuze ko Royal balloon bamaze imyaka irenga 30 bakora ibikorwa n' ubucuruzi byerekeye ubukerarugendo, rero bakaba biteguye kugernda n' icyerecyezo n' ingamba bya leta y' uRwanda muguteza imbere ubukerarugendo mu Rwanda.\nububuryo bushya bwitezweho gufasha abakerarugendo bagana pariki y' akagera gusura no kwihera ijisho ibyiza bya pariki y' akagera cyane cyane inyamanswa nka; Intare, inzovu, imbogo, inkura, ingwe, impala nizindi.\nAmateka.\nRoyal Balloon nkuko byagarutsweho n' umuyobozi wayo mu Rwanda bamaze imyaka irenga 30 bakora ibikorwa nkibi by' ubukerarugendo mu karere ka afrika y' iburasirazuba n' amagepfo, aho bamaze kugira inararibonye mugukoresha iyi mipira itwarwa n' umuriro."}
{"id": "20216", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20216", "title": "Umusozi wa Marrah", "text": "Umisozi ya Marra (Fur, Fugo Marra; Arabic, Jebel Marrah ni impinga y'imisozi y'ibirunga iba muri massif ifite ubutumburuke bwa. Ni imisozi miremire muri Sudani.\nImisozi miremire iherereye hagati mu karere ka Darfur muri Sudani ku mupaka w\u2019ibihugu bya Darfur yepfo na Darfur yo hagati, hamwe n\u2019agace gato kari muri leta ya Darfur y'Amajyaruguru. Igice cyo hejuru ni Deriba Caldera. Ahagana hejuru ya massif ni agace gato ariko kagira ikirere gishyushye hamwe n\u2019imvura nyinshi n\u2019amasoko ahoraho y\u2019amazi hagati ya savanna y'umye hamwe na scrub ya Sahel hepfo. \nImiterere y'umusozi wa Marrah.\nJebel Marra, n'ikirunga cya Tertiary gifite uburebure bwa, gikora mu majyaruguru n'amajyepfo nko muri, cyaguka kugera kuri, gikomeza amajyaruguru mu bindi. Imisozi ya Tagabo n'ikibaya cya Meidob, mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'urugero,abashakashatsi batekerezako aricyo ikomoka mu birunga. Ikibaya gishingiye ku rutare rwa Archean kikazamuka hagati y\u2019ibibaya bya Tchad na Nili yo hagati kandi bigera mu burengerazuba kugera ku mupaka wa Sudani, bigakora umwobo utagira umupaka witwa Basement Complex, ufite uburebure buri hagati ya mu burasirazuba kugeza kuri mu burengerazuba. Imisozi n'udusozi twitaruye, nka Tebella Massif, birashoboka ko ibisigisigi byubuso bwakera bwisuri, akadomo."}
{"id": "20217", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20217", "title": "Umusozi wa NUBA", "text": "Umusozi wa NUBA, ni agace gaherereye mu majyepfo ya Kordofan, muri Sudani. Ako gace gatuwe n'abaturage m'umoko kavukire azwi hamwe nkabaturage ba Nuba.abaturage babo Ntabwo bameze nkaba Nubian kavukire m'umajyaruguru ya Sudani. Ahubwo izina ryabo rikomoka ku izina ry'imisozi, \u201cNuba\u201d. Mu Gihe Hagati, imisozi ya Nuba yari imwe mu bwami bwa Nubiya bwa Alodiya. Mu kinyejana cya 18, babaye ubwami bwa Taqali bwagenzuraga imisozi kugeza batsinzwe na Mahdi Muhammad Ahmad. Abongereza bamaze gutsinda ingabo za Mahdi, Taqali yagaruwe nk'igihugu. Kwinjira mu bwoko bwa Messiria na Muraheleen wo mu barabu ba Baggara byagize uruhare runini mu makimbirane agezweho ingeruka. Abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 1.5 baba mu misozi, cyane cyane abo mu ubwoko bwa Nuba, hamwe na bake muri Baggara. \nIkindi wamenya muriri misozi yo mugace ka NUBA.\nKu rugero runini urutare rwo mu misozi ya Nuba rugize igice cyo mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bwa Shield y'Abarabu Nubian. Imisozi ya Nuba igizwe ahanini nubutare bwa metamorphic yo mu bihe bya Precambrian hiyongereyeho uduce tunyanyagiye mu rutare rwaka rwa Neoproterozoic na Paleozoic. Uzengurutse agace k'imisozi ya Nuba nk'inyanja hari ahantu hanini h'urutare rwa Cenozoic rwubatswe ruzwi ku izina rya \"Rawaba\". Ku misozi ya Nuba hari ububiko bwa fosifate bwakira uraniyumu, vanadium na fosifore bishobora kuba inyungu mu bukungu. \nImisozi miremire muri iki gihugu cya Sudani ni imisozi iboneka mugace rwagati k'imisozi ya Nuba, kandi iyi ni inselbergs. Izi inselbergs zigizwe ahanini nigitare cyaka, kuko urutare rwa metamorphic rwarangiritse cyane bityo rukaba rufite ubutaka bwo hasi. "}
{"id": "20218", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20218", "title": "I Rwanda", "text": "I Rwanda ni agace gaherereye mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda, mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu karere ka Gasabo, mu murenge wa Rutunga, mu kagari ka Gasagara, hakaba ari mu mpinga y'umusozi wa Rutunga mu ihuriro ry'imidugudu ya Kamasasa na Gatare. Aha niho u Rwanda rugari rwa Gasabo rwahereye rwaguka.\nIbikorwa bya habaye.\nI Gasabo habaye imiryango itandukanye y'abiru bo mu bwoko bw'abatege, bakaba bari bafite inshingano zo kuba abiru b'abanyamihango; Mu mihango umwiru w'umutege yarakurikiraga umwami w'u Rwanda mu cyubahiro ndetse bakaba bari banafite ingoma ngabe ebyiri ari zo: Rwagagaza na Rugeramisango, izi ngoma zikaba zimuritse mu ngoro y'umurage iri i Huye.\nI Rwanda hatuye abami b'u Rwanda batandukanye barimo umwami Kigeri III Ndabarasa ndetse n'umwami Kigeri IV Rwabugiri.\nI Rwanda hahoze urugo rw'umuterekero rw'umwami Yuhi V Musinga."}
{"id": "20219", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20219", "title": "One&amp;only Gorilla's Nest", "text": "One&amp;only Gorilla's Nest ni hoteli iherereye mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda, mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru, Karere ka Musanze mu Kinigi, ikaba iherereye mu nzira yerekeza muri Pariki y'igihugu y'Ibirunga. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nOne&amp;only Gorilla's Nest ni hoteli ifite inyenyeri 5 ikaba yaratingije ibikorwa byayo mu Rwanda ku italiki ya \"1 Kanama 2019\", Ikaba yubatse ku buso bungana na hegitari (Ha) 35. Imirimo yo kuyubaka yatwaye amafaranga agera kuri miliyoni 65 z'amadorali y'Amerika.\nImiterere.\nOne&amp;only Gorilla's Nest yubatse mu buryo bw'imyubakire igendanye n'igihe aho ibiyubatse bidahumanya ikirere ndetse, ikaba yubatswe n'ibiti gusa uretse ibyuma biyifashe gusa, mu miterere yayo imbere itatswe n'imitako y'umuco nyarwanda nk'imigongo n'ibindi bikoresho bitandukanye byo mu muco nyarwanda.\nIyi hoteli iherereye mu ishyamba rikungahaye ku bimera aho ifite amoko arenga ibihumbi 36 y'ibimera bihinzemo, ikaba inafite umwihariko wuko imboga zakirizwa abayigana zose ariho zihingwa.\nAmacumbi.\nIyi hoteli ifite ibyumba 21 bibarizwa mu byiciro bine bitandukanye ari nako ibi byiciro bigiye bitandukanye ku ngano y'icyumba ndetse n'ubwiza bwa buri cyumba. Ibyo byiciro ni:"}
{"id": "20220", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20220", "title": "Munazi Eco Lodge", "text": "Munazi Eco Lodge ni hoteli iherereye mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda, mu ntara y'Uburengerazuba, mu karere ka Nyamasheke, umurenge wa Rangiro, akagari ka Banda, umudugudu wa Nkamba. Ikaba ibarizwa muri pariki y'igihugu ya Nyungwe.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMunazi Eco Lodge ni hoteli yatangiye kubakwa mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 2024, imirimo yo kubaka ikaba yarakozwe hifashishijwe ibikoresho bigezweho bidahumanya ikirere ndetse byose bikaba byarakorewe mu Rwanda mu rwego rwo kwimakaza ihame ryo guteza imbere ibikorerwa mu Rwanda.\nMuri Kamena 2025 nibwo iyi hoteli yatangiye kwakira abayigana. \nInkomoko y'izina.\nMunazi Eco Lodge yiswe izina \"Munazi \" rikomotse ku izina ry'igiti kiboneka mu ishyamba ry'igihugu rya Nyungwe cyitwa \"Umunazi,\" kikaba ari igiti mu mikurire yacyo cyirangwa no gukura kigandarara, aho ukirebye ari munsi yacyo abona cyakoze ishusho y'umutaka."}
{"id": "20222", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20222", "title": "Kigali Green Complex", "text": "Kigali Green Complex (KGC), ni inyubako irimo kubakwa i Kigali, aho iri kubakwa mu murwa mukuru w'u Rwanda, Kigali. Ikaba izaba igizwe n'amagorofa (etage) 29 mu bujyejuru uturutse k'ubutaka, biteganijwe ko iyi nyubako mu gihe ibikorwa byo kuyubaka bizaba birangiye izaba ariyo nyubako ndende mujyi wa Kigali ndetse no mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda muri rusange. Ndetse mu miterere yayo hagendewe ku gishushanyo mbonera cyayo izaba ifite izindi etage 6 zo munsi (zo mu bujyakuzimu). \nAho iherereye.\nIyi nyubako iherereye mu gace kahariwe ibikorwa by'ubucuruzi n'amahoteli hagati mu mujyi wa Kigali, aho iherereye ku kibanza gifite ubuso bungana na. Iyi nyubako kandi iherereye hafi ya Kigali Convention Center,Inzovu mall,Kigali heights ikaba iri ahahoze inyubako yakoreragamo ibiro bya Minisiteri y\u2019ubutabera mu Rwanda. Umuyoboro ndangamerekezo wa geografiya (GPS) waho ni: 1 \u00b0 56'42.0 \"S, 30 \u00b0 03'44.0\" E (Uburambike: -1.945000; Uburebure: 30.062222). \nIncamake.\nInyubako y\u2019amagorofa 29 iri mu bikorwa byo kubakwa n'ikigo cyitwa Ultimate Developers Limited (UDL), iyi nyubako ikaba ari umutungo w\"\u2019ikigo gishinzwe ubwiteganyirize bw\u2019u Rwanda\" (RSSB) ku kigero cy'ijanisha rya 100%. Iyi nyubako ya Kigali Green Complex ikaba yitezweho kuba imwe mu miyoboro ibyarira inyungu ikigo cya RSSB biturutse mu mafaranga yinjizwe avuye mu bafatanyabikorwa ba RSSB ndetse n'abagenerwabikorwa bayo, ndetse iyi nyubako izatanga umwanya uhagije wo gukodeshwa ndetse wujuje ibikenerwa byose ku bigo bitandukanye, ibikorwa bitandukanye by'ubucuruzi ndetse n\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nUmujyanama mu bwubatsi by'umwihariko ku miterere y'inyubako (igishushanyo mbonera cy'inyubako) bivugwa ko ari Vavaki Architects. Amasezerano y'ubwubatsi, amasoko n'ibikorwa bigendanye n'ubwubatsi yahawe itsinda rya Shelter Group, rifite icyicaro i Doha, mu gihugu cya Qatar, akaba ari ikigo gifite ibiro mu burasirazuba bwo hagati, m'Uburayi ndetse no muri Aufrika. Ibikorwa byo gutegura ubucuruzi biteganijwe mu mwaka wa 2027. "}
{"id": "20225", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20225", "title": "Chateau le marara Hotel", "text": "chateau le marara hotel ni imwe mumahotel meza ajyezweho mumujyi wa karonjyi ndetse no mu Rwanda ikaba iherereye kunkombe za kivu ni umujyi uherereye mu bilometero 130 uvuye mumujyi wa kigali, chateau le marara hotel iherereye mu kagari ka kibuye umurenge wa bwishyura mu karere ka karongi ni inyubako yubatswe muburyo bwinyubako bwa cyami bityo bikayijyira inyubako ifite umwihariko wayo.\nindanganturo.\nhttps://igihe.com/ubukerarugendo/article/karongi-yungutse-hotel-ya-mbere-ifite-isura-y-inyubako-z-i-burayi"}
{"id": "20226", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20226", "title": "Amashuri ya kaminuza m' u Rwanda", "text": "Mu Rwanda hari amashuri makuru na kaminuza zigera kuri 37, harimo 28 zikorera mu gihugu, naho andi 9 akaba ari amashami ya kaminuza z'amahanga. \nurutonde rwamashuri ya kaminuza.\n- kaminuza y'u Rwanda (UR):ni kaminuza ya leta, ikaba ari yo nini mu gihugu -kaminuza y'abadiveventisiti (adventist university of central afric -AUCA):ni kaminuza yigenga -kaminuza y'abadiventisite (unuversty of lay adventist of kigali-UNILAK):ni kaminuza yigenga -kigali independent university (ULK):ni kaminuza yigenga -INilfashu business university:ni kaminuza yigenga -mount kenya university (MKU):ni ishami rya kaminuza ikomeye yo muri kenya -university of kigali: ni kaminuza yigenga -universty of kibungo: ni kaminuza yigenga -southern african nazarene universty (SANU): ni ishami rya kaminuza yo muri afurika y'epfo -akazi internation academy: ni kaminuza yigenga -Rwandan institute for peace studies and conflict resolution (RIPCOR):ni kaminuza yigenga -institute of legal practice and development (ILPD)ni kaminuza yigenga -universty of tourism, technology and business studies (UTB):nikaminuza yigenga -INES-Ruhengeri:ni kaminuza yigenga -christian universty of Rwanda (CHUR):ni kaminuza yigenga -Rwanda institute of technology and management (RITM): ni kaminuza yigenga -university of Gitwe:ni kaminuza yigenga -kampala internation university: ni kaminuza yo muri Uganda -African leadership universty: ni kaminuza yigenga \nindanganturo.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/uburezi/amashuri/article/menya-kaminuza-n-amashuri-makuru-13-bibarizwa-mu-ntara-y-amajyaruguru"}
{"id": "20227", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20227", "title": "Menya imibereho y'intare", "text": "Intare ni inyamaswa y'inkazi abantu benshi batinya ndetse no kumenya ubuzima bwite bwayo biragoye, mujyihe cyubukonje nibwo intare zororoka intare yingabo ifita iyingore ikayimarana iminsi ibiri, icyojyihe ishobora gukora imibonano mpuza bitsina inshuro ziri hagati 100 na 120, iyo ingore irimo gusenzanya n'ingabo ifite uburyo ijya kuruhande igahura nizindi ngabo kugirango nibyara zizabashe kurinda abana bayo.\nibyutaruzi k'intare.\nintare ni inyamaswa zitunzwe n'inyama zigahiga izindi nyamaswa zikaba arizo zirya zikanwa amaraso yazo, iyo iyi nyamaswa ikuze cyane ishobora kugira ibilo 250, kumunsi irya ibiro birindwi by'inyama ku ngabo naho ingoreyo ikarya ibiro bitanu, ni ubwoko bw'inyamaswa bukunda kuba mu miryango migari, zikibera mu mashyamba kandi ingabo ingabo ishobora kubaho mujyihe cyimyaka iri hagati yi 7 cyangwa 12 naho ingore zikabaho hagati ya 14 na 20 ariko bishobokako intare yanarenza imyaka 30, mu mashyamba zibamo bakunze kuzita umwami w'ishyamba kuko usanga zitinywa cyane n'izindi nyamaswa, intare zikunda guhiga mu ijoro no mu rukerera kuko mu masaha yandi zisinzira.\nindanganturo.\n1.Menya imibereho y\u2019intare n\u2019uko zororoka - Kigali Today\n2.Ese intare ni umwami w\u2019ishyamba koko? Menya ibintu bitangaje uta | InyaRwanda.com"}
{"id": "20228", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20228", "title": "Parike ya Serengeti", "text": "Parike y'igihugu ya Serengeti ni pariki iherereye mu majyaruguru yo mugihugu cya Tanzaniya igera ku 14,763\u00a0km. Iherereye mu burasirazuba bwa Mara no mu majyaruguru y\u2019akarere ka Simiyu kandi ikikijwe n'abaturage bagera kuri ya savanna. Iyi parike yashinzwe mu 1940.\nAmateka.\nMu 1930, ubuso bungana na 2,286\u00a0km yagenwe nk'imikino yaberaga mu majyepfo no mu burasirazuba bwa Serengeti. Mu myaka ya za 1930, guverinoma ya Tanganyika yashyizeho gahunda ya parike y\u2019igihugu yubahiriza ibyemezo bijyane n'amasezerano ajyanye no kubungabunga Fauna na flora muri Leta yabo. \nMu 1930, major Richard Hingdston, yasuye Tanganyika mu butumwa bwatanzwe na Sosiyete ishinzwe kubungabunga Fauna y\u2019Ingoma (SPFE), yasabye ko ikigo cy\u2019imikino cya Serengeti cyagenwa nka parike y\u2019igihugu kugira ngo gikemure cg gikingire ibibazo by\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019abaturage n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu."}
{"id": "20229", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20229", "title": "Zanzibar", "text": "Zanzibar [a] ni ikirwa cya Tanzaniya kiri ku nkombe za Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Iherereye mu nyanja y'Ubuhinde, kandi igizwe n'ibirwa byinshi bito n'ibinini binini, Muribyo birwa ikinini kirimo kitwa Zanzibar n'ikirwa cya Unguja n'ikirwa cya Pemba. Umurwa mukuru ni Umujyi wa Zanzibar, uherereye ku kirwa cya Unguja. Ikigo cyamateka cyacyo, Umujyi wa Kibuye, ni Umurage wisi.\nZanzibar kandi ni agace kigenga kunze ubumwe na Tanganyika mu 1964, kagashinga Repubulika yunze ubumwe ya Tanzaniya y'ubu.Inganda nyamukuru za archipelago ni ubwiza n'ubukerarugendo. Ingingo nyamukuru byakozwe. Ikirwa cya Zanzibar, hamwe n'ikirwa cya Mafia cyo muri Tanzaniya, rimwe na rimwe bakunze kwitwa \"Ibirwa bya Spice\". bigizwe n'ubukerarugendo bwa Zanzibar gahunda ya leta yatumye ubwiyongere bwa ba mukerarugendo 19.000 mu 1985, 376.000 muri 2016. \nImibereho n'ubuzima bwa Zanzibar.\nUbusumbane butandukanye buriho mu mibereho y'abatuye Pemba na Unguja, ndetse n'ubusumbane buri hagati y'abatuye imijyi n'icyaro. Impuzandengo y'umwaka yinjiza ni US $ 2500. Hafi ya kimwe cya kabiri cyabaturage baba munsi yumurongo wubukene.\nN\u2019ubwo urwego rwo hejuru rw\u2019ubuvuzi n\u2019uburezi rwibanze,impfu z'abana muri Zanzibar ni 54 kuri 1.000 bavutse ari bazima, ibyo bikaba biri munsi ya 10.0 ku ijana ugereranije n\u2019igipimo cyo muri Tanzaniya. Umubare w'abana bapfa muri Zanzibar ni 73 kuri 1.000 bavutse ari bazima, ibyo bikaba biri munsi ya 21.5 ku ijana ugereranyije n'igipimo cyo muri Tanzaniya. Umubare w'abana bavuka muri Tanzaniya ni mwinshi, 35,64 bavuka ku baturage 1000, ariko umubare uragabanuka. "}
{"id": "20230", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20230", "title": "Parike ya Tarangire", "text": "Tarangire ni parike y'igihugu iri mu karere ka Menyara muri Tanzaniya. Izina rya parike rikomoka ku ruzi rwa Tarangire rwambuka parike. Umugezi wa Tarangire nisoko yambere y\u2019amazi meza y\u2019inyamaswa zo mu gasozi muri Ecosystem ya Tarangire mugihe cyizuba cyumwaka. Ibinyabuzima bya Tarangire bisobanurwa no kwimuka intera ndende ya wildebeest na zebrasi. Mu gihe cyizuba inyamanswa ibihumbi n\u2019ibihumbi byibanda muri parike ya Tarangire uhereye mu bihe bikikije ibihe byo gukwirakwiza no kubyara.\nIfite ubuso bungana nana 2,850\u00a0km. Imiterere nyaburanga igizwe n'imisozi ya granitike, ikibaya cy'umugezi, n'ibishanga. Ibimera ni uruvange rw\u2019ishyamba Rya Acacia, ishyamba rya Combretum, ibyatsi byuzuyemo n'ibiti bya Adansonia.\nInzovu ya kera izwi kubyara impanga tuyisanga muri Tarangire. Ivuka ry'impanga ziherutse muri parike yigihugu ya Tarangire ya Tanzaniya ni urugero rwiza rw'ukuntu kuvuka kwizo mpanga zombi zifite ubuzima bwiza kandi bitera imbere bishobora gutsinda ibibazo. \nInzu ibamo amoko arenga 550, parike ni ahantu h'abakunda inyoni. Iyi parike izwi cyane kubera Imisozi miremire itondekanya imiterere. Abatereranywe usanga akenshi babamo dwarf mongoose. Muri 2015, giraffe yera kubera leucism yagaragaye muri parike. Ubushakashatsi bwibinyabuzima bwibanze ku nzovu yo muri Afurika yo mu gihuru na Masai giraffe.\nKuva mu 2005, agace karinzwe gafatwa nk'igice cyo kubungabunga intare muriyi pariki \nAmerekezo ya pariki Tarangire.\nParike ya Tarangire irashobora kugerwaho unyuze kumuhanda wa kaburimbo uva Arusha mumasaha abiri.Pariki y'ikiyaga cya Manyara ni kilometero 70 uvuye Tarangire."}
{"id": "20231", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20231", "title": "Imbogo", "text": "Imbogo ni Inyamanswa nini iteye nk' Inka iba mu ishyamba. Mu Rwanda Imbogo zikunze kuboneka muri Pariki y' igihugu y' Akagera iherereye mu ntara y' ibutasirazuba no muri pariki y' Ibirunga mu majyaruguru y' igihugu.Mu uturere Gatsibo, Kayonza na Nyagatare\nImiterere.\nIyi inyamanswa uko iteye ni nki inka, gusa aho bitandukaniye nuko Imbogo ziba mu mashyamba kandi zikagira n' amahane nkuko akenshi bigaragaraiyo zitorotse pariki, aho usanga zitera abaturage ndetse zikanangiza imyaka yabo mu ntara y' amajyaruguru, ikindi nanone Imbogo iba nini kuruta Inka. Indi miterere ubona izi nyamanswa zombi zihuje. \nibindi wamenya ku mbogo.\nImbogo muri rusange zibamo amoko abiri manini gusa nanone bwoko nabwo bukagira andi moko mato abugize, kabaho imbogo zo muri Afrika akenshi ziganje mugice cy' Afrika y' iburasizuba n' amajyepfo, hakabaho n' imbogo zo muri Aziya bakunze kwita imbogo zo kumazi, zibonela mu Buhindi no mubice bihegereye cyane cyane. Imbogo iramba kugeza kumyaka 30, ihaka amezi 11.5 kandi iyo ibyaye ishobora kongera guhaka nyuma y' imyaka ibiri, zikunda kugenda mu matsinda gusa hari nizigenda zonyine cyangwa mu dutsinda duto cyane izo rero niza zigira amahane cyane, akenshi ziba ari imbogo z' ingabo zashaje izindi ngabo zikaziruka mu ishyo rinini, ziba zifite intege nke (zishaje) kandi zikarangwa n' amahane menshi no kwigunga. \nImbogo zo muri Afrika.\nimbogo ziboneka muri Afrika n' imbogo zigabanijwemo amoko (Ibyiciro) abiri; hari imbogo zo mu mukenke (savannah) ziboneka cyane muri pariki zo muri kenya, tanzania, Botswana, Rwanda muri pariki y' igihugu y' akagera na Uganda mu bice by' imirambi ndetse hari n; ubundi bwoko bw; imbogo zo mu misozi izi rero zikunze kuba mu bice by' imisozi miremire nko mu Rwanda muri pariki y' igihugu y' Ibirunga ndetse no muri Tanzania. \nAmabara y' imbogo zo muri Afrika.\nImbogo zo muri Afrika zikunze kuba zifite ibara ry' umukara muri rusange gusa habaho n' imbogo zifite ibara ry' igitare (Umweru) nkuko byagiye bigaragara muri pariki zo mu Rwanda z' akagera n' ibirunga. "}
{"id": "20232", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20232", "title": "Sisitemu yo Gusakaza Amazi yo Kunywa ya Karenge", "text": "Sisitemu yo Gusakaza Amazi yo Kunywa ya Karenge (KDWSS), ariyo ikunze kwitwa Sisitemu yo Gutanga Amazi ya Karenge ni uburyo bwo gukusanya cyangwa gufata amazi, agatunganywamo amazi meza, netse agakwirakwiza mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda. Iyi sisitemu itanga amazi mu bice bigize umujyi Kigali ndetse no mu Karere ka Rwamagana. \nAho biherereye.\nIkigo gishinzwe gutunganya no gukwirakwiza amazi giherereye mu gace k'ibiyaga bya \"Karenge\", mu karere ka Rwamagana, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda, ikaba yegerane n'inkombe z'ikiyaga cya Mugesera, nko muri, uturutse ku muhanda, mu majyepfo ashyira uburasirazuba bw'umujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'igihugu cy'u Rwanda. \nIncamake.\nKDWSS yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1975 ifite ubushobozi bwo gutunganya amazi angana na (metero kube) buri munsi. Mu mwaka wa 1985, ubwo bushobozi bwongereweho bugera bugera kuri (metero kibe) buri munsi. Muri 2008, umusaruro wa buri munsi wongerewe kugera kuri. Kugeza mu Kwakira 2020, sisitemu yatunganyije (metero kibe) y'amazi yo kunywa yatunganywaga buri munsi, muri uwo musaruro (metero kibe) (80 ku ijana) yoherejwe i Kigali na (20 ku ijana) yatanzwe mu Karere ka Rwamagana. \nImirimo yo kwagura.\nMu mwaka wa 2020, guverinoma y'u Rwanda, ibinyujije mu ishami ryayo, \"Ishami rishinzwe gutunganya amazi n\u2019isukura\" (WASAC Limited), yiyemeje kongerera uru ruganda ubushobozi bwo gutunganya bwo gutunganya amazi kugera kuri (metero kibe) buri munsi. Imirimo yo kwagura ikubiyemo: \nKubaka no gutera inkunga.\nIgiciro cyo kwagura giteganijwe kuzakoresha angana na miliyoni 164.3 z'amadolari y'Amerika. Inkunga yo kubaka itangwa ninzego zavuzwe hepfo: \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nUruganda rwagutse ruri muri gahunda zateguwe n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019u Rwanda muri gahunda yo kugira ngo hagezwe amazi meza yo kunywa ku baturage bose mu Kuboza ku mwaka wa 2024. "}
{"id": "20233", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20233", "title": "Sitade Umuganda", "text": "Stade Umuganda ni sitade mberabyombi iherereye mu karere ka Rubavu aha hoze hitwa muri Gisenyi, mu ntara y'Uburengerazuba, mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda. Kugeza ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru, ku rwego rw'amakipe ya club nka Etincelles FC na Marines FC yose akaba akina muri Rwanda Premier League shampiyona y'amakipe yo mu cyiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda. Iyi sitade ifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu bangana n'ibihumbi bitanu (5000). Sitade Umuganda ifite ikibuga kigizwe n'ibyatsi bihangano mu rurimi rw'icyongereza byitwa \"turf artificial\" ndetse ifite n'umwanya w'ikibuga cyo gukoreraho imyitozo. Hariho kandi ibyumba bine by'amakipe byo kwambariramo hamwe na VIP hamwe n'ibice byagenewe itangazamakuru. Iyi stade yakiriye imikino yo mu itsinda rya kane (Pool D) yo muri shampiyona y'ibihugu bya Afrika (CHAN) mu mwaka wa 2016."}
{"id": "20234", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20234", "title": "Ibyo wamenya ku mpyisi\\", "text": "ibyo wamenya ku impyisi imwe munyamaswa zitinyitse mu ishyamba, ibarwa munyamaswa zinkazi n'intare nizipfa kuyigondera kuko insuro nyinshi usanga zirwanira umuhigo nubwo waba wishwe n'intare, ubudahangarwa bw'impyisi buturuka kurwsaye rwayo rukomeye ku buryo bushobora guhekenya kandi rukajanjagura igufa ry'inzovu. \nibyo wamenya ku mpyisi.\nubusanzwe mumuryango w'impyisi harimo ubwoko bune butandukanye, impyisi zirangwa no kugira ibidomo binini ku ruhu rwazo kuko uko zigenda zitandukana niko nimiterere n'imigaragarire y'amabara y'uruhu igaragara itandukaniraho, kugeza ubu ku rwego rw'isi habarirwa impyisi ziri hagati 27000-47000, umuvuduko wayo ku isaha ushobora kugera kuri kilometero 60,impyisi ishobora gupima kilogarama ziri hagati ya 40-64 igihagararo cy'impyisi gishobora kubarirwa hagati ya santimetero 70-91, uburebure bwayo burihagati ya santimetero 95-166.\nimibereho y'impyisi.\nmubijyanye nimibanire yazo izi nyamaswa zibaho nkizindi nyamabere zitandukanye, mu jyihe cyaninjoro zireba neza cyane bigatuma zihiga ninjoro kumankwa zikaryama hafi yimyobo yazo, ziba mumiryango aho umuryango uba uyoborwa nimpyisi y'ingore, iyo zishatse kuganga zijya kure yimyobo yazo nabwo bukaba ubundi buryo bwokwerekana agace ziherereyemo, zijyira amajwi ajyera kure cyane izo bikazifasha mu buryo bwo guhanahana amakuru n'izindi zo mu bwoko zibarizwamo.\nimyororokere y'impyisi.\nubu bwoko bw'impyisi icyigabo gishobora kwimya ibigore byinshi kubwagura bishobora kuba igihe icyaricyo cyose mumezi agize umwaka, iyo ikigore kimaze kubangurirwa kibwegeka amezi ane kandi kongera kwima ku yindi nshuro bikorwa hagati y'amezi 11 na 21, ikigore kibwagurira mu isenga kandi kikabwagura ibibwana hagati ya 1-3 ariko inshuro nyinshi biba aribibwana bibiri, bigacutswa hagati yamezi 12 na 18, impyisi, impyisi yingabo iva mumuryango yavukiyemo ku myaka ibiri mu gihe impyisi y'ingore ihaguma.\nintanganturo.\n1.Ibyo utari uzi ku mpyisi, inyamaswa irya ibyasigajwe n\u2019izindi, ifatiye runini urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima \u2013 MUHAZIYACU\n2.Iyo bavuga ko impyisi yarongoye biba byagenze gute? - Kigali Today"}
{"id": "20235", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20235", "title": "Ingwe", "text": "Ingwe ni inyamanzwa ibarizwa mu itsinda ry' injangwe nini (Panthera) ni inyamajanja ndetse ikaba inyamanswa y' ikazi kandi ihorana umujinya ukabije, hari nizindi nyamanswa zibarizwa muri iritsinda nka; tigire, jaguari nizindi.\nAho ingwe ziboneka.\nIngwe n' inyamanswa yi indyanyama iboneka kandi ishobora kuba ahariho hose kwisi, ingwe ishobora kuba ahantu haba ubushyuhe bwinshi nko mu mukenke, mu bice by' ubutayu, ishobora kuba mu mashamba ahora agwamo imvura ndetse ziba nahantu haba amasimbi (Amasimbi) nko mu burussiya kanda hase ikahashobora. \nIngwe zo mu kagera.\nmuri pariki y' igihugu y' akagera nihamwe mu hantu haboneka ingwe mu Rwanda zikunda kwibera ahantu hihishe, akenshi iyo abakerarugendo bauye iyi pariki ntibazibona byoroshye, gusa muri iyi parike hari uduce dukunze kubonekamo inyamanswa y' ingwe nko mu bibaya bya; kilala, muhana, nyamashama, nyamatete na magashi biherereye ahagana mu majyaruguri y' iburasirazuba bwiyi pariki."}
{"id": "20236", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20236", "title": "Ingando y\u2019Umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa i Mimuri", "text": "Ingando y\u2019Umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa i Mimuri ni kimwe mu bice bikomeye byaranze amateka y\u2019u Rwanda ikaba ibumbatiye urwibutso rw\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa. Iherereye mu Mudugudu wa Rebero, Akagari ka Rugari, Umurenge wa Mimuri, mu Karere ka Nyagatare, ahahoze hitwa Umutara w\u2019i Ndorwa.\nAmateka n\u2019akamaro.\nIngando y'i Mimuri yubatswe hagati y\u2019imyaka ya 1940 na 1950, mu gihe Umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa yabaga ari kurambagiraigihugu, by'umwihariko mu gice cy\u2019Umutara cyari kigizwe ahanini n\u2019umukenke, ahanini ajya kureba ikiraro cy\u2019inka ze cyari i Nyagatare (ahazwi nka \"Cyarudahigwa\") cyangwa agiye mu muhigo.\nKubera intera iri hagati y\u2019i Nyanza n\u2019i Mimuri, Umwami ntiyabashaga gusubira mu ngoro ye iherereye i Nyanza uwo munsi, bityo yategetse ko hubakwa iyo ngando kugira ngo ajye aharara.\nImiterere y\u2019ingando.\nIngando igizwe n\u2019amazu atanu yubatswe mu ishusho y\u2019inzu za kinyarwanda, ariko zose zikaba zarubatswe mu mabati y\u2019icyuma kuva hasi kugeza hejuru. Mu rwego rwo kugabanya ubushyuhe mu gihe cy\u2019izuba n\u2019ubukonje mu gihe cy\u2019imbeho, hejuru y\u2019amabati hashyirwagaho ibyatsi bizwi nk\u2019inkorogoto.\nInkike y\u2019ingando yabaga yubakitse neza, igakorerwaho isuku n\u2019ivugurura, cyane cyane iyo umwami yabaga ategerejwe ko ahajya. Kugeza ubu, ibimenyetso bimwe by\u2019iyo nkike biracyahari, birimo umunyinya umwe n\u2019ibiti bibiri by\u2019imishashi yo mu bwoko bw'inganzamarumbo."}
{"id": "20237", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20237", "title": "Ubukomane bwa Nyakayaga", "text": "Ubukomane bwa Nyakayaga ni agace gakungahaye ku mateka y\u2019ubworozi n\u2019ingendo mu Rwanda rwo hambere. Gaherereye mu Mudugudu wa Bukomane, Akagari ka Bukomane, Umurenge wa Gitoki, mu Karere ka Gatsibo, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba. Aka gace kari ku nkengero z\u2019aho Umutara wagabaniraga n\u2019Ubuganza bwa Ruguru.\nAmateka n\u2019akamaro.\nUbukomane bwa Nyakayaga bwamenyekanye cyane mbere y'umwaduko w\u2019abazungu ndetse no ku ngoma ya gikoroni, nk\u2019ahantu habereye ubworozi kubera ubwatsi bwiza bwahabonekaga byumwihariko ku misozi ya Kiburara na Nyakayaga. Ubu bwatsi bwatumaga abatunzi bo mu bice by\u2019Ubuganza n\u2019Umutara, ndetse no mu tundi duce nka Ndorwa, Bugesera, Gisaka, na Bwanacyambwe, bahakunda cyane kuko inka zabo zahabaga neza, zikabyara vuba, kandi zigakamwa amata y\u2019amavuta menshi.\nMu gihe amapfa yabaga yateye, aka gace kabaga ahantu hakururaga aborozi baturutse impande zose z\u2019igihugu. Ibi byatewe n\u2019ubwoko bw\u2019ubwatsi bwahabonekaga burimo itete, umucaca, urukemba, inyovi, ivubwe, n\u2019ishinge.\nIriba rya Rwarukaza.\nMu misozi ya Nyakayaga, Gikoma, na Matare, hahoraga iriba rihiye ryitwaga \"Rwarukaza\". Rikaba ryari iriba rizwi cyane mu bworozi kuko inka zanywaga ku mazi yaryo zahakaga cyane n\u2019iyo ubwatsi bwabaga bwabaye buke. Bitewe n\u2019uko ayo makera yafatwaga nk\u2019isoko y\u2019uburumbuke bw\u2019inka, benshi mu batunzi bahitaga baguma i Nyakayaga, bamwe bagatura burundu.\nNubwo iriba rya Rwarukaza rikiri aho ryahoze, ubu ntirigikoreshwa mu bworozi kuko amazi yaryo agenerwa ubuhinzi bw\u2019umuceri mu bishanga bya Rwagitima na Ntende."}
{"id": "20238", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20238", "title": "Ku Cyasemakamba", "text": "Ku Cyasemakamba ni agace kari mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba, mu Karere ka Ngoma, Umurenge wa Kibungo, Akagari ka Cyasemakamba, Umudugudu wa Kiruhura. Aka gace gaherereye hafi y\u2019amasangano y\u2019umuhanda munini uturuka Kigali werekeza Rusumo n\u2019uwerekeza mu Mujyi wa Kibungo. Amateka y\u2019aka gace ahanini ashingiye ku mutware Semakamba mwene Shumbusho ya Vuningoma ya Rwasa, wo mu muryango w\u2019Abasa, wabayeho ku ngoma z\u2019Abami Mutara II Rwogera na Kigeri IV Rwabugiri.\nAmateka ya Semakamba.\nSemakamba ya Shumbusho yabaye umwe mu batware b\u2019ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda, akaba yaravaga mu muryango w\u2019Abasa. Yakuriye mu mutwe w\u2019ingabo Abatsinzi, wari warashinzwe ku ngoma ya Mibambwe III Sentabyo. Uyu mutwe w\u2019ingabo watwarwaga na Vuningoma, sekuru wa Semakamba, wanawuraze umuhungu we Bakimbagira, wageze ku butware ariko akaza gupfa ku ngoma ya Kigeri IV Rwabugiri. Nyuma ye, umutwe wategetswe na Ngabo, umuhungu wa Bakimbagira.\nSemakamba ya Shumbusho yageze ku Cyasemakamba aherekeje ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda ubwo zateraga igice cy\u2019Igisaka, kikigarurirwa na Mutara II Rwogera mu ntangiriro z\u2019ikinyejana cya 19. Yahisemo gutura muri ako gace, aho yateye igiti cy\u2019umuvumu cyaje kumenyekana cyane mu mateka y\u2019ako gace.\nInkomoko y'izina Cyasemakamba.\nIzina \u201cCyasemakamba\u201d rikomoka ku mvugo y\u2019abaturage bajyaga bavuga ku giti cy\u2019umuvumu cyari mu itongo rya Semakamba. Aho bavugaga bati \u201cKiriya giti ni icya Semakamba\u201d, bigenda bihinduka buhoro buhoro kugeza ryabaye \u201cKu Cyasemakamba\u201d, izina rirahafata kugeza n\u2019ubu."}
{"id": "20239", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20239", "title": "Ingoro Ndangamateka y\u2019Urugamba rwo Guhagarika Jenoside", "text": "Ingoro ndangamateka y' urugamba rwo guhagarika Jenoside nimwe mu ngoro z' umurage, umuco n' amateka z' uRwanda, yatangiye kumugaragaro itangijwe na nakubahwa Perezida wa Repubulika y' uRwanda Paul KAGAME muri 2017.\nIbyo wamenya kuri iyi ngoro.\nIyi ngoro Ndangamateka y' urugamba rwo guhagarika jenoside ni ingoro iherereye I Kigali ahahoze hitwa muri CND ubu hakorera inteko ishinga amategeko imitwe yombi. iyo usuye iyi ngoro ubona inzira y' umusara ingabo za RPF _ Inkoyanyi zanyuzemo kugirango zihagarike jenoside yakorerwaga Abatitsi muri 1994 mu Rwanda, harimo amashusho, amakarita bikranye ubuhanga bigaragaza ayo mateka ndetse iyi ngoro irimo ibyumba 9 bigaragaza amateka y' urugamba rwo guhagarika jenoside kuva ku masezerano ya Arusha yo muri 1993 kugeza hagiyeho guverinoma y' ubumwe bw abanyarwanda muri nyakanga 1994.\nIbihe byingenzu mu rugamba rwo guhagarika jenoside.\nMuri 1990 tariki ya 1 ukwakira, ingabo za RPA (RPF _ Inkotany) zagabye igitero ku umupaka wa kagitumba, ziyobowe Major General Fred Gasa RWIGEMA, bigeza ku tariki ya 2 ukwakira major general fred Gisa RWIGEMA yarasiwe Nyabwishongwezi arapfa, kuva icyogihe kugeza mu matariki ya 16 ukwakira, muri icyo gihe ingabo za RPA yatakaje morale kubera icyuho cyo kubura bamwe mubayobozi, kuko ingabo zare ya habyarimana zifatanyije n' abacancuro barabarashe cyane.\nRyabega kuwa 23 ukwakira major bayingana na bunyenyezi bararashwe kurugamba bikomeza kuba bibi, bigeze mu gushyingo 1990, habyarimana yemereye amashyaka menshi gukora, mu kuboza leta ya habyarimana ihimba ikinyoma cyuko Inkotanyi zateye Kigali kugirango babone uko batoteza abatutsi.\nmuri 1991, mutarama tariki 3 RPA yahinduye uburyo bwo kugaba ibitero, batera gatuna na kaniga, tariki 7 leta abantu urwogupfa babaziza ko ari ibyitso by' inkotanyi, tariki ya 23 mutarama RPA yafashe umujyi wa ruhengeri ari nabwo yafunguye abitwaga ibyitso bari bafungiye kuri gereza Ruhengeri.\nMuri 1992, Werurwe leta ya Habyarimana nibwo yashinze umutwe w' abahutu babahezanguni wiswe CDR n' iyicwa y' abatutsi mu bugesera, muri Gicurasi RPA yagabye ibitero yigarurira amakomini amwe mu majyarugurun' iburasirazuba bituma abaturage benshi bava mubyabo. mumpera z' uyu mwaka abatutsi benshi barishwe ninabwo mu ugushyingo Lo Mugesera avugiye ijambo ku kabaya ashishikariza abahutu gutsemba abatutsi, ngo babanyuze muri nyabarongo basubire aho bakomoka muri Ethiopia.\nmuri 1993 muntangiriro PRA yari yamaze kwigarurira agace kaniki k' igihugu ndetse iza no gusubira inyuma kugirango bagaragaze ko ibirikubera mu Rwanda biteye inkeke, abatutsi baricwaga, inyigisho z' urwango kuri radiyo RTLM, gutoza abicanyi nk' interahamwe n' impuzamigambi, bigeze tariki ya 28 ukuboza ingabo 600 za RPA zigize batayo ya gatatu zageze muri CND i kigali muri gahunda yo kubahiriza amasezerano ya Arusha.\nmuri 1994 mata, tariki ya 6 arusha habaye inama y' akarere, muri iryo joro inde ya habyarimana irahanurwa yenda kugera ku kibuga cy' indege i kigali, tariki ya 7, hishwe uwari minisitiri w' intebe, abandi baminisitiri bataribashyigikiye umugambi wa jenoside n' abamurinda 10 bababiligi kandi Jenoside yahise itangira muri Gitarama, byumba nahandi, tarriki ya 8 PRA biyemeje gutera Kigali no guhagarika jenoside, mu nzira zitoroshye guturuka ku murindi wa byumba berekeza i kigali, kugera kuri tariki ya 30 mata RPA yari yamaze kwigarurira ibindi bice nka byumba yose ndetse n' umupaka wa rusumo, muri gicurasi ingabo za RPA zakomeje umurego kuko kuri tariki 18 barashe radiyo RTLM, tariki 22 babohoye ikibuga mpuzamaganga cy' indege cya kigali, tariki 29 babohoye umugi wa Kigali. muri kamena tariki 2, RPA yabohoye Kabyayi, tariki 28 loni itangaza umwanzuro ko mu Rwanda hari kuba Jenoside ikorerwa abatutsi, kugera muri nyakanga tariki 19 ubwo hashigwaga goverinoma y' ubumwe bw' abanyarwanda no guhagarika jenoside kumugaragaro, ibice byose by' igihugu byari byabohowe ibyanyuma byari Butare, Ruhengeri na Gisenyi.\nUmwihariko.\nAho iyi ngoro ndangamateka iherere ari naho inteko ishinga amategeko ikorera, hashyizwemo icyumba cyihariye cyo kumurikiramo ibihangano bibumbatiye aya mateka yo kubohora igihigu no guhagarika jenoside, urubyiruko rwahawe icyo \ncyumba ruhagarariwe na King Ngabo, ni abanyabugeni babyize mwishuri kandi bakora ibihangano byiza. ururubyiruko rubyaza inyungi ibihangano byarwo arinako bafasha igihugu kumenyekanisha no gusigasira amateka."}
{"id": "20240", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20240", "title": "Misiyoni Gatolika ya Zaza", "text": "Misiyoni Gatolika ya Zaza ni imwe mu za mbere zashinzwe n\u2019Abamisiyoneri b\u2019Abapadiri bera mu Rwanda, ikaba iya kabiri mu gihugu nyuma ya Misiyoni ya Save. Yashinzwe ku italiki ya 1 Ugushyingo 1900 ishingwa na Musenyeri John Joseph Hirth, mu rwego rwo kwagura ivugabutumwa rya Kiliziya Gatolika mu bice by\u2019i Gisaka byari bimaze igihe gito byigaruriwe n\u2019u Rwanda.\nAho iherereye.\nMisiyoni ya Zaza iherereye mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba, mu Karere ka Ngoma, Umurenge wa Zaza, Akagari ka Ruhembe, ku musozi wa Ruhembe mu gice cy\u2019aho, mbere hitwaga Mirenge mu Gisaka cy\u2019Igihunya. Iherereye hafi y\u2019amasangano y\u2019umuhanda munini wa Kigali\u2013Rusumo n\u2019uwerekeza mu mujyi wa Kibungo.\nAbapadiri bashinze misiyoni.\nMu batangije misiyoni ya Zaza harimo:\nMu bandi bashinze misiyoni mu minsi ya mbere harimo Padiri Brard (Terebura), Furere Anselme, na bo bombi bari barakoreye i Save mbere yo kuza i Zaza.\nAmavu n'amavuko n'inkomoko.\nAbapadiri bageze i Zaza bakirwa na Karakawe, se wa Joseph Rukamba ndetse akaba na sekuru wa Musenyeri Aloys Bigirumwami, wabaye umwepisikopi wa mbere w\u2019Umunyarwanda. Inzu yabo ya mbere yari nto, yubatswe ku musozi wa Ruhembe, ikaba yari iyo kwifashisha mu kwikinga izuba n\u2019imbeho.\nNk\u2019uko byari byarakozwe ahandi, abapadiri bakoreshaga impano nk\u2019amasaro, imyenda, umunyu, n\u2019ibindi mu rwego rwo gukurura abaturage ku idini Gatolika. Aha ni na ho Elisabeth Nyirambeba, umukirisitu wa mbere w\u2019Umunyarwandakazi, yabatirijwe mu mwaka wa 1903, nubwo yakomokaga i Save.\nAbanyarwanda ba mbere bihaye Imana.\nMisiyoni ya Zaza yabereye isoko abanyarwanda ba mbere mu nzira yo kwiha Imana, muri abo banyarwanda harimo:"}
{"id": "20241", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20241", "title": "Isoko rya Rukira", "text": "Isoko ry\u2019i Rukira riherereye mu Murenge wa Murama, Akagari ka Kigabiro, Umudugudu wa Kigabiro, mu Karere ka Ngoma, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba. Mu mateka, iri soko ryakorerwagamo ubucuruzi bw\u2019abantu, cyane cyane abacakara babaga bafashwe bunyago cyangwa bashinjwaga ubugizi bwa nabi, rikaba ryarabayeho mu mpera z\u2019ikinyejana cya 19.\nUbucuruzi bw'abacakara muri Rukira.\nAhagana mu myaka ya 1890, mu gice cyari kizwi nka Gisaka Migongo, hari ibikorwa by\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019abantu byakozwe n\u2019Abarabu n\u2019Abaswayire. Abashimusi bafataga abasore n\u2019inkumi bo mu bihugu bituranye n\u2019u Rwanda cyangwa Abanyarwanda bashinjwaga ubugizi bwa nabi, bakabajyana kubagurisha ahitwa i Gisundwe muri Tanzaniya.\nUruhare rw\u2019abaturage n\u2019abatware b\u2019Abanyarwanda.\nNubwo abacuruzi b\u2019abanyamahanga bagerageje gukora ubucuruzi bw\u2019abantu mu Rwanda, biragoye kuvuga ko byari byemewe. Abarabu bari bafite ingabo zigera kuri 500 bagerageje kwinjira mu Rwanda gushaka abacakara, ariko Abanyarwanda babasubije inyuma bakoresheje imyambi n\u2019intwaro gakondo. Ibi bigaragaza ko ubutegetsi bwa cyami, cyane cyane ubwo ku ngoma y'Umwami Kigeri IV Rwabugiri, butigeze bushyigikira ubucuruzi bw\u2019abacakara.\nIhagarikwa ry\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019abantu.\nUbucuruzi bw\u2019abantu muri ako gace bivugwa ko bwacitse mu mizo y\u2019ingoma ya Yuhi V Musinga. Icyo gihe, abari basigaye bafite abacakara babahinduye abaja bo mu ngo, kugeza igihe basaziye cyangwa bakiriwe nk\u2019abaturage basanzwe.\nAho isoko ryahoze n\u2019ibimenyetso bisigaye.\nAho isoko rya Rukira ryari riri, ubu hubatse ibiro by\u2019Umurenge wa Murama, biherereye nko muri metero 500 uvuye kuri Paruwasi Gatorika ya Rukira. Hegereye kandi ibiro by\u2019Akagari ka Kigabiro hamwe nindi nzu yubatswe mu gihe cy\u2019ubukoloni, yakorerwagamo n\u2019umudiyakoni w\u2019Umubiligi wayoboraga ako karere mu myaka ya za 1940."}
{"id": "20242", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20242", "title": "Urwobo rwa Bayanga", "text": "Urwobo rwa Bayanga, cyangwa ahazwi nko Mu Rwabayanga, ni ahantu hari urwobo ruherereye mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba, Akarere ka Bugesera, Umurenge wa Mayange. Ni urwobo ruri hagati mu ishyamba riri mu gice cy\u2019ahitwa Gako, hafi y\u2019umupaka w\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019u Burundi. Mu Rwabayanga hafite amateka maremare, ajyanye n'imico, imyumvire n'amateka y\u2019u Rwanda kuva kera kugeza igihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.,,\nAmateka n\u2019inkomoko y\u2019izina.\nHari impaka zishingiye ku nkomoko y\u2019uru rwobo ndetse no ku muntu witwaga Bayanga aho bivugwa ko yarwubatse cyangwa yaruguyemo. Bamwe bavuga ko Bayanga yari umugaragu w'umwami Kigeri IV Rwabugiri wafukuye iriba riri imbere mu nzu ye mu gihe hariho izuba rikabije, maze bituma abona amazi ku giti cye(wenyine) maze bikabangamira ibwami. ibyo byaje gutuma afatwa nk\u2019umugome, aratoroka ajyana n\u2019amatungo ye, azimira muri rwa rwobo arurohamamo. Abandi bavuga ko yari umutasi waturutse i Burundi ku ngoma ya Yuhi III Mazimpaka, aho yategetswe gucukura umwobo kugeza abonye igihugu cye. Hari n\u2019abavuga ko yari nyirarume wa Nsoro w\u2019i Bugesera, akicwa azira gucika na inka.,\nUmumaro n\u2019uruhare mu muco.\nUrwo rwobo rwahuriragamo imyumvire myinshi y\u2019imigenzo gakondo. Rwavugwagaho kuba rurerure cyane ku buryo ruhinguka mu kiyaga cya Rweru cyangwa mu Cyohoha. Hari n\u2019abavugaga ko harimo inzoka nini y\u2019uruziramire, ndetse hakabamo n\u2019amajanja y\u2019imbwa za Ruganzu II Ndori.\nUrwobo rwa Bayanga ryifashishwaga nk\u2019igihano gikomeye, aho abarwanyaga ubutegetsi cyangwa abakekwagaho imyitwarire mibi barohwaga. Mu mateka, hari abakobwa batwaye inda z\u2019indaro ndetse n\u2019abakekwagaho imyitwarire idakwiriye bo mu muryango w\u2019ibikomangoma barohwagamo. Abayobozi nka Rwampembwe, Nyombayire, Baryinyonza Burabyo n\u2019abandi baroshwemo nk\u2019igihano cy\u2019ubugome cyangwa kwigomeka.,"}
{"id": "20243", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20243", "title": "Imisezero y\u2019Abami b' u Rwanda", "text": "Imisezero ni ahantu hatabarizwaga (hashyingurwaga) abami n' Abagabekazi b' u Rwanda, mu Rwanda Abami n' abagabekazi bagiye batabarizwa ahantu hatandukanye mu gihugu ariko habayeho imisezero rusange, urugero n' umusezero w' Abami w' i rutare ho mu murenge wa rutare mu karere ka Gicumbi kuri ubu. Aha i Rutare hatabarijwe Abami 11 n' Abagabekazi 2, kugeza ubu imisezero (Imva) zikigaragara ni 2 iy' umwami Kigeli IV Rwabugiri yatwaye u rwanda kuva muri 1853 _ 1895 nuwa Nyirayuhi V kanjogera, ahandi ntabimenyetso bigaragara ko hari imisezero kuko n' abaturage bahakoresha mumirimo yabo isanzwe yaburi munsi. "}
{"id": "20244", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20244", "title": "Umusozi Speke", "text": "Umusozi Speke uri muri parike yigihugu ya Ruwenzori muri Uganda kandi niwo musozi wa kabiri muremure Hamwe n'umusozi Stanley n'umusozi wa Baker, ikora inyabutatu ikikije ikibaya cyo hejuru cya Bujuku. Impinga yegereye ni umusozi wa Stanley,ufite ubuso bwa 3.55\u00a0km (2.21\u00a0mi) mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba. \nImiterere.\nImisozi yose muriki cyiciro igizwe nimpinga nyinshi. Mount Speke ni Vittorio Emanuele 4,890\u00a0m (16.040\u00a0ft) ; Ensonga ifite ubuso bwa 4,865\u00a0m (15,961)\u00a0ft) ; Johnston 4,834\u00a0m (15.860\u00a0ft) ; na Trident 4,572\u00a0m (15.000)\u00a0ft). Amazina yatoranijwe yubaha umuryango wibwami wUbutaliyani; icyakora, guhitamo izina byagombaga kwemezwa na Protectorate y'Ubwongereza na Uganda wayoboraga ako karere muri kiriya gihe."}
{"id": "20245", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20245", "title": "Umusozi wa Moroto", "text": "Umusozi wa Moroto, ufite ubuso bwa (), ni umusozi uri mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Uganda. \nIzina kavukire ryuyu musozi ryari \"Moru To\" (bisobanura \"umusozi wiburengerazuba\", rikomoka ku magambo \"Moru\" risobanura umusozi na \"Kuri\" bisobanura iburengerazuba). wiswe gutya kuko mugihe cyo kwimuka kwimiryango kavukire, yakomokaga muri Etiyopiya, yagaragaye mu burengerazuba.\nAho biherereye.\nUyu musozi kandi wegeranye n'umujyi wa Moroto mu Karere ka Moroto, Karamoja, Intara y'Amajyaruguru ya Uganda. Nibirometero 3(3km), kumuhanda, iburasirazuba bwa Moroto akarere k'ubucuruzi hagati. Umusozi wa Moroto ni umwe mu ruhererekane rw'ibirunga ku mupaka mpuzamahanga wa Uganda na Kenya utangirira ku musozi wa Elgon mu majyepfo ukaba urimo umusozi wa Kadam n'umusozi wa Morungole. Agace gakikije umusozi wa Moroto ni ishyamba ry\u2019amashyamba ririnda ahantu hatandukanye kuva savanna yamahwa yumye kugeza ishyamba ryumye. \nKuzamuka umusozi.\nIbidukikije bikikije umusozi wa Moroto bipima kandi bikubiyemo amoko arenga 220 y\u2019inyoni, inkende ninjangwe. Inzira zo kuzamuka zirahari kandi n'abantu abayobora imisozi barahari. \nGuhinga no kuhira.\nAmasoko karemano k'umusozi wa coesce kugirango ube amasoko ninzuzi nto Gahunda y'ibiribwa ku isi. yigisha abaturage ba Karimajong uburyo bwo gusarura no kubika ayo mazi no kuyakoresha mu kuhira umusaruro w'ubuhinzi mu biribwa byo mu rugo no kwinjiza amafaranga."}
{"id": "20246", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20246", "title": "Dr. Justin Nsengiyumva", "text": "= Dr. Justin NSENGIYUMVA =\nDr. Justin NSENGIYUMVA, yari asanzwe ari visi guverineri wa bank nkuru y' igihugu kuva muri gashantare 2025, kuwa 23 nyakanga 2025 yagizwe minisitiri w' intebe na nyakubahwa perezida wa repubulika t' u Rwanda paul KAGAME, asimbuye Dr. Eduard NGIRENTE wari muri uwo mwanya kuva muri 2017.\nAmateka.\nMinisitiri w' Intebe mushya Dr. Justin NSENGIYUMVA afite inararibonye mu bukungu na politiki y' u Rwanda ndetse namahanga kuko yize anabona impamyabumenyi zinyuranye muri za kaminuza zikomeye ndetse anakora imirimo itandukanye mu gihugu no mu mahanga yerekeye ubukungu na politiki.\nAmashuri yize.\nDr. Justin NSENGIYUMVA yize muri catholic university of eastern Africa ahakura impamyabumenyi y' icyiciro cya kabiri mu bucuruzi, yahise yerekeza muri kaminuza ta nairobi naho ahakura icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu ngamba z' ubukungu n' imicungire yabwo, muri 2011 kugeza 2015 yize ze muri kaminuza ya Liecester ahakura Impamyabushobozi y' ikirenga mu bukungo.\nImirimo yakoze.\nDr. Justin NSENGIYUMVA yakoze imirimo myinshi inyuranye yerekeranye n' ubukungu n' ingamba zabwo, ubucuruzi n' uburezi haba imbere mu gihugu no mu mahanga."}
{"id": "20247", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20247", "title": "Mpazi Rehousing Project", "text": "= Mpazi Model Village =\nUmushinga wa Mpazi wo kuvugurura imiturire y' abaturage batuye ahazwi nko mu gitega ku mugezi wa Mpazi, aha abahatuye bari mubyago bikabije byo guhura n' ibiza kuko uwa mugezi wajyaga uhura n' amazi ya ruhuru yo mu mujyi amazi akuzura agateza ibibazo kuko yigeze gutwara ubuzima bw' abantu. \nIbyo wamenya kuri Mazi Model Village.\nUmushinga w' imiturire ivuguruye wa Mpazi ni umwe mu mishinga itandukanye y' umugi wa Kigali yo kuvugurura imiturire mu mujyi cyane cyane mu duce dufite imiturire y' akajagari kandi ishyira umuzima bw' abaturage mu byago, uyu mushinga watangiye muri 2021 mu gice cy' igerageza aho hubatswe inzu eshanu za G+2 (Zigeretse kabiri) nyuma yiri gerageza Guverinoma y' u Rwanda binyuze mu mugi wa Kigali na minisiteri y' ingabo, bakomeje uyu mushinga bawita Mpazi rehousing project aho bari kubaka umudugudu w' amazu ageretse gatatu (G+3), uyu mudugudu biteganyijwe ko uzatuzwamo abasaga 688, harimo imihanda, ubusitani n' amazi meza. \nGasabo 3D companyi ishinzwe ubugenzuzi muri uyu mushinga ivugako imirimo yo kubaka uyu mudugudu biteganyijwe ko izarangizwa muri kamena 2025. \nIndi mishinga yo kuvugurura imiturire muri kigali.\nUmugi wa Kigali ufite gahunda yo kunoza imiturire y' abatuye kigali, nyuma yo gushyira mubikorwa uyu mushinga wa mpazi Model Village ubari indi mishinga muri Kigali izasiga abanyakigali batuye neza kandi batekanye."}
{"id": "20248", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20248", "title": "Nyabisindu Rehousing Project", "text": "= Nyabisindu Model Village =\nUmugi wa Kigali ukomeje kuvugurura imiturire y' abawutuye, mu karere ka Gasabo mu murenge wa Remera ahazwi nka Nyabisindu hatangiye kubakwa imidugudu y' icyitegererezo mu mushinga wa leta y' u Rwanda uzwi nka Kigali formal settlement mugice cyawo cya Nyabisindu Rehousing Project, aho biteganijwe ko abarenga 1600 bazatuzwa muri iyi midugudu. \nImiterere.\nNyabisindu Model Village watangiye muri Mata 2025 biteganyijwe ko mu mwaka umwe uzaba wageze kumusozo, uzaba wubatse kuri hegitari zirenga 38, ugizwe n' imidugudu 4 ndetse nundi uzongerwaho nyuma, amashuri, isiko, ubusitani bugezweho n' imihanda yakijyambere. \nUbuyobozi bw' umugi wa Kigali buvuga ko imishinga nkiyi izakomeza gukorwa ahantu hatandukanye mu mugi murwego rwo rwoguhangana n' ikibazo cy' imiturire kandi no kunoza itunganyirize y' umugi, byagarutsweho na meya w' umugi wa Kigali Samuel DUSENGIYUMVA mu gutangiza uyu mushinga. "}
{"id": "20249", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20249", "title": "Dr. Bernadette Arakwiye", "text": "Minisiteri y' Ibidukikije yabonye Minisitiri mushya kuga kuwa 24 nyakanga ubwo Nyakubahwa perezida wa repubulika y' u Rwanda Paul KAGAME ubwo yashyiragaho guverinoma nshya, Dr. Bernadette Arakwiye yasimbuye Dr. Uwamariya Valentine wayoboraga iyi minisiteri kugeza ubu. \nAmateka.\nminisitiri w' ibidukikije Dr. bernadette Arakwiye ni umunyarwandakazi wize kurwego ruhanitse mu mashuri atandukanye yo mu Rwanda no mumahanga nko mu bwongereza na Amerika, kandi yanakoze imirimo inyuranye y' ubushakashatsi mu bigo mpuza mahanga bikora ibyerekeye ibidukikije n' ubumenyi bw' isi.\nAmashuri yize.\nDr. bernadette Arakwiye yize muri kaminuza nkuru y' u Rwanda ahakura impamyabumenyi y' icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu binyabuzima, yongeye kubona impamyabumenyi y' icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu bidukikije muri kaminuza ya Antiock University New England kandi nanone yabonye impamyabushozi y' ikirenya mu bumenyi bw' isi ayikuye muri kaminuza ya Clark university muri Massachusetts, Amerika. \nImirimo yakoze.\nDr. bernadette Arakwiye mbere yo kuba minisitiri w' ibidukikije muri Guverinoma y' u Rwanda yari umuyobozi mukuru wa World resources Institute (WRI) ayoboye porogaramu ya Land restoration kuri afrika, kandi yanabaye umuyobozi w' inama y' ubutegetsi yarishinzwe kwiga kuri porogaramu yo kubungabunga ubutaka muri Afrika, ariko mbere yaho yari umushakashatsi ari research associate mukigo cya conservation international muri amerika, ndetse yanabaye research assistant mukigo cya Dian fossey gorilla funds international mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "20250", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20250", "title": "Umubari", "text": "Umubari ni agace gaherereye mu ntara y'Uburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda, kari mu gice cy\u2019icyanya cy\u2019Akagera (parike y'Akagera). Amateka y\u2019iki gice yerekana ko hari hasanzwe hatuwe n\u2019igihugu cyigenga cyayoborwaga n\u2019Umwami Biyoro n\u2019umugabekazi Nyirabiyoro. U Rwanda rwaje kwigarurira agace k'Umubari ku ngoma y'umwami Kigeri III Ndabarasa, nyuma y\u2019aho se Cyirima II Rujugira yari yohereje umuhungu we kuhigarurira. Nyuma y\u2019icyo gikorwa, Umubari wagiye ucengera buhoro buhoro mu Rwanda, n\u2019ubwo wakomeje kugira ubwigenge kugeza mu ntangiriro z\u2019ikinyejana cya 20, nyuma y\u2019Intambara ya Mbere y\u2019Isi Yose.\nAmateka.\nKu ngoma y'umwami Kigeli III Ndabarasa, Umubari wigaruriwe n\u2019ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda zari ziyobowe na Kamari ka Gahurira. Hari ibitekerezo bitandukanye bivuga ko Kigeli III Ndabarasa ashobora kuba yarigaruriye Umubari akiri igikomangoma, ibindi nabyo bikavuga ko ashobora kuba yarawigruriye amaze kuba umwami. Nyuma y\u2019ifatwa ry\u2019Umubari abaturage baho batangiye kwimuka, u Rwanda ruragenda rwibagirwa Umubari kugeza igihe cy\u2019ubukoloni.\nIbitekerezo nyemvugo bivugwa ku Mubari.\nIbimanuka.\nMu myemerere y\u2019Abanyarwanda, bivugwa ko Gihanga Ngomijana, wahanze u Rwanda, akomoka ku bimanuka byamanutse mu ijuru bigwa mu Mubari. Ibyo bimanuka ni Sabizeze (Kigwa), Mututsi, na Nyampundu. Bitwa ibimanuka kuko bakomotse ku Mana y\u2019ijuru (Nkuba). Bivugwa ko mu gihe ibimanuka byamanukaga aribyo byazanye amatungo, imbuto, n\u2019imyuga ine yahoze ari ingenzi mu Rwanda ariyo ububaji, ubucuzi, ubukannyi, n'ubuhigi, bityo Umubari ukitwa inkomoko y\u2019umuco n\u2019ubwami bw\u2019u Rwanda.\nNyirabiyoro.\nNyirabiyoro yari umugabekazi wo mu Mubari. Amateka ye akunze gushingirwaho mu buhanuzi n\u2019amateka y\u2019ingoma ya Kigeri III Ndabarasa. Nyirabiyoro yahunze ubwo ingabo za Ndabarasa zafataga Umubari, nyuma akaza gufatirwa aho yari yarahungiye i Karagwe agasubizwa i Rwanda aho yishwe n\u2019Ingabo za Ndabarasa. Azwi cyane mu mateka y\u2019ubuhanuzi yagiye ahanura ku Rwanda ibikunze kwitwa indagu za Nyirabiyoro.\nNyirarucyaba.\nNyirarucyaba yari umukobwa wa Gihanga. Yamenyekanye mu mateka y\u2019imiryango migari y\u2019ubwami bw\u2019u Rwanda, by\u2019umwihariko mu kwitirirwa inkomoko y\u2019ubwoko bw'Abacyaba. Inkuru ye ivuga uburyo yishe mukase (Nyirampirangwe) akamumena inda yari atwite, maze agahunga akajya gutura mu Mubari, aho yabyaye abana maze batandukanwa ku nkomoko ya se maze bitirirwa nyina haba havutse ubwoko bw'Abacyaba."}
{"id": "20251", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20251", "title": "Ku Cyarudahigwa", "text": "Ku Cyarudahigwa ni ahahoze icyiraro cy\u2019inka z\u2019umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa, giherereye mu Murenge wa Nyagatare, Akarere ka Nyagatare, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba. Iki cyiraro cyahoze cyubatse ku musozi wa Nsheke, kuri ubu hakaba hubatse ibiro by\u2019Akagari ka Nsheke, kandi ni ho ibi biro byubatse muri iki kibanza. Iki kiraro cyarashenywe mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, ariko ibisigaratongo byacyo birimo ibikuta n\u2019ibyuma byari bifashe igisenge biracyari aho cyari cyubatse.\nInkomoko y\u2019icyiraro.\nNyuma yo kwima ingoma, Umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa yagaragaje ubushake bwo guteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019Abanyarwanda, ariko imigambi ye yagiye ikomwa mu nkokora n\u2019ubutegetsi bwa gikoloni bwariho icyo gihe. Kuva mu 1946, cyane cyane nyuma ya 1950, yatangiye gushyira mu bikorwa gahunda ziganisha ku iterambere ry'ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi bwa kijyambere.\nMu rwego rwo kugabanya ubukana bw\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019ubutaka cyaterwaga n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019abaturage, Umwami yashishikarije abaturage korora inka nkeya zitanga umukamo mwinshi, aho kuba nyinshi zidatanga umusaruro.\nInyambo n\u2019inzuri z\u2019Umwami mu Mutara.\nMu mwaka wa 1949, Umwami Rudahigwa yategetse ko inyambo zivanwa mu nzuri zitandukanye maze zikimurirwa mu gice cy\u2019Umutara, kuko ari ho hari hasigaye inzuri nini. Izo nyambo zaturutse mu nzuri nka Inyangamutsindo, Ingaju, Urugaga, Ingirikirwa, Ingeri, n\u2019izindi. Mu Mutara, zaragirwaga ahitwa Nsheke, Barija, Gasinga, ndetse na Kabare.\nIbyihariye by\u2019ikiraro cy'i Nsheke.\nMu kiraro cy'i Nsheke, Umwami Rudahigwa yashyizeyo ibikoresho byose byifashishwa mu bworozi bwa kijyambere, harimo:\nAbashumba bazwi bari barimo: Kabagema, Bigaba, na Ruhanamirindi. Amata y\u2019inka z\u2019umwami, kimwe n\u2019ayo abandi borozi bajyaga kugurisha, yakusanyirizwaga ku ikaragiro rya Nyagatare rizwi nko Ku Ilitiro, aho yatunganywaga agacuruzwa ari inshyushyu, ikivuguto, cyangwa amavuta.\nUmushinga w\u2019imiturire n\u2019ubworozi bwa kijyambere.\nRudahigwa yatangije imishinga igamije gutuza abaturage neza no kubafasha korora neza. Muri iyo gahunda:\nUmwami ubwe yubatse ibiraro bye bwite:"}
{"id": "20252", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20252", "title": "Ibigabiro bya Rwamagana", "text": "Ibigabiro bya Rwabugiri ni ahantu ndangamateka hahoze urugo rw\u2019Umwami Kigeri IV Rwabugiri, kuri ubu ni mu Mudugudu wa Bigabiro, Akagari ka Cyanya, Umurenge wa Kigabiro, mu Karere ka Rwamagana, Intara y\u2019Uburasirazuba. Ibyo bigabiro biri ahazwi n\u2019ubu nko mu Bigabiro.\nInkomoko y\u2019izina \u201cIbigabiro\u201d.\nMu muco nyarwanda, aho umwami yabaga atuye (urugo rw\u2019umwami) hakundaga guterwa ibiti nk\u2019imivumu n\u2019ibihondohondo, bikaba ikimenyetso cy\u2019uko hahoze urugo rw'umwami. Iyo umwami yatabarizwaga ahantu, aho hantu hitwaga umusezero, naho hagaterwa ibiti byitwaga ibigabiro. Icyo gikorwa cyari igice cy\u2019umuco wo guha icyubahiro aho hantu no kukibungabunga.\nUrugo rwa Rwabugiri i Rwamagana.\nUmwami Kigeri IV Rwabugiri yagize urugo mu Buganza, mu gace ka Rwamagana, ahahoze ari mu Gisaka mbere y\u2019uko hashyirwa ku Rwanda mu kinyejana cya 18. Aho urugo rwe rwari rwubatse niho haturuka izina mu Bigabiro.\nUrugo rwa Rwabugiri rwari rufite ibigabiro byinshi kandi binini, ariko byaje gutemwa nyuma y\u2019Intambara ya Mbere y\u2019Isi Yose, ubwo abapadiri bubakaga Misiyoni ya Rwamagana. Icyo gihe, Rwabutogo rwa Kabare ka Rwakagara, wari umutware wategekaga u Buganza bw\u2019epfo, ni we wafashije abapadiri kubona imbaho,aho yasabye uburenganzira Umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa ngo atemeshe ibigabiro bya Rwabugiri."}
{"id": "20253", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20253", "title": "Parike ya Kakum", "text": "Parike ya Kakum, iherereye mu nkengero z\u2019akarere ko hageti Muri Gana, ifite ubuso bwa.Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1931 nk'ikigega, yashyizwe mu kinyamakuru nka parike y'igihugu gusa mu 1992 nyuma y'ubushakashatsi bwa mbere kuri avifauna. Agace karimo amashyamba yo mu turere dushyuha. [Ni hamwe mu hantu 3 gusa muri Afurika hamwe n'inzira nyabagerwa, ifite \nAmateka ya pariki ya kakum.\nMu 1931, agace kavomwe n\u2019amazi y\u2019amazi y'umugenzi wa kakum yatangajwe ko ari amashyamba kandi acungwa n\u2019ishami ry\u2019amashyamba. Muri gihe, ibikorwa byo gutema ibiti byari byiganje, cyane cyane mu bwoko bw\u2019ibiti bya mahogany. Ibikorwa byo gutema ibiti byakomeje kugeza mu 1989 igihe ubuyobozi bw\u2019ikigega bwimurirwa mu ishami ry\u2019ibinyabuzima. \nInyigo ishoboka na gahunda ibanza yimyaka 5 yo gucunga iterambere rya parike yigihugu ya Kakum nkahantu nyaburanga hashyizweho mu mwaka mu 1990 hashyizweho umushinga wakozwe na gahunda y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe iterambere (Dudley 1990). Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe bwarimo isuzuma ry\u2019ibinyabuzima bitandukanye by\u2019ibimera n\u2019ibinyabuzima byo mu ishyamba rya Kakum hamwe n\u2019ishyamba rya Assin-Attandanso, hamwe n\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019abaturage ndetse n'inzovu (Dudley 1990; Dudley, Mensah-Ntiamoah, &amp; Kpelle 1992; Dudley 1995). Gahunda yo Kwiga no Kubanziriza Imyaka 5 Yateguwe yateguwe muburyo bwo gufatanya no gutanga inama zirimo umujyanama w\u2019ibinyabuzima, abashinzwe amashyamba, abashinzwe inyamanswa, abaturage baho, kaminuza zo muri Gana, abayobozi ba leta mu karere, n\u2019abandi bafatanyabikorwa bakomeye (Dudley 1992)."}
{"id": "20254", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20254", "title": "Aburi Botanical Gardens", "text": "Ubusitani bwa Aburi Botanical nubusitani muri Abari mukarere k'iburasirazuba bwa Gana.\nUyu munsi, mu kinyejana cya 21, umuntu ntashobora kuvuga ibijyanye n'ubuhinzi bw'imboga muri Gana no muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba atavuze ku busitani bwa Aburi Botanical. Ubusitani bufite ubuso bwa hegitari 64.8. Yafunguwe muri kandi yashinzwe na guverineri William Brandford Griffith na Dr. John Farrell Easmon, umuganga w'ubuvuzi wa siyera Lewone Mbere yuko ubusitani bushingwa, niho hari sanatori yubatswe mu 1875 ku bayobozi ba leta ya Gold Coast. Ku butegetsi bwa William Branford Griffith, umumisiyoneri wa basel na Moroviya wo muri Jamayika, Alexandre Worth clerk bagenzuye isaranganya ry\u2019ubutaka bukikije sanatori kugira ngo batangire ishami ry\u2019ibimera. Mu 1890, William Crowther, umunyeshuri wo muri Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew, yagizwe umuyobozi wa mbere w\u2019ubusitani. Ubusitani bwagize uruhare runini mu gushishikariza umusaruro wa kakao muri Gana yepfo, utanga ingemwe za kakao zihenze namakuru ajyanye guhinga siyanse. \"Hevea brasiliensis\" imaze koherezwa i Aburi kuva Kew mu 1893, ubusitani nabwo bwashishikarizaga umusaruro wa rubber muri Gana.\nUbwoko bw'ibiti buboneka mu Busikani bwa Botanical.\numuntu ashobora gusangamo ubwoko bw'inshi bw'ibitu nka pamba y'ubudodo (ceiba pentandra) mahogany Imyerezi, igiti cya silver, n'ibindi byinshi, urebye uko imitetere y'imisozi ifite amoko atandukanye y'ibiti byo muturere dushyuha hamwe n'ubusitani bw'ibimera mumujyi,cyane cyane ubusitani buzwi ku izina Aburi Botanical Gardens, wabaye indiri yaba mukerarugendo 'abanyamahanga ndetse n'abenegihugu"}
{"id": "20255", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20255", "title": "Kumasi", "text": "Kumasi n'umurwa mukuru w'Inteko ya kumasi Metropolitan n'akarere ka Ashanti muri Gana.:\u200a1,\u200a3\u200aNumujyi wa kabiri munini mu gihugu, \u200aifite abaturage 443.981 guhera mu ibarura rya 2021. umusozi wa Kumasi uherereye mu karere k\u2019ishyamba ryimvura hafi yikiyaga cya Bosomtwe:\u200a2\u200akandi iherereye nko mu kuva i Accra. Umujyi uhura N'ikirere gishyuha cya savanna, hamwe n'ibihe bibiri by'imvura bigenda bitandukana bito. Amoko menshi atuye Kumasi ni Asante Mole dagbon na Ewe. \nKumasi ni ihuriro ry\u2019ubucuruzi, ubukungu, n\u2019ubucuruzi muri Gana, rikaba rifite isoko rinini muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba: Isoko rya Kejetia. Umujyi niwo muco w\u2019umuco wa Asante, bityo nanone bakitwa \"Osei-Krom\" cyangwa \"Oseikrom\" gusa, hamwe no gukurura abashyitsi benshi.:\u200a9\u200aUyu mujyi kandi urimo amashyirahamwe menshi yubucuruzi, nk\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatunganya ibicuruzwa bya Aboabo Talia. Kimwe cya kabiri cyo gutunganya ibiti mu gihugu kibera mu mujyi. Ikigo cy\u2019umuco w\u2019igihugu, Ishuri ry\u2019Uburezi rya Wesley, n\u2019ibitaro byigisha Komfo Anokye byose biherereye mu mujyi. \u200a10\u200aUmujyi kandi urimo uruganda rwamafirime rugenda rwiyongera, Kumawood, rwibanda cyane cyane ku kuvuga inkuru zishingiye ku nsanganyamatsiko mu rurimi rwaho rwa Twi.\nUmuco.\nUmusozi wa Kumasi ni ihuriro ry'umuco wa Asante, uyifasha kwitwa \"Osei-Krom\" cyangwa gusa \"Oseikrom\". Kumasi azwiho kandi Imyenda gakondo,Kente, mubisanzwe bikozwe hakoreshejwe imigenzo gakondo. Niho hari isoko rinini muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba,Isoko rya kejetia, rikaba rifite amaduka arenga 10,000. imico n\u2019umuco muri uyu mujyi harimo Fort Kumasi (yubatswe mu 1896 kugirango isimbure igihome cya Asante ubu ni inzu ndangamurage) hamwe n\u2019inzu Ndangamurage ya nurom. Ibyiza bya Royal Asante birimo Ikigo cy'umuco w'igihugu,Okomfo Anokye sword, Ingoro ya Asantehene (yubatswe mu 1972), n\u2019ingoro ya Manhyia, guhera mu 1925, ubu ni inzu ndangamurage. "}
{"id": "20256", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20256", "title": "Drakensberg", "text": "Drakensberg n'igice cy'iburasirazuba bwa Escarpment nini, ikikije ikibaya cyo muri Afrika yepfo. Escarpment nini igera ku butumburuke bukomeye - mu karere gahana imbibi na Afurika yepfo na Lesotho.\nIbirindiro bya Drakensberg bifite uburebure bwa kilometelo 1000(600 miles) uvuye mu ntara ya cape y'iburasirazuba mu majyepfo, hanyuma bigenda bikurikirana, uhereye mu majyepfo ugana mu majyaruguru, umupaka uhuza Lesotho na Cape y'iburasirazuba n'umupaka uhuza Lesotho n'Intara ya KwaZulu-Natal. Nyuma yaho ikora umupaka uhuza KwaZulu-Natal na Leta yigenga, hanyuma ukurikira nk'umupaka uhuza KwaZulu-Natal n'intara ya Mpumalanga. Umuyaga uherekeza mu majyaruguru uva aho, unyuze kuri Mpumalanga, aho urimo ibintu nka Blyde River Canyon, Rondavels eshatu, na Window y'Imana. Ihita igera mu majyaruguru kugera kuri Hoedspruit mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Limpopo aho izwi ku izina rya 'Klein Drakensberg na Afrikaner. Kuva kuri Hoedspruit igera mu burengerazuba kugera Tzaneen, no mu Ntara ya Limpopo, aho izwi ku izina ry'umusozi wa wolkberg n'umusozi wa Iron Crown. Kuri hejuru y'inyanja, Wolkberg nuburebure buri hejuru ya Limpopo. Escarpment yongeye kwerekera iburengerazuba kandi kuri Mokopane izwi ku izina rya Strydpoort. \nEtymology.\nIzina ry'Abanyafurika ryitwa \"Drakensberge\" rikomoka ku izina abimukira ba mbere b'abadage bahaye abamuherekeje, ari bo \"Drakensbergen\", cyangwa \"imisozi ya Dragons\". Igice kinini cya Escarpment nini kizwi muri Zulu nka \"uKhahlamba\" na \"Maloti\" muri Sotho. \nUbumenyi bwa geologiya.\nInkomoko.\nIgice kinini cya Escarpment kigizwe nurukuta ruhanamye rwubatswe hafi y'ubutaka bw'umugabane mugihe cyo gutandukana kw'amajyepfo ya Gondwana kuva aho yangirika imbere mu gihugu kuva aho yari iherereye hafi y'inyanja ya Afrika yepfo, kandi igice cyayo cyose cy'iburasirazuba (reba ikarita iherekeje) bigize Drakensberg. Drakensberg irangirira mu majyaruguru hafi ya Tzaneen nka 22 \u00b0S parallel. Kubura Escarpment Nkuru hafi mu majyaruguru ya Tzaneen (kongera kugaragara ku mupaka uhuza Zimbabwe na Mozambike mu misozi ya Chimanimani biterwa n\u2019ishami ry\u2019iburengerazuba ryananiranye ry\u2019imvururu zikomeye zatumye Antaragitika itangira kugenda yerekeza muri Afurika yepfo mu gihe cyo gutandukana kwa Gondwana 150miliyoni ishize. Umugezi wa Limpopo wo hepfo hamwe n'umugezi wa Save utemba mu nyanja y'ubuhinde unyuze mu bisigisigi by\u2019iki kibaya cyimuwe, ubu kikaba kigizwe na Afurika yepfo Lowveld. \nMu myaka 20 ishize miliyoni, Afrika yepfo yahuye nizamuka ryinshi, cyane mu burasirazuba, bivamo ko igice kinini cyibibaya kiri hejuru. Ikibaya kigoramye ku buryo kiri hejuru cyane mu burasirazuba kandi kikamanuka gahoro ugana iburengerazuba n'amajyepfo. Mubisanzwe, ubutumburuke bw'uruhande rwiburasirazuba bwarenze. Igera ahantu hirengeye harenga aho escarpment igizwe n'umupaka mpuzamahanga uhuza Lesotho nintara ya Afrika yepfo ya KwaZulu-Natal. \nKwaZulu-Natal - Leta yubuntu Drakensberg igizwe nubutare bworoshye bityo rero ikaba ifite uruziga ruzengurutse, rworoshye kuva hepfo. Mubisanzwe, hejuru ya escarpment ni hafi kumeza-hejuru kandi yoroshye, ndetse no muri Lesotho. \"Imisozi ya Lesotho\" ikozwe kure y\u2019inyanja ya Drakensberg n\u2019imigezi y\u2019isuri ihinduka ikibaya kinini kirimo imigezi y\u2019uruzi rwa Orange. Umubare munini winzuzi utanga imisozi ya Lesotho imisozi igaragara cyane k'umusozi, haba k'ubutaka ndetse no mu kirere.\nIbice byo hejuru bya Drakensberg bifite ibidukikije byoroheje. Birashoboka ko imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere iherutse kugabanya ubukana bwa periglaciation. \nKnight na Grab bashushanyije ikwirakwizwa ry\u2019umurabyo i Drakensburg maze bavumbura ko inkuba igenzura cyane ihindagurika ry\u2019imisozi kuko ifasha mu turere tw\u2019imisozi - ahantu hirengeye - hamwe n\u2019ingaruka zo guturika. Mbere, imyanda yo mu nguni yafatwaga nk'iyakozwe n'impinduka zisanzwe zikonje, ibidukikije, nko kuvunika kubera ubukonje. \nIbigize.\nImiterere ya geologiya ya Drakensberg (urukuta rwa escarpment) iratandukanye cyane kurenza 1000km. Limpopo na Mpumalanga Drakensberg bafashwe n\u2019igice cya quartzite irwanya isuri igizwe na Transvaal Supergroup, nayo ikora Magaliesberg mu majyaruguru ashyira uburengerazuba bwa Pretoriya. Aya mabuye arenga 2000 imyaka miliyoni. Amajyepfo ya 26 \u00b0 S ibangikanye na esrakment ya Drakensberg igizwe na shale ya Ecca iri muri Karoo Supergroup, kandi imaze imyaka miriyoni 300. \nAmatsinda ya Ecca na Beaufort agizwe nubutare bwimitsi butarwanya isuri kurusha andi mabuye agize escarpment ya Drakensberg. Kubwibyo, iki gice cya escarpment ntabwo gishimishije cyane nka Mpumalanga na Lesotho irambuye ya Drakensberg. Drakensberg igizwe n\u2019umupaka w\u2019amajyaruguru y\u2019iburasirazuba n\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Lesotho, kimwe na Cape Drakensberg y\u2019iburasirazuba, igizwe n\u2019urwego runini rwa basalt (lava) rwadutse mu myaka miriyoni 180 ishize. Urwo rupapuro rushingiye ku muto mu butayu bwa Karoo Supergroup, ibuye ryumusenyi rya Clarens, ryashyizwe mu butayu, hashize imyaka miliyoni 200"}
{"id": "20259", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20259", "title": "Cederberg", "text": "Cederberg n'imisozi itangaje cyane, imisozi igera kuri kilometero 200 (200km) mu majyaruguru ya Cape town.\nImisozi ya Cederberg igera kuri 50km amajyaruguru - amajyepfo na 20km iburasirazuba - iburengerazuba. Bahana imbibi n'iburengerazuba na Sandveld, amajyaruguru n'imisozi ya Pakhuis, iburasirazuba n'amasoko ya Springbok n'amajyepfo n'imisozi ya Kouebokkeveld na Skurweberge. Umuhanda munini winjira,N7, ugana iburengerazuba bwurwego. Imijyi yegeranye ni Citrusdal mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba na Clanwilliam mu majyaruguru. Agace gatuwe cyane.\nHariho imisozi myinshi izwi muriyo harimo Sneeuberg (2026m) na Tafelberg (1969m). Tafelberg (Afrikaans ya \"Umusozi wameza\") ntigomba kwitiranywa n'umusozi w'ameza muri Cape Town. Ahantu nyaburanga hagaragara harimo umusaraba wa Maltese, Wolfberg Arch na Wolfberg Cracks.\nIkiranga ako gace gisobanuwe neza n'amabuye y'umucanga, akenshi ritukura mu mabara. Iri tsinda ryibitare ririmo imirongo ya shale kandi mu myaka yashize havumbuwe ibintu bike by,ingenzi byavumbuwe muri ibyo byiciro. Ibisigazwa by\u2019ibinyabuzima ni amafi ya mbere kandi byatangiye kuva miliyoni 450 kuva mugihe cya Ordovic. \nIbimera n'ibinyabuzima.\nIbimera byiganjemo ni Mediterranean fynbos mu bishanga byo mu majyepfo no mu burengerazuba, bigahinduka igice cy\u2019ubutayu mu majyaruguru no mu burasirazuba.imyerezi ya Clanwilliam iri mu kaga(\"Widdringtonia wallichii\") yo mu muryango Cupressaceae hamwe na protea ya shelegi(\"Protea cryophila\") ya Proteaceae yanduye muri kariya gace, iboneka gusa mu turere twa kure cyane hejuru y\u2019imisozi.\nInyamanswa zo muri ako gace ni feids ingwe (\"Panthera pardus\") na caracal(\"Caracal caracal\"). Izindi nyamabere zirimo hyrax (\"Procavia capensis\") cyangwa \"dassie\", meerkats (\"Suricata suricatta\") n'izindi mongoose(Herpestidae), antelopes nini\"(urugero\":bontebok Damaliscus \"pygargus dorcas\" na gemsbok \"Oryx\" \"gazella\") Hariho kandi inyoni nyinshi, inyamaswa z\u2019inyamabere nto, ibikururuka hasi n'udukoko.\nAndi moko yugarijwe aboneka mu gace k'ubutayu bwa Cederberg harimo cyprinide Clanwilliam y'umuhondo (\"Labeobarbus capensis\", abatishoboye), Clanwiliam redfin(\"Barbus calidus\",abatishoboye) na sawfin (\"Barbus serra\", iri mu kaga).\nIbikorwa byabantu.\nAmateka.\nMu buvumo no hejuru y\u2019akarere kose, ibihangano bya San rock birashobora kuboneka, gihamya y'abantu ba mbere b'abantu. Gutura mu Burayi byazanye amashyamba n\u2019ubuhinzi bumwe na bumwe, bituma hasenywa cyane ibiti by'amasederi byaho, ibihumbi n'ibihumbi bitemwa ku nkingi za telefone, ibikoresho byo mu nzu ndetse n'amazu. Kugera kwi Burayi kwanatumye abaturage ba San bakurwaho. Mu majyaruguru,sitasiyo ya kera ya Moraviya ya Wupperthal iracyahari, umutima w\u2019umuryango muto uhinga, kandi ubamo inganda zaho zitanga \"veldskoene\", inkweto gakondo zoroshye.\nBirashoboka ko Cederberg yari ikibuga cy'amajyepfo cy'intambara ya kabiri ya Boer. Itsinda rito ry'inyeshyamba za Boer ryinjiye muri kariya gace kuva muri repubulika ya Boer, mu bilometero amagana ugana mu majyaruguru, bizeye ko bazatera inkunga abaturage benshi mu bahinzi baho bakomoka mu Buholandi. Muri ibyo barananiwe; abahinzi bashobora kuba badafite impuhwe nke zo kubongereza ariko bari bafite imyumvire iboneye n'inde uzatsinda intambara. Bavuga ko abakomando ba Boer bahuye na Cederberg n'umwongereza wenyine, abategeka kwiyegurira. Baramusetse, kuko yari umwe kandi bari benshi kandi bagerageza kumutekerezaho, berekana ibyiringiro by'umwanya we. Yanze gusubira inyuma arangije arashwe. Aho yaguye ubu yitwa \"Engelsmanskloof\" (\"Ikibaya cy'umwongereza\").\nUbuhinzi.\nUbutaka bwo guhinga bugarukira ku butumburuke, ikirere cyumutse, hamwe n'ubutaka bw'amabuye, kandi imirima mike irahari. Icyayi cya Rooibos nicyo gihugu kizwi cyane cyoherezwa mu mahanga, nubwo imbuto n'itabi nabyo bisarurwa mu mirima imwe n'imwe. Agace ka Cederberg karimo divayi imwe, hejuru muri Afrika yepfo. Hafi yakarere ka Wupperthal hari imirima myinshi itunzwe. Ibihingwa bimwe na bimwe by'ubucuruzi biguma hafi ya sitasiyo y\u2019amashyamba ya Alijeriya. Proteas n'ibindi bimera bya fynbos nabyo birahingwa. Imirima itari mike yahindutse abashyitsi benshi bigaburira isoko ry'ubukerarugendo bwaho ndetse n\u2019amahanga.\nUbukerarugendo.\nNka gace k'ubutayu, ibikorwa byibanze ni ubukerarugendo bushingiye ku bidukikije, harimo gukambika,kuzamuka urutare no gutembera. Inkambi nkuru, Alijeriya, ikorwa na CapeNature, mu gihe izindi nka Sanddrif, Driehoek, Jamaka na Kromrivier zikorera ku giti cyabo kandi zigashinga Cedarberg Conservancy, ishyirahamwe ku bushake bwa ba nyir'ubutaka. \nCederberg izwi cyane kubera ubwiza bw'inzira zo kuzamuka ku rutare cyane cyane izengurutse impinga ya Krakadouw na Tafelberg. Imeza Umusozi Sandstone ikora ibintu byiza byinzira zidasanzwe. Hariho urugendo rwinshi n'ijoro harimo ibyamamare kandi bitangaje bya Wolfberg Arch, Wolfberg Cracks na Maltese Cross.\nAka gace kandi karimo indorerezi y\u2019inyenyeri yikunda, ikunze kwakira n'imugoroba ifunguye k'ubantu rusange. \nHariho inzira zitandukanye 4x4.\nAgace kanini ko mu majyaruguru ya Cederberg gafite Itorero rya Moraviya. Umudugudu wuzuye wa Wuperthal ugizwe n'inzira ya misiyoni itanga abashyitsi uburyo bushimishije bw'ubuzima bwo mu cyaro. Umudugudu kandi n'ikigo kizwi cyane cyakozwe n'intoki zikozwe mu ruhu n'inkweto. Imwe muri \"buite stasies\" (bisobanurwa mu buryo butaziguye nka sitasiyo yo hanze) ni Heuningvlei, agace gato keza cyane kari mu nzira yo gutunganya inzira y'amagare y'indogobe kuva mu mpinga ya Pakhuis Pass kugera mu mudugudu. Uyu mushinga wo kurwanya ubukene uterwa inkunga n\u2019ishami rishinzwe ibidukikije n\u2019ubukerarugendo, urimo gushiraho amacumbi y\u2019ibikapu, ubusitani bw\u2019ibimera n\u2019andi masoko atandukanye y\u2019ubukerarugendo. "}
{"id": "20260", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20260", "title": "Iterambere ry'abari n'abategarugori mu Rwanda", "text": "Mu myaka yo hambere mbere yuko abazungu baza mu Rwanda(mu kinyejana cya 19) sosiyete y'U Rwanda yari ishingiye ku muryango wa patriarkiya(ugenderaho ku butware bw'abagabo) aho Abagore bafatwaga nk'abantu bagomba kubahwa ariko batari bafite uburenganzira bwinshi ku bijyanye n'ifata-rwanzuro, Bari bashinzwe cyane imirimo yo mu rugo kurera n'ubuhinzi ariko nta bureganzira bwo kuragwa ku matungo cyangwa gufata ibyemezo bikomeye mu muryango. Abagore bake bonyine nibo bashoboraga kubona agaciro kenshi iyo bari abavuzi,abahanuzi, cyangwa ababyeyi b'abami.\nMu gihe cy'ubukoloni bw'abadage n'ababiligi (1890s-1959) byarushijeho kudindiza abagore (abakoloni bashyizeho ubuyobozi bushingiye ku bagabo gusa, bityo abagore barirengagizwa mu nzego zose, ishuri ryatangiriye ku bahungu abakobwa n'abagore ntibigeze bahabwa amahirwe yo kwiga, nta burenganzira bwo gutora, gutunga ubutaka cyangwa se kwiyamamaza mu nzego).\nMu gihe cya Repubuika ya mbere niya kabiri(1962-1994) habonetse intambwe ya mbere y'impinduka:\nIterambere nyuma ya 1994, iki nicyo gihe cy'ingenzi mu iterambere ry'abari n'abategarugori ubwo Guverinoma y'U Rwanda(FPR Inkotanyi) yashyizeho gahunda zikomeye:\nAmavugururwa.\nU Rwanda rufatwa nk'ikitegererezo ku isi kuva mu mwaka wa 2005 kugeza ubu. U Rwanda rufatwa nk'igihugu cya mbere muri Afurika n'isi mu gushyigikira iterambere ry'abagore:\nKera Abagore babaga mu muryango utegekwa n'abagabo badafite ijambo ariko ubu Abari n'Abategarugori bari mu myanya y'ubuyobozi, bashyigikiwe n'amategeko n'imishinga.\nNta burenganzira bwo gutunga, kwiga cyangwa kuyobora ariko ubu iterambere ryabo ryahindutse rishingiye kuri olitiki y'uburinganire, amavugurura y'amategeko n'uruhare rwabo mu kubaka igihugu.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.gmo.gov.rw/\nhttps://www.statistics.gov.rw/statistical-publications/gender-and-youth/gender/national-gender-statistics-report-2024\nhttps://africa.unwomen.org/en/where-we-are/eastern-and-southern-africa/rwanda\nhttps://rwandadispatch.com/empowering-rwandas-future-how-gender-equality-is-shaping-a-sustainable-society/"}
{"id": "20261", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20261", "title": "Magaliesberg", "text": "Magaliesberg (amateka azwi kandi ku izina rya \"Macalisberg\" cyangwa \"imisozi ya Cashan\") yo mu majyaruguru ya Afurika y'Epfo, ni imisozi yoroheje ariko isobanuwe neza igizwe ahanini na quartzite. Irazamuka igana mu majyepfo ya Pilanesberge (na Parike ya Pilanesberg) kugira ngo igaragaze icyerekezo kigoramye gihuza umujyi wa Pretoriya mbere yuko gisohora abagera kuri 50\u00a0km (31mi) iburasirazuba, mu majyepfo ya Bronkhorstspruit. Ahantu hirengeye ha Magaliesberg hagera kuri Nooitgedacht, nko muri metero 1852 (6076ft) hejuru y'inyanja. Inzira nyabagendwa igera hejuru y'umusozi iherereye ku rugomero rwa Hartbeesoort, itanga amashusho meza ya Magaliesberg ndetse n\u2019akarere kayikikije. \nUbumenyi bwa geologiya.\nMagaliesberg ifite inkomoko ya kera. Ibiyigize byitirirwa inzira ya geologiya ikurikiranye mu mateka maremare cyane. Quartzite, shale,chert na dolomite byashyizwe mu myanda mu kibaya cyo hagati hejuru y\u2019imyaka miliyari 3 y\u2019imyubakire ya Archaean Basement, izwi ku izina rya Kaapyaal craton. Iyi nzira yo gutembera yamaze imyaka igera kuri miliyoni 300. Hafi yimyaka miliyari 2, kuzamuka kwinshi kwa magma gushonga byavuyemo icyitwa Bushveld Igneous Complex. Uburemere bukabije bw'ubwo bwinjira bwagabanije imyanda yari munsi yacyo kandi ihengamye imyanda ku nkombe ku buryo ibice byavunitse byarebaga hanze no hejuru, kandi byoroheje bikamanuka imbere. Uko ibihe byagiye bisimburana, ubwo bwinjira bwarashize, cyane cyane ahantu hahanamye, bikora ibinure byimbitse cyangwa ibibaya bitanga ubushobozi bwo kuzamuka urutare k'ubantu ba none. Aka ubu kitwa ikibaya cya Transvaal kandi kirimo no hejuru cyane ya Transvaal Drakensberg ireba Lowveld mu burasirazuba bw'igihugu. Isoko ryinshi ryibikoresho byaka - lava y'ibirunga - ya Karoo Supergroup yari muto cyane nyuma yaje gutwikira ikibaya cya Transvaal, ariko nyuma yaje kwangirika ku buryo iguma gusa ku nkombe y\u2019ikibaya cya Transvaal.\nIzina rya mbere rizwi ku misozi ya Magaliesberg ni Dithaba Diloka. Iri ni izina rya se Tswana ryaho ryerekeranye n'ubwinshi bwa Heteropogon contortus ikurira muri kariya gace. Icyakora birasa nkiri zina ryaba ryarakoreshejwe gusa n'abaturanyi ba Sotho-Tswana abaturage baza kumusozi wa Magaliesberg. Abaturage baho bo mu bwoko bwa Tswana bavuze ko ari Dithaba \"Imisozi\". \nAbashakashatsi ba mbere b'abanyaburayi baje muri ako gace banditse imisozi yitwa \"Cashan\" cyangwa \"Kashan\". Iyi yari ruswa yizina ryumukuru ukomeye wa BaKwena ba Mmatau witwaga Kgwasane wa Sekano \"(Kgwasane, mwene Sekano)\". \nHagati ya 1800s rwagati imisozi yamenyekanye nka Magaliesberg nyuma ya Kgosi Mogale. Mogale isobanura \"umuntu utyaye\" cyangwa \"intwari\", ariko kandi ni ijambo risanzwe rivuga umurwanyi cyangwa umusirikare wa Tswana, muri Sotho bogale risobanura \"ityaye\" naho mogale \"intwari\". Mu buryo nk'ubwo, imisozi iri mu majyaruguru, hafi y'Umujyi wa Sun, Pilanesberg, yitiriwe abatware ba Bakgatla baho, bitwaga Pilane.\nKu ya 17Mutarama1837, nyuma yuko bamwe mu ba voortrekkers bagabweho igitero bakicwa n'impis ya Mzilikazi, barwanyije kandi bayobowe na Hendrik Potgieter na Gerrit Maritz, kandi babifashijwemo n\u2019abayobozi bakuru ba Sotho- Tswana, batwara Matabeles mu majyaruguru bambuka uruzi rwa Limpopo. Kubera ko kongera kwigarurira ako karere byari umushinga wa koperative ya Boers na Sotho-Tswana kurwanya Matabele, Boers na Sotho-Tswana bari bafitanye umubano wa gicuti mu ntangiriro yo gutura abazungu. Iyi mibanire ya gicuti igaragarira mu izina ry\u2019umujyi mukuru wa Boer, Rustenburg, kubera ko babonaga ko batagomba kongera kugira indi mirwano irwanya imiryango nyafurika. Boers yabanje gutura mu majyepfo ya Magaliesberg muri Highveld, hasigara Bushveld mu majyaruguru ya Magaliesberg ahanini ku nshuti zabo na Sotho-Tswana n'inshuti zabo; nk'uko byanditswe na Sarah Heckford, \"Umudamu Umucuruzi muri Transvaal\", Boers bari kwimukira i Bushveld gusura abaturanyi babo ba Sotho-Tswana mu gihe cy'itumba. Dukurikije ubuhamya bwo mu magambo bwatanzwe n'abayobozi ba Tswana bwanditswe ahagana mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20, Boers benshi ku giti cyabo bagiranye ubucuti bwa hafi n'abayobozi bakomeye ba Tswana n'abayobozi bakuru, cyane cyane bagamije gushinga amashyaka yo guhiga kugira ngo bakusanyirize amahembe y'inzovu n'ibindi bicuruzwa baturutse mu majyaruguru. Nyuma yaho, Boers batangiye gutura mu mibande ya Range ya Magaliesberg no mu Bushveld mu majyaruguru ya Magaliesberg, maze bahindura ako karere mu turere tumwe na tumwe tw\u2019imirima itanga umusaruro muri Afurika y'Epfo, mu gihe bimuye abahoze ari inshuti zabo, babashyira ahantu hamwe no mu bubiko.\nMuri ako gace habaye imirwano ikomeye mu gihe cy'intambara ya kabiri ya Anglo-Boer, kubera ko yari imenyereye cyane imisozi, yakoresheje inzira y'ibanga yambukiranya imisozi kugira ngo igabe ibitero ku basirikare b'abongereza. Mu gusubiza, ingabo z\u2019Abongereza zubatse amazu hejuru y\u2019imisozi hagamijwe kugabanya ingendo za Boer; amatongo yizi nyubako aracyagaragara k'umusozi.\nIgenzura ry\u2019imisozi ya Magaliesberg ryagize akamaro kanini ku ngabo za Boer n\u2019Ubwongereza, cyane cyane inzira ebyiri zahuzaga Pretoria na Rustenburg, zambukaga ahitwa Silkaatsnek na Kommandonek. Kubera iyo mpamvu, muri ako karere habaye intambara nyinshi, nk'intambara za Buffelspoort, Nooitgedacht na Olifantsnek.\nNyuma y'intambara, imirima yo muri ako gace yarongeye guhindurwa neza maze ubuhinzi burakomeza,itabi na citrusi bigenda neza.\nMu 1923, urugomero rwa Hartbeespoort, ruherereye muri kimwe mu bibaya by'urwo rwego, rwuzuye. Yabaye ibiruhuko bizwi cyane no muri wikendi kubatuye Johannesburg na Pretoriya, kandi imidugudu ya Hartbeespoort na Kosmos yateye imbere kubwibyo.\nKugeza ubu, agace ka Magaliesberg karacyafite ubuhinzi, nubwo ubukerarugendo ari inganda zikura vuba muri ako karere.\nUmusozi wa Kgaswane ni nyaburanga hejuru ya Rustenburg ifite 4,257ha (hegitari 10,520) za Magaliesberg.\nIbigega byinshi bito, byigenga na leta, bigomba kuboneka mu burebure bw'urwego.\nIkigega cya Magaliesberg.\nNyuma y'imyaka hafi icumi yo guharanira no gushyira ingufu hamwe na komite nto y\u2019abashinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije, Magaliesberg yatangajwe ko ari urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima ku isi.\nIbi byatangajwe ku ya 9 Kamena 2015 I Paris n'Inama Mpuzamahanga mpuzabikorwa ya Porogaramu ku Muntu n'ibinyabuzima (MAB). Iyi ni gahunda ya UNESCO igamije kubaka umubano ushyigikiwe kandi urambye hagati y'abantu n\u2019ibidukikije. Mu byukuri, ibi bivuze kwibanda cyane kubungabunga urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima binyuze muburyo bushya bwo guteza imbere ubukungu.\nIhuriro ry'isi yose y'ibinyabuzima, Magaliesberg yinjiye ubu, riharura ibinyabuzima 631 mu bihugu 119.\nUmuyobozi w'ishami rishinzwe gutangiza urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima rwa Magaliesberg (MBIG), Paul Fatti, yagize ati: \"Twishimiye ko dushimira byimazeyo imiterere yihariye ya Magaliesberg n'umusanzu ukomeye itanga mu gihugu cyacu, muri serivisi z'ibidukikije muri Gauteng no mu Burenganzira bw'Amajyaruguru ndetse n'abaturage barera ahantu hanini.\" \nVincent Carruthers, wahoze ayobora MBIG akaba n'umwanditsi uzwi cyane wa \"The Magaliesberg\", ubushakashatsi bwemewe cyane ku misozi, yavuze ko iri tangazo ari indunduro y\u2019ubukangurambaga bwatangiye mu 2006. Ati: \"Nishimiye ko ubu hamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga iyi misozi minini yiboneye ubuzima bwose, uhereye ku nkomoko yayo\". \"Magaliesberg iruta inshuro 100 umusozi wa Everest ndetse n'igice cy'isi, ni ubutunzi budasanzwe kuri twe muri kariya gace ka Afurika.\" "}
{"id": "20262", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20262", "title": "Parike y'igihugu ya Mole", "text": "Parike ya Mole, imwe muri parike nini mu gihugu cya cya Gana, ni ubuhungiro bw'ibinyabuzima bunini muri iki gihugu. Parike iherereye muri muri Gana kuri Savanna n'ibinyabuzima byo kunkombe ku butumburuke hamwe na escarpment. Parike ni 24km uvuye i Damongo, umurwa mukuru w'akarere, 146 km mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba bwa Tamale, umurwa mukuru w'akarere. Parike ni 700km uvuye i Accra na 430km Kumasi. Ubwinjiriro bwa parike bugera mu mujyi wa Larabanga. Inzuzi za Levi na Mole zinyura muri parike, hasigara ibyobo byokunywa gusa mugihe cyizuba kirekire. ka Gana kakira abarenga 10\u00a0mm ku mwaka y'imvura. Ubushakashatsi bumaze igihe kirekire bwakorewe kuri parike ya Mole kugirango bumve ingaruka abahiga abantu ku nyamaswa zibungabunga. \nPariki ya Mole ni pariki y'ubukerarugendo bwateye imbere muri Gana mu bijyanye n'ubukerarugendo. ifite amacumbi ya mbere muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba yubatswe hagati mu ishyamba rya Mole. Zaina premier ecolodge yigihugu itanga serivise zo kwakira abashyitsi ku isi no gukoraho bidasanzwe. \nAmateka.\nUbutaka bwa parike bwashyizwe ku ruhande nkubuhungiro bw\u2019inyamanswa mu 1958. Mu 1971, abaturage bake bo muri ako gace barimuwe maze amasambu agenerwa parike y\u2019igihugu. Parike ntabwo yabonye iterambere rikomeye nkahantu nyaburanga kuva yagenwe mbere. Parike y'igihugu ya Mole nk'akarere karinzwe nta nkunga ihagije kandi impungenge z\u2019igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga zirahari ku bijyanye no guhiga no kuramba muri parike, ariko kurinda amoko y\u2019ibinyabuzima bya antelope byateye imbere kuva iyi pariki yatangira gushingwa. \nKuva aho abantu bimukiye muri ako gace, parike yabaye ahantu h\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019abahanga. Ibi byemereye ubushakashatsi bwigihe kirekire, byumwihariko, ahantu hasa nkaho hatabangamiwe ugereranije n\u2019ibice bisa na Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba ituwe cyane. Ubushakashatsi bumwe ku baturage batuye inzovu 800, urugero, bwerekana ko kwangiza inzovu ku biti binini bitandukana nubwoko. Muri Mole, inzovu zifite imyumvire myinshi yo gukomeretsa bikabije amoko y\u2019ubukungu nka Burkea africana \nVuba aha, ubuki bukozwe mu ndabyo mu pariki y\u2019igihugu ya Mol\u00e9 bwabaye ibicuruzwa bya mbere mu bucuruzi. Hafi aho, abaturage basarura ubuki bakoresheje uburyo gakondo, budatera, kandi bafatanya n\u2019isosiyete ikorera muri Utah kugurisha ubuki nk\u2019inyongera y\u2019ubuzima bwiza muri Amerika. Iyi gahunda yashinzwe n\u2019umuyobozi wa Ashanti, Nana Kwasi Agyemang, wizera ko azongera gukongeza inyungu z\u2019ubuki kandi amaherezo akazohereza mu bindi bihugu byo muri Afurika. "}
{"id": "20263", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20263", "title": "Isumo rya Wli", "text": "Isumo rya Wli ni isumo riherereye muri Gana kandi rirerire muri Afurika y'uburengerazuba..\nAho biherereye.\nIsumo rya Wli rifite ubuso bwa 20km uvuye Hohoe mu karere ka Volta muri Gana. \nIbidukikije.\nInyamaswa zo mu gasozi.\nGutembera mu ishyamba ry\u2019inyamanswa ya Agumatsa bitanga amahirwe yo kubona ibidukikije harimo unyamashwa ndetse n'ibindi binyabuzima harimo koloni nini y\u2019ibibabi by'imbuto, ikinyugunyugu, inyoni, inkende n\u2019abana. Ikoroni nini y'ibibabi irashobora kugaragara yiziritse ku bitare kandi iguruka mu kirere. \nAmateka.\nIsumo rya Wli n\u2019amazi maremare muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba aherereye muri Gana Isumo rizwi ku izina rya Agoomatsa - bisobanura ngo \" \"Munyemerere.\" \" Iherereye muri komine ya Hohoe yo mu karere ka Volta, igihugu cy\u2019umuco wa Ewe. Nibirometero 280 uvuye mumurwa mukuru Accra. Byabonetse nitsinda ryabahigi bakeka ko amajwi yaguye ari ingoma ivuga kandi yiruka yerekeza ku rusaku basanga ari isumo."}
{"id": "20264", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20264", "title": "Umugezi wa Ada Foah", "text": "Ada Foah ni umujyi uri ku nkombe y\u2019amajyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Gana, aho uruzi rwa Volta ruhurira n'inyanja ya Atalantika. Umujyi uherereye hafi yumugezi wa Volta, hafi yumuhanda wa Accra - Aflao. Azwiho kuba ku nkombe z'ibirwa, Ada Foah ni n'umurwa mukuru w'akarere ka Ada y'Iburasirazuba (ahahoze hitwa Dangme y'Iburasirazuba) n'icyicaro cy'Inteko y'Akarere. \nAmateka.\nUbukoloni bw\u2019Abaholandi muri Ada mu kinyejana cya 16 bwabonye iterambere ry\u2019ubucuruzi mu 1775. Izina \"Foah\" ryakomotse ku ijambo Fort, nko mu 1783, Fork Kongenstein yubatswe n\u2019Abaholandi kandi ikoreshwa mu bucuruzi bw'abacakara ba Transatlantike n\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019abacakara bo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara. Igihome cyaguzwe n'abongereza ku ya 15 Werurwe 1850. \nGusa ibimenyetso bya Fort Kongenstein tubisanga muri Ada,mukarere ka Greater Accra. Icyambu cya Ada giherereye ku nkombe z'umugezi wa Volta. aho abantu babaga bagurishirizazwe bakoherezwa muri Amerika banyuze muri iki gihome nk'abacakara. Igihome cyazimye hafi yinyanja kandi kirasenyuka, buhoro buhoro cyoza inyubako yahoze ari gereza mu nyanja. izamuka ry\u2019amazi rikomeje kubangamira inkombe n\u2019abaturage baho, kubaka urukuta rwo kurinda inyanja birizera ko bizahagarika iri terambere. \nUbutegetsi bw'abakoroni bw'abongereza bwashyizweho mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19. Gucuruza n'Abanyaburayi mu bucuruzi bw'abacakara barengana, Ada yabaye isoko rikomeye ry'ubucuruzi bw'abacakara mu byoherezwa mu mahanga. Ubucuruzi bwabacakara bumaze kuvaho, Dangmes yacuruzaga ibicuruzwa byamashyamba yo muri Afrika yo mu turere dushyuha (cyane cyane amavuta yintoki, intoki za palm na rubber). [\"citation ikenewe\"]\nUbukerarugendo bw'Ada Foah.\nAda Foah ni ikigo cy\u2019ubukerarugendo mu Karere ka Ada iburasirazuba hamwe n\u2019inyanja zacyo,Inkombe n\u2019ibikurura mukerarugendo na serivisi. Numugezi n'inyanja, Ada Foah azwiho siporo yo mazi nko koga, ubwato, kuroba hamwe n'ubwato. Inkombe z'umugezi ahanini zifunzwe na chalets z'ibiruhuko kuko abantu benshi baturutse i Accra bakoresha aho hantu nka weekend. Hariho icyambu n'ubwato ku nkombe z'umugezi aho amato ashobora gukodeshwa kugira ngo akore ingendo azenguruka ibirwa byo mu ruzi. Club ya Sailing Club, iherereye ku mugezi wa Volta, yugururiwe abanyamuryango gusa.\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nIkirere.\nUbushyuhe bwo mu turere dushyuha buri kwezi bivuze ubushyuhe buri hejuru ya 18\u00b0 C (64\u00b0 F) muri buri kwezi kwumwaka kandi mubisanzwe byitwa igihe cyizuba, ukwezi kwumutse kugusha imvura itageze kuri 60mm (2.36in) y'imvura.Ikirere cya Koppen cyerekana ubwoko bwikirere ni Aw, ikirere gishyuha cya savanna."}
{"id": "20265", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20265", "title": "Munyaga", "text": "Munyaga ni umusozi w\u2019amateka uherereye mu Karere ka Rwamagana, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda. Uyu musozi uherereye ku nkengero z\u2019aho u Rwanda rwagabaniraga na Gisaka mbere y\u2019uko igihugu cya Gisaka cyigarurirwa n\u2019u Rwanda mu kinyejana cya 19, ku ngoma y\u2019umwami Mutara II Rwogera. Munyaga ni umwe mu misozi ifite amateka akomeye mu bijyanye n\u2019umutekano n\u2019ubusugire bw\u2019u Rwanda, kuko ari ho hatangiriye igitekerezo cyo gugshinga \"urugerero rw\u2019ingabo z\u2019igihugu\".\nInkomoko y\u2019urugerero rwa Munyaga.\nUrugerero ni igikorwa cyakorwaga n'ingabo aho zabaga ziri ku nkiko (imbibi cyangwa imipaka) z\u2019u Rwanda mu rwego rwo kururinda ibikorwa byo kuba rwavogerwa n\u2019ibihugu by'amahanga. Ibyo bikorwa byatangiye ku ngoma y'umwami Cyirima II Rujugira, ubwo u Rwanda rwiteguraga guhura n\u2019ibitero byashoboraga guturuka mu bihugu by\u2019abaturanyi birimo nka Gisaka, Ndorwa, Bugesera, n\u2019u Burundi, aho ibyo bihugu byashakaga kwigarurira u Rwanda.\nRujugira yafashe icyemezo cyo kohereza imitwe y\u2019ingabo ngo ijye ihora ku nkiko z\u2019igihugu aho ibitero cyangwa abaje gutera igihugu bashoboraga kwinjirira, aherako avuga ijambo rikwira hose maze rirushaho kwamamara kugeza magingo aya, aho yavuze ati:\"U Rwanda ruratera ntiruterwa.\"\nAbakemba n\u2019itangira ry\u2019urugerero i Munyaga.\nKu ikubitiro, Rujugira yohereje umutwe w\u2019ingabo w\u2019Abakemba, bari bayobowe n\u2019umuhungu we Sharangabo, ngo bajye kurinda umupaka w\u2019u Rwanda na Gisaka. Izo ngabo zashinze ibirindiro mu mpinga y\u2019umusozi wa Munyaga, ahari hateganye na Gisaka. Aho ni ho urugerero rwatangiriye, maze abari bagize uwo mutwe bahatura burundu hamwe n\u2019imiryango yabo.\nNyuma ya Sharangabo, Ndabarasa, na we wari igikomangoma, yakomerejeho kuri urwo rugerero, aho yari kumwe n\u2019Abakemba. Abakomotse kuri abo basirikare b\u2019Abakemba baracyatuye i Munyaga, nubwo uwo mutwe w\u2019ingabo utacyiriho kuko wasenywe n\u2019ubukoloni bw\u2019Ababiligi, kimwe n\u2019indi mitwe y\u2019ingabo y\u2019icyo gihe.\nMunyaga mu gihe cya none.\nAho urugerero rwahoze, hitwa mu Nkamba, uhereye ku ngoma ya Rujugira kugeza ubu. Ni mu Mudugudu wa Kigabiro, Akagari ka Kaduha, Umurenge wa Munyaga, mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Mu gace k\u2019itaba ryari ricumbikiye ingabo, kuri ubu habarirwa ubutaka buri hagati ya hegitari 10 na 15, hakaba harimo ibikorwa bitandukanye aribyo:\nUmusozi wa Munyaga uherereye ahatuma uwuhagazeho abasha kwitegereza Kabarondo, ndetse n\u2019imisozi itandukanye ikikije agace ka Munyaga, irimo: Nkamba, Ruramira, Bugambira, Ruyonza, na Nyamirama.\nAgaciro k\u2019amateka y\u2019i Munyaga.\nUmusozi wa Munyaga ni umwe mu hantu harindirwaga ubusugire bw\u2019igihugu mu bihe cy'ingoma y'abami. Ni ishingiro ry\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019amateka y\u2019ubutwari bw\u2019ingabo, umuco wo kurinda igihugu, ndetse no kwibukiraho uko urugerero rwatangiye. Nubwo ubuyobozi bw\u2019abakoloni bwaje gusenya iyo mitwe y\u2019ingabo, urwibutso rw\u2019ibyabaye i Munyaga ruracyariho binyuze mu mateka n\u2019imiryango y\u2019abakemba bacyihatuye."}
{"id": "20266", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20266", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Chilwa", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Chilwa nicyo kiyaga cya kabiri kinini muri Malawi. Ni ikiyaga giherereye mu burasirazuba bw'akarere ka Zomba, hafi y'umupaka na Mozambike. Hafi ya 60km z'uburebure na 40km z'ubugari, ikiyaga kizengurutswe n'ibishanga binini. Hano hari ikirwa hagati yikiyaga cyitwa Chisi Island. Ikiyaga, kandi urwego rw'amazi rwibasiwe cyane n'imvura yibihe hamwe no guhumeka. Mu 1968, ikiyaga cyazimiye mu gihe cyizuba kidasanzwe. Igihe David Livingstone yasuraga ikiyaga mu 1859, yatangaje ko umupaka wacyo w\u2019amajyepfo wageze kuri Massif ya Mulanje, ikaba yari gutuma ikiyaga byibura igihe kirekire kuruta uko bimeze muri iki gihe.\nIkigo mpuzamahanga gishinzwe iterambere muri Danemark, ku bufatanye na Guverinoma ya Malawi cyakoraga mu rwego rwo kubungabunga ikiyaga n\u2019ibishanga byacyo. ikigo kandi kikaba gifite munshingano gahunda yo kurwanya imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere mu kiyaga cya Chilwa (LCBCCAP) yatangijwe mu rwego rwo kubungabunga agace gakomeye, kikaba atari igishanga gikomeye cy\u2019ibinyabuzima byaho gusa, ahubwo kikaba n\u2019isoko rikuru ry\u2019ibicuruzwa by\u2019amafi muri ako karere. \nInyamaswa zo mu gasozi.\nUbwoko bw'amafi bukunze kugaragara mu kiyaga cya Chilwa ni \"Barbus paludinosus\", \"Oreochromis shiranus chilwae\", \"Clarias gariepinus\", \"Brycinus imberi\" na \"Gnathonemus\". Ikiyaga kikaba gikunda kugaragaramo inyoni zo mu mazi zigera kuri zifite amoko agera kuri 160 atandukanye. Bamwe muribo bimukira muri Aziya - East African Flyway kuva muri Siberiya buri mwaka. Hamwe n'ubwoko cumi na bubiri bw'inyoni, umubare urenga 1% y'inyoni zosse ziraguruka. Umubare w'abantu ukikije ni mwinshi kandi uragenda wiyongera, kandi inyoni zo mu mazi zirahigwa ibiryo igihe amazi ari make kandi uburobyi bukaba ikibazo. Harimo gushyirwaho ingufu kugirango guhiga bikorwa muburyo burambye. \nUbukungu.\nImidugudu igera kuri 335 ituwe n\u2019abaturage barenga 60.000 yishora mu kuroba ikiyaga, kandi ikurura toni zirenga 17.000 buri mwaka, 20% by\u2019amafi yose yafatiwe muri Malawi. "}
