{"id": "20268", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20268", "title": "Pariki ya Vwaza Marsh", "text": "Vwaza Marsh Wildlife Reserve ni ikibuga cy'imikino cyo muri muri Malawi.\nBitandukanye na parike y'igihugu ya Nyika iri mu kibaya cya Nyika, igice kinini cya Vwaza giherereye ku butaka buringaniye nubwo uruhande rw'iburasirazuba rwa parike rufite imisozi. Iherereye mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bw\u2019ibibaya no mu majyaruguru y\u2019imigezi y\u2019uruzi rwa Rukuru y'Amajyepfo kandi ifite ubuso bwa 1.000km 2.\nIyi pariki irangwa n\u2019ishyamba rya Mopane na Miombo hamwe n\u2019ibishanga bikurura inyoni cyane zitari nke ku gasozi. \nIkibanza cy\u2019inyamanswa cya Vwaza Marsh ntigikunze gusurwa na benshi, ahanini bitewe n\u2019imiterere mibi y\u2019imihanda hamwe n\u2019ubutaka bugoye kandi butagerwaho.\nIcyo wamenya kuri Pariki ya Vwaza Marsh.\nItandukaniro ry'umubare winyamanswa n'ubwoko bushobora gutandukana mugihe uko bambuka umupaka na parike y'igihugu ya Luangwa y'Amajyaruguru muri Zambiya. Ubusanzwe ikigega gifite amashyo manini y'inyamanswa ninzovu, hamwe nubwoko butandukanye bwa antelope harimo roan, kudu nini, hartebeest ya Lichtenstein, eland na impala. Warthogs iboneka no muri iki kigega kimwe na podiyumu nyinshi ya hippopotamus mu kiyaga cya Kazuni. Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe mu bushakashatsi kamera bwerekanye kandi ko intare zihari, ariko bishoboka ko gito, kimwe n'ingwe n'imbwa zo mu gasozi. \nMose inzovu y'imfubyi ni nzovu ikuze muri iyi pariki ubu iri mu kigo cy'imfubyi cya Jumbo Foundation muri Lilongwe Malawi, yarokowe n'abashinzwe umutekano ku gishanga cya Vwaza mu ruzi rwa Rukuru y'Amajyepfo. \nInyoni zizwi cyane zirimo Goliath herons, ingurube zifunguye hamwe ni nyenyeri zidasanzwe zera. Ikiyaga cya Kazuni giherereye mu gace gashyigikira ubwoko bwayo bwa ba hippo.\nIyi arike ifite ubwoko butandukanye bw\u2019ibimera kandi hari amoko 398 y\u2019ibimera biva mu miryango 71. "}
{"id": "20269", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20269", "title": "Dambo", "text": "Dambo ni icyiciro cy'ibishanga bigoye muri Afurika yo hagati, Amajyepfo n\u2019Uburasirazuba,cyane muri Zambiya, Malawi na Zimbabwe. Mubisanzwe usanga ahantu h'imvura nyinshi igwa ahantu h'imisozi miremire kandi ifite amashami ameze nk'amashami ubwayo ntabwo ari manini cyane ariko ahujwe y'iyongera ahantu hanini. Bivugwa ko Dambos igizwe na 12.5% by'akarere ka Zambiya. Amagambo asa nyafurika arimo imbundo (akunze gukoreshwa muri Afrika yuburasirazuba), \"matoro\" (Mashonaland),viel (Afrika yepfo), \"fadama\" (Nijeriya), na \"bolis\" (Siyera Lewone) Abafaransa \"bas-fond\" hamwe n\u2019Abadage \"Sp\u00fcltal\" nabo basabwe kuvuga ku bishanga bisa n\u2019ibyatsi. \nIbiranga.\nDambos irangwa n'ibyatsi, ibihuru n'ibiti, bitandukanye n'ishyamba rikikije nk'ishyamba rya miombo. Birashobora kuba byumye cyane nyuma y'igihe cy'izuba, bikagaragaza ubutaka bw'umukara cyangwa ibumba ryirabura, ariko bitandukanye n'ubwatsi bwuzuye, bugumana imirongo itose yamazi mugihe cyizuba. Zirengewe n'amazi (zuzuye amazi) mugihe cyizuba (igihe cyizuba) ariko muri rusange ntabwo ziri hejuru yuburebure bwibimera, kandi ubuso bwamazi afunguye ubusanzwe bugarukira k'umugezi no mu bidendezi bito cyangwa lagoons (ibishanga bito) kumwanya muto muri rusange hafi y'ikigo.\nIzina dambo rikoreshwa cyane mu bishanga hejuru y'ibibaya bigizwe n'amasoko y'imigezi. Igisobanuro kigamije intego za siyansi cyasabwe nk'ibihe by'amazi, ibyatsi byiganjemo ibyatsi, kwiheba bihana umurongo w'amazi yo mumazi \". \nUbwoko.\nIkibazo n'igisobanuro kibanziriza iki nuko ijambo rishobora no gukoreshwa mu bishanga bihana imbibi n'inzuzi kure y\u2019amasoko, urugero dambo y'umugezi wa Mbereshi aho yinjira mu bishanga by'uruzi rwa Luapula muri Zambiya,\nRaporo yo mu 1998 y\u2019umuryango w'ibiribwa n'ubuhinzi itandukanya dambos 'hydromorphic / phreatic ' (ifitanye isano n\u2019amazi) na dambos ' fluvial ' (ifitanye isano n\u2019inzuzi), ikanavuga ku bwoko butanu bwa geomorphologique mu Ntara ya Luapula ya Zambiya: \"imisozi miremire\", \"ikibaya\", \"kumanika\", \"umusenyi\" na \"dambos\". \nHydrology.\nDambos igaburirwa n'imvura itemba buhoro kugirango igaburire imigezi bityo rero n'ikintu cy'ingenzi cy'inzira z'amazi. Usibye kuba urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima bigoye, bigira uruhare mu binyabuzima bitandukanye byo mu karere. \nHariho igitekerezo kizwi cyane ko dambos ikora nka sponges kugirango yinjize imvura y'igihe cy'izuba irekura gahoro mu migezi mu gihe cy'izuba bityo bigatuma umwaka wose utemba, ariko ibi birwanya ubushakashatsi bumwe na bumwe bwerekana ko mu gihe cy'izuba hagati cyangwa cya nyuma amazi arekurwa mu mazi. Amasoko aboneka muri dambos zimwe. Rero, birashobora gufata igihe kirekire imyaka itari mike kugirango amazi ava mugihe cy'imvura nyinshi ahindurwe mu misozi hanyuma agaragare muri dambo, agashiraho lagoons cyangwa imigezi mu migezi yo hepfo idashobora gusobanurwa n'imvura y'umwaka ushize. Dambos irashobora kugira uruhare, mugusobanura itandukaniro ritangaje ku rwego rw'amazi cyangwa imigezi mu kiyaga cya Mweru Wantipa nikiyaga cya Chila muri Mbala.\nKoresha.\nUbusanzwe, dambos zagiye zikoreshwa:\nVuba aha, zakoreshejwe mu byuzi by'amafi no guhinga umuceri wo mu misozi. Imbaraga zo gutezimbere dambos mu buhinzi zaburijwemo no kubura ubushakashatsi kuri hydrology n'ubutaka bwa dambos, byagaragaye ko bihinduka kandi bigoye. \nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.worldatlas.com/articles/what-and-where-is-dambo.html"}
{"id": "20270", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20270", "title": "Kinyeti", "text": "Umusozi wa Kinyeti n'impinga ndende muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo. Iherereye mu misozi ya Imatong mu Ntara ya Ikotos yo mu Burasirazuba bwa Ekwatoriya, hafi y'umupaka wa Uganda. Kinyeti ifite uburebure bwa metero 3187(10,456ft) hejuru y'inyanja. Itsinda irimo Kinyeti, igera k'umupaka na Uganda, rimwe na rimwe yitwa imisozi ya Lomariti cyangwa Lolobai. \nIbice byo hepfo y'umusozi byari bitwikiriwe n'ishyamba ryiza. Aya ni amashyamba yo mu majyaruguru cyane ya ecoregion ya montane yo muri Afrika y'uburasirazuba. Iyi mpinga ni urutare, rufite ibyatsi bya montane kandi biranyanyagiye, subshrub yo hasi hamwe n\u2019ibimera mu mwobo. Umwe mu Banyaburayi ba mbere basuye umusozi ni umuhanga mu bimera witwa Thomas Ford Chipp, wavumbuye \"chippii ya Coreopsis\" hafi y\u2019isonga. "}
{"id": "20271", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20271", "title": "Abidjan", "text": "Abidjan ni umujyi munini kandi w'ubukungu wahoze ari umurwa mukuru wa Cote d'Ivoire/Ivory Coast. Ibarura rusange ryakozwe mu 2021, ryagaragaje ko Abidjan yari utuwe n'abaturage miliyoni 6.3, bangana na 21.5% by'abatuye igihugu cyose. Abidjan ni umujyi wa gatandatu utuwe cyane muri Afurika: nyuma ya Logos, Cairo, Kinshasa, Dar es Salaam na Johannesburg. Uyu mujyi ni ihuriro ry\u2019imico itandukanye muri Afurika y\u2019Iburengerazuba, urangwa n\u2019 uruhuri rw\u2019inganda no kwaguka k'umujyi. Abidjan ni umujyi utuwe cyane n'abakoresha ururimi rw'igifaransa muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba.\nUyu mujyi wagutse cyane nyuma yo kubaka icyambu gishya mu 1931, bikurikirwa no kuba umurwa mukuru w\u2019abakoloni b\u2019Abafaransa mu 1933. Kuzuza umuyoboro wa Vridi mu 1951, byatumye Abidjan iba icyambu gikomeye cyo ku nyanja. Abidjan yakomeje kuba umurwa mukuru wa Cote d'Ivoire/Ivory Coast nyuma yo kwigenga mu 1960, ubwo yari yigobotoye Ubufaransa bwayikoronizaga. Mu 1983, umujyi wa Yamoussoukro wagizwe umurwa mukuru wa politiki wemewe wa Cote d'Ivoire/Ivory Coast. Icyakora, ku mugaragaro, Abidjan yagizwe umurwa mukuru w\u2019ubukungu kubera ko ari wo mujyi munini mu gihugu ndetse ukaba n'izingiro ry\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019ubukungu. Inzego nyinshi za politiki na za Ambasade zose z\u2019ibihugu by'amahanga zakomeje kuba muri Abidjan.\nAmateka.\nAbidjan yari isanzwe ari umudugudu ukorerwamo ibikorwa by'uburobyi. Mu 1896, nyuma y\u2019uruhererekane rw'ibyorezo bya Yellow Fever, abakoloni b\u2019Abafaransa bari batuye muri Grand-Bassam bahisemo kwimukira ahantu hizewe maze mu 1898 bahitamo kujya gutura mu mudugudu wari uherutse kwitwa Abidjan. Mu 1903 yahindutse umujyi ku mugaragaro. \u200b\u200b\nAbidjan, iherereye ku nkombe ya \"lagoon n'doup\u00e9\", yagukiye ku bundi butaka bunini ndetse haba ahantu hatanga amahirwe menshi yo kwaguriraho ibikorwa by'ubucuruzi. Icyambu cya Petit Bassam giherereye mu majyepfo y\u2019umujyi cyahise kirenga ku cyambu cya Grand-Bassam, maze gihinduka inzira nyamukuru inyuzwamo ibicuruzwa byajyaga mu bakoloni. Mu 1904, iherezo y'inzira ya gari ya moshi yari iherereye mu gace ka Port-Bou\u00ebt ko muri Abidjan. Guhera muri uwo mwaka, nubwo umujyi wa Bingerville utari warangiye kubakwa neza, Abidjan yabaye ihuriro rigari ry'ubukungu bw'abakoronizaga Cote d'Ivoire/Ivory Coast ndetse iba inzira ya mbere y'ingenzi mu bwikorezi yakoreshwaga mu gukwirakwiza ibicuruzwa bikoherezwa mu bihugu byo ku mugabane w\u2019Uburayi, cyane cyane binyuze mu muryango w'abanya Libani, urushaho kugira umumaro mu bucuruzi n'ubukungu. Mu 1934, Abidjan yabaye umujyi wa gatatu wa Cote d'Ivoire/Ivory Coast, nyuma ya Grand-Bassam na Bingerville. Hafashwe icyemezo cyo kuyigira umurwa mukuru bitewe n'muhanda wa gari ya moshi wahuzaga Amajyaruguru n'Amajyepfo ya Cote d'Ivoire/Ivory Coast. \nNyuma y'ubwigenge.\nIgihe Cote d'Ivoire/Yvory coast yigenga mu 1960, Umujyi wa Abidjan wabaye izingiro ry'ubuyobozi ndetse n\u2019ubukungu mu gihugu gishya. Igice giherereye mu majyepfo ya Treichville, cyerekeza ku kibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga no ku nkombe z'inyanja, habaye indiri y'Abanyaburayi ndetse n'abafite ubushobozi buciriritse n'ubwisumbuyeho. Nyuma yo kubona ubwigenge kwa Ivory Coast, Umujyi wa Abidjan wateye imbere byihuse ndetse bituma n'umubare w'abaturage bahatuye wiyongera cyane, uva ku baturage 180.000 mu 1960 bagera kuri 1.269.000 mu 1978. \nImirimo yo kubaka Katedarali yitiriwe Mutagatifu Pawulo, yakorewe igishushanyo mbonera n\u2019umwubatsi w\u2019umutaliyani witwaAldo Spirito, yatangiye mu 1980 nyuma y'uko Papa Yohani Pawulo wa II ashyizeho ibuye ry'ifatizo maze mirimo irangira mu 1985. Kuva mu mwaka ya za 1980, ubukungu bwa Abidjan bwatangiye kugabanuka bitewe n\u2019uburangare bw\u2019abayobozi, ruswa ndetse no gusubira inyuma muri rusange. Mu 1983, ku buyobozi bwa Perezida Felix Houphouet-Boigny, umudugudu wa Yamoussoukro wabaye umurwa mukuru mushya wa politiki wa Cote d'Ivoire/Ivory Coast, kuko ariho yari yavukiye. Icyakora, Abidjan yakomeje kuba izingiro ry'ubukungu n'ubucuruzi mu gihugu."}
{"id": "20273", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20273", "title": "Ubusitani bwa Kirstenbosch", "text": "\u00a0Kirstenbosch n'ubusitani bw'ibimera bwubatswe munsi y'uburasirazuba bw'umusozi wameza muri Cape Town. Ubusitani ni bumwe mu busitani bwa Botanika 10 bukubiyemo ibinyabuzima bitanu muri Afurika y'Epfo bitandatu bitandukanye kandi bikayoborwa n\u2019ikigocy'igihugu cy'ibinyabuzima cya Afurika y'epfo (SANBI). Mbere y'itariki ya 1 Nzeri 2004, ikigo cyari kizwi ku izina rya National Botanical Institute.\nKirstenbosch ishimangira cyane mu guhinga ibihingwa kavukire. Igihe Kirstenbosch yashingwa mu mwaka wi 1913 kugira ngo ibungabunge ibimera bikomoka ku butaka bwa Afurika y'Epfo, nibwo busitani bwa mbere bw\u2019ibimera ku isi bufite uyu mwihariko, mu gihe amoko atera atabonaga ko ari ikibazo cy\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019ibidukikije"}
{"id": "20274", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20274", "title": "Cape Town", "text": "Cape Town ni umurwa mukuru muri Afurika yepfo. N'umujyi wa kera cyane w'igihugu kandi niho Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Afrika yepfo. Umujyi wa Cape Town niwo mujyi mu bunini mu gihugu ukurikije abaturage, nyuma ya Johannesburg, n'umujyi munini mu burengerazuba bwa Cape. Umujyi ugizwe n'umujyi wa Cape Town metropolitan.\nUyu mujyi uzwiho kandi icyambu, imiterere karemano mu karere ka Cape Floristic, ndetse n\u2019ahantu nyaburanga nka Mountain na Cape Point. Cape Town yagizwe umujyi mwiza ku isi ku bagenzi, inshuro nyinshi, harimo nka The New York Times mu 2014, igihe cyashize mu 2025, na \"The Telegraph\" mu myaka 8 ishize(2017 kugeza 2025). \nIherereye ku nkombe za Table Bay, agace ka City Bowl ka Cape Town, karimo akarere k'ubucuruzi hagati (CBD), ni agace ka kera cyane ko mu mijyi yo mu burengerazuba bwa cape, ako gace kandi gafite umurage ndangamuco ukomeye. Agace ka metropolitani gafite inkombe ndende ku nyanja ya Atalantika, ikubiyemo igice cyo mu majyaruguru mu karere ka West Beach, ndetse n'akarere ka False Bay mu majyepfo.\nParike y'imeza iri mu mipaka y'umujyi kandi hari n'ibindi byinshi bibungabunga ibidukikije hamwe n\u2019ahantu harinzwe n\u2019inyanja imbere ndetse no hafi y\u2019umujyi, birinda ibidukikije bitandukanye byo ku isi n\u2019inyanja. Muri byo harimo ubusitani bwa Kirstenbosch National Botanical Garden, bukubiyemo 5 muri biome 6 zo muri Afurika y'epfo, kandi bukerekana ibimera byinshi bikomoka mu karere ka Cape.\nCape Town yinjiza amafaranga menshi yo muri Afurika y'epfo, umubare muto w\u2019ubushomeri, urwego rwo hejuru rw\u2019ishoramari ry\u2019ibikorwa remezo, zitanga serivisi zikomeye, ubukerarugendo bunini, n\u2019isoko ry\u2019imitungo itimukanwa. \nAmateka.\nIgihe cyambere.\nIbisigisigi bya mbere bizwi cyane mu bikorwa by'abantu muri kariya karere byabonetse mu buvumo bwa Peers muri Fish Hoek kandi byanditswe hagati yimyaka 15.000 na 12.000. \nBartolomeu Dias Umunyaburayi wa mbere wageze muri ako karere yahageze mu mwaka wa 1488 ayita \"Cape of Storms\" (). Nyuma yaje kwitwa John II wo muri Porutugali yitwa \" Cape of Hope Hope \" () kubera icyizere gikomeye cyatewe no gufungura inzira y'inyanja yerekeza k'umugabane wu Buhinde no mu burasirazuba bwa Indies.\nMu mwaka wi 1497, umushakashatsi w\u2019igiporutugali Vasco da Gama yanditse amajwi yerekeranye n\u2019umusozi w\u2019amizero meza.\nMu mwaka wi 1510, ku rugamba rw'uruzi rw'umunyu, admiral wo muri Porutugali Francisco de Almeida na mirongo itandatu na bane mu bagabo be barishwe kandi ishyaka rye ryatsinzwe na \"Goringhaiqua\" mu myandikire y\u2019Abadage) bakoresheje inka zatojwe bidasanzwe kugira ngo basubize ifirimbi n'induru. Gorinaiqua yari umwe mu miryango ya Khoikhoi yari ituye muri ako gace.\nMu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 16 Abafaransa, Danemarke, Abadage, n'Abongereza, ariko cyane I giporutugali, amato yahoraga akomeza guhagarara hejuru ya Bay Bay yerekeza mu Buhinde. Bagurishaga itabi, umuringa, n'icyuma hamwe n'imiryango ya Khoikhoi yo mu karere kugirango bagurane inyama nshya n'ibindi byangombwa by'ingendo.\nIgihe cy'Ubuholandi.\nGutura byakuze buhoro muri iki gihe, kuko byari bigoye kubona akazi gahagije.Uku kubura abakozi kwatumye kandi abayobozi baho batumiza mu mahanga abacakara muri Indoneziya na Madagasikari. Benshi muri aba bantu ni abakurambere b'iki gihe cya Cape Colored na Cape Malay. \nKu butegetsi bwa Van Riebeeck n'abamusimbuye, nk'abayobozi ba VOC ndetse na ba guverineri nyuma ya Cape, hashyizweho ibihingwa bitandukanye by'ubuhinzi. Bimwe muribi, birimo inzabibu, ibinyampeke, imbuto z'ubutaka, ibirayi, pomme na citrusi, byagize uruhare runini kandi birambye mu mibereho n'ubukungu bw'akarere. \nIgihe cy'Ubwongereza.\nRepubulika y'ubuhorandi yahinduwe muri Repubulika ya Bataviya y\u2019impinduramatwara y\u2019Ubufaransa, Ubwongereza bwimukiye kwigarurira ubukoloni bw\u2019Ubuholandi, harimo n\u2019ubukoroni bwa VOC.\nU bwongereza bwigaruriye Cape Town mu mwaka wa 1795, ariko busubizwa mu Buholandi n\u2019amasezerano mu 1803. Ingabo z\u2019Abongereza zongeye kwigarurira Cape mu 1806 nyuma y\u2019Intambara ya Blaauwberg igihe Repubulika ya Bataviya yifatanyaga na mukeba w\u2019Ubwongereza, Ubufaransa, mu gihe cy\u2019intambara ya Napoleon. Intambara irangiye Cape Town yahawe u Bwongereza burundu mu masezerano y'Abongereza n'ubuholandi yo mu mwaka 1814.\nUmujyi wabaye umurwa mukuru wa Cape Colony nshya yari imaze gushingwa, akarere kayo kakaguka cyane kugeza mu myaka ya 1800, igice cyatewe n'intambara nyinshi na ama Xhosa k'umupaka w'iburasirazuba bwa koloni. Mu 1833, ubucakara bwakuweho muri koloni babohora imbata zirenga 5500 muri uwo mujyi, hafi kimwe cya gatatu cyabatuye umujyi icyo gihe. ikibazo cy'abakatiwe mu 1849, cyaranzwe n\u2019imivurungano ikomeye y\u2019abaturage, cyashimangiye icyifuzo cyo kwiyobora muri Cape. \nMu kwaguka haje gusabwa ubwigenge bukomeye mu Bwongereza, Cape igera ku nteko ishinga amategeko yayo mu mwaka wi 1854 na Minisitiri w\u2019intebe ubarizwa aho (1872). Amatora yashyizweho hakurikijwe amacakubiri adafite amoko Cape yujuje ibisabwa. \nMu mwaka wi 1850 nuwa 1860, ubundi bwoko bw\u2019ibimera bwatangijwe muri Ositaraliya n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019Ubwongereza. By'umwihariko rooikrans yatangijwe kugirango ituze umucanga wa Cape flats kugirango yemererwe umuhanda uhuza umupaka n\u2019igice cy\u2019umugabane wa Afurika, kandi eucalyptus yakoreshejwe mu kuvoma ibishanga. \nMu 1859, umurongo wa gariyamoshi wa mbere wubatswe na gariyamoshi ya leta ya Cape kandi sisitemu ya gariyamoshi yagutse vuba mu 1870. Ivumburwa rya diyama muri Griqualand West mu 1867, na Witwatersrand Gold Rush mu 1886, byatumye umwuzure w\u2019abinjira muri Afurika y'epfo. Mu 1895, hafunguwe sitasiyo ya mbere y\u2019amashanyarazi rusange y\u2019umujyi, Graaff Electric Lighting Works.\nAmakimbirane hagati ya Repubulika ya Boer imbere na guverinoma y'ubukoroni bw\u2019Abongereza yatumye Intambara ya kabiri ya Boer yo mu mwaka wi 1899\u20131902. Intsinzi y'Ubwongereza muri iyi ntambara yatumye hashyirwaho Afurika y'Epfo yunze ubumwe. Kuva mu 1891 kugeza 1901, abatuye umujyi barikubye kabiri bava kuri 67.000 bagera kuri 171.000. \nIgihe cy' ikinyejana cya 19 ubwo cyarangiraga, ubukungu bwa politiki bya Cape Town mu karere ka Afurika y'epfo mu kinyejana cya 19 byatangiye guha umwanya Johannesburg na Pretoriya mu kinyejana cya 20. \nIgihe cya Afrika yepfo.\nMu 1910, Ubwongereza bwashizeho ubumwe bw'Afurika y'epfo bwahuzaga Cape Colony hamwe na Repubulika ya Boer yatsinzwe na koloni y\u2019Abongereza ya Natal. Cape Town yabaye umurwa mukuru w\u2019amategeko w\u2019Ubumwe, nyuma ya Repubulika ya Afurika yepfo.\nMu ibarura ryo mu 1936 Johannesburg yari Cape Town nk'umujyi munini mu gihugu.\nMu 1945 kwagura ikibanza cya Cae Town cyarangiye, hiyongeraho 194ha (hegitari 480) kuri Cape Town CBD, no mu kwagura, akarere ka Bowl. \nMugihe cya Aparthied.\nMbere kandi y'ikinyejana cya 20 rwagati Cape Town yari umwe mumijyi ihuriweho n'amoko muri Afurika y'epfo. \u200b\"\u200b\"\u200b"}
{"id": "20275", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20275", "title": "Umusozi wa Monte Binga", "text": "Monte Binga ni umwe mu misozi miremire muri Mozambike n'uwa kabiri muremure muri Zimbabwe. Iherereye mu misozi ya Chimanimani, ikanyura ku mupaka wa Zimbabwe na Mozambike muri Parike ya Chimanimani mu Ntara ya Manica. Ireshya na metero 8,004 (hejuru ya 2,440m) hejuru yinyanja. \nUbumenyi n'imiterere ya Monte Binga.\nUmusozi ugizwe na quartzite yumukara wijimye cyane, munsi y'umusozi wa Chimanimani, ukawuha ubutayu. imisozi yo mu majyaruguru n'amajyepfo bigenda byuzura hafi ya mpinga kugera ku mpande ya dogere 40 hanyuma bigahuriza mu burasirazuba, ikirenge cy'umusozi hamwe na Turret Towers bihita byerekeza mu majyepfo biryamye ku makosa. Kubwibyo, inzira y'uburasirazuba ninto, mugihe iyomu uburengerazuba ihanamye cyane ahantu. ihinduka ku rutare ruhagaze hepfo. Iyo wegereye iburengerazuba, uva mu kibaya cy'Uruzi rwa Bundi, hari inzira idasobanuwe neza ishami riva mu nzira nyamukuru ya magendu yerekeza kuri Skeleton Pass.\nUmusozi ucuramye uhinduka nk'ikizenga. Kugaragara hejuru y'umusozi ni mwiza kandi n'urutare, hamwe nubutaka butagira ingano cyane bukikijwe ibyatsi bya tussocky gusa na mususu hagati y'imisozi ihanamye cyane.\nUshobora kandi kubona inyanja y'Ubuhinde kuva ku mpinga ya Binga ku munsi ugaragara neza ureba hafi y'iburasirazuba, ku birometero 190. Umusozi uri kure yimiturire."}
{"id": "20276", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20276", "title": "Umusozi wa Namuli", "text": "Umusozi wa Namuli ni umusozi wa kabiri muremure muri Mozambike kandi muremure uherereye mu Ntara ya Zambezia. Ni n'umusozi muremure yarapimwe, abajijwe kandi mu mwaka wa 1886 na Henry Edward O'Neill, konseye w\u2019Ubwongereza uba muri Mozambike. Massif ya Namuli igizwe nubutumburuke buringaniye hamwe na granite dome y'umusozi wa Namuli hejuru. Aka gace kari kambaye amashyamba y'imvura yo mu turere dushyuha kandi ni ahantu h\u2019ibinyabuzima bifite amoko menshi y\u2019inyamaswa n\u2019ibimera. Ahantu hahanamye ubu hakoreshwa cyane cyane mu guhinga icyayi n\u2019imisozi yo hagati mu bindi bikorwa by\u2019ubuhinzi, hamwe n\u2019amashyamba kimeza aherereye murako gace ubu ahanini agarukira mu bice byo hejuru na koridoro ku masomo y\u2019amazi.\nUmusozi wa Namuli ni impinga ndende mu Ntara ya Zambezia ya Mozambike. Kuri metero 2,420 n'iwo umusozi wa kabiri muremure wa Mozambike inyuma ya Monte Binga. Massif ya Namuli igizwe n'ubutayu buringaniye buzamuka metero 700 kugeza 800. Dome ya granite ya Namuli yazamutseho ubuso bw'ubutumburuke bwa metero 1,600 hejuru y'ibibaya. Ubuso buri hejuru ya metero 1200 bupima 50 x 30km. Umusozi wa Namuli uherereye 12km amajyaruguru-uburasirazuba bwa Guru\u00e9 na 160km uvuye muri Massif ya Mulanje mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Malawi.\nAmashyamba yo ku musozi wa Namuli ni ahantu bari ibinyabuzima hashyizweho bivuze ko bifite umubare munini w\u2019ibinyabuzima bitandukanye by\u2019inyamaswa zibangamiwe na tagisi y\u2019ibimera. Ubwoko nka Namuli apalis (\"Apalis lynesi\") hamwe nigisimba cya Vincent (\"Paraxerus vincenti\") byavumbuwe ku umusozi wa Namuli. Andi moko adasanzwe ni Thyolo alethe (\"Alethe choloensis\") hamwe na dapple-umuhogo (\"Modulatrix orostruthus\") iboneka ahandi.\nImusozi wa Namuli yiganjemo imirima yicyayi. Ahantu hahanamye hagaragara ubuhinzi. Amashyamba kavukire agarukira kuri koridoro kumasomo yinzuzi. Umujyi wegereye ni Gur\u00fa\u00e8 niwo mutungo munini w'icyayi wa Mozambike.\nAmateka.\nUmusozi wa Namuli wacukuwe bwa mbere muri Kanama 1886 na Henry Edward O'Neill wari konseye w\u2019Ubwongereza muri Mozambike mu 1879. Yamenyekanye cyane mu nzego z\u2019imyororokere kugira ngo urugendo rwa Hubert Lynes na Jack Vincent mu 1931/1932. Bitewe n'intambara y'abene gihugu ya Mozambike no kutagira umuhanda mubi, ni bwo mu 1998 ubwo itsinda ryo muri Afurika y'Epfo ry\u2019abahanga mu by'imiterere y\u2019imiterere yabashaga gukora ubushakashatsi ku mashyamba yo ku musozi wa Namuli. Mu 2024, abahanga basabye ecoregion nshya, izitwa Afurika yepfo yepfo Montipe Archipelago (SEAMA), izaba irimo umusozi wa Namuli nizindi inselbergs zo mukarere."}
{"id": "20277", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20277", "title": "Umusozi wa Gorongosa", "text": "Umusozi wa Gorongosa uherereye mu ntara ya sofara iherereye muri Mozambike rwagati. Impinga yayo ndende, Gogogo, igera ku burebure bwa metero 1.863 (metero 6.112). Yakozwe na Karoo Ibirunga. \nAgace ko hejuru k'umusozi gafite uburebure bwa metero 700 kagizwe na parike ya Gorongosa na leta ya Mozambike mu mwaka wa 2010. Igice kinini cya parike kiri ahantu hirengeye mu burasirazuba bwumusozi. \nUbumenyi bwa geologiya.\nUmusozi wa Gorongosa uzamuka nka misa y'itaruye kuva mubibaya bikikije. Umusozi wa Gorongosa uri hejuru y'ibibaya bi nini, rufite impeta ya ova, nko muri kuri. Hariho nyamukuru, imwe mu majyaruguru, imwe mu majyepfo, na Gogogo, hejuru cyane, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba. Hagati yabo hari ikibaya kirimo ibibaya bitatu. Umusozi ugizwe na granite yo mu bihe bya nyuma ya Jurassic, izengurutswe na gabbros mu burengerazuba no mu majyepfo. \nIkirere.\nn'umusozi ufite ikirere gikonje kandi gihora gitose kuruta ubutayu buhakikije bukikije. Umuyaga mwinshi wo mu nyanja wimuka uva mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba uzamuka imisozi ikonja, kandi ubuhehere buri mu kirere buragwa kandi bukagwa nkimvura, cyangwa bukagira ibicu bito n'ibicu bya mugitondo. Umuyaga uhuha uva mu majyepfo no mu burasirazuba wakira ubuhehere burenze ubw'amajyaruguru n'iburengerazuba, biri mu gicucu cy'imvura cy'umusozi.\nIbidukikije.\nUmusozi wa Gorongosa ugira ikirere cy'uzuye ubukonje, bitandukanye nubutayu bukikije. Uyu musozi ubamo ibyatsi bya montane na submontane, amashyamba yimeza yicyatsi kibisi, amashyamba yumye ya montane, ishyamba rya miombo, nubutayu bwa ericaceous.\nAmashyamba y\u2019umusozi wa Gorongosa n\u2019ibyatsi ni agace kegeranye k\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Zimbabwe montane y\u2019amashyamba-nyakatsi ya mosaic ecoregion, usanga ahanini iburengerazuba mu misozi y\u2019iburasirazuba ku mupaka wa Mozambike na Zimbabwe. Amashyamba ya miombo yepfo ecoregion azengurutse umusozi ahirengeye."}
{"id": "20278", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20278", "title": "Umusozi wa Hombori", "text": "Umusozi Hombori (Hombori Tondo) ni umusozi wo mu karere ka Mopti ka Mali, hafi y'umujyi wa Hombori. Kuri metero 1,155, ni ahantu hirengeye muri Mali.\nIbinyabuzima bitandukanye.\nUmusozi wa Hombori ni ahantu nyaburanga h'ingenzi ku binyabuzima muri Sahel, ufite amoko 150 y\u2019ibimera hamwe n\u2019ubwoko butandukanye bw'inyamanswa, inyoni, ibikururuka hasi, n\u2019udukoko ku buso bwa kilometero kare ebyiri.\nHombori ifite ubuso bwibibaya, hafi kilometero kare 10,000 zubutayu burimo amoko agera kuri 200 gusa y'ibimera. Ikintu gikomeye kigira uruhare runini mu binyabuzima bya Hombori,irinzwe impande zose n\u2019imisozi miremire. Ku moko menshi y\u2019ibimera, harimo na Bombox costatum, umusozi wa Hombori n\u2019amajyaruguru y\u2019ikwirakwizwa ryayo, yerekana akamaro kayo nk'ubuhungiro bw\u2019ibinyabuzima byinshi byo mu majyepfo. \nUmusozi wa Hombori ubamo amoko amwe y\u2019inyamaswa, aribyo ibikururuka hasi n\u2019inyoni, ariko kandi amoko amwe y\u2019inyamabere harimo na hyrax yo mu rutare na olive baboon. \nUbucukumbuzi.\nUmusozi wa Hombori ni ahantu h'ubucukuzi bukomeye, ubuvumo butuwe hashize imyaka irenga 2000."}
{"id": "20279", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20279", "title": "Umusozi wa Bandiagara Escarpment", "text": "Umusozi wa Bandiagara Escarpment ni urutare ukaba uherereye mu gihugu cya Mali. ufite uburebure bugera kuri.\nAgace ka escarpment gatuwe nuyu munsi n'abantu bo mubwoko bwaba Dogon. Mbere ya Dogon, escarpment yari ituwe n'abantu bo mubwoko bwa Tellem na Toloy. abantu benshi basigaye kuri Tellem. Escarpment ya Bandiagara yashyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019umurage w\u2019isi wa UNESCO mu 1989.\nImisozi ya Bandiagara ni urutare rufite umucanga uva mu majyepfo ugana mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba hejuru ya no kugera kuri massif ya Grandamia. Iherezo rya misifike ryaranzwe na Hombori Tondo, impinga ndende ya Mali kuri. Kubera imiterere yubucukumbuzi, amoko na geologiya, ikibanza cyose ni ingingo ishimishije.\nEscarpment ya Bandiagara uyumunsi.\nUyu munsi, abayobozi baho baherekeza amatsinda yubukerarugendo kumuherekeza gusura imidugudu ya Dogon. Urukurikirane rw'inzira zinyura mu bitare, kandi burigace mui buri mudugudu utanga ibiryo n'amacumbi. Imidugudu yakira amafaranga ava mumacumbi n' ubukerarugendo. Biteganijwe ko ubwiyongere bukabije mu bukerarugendo bugana muri ako karere, kubera ko hubatswe umuhanda mushya, ugashyira igitutu ku mico gakondo, gakondo. Byongeye kandi, \"Ikinyamakuru The Independent\" kivuga ko gusahura ibihangano bya kera byakwirakwiriye muri kariya gace, gafite polisi mbi. \nMu rwego rwo rushinzwe pariki n'ubukerarugendo ruhamagarira abantu ikibazo cyo gusura ba mukerarugendo batagenzuwe, Ikigega cy\u2019Urwibutso rw\u2019isi cyashyizemo Escarpment ya Bandiagara muri World Monuments Watch 2004. Mu 2005, WMF yatanze inkunga yatanzwe na Express Express y'Abanyamerika kuri Mission Culturelle de Bandiagara yo gutegura gahunda yo kuyobora. Usibye kurinda inyubako gakondo, gahunda yubuyobozi irasaba ko hajyaho iyubakwa rishya binyuze mu gushyiraho umurongo ngenderwaho w\u2019inyubako, nk'izigenga iterambere rishya mu turere tw\u2019amateka ku isi.\nNyuma y'intambara yabaye mu 2012 ikabera muriki gihugu cya Mali, uduce two hagati mu gihugu, harimo ikibaya cya Dogon na Escarpment ya Bandiagara, byarushijeho kuba bibi. Imitwe y'iterabwoba ikorera muri kariya gace, kandi ihohoterwa hagati y'amoko yaho riba buri munsi.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 2018, uyu mwanya w'ubukerarugendo ntago byemewe cyane kujya muri kariya gace mu bukerarugendo, kandi abashinzwe umutekano muri Mali bazwiho gusubiza inyuma abagerageza kubikora. Muri Werurwe 2018, umutwe witwaje intwaro wagabye igitero kuri hoteri yakundaga abakozi ba Loni mu mujyi wa Bandiagara, ihitana abantu benshi. "}
{"id": "20280", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20280", "title": "Leptis Magna", "text": "Leptis cyangwa Lepcis Magna uzwi kandi ku yandi mazina mu bihe bya kera, wari umujyi ukomeye w'ingoma ya Carthagine na Libya y'Abaroma ku munwa wa Wadi Lebda muri Mediterane.\nUyu mujyi washyizweho nk'umudugudu wa Punic mbere y'imyaka 500 mbere ya Yesu, umujyi wagutse cyane ku ngoma y'Umwami w'Abaroma Septimius Severus(r.\u2009193\u2013211), wavukiye mu mujyi. Legio ya 3 kanama yari ihagaze hano kugirango irinde umujyi ibitero bya Berber. Nyuma y\u2019iseswa rya legiyonali ku butegetsi bwa Gordian III mu 238, umujyi warushijeho gukorerwa ibitero mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 3. Diocletian yagaruye umujyi nk'umurwa mukuru w'intara, kandi wongeye gukura mu iterambere kugeza igihe waguye kuri Vandals mu 439. Yongeye kwinjizwa mu Bwami bw'iburasirazuba mu 533 ariko akomeza kwibasirwa n'ibitero bya Berber kandi ntiyigeze agarura akamaro kahoze. Yaguye mu bitero byab'abayisilamu muri c.\u2009647 hanyuma aratereranwa.\nNyuma yo gutereranwa, umujyi warinzwe ku buryo budasanzwe kuko wari ushyinguwe munsi y\u2019imisozi. Mu myaka yo mu 1920, umujyi wacukuwe n'abacukuzi b'ibyataburuwe mu mataliyani mu gihe U butaliyani bwigarurira Libiya. Amatongo yacyo ari muri Khoms Libiya, iburasirazuba bwa Tripoli. Biri mubibanza byabitswe neza n'Abaroma muri Mediterane.\nAmateka.\nIbihano.\nUmujyi wa Punic washinzwe mu gice cya kabiri cy'ikinyejana cya 7\u00a0BC. Ntabwo uzwi cyane kuri Leptis muri iki gihe, ariko bigaragara ko yari ifite imbaraga zihagije zo guhashya Dorieus yagerageje gushinga ubukoloni bw\u2019Abagereki hafi ya 515\u00a0BC. Kimwe n\u2019imidugudu y\u2019Abapunike, Leptis yabaye umwe mu Bwami bwa Carthaginiya maze igwa mu maboko y'Abaroma itsinzwe na Carthage mu ntambara ya Punic. Leptis yagumye yigenga cyane mu gihe nyuma ya 111\u00a0BC.\nRepubulika y'Abaroma.\nRepubulika y\u2019Abaroma yohereje abakoloni hamwe n\u2019abasirikare bato kugira ngo bagenzure umujyi. Umujyi wateye imbere ndetse yemererwa guhimba amafaranga yacyo mw'ifeza n'umuringa. Mu kwerekana imiterere y\u2019imico, ibiceri byayo byari byanditseho Punic ariko amashusho ya Hercules na Dionysus. Bidatinze, abacuruzi b'Abataliyani batuye muri uwo mujyi maze batangira ubucuruzi bwunguka imbere muri Libiya. Umujyi washingiye ahanini ku burumbuke bw\u2019imirima ikikije iyo, aho hacukuwe imashini nyinshi elayo. Kuri 46\u00a0BC, umusaruro w\u2019amavuta ya elayo wari ku buryo umujyi washoboye gutanga miliyoni eshatu zama pound buri mwaka kuri Julius Sezari nk'umusoro.\nIngoma y'Abaroma.\nLeptis Magna yagumye gutya kugeza ku ngoma y'umwami w'abami w'Abaroma Tiberiyo, igihe umujyi n'akarere kegeranye byinjizwaga mu bwami mu rwego rw'intara ya Afurika. Bidatinze byahindutse umwe mu mijyi iyoboye Afurika y'Abaroma ndetse n'iposita ikomeye. Umujyi wateye imbere byihuse ku butegetsi bw'Abaroma. Ku ngoma ya Nero hubatswe amphitheater. Gutura byazamuwe muri komini muri AD 64 cyangwa 65 no mubu koloni munsi ya Trajan (r.\u200998\u2013117).Umwepiskopi wa mbere uzwi wa Letis Magna yari umupadiri runaka witwa Victor wabaye papa mu 189 \nLeptis yageze ku ntera ikomeye cyane guhera muri AD\u00a0193, nk'umujyi w'umwami w'abami Septimius Severus. Septimius yatoneshaga umujyi yavukiyemo kuruta indi mijyi yose y'intara, kandi inyubako n'ubutunzi yawutunze byatumye Leptis Magna umujyi wa gatatu w'ingenzi muri Afurika, uhanganye na Carthage na Alegizandiriya. Muri AD\u00a0205, we n'umuryango w'abami basuye umujyi kandi baha icyubahiro gikomeye. Mu mpinduka Severus yazanye harimo gushiraho ihuriro rishya ryiza no kongera kubaka dock. Icyambu gisanzwe cyari gifite impengamiro yo gushonga, ariko impinduka za Severan zatumye ibi birushaho kuba bibi, kandi ibibuga by'iburasirazuba birarinzwe neza cyane, kubera ko bitakoreshejwe gake.\nLeptis yateye imbere binyuze mu bucuruzi bwambukiranya ibicuruzwa bitandukanye muri Sahara bifite agaciro, birimo amahembe y'inzovu, inyamaswa zo mu gasozi ku kibuga cya gladiator, umukungugu wa zahabu, karubone, ibiti by'agaciro nka enbony, n'amababa ya ostrich.\nLeptis muri iki gihe yarikabije. mu gihe cya Crisis yomu kinyejana cya 3 igihe ubucuruzi bwagabanutse ku buryo bugaragara, akamaro ka Leptis Magna nako karagabanutse, kandi hagati mu kinyejana cya 4 rwagati, ndetse na mbere yuko cyangizwa na tsunami 365, igice kinini cyuyu mujyi cyari cyaratereranywe. Ammianus Marcellinus avuga ko ikibazo cyarushijeho gukomera na guverineri w\u2019Abaroma wamunzwe na ruswa witwa Romanus, wasabye ruswa kugira ngo arinde uyu mujyi mu gihe cy'igitero gikomeye cy\u2019amoko. Umujyi wangiritse ntushobora kwishyura ibi kandi bitotombera umwami Valentiniya I. Romanus yahise atanga ruswa mu rukiko ategura ko intumwa za Leptan zihanwa \"kubera ibirego by'ibinyoma\". yishimiye ubuzima bushya butangira ku ngoma y'umwami Theodosius I.\nUbwami bwa Vandal.\nMu mwaka wa 439, Leptis Magna hamwe n'indi mijyi yose ya Tripolitania bagengwaga na Vandals igihe umwami wabo, Gaiseric yafataga Carthage mu Baroma akayigira umurwa mukuru. Ikibabaje ni uko ejo hazaza ha Leptis Magna, Gaiseric yategetse ko inkuta z'umujyi zasenywa kugira ngo abaturage bacyo batigomeka ku butegetsi bwa Vandal. Abaturage ba Leptis na Vandals bombi bishyuye igiciro cyinshi kuri AD\u00a0523 mugihe itsinda ry'abateraga Berber birukanye umujyi.\nIngoma ya Byzantine.\nBelisariyo,jenerali w'Umwami Justinian I, yigaruriye Leptis Magna mu izina ry'ingoma y'Abaroma nyuma y'imyaka icumi, maze mu mwaka wa 533-4 yongera kwinjizwa mu bwami. Leptis yabaye umurwa mukuru w'intara y'Ubwami bw'iburasirazuba, ariko ntiyigeze akira irimbuka ryatewe na Berber. Mu mwaka wa 544, munsi ya perefegitura ya Sergiyo, umujyi wibasiwe cyane n\u2019imiryango ya Berber, kandi nyuma yo kugira icyo ugeraho, Sergiyo yagabanutse asubira muri uwo mujyi, ihuriro ry\u2019imiryango ya Leuathae rikambika hanze y\u2019irembo risaba kwishyurwa. Sergius yemereye abadepite mirongo inani mu mujyi kugira ngo bagaragaze ibyo basaba, ariko igihe Sergius yimukiye mu nama, yafunzwe n\u2019umwenda n\u2019umudepite umwe, yuzura abandi. Ibi byateje umupolisi w\u2019umuzamu wa perefe kwica uwo umudepite urambika amaboko kuri perefe, bikaviramo ubwicanyi rusange. Abadage bakiriye igitero simusiga maze Sergius ahatirwa guta Leptis asubira i Carthage.\nIntsinzi ya kisilamu.\nMu kinyejana cya 6, umujyi wari umukirisitu wuzuye mu myaka icumi 565-578 nyuma ya Yesu, abamisiyonari b'Abakristo bo muri Leptis Magna ndetse batangiye kwimukira mu moko ya Berber kugera mu majyepfo ya Fezzan mu butayu bwa Libiya maze bahindura Garamantes. Mu kinyejana cya 10, umujyi wa Al-Khums wari wuzuye.\nUbucukuzi.\nKugeza uyu munsi, ikibanza cya Leptis Magna niho hari amatongo amwe n'amwe atangaje yo mu gihe cy'Abaroma.\nIgice cy'urusengero rwa kera cyazanywe I Leptis Magna munzu ndangamurage y'Ubwongereza mu 1816 gishyirwa munzu ya cyami ya Fort Belvedere mu Bwongereza mu 1826. Ubu kiri mu gice cya Parike nini ya Windsor. Amatongo aherereye ku nkombe y\u2019amajyepfo y\u2019amazi ya Virginie n\u2019umuhanda wa Blacknest hafi y\u2019isangano ry\u2019umuhanda A30 London na Wentworth Drive.\nIgihe Abataliyani bigarurira Libiya mu ntangiriro y'ikinyejana cya 20, byatwaye imbaraga nyinshi mu kuvumbura Leptis Magna.mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 1930, ubushakashatsi bw\u2019ibyataburuwe bwashoboye kongera kwerekana ibisigazwa byashyinguwe hafi y\u2019umujyi wose. Ikinyejana cya 4 kugeza ku cya 3BC\u00a0necropolis yaje kuboneka munsi y'ikinamico y'Abaroma.\nMuri Kamena 2005, byagaragaye ko abahanga mu bucukumbuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo bo muri kaminuza ya Hamburg bakoraga ku nkombe za Libiya ubwo bavumburaga uburebure bwa metero 30 z'uburebure bwa mosaika eshanu zakozwe mu kinyejana cya 1 cyangwa icya 2. Mosaika yerekana mu buryo budasobanutse bwerekana umurwanyi urwana n'impongo, abasore bane barwanira ikimasa cyo mw'ishyamba hasi, hamwe na gladiator iruhuka mu munaniro kandi yitegereza uwo bahanganye yiciwe. Mosaika yashushanyije inkuta za pisine ikonje muri \"balneae\" muri villa y'Abaroma i Wadi Lebda muri Leptis Magna. Mosaic ya gladiator izwi n\u2019intiti nkimwe mu ngero nziza cyane zerekana ibihangano bya mozayike byigeze kubaho - \"igihangano cyagereranywa n\u2019ubuziranenge na Alexandre Mosaic muri Pompeii.Mosaika yavumbuwe mu mwaka wa 2000 ariko ibikwa mu ibanga kugira ngo birinde gusahura. Kuri ubu barerekanwa munzu ndangamurage ya Leptis.\nHari amakuru avuga ko Leptis Magna yakoreshejwe nk'igifuniko cya tanki n'imodoka za gisirikare n'ingabo zishyigikiye Kadhafi mu gihe cy'intambara ya mbere y'abanyagihugu yo muri Libiya, Nyuma gato y'intambara, umuhanga mu bucukumbuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo wo muri Libiya, Hafed Walda, yatangaje ko Leptis Magna, hamwe n'ikigo cya Rasaimergib kiri hafi na Tripolis yo mu burengerazuba bwa Sabratha, kugeza ubu nta gihombo kigaragara\" cyatewe no kurwanira ku butaka cyangwa ibisasu byakozwe n'ingabo mpuzamahanga.\nHagati y\u2019intambara ya 2 y'Abanyalibiya no kubura inkunga ya leta ndetse n\u2019amahanga ku rubuga, abaturage batuye muri ako gace biyemeje kurinda no kubungabunga Leptis Magna.\nImihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.\nKubera ko ziherereye ku nkombe, amatongo ya Leptis Magna ashobora kwibasirwa n'inyanja. Mu mwaka wa 2022, raporo y\u2019isuzuma rya gatandatu rya IPCC y'abashyize ku rutonde rw\u2019ahantu ndangamuco nyafurika hashobora kwibasirwa n\u2019umwuzure hamwe n\u2019isuri ku nkombe mu mpera z'ikinyejana, ariko ari uko imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere yakurikiye RCP 8.5, ibyo bikaba ari ibintu byerekana ko imyuka ihumanya ikirere ikomeza kwiyongera 4 \u00b0 C., kandi ntibikiboneka ko bishoboka cyane. Ibindi, byumvikana cyane bituma ubushyuhe buke bugabanuka bityo inyanja ikagabanuka: nyamara, inyanja yakomeza kwiyongera mu myaka igera ku 10,000 munsi yabyo bose. Nubwo ubushyuhe bugarukira kuri 1.5\u00a0\u00b0 C, kuzamuka kw'inyanja kw'isi biracyateganijwe kurenga nyuma y'imyaka 2000 (n'ubushyuhe bwo hejuru buzabona ubwiyongere bukabije icyo gihe), kubwibyo birenga 2100 kuzamuka kw'inyanja munsi ya RCP 8.5 (~ hamwe na.\u200b "}
{"id": "20281", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20281", "title": "Sabratha", "text": "Sabratha mu Karere ka Zawiya muri Libiya, yari mu burengerazuba cyane mu mijyi itatu ya kera ya Tripolis y'Abaroma, hamwe na Oea na Leptis Magna. Kuva mu 2001 kugeza 2007 wari umurwa mukuru w'icyahoze ari Akarere ka Sabratha wa Sorman. Iherereye ku nkombe ya Mediterane hafi iburengerazuba bwa Tripoli igezweho. Ikibanza cy\u2019ubucukuzi bwa kera cyanditsweho nk'umurage ndangamurage wa UNESCO mu 1982.\nSabratha ya kera.\nIcyambu cya Sabratha cyashinzwe, hafi 500\u00a0BGC, Abanyafenisiya bacuruza-poste yaTsabratan. Icyambu cyabaye isoko yo muri Fenisiya ku bicuruzwa byo mu gihugu cy'Afurika.Abagereki babyise Sabrata hamwe na Abrotonon. Nyuma y\u2019urupfu rwa Fenisiya, Sabratha yaguye mu rwego rwa Carthage. \nNyuma y\u2019Intambara ya Punic, Sabratha yabaye umwe mu bwami bwa Numidian bwabayeho igihe gito cya Massinissa mbere yuko yomekwa muri Repubulika y'Abaroma nk'intara ya Afurika Nova mu kinyejana cya mbere ya Yesu. Nyuma yaje gutunganwa no kongera kubakwa mu kinyejana cya 2 n'icya 3\u00a0CE. Umwami Septimius Severus yavukiye hafi ya Leptis Magna, kandi Sabratha yageze ku rwego rwo hejuru cyane ku ngoma ya Severans, igihe yikubye hafi kabiri ubunini. Umujyi wangiritse cyane kubera umutingito mu kinyejana cya 4, cyane umutingito wa 365. Yayobowe n'ubwami bwa Vandal mu kinyejana cya 5, igice kinini cy'umujyi kiratereranwa. yishimiye ububyutse buto ku butegetsi bwa Byzantine, igihe hubakwaga amatorero menshi n'urukuta rwo kwirinda. Umujyi wari urimo umwepiskopi. Mu myaka ijana nyuma y\u2019abayisilamu bateye Maghreb, ubucuruzi bwari bwarahindutse ku bindi byambu maze Sabratha agabanuka mu mudugudu.\nUmujyi ubamo kaminuza ya Sabratha. Wefaq Sabratha ni club y'umupira w'amaguru, ikinira muri Stade ya Sabratha."}
{"id": "20282", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20282", "title": "Cyrene, Libiya", "text": "Cyrene, yiswe Kyrene, yari ubukoloni bwa kera bw'Abagereki n'umujyi w'Abaroma hafi ya Shahhat y'ubu mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Libiya muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru. Wari igice cya Pentapolis, itsinda ry'ingenzi ry'imijyi itanu yo mukarere, kandi ryahaye ako gace izina rya kera na kera rya Cyrenaica.\nCyrene iryamye k'umusozi wa Jebel Akhdar. Ibisigazwa by'ubucukuzi bwa hegitari nyinshi kandi birimo insengero nyinshi zubatswe, stoas, theatre, ubwiherero, amatorero, hamwe n\u2019amazu ya palasitike. Umujyi ukikijwe na Necropolis ya Cyrene. Kuva mu 1982, ni Umurage w\u2019isi wa UNESCO. Icyambu cy'umujyi cyari Apolloniya (Marsa Sousa), giherereye nko mu mu majyaruguru.\nUyu mujyi witiriwe Apollo na etymom w'icyamamare, Cyrene n'Abagereki ubwabo ariko birashoboka ko byakoronijwe n'abimukira baturutse I Thera mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya karindwi mbere ya Yesu. Mu mizo ya mbere yategekwaga n'ingoma y'abami yitwa Battiads, bakize kandi bakomeye bitewe n'imivumba yagiye ikurikirana y'abinjira n'abasohoka no kohereza amafarashi na silifium, n'ibihingwa by\u2019imiti. Mu kinyejana cya gatanu mbere ya Yesu, bari bamaze kwagura indi mijyi ya Cyrenaica. Yabaye icyicaro cya cyrenaics, ishuri rya filozofiya mu kinyejana cya kane mbere ya Yesu, ryashinzwe na Aristippus, umwigishwa wa Sokalate. Mu gihe cy'Abagiriki, umujyi wasimburanaga hagati yo kuba mu Misiri ya Ptol\u00e9m\u00e9e n'umurwa mukuru w'ubwami bwigenga. Wari kandi ihuriro rikomeye ry'Abayahudi. Mu mwaka wa 96 mbere ya Yesu, yanyuze muri repubulika y'abaroma ihinduka igice cy'intara ya kirete na cyrenaica. Umujyi washenywe n\u2019abarwanyi b'Abayahudi mu mwaka wa 115 nyuma ya Yesu mu gihe cyo kwigomeka kw'abadiaspola, kandi wubatswe buhoro mu kinyejana cyakurikiyeho. Umutingito wabaye mu 262 na 365 washenye umujyi, ariko gutura bimwe byakomeje mu gihe cya mbere cya Byzantine ndetse n\u2019abayisilamu bigarurira Maghreb mu 642, nyuma y\u2019aho hantu haratereranwa kugeza hashyizweho ikigo cya gisirikare cy\u2019Ubutaliyani kuri icyo kibanza mu 1913. Ubucukuzi burakomeje kuva icyo gihe.\nAmateka.\nAbantu babaye muri Cyrenaica kuva muri Palaeolithic. hariho ibimenyetso bimwe byo gutura mu buvumo buri munsi ya Acropolis ishobora kubanziriza gutura mu Bugereki. Birashoboka koabanya Mino na Mycenaeans basuye Cyrene mu gihe cya Bronze, kubera ko iri mu nzira yoroshye yo mu nyanja iva muri Aegean yerekeza muri Egiputa, ariko ibimenyetso byonyine bya kera byerekana ko ibyo ari ibintu bitandukanye byavumbuwe ku gicaniro gito cya Minoan hamwe n'ikidodo cya Minoan, gishobora kuba cyarazanywe nyuma. \nUrufatiro.\nUmugani w'Abagereki wanditswe bwa mbere na Pindar mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya gatanu mbere ya Yesu uvuga ko imana Apollo yakunze umuhigi Cyrene ikamuzana muri Libiya, ari naho yabyariye umuhungu Aristaeus.Imigenzo y\u2019amateka y\u2019Abagereki, yavuzwe mu \"mateka\" ya Herodote no mu kinyejana cya kane mbere ya Yesu yabonetse I Cyrene, ivuga ko itsinda ry\u2019Abagereki ba Cretan, birukanwe muri Sparta maze batura ku kirwa cya Thera, bashinze Cyrene mu mwaka wa 631 mbere ya Yesu, bayobowe na Battus wa mbere, babisabwe na Oracle ya Delphi. Imigenzo imwe n'imwe ivuga ko abimukira bavuye IThera kubera inzara, abandi kubera intambara y'abenegihugu. benshi bavuga ko abakoloni babanje gutura ku kirwa cya Aziris (iburasirazuba bwa Derna) mbere yo kwimukira I Cyrene.Amateka y'izi nkuru ntashidikanywaho, cyane igitekerezo cy'uko Thera yari \"umujyi wa nyina wa Cyrene\" wenyine. Umubano n'indi mijyi, nka Sparta na Samos,uvugwa mu nkuru zifatizo, nturamenyekana. \nIbimenyetso by'ubucukuzi bwakuwe muri icyo kibanza, cyane cyane ibisigazwa by\u2019ubutaka, byemeza ko gutura mu Bugereki byatangiye hagati mu kinyejana cya karindwi mbere ya Yesu. Ububumbyi bwa mbere bukomoka kuri Thera, Sparta, na Samos, ariko na Rhodes. Agace ka mbere ko guturamo kari umusozi urambuye iburasirazuba kuva Acropolis kugera Agora, ariko umujyi wagutse vuba mu burasirazuba. Ubuturo bwera bwa Apollo mu majyaruguru ya Acropolis, I Demeter mu majyepfo, na Zewusi mu burasirazuba byose bisubira mu cya karindwi cyangwa icya gatandatu mbere ya Yesu. Ubucukuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo bwerekana ko ahandi hantu henshi muri Cyrenaica, nka Apolloniya, Euesperides, na Taucheira byatuwe icyarimwe na Cyrene."}
{"id": "20283", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20283", "title": "Adrar des Ifoghas", "text": "Adrar des Ifoghas ni Imisozi iherereye mu karere ka Kidal muri Mali, igera muri Alijeriya. Ifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 250.000 (kilometero kare 97.000).\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nAgace ka Adrar des Ifoghas karangwa n'ubugari, butagaragara kandi bwuzuyemo ibimera byinshi bya granite bimwe muribyo bikaba byarangiritse. Ibibaya bya massif bifunguye mu kibaya cya Tamesna mu burasirazuba, kuri fosisi ya Telemsi mu burengerazuba, mu kibaya cy'iburengerazuba cy'ikibaya cya Azaouak mu majyepfo na Tanezrouft mu majyaruguru. Gutura muri kariya gace harimo Kidal, Aguel'hoc, Boghassa, Essouk na Tessalit.\nAdrar des Ifoghas izwi nka \"Adagh\". \"Adrar\" ni ijambo rya Berber risobanura umusozi, naho \"Ifogha\" ni izina rikomoka ku muryango wa Tuareg ukomeye, \" Kel Ifoghas \", wiganje muri ako karere uko ibisekuruza byagiye bisimburana. Kimwe na Tuareg benshi, Kel Ifoghas abatuye kuruwo musozi abakaba bakunda korora ingamiya, ihene n'intama kugirango bibatunge kandi bigurishwe.\nAka gace gakungahaye ku murage wi bisigazwa bya kera, cyane cyane ibishushanyo byerekana amabuye agaragaza abagabo bahiga, ubuhinzi n'ubworozi bw'inka. Igikanka cyumugabo wa Asselar (BP) nacyo cyabonetse muri ako gace na Wladimir Besnard na Th\u00e9odore Monod. Adrar des Ifoghas nayo yamenyekanye cyane murugendo.\nImisigiti ya Adrar des Ifoghas.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe na Patrice Cressier bigaragaza kandi bigatanga ubumenyi ku bijyanye n\u2019imyubakire n\u2019umuco by\u2019imisigiti ine yo muri Adrar des Ifoghas, mu majyaruguru ya Gao na Agadez.\nUmusigiti wa Tefis, ushobora kuba warubatswe ahagana mu 1480, wari ufite icyanya kinini mu kigo cyera cya oval kandi wari wanditsweho n\u2019amagambo mato mato yo mu kinyejana cya cumi na gatanu. Undi musigiti uzwi cyane mu mujyi wa In-Teduq, washinzwe ahagana mu 1430 na \u02bfUthman al-Mawhub bin Iflawas, wari ufite inyubako nkuru igabanyijemo inzira eshatu zahujwe na qibla. Kubwamahirwe, yarimbuwe nubukazi hagati yikinyejana cya cumi na gatandatu.\nUmusigiti wa Shi-n Wasagharan, waranzwe n'inzira ebyiri zisa na Qibla, guhera mu kinyejana cya cumi na gatandatu, zishingiye ku bimenyetso bifatika byatanzwe na necropolises hafi. Hagati aho, umusigiti wa Es-Suk, uherereye mu mujyi wa Tadmekka rw'agati rwagati, wari ufite salle y'urukiramende ipima metero 23.5 na metero 15.5 kandi igabanyijemo inzira eshanu zisa na qibla. \nAmateka ya vuba.\nMu 2013, ibibaya binini byahindutse ubuhungiro ku barwanyi ba kisilamu bahunga ubutabazi bw\u2019Abafaransa mu ntambara yo muri Mali. Ku ya 22 Gashyantare, intambara yabereye muri Adrar des Ifoghas, ihitana Abanyakadani 25, barimo Abdel Aziz Hassane Adam, barimo umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ingabo zidasanzwe za Tchad muri Mali, hamwe n\u2019abayisilamu 93. Ku ya 12 Werurwe, intambara yabereye mu mudugudu wa Tigharghar, ihitana umusirikare umwe wa Tchad n'Abayisilamu 6. Intambara yatumye Abanyakadiyani bafata umudugudu."}
{"id": "20284", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20284", "title": "Gutegeka imisozi", "text": "Imisozi ya Manding ni agace k'imisozi miremire muri Mali, gahuza umupaka w\u2019iburengerazuba na Gineya kugera ku birometero 50 mu burengerazuba bwa Bamako, umurwa mukuru wa Mali. Bagera kuri ukaba uri hejuru yinyanja. Kangaba, n'inzu y'abaturage ba Mandinka, iherereye munsi yimisozi. \nuyu musozi ufite Ikirere kigizwe n'ibuye ry'umucanga, ukagira n'uruhande rw'amabuye akomeye n\u2019imisozi ukunda kw'ibasirwa n'isuri. Bimwe muri ibyo bibumbano byitiriwe abaturage baho, nka Butte y\u2019umugore winangiye, bivugwa ko ari umugore wanze kongera gushakisha umugabo we wabuze maze ahanishwa guhindurwa ibuye. "}
{"id": "20285", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20285", "title": "Umusozi wa Chaillu Massif", "text": "Imisozi ya Chaillu ni imisozi izenguruka mu majyepfo ya Gabon hamwe na Repubulika iharanira demokarasi ya Kongo yitiriwe umushakashatsi w\u2019umufaransa Paul Du Chaillu, wakoze ubushakashatsi kandi yandika muri kariya karere mu kinyejana cya 19.\nUmusozi wa Chaillu ufite impinga ndende ni Mont Iboundji (980m), na Mt Mimongo (m 1020). Urutare rwurwego ni ubutayu mu nkomoko za Chaillu.\nUru ruhererekane niho hazamuka inzuzi nyinshi zirimo Louesse, Ogoulou, Ikoy, Lolo, Lekoko, Lebombi, na Offoue."}
