{"id": "20287", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20287", "title": "Ikibaya cya Bat\u00e9k\u00e9", "text": "Ikibaya cya Bat\u00e9k\u00e9 giherereye hafi y'umupaka uhuza Repubulika ya Kongo na Gabon. Mu bihugu byombi yahaye izina amashami:\nikibaya cya Bateke gifite ubuso bwa bugera hagati ya metero 550 na 830, kandi kikaba gikungahaye kuri manganese. Ikibaya cya Bateke ni agace ka kera k'ibirunga.\nImigezi nyinshi inyura muri ako gace, harimo uruzi rwa Niari, rutemba muri Kongo, Ogooue, Mpassa, Ndjoumou, Lekabi na Lekey Inzuzi zitemba muri Gabon."}
{"id": "20288", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20288", "title": "Ikibaya cya Mambilla", "text": "Ikibaya cya Mambilla ni ikibaya muri giherereye muri Leta ya Taraba ya Nijeriya. Ikibaya cya Mambilla gifite impuzandengo ya hejuru y'inyanja, ikagira ikibaya kinini muri Nijeriya. imwe mu midugudu yacyo iherereye ku misozi ifite byibura hejuru yinyanja. Imisozi imwe yo mubibaya no hafi yayo ni nimuremure, nka Gang cyangwa Chappal Waddi ifite uburebure bwa hejuru y'inyanja. N'umusozi muremure muri Nijeriya no muri Afrika y'uburengerazuba. Ikibaya cya Mambilla gipima hafi ku burebure bwacyo bugoramye; ni ubugari kandi bugarukira kuri escarpment igera kuri hejuru ahantu hamwe. Ikibaya gifite ubuso bungana na kilometero. \nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nIkibaya cya Mambilla giherereye mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Leta ya Taraba muri Nijeriya munsi y\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019ibanze bwa Sardauna. Ikibaya cya Mambilla ni kamwe mu turere twinshi two muri leta ya Taraba. Hano hari imijyi myinshi kuri plateau, nini ya Gembu. Ikibaya gifite ibice byacyo byo mu majyepfo no mu burasirazuba bihagaze ku mupaka wa Kameruni, mu gihe ibisigaye byo mu majyaruguru no mu burengerazuba bwabyo biri muri Nijeriya. Ikibaya cya Mambilla gifite imisozi miremire cyane, ni ikibaya gifite inzira nyabagendwa Ikibaya gitwikirijwe n'imisozi n'ubutaka hamwe na granite rimwe na rimwe. Ikibaya cyatandukanijwe ninzuzi nyinshi, cyane cyane uruzi rwa Donga n\u2019umugezi wa Taraba, byombi bifite amasoko kuri / kuva mu Mambilla.\nImiterere ya Mambilla.\nIbimera byo mu kibaya bigizwe n\u2019ibyatsi bito kandi ibiti bidahari bigaragara ko usibye amashyamba byatewe n'abantu aho ryatewe n\u2019abakoloni b\u2019Abadage mu gihe cy\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019Abadage bayoboye Kameruni (nko mu 1906-1915) hamwe na gahunda za leta zo muri Nigeriya zo gutera ibiti. harimo ibimera ni cyatsi gito, cya mahmal gisa nicyatsi kizwi hano nka nyakatsi \"gwur\". Ni ikirango gikomeye cy'imihango y'idini gakondo. Ikibaya nicyo karere cyonyine cya Nijeriya gikura igihingwa cyicyayi ku rugero runini kandi hari imirima myinshi yicyayi, nubwo umurenge wo murako gace utaratera imbere. Ikaba kandi ibamo parike y\u2019igihugu ya Gashaka Gumti, ikaba ari parike nini, n\u2019akarere karinzwe muri Nijeriya yose, ndetse n\u2019ishyamba rya Majang rizwi ku izina rya Ngel Nyaki Forest Reserve, ryombi rikaba rifite ibimera bidasanzwe kandi byangirika by\u2019ibimera byo muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba / Hagati ndetse n\u2019ubwoko bw\u2019inyamaswa byanduye muri ako karere.\nIgiti cya eucalyptus nicyo giti cy'iganje kitiriwe eucalyptus uyu mugabo wakoze amashyamba biturutse ku guhuza byoroshye n\u2019igiti cya eucalyptus ku burebure hamwe n\u2019imiterere ikonje y\u2019ikirere no mu kibaya. Ubwinshi bw'ibyatsi bitoshye ku kibaya byakwegereye byakuruye inka nyinshi ziza kuharishiriza, kuva mu gihe cy'ubutegetsi bw'Ubwongereza bikaba byaragize ingaruka ku bimera byo mu kibaya. Ibi byaviriyemo kurisha cyane no gutwarwa n\u2019isuri ku kibaya kandi byateje ibibazo hagati y\u2019abashumba b\u2019inka, bitwa Fulanis n\u2019abasangwabutaka, Mambila.\nikibaya cya Mambilla gifite umwimerere, kandi kitiriwe abaturage bo murako gace. abaturage ba Mambilla. Agacegafite ubuso bwa 60.000 km2 ka Mambilla gahana imbibi n\u2019umupaka hano byagaragaye ko karimo ibisigisigi bya \"Bantu bagumye mu rugo\" kuko igice kinini cy\u2019abavuga Bantu bimukiye mu karere (reba kwaguka kwa Bantu). \nKuva Abongereza bahigarurira na nyuma yaho, habaye abimukira mu yandi matsinda arimo Yamba, Fulani n'imiryango y'ubucuruzi ya Igbo, Wimbum (Kambu), Hausa na Banso. Muri bo, Yamba yonyine niyo yashinze imidugudu igera kuri 4 imaze kwimuka. Abandi baturage bashya binjiye ntibasaba ubutaka bwa basekuruza, ahubwo ni abimukira cyangwa abimukira mu kazi badafite imidugudu ya kera cyangwa abakurambere babo. Imidugudu yose ya Banso na Kambu (Wimbum) igomba kuboneka muri Repubulika ya Kameruni gusa, igiye iri kure cyane y'umupaka wa Nigeriya. Umubare munini wabaturage ba Mambilla Plateau bavuga Mambilla nkururimi rwabo rwa kavukire arirwo rwa mbere. Icyongereza ni ururimi rwemewe muri iki gihe, mu gihe Fulfulde (ururimi rwa Fulani, rwatangijwe mu Bwongereza) yakoreshejwe nk'ururimi rw'ubucuruzi mu bihe bya none.\nUbukirisitu n'Ubuyisilamu ni amadini akomeye muri iki gihe, amaze kwimika buhoro buhoro Iyobokamana gakondo rya Mambilla ryari rishingiye kuri gahunda ya Suu, iryo rikaba ariryo dini ryiganje mbere yuko haza abamisiyonari b'Abakristo (guhera mu myaka ya za 1920) hamwe na Hausa na Wawa. Aya madini mashya yagaragaye cyane nyuma y'imyaka ya za 1960."}
{"id": "20289", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20289", "title": "Ghadames", "text": "Ghadames, n'umujyi wa Oasis mu karere ka Nalut mu karere ka Tripolitania ukaba uherereye mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Libiya..\nGhadames, uzwi ku izina ry'isaro ryo mu butayu, uhagarara muri oasisi. Ni umwe mu mijyi ya kera yabanjirije Sahara kandi ni urugero rwiza rwo gutura gakondo. Imyubakire y'imbere mu gihugu irangwa no kugabana ibikorwa bihagaritse hasi ikoreshwa mu bubiko,igorofa ya mbere ni iy'umuryango, hejuru y'inzira zitwikiriye zirema hafi ya rezo yo munsi y'ubutaka bw'inzira nyabagendwa; kandi, hejuru, amaterasi y'indinganire yagenewe abagore. \nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nGhadames ireshya hafi mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bwa Tripoli, hafi y'umupaka wa Alijeriya na Tuniziya. Ghadames ihana imbibi n'intara ya Illizi, Alijeriya na Guverineri wa Tataouine, Tuniziya.\nOasisi ituwe n'abaturage bagera ku 10,000,cyane Berber. Igice cya kera cy'umujyi kizengurutswe n'urukuta rw'umujyi, cyatangajwe ko ari umurage w'isi wa UNESCO. Buri miryango irindwi yahoze ituye muri kariya gace k'umujyi yari ifite akarere kayo, buriwese ukaba wari ufite ahantu rusange hashobora kubera ibirori.\nAmateka.\nHasabwe ko hashingiwe ku bimenyetso by'ubucukuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo, ko ako gace katuwe kuva mu kinyagihumbi cya 4 mbere ya Yesu, kandi ko ari kamwe mu turere twa cyera cyane mbere ya Sahara. Ibihe byacyo hafi y'isoko y'amazi hagati y'ubutayu byari kuba ahantu h'ingenzi ku bantu bose bashaka gutura muri kariya gace.\nInyandiko za mbere zanditswe zivuga kuri Ghadames zanditswe mu gihe cy\u2019Abaroma, igihe gutura kwari kuzwi nka Cydamus, aho Ghadames ya none yakomotse ku izina ryayo. Mu kinyejana cya mbere ya Yesu, umutware w\u2019Abaroma Lucius Cornelius Balbus yateye Cydamus ku ngoma y'umwami Augustus. z\u2019Abaroma zashinzwe ku ngoma ya Septimiyo Severus, kandi umwami w'abami ashobora kuba yarasuye uwo mudugudu ahagana mu mwaka wa 202 nyuma ya Yesu.\nMu kinyejana cya 6,abaturage bamaze guhinduka abakirisitu n'abamisiyonari ba Byzantine. Yabaye igihome gikomeye cy'ubuyobe bwa Donatiste kugeza igihe yigaruriwe n'Abarabu b'Abayisilamu.\nMu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 7,Ghadames yategekwaga n'abarabu b'Abayisilamu. Abaturage bahise bahindukirira Islam kandi Ghadames bagize uruhare runini nk'ishingiro ry'ubucuruzi bwambukiranya muri Sahara kugeza mu kinyejana cya 19.\nUmuhanga mu bumenyi bw'isi mu kinyejana cya 12 Abu Hamid al-Gharnati yashyizemo Ghadam mu bihugu bya Sudani (ni ukuvuga ibihugu by'abirabura), hypothesis Saad ibona ko bishoboka, kubera ko Ghadamis yahoraga ifite abimukira bamuhagarariraga ITimbuktu.\nGhadamis wari umujyi ukomeye mu bucuruzi bw'abacakara ba Sahara. \nEtymology.\nImyitwarire y'izina \"Ghadames\" ifitanye isano rya hafi n'inkomoko y'abasangwabutaka. iri zina ryakomotse ku moko yo mu bwoko bwa Garamantes ya kera, na bo ubwabo bakomoka kuri Tehenu abaturage ba kera bo muri Libiya ndetse n'abaturage ba mbere batuye ku nkombe za Afurika y'Amajyaruguru, kuva muri Maroc kugera i Levant (mbere yuko abateye binjira mu karere). Dazaga-Annaga-Tedaga n'izina ryabo rya kera ni Gara-umuryango wa Garamantes witwaga Tedamansi. Umuhanga mu bumenyi bw'isi mu Bugereki Ptol\u00e9m\u00e9e yasanze ubwoko bwa Tedamansi hagati y'uturere twa Tripolitania na Fezzan, agaragaza ko bahari muri ako gace kazahinduka Ghadames. Izina Tedamansi ryangijwe n\u2019Abaroma cyangwa Abadage bateye kugira ngo bakore izina Cydamus, ari naryo ryahaye izina Ghadames. Ijambo Amazagh rikomoka kuri Toubou, aho risobanura \" abantu \" naho \" zagh \" risobanura \" inkambi.\" Mu mvugo ya Toubou Dazaga, ibi bisobanurwa mu buryo butaziguye \u201cabantu-bakambitse,\u201d mu gihe mu mvugo ya Toubou Tedaga bigaragara ko ari Zaghna (zagh = inkambi, na = abantu), bisobanura kandi ijambo \u201c abantu-nkambi \u201d kandi aya magambo yavuzwe mu bwami bwa Kanem-Borno bwatangiye mu kinyejana cya 7 nk'uko byavuzwe na Palmer. \n1900s - ubungubu.\nMu Kwakira 1911, nyuma gato y'intambara yo mu Butaliyani na Turukiya, Ghadames yigaruriwe n'abasirikare b'Abataliyani bavaga ITripoli. Icyakora Ubutaliyani bwafashe uyu mujyi bwahagaritswe inshuro nyinshi kugeza muri Kamena 1915, igihe umujenerali wazamutse muri Libiya yose yatumaga abapolisi bo mu Butaliyani basubira I Ghadames berekeza mu gihome cya Tripoli. Kugenzura neza umujyi byagarutsweho mu Kuboza 1918, ariko kwigomeka muri Fezzan byatumye Ghadames y'ihutirwa kugeza mu 1923.\nMu mwaka wi 1943, ingabo z\u2019Abafaransa zigenga zigaruriye Ghadames n\u2019akarere kayikikije mu majyepfo y\u2019icyahoze ari ubukoloni bw\u2019Ubutaliyani bwa Libiya, zishyiraho Intara ya gisirikare ya Fezzan-Ghadames kugeza igihe Libiya yigengaga mu mwaka wi 1951. Ghadames yagizwe umurwa mukuru w\u2019icyo gihe.\nMu mwaka wa 70, guverinoma yubatse amazu mashya hanze y\u2019umujyi wa kera. nyamara, abaturage benshi basubira mu gice cya cyera cyumujyi mu gihe cy'izuba, kuko imyubakire yacyo itanga uburinzi bwiza k'ubushyuhe.\nMuri icyo gihe, umuyobozi Moustapha Akkad yahisemo Ghadames nk'ahantu hafatirwa amashusho y\u2019imbere mu mujyi wa Medina muri the message na filime y\u2019ikinamico y\u2019ubuyisilamu.\nMu ntambara yo muri Libiya, ingabo z'inama y'inzibacyuho zinjiye muri uyu mujyi ku ya 30 Kanama 2011, yari yagoswe n'ingabo za NTC kuva amakimbirane yatangira. Kugeza mu 2011, umujyi wagenzurwaga n'ingabo zigenga za Tuareg. Nyuma yo gufatwa n\u2019ingabo z\u2019igihugu cya Libiya, umuryango wa Tuareg wose wahatiwe guhunga mu gikorwa cyo guhanagura amoko. "}
{"id": "20290", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20290", "title": "Umusozi wa Mandara", "text": "Imisozi ya Mandara ni ikirunga gifite ubugari bugera ku 190km (hafi 120mi) hafi y\u2019amajyaruguru y'umupaka wa Kameruni na Nijeriya, kuva ku ruzi rwa Benue mu majyepfo.\nAka karere gatuwe n'abaturage abavuga cyane cyane indimi za Tchad, harimo n'aba Mofu ndetse n'amoko ya Kirdi. \nUbushakashatsi bunini bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo bwakorewe ku misozi ya Mandara, harimo no gukorera ahitwa Diy-Gid-Biy (DGB). \nUtuntu n'utundi.\nImisozi ya Mandara yashinzwe mu myaka yaza miriyoni ishize ubwo isahani ryo ku mugabane w\u2019urutare rwo munsi munsi y\u2019umugabane n'ubutayu bw' Afurika yazamutse, igacikamo ibice kandi igacikamo ibice kuko yasunitswe hejuru. Muri icyo gihe ikirere cyari cyuzuye cyane, ku buryo imvura nyinshi yaguye ikora imigezi myinshi inyura muri iyo mvune, ikayigaragaza cyane kandi yagutse, bigatuma ubutaka bugaragara cyane. \nIbikorwa by'ibirunga nabyo byagize uruhare mukurema ibirunga. Kuruka kwa lava byashizeho imishwarara y'ibirunga umuyaga wacyo amaherezo ukomoka hamwe na magma ikomera. Izi ngingo zikomeye zitwa amacomeka y'ibirunga. Ku bijyanye n'imisozi ya Mandara, maguma ifasha mu kurwanya isuri isuri cyane kuruta inyuma ya cones, yashaje igihe. Amaherezo, gusa amacomeka yarasigaye, akora stark, inshinge zimeze nka spiers nka Kapsiki Peak urwego ruzwiho. \nimiturire ya Mandara.\nImisozi ya Mandara itunga abaturage ugereranije, nubwo imiterere y'ubutaka n'ubutaka bubi. Mu mateka, imisozi yari ubuhungiro bwabantu barwanya kwigarurira cyangwa kuba imbata za leta zo mubibaya bikikije, kandi imisozi ikomeza indimi nyinshi n\u2019amadini gakondo. \nAbaturage baho bashyizeho gahunda y'ubuhinzi bukomeye burimo kubaka amaterasi ningamba zo kugumana no kuzamura uburumbuke bw'ubutaka. Amaterasi yubatswe k'umusozi kugirango arinde ubutaka isuri kandi ishobora kuva mubibaya kugera kumusozi muremure. Guhinduranya ibihingwa hagati yamasaka, umuceri, n'ibinyamisogwe bikomeza uburumbuke bwubutaka kandi bigabanya udukoko. Ibiti bikoreshwa mu gicucu, ibiryo, n\u2019ifumbire y'icyatsi. \"Khaya senegalensis\" na \"Acacia albida\" nibyingenzi, hamwe nandi moko agera kuri 30. Intama zo mu rugo, ihene, n'inka birabikwa kandi bikagaburirwa mu kiraro mu gihe cy'ihinga, kandi ifumbire yabo igashyirwa ku materasi nyuma yo gusarura. Inyamaswa zo mu rugo zemerewe kurisha ku bimera by'amaterasi nyuma yo gusarura kugira ngo ifumbire ifumbire mu murima. Imyanda yo mu rugo, iy'abantu, n'ibimera ikoreshwa mugutezimbere ubutaka kumaterasi. "}
{"id": "20291", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20291", "title": "Umusozi wa Sankwala", "text": "Imisozi ya Sankwala ni imisozi muri Obanliku Ubuyobozi bwibanze bwa Leta ya Cross River muri Nijeriya. Imisozi ya Sankwala iri mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bw'umujyi wa Obudu, mu majyaruguru y\u2019igice cya Okwangwo cya Parike y\u2019Uruzi rwa Cross. Imisozi igera ku burebure bwa hejuru yinyanja. \nImiterere y'kirere.\nImisozi ya Sankwala ifite ikirere gikonje. Ibi byakuruye ba mukerarugendo kuruyu musozi mumyaka yashize mukibaya cya Obudu k'umusozi wa Sankwala. \nIbikorwa bya ba mukerarugendo.\nUmusozi wa Sankwala wakira ibikorwa byinshi by'ubukerarugendo bitandukanye buri mwaka. Ibi byatumye habaho iterambere rya Resort Resort ya Obudu kuri imwe mu misozi miremire, izwi ku izina rya Oshie Ridge. "}
{"id": "20292", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20292", "title": "Umusozi wa Zuma", "text": "Urutare rwa Zuma ni monolith urutare karemano runini, inselberg, rwinjira cyane,bigizwe na gabbro na granodiorite, biherereye i Madalla, umujyi wo muri leta ya Niger, muri Nijeriya. Iherereye mu burengerazuba bw\u2019umurwa mukuru wa Nijeriya, Abuja, ku muhanda munini uva Abuja ugana Kaduna, hafi ya Madalla, ndetse rimwe na rimwe bakitwa \"Irembo ryerekeza Abuja kuva Suleja \". Urutare rwa Zuma ruzamuka hafi hejuru yacyo. \nZuma n'urutare rwerekanwe, 100 naira. Yakoreshejwe mu mwiherere ndetse no kwiyitaho n\u2019abaturage ba Gbagyi kurwanya amoko aturanye mu gihe cy\u2019intambara hagati y\u2019abantu. \nUrutare rwa Zuma nirurerure cyane ukurikije ibipimo bya geografiya ya Nigeriya. Ni muremure kuruta urutare rwa Aso na Olumo urutare. \nUrutare rwabonetse mu kinyejana cya 15 rubonwa n\u2019abaturage ba Zuba bo muri Leta ya Nigeriya, barwita \"zumwa\", rushobora guhindurwa ngo agace gatuwemo n'inyoni zo muri Gineya\u201d. Byari bizwi ko mu kinyejana cya 15 Kwararafa yari yatangiye gukwirakwira mu majyaruguru ya Nijeriya. Abaturage ba Zuba muri iki gihe bari bagize Kwararafa bita cyangwa izwi muri iki gihe nka Koro. Nibice bya Jukun biri muri diaspora. Abakurambere bakwirakwiriye mu bwami bwa Kwararafa, berekeza mu burengerazuba banyuze muri Lafia (ariko Lafia ntabwo yari ihari nko muri kiriya gihe), hanyuma banyura mu gace ka Keffi (ariko nta kintu na kimwe cyari nka Keffi nko muri kiriya gihe), hanyuma bajya mu gace ka kera ka Abuja katariho icyo gihe nacyo. Ariko mbere yuko bagera ku rutare rwa Zuma, abakurambere babo cyangwa se abo dukunze kwita abapfumu babo bababwiye ko batagomba gutura burundu kugeza bageze ku rutare rumwe rwiza, imbere yabo. Bakomeje kugenda begera urutare rwa Zuma kugeza baza guhura n'urutare rya Zuma hagati y'ishyamba rinini. Binjiye mu ishyamba, batura mu kirometero kirometero hafi yacyo maze bashinga imidugudu nka Shinapa (aho ubuyobozi bwabo bwari), Chaci, Luki, Esa, Zumwa, Yeku, Huntu, Wagu yo mu misozi miremire na Wagu yo mu majyepfo. \nMu ishyamba rikikije urutare, hari umudugudu utuwe n'abaturage ba Koro, umutware wabo akaba umupadiri w'imana y'urutare. Iyi mana yari ifitanye isano ni gitare gito mu mudugudu wasangaga abantu batamba ibitambo. Abatuye muri uyu mudugudu w\u2019amashyamba ngo barinze urutare, babuza 'abo hanze' kutageraho. Hariho imyizerere yiganje ivuga ko ntamuntu numwe wigeze agera munsi yigitare kubera imiziririzo no gutinya umuvumo. Byongeye kandi, byizerwaga ko umudugudu ubwawo utari wihishe. Mu mateka, Emir wa Abuja yoherezaga ibitambo bya buri mwaka - impfizi y'umukara, ihene y'umukara, n'imbwa y'umukara - ku barinzi b'urutare nk'ibitambo byimana yabo. Ibyo bitambo byatanzwe n\u2019abaturage bo muri Chachi, bemerewe gusabana n\u2019abashinzwe umutekano kubera isano basangiye n\u2019imiryango. \nMu myaka ya za 40, Umuyobozi w'akarere ka Abuja, Sarkin Malamai na Sulaimanu Barau, waje kuba Emir wa Abuja, bifatanya n'Umuyobozi wa Zuba icyo gihe gusura urutare n'umudugudu wa fetish \"kugira ngo bamenye ukuri ku rutare\". Abenegihugu bagiriye inama ikomeye yo kwirinda urugendo, baburira ku mivumo no kwangwa ko wo mumupadiri abonana nabo. Uyu mupadiri yasobanuwe nk'umuntu utuje kandi wambaye ubusa mu gihe abaturage bari bazwiho kwigomwa, kugira ngo bashimishe imana zabo. Kwirengagiza ibyo kwitondera, ibirori byatangije urugendo babanza gusura Chachi. Abatuye umudugudu banze kubayobora mu mudugudu wa fetish ariko bemera kubereka icyerekezo aho. Bageze mu mudugudu, bahuye n\u2019ikaze abaturage, bavuga 'igikwiye' Hausa. Bitandukanye n'ibisobanuro bari bumvise mbere, padiri \"yari ameze nkabandi bagabo, bambaye neza kandi biyogoshesha nkatwe\". Abajijwe ku bitambo by'abantu, yahakanye ubumenyi ariko yemera ko bishobora kuba byarakozwe kera. Icyakora, yasobanuye ko ibitambo by\u2019amatungo byari bigikorwa kandi ko byerekezaga kuri ba sekuruza no ku myuka y\u2019abapadiri ba kera, aho kubitare ubwabyo. \nIbinyejana byinshi, Zuma Rock uracyafite inkuru nyinshi zidasanzwe zizengurutse. Abaturage kavukire bafite imigani y'imyuka mibi itagaragara iba munda y'urutare. Abandi babifata nk'urwobo rw'abihayimana, urusengero rwihishe kugira ngo rutangwe mu isi y'ubupfumu ndetse n'ahantu hatuwe n'abajura bitwaje intwaro bahaza bashaka ubuhungiro bw'agateganyo igihe cyose barangije igikorwa cyagenze neza kandi bashaka gusangira iminyago yabo cyangwa igihe inzego z'umutekano ziri mu nzira zabo.\nHafi yurutare hari inyubako yera ituzuye izwi nka Zuma Rock Hotel. Bamwe mu baturage bo muri ako gace bemeza ko iyo ari hoteri murako karere gahiga, bityo ikaba yaratereranywe na ba nyirayo. Mu gihe cyo gukora ubushakashatsi muri ako gace no kugerageza gukosora urujijo rwerekana urutare, abaturage batuye hafi y'urutare batanze inkuru zitandukanye. Bamwe bavuga ko imyuka mibi yimutse, igaha abantu ikiruhuko cyo gutangira guhinga kuri parike y'ubutaka hafi yurutare. Nyamara bamwe mu baturage bavuze ko imyuka mibi ikiri mu nda y'urutare kandi ikagaragaza imbaraga zidasanzwe cyane cyane mu masaha adasanzwe ya nijoro. "}
{"id": "20293", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20293", "title": "Kerma", "text": "Kerma yahoze ari umurwa mukuru w\u2019umuco wa Kerma, washinzwe muri Sudani y'ubu mbere ya 3500 mbere ya Yesu. Kerma ni hamwe mu hantu hanini cyane hacukuwe kera muri Nubiya ya kera. Yatanze imyaka myinshi y'ubucukuzi n'ubushakashatsi, harimo ibihumbi n\u2019imva hamwe n\u2019aho gutura mu mujyi munini ukikije Uburengerazuba hasi ya Deffufa.\nAhantu ubu ni Kerma hatuwe bwa mbere n'abahiga ahagana mu 8350 mbere ya Yesu, mu gihe cya Mesolithique. hagati ya 5550 mbere ya Yesu na 5150 mbere ya Yesu, ikibanza cyaratereranywe, bishoboka ko cyatewe no kugabanuka kwa Nili muri iki gihe. Ikiruhuko cya kabiri mu mwuga cyabaye hagati ya 4050 mbere ya Yesu na 3450 mbere ya Yesu, bishoboka ko biturutse ku gutembera kwinshi kuva muri Nili yera. Ahagana mbere ya Yesu, ubuhinzi bwateye imbere kandi umuco utangira hafi ya Kerma. Kerma yaje gukura ihinduka umujyi munini wubatswe hafi y'urusengero runini rwa adobe ruzwi ku izina rya Western Deffufa, rwubatswe nyuma ya 1750 mbere ya Yesu. umuryango wa leta washinzwe hagati 2550 mbere ya Yesu na 1550 mbere ya Yesu, aho ubworozi bw'inka bwagabunutse cyane nkuko bigaragazwa n'ubucukuzi bwa kera nko mu 1750 mbere ya Yesu Ibimenyetso byerekana umuringa bigaragara kuri c. 2200-22000 mbere ya Yesu. Nk'umurwa mukuru hamwe n\u2019aho bashyinguwe mu bwami, Kerma atanga urumuri ku mibereho igoye igaragara muri uyu muryango.\nImigenzo y'idini.\nBamwe mu bahanga bavuga ko imigenzo ya Animiste yaho kuba imana nyinshi mu bwami bushya bwa Kerma,bitandukanye na nyuma ya Napatan na Meroitike, kubera ko inyamaswa zo mu gihe cya kera cya Kerma zitagaragaza imiterere ya Anthropomorphique nka ngenzi zazo z'Abanyamisiri, kandi Mesa nka Jebel Barkal bafatwaga mu buryo bwa Animiste, nyuma y\u2019ubwami bushya Abanyamisiri bigaruriye ubwami bwa Nubia Anthropomorph Abanyamisiri batangiye gufata Jebel Barkal nk'ahantu hera umuco gakondo bashobora kuba barigiye ku muco gakondo w'Abany Kerma.\nUbucukumbuzi.\nMu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20.\nUbucukumbuzi bwa mbere muri Kerma bwatangiriye k'ubushakashatsi bwakozwe n'Abanyamisiri na Sudani bwakozwe na George A. Reisner, Umunyamerika washyizwe hamwe muri kaminuza ya Harvard n'inzu ndangamurage y'ubugeni, I Boston. Nyuma Reisner yayoboye ibyo bigo byombi, mu cyiswe \"Harvard-Boston\", mu bihe bitatu byo mu murima I Kerma (1913\u20131916). Yakoze mur'Egiputa na Sudani imyaka 25, 1907\u20131932. \nHamwe mu hantu hambere hacukuwe muri kano karere, muruhare rwa Kerma na Reisner mu bucukumbuzi bw'akarere ni ingenzi. Ikurikiranyabihe shingiro ryumuco wa Kerman ryashinzwe hashingiwe ku bikorwa by'urugendo rwa Harvard-Boston rwa Reisner (1913\u20131916); ibi byatanze ibisobanuro ku bindi byagaragaye mu karere. Ubuhanga bwo gucukura neza bwa Reisner, raporo z'urubuga, nibindi bitabo byatumye nyuma yo gusobanura ibisubizo bye bishoboka.\nMu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 20 kugeza ubu.\nNyuma y'imyaka icumi nyuma yubucukuzi bwa Reisner, Bonnet yanze igitekerezo cy'urubuga nk'umujyi wa satelite wo muri Egiputa. Imirimo yihanganye n'umurava bya Bonnet na bagenzi be bavumbuye urufatiro rw'amazu menshi, amahugurwa, n'ingoro, byerekana ko mu 2000 mbere ya Yesu, Kerma wari umujyi munini, bishoboka ko ari umurwa mukuru ndetse n'ahashyinguwe abami ba Kush \". Kuva 1977 kugeza 2003, Bonnet hamwe n'itsinda mpuzamahanga ryintiti zacukuye I Kerma.\nIkipe ya Bonnet yo mu Busuwisi yacukuye ahantu hakurikira muri Kerma: umujyi wa kera, imva y\u2019igikomangoma, urusengero, inyubako zo guturamo, inyubako za Napatan, amahugurwa y\u2019umubumbyi wa Napatan, amarimbi ya Meroitike, ibihome, hamwe n\u2019ibyobo by\u2019ibinyampeke bya Neolithic. mu bindi bintu bidasanzwe byavumbuwe, Bonnet yavumbuye umuringa mu mujyi wa Kerma. Mu rukuta rwicyo kigo cy'idini niho hubatswe amahugurwa y'umuringa. aya mahugurwa yari agizwe n'ibihome byinshi kandi tekiniki z'abanyabukorikori bigaragara ko zasobanuwe neza. Nta byavumbuwe byagereranywa muri Egiputa cyangwa muri Sudani byadufasha gusobanura ibyo bisigazwa.\" \nMu mwaka wa 2003, Charles Bonnet hamwe n\u2019itsinda rye ry\u2019ubucukuzi, bavumbuye ibishusho bya granite y\u2019umukara wa farawo wo ku ngoma ya makumyabiri na gatanu yo mu Misiri. Ibishusho byerekanwe k'urubuga mu nzu ndangamurage ya Kerma.\nBioarchaeology.\nImyitozo ya Mortuary muri Kerma yagiye itandukana mu gihe, kandi ibi bigaragara mu byanditswe kera. Irimbi rinini, rikikije Deffufa yo haruguru mu burasirazuba ritunganijwe hamwe n\u2019imva zishaje mu majyaruguru hamwe n\u2019imva za vuba (kandi zigoye) n\u2019imva ziri mu majyepfo. Gushyingura biboneka bikikije imva zikomeye. Imva zitera imbere kuva ku misozi yoroshye kugera muri misiri yahumetswe na piramide. Inzibacyuho ntabwo itangira kugeza igihe kirekire nyuma ya piramide zidafite imyambarire muri Egiputa.\nBonnet avuga ko ibitambo by'ibitambo bigaragara kandi bikamenyekana mu gihe cya Kerma hagati. Kubera ko ibyumba byo gushyinguramo bishobora kwinjirwamo byoroshye, umuntu yakwibaza niba bishoboka ko igitambo cy'umugore cyangwa umwana mu gihe umugabo apfuye, nta bimenyetso bifatika bishingiye ku moko byemeza uyu muco. Mu byukuri Buzon na Judd barabaza iki gitekerezo basesenguye ihahamuka n'ibimenyetso byerekana ihungabana rya skeletale muri aba \"ibitambo.\"\nIbisigazwa byinshi biboneka mu masezerano yoroheje cyangwa yasezeranijwe ku ruhande rwabo. Kubera ikirere cy'ubutayu cyumutse, mummisiyasi karemano kirasanzwe. Hatabayeho inzira zisanzwe zo kubora kugirango skeletonize umubiri, imyenda yoroshye, umusatsi, nibicuruzwa kama kama biracyaboneka (urugero, imyenda, amababa, uruhu, urutoki). Ibicuruzwa byo mu mva birimo amasaro ya faience, ibihanga by'inka, n'ububumbyi. Ibyegeranyo bya skelete, kimwe nibindi bimenyetso by'ubucukuzi, bikomeje gusubirwamo no kongera gusobanurwa mu gihe ibibazo bishya by'ubushakashatsi bivutse. Ubushakashatsi bubiri buherutse kwerekana ubwoko bw'ibibazo abahanga mu binyabuzima babaza ibikoresho bya skeleti yacukuwe muri Kerma.\nKendall, yerekana ko imva nini zo muri Deffufa yo hejuru yarimo imirambo y\u2019abiciwe ibitambo mirongo cyangwa amagana. Nyuma yisuzumabumenyi rya bioarchaeologie ryerekeye \"ibitambo\" abantu baturutse muri ibi bice ryerekanye ko nta tandukaniro rikomeye riri hagati y'ikimenyetso cya skeletale y'ibitambo by'abantu batambwe. Bakuye ingero muri koridoro yo gutamba no gutabaza hanze ya koridoro nini ya tumuli. Guherekeza abantu muri tumuli i Kerma bisobanurwa nk'abagore batambwe nyuma y'urupfu rw'umugabo, ariko ibimenyetso bya bioarchaeologie ntabwo bishyigikira uyu mwanzuro w'ubucukuzi. Ubushakashatsi bwibanze bwerekanye ko nta tandukaniro riri hagati y'inshuro z\u2019imvune.\nIhahamuka ryarebwa binyuze mu murongo w'uburyo bugezweho bwo gukomeretsa. \"Ibice byinshi byerekana imvune ya Kerma byagereranijwe n\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019ubuvuzi: abagabo bahuye n\u2019ihungabana ryinshi, itsinda ry\u2019abageze mu za bukuru ryagaragaje ihungabana ryinshi, itsinda ry\u2019abasaza ryagaragaje umubare muto w\u2019imvune zegeranijwe, itsinda rito ryahuye n\u2019ihungabana ryinshi kandi kuvunika kwabaye kenshi kuruta gutandukana cyangwa gukurura imitsi. Ibi ntabwo byanze bikunze biva mubitero, ariko, kandi Judd arabyemera. Ntabwo akoresha ingamba zimwe zo gusesengura mu gihe asuzumye ivunika rya Colles (ry'ikiganza, bikunze kubaho mu gihe uguye mu maboko) rishobora guterwa no gusunikwa hejuru aho kuba ihohoterwa ry'abantu, kandi ibyo ntibyemewe.\nS.O.Y Keita yakoze ubushakashatsi bwa antropropologique bwasuzumye crania z'amatsinda yo mu karere ka Afurika y'Amajyaruguru yarimo ingero zaturutse I Kerma, ahagana muri 2000 mbere ya Yesu, akarere ka Maghreb, ahagana mu mwaka wa 1500 mbere ya Yesu, hamwe na crania y'ingoma ya mbere yavuye mu mva z'umwami i Abydos, mu Misiri. Ibyavuye mu bushakashatsi byagaragaje uburyo bwiganjemo ingoma ya 1 yo mu Misiri, crania yari Amajyepfo cyangwa \" tropical African variant, yari ifitanye isano na Kerma Kushites. Ibisubizo rusange byerekana isano iri hagati y'itsinda rya Nili yo haruguru, ariko kandi ryerekana impinduka zisobanutse kuva kera. Urujya n'uruza rw'abayobozi bo mu majyaruguru mu mujyi ukomeye wo mu majyepfo birashobora gusobanura ibyagaragaye."}
{"id": "20294", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20294", "title": "Idanre Hill", "text": "Umusozi wa Idanre, uzwi kw'izina rya Oke Idanre uherereye mu mujyi wa Idanre muri Leta ya Ondo mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Nijeriya. \nUmusozi wa Idanre uzwi cyane kubera ibyiza nyaburanga.] \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b Iherereye ku butumburuke bwa 3000ft (metero 914.4) hejuru y'inyanja kandi ikagira urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima bidasanzwe aho umuco wahujwe. Ifite kandi kandi butandukanye bwibidukikije bwibinyabuzima. umusozi wa Oke Idanre ikubiyemo bio-physique nubutaka bukomeye buranga imikoranire n'ibintu bifatika byaremye imico irambye mumiterere. \nAmatangazo yukuri na / cyangwa ubunyangamugayo.\nUmusozi wa Idanre ni ahantu nyaburanga haherereye muri Leta ya Ondo, muri Nijeriya. Hiyongereyeho ubwiza bwaho, bwateye amatsiko abantu benshi, ni uko abaturage ba Idanre bose babayeho kuri uwo musozi hafi imyaka igihumbi. Kuva abimukira batangira kugabanuka, mu 1923, imiterere y'ibimera kimwe n\u2019ibinyabuzima n\u2019ibinyabuzima by\u2019indabyo byakomeje gutangwa. Ariko, iminsi mikuru itanga ibihe kubutaka buke kugirango bongere guhura n'ibidukikije ndetse no kongera kwerekana amateka ya Idanre hamwe nimitekerereze yagutse ya Yoruba, imigani n\u2019ubufatanye. \nkuruyu musozi bizihiza umunsi mukuru wa Ogun, mugihe cy'Ukwakira na Ije, ukwira iminsi irindwi. \nUsibye iminsi mikuru ya theeses, ituma urubuga ruba umuco gakondo, ibimera n\u2019ibinyabuzima byo ku musozi nabyo birihariye. Hariho ubwoko bwihariye bw'inyamaswa zitagira umurizo zitwa Hyrax ziba ku rutare gusa muri kinogihe zirimo kuzimira kubera guhiga. Hariho kandi inkende zidasanzwe zagaragaye hafi y'imisozi ya Orosun.\nUmusozi kandi ukunda kugendwaho n'itsinda ryabahanga nabashakashatsi mu by'imirima. Ikibanza kibamo itsinda ryibibabi, kandi abantu bakora ibirori bidasanzwe byibibabi buri mwaka. Umusozi urimo gukoreshwa nabakinnyi ba firime nkahantu bakinira henshi muri firime zabo. Byongeye kandi, havugwa mu gitabo cy\u2019umuntu umwe rukumbi wegukanye igihembo cyitiriwe Nobel kubera ubuvanganzo muri Afurika, Porofeseri Wole Soyinka, uzwi cyane ku gitabo cye \"Idanre n\u2019ibindi bisigo\". \nUmuco.\nUmudugudu wa kera wa Idanre wabayeho ku musozi kuva kera, icyakora umuco w\u2019iburengerazuba wamenyekanye mu mujyi wa kera igihe itsinda ry\u2019abamisiyonari bayobowe na nyiricyubahiro Gilbert Carter ryageraga mu myaka yaza 1894. \nAbamisiyoneri bubatse ishuri ryambere mu mwaka wa 1896 inyubako yibumba iracyafite imbaraga kugeza na nubu. Mu 1906, hashyizweho urukiko rw'amategeko. Harimo gereza ya kera aho abakatiwe bamara igifungo cyabo. "}
{"id": "20295", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20295", "title": "Zaria Court Kigali", "text": "= Zaria Court Kigali =\nZaria Court Kigali ni igikorwaremezo cyagenewe ibikorwa bya siporo, umuco n' imyidagaduro cyubatswe n' umushoramari Masai Ujiri ufite ubwenegihugu bwa Canada, akaba n' inshuti y' u Rwanda, byumwihariko akaba n' inshuti ya nyakubahwa Perezida wa repubulika y' u Rwanda Paul KAGAME, Ujiri yagaragaje ko icyi gikorwa cyuzuye gitwaye asaga miliyoni 25 z' amadolari. \nIbyo wamenya kuri Zaria court Kigali.\nZaria Court Kigali bikomoka kugace ka \"Zaria\" kakaba agace ko muri Nigeriya aho Masai Ujiri yakuriye, Ujiri akomoka kuri Nyina ukomoka muri Kenya na se Ukomoka muri Nigeriya kandi yamenyekanye cyane muri champiyona ya basketball yo muri Amerika NBA kandi yabaye perezida wa Toronto Raptors yo muri Canada ikina iri rushanwa rya NBA. \nZaria court KIgali igizwe n' ibice bitandukanye harimo nka Hoteli y' ibyumba bigera kuri 80, za Restaurants na Bar, GYM, ifite kandi ibibuga by' imikino itandukanye nka football yabato, basketball, ibyumba by' inama n' ibirori kandi ifite na pisine.\nIki gikorwaremezo kiri kubuso bwa hegitari 2,4, giherereye mu karere ka Gasabo, umurenge wa Remera, Akagari ka Amahoro mu Mudugudu wa Rukiri II ahazwe nko mucyanya cyahariwe ubukerarugendo bushingiye kuri siporo n' inyidagaduro, aha hubatse Zaria court ni ubutaka leta y' u Rwanda yahaye nk' inkondabutaka umushoramari Masia Ujiri muri 2021 bityo Ujiri ahitamo gutangira ku bwubakaho icyi gikorwaremezo kuva muri 2023 imirimo yo kubaka irangira muri 2025. "}
{"id": "20296", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20296", "title": "Axum", "text": "Axum n'umujyi wo mu karere ka Tigray muri Etiyopiya, uyu mujyi utuwe n'abaturage 66,900 guhera muri 2015. akaba ari ikibanza cy'umurwa mukuru w'amateka y'Ubwami \nAxum iherereye muri zone yo hagati y'akarere ka Tigray, hafi y'umusozi wa Adwa. Ifite uburebure bwa metero 2131(6991feet) kandi izengurutswe na La'ilay Maychew, imyenda yayobowe mu karere ka Tigray.\nAmateka.\nAmakuru make arahari ku byerekeranye n'ibinyejana bya mbere bya Aksum byafashwe nkubwihindurize kuva mu karere kajya m ubutegetsi bwiganje. Ubushakashatsi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo i Gobadra (Gobo Dara) no mu butare bwa Anqar Baahti bwerekana ko ibisigisigi bya Age Stone byegeranye. Ubucukuzi bwa R. Fattovich kuri amba 'Beta Giyorgis hejuru ya Aksum bwemeza imizi yabanjirije Aksumite yo gutura muri Aksum guhera mu kinyejana cya 7 kugeza mu cya 4 Mbere ya Yesu, Byongeye kandi, ubucukuzi bwakorewe muri parike ya Stele rwagati muri Aksum. bushimangira ibikorwa bikomeje muri kariya gace kuva intangiriro y'igihe rusange. Mu kinyejana cya 1 nyuma ya Yesu, Aksum yavuzweho kuba \" metropolis \" muri \"Periplus y'inyanja ya Erythraean\".\nUburezi.\nKaminuza ya Aksum yashinzwe muri Gicurasi 2006 ku kibanza 4km(2.5mi), kuva Axum rwagati. Umuhango wo gutangiza ku mugaragaro wabaye ku ya 16 Gashyantare 2007 kandi ubuso bw\u2019ikigo ni107ha(260acres), hamwe nicyumba gihagije cyo kwaguka. Ishyirwaho rya kaminuza muri Axum uruhare runini mu iterambere ry\u2019igihugu muri rusange ndetse n\u2019akarere by\u2019umwihariko."}
{"id": "20297", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20297", "title": "Brazzaville", "text": "Brazzaville ni umurwa mukuru wa Repubulika ya Kongo. Ubuyobozi, ni ishami na komine. Igizwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019imari n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019igihugu, giherereye mu majyaruguru ya Kongo, ahateganye na Kinshasa, umurwa mukuru wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DR Congo).\nBivugwa ko abaturage batuye m'umurwa mukuru barenga miliyoni 2.1 z'abaturage, bakaba barenga kimwe cya gatatu cy'abaturage batuye iki gihugu. Abagera kuri 40% bakoreshwa mu myuga itari iy'ubuhinzi. Mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, Brazzaville yabaye umurwa mukuru w\u2019Ubufaransa bwigenga hagati ya 1940 na 1942.\nMuri 2013, Brazzaville yagizwe Umujyi wa Muzika na UNESCO ; kuva icyo gihe nayo yabaye umunyamuryango wa Network Creative City Network. \nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nBrazzaville ifite igice kinini mu majyaruguru yumugezi wa congo, munsi yikidendezi cya Malebo. Mbamu, ikirwa kinini kiri mu kidengeri, ni igice cya Repubulika iharanira demokarasi ya Kongo.\nBrazzaville ifite ubuso bungana na 506\u00a0km (314)\u00a0mi) imbere mu nyanja ya Atalantika kandi hafi 474\u00a0km (295)\u00a0mi) mu majyepfo ya ekwateri. Hirya no hino mu mujyi hari ibibaya binini. Umujyi urasa neza, kandi uherereye ku butumburuke bwa 317\u00a0m (1.040)\u00a0ft). Downriver congo ifite rapide nyinshi, izwi kwizina rya Livingston Falls, ikabuza kuzamuka hejuru kugeza aho biva kumunwa kuri Atlantike.\nKinshasa, umurwa mukuru wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, iherereye ku nkombe y'amajyepfo ya Kongo, hakurya ya Brazzaville. Congo mu mazina yabo, Repubulika iharanira demokarasi ya Kongo rimwe na rimwe yitwa Congo-Brazzaville, bitandukanye na Congo Kinshasa. iruta inshuro eshanu kurenza Brazzaville mubaturage. Aha niho hantu honyine ku isi aho imigi ibiri y\u2019umurwa mukuru w\u2019igihugu yateye imbere ku nkombe z\u2019umugezi, imbere yazo. \nMuri Werurwe 2018, \"Itangazo rya Brazzaville\" ryashyizweho umukono hagamijwe guteza imbere imicungire myiza no kubungabunga Centre ya Cuvette, akarere ko mu kibaya cya Congo cyane cyane muri DRC. Nubutaka bunini kandi bushyuha ku isi, bugizwe n\u2019amashyamba arimo n\u2019ibishanga. Kubungabunga kariya gace ni ngombwa mu mibereho ya megafauna, kandi ni ngombwa ku kirere ndetse no kw'isi. Gutwika yamba byarekura karubone nyinshi kandi bikazamura ubushyuhe bwisi. Iri tangazo ryo gukiza ubutaka bw\u2019ibiti nk\u2019ibinyabuzima binini cyane ku isi byashyizweho umukono na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Repubulika ya Kongo, na Indoneziya, na byo bifite ubutaka. \nBrazzaville yashinzwe kungoma y'abakoroni y'abafaransa ku gace kavukire ka Bateke kavukire kitwa Ncuna, mu gihe cya Scramble for Africa igihe ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi byashyiriraho urwego rukomeye kuri uyu mugabane. Umushakashatsi wavukiye mu Butaliyani Pierre Savorgnan de Brazza, wahawe ubwenegihugu bw\u2019Ubufaransa mu 1874, yashinze ku mugaragaro ku ya 10 Nzeri 1880; bibuka izina rye. "}
{"id": "20298", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20298", "title": "Pariki y'igihugu ya Chambi", "text": "Pariki y'igihugu ya Djebel Chambi muri guverineri ya Kasserine muri Tuniziya. iyi parike iherereye mu burengerazuba hagati mu gihugu, parike yegereye umupaka na Alijeriya. irinda ibimera n\u2019ibinyabuzima bikikije umusozi wa Chambi (\"Djebel Chambi\"), umusozi muremure (1.544m hejuru y\u2019inyanja) muri Tuniziya.\nIyi parike iri mu mashyamba ya Mont de Tebessa azenguruka ako gace kuva Kasserine kugera ku mupaka wa Alijeriya. Parike ntizifite imigezi ihoraho, ariko ni imwe muza gaze ya Cuvier iri mu kaga ndetse n\u2019inzu y\u2019intama za Barbary zitishoboye. Iyi pariki kandi niho hari ubuzima bw\u2019ibimera (holm oak na Cotoneaster nummularia, pinusi ya Aleppo, na Stipa tenacissima)\nMu 1970, hashyizweho hegitare 300 (740 acre) izitiriwe uruzitiro rwo kurinda gazel ya Cuvier.Mu 1977, parike n\u2019akarere kayikikije byagizwe ikigega cy\u2019ibinyabuzima cya UNESCO. Parike yashinzwe nka parike yo mu gihugu"}
{"id": "20299", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20299", "title": "Kibuye, Rwanda", "text": "Kibuye n'umujyi wo mu Karere ka Karongi, ukaba uherereyemo n'icyicaro gikuru cy'Intara y'Iburengerazuba mu Rwanda.\nAho Uherereye.\nUyu mujyi ufata ku nkombe y'iburasirazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Kivu, hagati ya Gisenyi na Cyangugu, nko mu birometero, uvuye mu mujyi wa Kigali, umurwa mukuru. Korudone uyu mujyi uherereyeho ni: 2 \u00b0 03'42.0 \"S, 29 \u00b0 20'54.0\" E (Ubunini: -2.061672; Uburebure: 29.348344). \nIncamake.\nKibuye izwi nkahantu hari inkombe ziriho umucange mwiza kandi ikaba ituranye na parike ebyiri z'igihugu. Niho hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside rugaragaza ubwicanyi bwakorewe 90% by'abatutsi bo muri uyu mujyi muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu wa 1994. Isumo rya Ndaba riri hafi yumujyi. \nUrugomero rwamashanyarazi rwa Kibuye 1 na KivuWatt Station biherereye muri Kibuye.\nIhuza ryo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;02\u00b003\u203242\u2033S 29\u00b020\u203254\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff2.06167\u00b0S 29.34833\u00b0E\ufeff / -2.06167; 29.34833"}
{"id": "20300", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20300", "title": "Umusozi wa Rwenzori", "text": "Rwenzori ni imisozi miremire yo muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba bw\u2019uburinganire, iherereye ku mupaka uhuza Uganda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Impinga ndende ya Ruwenzori ifite uburebure bwa, ni umusozi ukunda kugaragaraho ibicu ndetse n'urubura. Inzuzi zigaburirwa ninzuzi zo mumisozi zigize imwe mumasoko ya Nili. Kubera iyo mpamvu, abashakashatsi b\u2019i Burayi bahujije Ruwenzori n\u2019imisozi y\u2019imigani y\u2019ukwezi, byavuzwe n\u2019intiti y\u2019Ubugereki Ptol\u00e9m\u00e9e nk\u2019isoko ya Nili. Pariki y'igihugu ya Virunga mu burasirazuba bwa DR Congo na Parike ya Rwenzori yo mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Uganda iherereye muri urwo rwego.\nImisozi yashinzwe ahagana mumyaka miriyoni eshatu ishize mugihe cyanyuma cya Pliocene kandi ni ibisubizo byazamuye amabuye ya kristaline harimo gneiss, amphibolite, granite na quartzite. \nRwenzori ifite imisozi miremire itari ibirunga, idafite orogene ku isi. \nAmateka ya Rwenzori.\nRimwe na rimwe imisozi igaragazwa n\u2019imigani uyu musozi wo bawitiriye \" Umusozi w'ukwezi \", ivugwa mu bihe bya kera nk'isoko y'uruzi rwa Nili. Abashakashatsi bo mu Burayi bwa none barebye intera yatangiye guhera mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya, Samuel Baker avuga icyo yise \"Imisozi y'Ubururu\" yegereye intera mu 1864, naho Henry M. Stanley asura intera mu 1875 na 1888, ubwo yandikaga izina nka \"Ruwenzori\". \nMu 1906,umushakashatsi Duke wa Abruzzi yakoze urugendo rugana i Ruwenzori, iyo nkuru ikaba yarasohowe na Filippo De Filippi. Urwo rugendo rwapimye impinga ndende cyane y\u2019urwo rwego, inyinshi muri zo zikaba zaritiriwe umutware, naho umusozi wa Luigi di Savoia witwa izina rye. Aherekejwe na duke yari umufotozi Vittorio Sella, wari wasuye imisozi mbere. Igikorwa cyo gufotora Sella kibitswe kuri Museo Nazionale della Montagna muri Turin no kuri Istituto di Fotografia Alpina Vittorio Sella muri Biella, haba mu Butaliyani. Kaminuza ya Makerere, muri Uganda, nayo ifite guhitamo amashusho ye. "}
{"id": "20301", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20301", "title": "Humure", "text": "Humure ni umusozi muremure uri mu Karere ka Gatsibo, Intara y\u2019Uburasirazuba mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda. Uherereye hagati ya Nyagisozi, Kageyo ya Gatsibo, Remera, Kirwa na Muhura, mu Mudugudu wa Kigabiro, Akagari ka Kigabiro, Umurenge wa Remera. Mu Rwanda rwo hambere, aho hantu hari mu karere k\u2019u Buganza.\nAmateka.\nMu mpinga ya Humure hari hubatse urugo rw\u2019Umwami Kigeri IV Rwabugiri, kimwe mu birindiro bye by\u2019amateka. Indi mirwa yari afite yubatse ni Gatsibo y\u2019Imitoma n\u2019i Rwamagana. Hari igitekerezo kivuga ko izina \"Humure\" ryaturutse ku Mwami Ruganzu II Ndori waharambagiriye mu gihe yarambagiraga igihugu maze akaharuhukira. Aho Ruganzu yaruhukiye ni kurutare ruri mu ibanga ry'umusozi wa Humure, hakaba ari ahitwa Ryanjero hakaba hari n'iriba ryitwa Ryanjyero.\nIbigabiro.\nMu bigabiro byahoze kuri uwo musozi, hasigaye igiti kimwe cyitwa Ruganiriro, ari cyo cyari ku rugo rw\u2019umwami. Ni igiti cy\u2019umuganashya cyarikagwagamo imizinga y\u2019inzuki zatangaga ubuki bwitwa inziramvuzo. Icyo giti gifatwa nk\u2019igisigaratongo cy\u2019ibigabiro bya kera. \nHafi yaho kandi hari ikindi giti kinini cyitwaga Ndaruhutse, cyabaye ikimenyetso cy\u2019uburyo umusozi wa Humure wabonwaga n\u2019abaturutse kure, cyane cyane Abanyarwanda bajyaga guhaha i Bugande. Cyari igiti cy\u2019icyerekezo cyabafashaga kutayoba bageze mu Mutara. Bitewe n\u2019umuyaga wakomotse ku muriro w\u2019abashumba, icyo giti cyaje kugwa. Hari ababivuga nk\u2019inkuru ishingiye ku myemerere y\u2019uko cyaba cyaratewe nk\u2019igiti cy\u2019intsinzi kugira ngo u Rwanda rutsinde Nyirabiyoro wari utuye mu Mubari wa Kabeja.\nInyambo n\u2019ubworozi.\nKu ngoma ya Mutara III Rudahigwa, i Humure hashinzwe igikingi cy\u2019inyambo zitwaga Intabangira, zari zishinzwe umutware Ryumugabe. Mbere yo kuhazana iryo shyo ry\u2019inyambo, Ryumugabe yari yarahagabiye inka z\u2019Impezamihigo zari zaraturutse i Gituza. Humure yari ifite urwuri rurerure rumeramo ubwatsi bunyuranye, burimo \"inyovi\", \"uruhihi\", n\u2019\"ivubwe\", ibyo bikaba bijyanye n\u2019amategeko agenga ubworozi bw'inyambo, kuko inyambo zitari zemerewe kurisha hamwe n\u2019andi matungo nk\u2019ihene cyangwa inkoko. Intabangira zaje kwagukira no mu yindi mirwa nka Murambi n\u2019i Nduba."}
{"id": "20302", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20302", "title": "Rugenge (Ikigabiro cya Rwabugiri)", "text": "Rugenge hazwi nko ku Kigabiro cya Rugenge, ni ahantu h\u2019amateka haherereye mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba, Akarere ka Bugesera, Umurenge wa Gashora, Akagari ka Ramiro, Umudugudu wa Kagasa. Aha ni ho honyine mu Bugesera hatuye umwami w\u2019u Rwanda, ari we Kigeri IV Rwabugiri.\nAmateka.\nUrugo rwa Kigeri IV Rwabugiri rwari rwubatse i Rugenge, aho yatungiye umugore w\u2019Umurundikazi witwaga Murerwa wa Ngwije. Murerwa yari yarahunze u Burundi hamwe na musaza we Cyoya, nyuma yo kwigomeka ku mwami w\u2019u Burundi. Cyoya yazanye n\u2019ingabo ze zitwaga Inyange, akimara kugera mu Rwanda, Umwami Rwabugiri yaramwakiriye amugira umutware ukomeye mu gihugu.\nNyuma y\u2019igihe, Rwabugiri yashyingiye Murerwa umuhungu we Sharangabo.\nIbisigaratongo.\nAhahoze urugo rwa Rwabugiri i Rugenge hasigaye igiti cy\u2019umuvumu cyari cyaratemwe ariko cyaje kongera gushibuka. Kuri ubu ahahoze urwo rugo hubatse uruganda rukora ibyuma (fer \u00e0 b\u00e9ton).\nHafi y\u2019aho, mu bilometero bibiri, mu Murenge wa Rweru, Akagari ka Nemba, Umudugudu wa Rutete, hari ahitwa Ku Kavure ka Rwabugiri, ahari iriba rito ryitiriwe uwo mwami. Bivugwa ko ari Rwabugiri warifukuje, kandi n\u2019ubu rikoreshwa n\u2019aborozi bo muri ako gace buhira inka. Inka nkuru zashokaga ku rindi riba ryitwaga iriba rya Nyirarubomboza.\nKintambwe na Rwacyoya.\nAho Cyoya yagabiwe n\u2019Umwami Rwabugiri akahatura, haje kwitwa \"Kintambwe\" rikaba ari ijambo ry\u2019Ikirundi risobanura \"Intare\", kubera ko ako gace kabagamo inyamaswa nyinshi zirimo n\u2019intare. Ubu, Kintambwe ni Akagari ko mu Murenge wa Rweru, aho kandi habarizwa iriba rya Rwacyoya, rifatwa nk\u2019iriba ryafukujwe na Cyoya."}
{"id": "20304", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20304", "title": "Akarwa k'abakobwa", "text": "Akarwa k\u2019Abakobwa ni akarwa gaherereye mu kiyaga cya Kivu, hafi y\u2019umwaro wa Nyamasheke, mu karere ka Nyamasheke, Intara y\u2019Iburengerazuba y\u2019u Rwanda. Aka karwa kazwi mu mateka n\u2019umuco nyarwanda nk\u2019ahajyanwaga abakobwa batwaye inda z\u2019indaro mu gihe cya cyami, mu rwego rwo kubahana no kubasiga ishyanga nk\u2019uko byari bisanzwe mu muco wa kera.\nImiterere n\u2019indangamerekezo.\nAkarwa k\u2019Abakobwa kari mu mudugudu wa Gikuyu, Akagari ka Ninzi, Umurenge wa Kagano, mu karere ka Nyamasheke. Ako karwa gaherereye mu bilometero bike uvuye ku nkombe za Kivu, kandi kari hafi y\u2019undi mwaro uzwi mu mateka y\u2019ubwikorezi n\u2019ubucuruzi bwambukiranya ibihugu.\nInkomoko.\nMu muco nyarwanda wa kera, gutwara inda y\u2019indaro (inda y\u2019umukobwa utarashyingiwe) byafatwaga nk\u2019icyaha gikomeye. Iyo byamenyekanaga, umukobwa yahabwaga igihano cyo gucibwa, agakurwa mu muryango agasigwa ishyanga cyangwa ahantu hadatuwe.\nMu turere twegereye Nyamasheke, nk\u2019uko byanditswe na Bigirumwami (1974), abakobwa batwaye inda z\u2019indaro boherezwaga kuri aka karwa, aho babaga ari bonyine. Kubera icyo gikorwa cyo guherekezwa no gusigwa kuri aka karwa, kazwi kugeza n\u2019uyu munsi ku izina rya \u201cAkarwa k\u2019Abakobwa.\u201d\nIkoreshwa ry\u2019aka karwa.\nAbahavu bari abaturage bo ku nkengero z\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu bajyaga basura aka karwa, bamwe bagasanga abakobwa bagihari bataricwa n\u2019inzara cyangwa inyamaswa. Bamwe muri abo bakobwa barashyingirwaga cyangwa bagatwarwa n\u2019abo bagabo, bagakomereza ubuzima mu bundi buryo.\nUmumaro w\u2019amateka.\nAkarwa k\u2019Abakobwa gafite akamaro k\u2019umuco n\u2019amateka, kuko kerekana imyumvire y\u2019ibihe byashize ku bijyanye n\u2019uburere, imyifatire n\u2019imyemerere ku bagore n\u2019abakobwa mu Rwanda rwa kera. Ubu ni ahantu h\u2019inyigisho z\u2019amateka n\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu, hashingira ku guha agaciro ubuzima no kurwanya ihutazwa rishingiye ku gitsina."}
{"id": "20305", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20305", "title": "Nampula", "text": "Nampula ni umurwa mukuru w'intara ya Nampula mu majyaruguru ya Mozambike. Hatuwe abantu basaga 743.125 mw'ibarura rusange rya 2017 ni umujyi wa gatatu munini muri Mozambike nyuma ya Maputo na Matola. Uyu mujyi uherereye imbere mu Ntara ya Nampula,mu birometero 200 uvuye ku nkombe kandi ukikijwe n'ibibaya n'amasoko y'amabuye. Uyu mujyi ni ikigo kinini cy\u2019akarere mu karere kose ko mu majyaruguru ya Mozambike, ndetse no mu bice bya Mozambike yo hagati ndetse n\u2019umupaka wa Malawi na Tanzaniya. \nUyu mujyi uhuza umujyi wa Nacala uri ku cyambu n\u2019ibihugu byo muri Afurika y'epfo bifunze ubutaka,cyane Malawi unyuze mu muhanda na gariyamoshi. Uyu mujyi ufite ikibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga gihuza Nairobi muri Kenya, Johannesburg muri Afurika yepfo, Dar-es-Salaam muri Tanzaniya kandi n'ihuriro ry\u2019ubwikorezi bwaho mu majyaruguru ya Mozambike. Nampula ni ihuriro ry\u2019ubucuruzi mu majyaruguru ya Mozambike, yungukira mu bice by\u2019ubuhinzi bitanga umusaruro mwinshi, hafi y\u2019umuhanda wa Nacala, ndetse n\u2019abaturage bo mu mujyi biyongera cyane. \nNampula n'inzu ndangamurage y\u2019igihugu ya Mozambike, amasoko menshi, katedrali, imisigiti, kaminuza, ibigo byigisha n\u2019ishuri. Umujyi uratandukanye, abaturage ba eMakhuwa kavukire niwo mujyi munini ariko ufite abahinde, Abanyaburayi (biganjemo Abanyaporitigale), Abashinwa, Abanyalibani, Abanyasomaliya, na Nijeriya.\nEtymology.\nIzina \"Nampula\" bivugwa ko ryakomotse ku ijambo eMakhuwa \"Whampula\", nk'uko bivugwa mu migani yaho bikaba bisobanura umuyobozi w'imiryango y'ako karere mu bihe byashize. \nAmateka.\nNampula ni umujyi mushya. washinzwe n\u2019ingabo z\u2019abakoloni ba Porutugali mu mwaka wi 1907 ikazamuka mu mujyi mu 1956. Mu gihe cy\u2019intambara y\u2019ubwigenge bwa Mozambike, Nampula yari ikigo cya gisirikare cy\u2019ingabo z\u2019abakoloni mu kurwanya umutwe wo kwibohora FRELIMO. \nNyuma y'ubwigenge mu mwaka wi 1975, Abanyaporitigale bataye Nampula maze abaturage bo mu cyaro bimukira muri uwo mujyi, bicara mu turere tutari duteganyijwe ku nkengero z'umujyi. Uyu mutwe w\u2019abimukira wiyongereye cyane mu gihe cy\u2019intambara y\u2019abenegihugu ya Mozambike, bigira ingaruka kuri Nampula mu myaka icumi hagati ya 1982 na 1992. Igihe intambara yarangiraga guverinoma ya Mozambike yari yiteze ko impunzi zizasubira mu cyaro, ariko baguma mu mujyi. nyuma y'imyaka mike abimukira batinze kugabanuka, ubwiyongere bw'umujyi bwarakomeje, kuko iterambere ryihuse ry'ubukungu rya Mozambike ryagaragaye cyane mu mijyi. Nampula, mu gihe cy\u2019intambara nyuma y\u2019intambara, yateye imbere mu kigo kinini cy\u2019iterambere cya Mozambike, gikurura umubare w\u2019ishoramari rya Leta n\u2019abikorera mu bice bitandukanye by\u2019ubukungu n\u2019imibereho. \nIyobokamana.\nAmadini yiganje mur'uyu mujyi wa Nampula ni abakristo,abayisilamu. hamwe n'muryango muto w'abahindu nawo urahari. Katedrali yayo ya Bikira Mariya wa Fatima ni archepiscopale reba Diyosezi Gatolika ya Roma ya Nampula.\nUburezi.\nUmujyi ubarizwamo ishami ry'ubumenyi bw'ubuzima, Universidade Lurio. muri 2009 hatangijwe amasomo muri optometrie,yambere muri Mozambike. Amasomo yatewe inkunga binyuze mu mushinga wa Eyecare Mozambique. Abandi bafatanyabikorwa barimo Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga rya Dublin, Kaminuza ya Ulster na Brien Holden Vision Institute. Kugeza muri 2019, abanyeshuri 61 bo muri Mozambike barangije bafite impamyabumenyi ya optometrie muri Universidade Lurio harimo 34 b'igitsina gabo na 27 b'igitsina gore. Amasomo ya optometrie ubu yashyizwe muri sisitemu ya Universidade Lurio kandi akomeza gushaka abanyeshuri bashya buri mwaka. icy'ingenzi, optometrie ubu yanditswe nkumwuga muri Mozambike kandi izwi binyuze mu banyamuryango b\u2019inama nyafurika ya Optometrie (AFCO). Mu barangije, 26 ubu bakora mu bitaro bya Leta. Mubyongeyeho, 10 bafite imyanya yo kwigisha muri kaminuza harimo abagabo batanu n'abagore batanu. barindwi mu barangije kwiyandikisha muri porogaramu z'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza (batanu b'igitsina gabo n'abagore barindwi). \nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nUmujyi wa Nampula uherereye hagati mu ntara ya Nampula kandi ukikijwe n'ibibaya n'amasoko y'amabuye. Umujyi uri hagati y'imisozi miremire n'imisozi, isanzwe imbere mu majyaruguru ya Mozambike."}
{"id": "20306", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20306", "title": "Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange", "text": "Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange riherereye ku Musozi wa Nyange ufite uburebure bwa metero 1,783, uherereye mu Mudugudu wa Ngobagoba, Akagari ka Gaseke, Umurenge wa Nyange, mu Karere ka Ngororero. Uyu musozi, wahoze mu cyahoze cyitwa Ubudaha, wubatseho iryo shuri rikaba ari ryo ryagabweho igitero gikomeye mu mwaka wa 1997 n\u2019ikindi mu mwaka wa 1998.\nUbwicanyi bw\u2019i Nyange mu 1997 no mu 1998.\nUbwicanyi bw\u2019i Nyange ni kimwe mu bikorwa by\u2019ubugizi bwa nabi byakozwe n\u2019abacengezi mu Rwanda nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ibyo bikorwa byabaye ku wa 18 Werurwe 1997 ku Ishuri Ryisumbuye rya Nyange riherereye mu Karere ka Ngororero, Intara y\u2019Iburengerazuba, aho abanyeshuri barindwi bishwe bazira kwanga kwitandukanya hashingiwe ku moko. Iri shyano ryagize uruhare runini mu gusigasira indangagaciro z\u2019ubumwe n\u2019ubwiyunge mu Rwanda, ndetse abahitanywe n\u2019icyo gitero bakaba barashyizwe mu rwego rw\u2019Intwari z\u2019u Rwanda mu cyiciro cy\u2019Imena.\nIgitero cya Mbere: 18 Werurwe 1997.\nAhagana saa mbiri z\u2019ijoro, abacengezi baturukaga mu mashyamba yo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo bateye ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange. Babanje kwica umuzamu Jean Baptiste Zibera, bamukubita icyuma ndetse bamutemagura ijosi. Binjiye mu ishuri ry\u2019abanyeshuri bigaga mu mwaka wa gatandatu, babategeka kwitandukanya hashingiwe ku moko, ariko abo banyeshuri bose banga kubyemera bavuga ko ari Abanyarwanda.\nAbacengezi bahise babarasa, hapfiramo abanyeshuri batatu:\nBinjiye mu rindi shuri ry\u2019umwaka wa gatanu barongera babategeka kwitandukanya, barabyanga. Babarasaho, barabatemagura, banabateramo grenade, hapfiramo abandi bane:\nAbandi banyeshuri benshi barakomereka. Ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda zahise zihagera, zirwana n\u2019abo bacengezi, bariruka, umwe aricwa.\nIgitero cya kabiri: 4 Nzeri 1998.\nMu gihe abanyeshuri bari mu biruhuko, abacengezi bongeye gutera Nyange. Bishe abarimu batatu bari batuye mu kigo:\nBanateye urusisiro rwa Rubyiniro i Nyange, bahica abaturage batandatu.\nKwibukwa nk\u2019Intwari.\nKu wa 12 Ukuboza 2001, Inama y\u2019Abaminisitiri y\u2019u Rwanda yemeje ko abanyeshuri 47 bigaga mu mwaka wa gatanu n\u2019uwa gatandatu b\u2019i Nyange baba Intwari z\u2019u Rwanda mu cyiciro cy\u2019Imena, harimo abapfuye n\u2019abarokotse. Iki cyemezo cyashingiye ku ndangagaciro y\u2019ubumwe n\u2019ubutwari bagaragaje banze kwitandukanya hashingiwe ku moko.\nUrwibutso.\nNubwo Igicumbi cy\u2019Intwari z\u2019Igihugu giherereye i Remera mu Mujyi wa Kigali, Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Nyange na ryo ryubatse urwibutso rw\u2019abo banyeshuri biciwemo, harimo n\u2019amazina yabo yanditse ku kimenyetso cy\u2019urwibutso."}
{"id": "20307", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20307", "title": "Ruhimandyarya", "text": "Ruhimandyarya, izwi cyane ku izina ry\u2019\"Urutare rw\u2019Abarundi\", ni urutare runini kandi rurerure ruhanamiye ku mugezi wa Nyakabuye, uherereye mu Mudugudu wa Gasebeya, Akagari ka Gaseke, Umurenge wa Nyakabuye, Akarere ka Rusizi, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba y\u2019u Rwanda. Uru rutare ruri mu gace kari kazwi kera nka Bukunzi, kamwe mu turere tw\u2019icyaro dufite amateka maremare y\u2019abimukira n\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro.\nAmateka y\u2019izina.\nIzina \"Urutare rw\u2019Abarundi\" rituruka ku muryango wa Mubarure, yari umugabo wari ufite inkomoko mu gihugu cy\u2019u Burundi wageze mu Rwanda ahagana mu mwaka wa 1935. Mubarure yari umuhigi, hamwe n\u2019abandi baje bari kumwe, bakaza guhigira mu mashyamba ya Bweyeye, Ikimena na Nyirandakunze (Cyamudongo) ariyo bahigiragamo inyamaswa. Nyuma baje gutura hejuru y\u2019urwo rutare, bahaba igihe kirekire bituma abaturage baho barwita urw\u2019Abarundi.\nIbisobanuro by\u2019izina \"Ruhimandyarya\".\nIzina Ruhimandyarya ryatanzwe na Sanduruma Faransisiko, mwene Mubarure, wari uzwi nk\u2019umucukuzi w\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro by\u2019umwihariko zahabu. Yacukuraga zahabu mu ishyamba rya Bweyeye akajya kuyigurisha i Bukavu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Kubera ko abamuguriraga zahabu akenshi batamwishyuraga, Sanduruma yafashe icyemezo cyo guhisha amafaranga ye mu isenga riri muri urwo rutare, nk\u2019uburyo bwo \"guhima indyarya\". Aho yahishaga amafaranga hari hahanamye cyane, bikagorana kuhagera cyangwa kuyiba. Ibyo byatumye urwo rutare rutangira kwitwa \"Ruhimandyarya.\"\nUbumenyi bw\u2019amateka n\u2019ubushakashatsi.\nUrutare rwa Ruhimandyarya rufite agaciro gakomeye mu by\u2019amateka kuko rwakoreweho ubushakashatsi n\u2019umubirigikazi witwa Irene Boutakoff. Uyu muhanga mu by\u2019amateka yibanze ku byasigaye byo hambere (Ibisigaratongo mu rurimi rw'igifaransa byitwa arch\u00e9ologie), aho yavumbuyemo ibikoresho by\u2019amabuye aconze byakoreshwaga n\u2019abakurambere b\u2019Abanyarwanda mbere y\u2019igihe cy\u2019icyuma."}
{"id": "20308", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20308", "title": "Port Louis", "text": "Port Louis ni umurwa mukuru akaba ari n'umujyi utuwe cyane wa Maurice, cyane uherereye mu Karere ka Port Louis, uyu mujyi ufite agace gato k'iburengerazuba mu Karere ka Ruzi rwa Rukara. Port Louis n'icyo kigo cy'imari na politiki by'igihugu. Iyobowe n'Inama Njyanama y'Umujyi wa Port Louis. Ibarura rusange ryo mu 2018 ryakozwe n\u2019ibarurishamibare Maurice, abaturage baho bari 147.066. \nAmateka.\nPort Louis yakoreshejwe nk'icyambu n'abimukira b'Abaholandi kuva mu mwaka wi 1606, igihe batangiraga kuvuga ako gace nka \"Harbour ya Tortoises\". mu mwaka wi 1736 iyobowe na guverinoma y\u2019Ubufaransa, yahindutse ikigo cy\u2019ubutegetsi bwa Maurice kandi gihagarikwa cyane n\u2019amato y\u2019Abafaransa igihe banyuraga hagati ya Aziya n\u2019U burayi, bazengurutse ikirwa cya Byiringiro. icyubahiro Umwami Louis XV. Muri kiriya gihe cy\u2019abakoloni b'Abafaransa, Maurice yari azwi ku izina rya Ile de France. Guverineri w\u2019Ubufaransa muri kiriya gihe, Bertrand-Fran\u00e7ois Mah\u00e9 de La Bourdonnais, yagize uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019umujyi. Kubera ko Port Louis yari ikingiwe neza n\u2019umuyaga mwinshi mu gihe cy\u2019umuyaga na Moka Mountain Range, Port Louis yatoranijwe kugira ngo ibemo icyambu kinini n\u2019igihome cy\u2019izinga. Agaciro k\u2019icyambu karakomeje mu gihe Abongereza bigaruriye icyo kirwa mu gihe cy\u2019intambara ya Napoleonique (1800-15), kandi kugenzura inyanja y\u2019Ubuhinde. Icyakora, guhamagarira amato cyane nyuma yo gufungura umuyoboro wa Suez mu mwaka wi 1869. Ibikorwa by\u2019icyambu byiyongereye mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka irindwi hafunzwe umuyoboro wa Suez guhera mu 1967. Kuvugurura icyambu mu mpera z'umwaka wa 70 byamufashije gukomeza uruhare rwacyo nk'ibintu nyamukuru biva mu mahanga n'ibicuruzwa biva muri Maurice. Mu gihe Port Louis ikomeje kuba umurwa mukuru w\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019ubuyobozi bwa Maurice, kwagura inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo yatumye habaho iterambere ryinshi muri Port Louis, hubatswe amaduka menshi, amahoteri, na resitora mu gace ka Caudan Waterfront. \nRaouf Oderuth, Umuhanzi wo muri Maurice atanga amashusho yo mu 1930 yerekana inkombe y\u2019amazi igihe ubwikorezi bwa moteri butabaho. haracyamenyekana nubwo inyubako ndende, imodoka nyinshi, hamwe n'imbaga y'abanyamaguru.\nGuverinoma.\nImiyoborere y\u2019ibanze ya Port Louis igenzurwa n'inama njyanama y'umujyi. Inama Njyanama y\u2019Umujyi wa Port Louis yashinzwe bwa mbere mu 1830, ubu ikaba ari imwe mu nama eshanu z\u2019amakomine zishinzwe imijyi yo muri Maurice, nkuko byateguwe n\u2019amategeko agenga ubuyobozi bw\u2019ibanze 2011. Inama njyanama y'umujyi wa komine ifite abanyamuryango 32. Umujyi ugabanijwemo amatora mu bice umunani buri wese asubiza abajyanama bane. Abajyanama noneho batora Umuyobozi n'uwungirije umuyobozi. Imikorere y'inama njyanama ikorwa binyuze mu mashami y'ubuyobozi, Imari, Imikoreshereze y'ubutaka n'igenamigambi, ibikorwa remezo rusange, Ubuzima rusange, imibereho myiza, parike n'ubusitani, hamwe n'isomero ry'Umujyi. Serivisi zitangwa n'inzego z'ibanze zirimo amashuri abanza, amashuri y'incuke, n'amashuri y'imyuga, kurengera ubuzima, kugenzura imiturire, serivisi z\u2019imihanda, gukusanya imyanda, amarimbi, serivisi zimwe na zimwe zo kurengera ibidukikije n\u2019umuguzi, n\u2019ibikorwa byo kuzamura ubukungu. Izindi serivisi zitangwa mu mujyi na guverinoma nkuru. Harimo serivisi za polisi binyuze mu gipolisi cya Maurice, gikomeza ibice bibiri bishinzwe agace ka Port Louis (Metropolitan Diviziyo y'Amajyaruguru n'Amajyepfo). Hariho na Polisi yihariye ya Port, igizwe na Polisi ya Harbour na Polisi ya Sugar Terminal. Mu nshingano zabo harimo gutanga umutekano ku mizigo n'ibikoresho byo mu cyambu no kubahiriza amategeko ajyanye n'amabwiriza yo ku cyambu, gasutamo, akato, abinjira n'abasohoka.\nMu matora y\u2019amakomine 2025, Alliance du Changement yatsindiye imyanya 31 kuri 32 y\u2019inama njyanama, mu gihe uwigenga yabonye umutekano. Nyuma y\u2019amatora, akanama katoye Aslam Hosenally w\u2019umutwe w\u2019abarwanyi bo muri Maurice kuba umuyobozi wa nyagasani, wahoze akora uwo mwanya kuva mu mwaka wa 2012 kugeza 2013, na Giovanni Hensley w\u2019ishyaka ry\u2019abakozi kuba umuyobozi wungirije.\nUbukungu.\nUbukungu bwuy'umujyi bwiganjemo ikigo cy\u2019imari, ibikoresho by\u2019ibyambu, ubukerarugendo, n\u2019inganda zikora imyenda, imiti, plastiki n'imiti. Port Louis niho hari icyambu kinini mu karere k'inyanja y'Ubuhinde kandi ni kimwe mu bigo by'imari bikomeye bya Afurika. \nUburezi.\nPort-Louis ibamo amashuri yisumbuye menshi arimo Alpha College, Bhujoharry College, Labourdonnais College, Port Louis Academy, Loreto College, Madad Ul Islam Girls College, Ishuri ry\u2019abakobwa ry\u2019abayisilamu, Umujyi wa Koleji, Ishuri ry\u2019umunsi, Ishuri ry\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019ubuyisilamu n\u2019isi, Ishuri Rikuru rya Londere, Ocep Ishuri rikuru ryisumbuye, MEDCO Trinity Secondary Secondary SSS, Goolam Mohammed Dawjee Atchia State College, Ishuri ryisumbuye rya MEDCO Cassis, Renganaden Seeneevassen SSS, Port Louis SSS na Port College Louis. Leta ikora kandi ishuri ry'imyuga ku bahungu, Immaculee Conception SSV.\nIkigo gikomeye cy\u2019amashuri makuru muri Port Louis ni kaminuza y\u2019ikoranabuhanga, Maurice, kaminuza ya leta yibanda ku ikoranabuhanga. \u00c9cole de Medecine Louis Pasteur ritegura abanyeshuri kwigira ubuvuzi muri Universit\u00e9 de Lille mu Bufaransa. Amashuri menshi ya tekiniki nayo afite ibibanza mu mujyi, harimo ishuri rya Jhurry ryari iryinzobere mu ikoranabuhanga ry'amakuru, Ishuri ryubucuruzi rya Appavoo, Ishuri ry\u2019abaforomo rya Apollo Bramwell, Ishuri ry\u2019icungamutungo n\u2019imicungire ya BSP, hamwe n\u2019ishuri rikuru ry\u2019ibaruramari rya London."}
{"id": "20309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20309", "title": "Cyangugu", "text": "Cyangugu (ahahoze ari Shangugu) n'umujyi mukuru w'akarere ka Rusizi mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba, mu Rwanda. Uyu mujyi ukaba uherereye mu majyepfo y\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu, kandi ukaba uhuza Bukavu, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya congo, ariko ukitandukanya n'uwo n'umugezi wa Ruzizi. Ibiraro bibiri n'urugomero rwambuka umupaka.\nifite ibice bibiri by'ingenzi: Cyangugu ubwayo ni akarere gafite ubucucike buke ku nkombe z'ikiyaga, naho Kamembe n'ikigo kinini cy\u2019inganda n\u2019ubwikorezi kiri imbere imbere no mu majyaruguru. Ikibuga cy'indege cya Kamembe gikorera mu mujyi n'indege inshuro 11 mu cyumweru zerekeza Kigali, zikoreshwa na RwandAir.\nUyu mujyi uri hafi y\u2019ishyamba rya Nyungwe, ahantu nyaburanga hasurwa n\u2019abakerarugendo, akaba ari kamwe mu turere tw\u2019amashyamba twa nyuma dusigaye mu Rwanda.\nMu 2022 uyu umujyi wari utuwe n'abaturage 43.866."}
{"id": "20310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20310", "title": "Ngorongoro Conservation Area", "text": "Izina rya crater rifite inkomoko ya onomatopoeic; yitiriwe abashumba ba Maasai nyuma yijwi ryakozwe na cowbell (\"ngoro ngoro\"). Hashingiwe ku bimenyetso by\u2019ibinyabuzima OH 7 biboneka ku kibaya cya Olduvai, amoko atandukanye ya hominid yigaruriye ako gace byibuze miliyoni 1.75. \nAbahiga basimbuwe n'abashumba mu myaka ibihumbi ishize. Abanyayiraki baje muri kariya gace hashize imyaka igera ku 2000 kandi bifatanya na Datooga ahagana mu mwaka wa 1700. Iyo mitwe yombi yirukanywe muri ako gace na Maasai mu myaka ya 1800. \nAbanyaburayi bazwiho kuba abarakandagije ikirenge muri Ngorongoro Crater kugeza mu 1892 ubwo yasurwa na Oscar Boumann. Abavandimwe babiri b'Abadage (Adolph na Friedrich Siedentopf) bahinze muri icyo cyobo kugeza Intambara ya mbere y'isi yose nyuma yo gukodesha ubutaka ku buyobozi bwa Afurika y'uburasirazuba bw'abadage. Abavandimwe bahoraga bategura ibirori byo kurasa kugirango bashimishe inshuti zabo. Bagerageje kandi kwirukana amashyo y\u2019inyamanswa mu mwobo. \nUbumenyi bwa geologiya.\nItsinda ry\u2019ibirunga rya Pliocene Ngorongoro rigizwe n\u2019ibirunga umunani byazimiye muri Eyasi igice cya graben, urubibi rw'iburasirazuba rwaranzwe na Gregory Rift Western Escarpment. Inkunga y'Ikiyaga cya Eyasi ihuza igice cya graben mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba. Muri urwo ruganda, ibirunga bitanu ni imeze nk'imigozi, mugihe bitatu bifite Calderas. Ikirunga cya Ngorongoro (2.5-1.9 Ma) ni trachyandesite ya basaltike. Caldera igaburirwa ni nzuzi za Munge na Oljoro Nyuki, mugihe amasoko ashyushye ya Ngoitokitok agaburira mu gishanga cya Goringop. Ikiyaga cya Magadi ni ikiyaga cya metero 1,7. Ibindi birunga biri muri icyo kigo birimo Olmoti (2.01\u20131.79 Ma), Empakaai, Loolmalasin, Sadiman (3.7 Ma), Lemagrut, na Oldeani. Igice cyo mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa NCA kigizwe n'ibibaya bya Serengeti, ikibaya cya Salei, ikibaya cya Oldupai, hamwe n'imisozi ya Gol inselbergs. Izi inselbergs zigize Quartzite ya Mozambike na schist ya mika hafi (800-500 Ma) mumyaka. "}
{"id": "20311", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20311", "title": "Inyamaswa zo muri Tanzaniya", "text": "Tanzaniya irimo ibice 20 kw'ijana by'ubwoko bunini bw'inyamabere z\u2019inyamabere z\u2019Afurika, ziboneka hirya no hino mu mashyamba naza pariki, ahantu hagenewe kubungabunga ibidukikije, parike zo mu nyanja, na parike 17 z\u2019igihugu, zikwirakwira ku buso bwa no gukora hafi 38 ku ijana by'ubutaka bw'igihugu. Umutungo w\u2019ibinyabuzima wo muri Tanzaniya uvugwa ko utabangikanye muri Afurika n'igihugu cyambere kireba imikino \". Parike ya Serengeti, ubuso bwa kabiri mu gihugu muri parike y\u2019igihugu kuri, iherereye mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya kandi izwi cyane kubera amashyo menshi yimuka y\u2019inyamanswa na zebra mu gihe kandi azwiho kuba kimwe mu bintu bitangaje by\u2019isi. Agace ko kubungabunga Ngorongoro, gashinzwe mu 1959, ni Umurage w\u2019isi wa UNESCO kandi utuwe n\u2019abaturage ba Maasai. Crater yayo ya Ngorongoro niyo Caldera nini cyane ku isi. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nKuva mu gihe cy'ubakoloni, kubungabunga inyamaswa muri Tanzaniya byabaye umukoro kuri guverinoma ya tanzaniya. Muri uru rwego, imikoreshereze y\u2019umutungo w\u2019inyamanswa n\u2019abaturage baho yari isanzwe ibuza, bigatuma ubukene bwiyongera mu cyaro no guhiga. Mu myaka yashize, ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cya parike ya Tanzaniya (TANAPA) cyatangije ibikorwa byo gukosora kugira ngo abaturage baho bagire uruhare mu kubungabunga ibidukikije, bigamije gutanga umusanzu mu bukungu bw\u2019ibanze binyuze mu kugabana inyungu zingana."}
{"id": "20312", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20312", "title": "Rukarara", "text": "Umugezi wa Rukarara (cyangwa Lukarara) ni uruzi rwo mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda rukaba uruzi rw'umugezi wa Mwogo, na rwo rukaba uruzi rw'umugezi wa Nyabarongo. Namazi ya kure cyane ya Nili.\nInkomoko.\nRukarara n'uruzi ruzamuka rukagera mu majyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda mu burasirazuba bw\u2019igabana rya Kongo Nili.Igishanga cya Kamiranzovu kiri mu ishyamba rya Nyungwe ritanga umugezi wa Rukarara. [1] Inkomoko ya Rukarara ubu izwiho kuba ariyo isoko rusange ya Nili. Ibi byashimangiwe n\u2019urugendo rwo mu 2005/2006 rwerekeje ku ruzi hamwe n\u2019ibikoresho bigezweho byo kugenda. Inkomoko ya Nili, isoko ya kure kuva mu kanwa kayo, iri ku butumburuke bwa, ku burebure n'uburebure\nRukarara ifite inkomoko mu Karere ka Nyamagabe. Umugezi wa Nyirabugoyi na Rubyiro niwo mugezi wacyo mukuru, byombi bizamuka muri parike y'igihugu ya Nyungwe. Rukarara ni nzira ndende yinzuzi zitanga Mwogo. [6] Rukarara itemba mu majyepfo hanyuma iburasirazuba, isuka mu ruzi rwa Mwogo. Mwogo igatemba imena mu majyaruguru, ihuza uruzi rwa Mbirurume mu majyepfo ya Bwek kugira ngo ruhinduke uruzi rwa Nyabarongo. "}
{"id": "20313", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20313", "title": "Umurenge wa Gisozi", "text": "Umurenge wa Gisozi ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari 2.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gisozi wari utuwe n'abaturage 75 611. Muri uyu murenge hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Gisozi ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 8,30. Ugizwe n'utugari 2:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gisozi wari utuwe n'abaturage 44 003. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 75 611.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside.\nMu Murenge wa Gisozi hari Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali. Mu mwaka wa 2023, UNESCO yashyize inzibutso enye za Jenoside mu murage w'isi. Urwibutso rwa Kigali ni rumwe muri izo nzibutso."}
{"id": "20315", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20315", "title": "Urutonde rw'amashanyarazi mu Rwanda", "text": "Urupapuro rukurikira rugaragaza amashanyarazi mu Rwanda.\nUmurongo ngenderwaho.\nMu mwaka wa 2016, u Rwanda rwashyizwe ku mwanya 166 mu bijyanye n\u2019ubushobozi bwashyizweho na191\u00a0 na 164 ku bijyanye n\u2019umusaruro w\u2019umwaka hamwe na \u00a0miliyoni 525 zaKilo wati(kw). Urwego rwo gukwirakwiza amashanyarazi rwari 21% muri 2013 (67% mu mijyi na 5% mu cyaro). Nk\u2019uko Banki y'Isi ibivuga, mu 2017, 34% by'igihugu bari bafite amashanyarazi, ahanini akaba agenerwa imijyi minini. Mu cyaro, abaturage batageze kuri umwe ku icumi bafite amashanyarazi, cyangwa abantu barenga miliyoni umunani. Kugeza muri Mutarama 2019, isosiyete y'igihugu ishinzwe amashanyarazi mu Rwanda ariyo Rwanda Energy Group (REG) yari ifite ingufu za Mega wati 218. Nk\u2019uko REG ibivuga, ubushobozi bwashyizweho bugomba kwiyongera kugera kuri mega wati 556\u00a0 muri 2024 naho urugero rw'amashanyarazi rugomba kuva kuri 49,6,rukagera kuri 100%. Kugeza muri Kamena 2019, ingufu z'amashanyarazi ku rwego rw'igihugu zigeze kuri 224,6 mega wati zifite ingufu zingana na mega wati 140,6\u00a0.\nIhuza ryo hanze.\nRwanda"}
{"id": "20316", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20316", "title": "Umurenge wa Remera", "text": "Umurenge wa Remera ni umwe mu mirenge 15 igize Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Remera wari utuwe n'abaturage 38 648. Ugizwe n'utugari 4. Muri uyu murenge hari Stade Amahoro na BK Arena.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Remera ni umwe mu mirenge 15 y'Akarere ka Gasabo. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 7,27. Uri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 445. Ugizwe n'utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Remera wari utuwe n'abaturage 43 279. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 38 648. Abagabo bari 20 300. Abagore bari 18 348. Abaturage bose batuye mu mujyi. Umubare w'abaturage wagabanutse hagati ya 2012 na 2022.\nIbikorwa by'ingenzi.\nMu Murenge wa Remera hari Stade Amahoro. Iyi sitade yakira abantu 45 000. Hafi yayo hari BK Arena. BK Arena yakira abantu 10 000.\nAgace ka Gisimenti (Kisimenti) kari hagati muri Remera. Ni ihuriro ry'ubucuruzi. Hari amahoteli, amabanki n'amaduka."}
{"id": "20324", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20324", "title": "Bimwe wamenya ku ngagi", "text": "bimwe wamenya ku ngagi uburyo zibayeho ndetse nuko zishyingurwa, umuryango w'ingagi nushobora gusurwa iminota irenze 60 kandi itsinda risura ingagi nirishobora kurenga abanu umunani ibi nukujyirango ingagi zitamenyerana nabantu kuburyo zishobora gutangira gukina nabantu ndetse nokubakoraho, bikaba byakorohereza barushimusi kuko zishobora kubishyira zikabitiranya nabashyitsi basanzwe.\nindanganuro.\n1.https://mobile.igihe.com/ubukerarugendo/article/bimwe-mu-byo-wamenya-ku-ngagi-birimo-uburyo-zibaho-n-uko-zishyingurwa\n2.https://mobile.igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/abana-b-ingagi-40-bazitwa-izina-muri-nzeri"}
{"id": "20325", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20325", "title": "Amangazini.com", "text": "Amangazini.com ni urubuga rwo kuri interineti rukorera mu Rwanda, rukaba rugurisha amatara atandukanye ndetse n\u2019ibikoresho bijyanye nabyo. Rukoresha urubuga rwa internet aho abaguzi bashobora kureba no gutumiza amatara atandukanye yiganjemo chandeliers, pendant lights, spotlights, n\u2019ibindi. Uru rubuga rwatangiye imikorere mu buryo bweruye muri gicurasi 2025 rukomeje gushyira itafari rifatika mu iterambere ry'ubucuri bwo kuri internet mu Rwanda."}
