{"id": "20335", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20335", "title": "Dominique Habimana", "text": "Dominique Habimana ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyarwanda. Ni Minisitiri w'Ubutegetsi bw'Igihugu kuva ku wa 24 Nyakanga 2025.\nMbere yaho, Habimana yari Umunyamabanga Mukuru wa RALGA. Ni n'umuhanzi w'indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nMu 2006, Habimana yabonye impamyabumenyi ya \"Bachelor\" mu mibereho y'abaturage (\"Social Sciences\"). Yayikuye muri Universit\u00e9 Libre de Kigali (ULK). Mu 2014, yabonye impamyabumenyi ya \"Master\" mu iterambere (\"Development Studies\"). Yayikuye muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Mu 2022, yabonye indi \"Master\" mu gukemura amakimbirane. Yayikuye muri Geneva Graduate Institute, mu Ubusuwisi.\nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 2013 kugeza mu 2018, Habimana yakoreye GIZ mu Rwanda. Yari impuguke mu miyoborere.\nKuva mu 2018 kugeza mu 2024, yakoreye Ikigo cy'Ubusuwisi gishinzwe iterambere n'ubutwererane (SDC). Yari ashinzwe gahunda z'imiyoborere. Yateje imbere uburyo bwo gukemura amakimbirane mu baturage, nk'Abunzi. Mu gihe cya COVID-19, yayoboye gahunda yo gufasha imishinga mito n'iciriritse. Iyo gahunda yakorerwaga mu Rwanda, mu Burundi no muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nKu wa 6 Kamena 2024, Habimana yabaye Umunyamabanga Mukuru wa RALGA. RALGA ni ihuriro ry'inzego z'ibanze mu Rwanda. Habimana yasimbuye Ladislas Ngendahimana.\nKu wa 24 Nyakanga 2025, Perezida Paul Kagame yagize Habimana Minisitiri w'Ubutegetsi bw'Igihugu. Habimana yasimbuye Dr Patrice Mugenzi. Ihererekanyabubasha ryabaye ku wa 28 Nyakanga 2025.\nUmuziki n'ukwemera.\nHabimana ni umuhanzi w'indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana. Mu 2025, yari amaze imyaka irenga 11 mu muziki. Yayoboye korali Seraphim Melodies. Yanditse indirimbo nyinshi z'iyo korali. Yandikiye n'abandi bahanzi indirimbo. Mu ndirimbo ze harimo \"Njyewe na Yesu\", \"Ndagukunda\", \"Narababariwe\" na \"Umunyarwanda\".\nHabimana ni Umukirisitu wo mu itorero AEBR Kacyiru. Se ni pasiteri."}
{"id": "20338", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20338", "title": "Ibuprofen", "text": "Ibuprofen ni imiti yo mu cyiciro cya nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory (NSAID) ikoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare, umuriro, n\u2019ububabare. Ibi birimo imihango ibabaza, migraine, na rubagimpande ya rubagimpande. Irashobora kandi gukoreshwa mugufunga patent ductus arteriosus kumwana utagejeje igihe. Ishobora gukoreshwa biciye mukanwa cyangwa mumitsi. Mubisanzwe itangira gukora mugihe kingana n isha imwe.\nIngaruka zisanzwe zirimo gutwika no guhubuka. Ugereranije nizindi NSAIDs, irashobora kugira ingaruka nke nko kuva amaraso gastrointestinal. Yongera ibyago byo kunanirwa k'umutima, kunanirwa kw'impyiko, no kunanirwa kw'umwijima. Mugihe gito, ntabwo bigaragara ko byongera ibyago byo kurwara umutima; icyakora, kuri dosiye ndende irashobora. Ibuprofen irashobora kandi kwangiza asima. Nubwo bidasobanutse niba ari umutekano mugihe cyo gutwita hakiri kare, bigaragara ko ari bibi mugihe cyo gutwita nyuma bityo ntibisabwa. Koresha mugihe konsa ari umutekano. Kimwe nizindi NSAIDs, ikora ibuza umusaruro wa prostaglandine kugabanya ibikorwa bya enzyme cyclooxygenase. Ibuprofen nintege nke zo kurwanya inflammatory kurusha izindi NSAIDs.\nIbuprofen yavumbuwe mu 1961 na Stewart Adams muri Boots UK Limited hanyuma ibanza kugurishwa nka Brufen. Iraboneka munsi yizina ryubucuruzi, harimo Nurofen, Inama na Motrin. Yashyizwe ku isoko bwa mbere mu 1969 mu Bwongereza no muri Amerika mu 1974. Ari kurutonde rwumuryango wubuzima ku isi urutonde rwimiti yingenzi. Iraboneka nkumuti rusange. Igiciro cyinshi mugihugu kiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati ya 0.01 na 0.04 kuri dose. Muri Reta zunzubumwe za Amerika, igura amadolari 0.05 kuri dose. Muri 2017, yari imiti ya 28 yandikiwe cyane muri Amerika, hamwe na barenga 24miriyoni."}
{"id": "20342", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20342", "title": "COVID-19", "text": "Indwara ya Coronavirus 2019 (COVID-19) n'indwara yandura iterwa na syndrome ikabije y'ubuhumekero coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV-2). Ibimenyetso bikunze kubamo umuriro, inkorora, ingorane zo guhumeka, umunaniro, kubabara umutwe, kubura impumuro n'uburyohe, kubabara mu muhogo, kuruka, no gucibwamo. Ubusanzwe bitangirira mu minsi ibiri na cumi nine nyuma yo kwandura virusi. kubantu bamwe; ariko, ntugire ibimenyetso.\nIkwirakwizwa ribaho cyane cyane iyo umuntu wanduye ahuye cyane nundi muntu. Ibi birashobora kubaho haba kwanduza ikirere cyangwa ibitonyanga bito birimo virusi. Ntibisanzwe, virusi irashobora gukwirakwira hifashishijwe ibintu byanduye. Abantu barashobora kwanduzanya virusi iminsi ibiri mbere yuko bagaragaza ibimenyetso, kandi muri rusange bakomeza kwandura iminsi igera ku 10, nubwo abafite uburwayi bukomeye wenda bandura igihe kirekire. Kwipimisha mubisanzwe biterwa na polymerase urunigi (PCR) cyangwa kwipimisha antigen byihuse bivuye mumazuru cyangwa umuhogo.\nIngamba zo kwirinda zirimo intera y'umubiri, gukoresha mask yo mu rwego rwohejuru, guhumeka ahantu h'imbere, na karantine. Inkingo nyinshi nazo zigabanya ibyago. Byinshi m'ubuvuzi n'ibimenyetso kandi birashyigikirwa. Mubadakeneye ibitaro, ariko bafite ibyago byinshi, nirmatrelvir / ritonavir, remdesivir, cyangwa molnupiravir irashobora gukoreshwa. Kubakeneye kuvura ogisijeni, dexamethasone na remdesivir barashobora gukoreshwa. Kubakeneye ubuvuzi bukomeye tocilizumab cyangwa sarilumab barashobora kongerwamo.\nMuri abo bantu bagaragaza ibimenyetso, abagera kuri 80% bakira badakeneye ibitaro, 15% bakeneye ubuvuzi bwa ogisijeni, naho 5% bakeneye ubuvuzi bukomeye. Abantu bakuze nabafite ibindi bibazo byubuzima bafite ibyago byinshi. Mugihe benshi bakira nyuma y'ibyumweru bike, bamwe bakomeza guhura n'ingaruka zitandukanye (COVID ndende) mumezi. Kugeza ku, byibuze zimaze kwemezwa, bikaba byavuyemo abarenga zapfuye. Umubare nyawo w'impfu wari; ariko, ugereranije hafi guhera ku ya 31 Ukuboza 2021. Urubanza rwa mbere ruzwi rwamenyekanye i Wuhan mu Bushinwa, mu Kuboza 2019. Indwara imaze gukwira isi yose, itera icyorezo gikomeje. "}
{"id": "20343", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20343", "title": "Ubumuga bwo kutumva", "text": "Ubumuga bwo kumva, bizwi kandi nko kutumva. Umuntu utumva ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva. Kubura kumva bishobora kugaragara k'ugutwi kumwe cyangwa yombi. Mu bana, ibibazo byo kutumva bishobora kugira ingaruka kubushobozi bwo kwiga ururimi ruvugwa kandi mubantu bakuru bishobora guteza ingorane mubikorwa by'imibereho no kukazi. Kubura kumva bishobora kuba igihe gito cyangwa gihoraho. Kubura kumva bijyanye n'imyaka mu busanzwe bigira ingaruka kumatwi yombi kandi biterwa no gutakaza umusatsi wa cochlear. Mu bantu bamwe, cyane cyane abantu bakuze, kutumva bishobora kuvamo irungu.\nIndwara yo kutumva ishobora guterwa n'impamvu nyinshi, zirimo: genetika, gusaza, guhura n'urusaku, indwara zimwe na zimwe, ingorane zavutse, ihahamuka ry'ugutwi, n'imiti imwe n'imwe cyangwa uburozi. Indwara isanzwe itera kutumva ni indwara zidakira. Indwara zimwe na zimwe mugihe utwite, nka cytomegalovirus, sifilis na rubella, nazo zishobora gutera umwana kutumva. Gutakaza kumva birasuzumwa mugihe ibizamini byo kumva bisanga umuntu ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva d\u00e9cibel 25 byibura ugutwi. Kwipimisha kutumva neza birasabwa kubana bavutse bose. Kubura kumva bishobora gushyirwa mubice byoroheje (25 kugeza 40 dB), biringaniye (41 kugeza 55\u00a0dB), biringaniye bikabije (56 kugeza 70\u00a0dB), bikomeye (71 kugeza 90\u00a0dB), cyangwa byimbitse (birenze 90\u00a0dB). Hariho ubwoko butatu bwingenzi bwo kutumva: gutakaza kwumva, kubura kumva, no kutumva neza.\nHafi ya kimwe cya kabiri cyo kutumva kw'isi yose irashobora kwirindwa hifashishijwe ingamba z'ubuzima rusange. Ibikorwa nk'ibi birimo gukingira, kwita ku gutwita neza, kwirinda urusaku rwinshi, no kwirinda imiti imwe n'imwe. Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku buzima rirasaba ko urubyiruko rugabanya amajwi menshi ndetse no gukoresha amajwi bwite ku isaaha imwe ku munsi mu rwego rwo kugabanya urusaku. Kumenyekanisha hakiri kare no gushyigikirwa ni ngombwa cyane mubana. Kubikoresho byinshi byumva, ururimi rwamarenga, cochlear yatewe hamwe na subtitles ni ingirakamaro. Gusoma iminwa n'ubundi buhanga bwingirakamaro bamwe batezimbere. Kubona ibikoresho byumva, ariko, bigarukira mubice byinshi byisi.\nKugeza mu 2013 kutumva bigira ingaruka ku bantu bagera kuri miliyari 1,1 ku rugero runaka. Itera ubumuga ku bantu bagera kuri miliyoni 466 (5% by'abatuye isi), n'ubumuga buciriritse kandi bukabije ku bantu miliyoni 124. Mu bafite ubumuga buciriritse kandi bukabije miliyoni 108 baba mu bihugu byinjiza amafaranga make kandi yo hagati. Mu bafite ikibazo cyo kutumva, byatangiye mu bwana miliyoni 65. Abakoresha ururimi rw'amarenga kandi bagize umuco w'abatumva babona ko bafite itandukaniro aho kuba uburwayi. Benshi mu bagize ubumuga w\u2019amatwi barwanya kugerageza gukiza ubumuga bwo kutumva kandi bamwe muri bo muri uyu muryango babona ko hashyizweho cochlear bafite impungenge kuko bafite ubushobozi bwo gukuraho umuco wabo. Ijambo \"kutumva\" akenshi rifatwa nabi kuko ryibanda kubyo abantu badashobora gukora."}
{"id": "20344", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20344", "title": "Impiswi", "text": "Indwara y'impiswi, nanone yitwa impiswi, ni uburyo bwo kugira byibura amara atatu arekuye, atemba, cyangwa y'amazi buri munsi. Bikunze kumara iminsi mike kandi bishobora kuvamo umwuma kubera kubura amazi. Ibimenyetso byo kubura umwuma akenshi bitangirana no gutakaza uburebure busanzwe bwuruhu nimyitwarire irakaze. Ibi birashobora gutera imbere kugabanuka kwinkari, gutakaza ibara ryuruhu, umuvuduko w'umutima wihuse, no kugabanuka kubyitabira uko bikabije. Intebe zidakabije ariko zidafite amazi kubana bonsa gusa, ariko, ni ibisanzwe.\nImpamvu zikunze kugaragara cyane ni kwandura amara bitewe na virusi, bagiteri, cyangwa parasite - indwara izwi kandi nka gastroenteritis. Izi ndwara akenshi ziboneka mu biryo cyangwa amazi byanduye umwanda, cyangwa biturutse ku wundi muntu wanduye. Ubwoko butatu bw'impiswi ni: igihe gito impiswi y'amazi, igihe gito cyo gucibwamo amaraso, hamwe n'impiswi ikomeza (kumara ibyumweru birenga bibiri, bishobora kuba amazi cyangwa amaraso). Igihe gito impiswi y'amazi irashobora guterwa na kolera, nubwo ibi bidasanzwe mubihugu byateye imbere. Niba amaraso ahari, bizwi kandi nka dysentery. Impamvu nyinshi zitandura zirashobora gutera impiswi. Muri byo harimo kutoroherana kwa lactose, syndrome de munda, kutagira celiac gluten sensitivite, indwara ya celiac, indwara zifata amara nka colitis ulcerative colitis, hyperthyroidism, diarrhea aside aside, hamwe n'imiti myinshi. Mubihe byinshi, imico yintebe kugirango yemeze impamvu nyayo ntabwo isabwa.\nIndwara y'impiswi irashobora kwirindwa no kunoza isuku, amazi meza yo kunywa, no gukaraba intoki n'isabune. Kwonsa byibuze amezi atandatu no gukingira rotavirus nabyo birasabwa. Igisubizo cyo mu kanwa (ORS) - amazi meza afite umunyu mwinshi hamwe n'isukari - nuburyo bwo guhitamo. Ibinini bya Zinc nabyo birasabwa. Iyi miti bivugwa ko yakijije abana miliyoni 50 mu myaka 25 ishize. Iyo abantu barwaye impiswi birasabwa ko bakomeza kurya ibiryo byiza kandi abana bagakomeza konsa. Niba ubucuruzi bwa ORS butaboneka, ibisubizo byakorewe murugo birashobora gukoreshwa. Kubafite umwuma mwinshi, hashobora gukenerwa amazi yimitsi. Imanza nyinshi; icyakora, irashobora gucungwa neza hamwe na flux kumunwa. Antibiyotike, nubwo idakoreshwa gake, irashobora gusabwa mugihe gito nkabafite impiswi zamaraso hamwe n'umuriro mwinshi, abafite impiswi ikabije nyuma yingendo, nabahinga bagiteri cyangwa parasite zihariye. Loperamide irashobora gufasha kugabanya umubare wamaraso ariko ntibisabwa kubafite uburwayi bukomeye.\nHafi ya 1.7 kugeza 5\u00a0miliyari zanduye zimpiswi zibaho buri mwaka. Bikunze kugaragara cyane mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, aho abana bato barwara impiswi ugereranije gatatu mu mwaka. Impfu zose zatewe n'impiswi zigera kuri 1.26\u00a0miliyoni muri 2013 - munsi ya 2.58\u00a0miliyoni mu 1990. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yari iya kabiri mu mpfu zikunze kwibasira abana bato bari munsi y\u2019imyaka itanu (miliyoni 0,76 cyangwa 11%). Ibice bikunze kurwara impiswi nabyo ni impamvu itera imirire mibi kandi ikaba ikunze kugaragara cyane kubatarengeje imyaka itanu. Ibindi bibazo birebire bishobora kuvamo harimo gukura kudindiza no gutera imbere m'ubwenge."}
{"id": "20345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20345", "title": "Kurdistan", "text": "Kurdistan cyangwa Kurdistan Nini, ni agace kadahagije gasobanuwe mu buryo bwa geo-kulturali muri Aziya y'Uburengerazuba aho Abakurdi bagize igice kinini cy'abaturage kandi umuco, indimi, n'indangamuntu by'Abakurdi byahoze bishingiye ku mateka."}
{"id": "20347", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20347", "title": "Urukingo rwa Tetanusi", "text": "Urukingo rwa Tetanusi, ruzwi kandi ku izina rya tetanus toxoid (TT), ni urukingo rukora rukoreshwa mu gukumira tetanusi. Ikoreshwa ifatanije ninkingo ya diphtheria. Mugihe cyubwana, inshuro eshanu zirasabwa, hamwe na gatandatu yatanzwe mugihe cyubwangavu. Nyuma yinshuro eshatu, hafi ya bose babanje gukingirwa. Ibihugu bimwe bitanga dose esheshatu gusa; mugihe abandi, nka USA, basaba kuzamura buri myaka icumi. Isasu rya booster rishobora gutangwa mugihe cyamasaha 48 yakomeretse kubantu bafite inkingo zitajyanye n'igihe. Ku bantu bafite ibikomere byinshi badakingiwe byuzuye, antitoxine ya tetanusi nayo irashobora gusabwa. Kwemeza ko abagore batwite bagezweho ku bijyanye no gukingira tetanusi muri buri gihe cyo gutwita birashobora gukumira tetanusi y\u2019ababyeyi na babyaye. \nUrukingo rufite umutekano cyane, harimo igihe utwite ndetse n'abafite virusi itera SIDA. Umutuku n'ububabare aho batewe inshinge bibaho hagati ya 25% na 85% byabantu. Umuriro, kumva unaniwe, nububabare bwimitsi bworoheje bibaho mubantu batageze ku 10%. Imyitwarire ikabije ya allergique ibaho munsi y'umuntu 100.000.\nInkingo nyinshi zahujwe zirimo urukingo rwa tetanusi, nka DTaP na Tdap, rukubiyemo urukingo rwa diphtheria, tetanusi, na pertussis, na DT na Td, rukubiyemo urukingo rwa diphtheria na tetanusi. DTaP na DT bihabwa abana bari munsi yimyaka irindwi, mugihe Tdap na Td bihabwa abo bafite imyaka irindwi nayirenga. Inyuguti nto d na p bisobanura imbaraga nke zinkingo za diphtheria na pertussis. \nTetanus antiserum yakozwe mu 1890, ingaruka zayo zo kuyirinda zimara ibyumweru bike. Urukingo rwa tetanus toxoid rwakozwe mu 1924, rutangira gukoreshwa ku basirikare mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose. Imikoreshereze yacyo yatumye igabanuka rya 95% igabanuka rya tetanusi. Ari kurutonde rwumuryango w'ubuzima ku isi urutonde rw'imiti yingenzi. Igiciro cyinshi mugihugu kiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati ya 0.17 na 0,65 USD kuri dose. Muri Amerika, amasomo y'urukingo rwa tetanusi ari hagati ya 25 na 50 USD."}
