{"id": "20352", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20352", "title": "E SC LM NYANZA", "text": "Ishuri rya ECOLE DES SCIENCES SAINT LOUIS DE MONTFORT riherereye mu murenge wa busasamana, mu karere ka nyanza, intara yamajyepfo. \nabize nabakoze muri ECOLE DES SCIENCES SAINT LOUIS DE MONTFORT bagiye kuri ririya shuri bizeho bahemba abanyeshuri batsinze neza. \nkuri uyu wa 22kamena abize nabakoze muri ryo shuri guhera 1965 kugeza 2024 bishyize hamwe bitwa E.SC.L.M NYANZA ALUMNI \nnibo basuye aho bize bahemba abanyeshuri batsinze neza."}
{"id": "20353", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20353", "title": "Abajyanama b'ubuzima", "text": "Mu 2008, ni bwo u Rwanda rwashyizeho gahunda y'abajyanama b'ubuzima batorwa muri buri mudugudu, bahabwa inshingano zo kuzamura imyumvire y'abaturage mu kwirinda indwara no kwivuza hakiri kare.\nABAJYAMA B'UBUZIMA BAGIYE GUSHYIRWA MU BAKORESHA MUGANGA SACCO\nMinisitiri b'ubuzima, Dr Sabin NSANZIMANA, yatangaje ko abajyanama b'ubuzima bagiye gushyirwa mu bakoresha Muganga SACCO mu rwego rwo kubafasha gutera imbere no gukemura bimwe mu bibazo biri mu makoperative yabo hirya no hino mu gihugu."}
{"id": "20354", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20354", "title": "Ibigo bya Saint Aloys", "text": "Groupe Scolaire (GS) Saint Aloys Rwamagana ni, ishuri ry'amadini ya gatorika riherereye i Rwamagana mu Rwanda, Rifashwa na leta kandi riyoborwa n'abafurere ba Yozefiti. Ishuri riyobora ibyiciro bitandukanye by'amashuri yisumbuye, harimo ibya siyansi n'ubucuruzi kandi ryakira abahungu n'abakobwa.\nAmashami atandukanye.\nIshuri rifite amashami atandukanye harimo MEG, PCM, PCB, MCB, HEG, Hamwe n'icyiciro rusange."}
{"id": "20358", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20358", "title": "Furosemide", "text": "Furosemide, igurishwa ku izina rya Lasix mu zindi, ni imiti ikoreshwa mu kuvura amazi bitewe no kunanirwa ku umutima, inkovu z'umutima, cyangwa indwara z'impyiko. Irashobora kandi gukoreshwa mukuvura umuvuduko ukabije wamaraso. Irashobora gufatwa no guterwa ku imitsi cyangwa mumunwa. Iyo ifashwe kumunwa, mubisanzwe itangira gukora mugihe cyisaha imwe, mugihe imitsi, itangira gukora muminota itanu.\nIngaruka zisanzwe zirimo kumva urumuri ruhagaze, kuvuza amatwi, no kumva urumuri. Ingaruka zikomeye zishobora kuba zirimo electrolyte idasanzwe, umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso, no kutumva neza. Kwipimisha amaraso birasabwa buri gihe kubavura. Furosemide ni ubwoko bwa loop diuretic ikora mukugabanya reabsorption ya sodium nimpyiko.\nFurosemide yahawe patenti mu 1959 kandi yemererwa gukoreshwa mu 1964. Ari kurutonde rw'umuryango wubuzima ku isi urutonde rwimiti yingenzi. Igiciro cyinshi mugihugu kiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati ya $ 0.004 na US $ 0.02 kumunsi. Muri Amerika, iraboneka nk'imiti rusange kandi igura amadorari y'Amerika 0.15 kumunsi. Muri 2017, yari imiti ya 17 ikunze kwandikirwa muri Amerika, hamwe na miliyoni zirenga 30 zandikiwe. Ari kurutonde rw\u2019ibiro bishinzwe kurwanya ibiyobyabwenge ku isi kubera impungenge z\u2019uko ishobora guhisha ibiyobyabwenge. Yarakoreshejwe kandi mu mafarashi yo gusiganwa mu kuvura no gukumira amaraso ava mu bihaha."}
{"id": "20359", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20359", "title": "Meropenem", "text": "Meropenem, igurishwa ku izina rya Merrem mu zindi, ni antibiyotike yagutse. ikoreshwa mu kuvura indwara zitandukanye za bagiteri. Bimwe muribi birimo meningite, kwandura munda, umusonga, na anthrax. Itangwa no gutera inshinge.\nIngaruka zikunze kugaragara zirimo isesemi, impiswi, impatwe, kubabara umutwe, guhubuka, no kubabara aho batewe inshinge. Ingaruka zikomeye zirimo kwandura Clostridium diffile, gufatwa, hamwe na allergique harimo na anaphylaxis. Abafite allergic kubindi \u03b2-lactam antibiotique barashobora kuba allergique kuri meropenem. Gukoresha mugutwita bigaragara ko ari umutekano. Ari mumuryango wa karbapenem yimiti. Ubusanzwe Meropenem itera urupfu rwa bagiteri binyuze mu guhagarika ubushobozi bwabo bwo gukora urukuta. Irwanya cyane gusenyuka na \u03b2-lactamase itanga bagiteri.\nMeropenem yahawe patenti mu 1983. Byemejwe gukoreshwa mu buvuzi muri Amerika mu 1996. Ari kurutonde rwumuryango wubuzima ku isi urutonde rw'imiti yingenzi. Igiciro cyo kugurisha byinshi mubihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri hagati ya 3.44 na 20.58 USD kuri garama imwe ya garama guhera muri Mu Bwongereza aya mafaranga agura NHS hafi \u00a3 16 muri 2015."}
{"id": "20360", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20360", "title": "Mubarak Muganga", "text": "Jenerali MK MUBARAKH yavutse mu mwaka 1967, agirwa Umugaba Mukuru w\u2019Ingabo (Chief of Defence Staff \u2013 CDS) ku wa 05 Kamena 2023. Mbere yaho, yari Umugaba w\u2019Ingabo za RDF. Afite uburambe burenze imyaka 30 mu gisirikare, Jenerali MK MUBARAKH yabaye Umugaba wa Divisiyo ya 4 kuva 2008\u20132012, Umugaba wa Divisiyo ya 3 kuva 2013\u20132015, Umugaba wa Divisiyo ya 1 kuva 2016\u20132021 (akanaba n\u2019Umuyobozi w\u2019Inama y\u2019Ubutegetsi y\u2019Iduka ry\u2019Ingabo).\nJenerali MK MUBARAKH afite impamyabumenyi ya Kaminuza (A0) mu Mibereho myiza n\u2019Imicungire y\u2019Abaturage (Public Administration).\nAmashuri yize.\nAmasomo ya gisirikare yize arimo:\nIbihembo yahawe.\nJenerali MK MUBARAKH yahawe ibihembo bikurikira:"}
{"id": "20362", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20362", "title": "Shampiyona y'isi y'amagare 2025", "text": "2025 UCI Road World Championships\nShampiyona y'isi y'amagare yo mu muhanda 2025 (mu Cyongereza: \"2025 UCI Road World Championships\") yabaye ku nshuro ya 98 y'iri rushanwa ngarukamwaka ritegurwa n'Ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry'umukino w'amagare (UCI). Yabereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda, kuva ku ya 21 kugeza ku ya 28 Nzeri 2025, ikaba ari yo ya mbere yabereye muri Afurika.\nHakinwe amarushanwa 13 ku muhanda uzenguruka umujyi wa Kigali, ufatwa nk'umwe mu mihanda igoye kurusha iyindi mu mateka y'iri rushanwa. Tadej Poga\u010dar wo muri Siloveniya yegukanye isiganwa nyamukuru ry'abagabo, naho Magdeleine Valli\u00e8res wo muri Kanada yegukana iry'abagore.\nAmateka.\nMuri Nyakanga 2018, UCI yagaragaje ubushake bwo guha bwa mbere igihugu cyo muri Afurika kwakira iri rushanwa. U Rwanda, binyuze mu ishyirahamwe ryarwo ry'amagare (FERWACY), rwasabye kuryakira i Kigali, ruhatana n'umujyi wa Tangier wo muri Maroke. Muri Nzeri 2021, UCI yemeje ku mugaragaro ko Kigali ari yo izakira Shampiyona y'isi ya 2025. U Rwanda rwari rusanzwe rutegura buri mwaka Tour du Rwanda, rimwe mu masiganwa akomeye ya UCI Africa Tour.\nNi ubwa mbere amarushanwa y'abagore batarengeje imyaka 23 yabaye ukwayo; mbere yaho, uwatsindaga muri iki cyiciro yabaga ari uwitwaye neza mu batarengeje imyaka 23 mu isiganwa ry'abagore bakuru.\nInzira.\nInzira y'amasiganwa yatangajwe muri Nzeri 2024, mu gihe cya Shampiyona y'isi yabereye i Zurich. Amasiganwa yo mu muhanda yakiniwe ku ruziga rw'ibilometero 15,1 ruzenguruka Kigali, rutangirira kandi rukarangirira kuri Kigali Convention Centre. Isiganwa ry'abagabo bakuru ryongerewemo agace k'ibilometero 42,5 kazamuka \"Mur de Kigali\". Kubera ko Kigali iri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1.850 kandi inzira ikaba yari ifite imisozi myinshi (metero zisaga 5.000 zo kuzamuka ku isiganwa ry'abagabo), ibinyamakuru by'umukino w'amagare byayise imwe mu nzira zigoye kurusha izindi mu mateka ya Shampiyona y'isi.\nGahunda.\nAmarushanwa 13 yari agizwe n'amasiganwa 6 yo mu muhanda, amasiganwa 6 yo gusiganwa n'igihe ku muntu ku giti cye, n'isiganwa rimwe ry'amakipe avanze (abagabo n'abagore).\nAmasaha yose ni ay'i Kigali (UTC+02:00).\nAbatsinze.\nMu gusiganwa n'igihe, Umubiligi Remco Evenepoel yegukanye umudari wa zahabu ku nshuro ya gatatu yikurikiranya, naho Umusuwisi Marlen Reusser yegukana uw'abagore. Ku ya 27 Nzeri, Magdeleine Valli\u00e8res yabaye Umunyakanada wa mbere wegukanye isiganwa ry'abakuru muri Shampiyona y'isi y'amagare yo mu muhanda. Bukeye bwaho, Tadej Poga\u010dar yisubiza umwambaro w'umukororombya w'umutsinzi."}
{"id": "20364", "revid": "11198", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20364", "title": "Oscar Goerke", "text": "Oscar Goerke, Jr. Yavukiye i Brooklyn apfira i Maplewood, muri Leta ya New Jersey akaba yari umwe mu bakinaga umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare. Goerke yitabiriye imikino irindwi yose yo gusiganwa ku magare mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1904 yabereye i Missouri kandi yegukana ifeza mu kwiruka ibirometero 3.21. "}
{"id": "20370", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20370", "title": "Nishimwe Solange", "text": "Nishimwe Solange uzwi Sol Solange umaze kubaka izina mu bikorwa by\u2019ubukerarugendo \nAmashuri yize.\nSol Solange afite imyaka 24, yiga Public Health muri Mount Kigali University. Akunda gusangiza abantu uduce duto tw\u2019ubuzima bwe binyuze mu mafoto n\u2019amavidewo ashyira ku mbuga nkoranyambaga ze\nIbikorwa.\nyitabiriye umunsi w\u2019ibirori bidasanzwe Perezida Kagame yakiriyemo abayobozi n\u2019abandi batumirwa na we arimo\nBuri mpera z\u2019umwaka Perezida Kagame na Madamu Jeannette Kagame bakira abayobozi batandukanye n\u2019abandi batumirwa bari mu byiciro bitandukanye bigize ubuzima bw\u2019igihugu.\nMu mpera za 2023 ibi birori bikaba byarabaye kuwa 30 Ukuboza.\nSol Solange yagarutse ku buryo nubwo haciyeho iminsi kugeza n\u2019ubu atariyumvisha ko byabaye avuga ko bidasanzwe.\nMu kiganiro InyaRwanda yagiranye na Sol Solange yagize ati \" \u00a0Ubutumire nabubonye nari nagiye gusura Nyungwe, ntakubeshye ntabwo nabyizeye na nyuma yaho ndi umuntu wakomeje kubyibazaho cyane.\"\nSol Solange avuga ko atiyumvisha uko byagenze ati \"Nkibubona sinabyemeye naribazaga ngo gute se? Njyewe se ndi nde? Numvaga ari ibintu bidasanzwe bidashoboka? Njyewe ntabwo nari nakabyizeye kugera no ku munsi wa nyawo.\"\nUyu mukobwa agaruka ku buryo uwo munsi yiteguye kare nubwo igikorwa nyirizinza cyari gitegerejwe mu masaha y\u2019umugoroba ati \"Njyewe saa cyenda nari narangije kwitegura hari ukuntu nyine umuntu aba afite mu turemangingo akantu ko gushya njyewe rwose nari narangije kwitegura.\"\nAgaruka ku buryo yigiriye inama yo kutaryama ngo adacikanwa ati \"Imvura igitangira kugwa naravuze nti uwaba ryamye ariko ndavuga ngo ndamutse ngiye kuryama sinkanguke amasaha akagenda, nageze no mu buriri ariko ngeze aho ndabyuka nshyiramo.\"\nSol Solange yasoreje icyiciro cya Kabiri cya Kaminuza muri Nursing muri Mount Kenya ari naho ubu ari kwiga icyiciro cya Gatatu muri Public Health.\nUyu mukobwa kandi yanakuze akunda itangazamakuru nyuma ariko yo kugerageza kenshi mu binyamakuru bitandukanye ntibamuhe amahirwe yo kuba yabikora, yatangiye kubikora mu buryo bwo kubara inkuru arangira abantu ahantu hatandukanye."}
{"id": "20371", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20371", "title": "Kaliza wa Kalisa", "text": "Kaliza wa kalisa ni filimi y'uruhererekane ivua ku mukobwa ukiri muto wavuye iwabo mu karere ka Rusizi akajya gushaka ubuzima bushya mu mujyi wa Kigali. iyi filimi inyuzwa kuri Zacu TV, yayobowe na Roger Niyoyita, ikaba umushinga wa Nelly Misago Willson usanzwe ukora umwuga wo gutegura no kuyobora amafilimi mu Rwanda.\nKaliza wa Kalisa ni filimi yakozwe ishingiye ku gitekerezo cya filimi y'uruhererekane yitwa \u2018Kareena Kareena\u2019 yakorewe mu gihugu cy'ubuhinde igakorwa na Zee Entertainment."}
{"id": "20372", "revid": "16406", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20372", "title": "HONORE RWANDA", "text": "ar renting, or car hire, is the process of temporarily leasing an automobile from a rental agency for a set period, offering flexibility, convenience, and the freedom to explore on your own terms. To rent a car, you typically need a valid driver's license, a credit card for payment, and a passport or ID. The process involves choosing a suitable vehicle, inspecting it upon pickup, reviewing and signing a rental agreement that outlines terms and conditions, and ensuring it includes comprehensive insurance and 24/7 support."}
{"id": "20373", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20373", "title": "HATEGEKIMANA Richard", "text": "HATEGEKIMANA Richard ni Umwanditsi w'ibitabo, akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru w'Urugaga rw'Abanditsi mu Rwanda ndetse akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Kompanyi yitwa Africa Oasis Ltd. Yanditse ibitabo byinshi bitandukanye harimo nk'ikivuga ku bigwi by'umukuru w'Igihugo cy'u Rwanda Perezida Paul. Yanditse igitabo cy\u2019ubudasa kivuga ku matora y\u2019u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "20374", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20374", "title": "Indoto", "text": "Indoto ni filime y'uruhererekane yo mu Rwanda. Yakozwe na Misago Nelly Wilson. Itambuka kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda (RTV). Yatangiye muri Mutarama 2020.\nMu 2023, umukinnyi Phionah Igihozo yahawe igihembo kubera uruhare rwe muri \"Indoto\".\nInkuru.\n\"Indoto\" ivuga ku musore witwa Muhire. Muhire arangiza amashuri yisumbuye. Ashakisha akazi ariko ntakabone. Inshuti ye yo mu bwana imujyana mu mujyi, ikamubeshya. Muhire atakaza ibyo yari afite. Nyuma, abona akazi ko kurinda izamu. Asubira no mu ishuri. Urukundo n'umukobwa w'umukire rumurangaza mu masomo, rukamushyira mu kaga.\nAmateka.\nMisago Nelly Wilson ni we wakoze \"Indoto\". Yari yarakoze kandi filime \"Seburikoko\" na \"City Maid\". \"Indoto\" yatangiye gutambuka kuri RTV muri Mutarama 2020.\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023, Phionah Igihozo yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugore mwiza wungirije (\"Best Supporting Actress\") muri Rwanda International Movie Awards, kubera \"Indoto\"."}
{"id": "20375", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20375", "title": "Shampiyona y'igihugu y'amagare mu Rwanda", "text": "Shampiyona y'isi y'amagare\nMinisiteri y'Ubucurzi n'Inganda MINICOM, yatangaje ko guhera tariki ya 21-28 Nzeri 20225 u Rwanda ruzakira Shampiyona y'Isi y'Amagare. U Rwanda rukazaba ruyakiriye ari cyo gihugu cya mbere muri Afurika yose. Minisiteri y'Ubucuruzi n'Inganda yasabye abikorera gutanga serivice inoze mu kwakira abazayitabira bose. Minisiteri y'Ubucuruzi n'inganada yatangaje ko amashuri yose aherereye mu mugi wa kigali azaba afunze kuva 21 Nzeri kugeza 28 Nzeri 2025. "}
{"id": "20376", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20376", "title": "Hurts harder", "text": "Hurts Harder ni filimi y'uruhererekane igaragaza umukobwa w'imyaka 28 witwa Kate uba utarigeze agira amahirwe mu rukundo, gusa agakomeza kugira ikizere ko azabona uwo bahuza. akisanga murukundo rw'iyakure ku ikoranabuhanga akundana n'umugabo witwa Tate amubwira ko ari umunyamahanga bagakundana imyaka ibiri nta kubonana, akazasanga Tate afite amabanga menshi yaramwoherezaga amafoto atari aye kuko we ari umusore ufite uruhara umeze nkabasaza w'umushumba atarigeze ajya mu mahanga.\nIyi film inyuzwa kuri zacu Tv, yanditswe inayoborwa na Mizero Yves Wayeem ikaba umushinga wa Nelly Wilson MISAGO usanzwe mu mwuga wo kuyobora no gutunganya film nyarwanda. \nAbakinnyi.\nShemaryimanzi dwane Emmy (Tate)\nVanessa Irakoze (kate)\nIradukunda Nadine (Sasha)\nAngello Shami (Fake Tate)"}
{"id": "20377", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20377", "title": "Ntwali fiston", "text": "Ntwali fiston nu muhugu wu munyarwanda wavutse muri 2000 akaba yiga muri kaminuza ya mount kigali university iherereye mu Murenge wa kagarama akaba ari umusore ufite dani ebyiri muri karate bityo kubera gukora cyane no gukunda karate bikaba byaratumye aba umukinnyi wi kitegererezo imyaka itari mike mu Rwanda agatsidira imidari ya zahabu,bronze maze bikamuteza imbere kuburyo ubu afite ishuri ryigisha karate (Donjo) akabasha kwibeshaho muru bubuzima. "}
{"id": "20378", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20378", "title": "City maid", "text": "City maid ni film y' inyarwanda yayobowe na KWIZERA Ibrahim itunganwa na Wilson Misago. Muri iyi filime y\u2019uruhererekane ishimishije, dukurikira Nikuze, umukobwa ucisha make ukomoka mu cyaro, mu rugendo rwe ajya mu mujyi ashaka ubuzima bushya. Ahabwa akazi ko kuba umukozi wo mu rugo mu muryango ukomeye wo mu mujyi, maze abyaza umusaruro ayo mahirwe yo kwinjira mu buzima bushya burimo abantu atamenyereye n\u2019ibikorwa bishya. Ariko rero, mu gihe Nikuze agenda amenya imiterere y\u2019umujyi, atangira gusanga igikundiro cyawo kizananye n\u2019imbogamizi n\u2019ihurizo ritunguranye atari yarigeze atekereza mbere.\namashakiro"}
{"id": "20379", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20379", "title": "Nshobozwabyosenumukiza Jean Jacques Wilson", "text": "Jean\u2011Jacques \"J.\u202fJ.\" Wilson Nshobozwabyosenumukiza ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaboko (basketball) ukomeye mu Rwanda, ukina ahagana imbere (Point Guard) mu ikipe ya APR, Kandi akaba yaragiye akunda guhamagarwa kenshi mw' ikipe yigihu guhera 2016 aho yakigana irushanwa rya afro basketball ry' abatarengeje 16 yavukiye mumujyi mukuru w' Rwanda i Kigali muwigihumbi kimwe na mirongo icyenda n' umunani yakuriye Inyamirambo ari naho yatangiriye umwuga we wo gukina umukino w' amaboko (basketball) ahazwi nko kuri club rafiki aho yanijwiriye muri ekipe ya Espoir BBC akaba ari nayo kipe yakiniye bwambere muri kiciro cyambere aho yavuye ajya muri REG BBC aho yakinaga nka point guard mumyaka itari micye aza no gutizwa muri Patriots BBC abakinira mwikipe ya mwirushanwa rya BAL rimwe muyakuzwe muri Africa nyuma wilson yaje kwerekeza muri APR basketball club akaba ari naho akina ubu. "}
{"id": "20380", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20380", "title": "Ubuhanzi art rwanda", "text": "ubuhanzi art rwanda batanze ibihembo kubaribitabiriye amarushanywa ya all star edition bahembaga babiri batsinze muri burikiciro kuwatsinze bamuhaga million icumi agasobanura neza umushinga we bakayamuha akajya kwiteza imbere byagaragayeko byafashije urubyiruko cyane mukwiteza imbere,kandi byagaragaye yuko urubyiruko rubonye abaterankunga bo kurufasha bakora cyane kandi neza,mwijambo babahaye nabo barabigaragaje mubitekerezo batanze imbere y'abayobozi bakuriye ubuhanzi art rwanda."}
{"id": "20381", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20381", "title": "Niyomwungeri aaron", "text": "Niyomwungeri Aaron ni umwe mubagize ihuriro ryabanditsi ba filime mu Rwanda, wagiye ugira uruhare muguteza imbere umwuga biciye muri iryo ihuriro.\nUmwuga Akora.\nMu kazi ke ka buri munsi, Aaron ni Umuyobozi ushinzwe amarushanwa n\u2019ibihembo mu izinda ryo gutanga ibihembo ku rwego muza mahanga mu Rwanda(Rwanda International Movie Awards). Ni umwanditsi wa filime, umuyobozi wa filime, ndetse n\u2019umukozi w\u2019amajwi. Yagize uruhare mu guteza imbere uruganda rwa sinema mu Rwanda. Afatanije na bagenzi be bashyizeho urubuga rwitwa \" vugafrica.rw\" rugamije gufasha abanditsi ba filime mu Rwanda no muri Afurika muri rusange kubahuza n\u2019abaguzi no gucuruza inkuru zabo, bikabafasha kwiteza imbere.\nAaron ni umunyamakuru, umusangiza nkuru, ndetse n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ibirori uzwi cyane kubera ubuyobozi mu mishinga y\u2019ubugeni n\u2019umuco. Ni umwe mu bashinze Mashariki African Film Festival ndetse yigeze no kuyobora ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019ibirori bya Set Film Festival. Mu bikorwa bye bifite uruhare, Aaron yayoboye amarushanwa ya National Street Dance Competition, inshingano yagiye akora yitanga, bitewe n\u2019urukundo afitiye gufasha urubyiruko kugaragaza impano zabo mu mbyino, filime, umuziki n\u2019izindi nzira z\u2019ubuhanzi.\nAmateka ye.\nNk\u2019umwe mu barokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, ubuzima bwa Aaron bwaranzwe no gukomera ku ntego no kugira uruhare mu kubaka igihugu. Ukwemera kwe mu mahoro n\u2019ubumwe si amagambo gusa, ahubwo kugaragarira mu bikorwa bye by\u2019ubuhanzi no guhindura imibereho y\u2019abaturage binyuze mu nkuru z\u2019ukuri.\nKu bwa Aaron, gusobanura inkuru si umwuga gusa ni uburyo bwo gukiza ibikomere, kwibuka, no kurinda umuco. Umwuga we wose ushingiye ku kwemera ko ubuhanzi ari kimwe mu bikoresho bifite imbaraga cyane mu kubaka amahoro n\u2019ubumwe. "}
{"id": "20382", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20382", "title": "SANKARA DA PRIMIER", "text": "SANKARA DA PRIMIER amazina ye nyakuri ni Mutore Isaac, ni umwe mu basobanuzi ba Film mu Rwanda babigize umwuga aho akundwa n'abatari bake, yagaragaje ko urupfu rwa mukuru we YANGA rwamubabaje cyane ndetse bigatuma yakira agakiza,\n\"Imibereho\" \nSankara ubuzima bwe bwa buri munsi abumara asobanura Film, ibizwi nk'agasobanuye aho yavuze ko abikora abikunze kandi ko bimutunze, yongeyeho ko akazi kose hhatitawe kuburyo abantu baguca intege iyo ubishyizeho umutima bigutunga kandi neza,\nAmateka ye mu mwuga.\nSankara yagize Ati \u201cKuri njye ntabwo byari binyoroheye, kuko byansabaga y\u2019uko ngomba kuva ku ishuri nkaba nzi neza ko saa kumi ngomba kuba mvuye Lyc\u00e9e de Kigali nageze mu rugo. Saa kumi n\u2019ebyiri cyangwa saa moya ngomba kuba ndi muri salle ndangije filime.\" \nImikoranire ye na Star times.\nSankara yatangiye gukorana na Star Times muburyo bwo kwa mamaza no gukora film zica kuri shene za star times,"}
{"id": "20383", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20383", "title": "Kanyombya", "text": "Kanyombya ni umukinnyi wa filimi nyarwanda amazina ye bwite ubusaznwe yitwa Kayitankore Ndjoli, yavutse 1962 avukira mu gihugu cya Repubulika iharanira Demokalasi ya Congo (RDC) mu mugi wa Goma. Amaze imyaka irenga 20 muri cinema nyarwanda. \nAmashuri Yize.\nKanyomba yize amashuri abanza mu gihugu cya kongo i Goma ku mashuri rabanza yitiriwe mutagatifu Andereya, nyuma aza gukomereza amasomo mu ishuri ryisumbuye muri Tuungane, ari naho yagarukiye akajya mu gisirikare. \numwuga akora.\nKanyombya ni umunyarwenya, yatangiye gukina urwenya mu mwaka wa 2002,cinema ze nyinshi zibanda kurwenya, arbyyo byatumye atangira kugaragara ku ma television atandukanye yo mu Gihugu,yakinnye muri filimi zitandukanye hari harimo n'iziheruka gusohoka muminsi yashize nk'iyitwa \"Kwivuko Series.\"\nUyu mukinnyi yagiye afasha bagenzi be kumenyekana no kuzamura impano zabo kandi yashyizeho gahunda yari igamije gufasha abakizamuka muri cinema.\nImibereho isanzwe.\nKanyombya atuye i Gikondo mu mugi wa Kigali,Ni umugabo ufite umugore,abana ndetse n'abuzukuru. avuka mu muryango w'abana barindwi (7), se umubyara yitwa Jean Batiste Sakumi na nyina Mukandutiye Gaudence. Yabaye mu ngabo z'igihugu z'u Rwanda,yinjiye mu gisirikare mu mwaka wa 1992 akimaramo imyaka 10, yabarizwaga muri Batayo ya Charlie Mobile,akaba ariho yahuriye n'impanuka yo gukuka amenyo."}
{"id": "20384", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20384", "title": "Umutesi sandra", "text": "Umutesi sandra,umukobwa muto muto wavukiye mu karere ka Gasabo,mu murenge wa gatsata.Yakuze akunda gukina film,mu mwaka wa 2024 yaje kwiga mu ishuri rikuru rya kaminuza mu ishami ry'itangazamakuru muri Mount kenya University.\nNiho umwuga we, wo gukina film watangiye mu mwaka wa 2025. yatangiye akina mu itsinda ryitwa Cinematic Syndicate, yatangijwe n'abanyeshuri bigaga muri Mount kenya University. "}
