{"id": "20388", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20388", "title": "Ishusho ya papa", "text": "Ishusho ya papa ni filimi nyarwanda Jean Luc, umusore w\u2019imyaka 30 ukomoka mu Bubiligi muba byeyibe hakaba hari harimo umunyarwanda, ntiyigeze ahura na se w\u2019Umunyarwanda. Igihe nyina arwaye amerewe nabi, afata urugendo ajya mu Rwanda kumushaka, afite gusa ifoto n\u2019izina ry\u2019ahantu ababyeyi be bahuriye. Ku bw\u2019amahirwe, Bonheur avuga Ikinyarwanda, bituma kumvikana bimugendekera neza. Ariko ibintu birushaho kugorana igihe ahuye na Olive, umukobwa w\u2019umurobyi mwiza bahuye, maze akabyukira amarangamutima yo kumukunda "}
{"id": "20391", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20391", "title": "Gogo", "text": "Urupfu rwanyakwijyendera Musabyimana Gloriose wamenyekanye kwi izina rya GOGO rumajije gusobanuka nyuma\nyuko yamaze iminsi mugihungu cya Uganda aho yarafiteyo ibitaramo bitandukanye akaza kugira ikibazo kibihaha bye \nbyari byarangiritse gutyo bikamuviramo urupfu. Ibitaro bya Mulago Hospital nibyo byakuyeho urujijo rwuko abeshi bakekaga ko yaba \nyararozwe basohora urwandiko rwerekana icyamishe. umurambo wa GOGO ukaba wajyejejwe m'Urwanda tariki 06 nzeri 2025."}
