{"id": "20402", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20402", "title": "Kayumba Vianney", "text": "Kayumba Vianney uzwi cyane nka Manzi wavutse mu 1986 muri Central Uganda ni Umunyarwanda ukina filme wabigize umwuga, wamamaye mu ruganda rwa filme mu Rwanda ndetse aba umuntu wigarurira imitima ya benshi kubera filme yakinnye \"Amarira y'Urukundo\" ari kumwe na Mukasekuru Hadidja Fabiola nk'abakinnyi bombi b'imena bari bayoboye inkuru yayo. \nKayumba Vianney yinjiye mu gukina filme mu rwanda yinjijwe na Mukasekuru Hadidja Fabiola wanditse amarira y'urukundo, filme yabameneyekanishije, Ubwo yaramusanze ku muhanda arabimusaba arabyemera ibyo bita random casting cyangwa street casting kuva uwo munsi yagaragaye mu mishinga myinshi itandukanye ya filme harimo 'Intare y'ingore, Kaliza, Siryo herezo filme yarishingiye ku nkuru y'ivugabutumwa yaje no kwegukana igihembo muri 2014 \nAmateka.\nKayumba Vianney Manzi yavutse 1989 avukiye muri Uganda ahitwa Luwero in Central Uganda ku babyeyi be se witwa Ngarambe John na Mama we witwa Mukantagara Antoinette, akurira muri Uganda aho amashuri abanza yayigiye muri Uganda kugeza aho Umuryango we wagarutse mu Rwanda akomereza amashuri yisumbuye mu kigo cya Nyamata high school arangije ayisumbuye akomereza muri kaminuza yitwa Innovation Business Technical College. \nKayumba Vianney uzwi cyane nka Manzi avuga ko urugendo rwe rwo gukunda no gukina film rutatangiriye muri filme \"amarira y'urukundo\" kuko akiri mu mashuri hagati ya 2001 na 2002 Kayumba Manzi yagaragaye mu mukino wari wateguwe n'ishuri yigaho uwo mukino wari wateguwe na ZOA igaruka ku kurwanya SIDA yagize ati: \"\" \nUmwuga.\nKayumba Vianney Manzi akirangiza ishuri mu mwaka wa 2009 yabanje gukora nk'umucuruzi wa telephone akorera kwa Rubangura, Umwe mu bakiriya be wari Mukasekuru Hadidja Fabiola niwe wamwegereye amubwira ko yaba umukinnyi wa filme mwiza ndetse yegera na Boss wamukoreshaga icyo gihe amusabira uruhushya amujyana mu igerageza (Casting) ni uko yinjiye muri filme ye ya mbere \"Amarira y'urukundo\" \nAmarira y'urukundo yamubereye filme fatizo kuko yakinnye mu bice byayo 15 bya mbere byari bigize umuzingo wa 1 (season 1) ndetse baza kuyisubukura muri 2025 bayihaye izina rya \"Tears of Love\" ndetse inkuru yayo iyoborwa na Kayumba Vianney na Mukasekuru Fabiola ndetse bongeramo n'abandi bakinnyi bashya. \nKayumba Vianney Manzi yagaragaye mu bikorwa byinshi bya sinema filme nyarwanda harimo Intare y'ingore mu bice byayo 9 filme yaje no kwegukana igihembo cya filme nziza y'umwaka muri 2014 ndetse akina muri Siryoherezo ndetse na Kaliza, sibyo gusa kuko Kayumba yegukanye ibihembo bitandukanye akuye muri 1000 hills awards ndetse no muri Rwanda Movie Awards aho yegukanye muri 2014 igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza w'umugabo (Best Actor 2014) ndetse na n'igembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza watoranyijwe n'abantu (people choice award) \nKayumba Vianney Manzi ni umwe mu itsinda ryoherejwe muri Tanzania ari kumwe na Willy Ndahiro na Liane Mutaganzwa mu iserukiramuco rya filme muri Arusha (Arusha African film festival) abakinnyi n'abakora filme mu rwanda bajya bitabira muri Arusha Tanzania \nkandi Kayumba Vianney (Manzi) ashyira itafari kuri sinema Nyarwanda atoza, yigisha ahugura Abana bashya bashaka kwinjoira mu mwuga wo gukora no gukina filme mu rwanda, anyuze mu kigo cya Kigali Film and Television School (KFTV) kuva mu mwaka wa 2016 aho yabaye umuyobozi wungirije w'icyo kigo (assistant director of KFTV) \nUbuzima bwite.\nMu mwaka wa 2014 Kayumba Vianney (Manzi) byamenyekanye mu itangazamakuru ko uyu mukinnyi yapfushije umwana wa mukuru we Bukumba Edouard umuhungu wa gashura James mukuru wa Kayumba Vianney\nKayumba Vianney (Manzi) ni umwe mu bakinnyi bavuzwe mu nkundo zitandukanye hagate ye n'Bakinnyi babakobwa bakinanaga, aho byigeze guhwihwiswa cyane ko yaba yarakundanye na Mukasekuru Fabiola bakinanaga filme \"Amarira y'Urukundo\" bikaba intandaro yo gutandukana kwa Mukasekuru Fabiola n'umugabo we wa mbere, Ariko Mukasekuru Fabiola abihakana avuga ati: \"\" "}
{"id": "20403", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20403", "title": "BUJYAKERA Jean Paul", "text": "BUJYACYERA Jean Paul, uzwi nka Gutermann Guter, yavutse kuwa 27 ukuboza 1989. Avukira mu Rwanda, intara y'iburasirazuba, akarere ka Gatsibo, umurenge wa Ngarama, akagali ka Karambi. Mwene BARIGIRA Gilbert na UWIMANA Felecite, Avuka mu muryango w'abana batanu babakobwa babiri n'abahungu batatu. \n\"Imikurire n' Imyigire\".\nAmashuri abanza yayize kuri EP ADEPR NGARAMA kuva mu 1997 kugeza 2003 akomereza ayisumbuye ikiciro rusange kuri ES APEM NGARAMA. Asoreza GS BUSHYANGUHE mu mwaka wa 2007 ahava ajya gukomereza ikiciro kisumbye ku kigo cya SAINT ALOYZ RWAMAGANA aho yize amateka, ubumenyi bw'isi n'icungamutungo bizwi nka (HEG).\nYakomereje muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda ishami rya Huye aho yize itangazamakuru, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza, akomereza muri MOUNT KENYA ahakura impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu itangazamakuru.\nYakuriye mu buzima bugoranye aho yize amashuri ye abanza ndetse nayisumbuye bigoranye cyane ariko arahatana ku buryo bushoboka ayarangiza afite amanota meza ari byo byatumye agira amahirwe yo gukomereza muri kaminuza. \n\"Ibyo yakoze\".\nYakoze imirimo. itandukanye harimo nko kuba umunyamakuru. ibi yabitangiye ubwo yari akiri muri kaminuza. mu mwaka wa gatatu aho yabaye umukorera bushake w'igitangaza makuru kiri mubikomeye mu rwanda ISANGO STAR aho yaje gukomereza 'nk'umunyamakur w'umunyamwuga nyuma yo gusoza kwiga kaminuza\nAgendeye ku buzima butari bworoshye yakuriyemo, yaje gushinga umuryango (organization) udaharanira inyungu witwa NUFASHWA YAFASHA ORGANIZATION (NYO) mu mwaka wa 2014. Uwo muryangowashinzwe ufite intego yo gufasha abana bo mu miryango itishoboye n'abana bafite ubumuga kubona uburere bwiza bukwiriye umwana w'umunyarwanda. Aho abo bana bafashwa kubona ibikoresho by'ishuri, amafaranga yishuri n'ibindi bikenerwa byibanze kugira ngo bagire ireme 'ry'uburezi riri ku rugero rukwiriye.\nUwo muryango ufasha kandi ababyeyi babo bana kubona amahirwe yo kongerera ubushobozi ubukungu kubagore cyane cyane n'abakobwa. Uyu muryango utanga amahugurwa mu bikorwa by'ubukorikori bwinjiza amafaranga, birimo nko, kudoda, kuboha ibiseke, no gutunganya imisatsi\nNyuma mu mwaka wa 2021 yaje gushinga ikigo cy'amashuri akitirira uwo muryango. Kugeza ubu hari amashuri y'incuke n'abanza biteganyijwe ko uko iminsi izagenda ishira bizaguka bakagira n'amashuri yisumbuye "}
