{"id": "20405", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20405", "title": "The incubation film", "text": "filime THE INCUBATION ni film yakozwe kubufatanye hagati ya Zacu Entertainment Ltd hamwe na Greenland pictures, Ni film igaruka ahanini ku icuruzwa ry'abantu aho mu myandikire yiyi film hagaragaramo umusore witwa Nelson, amenya ko hari ikigo cyamashuri yisumbuye gikorerwamo ubucuruzi bw'abana bahiga, ni nyuma yuko haba imfu z'abanyeshuri zahato nahato, Nelson akiha umukoro wo kuburizamo umugambi wo gucuruza abanyeshuri wari gukorwa mumugoroba umwe wari gusiga benshi bacurujwe.\nIgitekerezo cyo gukora fiIime the incubation cyan ubwo Nelly Wilson MISAGO umuyobozi wa zacu entertainment Ltd yaganiraga n'umuyobozi wa Greenland pictures Deus SANGWA wanayoboye ifatwa ry'amashusho yiyi filime, biyemeza gukorana iyo filime. \ncast.\nIrunga Longin,\nMazimpaka Kennedy, \nPrince Ganza akaba ari nawe mukinnyi w\u2019imena, \nGihozo Nshuti Mireille, \nRukundo Chantal, \nMuniru Habiyakare n\u2019abandi."}
{"id": "20406", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20406", "title": "Nyaxo comedy", "text": "Nyaxo comedy ni imwe muma filimi akinnye mukinamico cy'urwenya yamamaye cyane mu Rwanda.\nIkaba inyuzwa kuri youtube ndetse no mubitaranmo bitandukanye murwanda. Kanyabugande Olivier nyaxo akaba ariwe mukinnyi wimena mubagize iyi filime muri uru rwenya. Ikabayaratangiwe gukinwa mu mwaka 2020 akaba aribwo yagejeje igihangano cye cyambere."}
{"id": "20407", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20407", "title": "Behind film", "text": "filime BEHIND ni filime yanditswe inayoborwa na Mizero Yves bakunze kwita Wayeem ikaba ari film ica kumuyoboro wa YouTube witwa cine-rw, iyi film igaruka cyane cyane kubuzima bw'umusore witwa Lucas, aho uyu Lucas asanga umukunzi Lana yapfuye k'umunsi yari kumwambikiraho impeta, Lucas mugushaka kumenya icyishe umukunzi we akagwa ku mashusho y;inkumi yitwa Amanda agashaka kwihorera agashimuta amanda gusa amanda Akaba umukobwa ugira amayeri menshi, bagenda bahangana hakazamenyekana ko Lana atapfuye ahubwo, abifashijwemo na Amanda bakabeshya Lucas iby'urupfu rwa Lana kuko Lucas aba akorana na uncle wa Lana kandi Uncle wa Lana aba ari umwicanyi ndetse kandi akaba yarafataga Lana ku ngufu."}
{"id": "20408", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20408", "title": "Bahizi Venuste", "text": "BAHIZI Venuste wa menyeka kw'izina rya maitre nzovu cg se Mr elephant akaba yaramenyekanye muri film z'inyarwanda zitandukanye harimo iyamenyekanye cyane nka maitre nzovu ndetse n'izindi zitandukanye harimo na zirara zishya \nMaitre nzovu ni imwe muri film yakunzwe cyane ndetse ikanamenyekana kurwogo mpuza mahanga iyi film ivuga k'umugabo ariwe nzovu aba atabara ndetse arwanya nabagizi banabi.\nIyi film y'uruhererekane yarakunzwe cyane kuberako iyi film yakinnye cyangwa se yasohotse mugihe abantu bose bari murugo mugihe cya (COVID LOCKDOWN) ikaba yarakunzwe n'abantu batari bacyeya.\nBahizi venuste ndetse akaba azwi nanone mubikorwa byo gushimisha abantu kumbuga nkoranya mbaga nka Youtube ndetse akanabinyuza m'uburyo bwa (Standup comedy).\nMu kiganiro nzovu yagiranye ni cy'inyamakuru MIE EMPIRE yavuzeko umwaka wa 2024 yakoreye amafaranga menshi ariko ujya Gusoza nta namacyeya afite, bitewe n'uburyo bwo kuyasesagura mubikorwa bitandukanye birimo kuyajyana mubusinzi ndetse no mundaya Ndetse avugako amenshi yariwe n'abagore bagiye batandukanye.\nIbyo bikaba byaramuviriyemo gutandukana nuwari umugore we mama w'abana be ndetse akaba abyicuza mu mwaka wa 2025 Bikaba byaramuteye kwicuza ibyo bintu byose yakoraga akaba afite ingamba zo gusubirana nuwari umugore we wa mbere. \nTugarutse gato kumateka ya nzovu cyangwa se Mr elephant kuri taliki 20 Gashyantare 2025 uyu mugabo yakoze amateka atizibagiranwa mu mitima ya ba nyarwanda aho we nuyu mugabo bita yaka mwana bujuje inzu iberamo urwenya izwi nka GEN Z COMEDY SHOW hagurishijwe amatike menshi ndetse bamwe babura aho bicara. \nNdetse icyi gitaramo cyitabiriwe n'abantu benshi cyane harimo aba star nyarwanda bagiye batandukanye bamwe mubitabiriye icyi gitaramo bavugako uyu mugabo adasanzwe \nAkajagari kaje kubera aho abantu babarirwa mu magana bateraniye mu cyumba cy'itike barwanira kubanza gutangwa kugira ngo binjire. \nIbyo washoboraga kumva byose byari ibyishimo byabashishikarizaga kubona Nzovu na Yaka Mwana bajyana hamwe kuva kuri YouTube berekana kuri stage nini ya Gen Z Comedy. Bashobora kuba batarashyizwe mubakora igitaramo ariko abantu bose bazi ibikorwa byabo byurwenya bari bazi ko bagiye gutunga iki gitaramo. Kandi bombi ntibigeze batenguha kuva yabamenyekanisha kuri stage \nAba bagabo bashoboraga kugaragara baririmba, babyina ndetse bakora ibintu byinshi bisekeje kuri stage kugirango abateranye banezerwe. Ibi byateye ijoro ryiza ritazibagirana hagati yabo n'abayoboke babo.\nNzovu, Venuste Bahizi, na Yaka Mwana, izina nyaryo Pacifique Gasore, biyubakiye izina kubera ibyo bakoze uburyo bahuza mu biganiro bitandukanye kuri YouTube byatumye umubare wabantu benshi bakoresha imbuga nkoranya mbaga babamenya kubera ubuhanga bwabo."}
{"id": "20409", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20409", "title": "Killerman", "text": "Niyonshuti Yannick umaze kwamamara muri sinema Nyarwanda nka Killer Man mu minsi ishize yasabye anakwa umugore we. Shemsa \nNi umuhango wabaye mu gitondo cyo ku itariki 02 werurwe 2024 ubera muri Romantic Garden ku gisozi \nmu kiganiro uyu mugabo yagiranye n'umunyamakuru wigenga Irene Mulindahabi Yavuze ko iyo umugabo abana n'umugorte batarasezerana aba ari indaya ye \nabajijwe niba umugore we bari indaya yabyemeje yivuye inyuma kuko ngo babanaga batarasezeranye \nyagize ati \"Nabanaga nawe ari indaya yange kubera ko tutari twarasezeranye ariko ubu ni umugore wange byemewe n'amategeko ndetse n'imbere y'imana\nIbihembo.\nuyu mukinnyi wa film yahatanye mubihembo bitandukanye nkumukinnyi mwiza hari naho yahatanaga nkumwanditsi wa film mwiza aho uyahatanaga nku wakoze film nziza "}
{"id": "20410", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20410", "title": "Rwanda animation", "text": "Filim z' Inkuru zishushanyije mu Rwanda cyagwa ibyo bita (Rwanda animation) nu bwoko bwa flimi ziri gutera imbere cyane ku rwego rw' isi byumwihariko no mu Rwanda \nNdetse leta y' u Rwanda ibinyujije muri minisiteri y' uburezi yemeye ko habaho kwigisha abanyeshuri babyifuza, kumenya gukora inkuru zishushanije, yaba mu mashuri yisumbuye mwishami ryitwa(Mutimedia) ariko nomuri kaminuza cyane cyane muma kaminuza yo mu rwanda urugero nka "}
