{"id": "20412", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20412", "title": "Jean Marie Vianney Safari", "text": "J.M.V Safari ni umunyabugeni ukora ibishushanyo bimeze nk\u2019ukuri kandi akaba umushushanyi w\u2019amafoto no gukora ibibumbano. Ibihangano bye byagiye byerekanwa ahantu hatandukanye nka Kigali Arts Centre ndetse na Inshuti Art Centre.\nUmwuga Akora.\nAkora ibibumbano akoresheje ibikoresho bitandukanye birimo isemeti, ibyuma n\u2019inkwi, byose abikoresha mu buryo butuma ibihangano bye bigira ishusho itangaje kandi nyayo. Akenshi, ibyo bibumbano bisa n\u2019amafoto manini y\u2019umukara n\u2019umweru, ku buryo ubirebye ubona nk\u2019aho ari amafoto yafashwe n\u2019akamashini, nyamara ari ibibumbano bifite ubuhanga bukomeye.\nNi Muntu Ki.\nSafari aharanira kugaragaza ubuzima bwa muntu, amarangamutima ye, n\u2019inkuru z\u2019imibereho mu buryo bunoze kandi bufite ubusobanuro. Ibihangano bye ni uburyo bwo gutanga ubutumwa, kubungabunga umuco nyarwanda, no gutuma abantu batekereza ku buzima busanzwe babamo."}
{"id": "20413", "revid": "11198", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20413", "title": "Hakkunde", "text": "Hakkunde ni filime yo muri Nigeriya yo mu mwaka w'2017 yanditswe kandi iyoborwa na Oluseyi Asurf. \nInkuru ya Filimi.\nUmusore warangije kaminuza arwana no kwimenyekanisha nuburyo agerageza kubirenga no kugira icyo ahindura mu baturage no muri societe ye. Yahuye n'ingutu zubuzima afata umwanzuro wo kwimukira i Kaduna avuye i Lagos. amahirwe atarahiriye mushiki we. ibyo yari ahiteze byaragabanutse afata umwanzuro wo kwiga kubaho ubwo buzima cyangwa kwemera gutsindwa nanone. "}
{"id": "20414", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20414", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Mashariki", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Mashariki (MAFF) ni ibirori bya firime bishingiye mu Rwanda byerekana kandi bigatanga ibihembo byakozwe nabanyafurika na diaspora nyafurika. Ijambo 'Mashariki' risobanura 'Iburasirazuba' mu Kiswahili. Ku nshuro ya mbere iserukiramuco ryabaye mu 2015.\nIbirori Ntibabaye muri 2020 na 2021 kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19.icyorezo \nIri serukiramuco ryashinzwe na Tresor Senga. Floriane Kaneza yari umuyobozi wubuhanzi kuva 2016-2018. \n2020.\nIbirori ntibyabaye muri 2020 kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19. \n2022.\nMu 2022, Iserukiramuco rya sinema Nyafurika rya Mashariki ryabaye kuva ku ya 26 Ugushyingo 2022 Kugeza ku ya 2 Ukuboza 2022."}
{"id": "20415", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20415", "title": "Gen z comedy show", "text": "Gen z comedy show ni igitaramo cyibera murwand acyashinzwe n' umunyarwenya Fally Merci mu mwaka wa 2022.\nIki gitaramo kibera ahitwa kwita camp kigali mumujyi wa kigali, ariko siko byahoze kuko mbere cyaberaga Ubuhanzi art Rwanda ahoo yakiraga abantu 40 gusa. ibyo byaje gutuma atekereza uburyi yakongera umubare wabantu yakira yimukira camp kigali aho yakira abantu barenga 1000. \nGen z comedy sho yatangiye igizwe nabanyarwenya 7 ariko ubu bakaba bageze kumubare urenga ijana "}
{"id": "20416", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20416", "title": "Nzovu", "text": "Venuste Bahizi uzwi cyane ku izana rya Nzovu ni umwe mu banyarwenya bakunzwe cyane nabanyarwanda benshi haba ababa murwanda cyangwa nabanyarwanda batuye hanze y'urwanda mumahanga.\nUbuzima.\nNzovu ni umugabo ufite abana harimo uwo bita Sandrine n'umugore ariko ubu umugore ntabwo babana\nyakinnye filime nyinshi kuva kera ndetse nubu aracyazikina nkiyo aheruka yitwa Maitre Nzovu gusa yaje guhagarara bitewe namikoro\nubu agaragara cyane cyane kuri youtube akaba ari naho benshi ubu bamuzi cyangwa bamubona ibi bigaro akorera kuri youtube ni nabyo byatumye \nyigarurira imitima ya benshi kubera urwenya atera abantu\nibi bituma abikora nkakazi kuko youtube channel yose imutumira inamuhemba kubera ukuntu urwenya rwe bikinjiriza agatubutse banyiri \nyoutube"}
