{"id": "20418", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20418", "title": "The bishop family", "text": "The bishop family ni filimi nyarwanda ivuga kuri Dan numugabo wumuryango kandi umwepiskopi watsinze ariko wicisha bugufi washakanye na Jane utavugwaho rumwe. Iyo abanzi badakekwa babangamiye umuryango wabo nibikorwa byubuzima bwabo, Dan na Jane bagomba kurwana kugirango bababuze gusenya ibyo bakoreye cyane.\nUrukurikirane rw'amakinamico yo mu Rwanda 'Umuryango wa Musenyeri' rwakozwe na Zacu Entertainment Ltd ubu ruri kuri A +, umuyoboro wa televiziyo w\u2019imyidagaduro w\u2019umuryango w\u2019Abafaransa bavuga Igifaransa wakozwe na Canal +.\nNelly Wilson Misago, washinze Zacu Entertainment yerekanye ingaruka uyu mushinga uzagira ku bibuga bya sinema mu Rwanda.\nAti: \"Uyu ni umwanya w'ingenzi ku nganda za Sinema zo mu Rwanda mu gihe twinjiye mu isoko rya Pan-Afurika. Gutunganya filime yacu muri Kinyarwanda byari umurimo w'urukundo ndetse n'ukuri ku muco kuri twe. Kuba ubu byiswe igifaransa kandi bikaba byerekanwa kuri A + birasobanutse bidasanzwe\".\nUrebye ko bahoraga bifuza ko serivise za Tv zigaragara ku miyoboro mpuzamahanga, Misago yavuze ko iyi ntambwe isobanura intangiriro y'urwo rugendo rushimishije nk'abashinze u Rwanda.\nUrukurikirane ruvuga kuri Dan, umugabo wumuryango akaba na musenyeri watsinze ariko wicisha bugufi washakanye na Jane utavugwaho rumwe. Iyo abanzi badakekwa babangamiye umuryango wabo nibikorwa byubuzima bwabo, Dan na Jane bagomba kurwana kugirango bababuze gusenya ibyo bakoreye cyane.\nAbakinnyi ba 'Umuryango wa Musenyeri' bakinnye mu bakinnyi bazwi bo mu Rwanda Alain Samson Mwiyeretsi, Bloda Rutayisire, Aime Valens Tuyisenge, Divine Gatesi Kayonga, Clenie Dusenge na Abouba Iradukunda n'abandi."}
{"id": "20419", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20419", "title": "Inkindi nadine", "text": "Inkindi Nadine Aisha wamenyekanye mu kinamico nyarwanda z'urwenya,nkomuri nyaxo comedy ndetse nizinyuzwa kuri big man empire.akaba ari umwe mu bakobwa bakunzwe kumbuga nkoranyambaga zigiye zitandukanye nka yutube(YouTube), tikitoki(TikTok), insitagaramu(Instagram) nizindi zinyuranye."}
{"id": "20420", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20420", "title": "Igeno ryajye", "text": "Claire numukobwa ukiri muto ufite isura yinzirakarengane kandi afite ubwoba mu kabari i Kigali. Arasa n'uwihebye kandi yazimiye; yagiye mu kabari kugira ngo anywe ikirahure kinini cya whisky nini cyane kugirango yumve ameze neza, mu burya bwo kwivanamo stress. Claire yavuye mucyaro iwabo afite inzozi zuko yaba umustar wa pop muri Kigali nziza. Claire atekereza kuba Beyonce w'abaririmbyi bose, impano afite iri hejuru y'ibindi byose mubuzima bwe, ariko Kigali avuga birakomeye ahura nabyinnci bimuca intege agomba kubirenga kugirango agere kuntego ye. Ese Claire azatsinda?\niyi filime yanditswe na Emmanuel Iradukunda iyoborwa na Roger niyoyita kubufatanye na Nelly Wilson Misago, kaba kendi inyuzwa kumuyoboro wa Zacu tv"}
{"id": "20421", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20421", "title": "Kimenyi Tito", "text": "Umunyarwanda utunganya filime, Kimenyi Tito, avuga ko TikTok ariyo yamwinjije mu isi ya sinema. Yatangiye akina filime yitwa \"Love Might Happen\", ubu akaba arimo gukina \"Umuruho Wanjye\" afite intego yo guhindura sinema nyarwanda.\nUmwuga Akora.\nAvuga ko urubuga rwitwa Tik Tok rwamubereye intangiriro kugirango abashe kwinjira mwisi yo gukina film neza. Yagize ati: \"Nari nzi ko nshaka gukina filime, ariko TikTok yabaye ikiraro kinjiza mu isi ya sinema. Nayikoresheje ntanga ubutumwa bijyanye no gukina, bituma abantu bamfata nk'umukinnyi.\"\nGuhindura Sinema Nyarwanda.\nUyu musore ufite imbaraga n'intego zihambaye, yashimiye bagenzi be bakina sinema nyarwanda ariko avuga ko nta mukinnyi yigana cyangwa areberaho. Intego ye ni uko filime ze zagera ku mbuga zikomeye nka Netflix no guhindura inganda za sinema mu Rwanda mu myaka itanu iri imbere.\nAmashakiro.\n1.https://inyarwanda.com/en/news/how-tiktok-propelled-kimenyi-titos-rise-in-rwandan-cinema-1747837244652?utm"}
{"id": "20422", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20422", "title": "Daniel Gaga", "text": "Daniel Gaga uzwi nka Ngenzi,n'umwe mubakinnyi ba cinema nyarwanda uzwi cyane,akaba yaramenyekanye kubera imikino ye ikomeye agaragaza ubugome,nko muri filme bise ikigeragezo cy'ubuzima,Ryangombe na Anitha,kandi akaba yaragaragaye kumeza y'umukino w'iteramakofe.\nUbuzima bwe bwambere n'imiterere y'umwuga.\nYamenyekanye bwa mbere muri filme mumwaka wa 2008 yitwa ikigeragezo cy'ubuzima,aho abantu bose bamufushe nk'umugome udasanzwe ndetse bagatekerezako ari umugome no mubuzima bwe busanzwe.\nIndi filme yagaragayemo ya kabiri niyamuvugishije nka Ryangombe,Nkuba,Anitha nd'umukristo na Ikirara.\nGushyira ahabona\nNyuma y'igihe atagaragaraga cyane,yagarutse mu ma filme nka \"Gica\" mugice cya 3 aho yakinnyemo nka bamwe mubakinyi bahanganye n'ibihe bikomeye.\nNatojeko urubyiruko rwaho n'abakunzi ba filme bamureba nkumwe mubatangije urugendo mu mwuga wo gukina.hamwe na Denis Nsanzamahoro na Willy Ndahiro.\nIngaruka mu mubuzima bwe busanzwe.\nYakomeje kugaragazako yakomeje gutinya nokwa kwisanzura mubaturage bitewe nuko bakiraga isura ya Ngenzi mubuzima busanzwe,ariko uko imyaka yagiye ishira,bamwe batangiye kumufata nk'umuntu usanzwe.\nYagaragaje ko gukina filme nk'umugome,byamugiraho ingaruka zitandukanye,ariko ntiyigeze abihagarika.\nYongeraho ko urubyiruko rukunda cinema,rushishikajwe nokumva iyo mitwe ishobora gutanga ubutumwa bukomeye. "}
{"id": "20423", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20423", "title": "UMUTURANYI FILIMI", "text": "\"Umuturanyi\" filimi yuruhererekane ica kurubuga rwa youtube, ikab aikunzwe cyane muri filimi zikinwa hano murwanda.\nIyi filimi ikaba ikinwamo abakinnyoi bibyamamare murwanda nka clapton kibonke, Rufonsina nabandi batandukanye. ikaba kandi ishingiye kubuzima bwabayikibamo ndetse igakinwa kandi nkurwenya. Ikaba imaze kurebwa numubare munini kuri youtube."}
{"id": "20424", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20424", "title": "Kazungu Emmanuel", "text": "Uzwi nka Mitsutsu Comedy Uyu musore w'imyaka 28 y'amavuko witwa Emmanuel Kazungu,Uzwi nka mitsutsu abaibwira The new Times mu kiganiro.\nMitsutsu ashimangira ko impamvu kon impamvu yaretse akazi ko gutwara abantu kuri moto atari ikibazon ahubwo byaturutse ku kumenyekana kw'impano yari yibitsemo atari yarigeze atekereza ko \nayifite impano yamuhaye Imbaraga zo gufata icyemezo cyo kwinjira muri comedy nk'umunyamwuga ahitamo kubikora kuburyo buhoraho.\navuka ko guhindura akazin nakava kuri taxi ya moto akajya muri coomedy bitari bitari ikimenyetso cy'ukon yatsinzwe ahubwo byari ukumenya integoye nyakuri mu buzima "}
{"id": "20426", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20426", "title": "Joelle karekezi", "text": "Karekezi ni umwe mubahanzi ba film bemera ko ari ngobwa ko tubungabunga amateka ya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi 1994 bumuryo bwa filimi.\nUmwuga Akora.\nHari aho usanga imiryango n\u2019abaturage barishwe bose, nta n\u2019umwe usigaye wo kuvuga amateka y\u2019ibyabaye. Ahandi ho, abayirokotse basigaye bafite ibikomere n\u2019ihungabana rikomeye.\nMu gihe u Rwanda rwitegura kwibuka imyaka 30 ishize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ihitanye abantu barenga miliyoni, ikibazo cy\u2019uko amateka ya Jenoside atanditswe neza ni kimwe mu bibazo bikomeye abahanga mu by\u2019amateka n\u2019abashinzwe kubika amateka bahanganye na cyo, benshi bakaba banabishyira ku ruhande rw\u2019abashaka guhakana Jenoside.\nMu gihe Leta yagize uruhare mu kubungabunga amateka binyuze mu rwibutso n\u2019amanyarwanda y\u2019ibyaha bya Jenoside, ni abacitse ku icumu bake cyane babashije kuvuga amateka yabo, haba mu bitabo cyangwa muri filimi."}
{"id": "20427", "revid": "16253", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20427", "title": "The Endless River (film)", "text": "The Endless River ni filime y\u2019amakinamico yo muri Afurika y'epfo yakozwe mu mwaka wa 2015 iyobowe na Oliver Hermanus. Yerekanwe mu gice cy\u2019amarushanwa gikuru cya 72nd venice International Film Festival. Niyo filime ya mbere yo muri Afrika y'epfo yahataniye muri Golden Lion. Yerekanwe kandi mu gice cya Contemporary World Cinema cyo muri 2015 Toronto International Film Festival. \nUburyo yakozwe.\nAmashusho y'ingenzi yafatiwe ahitwa Riviersonderend na Plettenberg Bay no muri Nature's Valley ndetse n'andi mashusho y'imbere (interior scenes) afatirwa muri Paarl na Cape Town. "}
{"id": "20428", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20428", "title": "Kigali cine junction", "text": "Kigali cine junction urubyiruko mwiterambere rya sinema mu rwanda \nItangiriro: Kigali cine function ni serukira muco ngarukamaka rya sinema mpuzamahanga ribera murwanda ritegurwa nikigo gitunganya filime murwanda kuva 2023. uretse kwerekana filimi iki kigo kigamije kuhuza abazikora kubatezimbere no no gushikikariza abanyarwanda muri rusange umuco wa sinema. no guhuza abanyempano ba sinema mu rwanda nisi yose itandukaniro nandi ma serukiramuco ya sinema kwisi kigali cine junction ntago itegura amarushwa ya filimi ahubwo ishirimbere kwerekana filimi nziza guha agaciro umwanya wokuganira no kungurana ibitekerezo bana tegura amahugurwa menchi atandukanye ajyanye na filimi na sinema muri rusange. \nsinema nkiraro gihuza abantu. \nabategura iriserukiramuco itengo yabo nyamukuru nuguhindura kigali umurwamukuru wa sinema muri afurika umugi uhuza abakora filimi nabakunzi bazo bagahura bakaganira bakungurana ibitekerezo muburyo bwo kugeza imbere ubuhanzi bwa sinema.abategura iri serukira muco bemeza badashidikanya ko sinema aruburyo bwiza bwo kubungabunga biriho, gusigasira ibyagezweho ndetse no gutekereza ahazaza. bizera nanone ko sinema ifite uruhari runini mu kubaka ubumwe mubantu niyo mpamvu iriserukiramucyo naryo ryerekeranira filimi ahuntu hahurira abantu benchi nko mumbuga ya car free zone cyangwa mumihanda (nyamirambo) intego niyo kwegereza filimi rubanda nyamwinchi cyane ko filimi zanagira umumaro wubukangurambaga no gushishikariza bantu kwanga ikibi bagakora icyiza (morality). \nKigali cine juction 2025 yagaragayemo ibiganiro byinchi byahuzagaga abakora filimi inzu zikora ziganacuruza filimi murwanda nka izacu entertainment ibiganiro byari bigamije kurebera hamwe iterambere ya sinema nabakora muruganda rwa sinema muri rusange. \nmugihe urwanda inganda za sinema zikiri muntangiro Kigali cine junction nindashikirwa cyane cyane ko itanga amahugurwa kurubyiruko nurifte inzozi zogukora filimi inahunza nanone ahakora filimi murwanda ninzobere muruganda rwa sinema mpuza mahanga bakanafasha imikoranire hagati yabo kubabyifuza hagatiyabo kigali cine junction inafasha na none gutizimbere inkuru nyarwanda nokogaragaza urwanda nkigihugu gifite ijambo muruhando mpuzamahanga. \nUmusozo\nKigali cine junction igambiriye kwihaza nkumusingi wumuco nyarwanda kuberako ishingikiye sinema nkubuhanzi kubyo cyangwa igikoresho gihuza imico kandi nkimbaraga ziteza imbere ubukungu bwigihungu nabagituye kigali cine junction ni serukiramuco ririkurema ahazaza ha sinema nyafurika ryifashishije kuguza abantu nimico yose yabanyafurika nisiyose muri rusange. "}
{"id": "20430", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20430", "title": "IMPANGA", "text": "ni film y'uruherekane igaragaza abakobwa b'impanga Kami na Keza bafite imico itandukanye kami uba yitonda akundana n'umusore impanga Keza adakunda, kuko keza we aba akanda abagabo bakuru kandi bafite abagore ari n'umusinzi. \nImpanga ni film yashyizwe hante muri 2021 ikaba ari filime yayobowe kandi na Bahavu Jannet ikaba inyuzwa ku murongo wa YouTube witwa impanga tv"}
{"id": "20431", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20431", "title": "Kalisa Ernest", "text": "Kalisa Ernest uzwi nka Samusure muri sinema nyarwanda, akaba ari umukinnyi wa filimi, Urwenya n'ikinamico. mumirimo yihangiye harimo no kuba avuga imivugo akaba yaramenyekanye muri filime yitwa SEBURIKOKO. \nAkaba yarakinnye filimi zirimo nka samusure,Rulinda, seburikoko na filime yitwa Makuta akaba ari muri bamwe bazamuye ndetse bagira aho bashyire sinema nyarwanda ndetse Akaba yaragize uruhare rukomeye muri filime yiswe makuta. iyi filimi yayikinnyemo ndetse anashoramo amafranga atari macyeya gusa iyi filime makita ntago yaje kumuhira nkuko yabitekerezaga aho yaje kujyanwa murucyiko kubera ibibazo birimo kubura amafranga yo kwishyura aho yari yagujije kugirango iyi filime ikinwe.\nTugarutse gato mubyo yagiye akora uyu mugabo yamenyekanye cyane cyane muzirimo zirara zishya ndetse na seburikoko. iyi filime yitwa seburikoko ni filime y'uruhererekane y'inyarwanda yakozwe na Misago Nelly Wilson ayikora binyuze muri Sosiyete itunganya amafilimi ya Afrifame Pictures.\nBuri gace k'iyi filimi kanyura kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda buri wa mbere na buri wa kane saa kumi n'ebyiri na mirongo ine n'itanu za nimugoroba guhera muri Werurwe 2015 "}
