{"id": "20433", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20433", "title": "The Dream filimi", "text": "Abakinnyi ba filime bakomeye mu Rwanda, barimo Rukundo Arnold wamamaye muri sinema nka Shaffy, bagaragara muri filime \u201cThe Dream\u201d, igaragaramo umukobwa wakunze umuhungu, akanga kumuvaho nyamara umuhungu atakimushaka.\nMugwaneza Abdul ushinzwe kumenyekanisha iyi filime, yabwiye IGIHE ko igitekerezo cyayo cyaturutse ku buzima abantu banyuramo cyane cyane abakundana, aho umwe ashobora kunaniza undi ashaka ko amuvaho ariko ntave ku izima.\nMugwaneza watangiye Sinema mu 2012 yanyuze muri filime zitandukanye zirimo \u2018Amarira y\u2019Urukundo\u2019, \u2018Inzozi Mbi\u2019 na \u2018Isi Ntisakaye\u2019\nRukundo Arnold wamamaye muri sinema y\u2019u Rwanda nka Shaffy, we yayishoyemo imari bamwe bazwi nka \u2018Producer\u2019."}
{"id": "20434", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20434", "title": "Filime y'Ikarita y\u2019Urupfu", "text": "Iyi filime y\u2019uruhererekane ifite inkuru ivuga ku mugabo washatse umugore afite undi mwana, ahageze wa mugore abyara undi mwana utari uw\u2019uwo mugabo bashakanye.\nUwo mugabo wari umukire, yaje kwitaba Imana, asiga araze imitungo ye umwana wa mbere. Nyuma yo gupfa, hatangiye intambara hagati y\u2019abana na nyina washakaga kwigarurira iyo mitungo yose.\nIyi filime yanditswe inayoborwa n\u2019umusore witwa Mugwaneza Abdul \u2018Cobby\u2019. Uyu mugabo watangiye Sinema mu mwaka wa 2012, yagize uruhare muri filime zitandukanye zirimo \u2018Amarira y\u2019urukundo\u2019, \u2018Inzozi mbi\u2019, \u2018Isi Ntisakaye\u2019 n\u2019izindi."}
{"id": "20435", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20435", "title": "Filime ya stick around", "text": "Ni filime nyarwanda ifite ibice bifite ubutumwa butandukanye, kimwe kimwe gifite uburebure burenga isaha.\nMuri make ntabwo ari uruhererekane rwa filimi nk\u2019inyinshi zikinwa muri iki gihe inyuzwa ku rubuga rwa YouTube. Ifite umwihariko wo kuba ifite izina rimwe, ariko abayiteguye bakaba bagenda bakinamo ubutumwa bashaka gutambutsa mu gice kimara isaha irenga, ikindi gikurikiraho kikaza gitandukanye n\u2019icyari cyabanje. \nIyi filime yateguwe na Nkusi Queen [La Queen] usanzwe ari murumuna wa Nkusi Lynda umaze kumenyekana mu ruganda rw\u2019imyidagaduro kuva ubwo yitabiraga Miss Rwanda. "}
{"id": "20436", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20436", "title": "Filime y'inkomoko", "text": "Dusenge Clenia wamenyekanye nka Madedeli muri sinema y\u2019u Rwanda, atangiye gusohora filime ye bwite y\u2019uruhererekane yise \u2018Inkomoko\u2019. Amaze gushyira hanze uduce twinshi tw\u2019iyi filime.\nNi filime igaragaramo abandi bakinnyi bafite amazina akomeye muri sinema nyarwanda nka Emmanuel Rugaba na Kakuze Cecile.\nMu kiganiro na IGIHE, Madedeli mu minsi yashize ubwo yatangiraga kuyishyira hanze, yavuze ko yari amaze iminsi mu myiteguro yo gukora filime ye bwite. Ati \u201cUyu ni umushinga wagutse ugizwe na filime y\u2019uruhererekane ifite inkuru zivuga ku nkomoko y\u2019ibibazo benshi bakunda guhura nabyo mu buzima bwa buri munsi.\u201d\nMadedeli ahamya ko iyi filime izagaragaza ingeri zitandukanye z\u2019ubuzima bwa buri munsi bw\u2019abantu, hibandwa ku bibazo biba mu miryango.\nUretse Papa Sava yamamayemo, Madedeli yanamenyekanye muri filime nka \u2018Indoto\u2019, \u2018Kaliza wa kalisa\u2019 na \u2018The Bishop\u2019s Family\u2019. "}
{"id": "20437", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20437", "title": "Abbott na Costello muri Legio Yamahanga", "text": "Yakorewe muri Sahara y'Ubufaransa hamwe nintwari zinjiye muri Legio Y\u2019amahanga y\u2019Ubufaransa.\nUmugambi.\nBud Jones na Lou Hotchkiss n'abagabo baribashizwe kumenyekanisha urugamba i Brooklyn. bari ibyamamare Abdullah yaratewe ishema, ntiyaragishaka gukurikiza ibyanditswe n'amategeko kugirango bategure mbere, cyane ko agomba gutsindwa umukino utaha. Abdullah yavuye muri Amerika asubira mu gihugu cye, Alijeriya. Abaterankunga ba promoteri, syndicat yabagurije 5,000 $ yo kuzana Abdullah muri Amerika, ubu barasaba ko basubiza amafaranga cyangwa bagahura ningaruka. Aba bagabo bombi bakurikira Abdullah kwa Algiers bizeye ko azamugarura.\nLou yereka umugore we uburyo bwo guhangana ariko biba ibyubusa kuko atarabisobanukiwe.\nHagati aho, mubyara wa Abdullah, Sheik Hamud El Khalid na Legionnaire w\u2019abanyamahanga bagoranye, Sgt. Axmann, yagabye igitero ahobazajya bategera Gariyamoshi hagamijwe kwaka amafaranga y'uburinzi muri sosiyete ya gariyamoshi. Bud na Lou bagezeyo baribeshya ko ari intasi za sosiyete, maze Sheik na Axmann bohereza abarabu batatu bateye ubwoba basa nabarabu bashaka kubica. Kubera ko buri kigeragezo cyatsinzwe, urwango rw'abicanyi kuri Bud na Lou rugenda rwiyongera, cyane cyane iyo Lou atabishaka abishaka Sheik ku bakobwa batandatu b'abacakara, umwe muri bo, Nicole, mu by'ukuri akaba ari intasi y'Abafaransa yashinzwe kwinjira mu nkambi ya Sheik, bityo akaba yarifuzaga ko Sheik yatsindira cyamunara. Abahungu bahise birukanwa, gusa bahita bihisha ku cyicaro gikuru cya Legio y\u2019amahanga, aho Axmann abashuka ngo biyandikishe muri Legio, umuhango wo kurahira ukaba uri mu gifaransa.\nInshingano zabo zambere zar'imyitozo ya bayonet mubutayu. Komanda wa Legio arakeka ko muri Legio harimo umuhemu, kubera ko Sheik ateganya neza buri kimwe mu bikorwa bya Legio (rwihishwa binyuze muri Axmann). Komanda yahise aha Bud na Lou pasiporo m'umujyi aho bavumbuye ubufatanye bwa Axmann nabarabu mbere yo guhura na Nicole. Arabamenyesha ko bagomba gusaka icyumba cya Axmann kugira ngo bagaragaze kwar'umuhemu, ariko akabafata mur'icyo gikorwa cyitararangira. Ariko, baratorotse, bahungira mu nkambi ya Legionnaire. Muriryojoro mbereyuko inkambi igabwaho ibitero n\u2019abagabo ba Sheik, Bud na Lou barazerera bashaka ingamiya yoguhungiraho bityo barokoka urupfu, ariko bivamo kuzenguruka mu butayu nta mazi bafite. Lou atangira kubona mirage, harimo ice cream soda ihagaze hamwe nu mucuruzi w'ikinyamakuru. Iyo Bud abonye oasisi nyayo Lou yibwira ko ari indi mirage.\nBahavuye barafatwa, hamwe na Nicole, ushyirwa muri harem ya Sheik Hamud. Sheik ategeka ko umwe mu barwanyi be yica. mukinnyi waje guhinduka Abdullah, yabafashije guhunga kugirango ashobore gutoroka gushakana n'umugore utarumunyuze Berekeje i Fort Apar, aho barangaje abagabo ba Sheik imbere hanyuma bakabaturuka inyuma. Bahabwa imidari na Komanda ariko banahabwa gusezererwa icyubahiro muri Legio. Lou arashimira Nicole kuba yarabafashije kandi akamuha igihembo cye mbere yuko bagenda, gusa Bud amenya ko Lou ajyana nabakobwa batandatu b\u2019abacakara muri Amerika.\nUmusaruro.\nUbusanzwe yariteganyijwe kuzafatwa amashusho mu Kuboza 1949, gufata amashusho byasubitswe igihe Costello yagombaga kubagwa uruhago rw\u2019agashinyaguro mu Gushyingo 1949. Amashusho yaje gutangira ku ya 28 Mata 1950, arangira ku ya 29 Gicurasi 1950. Nubwo yari afite inshuro ebyiri, Costello yakoze urugamba rwe bwite muri filime, ababara urushyi rwamaboko kandi yarambuye. \nMu 1948, Abbott na Costello birukanye umukozi wabo, Eddie Sherman. Mbere gato yo gufata ayamashusho bariyunze na Sherman yongera kubona akazi \nDavid Gorcey, umwe mu bagize itsinda ry\u2019urwenya The Bowery Boys, agaragara neza muri filime. Ijwi rya skeleton muri film ryatanzwe na Candy Candido, waje kuba umufatanyabikorwa wa Abbott mu myaka yi 1960 nyuma yuko Costello apfuye.\nImwe mumiziki ya \"Abbott na Costello Tahura na Frankenstein\" yakoreshejwe muri iyi film.\nNk\u2019uko inkuru yigitabo cyitwa \"Nightmare of Ecstasy\" Rudolph Grey kibitangaza ngo umukinnyi wa filime Edward D. Wood Jr. yakoraga kuri iyi filime nk'umufasha w\u2019ibikorwa. \nItangazamakuru.\nIyi firime yasohotse inshuro eshatu kuri DVD. Ubusanzwe yasohotse nka DVD kwitariki ya 12 Kanama 1998, yasohotse kabiri mu rwego rwo gukusanya ibice bibiri bitandukanye bya Abbott na Costello, \"Ibyiza bya Abbott na Costello vorime ya gatatu\", kwitariki ya 3 Kanama 2004, irongera isohoka kwitariki ya 28 Ukwakira 2008, mu rwego rwa \"Abbott na Costello: Icyegeranyo cyuzuye cya Universal Pictures\"."}
{"id": "20438", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20438", "title": "I'm Not Lying But I'm Beautifying", "text": "I'm Not Lying But I'm Beautifying izwi kandi nka The Made Up Truth (yandikwa mu cyarabu cyo muri Egiputa ngo: \u0623\u0646\u0627 \u0644\u0627 \u0623\u0643\u0630\u0628 \u0648\u0644\u0643\u0646\u064a \u0623\u062a\u062c\u0645\u0644 mu kidage: \"Die geschminkte wahrheit\" translit: \"Ana La Aktheb Wlakenani Atajaml\"), ni filime yo muri Egypt yo mu mwaka wa 1981 yanditswe na Ihsan Abdel Quddq iyoborwa na Ibrahim El- Shaqanqeeri. Ni filme irimo Abakinnyo nka Salah Zulfikar, Ahmed Zaki na Athar El-Hakim. \nInkuru ya Filme.\nRafik Hamdy ni umwanditsi uzwi akaba afite umukobwa umwe Khairya.Khairya akaba umunyeshuri wiga muri kaminuza aho yigana na Ibrahim umunyeshuri w'umunyamwete. Ibrahim aramukunda ariko Khairya akaba umukobwa uhindagurika mu rukundo, n'ubwo aho biga hari umunyeshuri w'umukire Hani umwishimira, Ibrahim agerageza guhisha ukuri k'ubuzima abayemo kuko yatinyaga ko Khairya nabimenya azamuvaho, akabeshya ko akomoka mu muryango ukize. Ariko amaherezo Rafik waruzi kwa Ibrahim amuvamo, none Khairya agomba guhitamo. "}
{"id": "20439", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20439", "title": "Genesis Broadcasting Network", "text": "Genesis Broadcasting Network ni ikigo gikorera mu Rwanda kita ku mirimo ibyara inyungu mu Itangazamakuru, Urubyiruko n'Imyidagaduro kuva 2013 cyashinzwe na Niragire Marie France.\nmuri 2013 ubwo Mme Marie France Niragire yaramaze kugaragara muri filme zitandukanye, yifuje ko nawe yakwihugura mu ikorwa rya filme ndetse n'uko itunganywa (production), nyuma aho amariye kubimenya akora filme ze ubwe ariko abura Televiziyo n'imwe mu Rwanda yacishaho filme ye biba imvano yo gushinga iye muri 2020 isakazamashusho Genesis TV Rwanda itangira kugaragara mu bihugu 56 hirya no hino ku isi. \nIbyiciro.\nGenesis Broadcasting Network ikozwe n'ibyiciro bitandukanye bishingiye ku buhanzi ndangamuco n'imyidagaduro aribyo: \nGenesis TV Rwanda.\nGenesis TV Rwanda ni isakazamashusho (Television) ikorera mu Rwanda kuva mu mwaka wa 2020, kuva yatangira yagize ibiganiro byinshi byakunzwe, cyane ko ari Televiziyo ivuga gusa ku rubyiruko n'imyidagaduro aho slogan yabo ivuga ngo \"Genesis TV the Center of Happiness\" ikaba ariyo televiziyo ya mbere mu Rwanda yarishinzwe n'umugore. Marie France avuga ko umushinga w\u2019iki gitekerezo yawukuye n\u2019ubundi muri uyu mwuga asanzwe akora wo gukina filme. Mu kiganiro yagiranye n\u2019Imvaho Nshya yagize ati: \"\" \"\" \nibiganiro byose byanyuze kuri Genesis TV Rwanda kuva yatangira n'igihe byanyuragaho.\nGenesis TV Rwanda yagiye inagaragara mu bikorwa byo guteza imbere impano mu myidagaduro aho ku bufatanye na Genesis Broadcasting Network bateguye banashyira mu bikorwa irushanwa Head's Up Music Competition ryitabiriwe n'abanyempano mu muziki bagera kuri 400 rikaza kwegukanwa na Elie Maniraguha ndetse sibyo gusa Genesis TV Rwanda yateyemo inkunga kuko ku bufatanye na Genesis Studio ndetse na Kikac music bakoze Album launch ya Mico The Best."}
{"id": "20440", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20440", "title": "Alijeriya (film ya 1938)", "text": "Algiers ni filime y\u2019ikinamico yo muri Amerika yakinwe mu mwaka wi 1938 iyobowe na John Cromwell, yanditswe na John Howard Lawson ikinwamo na Charles Boyer, Sigrid Gurie na Hedy Lamarr. intego yayo yavugaga kum'umujura wihishe muri Algiers ahura na nukerarugendo mwiza womubufaransa. Igicuruzwa cya Walter Wanger (cyatanzwe mbere n\u2019abahanzi bunze ubumwe) cyasubiwemo filime nziza yo mu 1937 y\u2019Abafaransa \"P\u00e9p\u00e9 le Moko\", yakuye umugambi wayo mu gitabo cya Henri La Barthe cyitwa izina rimwe. \n\"Algiers\" yabaye sensation kuko aribwo bwa mbere Lamarr ya Hollywood. Iyi filime izwi cyane nk'isoko yo gutera inkunga abanditsi ba firime ya 1942 Warner Bros. \"Casablanca\", yanditse film nyuma akizirikana Lamarr n'umugore we wambere. Boyer yerekana Pepe le Moko iterwa imbaraga Warner Bros muburyo bwa animasiyo Pep\u00e9 Le Pew. Mu 1966, iyi filime yasohocyeye muri Amerika kubera ko abayireze batigeze bongera kwiyandikisha ku burenganzira bwabo mu mwaka wa 28 nyuma yo kujyahanze \nUmugambi.\nPepe le Moko ni umujura uzwi cyane wahunze Ubufaransa akaba atuye i Casbah, cyangwa mugace ka Alijeriya imyaka ibiri. Komiseri Janvier, umupolisi w\u2019Ubufaransa, yiyemeje gufata Pepe. Umunsi umwe nijoro, Janvier ayobora igitero kuri Casbah, aho Regis, umujura ugirira ishyari Pepe, ayobora abapolisi kuri Grandpere. Regis yagiye kwa Ines, nyirabuja wa Pepe, kugira ngo amuburire ko abapolisi bahageze. Ines ageze kwa Grandpere kuburira Pepe, ubwo yakekaga ko Regis yabibwiye abapolisi. Abapolisi bahageze, Pepe yihisha munsi muriyo nyubako kugeza igihe amasasu arangiriye. Pepe aratoroka nubwoyari yakomeretse.\nMu gihe cyo kurasa, umugenzuzi Slimane, ushinzwe iperereza muri Alijeriya, azana Gaby, umukerarugendo womubufaransa, warutuye aho Pepe nawe ageze aho ku gihe Slimane ashimira Pepe, abwira Gaby ko yanditse itariki Pepe yafatiwe kurukuta rwe. Bukeye, Regis abonana n\u2019umugenzuzi mukuru Louvain maze ategura umugambi wo gufata inshuti ya Pepe Pierrot, yizeye gufata Pepe. Regis ashyikiriza Pierrot ibaruwa, bivugwa ko yanditswe na nyina, avuga ko arwaye. Hanyuma, Gaby yagiye atekereza kuri Pepe, nubwo yasezeranye n'umukunzi we Giraux. Mugihe arimo kurya, Slimane abwira Gaby ibijyanye nogushimira Pepe imitako, amaze iminsi ategura ko azongera kubona Pepe.\nHanyuma muriryojoro, Pepe amenyeshwa ko Pierrot yavuye muri Alijeriya. Pepe ageze i Casbah, abaza Regis kubyerekeye ibura ya Pierrot. Hanyuma Regis abira ibyuya Pepe yongeye guhura na Gaby i Casbah, aho bahuriraga mugihe cyabo bari mubufaransa. Nuko Gaby basezerana kuzabonana bukeye Pierrot yakomeretse arahagera, ashaka kwica Regis. Pierrot yikubita hasi agerageza kurasa Regis, hanyuma yicwa na Carlos, umwe mu nshuti za Pepe.\nBukeye, umuhango wo gushyingura Pierrot ubera hanze ya Casbah, birakaza Pepe bimutera agahinda Pepe yashakaga kwujya gushyingura Pepe ashaka kujyayo ariko Ines aramubuza kuberako Gaby yari amutegereje iwe. Pepe yagiye ahwatuye, nubwo yabeshye, ashimira Ines kuba yaramubujije kwugwa mumutego. Gaby arahagera bacyirikumwe, Pepe agaragaza akababaro kuko atashoboraga narimwe guhunga Casbah. Mbereyuko Gaby agenda, bemeranya guhurira muri hoteri ye bukeye. Hanyuma Slimane abwira Giraux ko Gaby yirigeze kubona Pepe. Iyo ibyo binaniwe, Slimane abeshya Gaby, avuga ko Pepe yishwe.\nMbereyuko Pepe ajya kureba Gaby muri hoteri ye yabanje kwigira kumugabo witwa L'Arbi ko Gaby na Giraux bahunga bakava muri Alijeriya bakoresheje ubwato kumugoroba nyuma ya saa sita yirengagiza ibyo Ines yariyamubwiye, Pepe ava i Casbah agura itike yo kugenda. Pepe ari mu bwato abona Gaby, afatwa na Slimane n'abashinzwe iperereza. Pepe yihutira kwerekeza ku bwato ahamagara Gaby, ariko ntiyamubona. Umwe mu bagabo ba Slimane yarashe Pepe maze Slimane atwika umubiri we, asaba imbabazi kuva uyu mugabo yizeraga ko Pepe yashakaga gutoroka. Pepe aramusubiza ati: \"Nanjye rero mfite, nshuti yanjye.\"\nUmusaruro.\nWalter Wanger, yatunganyije iyi filime, yaguze uburenganzira kuri filime y\u2019Abafaransa \"Pepe le Moko\", yakinanye na Jean Gabin, mu rwego rwo kuyisubiramo, maze agura ibyapa byose bya filime kugira ngo birinde guhatana na filime ye muri Amerika Wanger yakoresheje imiziki myinshi yo muri filime y\u2019Abafaransa muri remake ndetse no mu bihe byakurikiranye. "}
{"id": "20441", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20441", "title": "Alijeriya (filime 2024)", "text": "Alijeriya (Arabic) ni filime y'amayobera 2024 yanditswe, yatsindiye, igafatanywa iyobowe na Chakib Taleb-Bendiab mugutangira kwe kwambere. Ubufatanye mpuzamahanga hagati ya Alijeriya, Tuniziya, n\u2019Ubufaransa, iyi filime ikinamo Meriem Medjkane, Nabil Asli na Hichem Mesbah. Yatsindiye igihembo cya Grand Prix mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 28 rya Rhode \nYatoranyijwe ngoyinjire muri Alijeriya nka Filime Nziza Nziza Mpuzamahanga yatsindiye ibihembo bya Academy mu 97, ariko ntiyahiswemo. \nInyandiko.\nDounia w'umuganga w\u2019indwara zomumutwe wabigize umwuga, arikumwe n\u2019umugenzuzi wa polisi Sami, bayobowe nibicucu bibangamiye amateka ya Alijeriya kugira ngo bamenye ibyihishinyuma y\u2019umukobwa wabuze. \nUmusaruro.\nAmafoto mfatizo yafashwe mu ntangiriro ya Kamena 2022 muri Alijeriya, Alijeriya. \nKurekura.\nYabaye iyambere kw'isi kwitariki ya 9 Kanama 2024, mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryabaye kunshuro ya 28 ya Rhode Island. Uburenganzira bwagurishijwe kuri K-Films Am\u00e9rique kugira ngo busohore mu makinamico yo muri Kanada, mu gihe Mad Solutions yabonye uburenganzira mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "20442", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20442", "title": "Igitero (film ya 2010)", "text": "Igitero (French) ni filime yakozwe nabafaransa muri 2010 ihagarariwe Julien Leclercq, ivuga ibyogushimuta indege yitwa Air France mumwaka wi 1994 n\u2019iterabwoba ry\u2019abayisilamu bomuri Alijeriya hamwe n\u2019igitero cyogufungura imfungwa na GIGN, ishami ry\u2019indashyikirwa mu kurwanya iterabwoba ry\u2019Abafaransa. "}
{"id": "20443", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20443", "title": "Bordellos ya Alijeriya", "text": "Bordellos ya Alijeriya (German) ni filime yikinamico yaba Badage yakozwe mu 1927 iyobowe na Wolfgang Hoffmann-Harnisch yakinwemona Maria Jacobini, Camilla Horn na Warwick Ward.amashusho yayo yafatiwe muri Afrika ya ruguru yatunganyijwe na Hans Jacoby na Bruno Krauskopf. Yerekanwe bwa mbere muri UFA-Palast am Zoo i Berlin."}
{"id": "20444", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20444", "title": "Buji muri Alijeriya", "text": "Buji muri Alijeriya ni filime y'imirwano yabongereza yakozwe mu 1944 ihagarariwena George King abakinnyi bari James Mason, Carla Lehmann na Raymond Lovell. Iyifilime ivuga kunama y'ibanga yabaye mu Kwakira 1942 ibera i Cherchell, muri Alijeriya hagati ya jenerali w'umunyamerika Mark W. Clark n'itsinda ry'abayobozi bakuru bo mu Bufaransa Vichy. Muri iyo nama, abayobozi ba Vichy b'Abafaransa bemeye kutarwanya indege ya Operation Torch i Vichy mu Bufaransa -kugenzura Afurika y\u2019amajyaruguru y\u2019Ubufaransa yabaye nyuma yukwezi kumwe.\nUmugambi.\nMumwaka wi 1943, mbere y\u2019uko Abanyamerika bagaba ibitero kuri Afurika y\u2019amajyaruguru, Alijeriya yari ifiteguverinoma ya Vichy ndetse n\u2019icyicaro gikuru cya komisiyo ishinzwe ibirwanisho mu Budage. Inshingano y'ibanga ya Jenerali Mark Clark ni ingenzi cyane mu gutuma inama ihuza Abongereza, Abanyamerika, n'Abafaransa, itanga inzira yo kugwa mu gisirikare gikomeye ku ntsinzi y\u2019Ubumwe nta gutakaza ubuzima bukabije\nMugihe Abanyamuryango baribishimiye intsinzi, Susan Foster, yarafite ikibazo cyo guhungabana yagize mugisasu, akangukira mubitaro kandi ahangayikishijwe n'ibyabereye kuri Alan Thurston, atinya ko yapfuye. Abajije umuforomo aho aherereye kandi amenyeshwa intsinzi, avuga ko Thurston ashimirwa cyane kuba yarashoboye gutsinda kandi akavuga uburyo Thurston yagize uruhare mu butumwa bwe.\nMuri flashback, mbereyinama, umukoziw\u2019Ubwongereza Alan Thurston yahawe inshingano zo kujya muri Algiers kugarura kamera irim'amafoto yerekanaho inam'izabera. Thurston ntiyigeze amenya ibyiyonama cyangwa ibyihishe murayomashusho arikohamabwiriza yokubuza kamera kugera ku Badage. Afite igicucu cya maneko w\u2019Ubudage Dr. M\u00fcller, ufite umugambi wo kwiba kamera akimara kuyibona.\nThurston yatawe muri yombi n\u2019Abafaransa Vichy afatwa mpiri n\u2019Abadage mugihome ariko arabacika. Akurikiranwa n'Abadage, ahungira mu nzu Susan Foster, umunyabugeni w\u2019umunyamerik'utuye i Biskra, akodesha Susan atekerezako umucengezi arumujura, Susan yamufatiyeho imbunda kugeza igihe Thurston amwibwiye hanyuma amusaba koyamufasha nk'umuntu ukunda igihugu. Mugihabakozi ba Vichy bagishakisha uwatorotse, Susan yahishe Thurston muri cyumbacy'ibanga kugirangoyirinde gushakisha imitungo. Muganga M\u00fcller yasanze ibimenyetso bya Thurston birimu kirahure cy\u2019amata n\u2019itabi kandi aburira Susan kwirinda kwishoramuri politiki. Susan amwizezako azagenda bukeye yerekezamuri Algiers. munzira asubira mur'Amerika. Abashakashatsi bamazekugenda, Thurston aburira Susan ko M\u00fcller azakomeza kumukurikirana ariko akamusaba ko yamufasha mukugarura kamera yari yihishe umukozi wapfuye mu biro mu rugo rw\u2019umukunzi w\u2019umukozi, umuririmbyi w\u2019ijoro rya Maritza, utazi akamaro kayo. Akeneye Susan udashaka gukunda igihugu cya tepid gukunda igihugu, amwemeza ko azakora ubutumwa nkibyingenzi kuruta gahunda ye yuzuye yo kwinjira muri WAC."}
{"id": "20445", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20445", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime, Inc.", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime nyafurika, Inc. Uyumuryango ufiticyicaro mumujyi wa New York, washinzwe mu 1990. Uyu muryango wiyemeje gutezimbere nokurushaho kumenyekanisha umuco w\u2019Afurika binyuze murifirime.\nPorogaramu.\nAFF yashinzwe mu 1990, na Mahen Bonetti na komite idasanzwe y'abahanzi n'intiti zomuri Afurika n'Abanyamerika. Gahundaya AFF, iserukiramuco ryafirime muri New York (NYAFF) ryatangiye mu 1993 munsiy\u2019ibendera ry'Iminsi igezweho, nijoro rya kera\". Iriserukiramuco ryashyikirijwe hamwe na Sosiyete ya Filime y\u2019ikigo cya Lincoln ifatanyije n\u2019inzu ndangamurage ya Brooklyn. Yerekanaga ibikorwa bya kera birimo na filime nka \"Udju Azul di Yonta\" ya Flora Gomes, \"Yeelen\" na Souleymane Ciss\u00e9, \"Kaddu Beykat\",Safi Faye na \"Badou Boy\" wa Djibril Diop Mamb\u00e9ty, n'abandi. Habayeho no gusubira inyuma kurifirime za Ousmane Semb\u00e8ne. Ibirori bikorwa buri mwaka hagati yukwezi kwa Mata na Gicurasi.\nIserukiramuco ngarukamwaka, rifatanyije na Sosiyete ya Filime ya Lincoln Centre, ikubiyemokwerekana amafilime, ibitaramo, ibihangano, ibiganiro nyunguranabitekerezo, ibiganirobyabahanzi, gahunda z'urubyirukozirwigisha, amasomo n'amahugurwa Mu 2004, BAMcin\u00e9matek ya Brooklyn Academy of Muzika yabayumufatanyabikorwa wa NYAFF. Mumwaka wi 2011, Ishuri rya Sinema rya Maysles ryatangijwe igihecyokwerekan'ibirori no kwerekana AFF yagejeje kubateraniye ahw'Abanyamerika ibikorwa by'abakinnyi bafilime benshibomur'Afurika, barimo Abderrahmane Sissako, Lupita Nyong'o, Tunde Kelani n'abandi. Iri serukiramuco rimara iminsi 8-14 ryerekana burimwaka film zigerakuri 40 zakera. Uyumuryango watangije Urugendorw\u2019igihugu rugizwenafirime ngufi zatoranijwe mw'iserukiramuco yaFilimi zaNew York ziheruka zerekanwe mubigo bikikij' Amerika \nAFF ikoragahunday'umwaka n'uburezi bikikij'Umujyi wa New York hamwen\u2019ibigo bikorera mumujyi nka Schomburg Centre y\u2019ubushakashatsi mu muco w\u2019abirabura, Electronic Arts Intermix, AFF ikoranan'iminsi mikuru y'imiryango mpuzamahanga.\nAbitabiriye gahundazizwi harimo, nyakwigendera \"Se wa Sinema nyafurika\", Ousmane Semb\u00e8ne, umwanditsi w'amakinamico, wumusizi akaban'uwahawe igihembo cyitiriwe Nobel, Wole Soyinka, umuhanziwatinze akaba n'umurwanashyaka uharanir'uburenganzira bwamuntu Miriam Makeba n'umuhanzi, umusizi,umukinnyi wa filime, n'umukangurambaga, Harry Belafonte. \nIbisohokayandikiro.\nMu 2003, AFF yasohoye anthologiya \"Binyuze mumaso ya Afurika: Ibiganiro n\u2019abayobozi\", n\u2019aba piyoniya ndetse n\u2019abakinnyib'afilime bakomokamur'Afurika bakizamuka. Mu mwaka wa 2010, AFF yasohoye igitabo cyakabiri kigaragaza incamakeyasinema nyafurika mukinyejana cya 20 na 21 binyuzemunyandiko nokubaz'abayobozi ba'Afurika. Mu mwaka wa 2013, murwego rwokwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 20 iserukiramuco ryaFiliminyafurika ryabereye i New York, AFF yasohoye antologiya y\u2019isabukuru yiswe \"Kureba Inyuma, Kureba Imbere: Imyaka 20 Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya New York\". "}
{"id": "20446", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20446", "title": "The woman in me", "text": "Uyu ni umukino wa filime ishingiye kunkuru wamuritswe ku itariki ya 25 Werurwe 2024 muri Century Cinema i Kigali. Ni kandi Filime yagarutse no ku nkuru y\u2019umukobwa witwa Carine wari umwogoshikazi, wavuye mu rugo yari yashakiyemo umugabo, ariko wamubuzaga kubaho ubuzima yifuza.\nCarine rero akaba yarashatse akiri muto, kandi mu ntangiriro yari anyuzwe n\u2019icyo cyemezo, ariko hashize imyaka aza gusanga hari icyuho n\u2019ibura ry\u2019itumanaho mu rugo rwe, bimutera gufata icyemezo cyo kugendera ku nzozi ze wenyine nubwo byari bigoye. Yashoboye gutangira ubucuruzi bwo kogosha no gutunganya imisatsi, maze nyuma yaho ubwo bucuruzi burakomera, bituma ashobora guha abagore bagenzi be imbaraga, ijwi ndetse n\u2019icyizere.\nIndirimbo ziri muri iyi filime zirimo iz\u2019abahanzi b\u2019Abanyarwanda nka Mike Kayihura, Peace Jolis na Malaika Uwamahoro."}
{"id": "20447", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20447", "title": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime", "text": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga riba buri mwaka rizwi kw'izina rya Eko (EKOIFF) ni iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime ryabereye i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Eko ryashinzwe kandi ryashinzwe mu 2009 na Hope Obioma Opara, umuyobozi mukuru wa Supple Communications Limited, aho ibirori bibera. Niwe kandi usohora ikinyamakuru Supple, ikinyamakuru cya sinema n\u2019umuco nyafurika kirimo kureba filime, gusubiramo, no kubazwa. Intego y'Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Eko ni uguteza imbere ubukerarugendo muri Nijeriya mu guteza imbere gushimira ubuhanzi n'umuco binyuze mu mashusho yerekana amashusho n'ubumenyi.\nIbirori mpuzamahanga bya firime ya Eko.\nibirori bya Eko byamuritswe bwambere mu mpeshyi ya 2010 muri megacity ya Lagos, hamwe nabakinnyi ba firime baturutse muri Nijeriya, Kenya, Ubwongereza, Ubudage, Ubufaransa, Espanye, na Amerika. ikindi kiciro kiri serukiramuco byakurikiyeho byabereye muri Silverbird Galleria ya Sinema ya Silverbird ku kirwa cya Victoria, Lagos. kugeza ubu \nIbirori byakira firime mubyiciro 6 byavuzwe hepfo:\nIbiranga Film, Filime ngufi, ibihimbano, Amateka, documentaire ngufi na film kavukire.\nInaugural Edition\nIbirori byambere byabaye hagati yitariki ya 7 na 12 Nyakanga 2010 muri Sinema Itangiriro Deluxe ya Palms i Lekki, Lagos\n2011 Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Eko.\nKu nshuro ya kabiri iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime ya Eko (EKOIFF), ryabaye kuva ku ya 9 kugeza ku ya 14 Nyakanga 2011. Iri rushanwa ry\u2019iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime rya Eko ryari rifite insanganyamatsiko igira iti \" Nollywood -kuzamura inganda za firime zo muri Nijeriya '. \n2015 Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Eko\n2018 Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime.\nAbakinnyi ba firime, cinema aficionados, hamwe nabanyeshuri baturutse muri Nijeriya ndetse no hanze yarwo bitabiriye umuhango wo kwerekana mafilime ya buri munsi, amasomo y'ibyiciro, n'ibiganiro nyunguranabitekerezo ku nshuro ya 8, yabaye kuva ku ya 5 kugeza ku ya 10 Werurwe 2018.\n2019 Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime\nIri serukiramuco ku nshuro ya cyenda, ryagaragayemo filime zirenga 208 zo hirya no hino ku isi, aho Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika ziza ku isonga hamwe na firime 58. Nijeriya ifite 43, Kanada ifite 30, Ubwongereza bufite 19, Ubudage bufite 13, Ubufaransa bufite 11, Ubuhinde bufite icumi, Uburusiya bufite barindwi, Ositaraliya n'Ubutaliyani zo buri gihugu gifitemo filimi 6, naho Burezili ifite filimi 5 gusa. muriri serukiramuco buri filimi herekanywemo dokimantere yayo, amafilime yerekana, documentaire, na firime kavukire ya Afrika bigize iki cyegeranyo. \n2020 Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Eko \n2021 Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Eko \nKwizihiza imyaka icumi iri serukiramuco ry'izihijwe mu buryo bwa glam kandi ryakira ibyanditswe mu bihugu birenga 55 ku isi mu gihe cyo ku ya 8 kugeza ku ya 12 Werurwe 2021. Itsinda rya Silverbird (bose bagize uruhare mu iserukiramuco rya firime."}
{"id": "20448", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20448", "title": "Amatara, Kamera, Afurika!", "text": "Amatara, Kamera, Afurika! Iserukiramuco rya firime riba buri mwaka i Lagos kuva 2011 kandi ryizihijwe kuva 30 Nzeri-2 Ukwakira 2011.\nIbirori byashinzwe na Ugoma Adegoke. Yakiriwe na The Life House, yagaragaye muri Kamera, Afurika! yatewe inkunga na New York's African Film Festival, Inc. ikora iminsi itatu, kuva 30 Nzeri - 2 Ukwakira 2011. "}
{"id": "20449", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20449", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Nollywood", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Nollywood (NTFF) ni iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryahariwe kwerekana sinema yo muri Nijeriya, izwi kandi nka Nollywood, ku bantu bose ku isi. Yashinzwe mu 2017 i Toronto, muri Kanada, herekanwa ibirori byakozwe n\u2019abakora amafilime yo muri Nijeriya ikorera muri Nijeriya ndetse no mu mahanga. Yashinzwe n'umukinnyi wa firime akaba n'umuyobozi wa Paruwasi Mykel, ukomeje kugenzura imikorere yayo. \nNTFF ni itsinda ryahariwe kwakira, ibiganiro nyunguranabitekerezo, amahugurwa, ibirori byo guhuza imiyoboro, hamwe n\u2019imihango yo gutanga ibihembo ku bibuga mpuzamahanga bitandukanye, igamije guteza imbere umuco n\u2019ubuhanzi bya Nollywood. Abahawe iki gihembo barimo abakinnyi, nka Omotola Jalade (2017), Richard Mofe-Damijo (2018), Ubutunzi bwa Uche (2024).\nAmateka.\nIserukiramuco rya Filime rya Nollywood ryashinzwe mu 2017 na Paruwasi ya Mykel, ryashinzwe mu rwego rwo kwagura isi yose ya sinema yo muri Nijeriya mu kwerekana amafilime mu mijyi mpuzamahanga itandukanye no gushishikariza ubufatanye hagati ya Nigeriya n\u2019abakora amafilime mpuzamahanga. Igitabo cyo gutangiza ku mugaragaro cyabaye muri Nzeri 2017 i Toronto, muri Kanada, mu rwego rwo kwerekana ko iri serukiramuco ryatangijwe nk'urubuga rwo kwerekana inkuru zitandukanye za Nollywood ndetse no kwerekana sinema. \nKuva yatangira, ibirori byabereye mu mijyi nka Atlanta, Hamburg, Berlin, Glasgow, Helsinki, Paris, Oslo, Amsterdam, Lima, Ubutaliyani, na Atenayi. Mu mwaka wa 2018, umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Nijeriya akaba n'umunyamideli Chris Okagbue yabaye Ambasaderi w'Iserukiramuco ku mugaragaro, agaragaza ubushake bw'iri serukiramuco ryo kugira uruhare mu bantu bazwi cyane ba Nollywood mu bikorwa byo kwamamaza. \nFilime izwi cyane.\n cyangwa zerekanwe \"bwa\" \"mbere\" \"mu\" \"iserukiramuco\" \"rya\" \"Filime\" \"rya\" \"Nollywood\" \"(NTFF) zirimo Umugezi wa Kada,\" \"Gufunga\". \"]\" [\u200b\u200b] Iri serukiramuco ryakorewe inyandiko mu binyamakuru bigiye bitandukanye, harimo na Atlanta mu 2019 ryateguwe ku bufatanye n\u2019iserukiramuco nyafurika rya Filime ndetse nirya Scotland Motion Film Scotland na Atenayi mu 2022, ryari rifite insanganyamatsiko igira iti: uburambe cg ubunararibonye muri Nollywood.\" \nIbyabaye nibikorwa.\nNTFF izwiho gutegura inama ndetse na gahunda zitandukanye, ubusanzwe itegura imara weekend kandi ikubiyemo: \nIbihembo.\n2017 Ibihembo bya Nollywood Travel Festival Festival\n2018 Nollywood Travel Film Festival Awards\n2024 Ibirori bya Filime Yurugendo rwa Nollywood"}
{"id": "20450", "revid": "16550", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20450", "title": "Detty December (Nigerian film)", "text": "Detty December ni filimi ivuga ibihe by'iminsi mikuru mu mpera z'umwaka muri Nijeriya ubusanzwe guhera hagati mu Kuboza kugeza mu mwaka mushya. Nigihe cyo kwizihiza no guhuza imbaraga, guterana kwabaturage, ibirori, nibirori birangwa nimbaraga nyinshi, umunezero, nicyizere. Ni igihe Abanyanijeriya benshi, haba mu gihugu ndetse no muri diaspora, basubira mu rugo kwishimana n'umuryango n'inshuti.\nImyitwarire n'imikoreshereze.\nIjambo Detty ni ruswa ndetse akaba ari \"umwanda\", bisobanura iminsi mikuru no kwizihiza nta nkomyi mugihe cya Noheri nibiruhuko. \nInkomoko.\nInkomoko y'iryo jambo ntirisobanutse neza. Abantu bamwe bavuga ko ari ibirori byatangiye nyuma ya Carnival ya Calabar yo mu 2004 mu majyepfo y\u2019amajyepfo ya Nijeriya, yiswe \"ishyaka rikomeye ry\u2019umuhanda muri Afurika\" na Donald Duke wahoze ari guverineri w\u2019intara ya Cross Rivers. Nk\u2019uko ikinyamakuru \"BellaNaija\" cyo muri Nijeriya na The Guardian kibitangaza ngo iri jambo ryahimbwe kandi ryamamazwa n'umuririmbyi wo muri Nijeriya Bwana Eazi, wakoresheje nk'igitutu cy'igitaramo cye i Lagos mu 2016. Bwana Eazi na we yagiye akoresha iryo jambo. \nIbyabaye.\nDetty December ni ijambo rikoreshwa cyane nabanyamuryango baba diaspora ya Nigeriya baherutse gutaha. Aba batahutse vuba bakunze kwita IJGBs, amagambo ahinnye ya \"Nsubiye inyuma\". Banki y'isi ivuga ko amafaranga yoherejwe na diaspora ya Nijeriya muri iki gihe angana na by'umusaruro rusange wa Nijeriya, kandi akerekana imbaraga zikoreshwa mu gihe ababa mu mahanga bagarutse mu rugo. \nMugihe Detty Ukuboza ahanini ifitanye isano nimijyi, benshi mubatahutse nabo bakoresha aya mahirwe yo gusura imidugudu yabo. Ig \"\u200b\u200b\" Icyakora, ni ngombwa kwerekana ko Detty December ni filimi yibanda cyane cyane ku gusura imijyi yo mu mijyi na diaspora yo muri Nijeriya mu birori nka Rhythm Unplugged,bakaba barayikoreye igitaramo cyatangiye kuva 2004 kigamije kuzamura abahanzi bo muri Nijeriya ndetse n'abahanzi mpuzamahanga. Ibi bitandukanye cyane n\u2019ibibera mu burasirazuba bwa Nijeriya, aho usanga abaturage benshi ba Igbo bakunda kuva mu mijyi myinshi yo mu mijyi. Ahubwo, basubira mu cyaro cyabo kwizihiza nko guhurira mu miryango ndetse n\u2019ibindi birori mu cyaro, bigatuma habaho ubukene bugaragara mu mijyi myinshi yo mu burasirazuba, bitandukanye na kamere yibanda ku mujyi wa Detty Ukuboza uzwi. Lagos, umujyi ufite amateka akomeye ya Owambe hamwe n\u2019inganda zidagadura zitera imbere (kuba ariho habereye imiziki yisi yose Afrobeats) ifatwa nkisura ya Detty December. \nMuri iyi filimi kandi ya Detty December, berekanamo habaho ibirori byinshi bitandukanye, uhereye k'umunsi mukuru wamazu, karnival kumuhanda, kumanika ku mucanga kugeza mubitaramo, ubukwe, guterana nijoro, nibindi byinshi., ibitaramo byo mu Kuboza biragaragara cyane nka kimwe mu bintu by'ingenzi, bikurura abahanzi ndetse n\u2019imiryango myinshi ya muzika kwakira ibitaramo muri iki gihe. Ikigaragara ni uko ibi bitaramo bisoza umwaka bitagenewe gusa umuziki uzwi cyane (nka Flytime Fest ubusanzwe ikaba ivuga ku bakinnyi bakomeye ba Afrobeats bo muri Nijeriya nka Burna Boy, Asake, Wizkid, Davido, Olamide, Rema, Ayra Starr); ubucuruzi butandukanye, guverinoma za leta, ndetse n\u2019amashami ya federasiyo nayo atunganya ibitaramo. Iyi myumvire itanga umusaruro mwinshi kubahanzi bo muri Nigeriya, bisa nubunini bwa Super Bowl, nkuko byavuzwe na Davido wamamaye muri Afrobeats. \u200b Ubu bukwe akenshi bumara iminsi yose, bukazarangirana nibirori nyuma yibirori. \nUrutonde rwibintu byihariye mugihe cyagenwe.\nBimwe mubikorwa byihariye byateguwe muri detty Ukuboza igihe cyagenwe hano hepfo.\nKunegura.\nBitewe no gusura igihugu cyangwa se gutaha kw'abanegihugu bazwi kw'izina ryaba diaspora yo muri Nijeriya hamwe n\u2019ivunjisha, guverinoma yishimiye iyinjira n\u2019ingaruka ku bukungu. Ku rundi ruhande, hamwe n\u2019ubutunzi bwerekanwe butandukanye cyane n\u2019ubukungu bwiganje mu babaturage, bamwe mu baturage bahangayikishijwe no gufungwa mu migi yabo kubera ibiciro byiyongereye n\u2019imodoka. "}
