{"id": "20452", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20452", "title": "Igihembo cya Afurika Movie Academy Igihembo cyumukinnyi mwiza mu nshingano zambere", "text": "Ibihembo.\nIgihembo cy'umukinnyi nya afurika witwaye neza ni igihembo gitangwa buri mwaka na Afrika Film Academy. Yatanzwe kuva igihembo cya 1 cya Afrika Movie Academy Awards ku mukinnyi watanze umusaruro udasanzwe mu nshingano zikomeye muri film.\nUmukinnyi witwaye neza mu bihembo byambere yatanzwe inshuro 21, kubakinnyi 21. Uwatsinze bwa mbere ni Richard Mofe-Damijo kubera uruhare yagaragaje rwe muri \"ba Mayors\" (2004). Uwatsinze vuba aha akana yarabaye Zolisa Xaluva \"kubwami bwa Queenstown\" (2024). yanditse kandi agira Amateka kuko yatsindiye byinshi, kuko afite na Richard Mofe-Damijo. Inyandiko zerekana kandidatire nyinshi ni ebyiri, na Damijo. "}
{"id": "20454", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20454", "title": "Kizazi Moto: GeneratioN fire Film", "text": "Kizazi Moto: Fire Fire ni Afrofuturist na Africanfuturist ni filimi Yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 5 Nyakanga 2023, kuri Disney +. Yakinywe muri rusange ikaba ifite ibitekerezo byiza byatanzwe nabayiteguye.\nInyandiko.\nBuri filime ifite icyerekezo nyafurika, uhereye kumuyobozi umwe cyangwa benshi, kumutwe nkimbuga nkoranyambaga, uburinganire, ubumuga, kwigaragaza, ubumuntu busangiye, hamwe nizindi ngingo, hamwe ninkuru zirimo ingendo zigihe, ibinyabuzima byo hanze, hamwe nisi isimburana. \nUmusaruro.\nKu ya 27 Kamena 2021, hatangajwe ko abakinnyi baturutse muri Zimbabwe, Afurika y'Epfo, Uganda, Nijeriya, Kenya, na Misiri bazakora ku bice icumi by'amafirime y'umwimerere ya animasiyo, yitwa \"Kizazi Moto: Generation Fire\". Peter Ramsey yatorewe kuba producer mukuru, mugihe Tendayi Nyeke na Anthony Silverston bagenzuraga abaproducer, naho Triggerfish niyo studio yambere, hamwe nandi ma studio ya animasiyo muri Afrika. Itariki yasobanuwe \"mu 2022,\" buri filime iba ifite iminota 10. \"Bamwe\"] [\"\u200b\u200b\" Iterambere ryuruhererekane ryarimo \"icyiciro yubushakashatsi\" kugirango film zigaragaze neza imico yihariye. \nItariki yo gusohora yaje guhinduka kugeza, Nyuma byaje gutangazwa ko uruhererekane ruzerekanwa bwa mbere kuri Disney + ku ya \nMbere y\u2019uko basohora agace ka mbere, Ramsey yavuze ko uruhererekane rwerekana filime kandi zerekana \"icyerekezo kidasanzwe cya Afurika\" ku bijyanye n\u2019ejo hazaza ndetse n\u2019ibihimbano bya siyanse, mu gihe yakinaga \"ku bantu benshi,\" mu gihe abayobozi Lesego Vorster, Isaac Mogajane, na Catherine Green baganiriye ku nkuru zerekana ndetse no kwerekana amashusho ya filime zabo. \nKwakira.\nUrubuga rusubiramo abaterankunga Rotten Tomatoes yatangaje ko 100% byemejwe hamwe nimpuzandengo ya 8.30 / 10, hashingiwe ku 8 banenze. \nCharles Pulliam-Moore wo muri \"The Verge\" yavuze ko iyi filime y'uruhererekane ari ikimenyetso cyerekana ko Disney yakira abantu bose ku isi bakagira isi yigitangaza yarose... n'abanditsi b'inkuru bakorera hanze ya Hollywood.\" Yavuze ko buri filime ngufi idasanzwe, aho uruhererekane muri rusange ari icyegeranyo cy\u2019imigani itandukanye yamenyeshejwe n\u2019urutonde rw\u2019umuco wa pop-sci-fi, yagereranije na \"Star Wars: Vision\", yavuze ko nta kiguzi na kimwe cyihuta cyangwa ngo kibone icyo gisobanura, yongeraho ko iyi filimi yuruhererekane izashyira impano nshya zizewe kuri radar yawe. Justin Carter wo muri \"Gizmodo\" yavuze ko uruhererekane ruhuza filozofiya n\u2019umuco nyafurika hamwe n\u2019ibintu bya fantasy na sci-fi, hamwe n\u2019umuryango nk\u2019insanganyamatsiko nkuru mu bice hafi ya byose, mu gihe abandi bashakisha \"baba bagishakisha ibitekerezo byaho bari buhere\" hamwe na kamere ye, nk'uko abibona, akamurika muri buri gice, hamwe no \"gusebanya intwari\" kandi akibanda ku kwitonda. Lauren Westbrook wo muri \"MovieWeb\" yavuze ko uruhererekane rutanga ibitekerezo bitandukanye n\u2019izindi filime n\u2019uruhererekane, kandi ko rutanga \"ibisobanuro by\u2019umuco byinjira cyane muri sosiyete igezweho.\" \"Imizi\" yasobanuye uruhererekane nk \"\" Tora Icyumweru. \" "}
