{"id": "20456", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20456", "title": "Tanga Kayisari", "text": "Render to Caesar ni filime yo muri Nigeriya yo yasohotse mu 2014 yanditswe kandi yakorwa na Desmond Ovbiagele, iyobowe na Desmond Ovbiagele na Onyekachi Ejim. Irimo Wale Ojo, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Omoni Oboli na Bimbo Manuel ikababa ifite uburyo igaragara bidasanzwe irimo abakinnyi nka Kehinde Bankole na Femi Jacobs. Filime yabanje gutegurwa ko izasohoka mu gihembwe cya kabiri cya 2013 ariko yasubijwe inyuma kubera gutinda kw\u2019iposita; ariko yasohotse ku ya 28 \nNubwo iyi filime yakiriwe neza, yatsindiye ibihembo bya \"Screenplay nziza y'umwimerere\" na \"Umukinnyi mwiza wagaragaye afasha abandi\" mu bihembo bya Nollywood Movies 2014. Yabonye kandi ibihembo bya Filimi yarebwe na \"Ijwi Ryiza Ryiza\" muri ya Nollywood Awards 2014. \nYasohowe.\nKu ya 28 Werurwe 2014, \"i Caesar\" yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Silverbird Galleria, ku kirwa cya Victoria, i Lagos Yabaye kandi gutoranywa kumugaragaro mu iserukiramuco rya sinema ryabirabura rya San Diego 2015, ndetse no mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Pan African 2014 (PAFF). \nKwakira.\n\"Render to Caesar\" yaje guhurirwaho n'ibisobanuro byinshi bivanze. \"Sodas &amp; Popcorn\" yayihaye amanota 3 kuri 5 kuri 5, yavuze ko iyi filime ifite inzira, avuga ko tekiniki zifite inenge ahanini biturutse ku \"kazi k'ubunebwe\". Yashoje igira iti: \"Ku bwoko butigeze bugenzurwa cyane mu mafilime yo muri Nijeriya, bugerageza kuba umwihariko mu kuzana ibiganiro by\u2019ubwenge hamwe n\u2019urwego rwiza rwo gukomeza, kugeza igihe ibice bya puzzle nini (byitwa ko byongeweho) binaniwe kubikora. \"Guha Sezari\" ni igeragezwa, ndetse n\u2019inenge nyinshi, amaherezo ni intambwe nini igana imbere.\" \u200b\"\u200b\" Yagaragaje ko nubwo filime ifite ubusobanuro bwiza, ariko ifite ibihe bikunze kwangizwa n\u2019ibintu bidasanzwe byabaye, guhanura byoroshye cyangwa ibishushanyo bisekeje. Yongeyeho ati: \"Ingaruka zidasanzwe ntizitangaje nkuko byari bisanzwe, gukina ntabwo ari byiza nkuko byakagombye ndetse no kwerekana amashusho, hamwe n'ibigoretse byayo ntabwo bishimishije nkuko ubishaka\". Yashoje avuga ko iyi filime isa nkaho ari \"igeragezwa\" kuruta \"umusaruro wizeye\". \nWilfred Okiche yashimye iyi filime kubera kwerekana neza abapolisi ba Nigeriya. Yavuze ko Ejim ari cyo gikorwa cy\u2019indashyikirwa muri iyi filime, ariko anavuga ko nta ruvangitirane ruri ihagati ya Omoni na Gbenga kuri ecran kandi ko amashusho yabo y\u2019urukundo ahinduka imwe mu mpande zombi zerekana amashusho. \nAccolades.\n\"Render to Caesar\" yahawe kandidatire icyenda kandi yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri bitandukanye muri ururuganda rwa filimi yo muri Nollywood Movies Awards 2014. Yakiriye kandi nomination eshatu kandi yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri muri Best of Nollywood Awards 2014."}
{"id": "20457", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20457", "title": "Zacu Entertainment", "text": "Zacu Entertainment ni sosiyete y'imyidagaduro ikorera mu Rwanda, ikora ibikorwa byo gutunganya no gukwirakwiza filme, ifatwa nk'imwe mu miyoboro ihamye myiza ifasha mu guteza imbere Sinema nyarwanda n'ubuhanzi muri rusange nyuma yo gutangiza urubuga rwa Zacu TV rukorera kuri online rwerekana filme (a web-based video streaming channel) \nAmateka.\nZacu Entertainment yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2017 na Misago Nelly wilson umwanditsi wa filme zo kuri televiziyo akanazitunganya, ni nyuma yuko yaramaze gukora filme seburikoko yatambukaga kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda RBA igakundwa cyane, muri 2019 abona gushinga urubuga Zacu TV rukorera online ruzajya rwerekana Filme Nyarwanda yakoze ndetse n'izindi yaguze.\nMu mwaka 2022 Zacu Entertainment yaguzwe na Canal+ Group mu rwego rwo kongerera inege abakora filme mu Rwanda Misago Nelly Wilson yagize ati: \"\u201cNishimiye gukomeza urugendo hamwe na Canal+ Group. Twese dufite intego zo gutunganya no gutanga porogaramu zifite ireme ku bakunda ibyo dukora. U Rwanda rufite abanyempano benshi ndetse n\u2019inkuru zubaka zitaravugwa. Ntekereza ko kuba Canal+ ije gufatanya natwe ari igihe cyo kugeza filime zakorewe mu Rwanda ku ruhando mpuzamahanga.\u201d\" \nZacu Entertainmet mu gice cyayo ZACU TV imaze gukora filme zirangira, filme z'uruherereka zirenga 25 zigaragara ku rubuga rwabo Zacu entertainment ndetse no ku mbuga za Canal+ ecosystem. \nIbikorwa.\nIbikorwa bya zacu Entertainment byatangiriye mu kitwaga Afriframe pictures ltd yarifite Inyarwanda nk'urubuga rwandika amakuru y'imyidagaduro mu Rwanda, nibwo bakoze Seburikoko -\"inkuru igamije gusetsa abantu (rwandan comedy show) y'umugabo witwa Seburikoko akiyita Sebu wari warifatiye agace kose ka Gatototo.\" ni filme yatangiye guca kuri Televiziyo y'u rwanda kuva muri 2015 kugeza 2021, 2022 yimukira kuri ZACU TV gusa igaragara kuri Canal+ \nCity Maid nayo ni filme ya Zacu Entertainment yatangiriye gukorwa muri Afriframe pictures kuva mu mwaka 2016 itangira kugaragara kuri televiziyo y'u rwanda ikaba imaze kugira season 26 kugeza n'uyu munsi iracyakinwa.\nIndoto ni inkuru ya Muhire warurangije ishuri aza i kigali gushaka akazi, Filme indoto imaze kugira season 12 na nuyu munsi iracyatambuka kuri televiziyo y'u rwanda. \nhagiye hakorwa n'izindi filme nyinshi harimo The Incubation, ishusho ya Papa, Kaliza wa Kalisa, The Bishop Family n'izindi\nIbihembo n'Ishimwe.\nFilme Seburikoko mu nshuro ya 5 ya Rwanda Movie awards yari ihataniye imyanya 8 (8 nominations) birangira itsinze 4 aribyo Best TV series, Best Director, Best Cinematographer na Best Sound Engineer \nPhionah Igihozo ukina mu Indoto Series muri 2023 mu bihembo bya Rwanda International Movie Awards (RIMA) yegukanye icya Best Supporting Actress \nIserukirakiramuco Mashariki African Film Festival ku nshuro yaryo ya gatanu yahaye ibihembo 2 City Maid, Laura Usanase nk'Umugore ukina muri filime y\u2019uruhererekane mu Rwanda ndetse n'igihembo cya Filime y\u2019uruhererekane nziza mu Rwanda "}
{"id": "20458", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20458", "title": "Tunnel Film (film ya 2014)", "text": "Tunnel ni filime ikoze muburyo bw'ikinamico yo muri Nigeriya 2014 iyobowe na Stanlee Ohikhuare ikinwamo na bakinnyi nka Nse Ikpe Etim, Femi Jacobs, Waje Iruobe na Lepacious Bose. Filime ivuga amateka yubuzima nintambara byumushumba ukiri muto nurugendo rwe rwo gusohozwa byimazeyo. \nYashyizwe hanze.\nIyi filime yerekanwe kunshuro yayo ya mbere ku ya 16 Werurwe 2014. Yasohotse kuri IROKOtv ku ya 4 Nzeri 2014. \nKwakira.\nishyirahamwe rya Nollywood Reinvented ryayihaye amanota 35% kandi ashima storyline no gukina ariko yumva bidashishikaje bihagije. "}
