{"id": "20461", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20461", "title": "2 Rats Film", "text": "2 Rats ni filimi ikoze mu buryo bwo gusetsa abantu benshi bakunze kwita comedi yo muri Nijeriya iyobowe na Andy Chukwu mu 2003. \nAbakinnyi ba Nollywood bakinnye iyi filime bakuyemo amafaranga menshi, Osita Iheme (A-Boy) na Chinedu Ikedieze (Bobo) bakina ari abahungu babiri bato se wabo wishwe na nyirarume. kuwo kwikunda, Amaechi Muonagor yifuza ko bakora nk'abahungu bo mu rugo kwa se. Iyi filime yerekana cyane abahungu 2 bitwa A-boy na Bobo, ubwo basuzumaga amakuba yo guta inshuti zabo nimiryango yabo kuri rwiyemezamirimo uzi ubwenge wabasezeranije amahirwe menshi yo kubasubiza akazi kabo. Uburiganya n'ibinyoma biva muriyi nkuru ikubiye mu butumwa bwa \"ntimukabe imbwa abahungu\". A-Boy na Bobo bafite izindi gahunda. Muri filime hagaragaramo ibikorwa bya Aki na Pawpaw."}
{"id": "20462", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20462", "title": "10 Days in Sun City", "text": "10 Days in Sun City ni ikozwe muburyo bwo gusetsa cyangwa se benshyi bazi nka comedi ariko y'urukundo yo muri Nijeriya yo muri 2017 yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 17 Kamena 2017. Iyobowe na Adze Ugah, yanditswe na Kehinde Ogunlola, kandi yakozwe na Darlington Abuda. Iyi filime ni igice cya gatatu muri \"Akpos Adventure\" Franchise kandi yarasiwe ahantu i Lagos na Johannesburg, muri Afurika yepfo. \nInyandiko n' Inkuru.\nIyi filime ivuga amateka y'umwamikazi wifuza ubwiza kandi akifuza no kwamamara ariko akishyura ikiguzi cyo gutakaza amahoro numunezero yamagana umukunzi we, umuyobozi we. Yari hafi kuba imbata na Se wabo ubwo yahuraga na bamwe mubantu yari yarambuye inyungu kera. Filime yerekana ko urukundo nyarwo rutsinda byose, hatitawe ku nzitizi cyangwa ibibazo byahuye nabyo. Akpos ni umugabo ubyutsemo afite intego yo kwidagadura no gushimisha inshuti ze. Yegukanye itike yo kujya muri Sun City aherekejwe na Bianca, umukobwa bamaze igihe bakundana. Muri ubwo buzima bushya, bahura n\u2019ibibazo bitandukanye byo mu rukundo, gusabana n\u2019abantu batandukanye, ndetse n\u2019imibereho y\u2019ahantu hatandukanye. Ubwo urugendo rwabo rukomeza, bakura amasomo ku rukundo, inshuti, n\u2019ubuzima muri rusange.\nIbyerekeye gutunganya no gusohora"}
{"id": "20463", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20463", "title": "30 Days (film ya 2006)", "text": "filimi\u00a0yitiriwe ininsi 30 cyangwa 30Days yanditse inerekanwa na Morgan spurlock kuri FX yerekanye buri episode. bamwe mubantu berekenye iyi film bafashe iminsi 30 kugirango batunganye iyi filimi\nInshakake.\nIyi filimi ishingiye mu gihugu kiberamo ubwicanyi na ruswa, umusore yasanze umudamu muri mukabyiniro akunda. gusa ntiyahiriwe nurwo rukundo ahubwo yaje gusanga uyu mudamu ni umwe mu bagize itsinda ry\u2019abicanyi bica abayobozi ba ruswa mu gihugu. "}
{"id": "20464", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20464", "title": "30 Days in Atlanta", "text": "Iminsi 30 i Atlanta ni filime yo iri mu buryo bwo gusetsa cyangwa se comedi gusetsa y\u2019urukundo yo muri Nijeriya 2014 yanditswe na Patrick \"Koinage\" Nnamani, yakozwe na Ayo Makun ikayoborwa na Robert Peters. Filime yafatiwe i Lagos na Atlanta, muri Amerika. Yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 31 Ukwakira 2014. Yamenyekanye nka filime yinjije amafaranga menshi kurusha ayandi muri sinema mu gihugu cya Nijeriya. \nUmugambi.\nAkpos yatsindiye itike y'urugendo rw'ukwezi kumwe i Atlanta, Jeworujiya maze atumira mubyara we Richard ngo baze. Bahageze, birukira mu nshuti yabo ishaje Okiemute, ibajyana gusangira ibya ni mugoroba. Akpos ahura na Kimberly mwiza kandi yifuza kumubaza niba bazasohokana, ariko Okiemute amuburira ko se wa Kimberly agenzura cyane. Kimberly, Akpos, na Richard bongeye guhura hagati yabo mu nama y\u2019ibidukikije, aho Akpos avuga amagambo make asekeje. Kimberly ariko, ashishikajwe cyane na Richard. Yahaye Richard numero ye ya terefone, baragenda mu gihe cya se, restaurateur Odiye, kwigaragaza.\nRichard asubira muri resitora gutegereza uruzinduko rwa Kimberly, ariko Akpos arigaragaza. Kimberly abwira Akpos ise yishimiye ibitekerezo bye muri iyi nama kandi ashaka kumuha amasezerano yo gusetsa. Mu nzira atashye na tagisi, Richard amenya ko yasize igikapu cye. Iyo umushoferi amenye ko badashobora kwishyura ibiciro, arabirukana mu kabari. Kimberly na Odiye babaha gusubira mu rugo rwa Odiye, aho bahurira n'umuryango, ndetse n'umunyamategeko w\u2019abinjira n'abasohoka, Olaraye, Clara. Akpos na Clara batangira umubano w'urukundo.\nBavuganiye kuri Skype hamwe n'ababyeyi be, Richard amenye ko uwahoze ari umukunzi we Ezee arimo gutegura ubukwe. Agerageza kumvisha nyina ko bahagaritse umubano wabo akavuga Kimberly. Richard amenyesha Kimberly ababyeyi be, ariko nyina ashimangira ko agomba kurongora Ezee. Ezee agerageza kumvisha Kimberly ko Richard azamutenguha gusa, Ezee yerekana Kimberly amashusho y'imbere ye na Richard. Kimberly acika intege maze yiruka asohoka mu nzu arira.\nAkpos yishora mu gukina urusimbi mu buryo butemewe birangira afashwe arafungwa. Clara yamusuye muri gereza yemera ku muhagararira. Byagaragaye ko Akpos yarenze kuri viza, bigatuma urubanza rwe rukomera kandi ruhanwa n'amategeko. Mu rukiko, umucamanza yemeye ko amafaranga yose Akpos yinjije azaba ahagije nk\u2019indishyi z\u2019uko yarenze ku mategeko na viza mu gihe amafaranga azatangwa nk'inkunga akazakurikiranwa. Mu rwego rwo gukumira andi makosa, Clara amujyana iwe, aho bombi basangira, nyuma yaho baza gukora igikorwa cy'ishimisha mubiri(bararyamana). Nyuma, Clara yumvise Akpos kuri terefone, bivuze ko umubano we na we bizorohereza green card ndetse n'ubwenegihugu bwa Amerika. Clara ararakara cyane ko Akpos ashobora kuba yarakoresheje umwanya we ukomeye maze akirukana Akpos mu nzu ye.\nRichard agerageza guhindura umubano we na Kimberly, ariko Odiye amutegeka gusiga umukobwa we wenyine, yongera gushimangira isura mbi abasore benshi bo muri Nijeriya bagaragaza mu bihugu by\u2019Iburengerazuba. Richard atongana na Ezee kubyerekeye kwivanga mu mibanire ye na Kimberly.\nMugihe Akpos yanze gutanga amafaranga yinjiza mubikorwa by'urukundo. Ku kibuga cy'indege, mu gihe abo bagabo bitegura gufata indege basubira muri Nijeriya, batangajwe no kubona Kimberly na Clara, bombi bahisemo kubakurikira basubira muri Nijeriya no guhura na bene wabo.\nKwakira.\nUburyo Filimi yakiriwe.\nFilime yakiriwe neza n'abari aho muri rusange, ariko yatumye abantu benshi bafite ibitekerezo bihinduka ibitekerezo bibi. Abanegura benshi bavuga ko urwenya rwa filime rwuzuyemo clich\u00e9s na stereotype, kandi ko iyi filime yasaga nkaho yasubiwemo \"Osuofia i Londere\" (2003), francise \"ya Jenifa\", cyangwa imvange ya bombi.\nBox office.\n\"30 Days in Atlanta\" yagiye guca amateka yose muri 2014. \nIbihembo.\n30 Days in Atlanta ni Filime yakiriye ibihembo 10 muri Golden Icons Academy Movie Awards 2014. "}
{"id": "20465", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20465", "title": "'76 Film", "text": "'76Film, yahoze yitwa Intare yo muri 76, ni filimi y'iserukiramuco filime yi iserukiramuco yo mu gihugu cya Nigeriya yakinwe muri 2016 iyobowe na Izu Ojukwu ikorwa na Adonaijah Owiriwa na Izu Ojukwu. Irimo Ramsey Nouah, Chidi Mokeme, Rita Dominic na Ibinabo Fiberesima. \nyatekerejwe imyaka itandatu nyuma yintambara yabenegihugu, ivuga inkuru y'umusirikare mukuru ukomoka mu mukandara wo hagati aza gukundana numunyeshuri wo mu kiciko cy'ambere cy'amashuri yisumbuye ukomoka mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba, ariko umubano wabo uhungabanywa no koherezwa buri gihe kuri misiyo nigisirikare. Uyu musirikare aza gushinjwa kuba yaragize uruhare mu guhirika ubutegetsi bwa gisirikare butatsinzwe mu 1976, no kwica Jenerali Murtala Mohammed. Iyi nkuru ivuga na none k\u2019umugore utwite cyane wishora mu bibazo by\u2019amarangamutima.\nInsanganyamatsiko.\nIzu Ojukwu yavuze ko \"ari inkuru yavuzwe mu buryo bubiri - duhereye ku gukunda igihugu cy'umusirikare ndetse no ku bagore ba ofisiye.\" Ojukwu yasobanuye neza ko iyi filime yubashye imbaraga z'abagore b'abasirikare: \"Njye uko mbibona, abagore ni abasirikare nyabo... Ni bo bababazwa n'icyemezo icyo ari cyo cyose abagabo babo bafata - haba ku rugamba cyangwa mu biro byabo.\" \nIbibazo bigaragara muri filime birimo ibihuha by\u2019uruhare rw\u2019amahanga mu guhirika ubutegetsi bwa Murtala Muhammed. Ojukwu yagize ati: \"Ntushobora kubahunga... Ugomba guhangana n'ibihuha byose - nubwo tudashobora kuvuga, mu byukuri, uko byagenze \"\"' yashyizweho nyuma y\u2019imyaka itandatu nyuma y\u2019intambara yo muri Nijeriya, kandi nk'uko umuyobozi abivuga, iki cyari igihe abaturage ba Nijeriya batangiye gukina ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose kandi bakabona ko ari abavandimwe na bashiki bacu. "}
{"id": "20467", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20467", "title": "Killer Music", "text": "Killer Music ni filme nyarwanda yasohotse mu mwaka wa 2025 ya Murigande Jacques uzwi cyane mu ruganda rw'imyidagaduro cyane cyane mu muziki nka Mighty Popo. \nIncamake.\nKiller Music ni label (\"inzu itunganya ikanareberera inyungu z'Abahanzi\") iyobowe na Sano (\"yakinnwe na Mugisha Patrick\") ndetse n'Abafatanyabikorwa be Kimmy, Rumata na Nina bakaba bafite Abahanzi bayobora Sine na Mwiza ariko bisanga muri politiki ya label, bashyirwaho igitutu cyo guhanga injyana nshya n'udushya mu muziki wabo ndetse ari nako babananiza mu masezerano bagiranye. \nAriko kandi hakaba hari Umupolisi Gisa ukunda gukurikirana ibyaha akora iperereza bimugeza kuri case yaje imutunguye yagize ingaruka kuri benshi harimwo n'Umukobwa w'umuherwe Kamali. Aho byaje guhurira na business y'umuziki n'uko Ira warumaze guhungurwa yakururiwe mu iperereza ry'ubwicanyi ryagaragaje imvo n'imvano ya za ruswa zibera muri label \"killer music\" kandi umuntu ubiri inyuma byose ari wa muherwe Kamali. \nbiba ibibazo, biba akavuyo muri label, n'ibigeragezo bikomeye byabyaye kugwa kwa label kugeza aho habaye performance ikomeye ya korali yo muri gereza iyobowe na Shanon ndetse na Mwiza nk'ikimenyetso cyerekana ubushobozi bw'impano zifite mu kuzanzahura ibyari byapfuye mu gihe cy'ingorane. "}
{"id": "20468", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20468", "title": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime ya Urusaro", "text": "Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime ya Urusaro ni iserukamuco rya filime y'umugore iserukiramuco rya filime ry\u2019abagore mu Rwanda. Byakorewe i Kigali, mu Rwanda kandi byateguwe na Cin\u00e9FEMMES Rwanda, bigamije guhuriza hamwe no guha imbaraga abakora amafilime. \nIri serukiramuco ryashinzwe na Jacqueline Murekeyisoni, washinze akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa w'ikigo Cine Femmes mu Rwanda. Floriane Kaneza yari umuyobozi wacyo kuva 2019-2021. \nIbihembo.\nKuva mu 2024, Iserukiramuco rya Urusaro ryahaye ibihembo filime nziza mu byiciro bikurikira: "}
{"id": "20469", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20469", "title": "I Bwiza", "text": "Nahimana Cl\u00e9mence, wamamaye mu rwenya nka Feruje yamuritse filime yise \u2018I Bwiza\u2019, igaruka ku buzima abahanzi babamo nyuma yo guhanga bikarangira hungutse abandi batari bo.\nI Bwiza ni filime ndende imara iminota 115 yanditswe inayoborwa ku bufatanye bwa Nahimana Cl\u00e9mence na Emmanuel Nturanyenabo, amashusho yayo afatwa na Sibomana Gilbert (One Hundred Pixels).Yerekanywe ku wa Gatatu, tariki 15 Ukuboza 2021, mu cyumba cya sinema kigezweho Canal Olympia giherereye ku i Rebero.\nIbirimo.\nI Bwiza ni filime ivuga inkuru y\u2019umukobwa Gatoni Maya w\u2019imyaka 23, ubarizwa muri koperative ikora ibihangano by\u2019ubwoko bwinshi uhangana na Myasiro, umukire ubigurisha kuko abona abaha amafaranga make. "}
{"id": "20470", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20470", "title": "URANTOKOZA", "text": "Gasigwa L\u00e9opold Umwanditsi akaba n\u2019umuyobozi wa Filime mpamo, yamuritse filime yise \u201cUrantokoza\u201d yerekana uburyo abagore n\u2019abana bishwe urubozo muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.Nk\u2019umuntu wacitse ku icumu rya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, Gasigwa Leopold, muri iyi filime ye imara isaha n\u2019iminota 20, yagerageje gukusanya ibimenyetso simusiga bigaragaza uburyo Interahamwe zagiye zifata abagore n\u2019abakobwa ku ngufu ndetse zijungunya abana mu byobo babatemye bamwe bagihumeka.\nAmateka.\n\u201cUrantokoza\u201d igizwe n\u2019ubuhamya butandukanye bwa bamwe mu barokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi banyuze muri iyo nzira y\u2019umusaraba, bamwe mu bayikoze barimo ahanini abayobozi bo nzego z\u2019ibanze, abaturage basanzwe, na bamwe mu ngabo zabohoye igihugu. Abo bose bafite ubuhamya bufatika cyane ndetse bukora ku mutima w\u2019umuntu uwufite kandi utakwishimira na busa Jenoside aho iva ikanagera.\nMu buhamya bw\u2019abo bahoze ari abayobozi bibanze muri Leta y\u2019abicanyi bavuga ko mu gihe barimo bica abantu, bumvaga bari mu murongo mwiza ngo kuko babwirwaga ko mu gihe batarwanyije Inkotanyi zizabica...\n\u201cUrantokoza\u201d igamije kugaragaza uburyo Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi yibasiye cyane abana n\u2019abagore, izamurikwa kumugaragaro bwa mbere ku itariki ya 4 Ugushyingo 2022 mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nMuri iyi filime abantu batandukanye batangamo ubuhamya, bagaragaza ibihe bikomeye bagiye banyuramo, abandi bakerekana uruhare rukomeye Inkotanyi zagize mu guhagarika Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994."}
{"id": "20471", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20471", "title": "Iserukiramuco rya Sinema", "text": "Iserukiramuco rya sinema mu Rwanda, rizwi kandi ku izina rya Hillywood, ryabaye iserukiramuco rya filime ryakozwe buri mwaka muri Nyakanga i Kigali, mu Rwanda, hagati ya 2005 na 2019.rikaba ryarongeye kuba 2022 na 2025 Wari umunsi mukuru wo guhatanira amarushanwa, utanga ibihembo bizwi ku izina rya Silverback Awards.\nAmateka.\nIserukiramuco rya sinema mu Rwanda ryashinzwe mu 2005 n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru Eric Kabera. \nMu mwaka wa 2009, Kabera yavuze ko iri serukiramuco rizava mu kwibanda gusa ku kibazo cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994, ahubwo bakongeramo n'ibindi byiciro kugira ngo harebwe filime zivuga ku bindi bibazo by'imibereho yo mu Rwanda rugezweho. \niserukiramuco yabaye mu 2012 muri 2012 yatumiye firime ziturutse impande zose zisi ku nsanganyamatsiko \"Ijwi ryanjye, Isura yanjye, Ubugingo bwanjye, Indangamuntu yanjye\". \nkuncuro 15 niyo yanyuma, yabaye mu Kwakira 2019. \nIbisobanuro.\nIri serukiramuco rya hagarariwe na Rwanda Cinema Center, umuryango ugamije guteza imbere inganda za sinema mu gihugu, iserukiramuco rya sinema mu Rwanda ryari iserukiramuco. Bitewe n'icyifuzo cya Kabera cyo kwerekana amafilime ku bantu benshi bashoboka, iserukiramuco ntiryabereye mu murwa mukuru wa Kigali gusa, ahubwo filime y'ibirori, cyane cyane iyakozwe n'abakora amafilime yo mu Rwanda, yanerekanwe ku mashusho manini yaka umuriro mu cyaro mu gihugu hose. \nIzina \"Hillywood\",portmanteau rihuza izina ryu Rwanda n'igihugu cyimisozi igihumbi\" na Hollywood, ryakoreshejwe kugirango ryerekane iserukiramuco rya sinema ryu Rwanda ndetse n\u2019inganda za firime zo mu Rwanda. \nWari umunsi mukuru wa amarushanwa, hatanzwe ibihembo byinshi. \nIbihembo.\nIbihembo bya Silverback byatangijwe nyuma yuko haje umuterankunga wa Silverback wo mu kigo cya Londres Hard Media hamwe n\u2019umunsi mukuru wa Filime mu Rwanda. Muri 2012, ibyiciro byo gutanga ibihembo byari: \n\u00a0. Hillywood Award\n. East Africa Award\n. Best Documentary Film\n. Best short Film\n. Resilience Award\n. Rwanda as seen Around the World\n. Audience Award\n. Out of Africa: Films on Africa"}
{"id": "20472", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20472", "title": "Imbabazi: The Pardon Film", "text": "Imbabazi: Pardon ni filime nya Rwanda yasohotse mu mwaka wa 2013, yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Jo\u00ebl Karekezi mu mashusho ye ya mbere.\nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ishingiye ku inshuti ebyiri zabayeho Manzi na Karemera, ubuzima bwabo buza gutandukanywa mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994. Manzi yinjiye muri Hutu Power, mugihe ubuzima bwa Karemara buri mukaga nkabatutsi. Nyuma yimyaka 15, Manzi yavuye muri gereza agerageza kwikosora amateka ye yubukazi. "}
{"id": "20473", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20473", "title": "The Secret", "text": "Amateka.\nFilime \u201c The Secret \" ikunzwe muri filime nyarwanda ikinamo Bertin na Saranda bakunzwe cyane. Iyi filime igaruka ku buzima bw\u2019urukundo,kwizwera cyane, gutakariza icyizere umuntu, ndetse n\u2019inzira zo kunga abagize amakimbirane mu rukundo.\nThe Secret ni filime kandi ivuga ku buzima busanzwe, ariko ikibanda cyane ku rubyiruko, ibyo rucamo mu rukundo, ariko nanone ikagaragaza ko na wa wundi ucyeka ko ari intungane ko nawe yambaye umubiri bityo akaba yakosa. The Secret yandikwa, ikanategurwa n'itsinda rya CLICK IMAGE igaca kuri shene ya Youtube yitwa Topline TV. "}
{"id": "20474", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20474", "title": "Isi Dutuye", "text": "Isi dutuye ni imwe muri filime zikunzwe mu Rwanda, ikagaragaza kwaguka mu ishusho yayo. Iyi filime ikinamo Robert Mutabazi uzwi nka Mc Nario, Sarah Kampire ndetse na Sam ukina uzwi nka Paru Rukundo.\nIyi filime igaruka ku buzima n\u2019ibibazo biboneka mu mibanire y\u2019abantu. Ikaba imaze kurebwa nabantu benshi kuri youtube ari naho ica."}
{"id": "20475", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20475", "title": "Ze Match", "text": "Amateka.\nFilime yitwa 'Ze Match' izaba ifite umwihariko kuko iri mu buryo bwa Animation.\nIyi filime y\u2019imirwano igaragaraza uwitwa Nkuba ari na we mukinnyi w\u2019imena, uba ushaka kurenganura abantu banyuranye baba bapfa umukobwa ariko akabanza kumenya neza uri mukuri n\u2019uri mu makosa.\nRodrige wanditse kandi akanayobora iyi filime ati \"Ni ikintu gishya twashatse kuzana ku isoko rya sinema nyarwanda, urebye ku Isi muri filime zakunzwe harimo izitwa Batman, Spiderman n\u2019izindi zubatse izina, nahoraga nibaza impamvu twe ino aha tutakora nk\u2019ibyo ahandi bakora ariko tukabikora mu rurimi rwacu n\u2019umuco wacu, bityo abana b\u2019i Rwanda ntibarangamire iby\u2019imahanga kuruta ibya hano\"\n'Ze Match' yamuritswe mu ijoro ryo ku wa Gatatu tariki 20 Ukwakira 2021 muri Orient Park Hotel i Nyarutarama, ni filime igaragaramo abakinnyi nka Daniel Gaga ukina yitwa Boss, Ugirumurera Claudine ukina yitwa Rita,Twizeyimana Bahati ukina yitwa Rurangiza na Rutungura Joseph ukina yitwa Nkuba."}
{"id": "20476", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20476", "title": "Sakabaka Filime", "text": "Amateka.\nFilimi \u2018Sakabaka\u2019 yatunganyijwe n\u2019inzu Cinematic Productions Ltd ya Denis Nsanzamahoro bahimba Rwasa, ndetse yavugishije menshi abari bitabiriye umuhango wo kumurika igice cyayo cya mbere kubere bimwe mu biyikubiyemo byerekana imyumvire iriho muri bamwe mu barambagizanya, aho kuryamana babigize ihame. \nIkaba ivuga ku imyumvire iriho muri bamwe mu barambagizanya, aho kuryamana babigize ihame.\nIbiyigize.\nMu myaka itari myinshi ishize, iyo umukobwa yatwaraga inda y\u2019indaro yafatwaga nk\u2019ikirara ndetse akaba n\u2019icyimwaro ku muryango we, rimwe na rimwe akaba yanakwirukanwa iwabo akangara.\nNk\u2019uko muri \u2018Sakabaka\u2019 babyerekana bisa nk\u2019aho muri iki gihe ari ibisanzwe kuba umukobwa yatwara inda y\u2019umusore bakundana mu gihe batarashakana.\nIcyaje gutungura abantu cyane muri iyi filimi ni kubona Freddy yari afite n\u2019undi mukobwa bakundana gusa uwo mukobwa yahoraga amubaza niba amukunda by\u2019ukuri cyangwa se niba urukundo rwabo rushingiye ku mibonano mpuza bitsina gusa bitewe n\u2019uko iyo batabaga bataryamye, umusore yabaga ameze nk\u2019aho yibereye mu bindi atamwitayeho.\nDenis benshi bamenyereye ku izina rya Rwasa, ari nawe nyiri iyi Film, nawe yagaragaye muri iyi filimi yitwa Peter avuye muri Amerika asanga mu Rwanda ibintu byose byarahindutse, gusa we icyamutunguye cyane, ni abakobwa beza bari biganje mu mujyi wa Kigali."}
{"id": "20477", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20477", "title": "Bora Shingiro", "text": "Bora Shingiro wavutse 1991 mu Rwanda i ni Umunyarwanda ufata amashusho ya filme akanayatunganya (Cinematographer), akayobora filme (Director) ndetse akaba n'umwanditsi. \nBora Shingiro amaze kumenyekana cyane kubera ibihembo bikomeye agenda atsindira, aho nko mu mwaka wa 2019 filme ye bwite \"Luna\" yanditse, akayiyobora ndetse akanayifatira amashusho yatwaye ibihembo bitandukanye harimo ko yatoranyijwe mu irushanwa rya ryaberaga mu Misiri muri 2019. Iyi filime nanone yatorejwe mu iheruka kubera muri Amerika mu 2019. Ariko kandi siyo yatangiriyeho kuko nyuma yo gusoza amashauri muri Kwetu Film Institute muri 2011, yahise akora Filme ngufi yise \"Igitambo\" muri 2016 akora kuri City Maid nka Director ndetse nka Cinematographer muri 2020 akora iyitwa \"Breaking ground\" yatoranyijwe muri Seattle nka Special Jury prize, 2022 akora ku mushinga wa filme ndende \"The Bride\" ya Myriam Birara nka Cinematographer, filme iri muzo akunda yakozeho kandi yanageze kure muri 2023 asohora iyo yise \"igihuku\" inkuru yakomotse ku mateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, yibanda ku buryo abantu bamwe bahungiye mu nsengero bizeye ko batari bwicirwe ahera nyamara bikaza kurangira bahaburiye ubuzima.\nAmateka.\nBora shingiro yavukiye i Kanombe mu Rwanda mu 1991, ni umwana wa 2 mu bana 7 bavukana, yakuranye inzozi zo kuzaba umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ariko aza guhindura inzozi ze ajya kwiga ibijyanye no gukora filme muri Rwanda Cinema Center abyiga amezi 6 ndetse akomereza muri Kwetu Film Institute \nBora Shingiro ahamya ko urugendo rwe rutari rworoshye mu gutangira gusa yarafite umuhate kuko aribuka rimwe rigeze kujya mu iyerekanwa rya filme \"Long Coat\" yagaragayemo Edouard Bamporiki aramwegera amusaba ko yamufasha mu gukina filme no kuzikora ariko aza kumuhereza Email ye ariko yaje kumwandikira umwaka urinda urenga ataramusubiza \nGusa ntibyamuciye intege yakomeje gukora filme ngufi zirimo \"igitambo\" yo muri 2011, \"Umutoma\" yo muri 2014 akazohereza mu ma serukiramico atandukanye, biza gutuma izina rye rigira ireme kuko nka 2016 yahamagawe na Richard Mugwaneza mu mushinga wa City Maid kuburyo amushimira cyane ko ariwe usa nk'uwamwinjije neza mu ruganda rwa sinema nyarwanda ndetse na Misago Nelly Wilson umuyobozi wa Zacu Entertainment Mutiganda wa Nkunda, Kivu Ruhorahoza, JB Rutagarama, abo bose nk'abagabo ashimira bamufashe ukuboko kugeza k'uwo ariwe uyu munsi ndetse kugeza ageze ku nzozi ze zo kugera "}
